declare
  j constant jsonb := $records$[{"id":"e47eac88-0649-4785-baf0-43b92dd2ec2e","recipe_group_id":"7dcd70ca-9fa9-40cc-95b8-a6444db4a292","slug":"como-preparar-limon-serrano-la-receta-de-ensalada-mas-buscada","public_path":"/como-preparar-limon-serrano-la-receta-de-ensalada-mas-buscada","source_url":"https://manualdecocina.com/como-preparar-limon-serrano-la-receta-de-ensalada-mas-buscada/","language":"es","title":"Limón serrano: ensalada de cítricos, huevo y embutidos","excerpt":"Prepara limón serrano con naranja, limón, huevo duro y embutidos curados. Cantidades para 4 porciones, pasos detallados y aliño de aceite, ajo y vino.","summary":"El limón serrano es una ensalada de la Sierra de Francia, en Salamanca. Esta versión combina naranja, una proporción menor de limón, huevo duro, jamón y chorizo curado, con un aliño de aceite, ajo y vino blanco. Las proporciones y el método que siguen son una propuesta propia; existen variantes locales.\n\nRinde 4 porciones de unos 245 g. Cuenta aproximadamente 40 minutos de principio a fin, incluidos 5 minutos para enfriar los huevos. Usa exclusivamente chorizo curado etiquetado como listo para comer.","category":"Ensaladas","category_slug":"ensaladas","difficulty":"Fácil","course":"Entrante","cuisine":"Salmantina","prep_time_minutes":20,"cook_time_minutes":15,"total_time_minutes":40,"servings":4,"ingredients":[{"name":"naranja, peso después de pelar","amount":"500","unit":"g","group":"Ensalada"},{"name":"limón, peso después de pelar","amount":"100","unit":"g","group":"Ensalada"},{"name":"huevos grandes, unos 200 g cocidos sin cáscara","amount":"4","unit":"unidades","group":"Ensalada"},{"name":"jamón serrano listo para comer","amount":"80","unit":"g","group":"Ensalada"},{"name":"chorizo curado listo para comer","amount":"60","unit":"g","group":"Ensalada"},{"name":"aceite de oliva virgen extra","amount":"25","unit":"g","group":"Aliño"},{"name":"ajo pelado","amount":"3","unit":"g","group":"Aliño"},{"name":"vino blanco","amount":"15","unit":"ml","group":"Aliño"}],"steps":[{"title":"Reúne los ingredientes","content":"Lava las naranjas y el limón antes de pelarlos. Prepara los 4 huevos, 80 g de jamón serrano, 60 g de chorizo curado, 25 g de aceite, 3 g de ajo pelado y 15 ml de vino. Comprueba que ambos embutidos estén etiquetados como listos para comer; esta preparación no cocina chorizo fresco.","image_url":"/recetas/como-preparar-limon-serrano-la-receta-de-ensalada-mas-buscada/paso-01.webp","image_alt":"Limón serrano: reúne los ingredientes"},{"title":"Cuece y enfría los huevos","content":"Pon los huevos en un cazo y cúbrelos con agua fría, unos 2 cm por encima. Lleva a ebullición y mantén un hervor suave durante 12 minutos; la clara y la yema deben quedar firmes. Enfría en agua fría durante unos 5 minutos, pela y corta cada huevo en cuatro. Cuenta unos 15 minutos de cocción, incluido el calentamiento del agua.","image_url":"/recetas/como-preparar-limon-serrano-la-receta-de-ensalada-mas-buscada/paso-02.webp","image_alt":"Limón serrano: cuece y enfría los huevos"},{"title":"Pela y corta los cítricos","content":"Retira la piel y la parte blanca de las naranjas y el limón con un cuchillo. Pesa 500 g de naranja y 100 g de limón ya pelados. Corta en rodajas o trozos de unos 5 mm, elimina las semillas y recoge el zumo que caiga en un cuenco para el aliño.","image_url":"/recetas/como-preparar-limon-serrano-la-receta-de-ensalada-mas-buscada/paso-03.webp","image_alt":"Limón serrano: pela y corta los cítricos"},{"title":"Corta los embutidos","content":"Corta los 80 g de jamón serrano en tiras cortas y los 60 g de chorizo curado en rodajas finas; retira la tripa si no es comestible. Mantén ambos fríos hasta montar la ensalada. No añadas sal: los embutidos ya aportan bastante.","image_url":"/recetas/como-preparar-limon-serrano-la-receta-de-ensalada-mas-buscada/paso-04.webp","image_alt":"Limón serrano: corta los embutidos"},{"title":"Mezcla el aliño","content":"Pica muy fino o ralla los 3 g de ajo. Mézclalo con los 25 g de aceite, los 15 ml de vino blanco y todo el zumo recogido al cortar los cítricos. Bate con un tenedor hasta que se unan; el vino se añade sin cocinar y conserva alcohol.","image_url":"/recetas/como-preparar-limon-serrano-la-receta-de-ensalada-mas-buscada/paso-05.webp","image_alt":"Limón serrano: mezcla el aliño"},{"title":"Monta la ensalada","content":"Reparte la naranja y el limón en una fuente ancha. Distribuye el jamón y el chorizo, vierte el aliño y mueve con suavidad sin romper los cítricos. Coloca encima los 16 cuartos de huevo, con las yemas visibles.","image_url":"/recetas/como-preparar-limon-serrano-la-receta-de-ensalada-mas-buscada/paso-06.webp","image_alt":"Limón serrano: monta la ensalada"},{"title":"Reparte y sirve","content":"Divide en 4 porciones procurando repartir cítricos, embutidos y un huevo por persona. Sirve recién montada. Si no se consume enseguida, tapa y refrigera; usa esta preparación dentro de 24 horas para conservar mejor su textura. No la dejes más de 2 horas a temperatura ambiente.","image_url":"/recetas/como-preparar-limon-serrano-la-receta-de-ensalada-mas-buscada/paso-07.webp","image_alt":"Limón serrano: reparte y sirve"}],"notes":"La proporción de naranja es mayor para equilibrar el limón; retira bien la parte blanca y las semillas para reducir el amargor. Para adelantar trabajo, guarda huevos cocidos, cítricos, embutidos y aliño en recipientes separados en la nevera y mezcla al servir. El vino queda crudo: para una versión sin alcohol, sustitúyelo por 15 ml de zumo de naranja; el cálculo nutricional corresponde a la versión con vino. Contiene huevo; los embutidos y el vino pueden contener otros alérgenos o sulfitos, según sus etiquetas.","nutrition":{"calories":295.2,"protein_g":15.5,"carbs_g":18.0,"fat_g":18.3,"saturated_fat_g":4.9,"fiber_g":3.7,"sugar_g":13.0,"sodium_mg":626.0,"serving_size":"1 de 4 porciones, aproximadamente 245 g","estimated":true,"source":"USDA FoodData Central — SR Legacy (abril de 2018)","source_url":"https://fdc.nal.usda.gov/download-datasets/","method":"Valores por 100 g de cada ficha FDC verificada, multiplicados por los gramos comestibles y divididos entre 4. Se incluye todo el aceite y el vino; se aproxima 15 ml de vino a 15 g. Sin sal añadida ni acompañamientos.","note":"Estimación, no análisis del plato. Jamón serrano y chorizo curado se aproximan con fichas genéricas de jamón curado cocinado y salami seco de cerdo y vacuno; especialmente sodio, grasa y energía pueden variar considerablemente según la marca. Comprueba las etiquetas para mayor precisión.","inputs":[{"ingredient":"naranja pelada","edible_grams":500,"fdc_id":169097,"fdc_description":"Oranges, raw, all commercial varieties","per_100g":{"sugar_g":9.35,"fat_g":0.12,"carbs_g":11.75,"calories":47.0,"saturated_fat_g":0.015,"fiber_g":2.4,"sodium_mg":0.0,"protein_g":0.94},"source_url":"https://fdc.nal.usda.gov/food-details/169097/nutrients"},{"ingredient":"limón pelado","edible_grams":100,"fdc_id":167746,"fdc_description":"Lemons, raw, without peel","per_100g":{"sugar_g":2.5,"protein_g":1.1,"fiber_g":2.8,"sodium_mg":2.0,"saturated_fat_g":0.039,"fat_g":0.3,"carbs_g":9.32,"calories":29.0},"source_url":"https://fdc.nal.usda.gov/food-details/167746/nutrients"},{"ingredient":"huevo cocido sin cáscara","edible_grams":200,"fdc_id":173424,"fdc_description":"Egg, whole, cooked, hard-boiled","per_100g":{"sugar_g":1.12,"fiber_g":0.0,"calories":155.0,"protein_g":12.58,"sodium_mg":124.0,"saturated_fat_g":3.267,"fat_g":10.61,"carbs_g":1.12},"source_url":"https://fdc.nal.usda.gov/food-details/173424/nutrients"},{"ingredient":"jamón serrano","edible_grams":80,"fdc_id":167872,"fdc_description":"Pork, cured, ham, boneless, regular (approximately 11% fat), roasted","per_100g":{"sugar_g":0.0,"fat_g":9.02,"carbs_g":0.0,"calories":178.0,"protein_g":22.62,"fiber_g":0.0,"sodium_mg":1500.0,"saturated_fat_g":3.12},"source_url":"https://fdc.nal.usda.gov/food-details/167872/nutrients","proxy_note":"Aproximación con jamón curado cocinado genérico: no corresponde exactamente a jamón serrano seco."},{"ingredient":"chorizo curado listo para comer","edible_grams":60,"fdc_id":174582,"fdc_description":"Salami, dry or hard, pork, beef","per_100g":{"calories":378.0,"saturated_fat_g":11.418,"sodium_mg":1756.0,"protein_g":21.07,"fat_g":31.65,"carbs_g":0.72,"sugar_g":0.26,"fiber_g":0.0},"source_url":"https://fdc.nal.usda.gov/food-details/174582/nutrients","proxy_note":"Aproximación con salami seco de cerdo y vacuno: no corresponde exactamente al chorizo curado utilizado."},{"ingredient":"aceite de oliva","edible_grams":25,"fdc_id":171413,"fdc_description":"Oil, olive, salad or cooking","per_100g":{"fat_g":100.0,"carbs_g":0.0,"calories":884.0,"sodium_mg":2.0,"protein_g":0.0,"saturated_fat_g":13.808,"fiber_g":0.0,"sugar_g":0.0},"source_url":"https://fdc.nal.usda.gov/food-details/171413/nutrients"},{"ingredient":"ajo pelado","edible_grams":3,"fdc_id":169230,"fdc_description":"Garlic, raw","per_100g":{"carbs_g":33.06,"calories":149.0,"sugar_g":1.0,"saturated_fat_g":0.089,"fiber_g":2.1,"sodium_mg":17.0,"protein_g":6.36,"fat_g":0.5},"source_url":"https://fdc.nal.usda.gov/food-details/169230/nutrients"},{"ingredient":"vino blanco","edible_grams":15,"fdc_id":174837,"fdc_description":"Alcoholic beverage, wine, table, white","per_100g":{"fat_g":0.0,"sugar_g":0.96,"fiber_g":0.0,"sodium_mg":5.0,"saturated_fat_g":0.0,"carbs_g":2.6,"protein_g":0.07,"calories":82.0},"source_url":"https://fdc.nal.usda.gov/food-details/174837/nutrients"}]},"keywords":["limón serrano","ensalada de naranja y limón","receta de la Sierra de Francia"],"image_url":"/recetas/como-preparar-limon-serrano-la-receta-de-ensalada-mas-buscada/portada.webp","gallery":[{"url":"/recetas/como-preparar-limon-serrano-la-receta-de-ensalada-mas-buscada/portada.webp","alt":"Limón serrano con naranja, limón, cuartos de huevo duro, jamón y chorizo curado"}],"seo":{"title":"Limón serrano con cítricos y huevo | Manual de Cocina","description":"Prepara limón serrano con naranja, limón, huevo duro y embutidos curados. Cantidades para 4 porciones, pasos detallados y aliño de aceite, ajo y vino.","image_alt":"Limón serrano con naranja, limón, cuartos de huevo duro, jamón y chorizo curado","image_variants":["/recetas/como-preparar-limon-serrano-la-receta-de-ensalada-mas-buscada/portada-1x1.webp","/recetas/como-preparar-limon-serrano-la-receta-de-ensalada-mas-buscada/portada-4x3.webp","/recetas/como-preparar-limon-serrano-la-receta-de-ensalada-mas-buscada/portada-16x9.webp"],"faq":[{"q":"¿Cómo evito que el limón serrano quede amargo?","a":"Retira completamente la parte blanca y las semillas. Pesa los cítricos después de pelarlos y respeta la proporción de 500 g de naranja por 100 g de limón."},{"q":"¿Se puede hacer sin vino?","a":"Sí. Sustituye los 15 ml por la misma cantidad de zumo de naranja. Cambia ligeramente el sabor y la nutrición; la estimación publicada incluye vino."},{"q":"¿Puedo usar chorizo fresco?","a":"Esta receta utiliza chorizo curado listo para comer. El chorizo fresco requiere una cocción completa distinta y no se debe servir crudo siguiendo estos pasos."}]},"published":false,"editorial_status":"draft","content_html":"<p>El limón serrano es una ensalada de la Sierra de Francia, en Salamanca. Esta versión combina naranja, una proporción menor de limón, huevo duro, jamón y chorizo curado, con un aliño de aceite, ajo y vino blanco. Las proporciones y el método que siguen son una propuesta propia; existen variantes locales.</p><p>Rinde 4 porciones de unos 245 g. Cuenta aproximadamente 40 minutos de principio a fin, incluidos 5 minutos para enfriar los huevos. Usa exclusivamente chorizo curado etiquetado como listo para comer.</p>"},{"id":"22b9b842-ac9c-5c97-aed6-e242104513f1","recipe_group_id":"7dcd70ca-9fa9-40cc-95b8-a6444db4a292","slug":"wie-man-serrano-zitrone-das-meistgesuchte-salat-rezept-zubereitet-2","public_path":"/de/wie-man-serrano-zitrone-das-meistgesuchte-salat-rezept-zubereitet-2","source_url":"https://manualdecocina.com/de/wie-man-serrano-zitrone-das-meistgesuchte-salat-rezept-zubereitet-2/","language":"de","title":"Limón serrano: Zitrussalat mit Ei und Wurst","excerpt":"Limón serrano mit Orange, Zitrone, hart gekochten Eiern und gereifter Wurst: Mengen für 4 Portionen und ein Dressing aus Olivenöl, Knoblauch und Wein.","summary":"Limón serrano ist ein Salat aus der Sierra de Francia in der spanischen Provinz Salamanca. Diese Variante verbindet Orange, einen kleineren Anteil Zitrone, hart gekochte Eier, Serrano-Schinken und gereifte Chorizo mit Olivenöl, Knoblauch und Weißwein. Mengen und Anleitung sind ein eigener Rezeptvorschlag; örtliche Varianten unterscheiden sich.\n\nErgibt 4 Portionen von ungefähr 245 g. Insgesamt etwa 40 Minuten einplanen, einschließlich 5 Minuten zum Abkühlen der Eier. Ausschließlich gereifte Chorizo verwenden, die laut Etikett verzehrfertig ist.","category":"Salate","category_slug":"ensaladas","difficulty":"Einfach","course":"Vorspeise","cuisine":"Salamanca, Spanien","prep_time_minutes":20,"cook_time_minutes":15,"total_time_minutes":40,"servings":4,"ingredients":[{"name":"Orange, nach dem Schälen gewogen","amount":"500","unit":"g","group":"Salat"},{"name":"Zitrone, nach dem Schälen gewogen","amount":"100","unit":"g","group":"Salat"},{"name":"große Eier, gekocht ohne Schale etwa 200 g","amount":"4","unit":"Stück","group":"Salat"},{"name":"verzehrfertiger Serrano-Schinken","amount":"80","unit":"g","group":"Salat"},{"name":"verzehrfertige gereifte Chorizo","amount":"60","unit":"g","group":"Salat"},{"name":"natives Olivenöl extra","amount":"25","unit":"g","group":"Dressing"},{"name":"geschälter Knoblauch","amount":"3","unit":"g","group":"Dressing"},{"name":"Weißwein","amount":"15","unit":"ml","group":"Dressing"}],"steps":[{"title":"Zutaten bereitstellen","content":"Orangen und Zitrone vor dem Schälen waschen. 4 Eier, 80 g Serrano-Schinken, 60 g gereifte Chorizo, 25 g Öl, 3 g geschälten Knoblauch und 15 ml Wein bereitstellen. Beide Fleischwaren müssen laut Etikett verzehrfertig sein; frische rohe Chorizo wird in diesem Rezept nicht gegart.","image_url":"/recetas/como-preparar-limon-serrano-la-receta-de-ensalada-mas-buscada/paso-01.webp","image_alt":"Limón serrano: Zitrussalat mit Ei und Wurst: Zutaten bereitstellen"},{"title":"Eier kochen und abkühlen","content":"Eier in einen Topf legen und etwa 2 cm hoch mit kaltem Wasser bedecken. Aufkochen, dann 12 Minuten sanft köcheln lassen; Eigelb und Eiweiß müssen fest sein. Etwa 5 Minuten in kaltem Wasser abkühlen, schälen und jedes Ei vierteln. Mit dem Erhitzen des Wassers ungefähr 15 Minuten Kochzeit einplanen.","image_url":"/recetas/como-preparar-limon-serrano-la-receta-de-ensalada-mas-buscada/paso-02.webp","image_alt":"Limón serrano: Zitrussalat mit Ei und Wurst: Eier kochen und abkühlen"},{"title":"Zitrusfrüchte schälen und schneiden","content":"Schale und weiße Haut mit einem Messer vollständig von Orangen und Zitrone entfernen. 500 g geschälte Orange und 100 g geschälte Zitrone abwiegen. In etwa 5 mm dicke Scheiben oder Stücke schneiden, Kerne entfernen und austretenden Saft für das Dressing in einer Schüssel auffangen.","image_url":"/recetas/como-preparar-limon-serrano-la-receta-de-ensalada-mas-buscada/paso-03.webp","image_alt":"Limón serrano: Zitrussalat mit Ei und Wurst: Zitrusfrüchte schälen und schneiden"},{"title":"Schinken und Chorizo schneiden","content":"80 g Serrano-Schinken in kurze Streifen und 60 g gereifte Chorizo in dünne Scheiben schneiden. Nicht essbare Wursthülle entfernen. Bis zum Anrichten kühl halten. Kein Salz zugeben: Die Fleischwaren enthalten bereits reichlich davon.","image_url":"/recetas/como-preparar-limon-serrano-la-receta-de-ensalada-mas-buscada/paso-04.webp","image_alt":"Limón serrano: Zitrussalat mit Ei und Wurst: Schinken und Chorizo schneiden"},{"title":"Dressing verrühren","content":"3 g Knoblauch sehr fein hacken oder reiben. Mit 25 g Öl, 15 ml Weißwein und dem gesamten aufgefangenen Zitrussaft mischen. Mit einer Gabel verrühren. Der Wein wird nicht erhitzt und enthält weiterhin Alkohol.","image_url":"/recetas/como-preparar-limon-serrano-la-receta-de-ensalada-mas-buscada/paso-05.webp","image_alt":"Limón serrano: Zitrussalat mit Ei und Wurst: Dressing verrühren"},{"title":"Salat anrichten","content":"Orange und Zitrone auf einer breiten Platte verteilen. Schinken und Chorizo daraufgeben, mit dem Dressing beträufeln und vorsichtig bewegen, ohne die Früchte zu zerdrücken. Die 16 Eiviertel mit sichtbarem Eigelb darauflegen.","image_url":"/recetas/como-preparar-limon-serrano-la-receta-de-ensalada-mas-buscada/paso-06.webp","image_alt":"Limón serrano: Zitrussalat mit Ei und Wurst: Salat anrichten"},{"title":"Aufteilen und servieren","content":"In 4 Portionen aufteilen und dabei Zitrusfrüchte, Fleischwaren und je ein Ei gleichmäßig verteilen. Frisch angerichtet servieren. Bei späterem Verzehr abdecken und kühlen; für eine gute Konsistenz innerhalb von 24 Stunden verwenden. Nicht länger als 2 Stunden bei Zimmertemperatur stehen lassen.","image_url":"/recetas/como-preparar-limon-serrano-la-receta-de-ensalada-mas-buscada/paso-07.webp","image_alt":"Limón serrano: Zitrussalat mit Ei und Wurst: Aufteilen und servieren"}],"notes":"Der höhere Orangenanteil gleicht die Säure der Zitrone aus. Weiße Haut und Kerne gründlich entfernen, um Bitterkeit zu verringern. Zum Vorbereiten gekochte Eier, Früchte, Fleischwaren und Dressing getrennt im Kühlschrank aufbewahren und erst zum Servieren mischen. Der Wein bleibt unerhitzt; für eine alkoholfreie Variante durch 15 ml Orangensaft ersetzen. Die Nährwertberechnung gilt für die Variante mit Wein. Enthält Ei; je nach Etikett können Fleischwaren und Wein weitere Allergene oder Sulfite enthalten.","nutrition":{"calories":295.2,"protein_g":15.5,"carbs_g":18.0,"fat_g":18.3,"saturated_fat_g":4.9,"fiber_g":3.7,"sugar_g":13.0,"sodium_mg":626.0,"serving_size":"1 von 4 Portionen, ungefähr 245 g","estimated":true,"source":"USDA FoodData Central — SR Legacy (abril de 2018)","source_url":"https://fdc.nal.usda.gov/download-datasets/","method":"Geprüfte USDA-Werte je 100 g werden mit dem essbaren Zutatengewicht multipliziert und durch 4 geteilt. Öl und Wein sind vollständig eingerechnet; 15 ml Wein entsprechen näherungsweise 15 g. Ohne zusätzliches Salz und Beilagen.","note":"Schätzung, keine Laboranalyse dieses Gerichts. Serrano-Schinken und gereifte Chorizo werden durch generische Datensätze für gegarten gepökelten Schinken und trockene Schweine-Rind-Salami angenähert. Natrium, Fett und Energie können je nach Marke erheblich abweichen. Für genauere Werte die Produktetiketten prüfen.","inputs":[{"ingredient":"Orange, nach dem Schälen gewogen","edible_grams":500,"fdc_id":169097,"fdc_description":"Oranges, raw, all commercial varieties","per_100g":{"sugar_g":9.35,"fat_g":0.12,"carbs_g":11.75,"calories":47.0,"saturated_fat_g":0.015,"fiber_g":2.4,"sodium_mg":0.0,"protein_g":0.94},"source_url":"https://fdc.nal.usda.gov/food-details/169097/nutrients"},{"ingredient":"Zitrone, nach dem Schälen gewogen","edible_grams":100,"fdc_id":167746,"fdc_description":"Lemons, raw, without peel","per_100g":{"sugar_g":2.5,"protein_g":1.1,"fiber_g":2.8,"sodium_mg":2.0,"saturated_fat_g":0.039,"fat_g":0.3,"carbs_g":9.32,"calories":29.0},"source_url":"https://fdc.nal.usda.gov/food-details/167746/nutrients"},{"ingredient":"große Eier, gekocht ohne Schale etwa 200 g","edible_grams":200,"fdc_id":173424,"fdc_description":"Egg, whole, cooked, hard-boiled","per_100g":{"sugar_g":1.12,"fiber_g":0.0,"calories":155.0,"protein_g":12.58,"sodium_mg":124.0,"saturated_fat_g":3.267,"fat_g":10.61,"carbs_g":1.12},"source_url":"https://fdc.nal.usda.gov/food-details/173424/nutrients"},{"ingredient":"verzehrfertiger Serrano-Schinken","edible_grams":80,"fdc_id":167872,"fdc_description":"Pork, cured, ham, boneless, regular (approximately 11% fat), roasted","per_100g":{"sugar_g":0.0,"fat_g":9.02,"carbs_g":0.0,"calories":178.0,"protein_g":22.62,"fiber_g":0.0,"sodium_mg":1500.0,"saturated_fat_g":3.12},"source_url":"https://fdc.nal.usda.gov/food-details/167872/nutrients","proxy_note":"Näherungswert für generischen gegarten gepökelten Schinken; kein exakter Datensatz für luftgetrockneten Serrano-Schinken."},{"ingredient":"verzehrfertige gereifte Chorizo","edible_grams":60,"fdc_id":174582,"fdc_description":"Salami, dry or hard, pork, beef","per_100g":{"calories":378.0,"saturated_fat_g":11.418,"sodium_mg":1756.0,"protein_g":21.07,"fat_g":31.65,"carbs_g":0.72,"sugar_g":0.26,"fiber_g":0.0},"source_url":"https://fdc.nal.usda.gov/food-details/174582/nutrients","proxy_note":"Näherungswert für trockene Schweine-Rind-Salami; kein exakter Datensatz für die verwendete gereifte Chorizo."},{"ingredient":"natives Olivenöl extra","edible_grams":25,"fdc_id":171413,"fdc_description":"Oil, olive, salad or cooking","per_100g":{"fat_g":100.0,"carbs_g":0.0,"calories":884.0,"sodium_mg":2.0,"protein_g":0.0,"saturated_fat_g":13.808,"fiber_g":0.0,"sugar_g":0.0},"source_url":"https://fdc.nal.usda.gov/food-details/171413/nutrients"},{"ingredient":"geschälter Knoblauch","edible_grams":3,"fdc_id":169230,"fdc_description":"Garlic, raw","per_100g":{"carbs_g":33.06,"calories":149.0,"sugar_g":1.0,"saturated_fat_g":0.089,"fiber_g":2.1,"sodium_mg":17.0,"protein_g":6.36,"fat_g":0.5},"source_url":"https://fdc.nal.usda.gov/food-details/169230/nutrients"},{"ingredient":"Weißwein","edible_grams":15,"fdc_id":174837,"fdc_description":"Alcoholic beverage, wine, table, white","per_100g":{"fat_g":0.0,"sugar_g":0.96,"fiber_g":0.0,"sodium_mg":5.0,"saturated_fat_g":0.0,"carbs_g":2.6,"protein_g":0.07,"calories":82.0},"source_url":"https://fdc.nal.usda.gov/food-details/174837/nutrients"}]},"keywords":["Limón serrano","Orangen-Zitronen-Salat","Rezept aus der Sierra de Francia"],"image_url":"/recetas/como-preparar-limon-serrano-la-receta-de-ensalada-mas-buscada/portada.webp","gallery":[{"url":"/recetas/como-preparar-limon-serrano-la-receta-de-ensalada-mas-buscada/portada.webp","alt":"Limón serrano mit Orange, Zitrone, hart gekochten Eivierteln, Serrano-Schinken und gereifter Chorizo"}],"seo":{"title":"Limón serrano mit Zitrusfrüchten | Manual de Cocina","description":"Limón serrano mit Orange, Zitrone, hart gekochten Eiern und gereifter Wurst: Mengen für 4 Portionen und ein Dressing aus Olivenöl, Knoblauch und Wein.","image_alt":"Limón serrano mit Orange, Zitrone, hart gekochten Eivierteln, Serrano-Schinken und gereifter Chorizo","image_variants":["/recetas/como-preparar-limon-serrano-la-receta-de-ensalada-mas-buscada/portada-1x1.webp","/recetas/como-preparar-limon-serrano-la-receta-de-ensalada-mas-buscada/portada-4x3.webp","/recetas/como-preparar-limon-serrano-la-receta-de-ensalada-mas-buscada/portada-16x9.webp"],"faq":[{"q":"Wie vermeide ich einen bitteren Salat?","a":"Die weiße Haut und alle Kerne entfernen. Früchte nach dem Schälen wiegen und 500 g Orange auf 100 g Zitrone verwenden."},{"q":"Geht es ohne Wein?","a":"Ja. Die 15 ml Wein durch dieselbe Menge Orangensaft ersetzen. Geschmack und Nährwerte ändern sich etwas; die veröffentlichte Schätzung enthält Wein."},{"q":"Kann ich frische Chorizo verwenden?","a":"Dieses Rezept verwendet verzehrfertige gereifte Chorizo. Frische Chorizo benötigt eine andere, vollständige Garung und darf nach diesen Schritten nicht roh serviert werden."}]},"published":false,"editorial_status":"draft","content_html":"<p>Limón serrano ist ein Salat aus der Sierra de Francia in der spanischen Provinz Salamanca. Diese Variante verbindet Orange, einen kleineren Anteil Zitrone, hart gekochte Eier, Serrano-Schinken und gereifte Chorizo mit Olivenöl, Knoblauch und Weißwein. Mengen und Anleitung sind ein eigener Rezeptvorschlag; örtliche Varianten unterscheiden sich.</p><p>Ergibt 4 Portionen von ungefähr 245 g. Insgesamt etwa 40 Minuten einplanen, einschließlich 5 Minuten zum Abkühlen der Eier. Ausschließlich gereifte Chorizo verwenden, die laut Etikett verzehrfertig ist.</p>"},{"id":"f669eca3-e817-5a12-89a3-39e98c538bf3","recipe_group_id":"7dcd70ca-9fa9-40cc-95b8-a6444db4a292","slug":"how-to-prepare-serrano-lemon-the-most-searched-for-salad-recipe","public_path":"/en/how-to-prepare-serrano-lemon-the-most-searched-for-salad-recipe","source_url":"https://manualdecocina.com/en/how-to-prepare-serrano-lemon-the-most-searched-for-salad-recipe/","language":"en","title":"Limón serrano: citrus, egg and cured meat salad","excerpt":"Make limón serrano with oranges, lemon, hard-boiled eggs and cured meats. Ingredients for 4 servings and an olive oil, garlic and wine dressing.","summary":"Limón serrano is a salad from the Sierra de Francia area of Salamanca, Spain. This version combines orange, a smaller amount of lemon, hard-boiled eggs, cured ham and dry-cured chorizo, dressed with olive oil, garlic and white wine. These proportions and instructions are an original proposal; local versions vary.\n\nMakes 4 servings of approximately 245 g. Allow about 40 minutes from start to finish, including 5 minutes to cool the eggs. Use only dry-cured chorizo labelled ready to eat.","category":"Salads","category_slug":"ensaladas","difficulty":"Easy","course":"Starter","cuisine":"Salamanca, Spain","prep_time_minutes":20,"cook_time_minutes":15,"total_time_minutes":40,"servings":4,"ingredients":[{"name":"orange, weighed after peeling","amount":"500","unit":"g","group":"Salad"},{"name":"lemon, weighed after peeling","amount":"100","unit":"g","group":"Salad"},{"name":"large eggs, about 200 g cooked without shells","amount":"4","unit":"pieces","group":"Salad"},{"name":"ready-to-eat Serrano ham","amount":"80","unit":"g","group":"Salad"},{"name":"ready-to-eat dry-cured chorizo","amount":"60","unit":"g","group":"Salad"},{"name":"extra virgin olive oil","amount":"25","unit":"g","group":"Dressing"},{"name":"peeled garlic","amount":"3","unit":"g","group":"Dressing"},{"name":"white wine","amount":"15","unit":"ml","group":"Dressing"}],"steps":[{"title":"Gather the ingredients","content":"Wash the oranges and lemon before peeling. Set out 4 eggs, 80 g Serrano ham, 60 g dry-cured chorizo, 25 g oil, 3 g peeled garlic and 15 ml wine. Check that both cured meats are labelled ready to eat; this preparation does not cook fresh chorizo.","image_url":"/recetas/como-preparar-limon-serrano-la-receta-de-ensalada-mas-buscada/paso-01.webp","image_alt":"Limón serrano: citrus, egg and cured meat salad: Gather the ingredients"},{"title":"Cook and cool the eggs","content":"Place the eggs in a saucepan and cover with cold water by about 2 cm. Bring to a boil, then simmer gently for 12 minutes; both yolks and whites must be firm. Cool in cold water for about 5 minutes, peel and cut each egg into quarters. Allow approximately 15 minutes for cooking, including heating the water.","image_url":"/recetas/como-preparar-limon-serrano-la-receta-de-ensalada-mas-buscada/paso-02.webp","image_alt":"Limón serrano: citrus, egg and cured meat salad: Cook and cool the eggs"},{"title":"Peel and slice the citrus","content":"Use a knife to remove the orange and lemon peel and white pith. Weigh out 500 g peeled orange and 100 g peeled lemon. Cut into slices or pieces about 5 mm thick, remove the seeds and collect any juice in a bowl for the dressing.","image_url":"/recetas/como-preparar-limon-serrano-la-receta-de-ensalada-mas-buscada/paso-03.webp","image_alt":"Limón serrano: citrus, egg and cured meat salad: Peel and slice the citrus"},{"title":"Slice the cured meats","content":"Cut the 80 g Serrano ham into short strips and the 60 g dry-cured chorizo into thin rounds; remove the casing if it is not edible. Keep both chilled until assembly. Do not add salt: the cured meats already supply plenty.","image_url":"/recetas/como-preparar-limon-serrano-la-receta-de-ensalada-mas-buscada/paso-04.webp","image_alt":"Limón serrano: citrus, egg and cured meat salad: Slice the cured meats"},{"title":"Mix the dressing","content":"Finely mince or grate the 3 g garlic. Mix with the 25 g oil, 15 ml white wine and all the juice collected from the citrus. Whisk with a fork until combined. The wine is added uncooked and retains alcohol.","image_url":"/recetas/como-preparar-limon-serrano-la-receta-de-ensalada-mas-buscada/paso-05.webp","image_alt":"Limón serrano: citrus, egg and cured meat salad: Mix the dressing"},{"title":"Assemble the salad","content":"Arrange the orange and lemon on a wide platter. Distribute the ham and chorizo, pour over the dressing and move gently without breaking up the citrus. Place the 16 egg quarters on top with their yolks visible.","image_url":"/recetas/como-preparar-limon-serrano-la-receta-de-ensalada-mas-buscada/paso-06.webp","image_alt":"Limón serrano: citrus, egg and cured meat salad: Assemble the salad"},{"title":"Portion and serve","content":"Divide into 4 servings, distributing citrus, cured meats and one egg per person. Serve freshly assembled. If not eating immediately, cover and refrigerate; use within 24 hours for the best texture. Do not leave at room temperature for more than 2 hours.","image_url":"/recetas/como-preparar-limon-serrano-la-receta-de-ensalada-mas-buscada/paso-07.webp","image_alt":"Limón serrano: citrus, egg and cured meat salad: Portion and serve"}],"notes":"The larger proportion of orange balances the lemon. Remove the white pith and seeds thoroughly to reduce bitterness. To prepare ahead, refrigerate cooked eggs, citrus, cured meats and dressing separately, then assemble just before serving. The wine remains uncooked: for an alcohol-free version, replace it with 15 ml orange juice; the nutrition calculation is for the wine version. Contains egg; cured meats and wine may contain other allergens or sulphites, so check their labels.","nutrition":{"calories":295.2,"protein_g":15.5,"carbs_g":18.0,"fat_g":18.3,"saturated_fat_g":4.9,"fiber_g":3.7,"sugar_g":13.0,"sodium_mg":626.0,"serving_size":"1 of 4 servings, approximately 245 g","estimated":true,"source":"USDA FoodData Central — SR Legacy (abril de 2018)","source_url":"https://fdc.nal.usda.gov/download-datasets/","method":"Verified USDA values per 100 g are multiplied by each edible ingredient weight and divided by 4. All oil and wine are included; 15 ml wine is approximated as 15 g. No added salt or side dishes.","note":"Estimate, not a laboratory analysis of this dish. Serrano ham and dry-cured chorizo are approximated using generic cooked cured ham and dry pork-and-beef salami records; sodium, fat and energy may vary considerably by brand. Check product labels for a more accurate estimate.","inputs":[{"ingredient":"orange, weighed after peeling","edible_grams":500,"fdc_id":169097,"fdc_description":"Oranges, raw, all commercial varieties","per_100g":{"sugar_g":9.35,"fat_g":0.12,"carbs_g":11.75,"calories":47.0,"saturated_fat_g":0.015,"fiber_g":2.4,"sodium_mg":0.0,"protein_g":0.94},"source_url":"https://fdc.nal.usda.gov/food-details/169097/nutrients"},{"ingredient":"lemon, weighed after peeling","edible_grams":100,"fdc_id":167746,"fdc_description":"Lemons, raw, without peel","per_100g":{"sugar_g":2.5,"protein_g":1.1,"fiber_g":2.8,"sodium_mg":2.0,"saturated_fat_g":0.039,"fat_g":0.3,"carbs_g":9.32,"calories":29.0},"source_url":"https://fdc.nal.usda.gov/food-details/167746/nutrients"},{"ingredient":"large eggs, about 200 g cooked without shells","edible_grams":200,"fdc_id":173424,"fdc_description":"Egg, whole, cooked, hard-boiled","per_100g":{"sugar_g":1.12,"fiber_g":0.0,"calories":155.0,"protein_g":12.58,"sodium_mg":124.0,"saturated_fat_g":3.267,"fat_g":10.61,"carbs_g":1.12},"source_url":"https://fdc.nal.usda.gov/food-details/173424/nutrients"},{"ingredient":"ready-to-eat Serrano ham","edible_grams":80,"fdc_id":167872,"fdc_description":"Pork, cured, ham, boneless, regular (approximately 11% fat), roasted","per_100g":{"sugar_g":0.0,"fat_g":9.02,"carbs_g":0.0,"calories":178.0,"protein_g":22.62,"fiber_g":0.0,"sodium_mg":1500.0,"saturated_fat_g":3.12},"source_url":"https://fdc.nal.usda.gov/food-details/167872/nutrients","proxy_note":"Approximation using generic cooked cured ham, not an exact record for dry-cured Serrano ham."},{"ingredient":"ready-to-eat dry-cured chorizo","edible_grams":60,"fdc_id":174582,"fdc_description":"Salami, dry or hard, pork, beef","per_100g":{"calories":378.0,"saturated_fat_g":11.418,"sodium_mg":1756.0,"protein_g":21.07,"fat_g":31.65,"carbs_g":0.72,"sugar_g":0.26,"fiber_g":0.0},"source_url":"https://fdc.nal.usda.gov/food-details/174582/nutrients","proxy_note":"Approximation using dry pork-and-beef salami, not an exact record for the dry-cured chorizo used."},{"ingredient":"extra virgin olive oil","edible_grams":25,"fdc_id":171413,"fdc_description":"Oil, olive, salad or cooking","per_100g":{"fat_g":100.0,"carbs_g":0.0,"calories":884.0,"sodium_mg":2.0,"protein_g":0.0,"saturated_fat_g":13.808,"fiber_g":0.0,"sugar_g":0.0},"source_url":"https://fdc.nal.usda.gov/food-details/171413/nutrients"},{"ingredient":"peeled garlic","edible_grams":3,"fdc_id":169230,"fdc_description":"Garlic, raw","per_100g":{"carbs_g":33.06,"calories":149.0,"sugar_g":1.0,"saturated_fat_g":0.089,"fiber_g":2.1,"sodium_mg":17.0,"protein_g":6.36,"fat_g":0.5},"source_url":"https://fdc.nal.usda.gov/food-details/169230/nutrients"},{"ingredient":"white wine","edible_grams":15,"fdc_id":174837,"fdc_description":"Alcoholic beverage, wine, table, white","per_100g":{"fat_g":0.0,"sugar_g":0.96,"fiber_g":0.0,"sodium_mg":5.0,"saturated_fat_g":0.0,"carbs_g":2.6,"protein_g":0.07,"calories":82.0},"source_url":"https://fdc.nal.usda.gov/food-details/174837/nutrients"}]},"keywords":["limón serrano","orange and lemon salad","Sierra de Francia recipe"],"image_url":"/recetas/como-preparar-limon-serrano-la-receta-de-ensalada-mas-buscada/portada.webp","gallery":[{"url":"/recetas/como-preparar-limon-serrano-la-receta-de-ensalada-mas-buscada/portada.webp","alt":"Limón serrano with orange, lemon, hard-boiled egg quarters, Serrano ham and dry-cured chorizo"}],"seo":{"title":"Limón serrano citrus salad | Manual de Cocina","description":"Make limón serrano with oranges, lemon, hard-boiled eggs and cured meats. Ingredients for 4 servings and an olive oil, garlic and wine dressing.","image_alt":"Limón serrano with orange, lemon, hard-boiled egg quarters, Serrano ham and dry-cured chorizo","image_variants":["/recetas/como-preparar-limon-serrano-la-receta-de-ensalada-mas-buscada/portada-1x1.webp","/recetas/como-preparar-limon-serrano-la-receta-de-ensalada-mas-buscada/portada-4x3.webp","/recetas/como-preparar-limon-serrano-la-receta-de-ensalada-mas-buscada/portada-16x9.webp"],"faq":[{"q":"How do I prevent a bitter limón serrano?","a":"Remove all the white pith and seeds. Weigh the citrus after peeling and use 500 g orange to 100 g lemon."},{"q":"Can I make it without wine?","a":"Yes. Replace the 15 ml wine with the same amount of orange juice. Flavour and nutrition change slightly; the published estimate includes wine."},{"q":"Can I use fresh chorizo?","a":"This recipe uses ready-to-eat dry-cured chorizo. Fresh chorizo requires a different, complete cooking process and must not be served raw following these steps."}]},"published":false,"editorial_status":"draft","content_html":"<p>Limón serrano is a salad from the Sierra de Francia area of Salamanca, Spain. This version combines orange, a smaller amount of lemon, hard-boiled eggs, cured ham and dry-cured chorizo, dressed with olive oil, garlic and white wine. These proportions and instructions are an original proposal; local versions vary.</p><p>Makes 4 servings of approximately 245 g. Allow about 40 minutes from start to finish, including 5 minutes to cool the eggs. Use only dry-cured chorizo labelled ready to eat.</p>"},{"id":"3304839e-5fce-5a5d-8597-dd1ce466b90f","recipe_group_id":"7dcd70ca-9fa9-40cc-95b8-a6444db4a292","slug":"comment-preparer-le-citron-serrano-la-recette-de-salade-la-plus-recherchee-2","public_path":"/fr/comment-preparer-le-citron-serrano-la-recette-de-salade-la-plus-recherchee-2","source_url":"https://manualdecocina.com/fr/comment-preparer-le-citron-serrano-la-recette-de-salade-la-plus-recherchee-2/","language":"fr","title":"Limón serrano : salade d’agrumes, œufs et charcuterie","excerpt":"Préparez un limón serrano avec orange, citron, œufs durs et charcuterie. Quantités pour 4 portions et assaisonnement à l’huile, à l’ail et au vin.","summary":"Le limón serrano est une salade de la Sierra de Francia, dans la province de Salamanque, en Espagne. Cette version associe de l’orange, une plus petite quantité de citron, des œufs durs, du jambon serrano et du chorizo sec, avec de l’huile d’olive, de l’ail et du vin blanc. Les proportions et la méthode sont une proposition originale ; les variantes locales diffèrent.\n\nPour 4 portions d’environ 245 g. Comptez environ 40 minutes au total, dont 5 minutes pour refroidir les œufs. Utilisez uniquement du chorizo sec dont l’étiquette indique qu’il est prêt à consommer.","category":"Salades","category_slug":"ensaladas","difficulty":"Facile","course":"Entrée","cuisine":"Salamanque, Espagne","prep_time_minutes":20,"cook_time_minutes":15,"total_time_minutes":40,"servings":4,"ingredients":[{"name":"orange, poids après épluchage","amount":"500","unit":"g","group":"Salade"},{"name":"citron, poids après épluchage","amount":"100","unit":"g","group":"Salade"},{"name":"gros œufs, environ 200 g cuits sans coquille","amount":"4","unit":"unités","group":"Salade"},{"name":"jambon serrano prêt à consommer","amount":"80","unit":"g","group":"Salade"},{"name":"chorizo sec prêt à consommer","amount":"60","unit":"g","group":"Salade"},{"name":"huile d’olive vierge extra","amount":"25","unit":"g","group":"Assaisonnement"},{"name":"ail épluché","amount":"3","unit":"g","group":"Assaisonnement"},{"name":"vin blanc","amount":"15","unit":"ml","group":"Assaisonnement"}],"steps":[{"title":"Rassembler les ingrédients","content":"Lavez les oranges et le citron avant de les éplucher. Préparez 4 œufs, 80 g de jambon serrano, 60 g de chorizo sec, 25 g d’huile, 3 g d’ail épluché et 15 ml de vin. Vérifiez que les deux charcuteries sont prêtes à consommer selon leurs étiquettes : cette préparation ne cuit pas le chorizo frais.","image_url":"/recetas/como-preparar-limon-serrano-la-receta-de-ensalada-mas-buscada/paso-01.webp","image_alt":"Limón serrano : salade d’agrumes, œufs et charcuterie: Rassembler les ingrédients"},{"title":"Cuire et refroidir les œufs","content":"Placez les œufs dans une casserole et couvrez-les d’eau froide jusqu’à environ 2 cm au-dessus. Portez à ébullition, puis laissez frémir 12 minutes ; blanc et jaune doivent être fermes. Refroidissez dans l’eau froide environ 5 minutes, écalez et coupez chaque œuf en quatre. Comptez environ 15 minutes de cuisson, chauffage de l’eau compris.","image_url":"/recetas/como-preparar-limon-serrano-la-receta-de-ensalada-mas-buscada/paso-02.webp","image_alt":"Limón serrano : salade d’agrumes, œufs et charcuterie: Cuire et refroidir les œufs"},{"title":"Éplucher et couper les agrumes","content":"Avec un couteau, retirez la peau et toute la partie blanche des oranges et du citron. Pesez 500 g d’orange et 100 g de citron épluchés. Coupez en rondelles ou morceaux d’environ 5 mm, retirez les pépins et recueillez le jus dans un bol pour l’assaisonnement.","image_url":"/recetas/como-preparar-limon-serrano-la-receta-de-ensalada-mas-buscada/paso-03.webp","image_alt":"Limón serrano : salade d’agrumes, œufs et charcuterie: Éplucher et couper les agrumes"},{"title":"Couper la charcuterie","content":"Coupez les 80 g de jambon serrano en courtes lanières et les 60 g de chorizo sec en fines rondelles. Retirez le boyau s’il n’est pas comestible. Gardez au froid jusqu’au montage. N’ajoutez pas de sel : la charcuterie en contient déjà beaucoup.","image_url":"/recetas/como-preparar-limon-serrano-la-receta-de-ensalada-mas-buscada/paso-04.webp","image_alt":"Limón serrano : salade d’agrumes, œufs et charcuterie: Couper la charcuterie"},{"title":"Mélanger l’assaisonnement","content":"Hachez très finement ou râpez les 3 g d’ail. Mélangez avec les 25 g d’huile, les 15 ml de vin blanc et tout le jus recueilli en coupant les agrumes. Fouettez à la fourchette. Le vin n’est pas cuit et conserve de l’alcool.","image_url":"/recetas/como-preparar-limon-serrano-la-receta-de-ensalada-mas-buscada/paso-05.webp","image_alt":"Limón serrano : salade d’agrumes, œufs et charcuterie: Mélanger l’assaisonnement"},{"title":"Assembler la salade","content":"Répartissez orange et citron sur un large plat. Ajoutez le jambon et le chorizo, versez l’assaisonnement et remuez délicatement sans écraser les agrumes. Disposez les 16 quartiers d’œuf dessus, jaunes visibles.","image_url":"/recetas/como-preparar-limon-serrano-la-receta-de-ensalada-mas-buscada/paso-06.webp","image_alt":"Limón serrano : salade d’agrumes, œufs et charcuterie: Assembler la salade"},{"title":"Répartir et servir","content":"Divisez en 4 portions en répartissant agrumes, charcuterie et un œuf par personne. Servez juste après le montage. Sinon, couvrez et réfrigérez ; consommez dans les 24 heures pour préserver la texture. Ne laissez pas plus de 2 heures à température ambiante.","image_url":"/recetas/como-preparar-limon-serrano-la-receta-de-ensalada-mas-buscada/paso-07.webp","image_alt":"Limón serrano : salade d’agrumes, œufs et charcuterie: Répartir et servir"}],"notes":"La proportion plus élevée d’orange équilibre le citron. Retirez soigneusement partie blanche et pépins pour limiter l’amertume. Pour anticiper, conservez œufs cuits, agrumes, charcuterie et assaisonnement dans des récipients séparés au réfrigérateur et assemblez au moment de servir. Le vin reste cru : remplacez-le par 15 ml de jus d’orange pour une version sans alcool. Le calcul nutritionnel concerne la version au vin. Contient de l’œuf ; charcuterie et vin peuvent contenir d’autres allergènes ou des sulfites selon leurs étiquettes.","nutrition":{"calories":295.2,"protein_g":15.5,"carbs_g":18.0,"fat_g":18.3,"saturated_fat_g":4.9,"fiber_g":3.7,"sugar_g":13.0,"sodium_mg":626.0,"serving_size":"1 des 4 portions, environ 245 g","estimated":true,"source":"USDA FoodData Central — SR Legacy (abril de 2018)","source_url":"https://fdc.nal.usda.gov/download-datasets/","method":"Les valeurs USDA vérifiées pour 100 g sont multipliées par le poids comestible de chaque ingrédient puis divisées par 4. Toute l’huile et tout le vin sont inclus ; 15 ml de vin sont assimilés à 15 g. Sans sel ajouté ni accompagnement.","note":"Estimation, pas une analyse en laboratoire du plat. Le jambon serrano et le chorizo sec sont approximés par des données génériques de jambon salé cuit et de salami sec de porc et de bœuf. Sodium, matières grasses et énergie peuvent varier sensiblement selon la marque. Vérifiez les étiquettes pour plus de précision.","inputs":[{"ingredient":"orange, poids après épluchage","edible_grams":500,"fdc_id":169097,"fdc_description":"Oranges, raw, all commercial varieties","per_100g":{"sugar_g":9.35,"fat_g":0.12,"carbs_g":11.75,"calories":47.0,"saturated_fat_g":0.015,"fiber_g":2.4,"sodium_mg":0.0,"protein_g":0.94},"source_url":"https://fdc.nal.usda.gov/food-details/169097/nutrients"},{"ingredient":"citron, poids après épluchage","edible_grams":100,"fdc_id":167746,"fdc_description":"Lemons, raw, without peel","per_100g":{"sugar_g":2.5,"protein_g":1.1,"fiber_g":2.8,"sodium_mg":2.0,"saturated_fat_g":0.039,"fat_g":0.3,"carbs_g":9.32,"calories":29.0},"source_url":"https://fdc.nal.usda.gov/food-details/167746/nutrients"},{"ingredient":"gros œufs, environ 200 g cuits sans coquille","edible_grams":200,"fdc_id":173424,"fdc_description":"Egg, whole, cooked, hard-boiled","per_100g":{"sugar_g":1.12,"fiber_g":0.0,"calories":155.0,"protein_g":12.58,"sodium_mg":124.0,"saturated_fat_g":3.267,"fat_g":10.61,"carbs_g":1.12},"source_url":"https://fdc.nal.usda.gov/food-details/173424/nutrients"},{"ingredient":"jambon serrano prêt à consommer","edible_grams":80,"fdc_id":167872,"fdc_description":"Pork, cured, ham, boneless, regular (approximately 11% fat), roasted","per_100g":{"sugar_g":0.0,"fat_g":9.02,"carbs_g":0.0,"calories":178.0,"protein_g":22.62,"fiber_g":0.0,"sodium_mg":1500.0,"saturated_fat_g":3.12},"source_url":"https://fdc.nal.usda.gov/food-details/167872/nutrients","proxy_note":"Approximation avec un jambon salé cuit générique ; pas une fiche exacte de jambon serrano séché."},{"ingredient":"chorizo sec prêt à consommer","edible_grams":60,"fdc_id":174582,"fdc_description":"Salami, dry or hard, pork, beef","per_100g":{"calories":378.0,"saturated_fat_g":11.418,"sodium_mg":1756.0,"protein_g":21.07,"fat_g":31.65,"carbs_g":0.72,"sugar_g":0.26,"fiber_g":0.0},"source_url":"https://fdc.nal.usda.gov/food-details/174582/nutrients","proxy_note":"Approximation avec du salami sec de porc et de bœuf ; pas une fiche exacte du chorizo sec utilisé."},{"ingredient":"huile d’olive vierge extra","edible_grams":25,"fdc_id":171413,"fdc_description":"Oil, olive, salad or cooking","per_100g":{"fat_g":100.0,"carbs_g":0.0,"calories":884.0,"sodium_mg":2.0,"protein_g":0.0,"saturated_fat_g":13.808,"fiber_g":0.0,"sugar_g":0.0},"source_url":"https://fdc.nal.usda.gov/food-details/171413/nutrients"},{"ingredient":"ail épluché","edible_grams":3,"fdc_id":169230,"fdc_description":"Garlic, raw","per_100g":{"carbs_g":33.06,"calories":149.0,"sugar_g":1.0,"saturated_fat_g":0.089,"fiber_g":2.1,"sodium_mg":17.0,"protein_g":6.36,"fat_g":0.5},"source_url":"https://fdc.nal.usda.gov/food-details/169230/nutrients"},{"ingredient":"vin blanc","edible_grams":15,"fdc_id":174837,"fdc_description":"Alcoholic beverage, wine, table, white","per_100g":{"fat_g":0.0,"sugar_g":0.96,"fiber_g":0.0,"sodium_mg":5.0,"saturated_fat_g":0.0,"carbs_g":2.6,"protein_g":0.07,"calories":82.0},"source_url":"https://fdc.nal.usda.gov/food-details/174837/nutrients"}]},"keywords":["limón serrano","salade d’orange et de citron","recette de la Sierra de Francia"],"image_url":"/recetas/como-preparar-limon-serrano-la-receta-de-ensalada-mas-buscada/portada.webp","gallery":[{"url":"/recetas/como-preparar-limon-serrano-la-receta-de-ensalada-mas-buscada/portada.webp","alt":"Limón serrano avec orange, citron, quartiers d’œuf dur, jambon serrano et chorizo sec"}],"seo":{"title":"Salade limón serrano aux agrumes | Manual de Cocina","description":"Préparez un limón serrano avec orange, citron, œufs durs et charcuterie. Quantités pour 4 portions et assaisonnement à l’huile, à l’ail et au vin.","image_alt":"Limón serrano avec orange, citron, quartiers d’œuf dur, jambon serrano et chorizo sec","image_variants":["/recetas/como-preparar-limon-serrano-la-receta-de-ensalada-mas-buscada/portada-1x1.webp","/recetas/como-preparar-limon-serrano-la-receta-de-ensalada-mas-buscada/portada-4x3.webp","/recetas/como-preparar-limon-serrano-la-receta-de-ensalada-mas-buscada/portada-16x9.webp"],"faq":[{"q":"Comment éviter une salade amère ?","a":"Retirez toute la partie blanche et les pépins. Pesez les agrumes épluchés et respectez 500 g d’orange pour 100 g de citron."},{"q":"Peut-on supprimer le vin ?","a":"Oui. Remplacez les 15 ml par la même quantité de jus d’orange. Saveur et nutrition changent légèrement ; l’estimation publiée comprend du vin."},{"q":"Peut-on utiliser du chorizo frais ?","a":"Cette recette utilise du chorizo sec prêt à consommer. Le chorizo frais exige une cuisson complète différente et ne doit pas être servi cru en suivant ces étapes."}]},"published":false,"editorial_status":"draft","content_html":"<p>Le limón serrano est une salade de la Sierra de Francia, dans la province de Salamanque, en Espagne. Cette version associe de l’orange, une plus petite quantité de citron, des œufs durs, du jambon serrano et du chorizo sec, avec de l’huile d’olive, de l’ail et du vin blanc. Les proportions et la méthode sont une proposition originale ; les variantes locales diffèrent.</p><p>Pour 4 portions d’environ 245 g. Comptez environ 40 minutes au total, dont 5 minutes pour refroidir les œufs. Utilisez uniquement du chorizo sec dont l’étiquette indique qu’il est prêt à consommer.</p>"},{"id":"caf81642-b3d0-588b-8b81-640b48d7c6ef","recipe_group_id":"7dcd70ca-9fa9-40cc-95b8-a6444db4a292","slug":"come-preparare-serrano-limone-la-ricetta-dellinsalata-piu-cercata","public_path":"/it/come-preparare-serrano-limone-la-ricetta-dellinsalata-piu-cercata","source_url":"https://manualdecocina.com/it/come-preparare-serrano-limone-la-ricetta-dellinsalata-piu-cercata/","language":"it","title":"Limón serrano: insalata di agrumi, uova e salumi","excerpt":"Prepara il limón serrano con arancia, limone, uova sode e salumi stagionati. Dosi per 4 porzioni e condimento con olio, aglio e vino bianco.","summary":"Il limón serrano è un’insalata della Sierra de Francia, nella provincia spagnola di Salamanca. Questa versione unisce arancia, una quantità minore di limone, uova sode, prosciutto serrano e chorizo stagionato, con olio d’oliva, aglio e vino bianco. Dosi e procedimento sono una proposta originale; esistono varianti locali.\n\nSi ottengono 4 porzioni di circa 245 g. Calcola circa 40 minuti complessivi, compresi 5 minuti per raffreddare le uova. Usa soltanto chorizo stagionato indicato in etichetta come pronto al consumo.","category":"Insalate","category_slug":"ensaladas","difficulty":"Facile","course":"Antipasto","cuisine":"Salamanca, Spagna","prep_time_minutes":20,"cook_time_minutes":15,"total_time_minutes":40,"servings":4,"ingredients":[{"name":"arancia, peso dopo averla sbucciata","amount":"500","unit":"g","group":"Insalata"},{"name":"limone, peso dopo averlo sbucciato","amount":"100","unit":"g","group":"Insalata"},{"name":"uova grandi, circa 200 g cotte senza guscio","amount":"4","unit":"unità","group":"Insalata"},{"name":"prosciutto serrano pronto al consumo","amount":"80","unit":"g","group":"Insalata"},{"name":"chorizo stagionato pronto al consumo","amount":"60","unit":"g","group":"Insalata"},{"name":"olio extravergine d’oliva","amount":"25","unit":"g","group":"Condimento"},{"name":"aglio sbucciato","amount":"3","unit":"g","group":"Condimento"},{"name":"vino bianco","amount":"15","unit":"ml","group":"Condimento"}],"steps":[{"title":"Prepara gli ingredienti","content":"Lava arance e limone prima di sbucciarli. Prepara 4 uova, 80 g di prosciutto serrano, 60 g di chorizo stagionato, 25 g di olio, 3 g di aglio sbucciato e 15 ml di vino. Verifica che entrambi i salumi siano pronti al consumo secondo l’etichetta: questa preparazione non cuoce il chorizo fresco.","image_url":"/recetas/como-preparar-limon-serrano-la-receta-de-ensalada-mas-buscada/paso-01.webp","image_alt":"Limón serrano: insalata di agrumi, uova e salumi: Prepara gli ingredienti"},{"title":"Cuoci e raffredda le uova","content":"Metti le uova in un pentolino e coprile con acqua fredda fino a circa 2 cm sopra. Porta a ebollizione e lascia sobbollire dolcemente per 12 minuti; albume e tuorlo devono essere sodi. Raffredda in acqua fredda per circa 5 minuti, sguscia e taglia ogni uovo in quattro. Considera circa 15 minuti di cottura, incluso il riscaldamento dell’acqua.","image_url":"/recetas/como-preparar-limon-serrano-la-receta-de-ensalada-mas-buscada/paso-02.webp","image_alt":"Limón serrano: insalata di agrumi, uova e salumi: Cuoci e raffredda le uova"},{"title":"Sbuccia e taglia gli agrumi","content":"Elimina con un coltello buccia e parte bianca di arance e limone. Pesa 500 g di arancia e 100 g di limone già sbucciati. Taglia a fette o pezzi di circa 5 mm, elimina i semi e raccogli il succo in una ciotola per il condimento.","image_url":"/recetas/como-preparar-limon-serrano-la-receta-de-ensalada-mas-buscada/paso-03.webp","image_alt":"Limón serrano: insalata di agrumi, uova e salumi: Sbuccia e taglia gli agrumi"},{"title":"Taglia i salumi","content":"Taglia gli 80 g di prosciutto serrano a striscioline corte e i 60 g di chorizo stagionato a rondelle sottili. Togli il budello se non è commestibile. Conserva al fresco fino al montaggio. Non aggiungere sale: i salumi ne contengono già molto.","image_url":"/recetas/como-preparar-limon-serrano-la-receta-de-ensalada-mas-buscada/paso-04.webp","image_alt":"Limón serrano: insalata di agrumi, uova e salumi: Taglia i salumi"},{"title":"Mescola il condimento","content":"Trita molto finemente o grattugia i 3 g di aglio. Mescola con i 25 g di olio, i 15 ml di vino bianco e tutto il succo raccolto dagli agrumi. Sbatti con una forchetta fino ad amalgamare. Il vino non viene cotto e conserva alcol.","image_url":"/recetas/como-preparar-limon-serrano-la-receta-de-ensalada-mas-buscada/paso-05.webp","image_alt":"Limón serrano: insalata di agrumi, uova e salumi: Mescola il condimento"},{"title":"Componi l’insalata","content":"Distribuisci arancia e limone su un piatto da portata largo. Aggiungi prosciutto e chorizo, versa il condimento e mescola delicatamente senza rompere gli agrumi. Sistema sopra i 16 spicchi d’uovo, con i tuorli visibili.","image_url":"/recetas/como-preparar-limon-serrano-la-receta-de-ensalada-mas-buscada/paso-06.webp","image_alt":"Limón serrano: insalata di agrumi, uova e salumi: Componi l’insalata"},{"title":"Dividi e servi","content":"Dividi in 4 porzioni, distribuendo agrumi, salumi e un uovo per persona. Servi appena composta. Se non la consumi subito, copri e conserva in frigorifero; usa entro 24 ore per mantenere una buona consistenza. Non lasciare a temperatura ambiente per più di 2 ore.","image_url":"/recetas/como-preparar-limon-serrano-la-receta-de-ensalada-mas-buscada/paso-07.webp","image_alt":"Limón serrano: insalata di agrumi, uova e salumi: Dividi e servi"}],"notes":"La maggiore quantità di arancia bilancia il limone. Elimina bene parte bianca e semi per ridurre l’amaro. Per preparare in anticipo, conserva uova cotte, agrumi, salumi e condimento in contenitori separati in frigorifero e unisci al momento di servire. Il vino rimane crudo: per una versione senza alcol sostituiscilo con 15 ml di succo d’arancia. Il calcolo nutrizionale riguarda la versione con vino. Contiene uova; salumi e vino possono contenere altri allergeni o solfiti secondo l’etichetta.","nutrition":{"calories":295.2,"protein_g":15.5,"carbs_g":18.0,"fat_g":18.3,"saturated_fat_g":4.9,"fiber_g":3.7,"sugar_g":13.0,"sodium_mg":626.0,"serving_size":"1 di 4 porzioni, circa 245 g","estimated":true,"source":"USDA FoodData Central — SR Legacy (abril de 2018)","source_url":"https://fdc.nal.usda.gov/download-datasets/","method":"I valori USDA verificati per 100 g sono moltiplicati per il peso commestibile degli ingredienti e divisi per 4. Si conteggiano tutto l’olio e il vino; 15 ml di vino sono approssimati a 15 g. Senza sale aggiunto o contorni.","note":"Stima, non analisi di laboratorio del piatto. Prosciutto serrano e chorizo stagionato sono approssimati con dati generici di prosciutto salato cotto e salame secco di maiale e manzo. Sodio, grassi ed energia possono variare molto secondo la marca. Controlla le etichette per maggiore precisione.","inputs":[{"ingredient":"arancia, peso dopo averla sbucciata","edible_grams":500,"fdc_id":169097,"fdc_description":"Oranges, raw, all commercial varieties","per_100g":{"sugar_g":9.35,"fat_g":0.12,"carbs_g":11.75,"calories":47.0,"saturated_fat_g":0.015,"fiber_g":2.4,"sodium_mg":0.0,"protein_g":0.94},"source_url":"https://fdc.nal.usda.gov/food-details/169097/nutrients"},{"ingredient":"limone, peso dopo averlo sbucciato","edible_grams":100,"fdc_id":167746,"fdc_description":"Lemons, raw, without peel","per_100g":{"sugar_g":2.5,"protein_g":1.1,"fiber_g":2.8,"sodium_mg":2.0,"saturated_fat_g":0.039,"fat_g":0.3,"carbs_g":9.32,"calories":29.0},"source_url":"https://fdc.nal.usda.gov/food-details/167746/nutrients"},{"ingredient":"uova grandi, circa 200 g cotte senza guscio","edible_grams":200,"fdc_id":173424,"fdc_description":"Egg, whole, cooked, hard-boiled","per_100g":{"sugar_g":1.12,"fiber_g":0.0,"calories":155.0,"protein_g":12.58,"sodium_mg":124.0,"saturated_fat_g":3.267,"fat_g":10.61,"carbs_g":1.12},"source_url":"https://fdc.nal.usda.gov/food-details/173424/nutrients"},{"ingredient":"prosciutto serrano pronto al consumo","edible_grams":80,"fdc_id":167872,"fdc_description":"Pork, cured, ham, boneless, regular (approximately 11% fat), roasted","per_100g":{"sugar_g":0.0,"fat_g":9.02,"carbs_g":0.0,"calories":178.0,"protein_g":22.62,"fiber_g":0.0,"sodium_mg":1500.0,"saturated_fat_g":3.12},"source_url":"https://fdc.nal.usda.gov/food-details/167872/nutrients","proxy_note":"Approssimazione con prosciutto salato cotto generico, non una scheda esatta del prosciutto serrano stagionato."},{"ingredient":"chorizo stagionato pronto al consumo","edible_grams":60,"fdc_id":174582,"fdc_description":"Salami, dry or hard, pork, beef","per_100g":{"calories":378.0,"saturated_fat_g":11.418,"sodium_mg":1756.0,"protein_g":21.07,"fat_g":31.65,"carbs_g":0.72,"sugar_g":0.26,"fiber_g":0.0},"source_url":"https://fdc.nal.usda.gov/food-details/174582/nutrients","proxy_note":"Approssimazione con salame secco di maiale e manzo, non una scheda esatta del chorizo stagionato utilizzato."},{"ingredient":"olio extravergine d’oliva","edible_grams":25,"fdc_id":171413,"fdc_description":"Oil, olive, salad or cooking","per_100g":{"fat_g":100.0,"carbs_g":0.0,"calories":884.0,"sodium_mg":2.0,"protein_g":0.0,"saturated_fat_g":13.808,"fiber_g":0.0,"sugar_g":0.0},"source_url":"https://fdc.nal.usda.gov/food-details/171413/nutrients"},{"ingredient":"aglio sbucciato","edible_grams":3,"fdc_id":169230,"fdc_description":"Garlic, raw","per_100g":{"carbs_g":33.06,"calories":149.0,"sugar_g":1.0,"saturated_fat_g":0.089,"fiber_g":2.1,"sodium_mg":17.0,"protein_g":6.36,"fat_g":0.5},"source_url":"https://fdc.nal.usda.gov/food-details/169230/nutrients"},{"ingredient":"vino bianco","edible_grams":15,"fdc_id":174837,"fdc_description":"Alcoholic beverage, wine, table, white","per_100g":{"fat_g":0.0,"sugar_g":0.96,"fiber_g":0.0,"sodium_mg":5.0,"saturated_fat_g":0.0,"carbs_g":2.6,"protein_g":0.07,"calories":82.0},"source_url":"https://fdc.nal.usda.gov/food-details/174837/nutrients"}]},"keywords":["limón serrano","insalata di arancia e limone","ricetta della Sierra de Francia"],"image_url":"/recetas/como-preparar-limon-serrano-la-receta-de-ensalada-mas-buscada/portada.webp","gallery":[{"url":"/recetas/como-preparar-limon-serrano-la-receta-de-ensalada-mas-buscada/portada.webp","alt":"Limón serrano con arancia, limone, spicchi d’uovo sodo, prosciutto serrano e chorizo stagionato"}],"seo":{"title":"Limón serrano con agrumi e uova | Manual de Cocina","description":"Prepara il limón serrano con arancia, limone, uova sode e salumi stagionati. Dosi per 4 porzioni e condimento con olio, aglio e vino bianco.","image_alt":"Limón serrano con arancia, limone, spicchi d’uovo sodo, prosciutto serrano e chorizo stagionato","image_variants":["/recetas/como-preparar-limon-serrano-la-receta-de-ensalada-mas-buscada/portada-1x1.webp","/recetas/como-preparar-limon-serrano-la-receta-de-ensalada-mas-buscada/portada-4x3.webp","/recetas/como-preparar-limon-serrano-la-receta-de-ensalada-mas-buscada/portada-16x9.webp"],"faq":[{"q":"Come evito un’insalata amara?","a":"Elimina tutta la parte bianca e i semi. Pesa gli agrumi sbucciati e usa 500 g di arancia per 100 g di limone."},{"q":"Posso omettere il vino?","a":"Sì. Sostituisci i 15 ml con la stessa quantità di succo d’arancia. Sapore e valori nutrizionali cambiano leggermente; la stima pubblicata include il vino."},{"q":"Posso usare chorizo fresco?","a":"Questa ricetta usa chorizo stagionato pronto al consumo. Quello fresco richiede una cottura completa diversa e non deve essere servito crudo seguendo questi passaggi."}]},"published":false,"editorial_status":"draft","content_html":"<p>Il limón serrano è un’insalata della Sierra de Francia, nella provincia spagnola di Salamanca. Questa versione unisce arancia, una quantità minore di limone, uova sode, prosciutto serrano e chorizo stagionato, con olio d’oliva, aglio e vino bianco. Dosi e procedimento sono una proposta originale; esistono varianti locali.</p><p>Si ottengono 4 porzioni di circa 245 g. Calcola circa 40 minuti complessivi, compresi 5 minuti per raffreddare le uova. Usa soltanto chorizo stagionato indicato in etichetta come pronto al consumo.</p>"},{"id":"15368ce6-3e64-5f0f-a911-72ec031ec937","recipe_group_id":"7dcd70ca-9fa9-40cc-95b8-a6444db4a292","slug":"limon-serrano-salad","public_path":"/ja/limon-serrano-salad","source_url":null,"language":"ja","title":"リモン・セラーノ：柑橘と卵、生ハムのサラダ","excerpt":"オレンジ、レモン、固ゆで卵、生ハム、熟成チョリソーで作るリモン・セラーノ。4人分の分量と、オリーブオイル、にんにく、白ワインのドレッシングを紹介します。","summary":"リモン・セラーノは、スペインのサラマンカ県シエラ・デ・フランシア地方のサラダです。このレシピでは、オレンジを多め、レモンを少なめに使い、固ゆで卵、生ハム、熟成チョリソーを合わせます。味付けはオリーブオイル、にんにく、白ワインです。分量と手順は独自の提案で、地域によってさまざまな作り方があります。\n\n4人分、1人分は約245 gです。卵を冷ます5分を含め、全体で約40分を見込んでください。チョリソーは必ず、加熱せず食べられると表示された熟成タイプを使います。","category":"サラダ","category_slug":"ensaladas","difficulty":"簡単","course":"前菜","cuisine":"スペイン・サラマンカ","prep_time_minutes":20,"cook_time_minutes":15,"total_time_minutes":40,"servings":4,"ingredients":[{"name":"オレンジ（皮を除いた重量）","amount":"500","unit":"g","group":"サラダ"},{"name":"レモン（皮を除いた重量）","amount":"100","unit":"g","group":"サラダ"},{"name":"大きめの卵（ゆでて殻を除くと約200 g）","amount":"4","unit":"個","group":"サラダ"},{"name":"そのまま食べられるセラーノ生ハム","amount":"80","unit":"g","group":"サラダ"},{"name":"加熱不要の熟成チョリソー","amount":"60","unit":"g","group":"サラダ"},{"name":"エクストラバージンオリーブオイル","amount":"25","unit":"g","group":"ドレッシング"},{"name":"皮をむいたにんにく","amount":"3","unit":"g","group":"ドレッシング"},{"name":"白ワイン","amount":"15","unit":"ml","group":"ドレッシング"}],"steps":[{"title":"材料を用意する","content":"オレンジとレモンは皮をむく前に洗います。卵4個、生ハム80 g、熟成チョリソー60 g、オイル25 g、皮をむいたにんにく3 g、白ワイン15 mlを用意します。生ハムとチョリソーの表示を確認し、そのまま食べられる製品を使ってください。この手順では生のチョリソーを加熱しません。","image_url":"/recetas/como-preparar-limon-serrano-la-receta-de-ensalada-mas-buscada/paso-01.webp","image_alt":"リモン・セラーノ：柑橘と卵、生ハムのサラダ: 材料を用意する"},{"title":"卵をゆでて冷ます","content":"卵を小鍋に入れ、卵の上まで約2 cmの高さになるよう冷水を注ぎます。沸騰させ、弱く沸く状態で12分ゆでます。白身と黄身が完全に固まっていることを確認してください。冷水で約5分冷まし、殻をむいて各卵を4等分します。湯を沸かす時間を含め、加熱時間は約15分です。","image_url":"/recetas/como-preparar-limon-serrano-la-receta-de-ensalada-mas-buscada/paso-02.webp","image_alt":"リモン・セラーノ：柑橘と卵、生ハムのサラダ: 卵をゆでて冷ます"},{"title":"柑橘をむいて切る","content":"包丁でオレンジとレモンの皮、白い部分を取り除きます。皮を除いたオレンジ500 g、レモン100 gを量ります。約5 mm厚の輪切りか食べやすい大きさに切り、種を除きます。切るときに出た果汁はドレッシング用に器で受けます。","image_url":"/recetas/como-preparar-limon-serrano-la-receta-de-ensalada-mas-buscada/paso-03.webp","image_alt":"リモン・セラーノ：柑橘と卵、生ハムのサラダ: 柑橘をむいて切る"},{"title":"生ハムとチョリソーを切る","content":"生ハム80 gを短い細切り、熟成チョリソー60 gを薄い輪切りにします。ケーシングが食べられない場合は取り除きます。盛り付けるまで冷やしておきます。加工肉に塩分があるので塩は加えません。","image_url":"/recetas/como-preparar-limon-serrano-la-receta-de-ensalada-mas-buscada/paso-04.webp","image_alt":"リモン・セラーノ：柑橘と卵、生ハムのサラダ: 生ハムとチョリソーを切る"},{"title":"ドレッシングを混ぜる","content":"にんにく3 gを細かく刻むかすりおろします。オイル25 g、白ワイン15 ml、取り分けた果汁全量と合わせ、フォークでよく混ぜます。ワインは加熱しないため、アルコールが残ります。","image_url":"/recetas/como-preparar-limon-serrano-la-receta-de-ensalada-mas-buscada/paso-05.webp","image_alt":"リモン・セラーノ：柑橘と卵、生ハムのサラダ: ドレッシングを混ぜる"},{"title":"サラダを盛り付ける","content":"オレンジとレモンを広い盛り皿に並べます。生ハムとチョリソーを散らし、ドレッシングをかけ、柑橘を崩さないよう軽く混ぜます。16切れのゆで卵を、黄身が見えるよう上にのせます。","image_url":"/recetas/como-preparar-limon-serrano-la-receta-de-ensalada-mas-buscada/paso-06.webp","image_alt":"リモン・セラーノ：柑橘と卵、生ハムのサラダ: サラダを盛り付ける"},{"title":"4人分に分けて出す","content":"柑橘と加工肉を均等に分け、1人につき卵1個分になるよう4人分に取り分けます。盛り付けたらすぐに食べてください。すぐ食べない場合は覆って冷蔵し、食感を保つため24時間以内に食べます。室温に2時間以上置かないでください。","image_url":"/recetas/como-preparar-limon-serrano-la-receta-de-ensalada-mas-buscada/paso-07.webp","image_alt":"リモン・セラーノ：柑橘と卵、生ハムのサラダ: 4人分に分けて出す"}],"notes":"オレンジを多めにしてレモンの酸味を調整しています。苦味を抑えるため白い部分と種をしっかり除きます。前もって準備する場合は、ゆで卵、柑橘、加工肉、ドレッシングを別々の容器で冷蔵し、食べる直前に合わせます。ワインは加熱しません。アルコールを使わない場合はオレンジ果汁15 mlに置き換えてください。栄養値はワインを使う場合の計算です。卵を含みます。加工肉やワインには、製品によってほかのアレルゲンや亜硫酸塩が含まれる場合があるため表示を確認してください。","nutrition":{"calories":295.2,"protein_g":15.5,"carbs_g":18.0,"fat_g":18.3,"saturated_fat_g":4.9,"fiber_g":3.7,"sugar_g":13.0,"sodium_mg":626.0,"serving_size":"全4人分のうち1人分、約245 g","estimated":true,"source":"USDA FoodData Central — SR Legacy (abril de 2018)","source_url":"https://fdc.nal.usda.gov/download-datasets/","method":"確認済みUSDAデータの100 g当たりの値に各材料の可食重量を掛け、合計を4人分で割っています。オイルとワインは全量計上し、ワイン15 mlは約15 gとして計算しています。追加の塩や付け合わせは含みません。","note":"料理そのものを分析した数値ではなく推定値です。生ハムと熟成チョリソーは、一般的な塩漬け加熱ハムと豚肉・牛肉の乾燥サラミのデータで近似しています。特にナトリウム、脂質、エネルギーは製品によって大きく異なります。精度を上げるには製品表示を確認してください。","inputs":[{"ingredient":"オレンジ（皮を除いた重量）","edible_grams":500,"fdc_id":169097,"fdc_description":"Oranges, raw, all commercial varieties","per_100g":{"sugar_g":9.35,"fat_g":0.12,"carbs_g":11.75,"calories":47.0,"saturated_fat_g":0.015,"fiber_g":2.4,"sodium_mg":0.0,"protein_g":0.94},"source_url":"https://fdc.nal.usda.gov/food-details/169097/nutrients"},{"ingredient":"レモン（皮を除いた重量）","edible_grams":100,"fdc_id":167746,"fdc_description":"Lemons, raw, without peel","per_100g":{"sugar_g":2.5,"protein_g":1.1,"fiber_g":2.8,"sodium_mg":2.0,"saturated_fat_g":0.039,"fat_g":0.3,"carbs_g":9.32,"calories":29.0},"source_url":"https://fdc.nal.usda.gov/food-details/167746/nutrients"},{"ingredient":"大きめの卵（ゆでて殻を除くと約200 g）","edible_grams":200,"fdc_id":173424,"fdc_description":"Egg, whole, cooked, hard-boiled","per_100g":{"sugar_g":1.12,"fiber_g":0.0,"calories":155.0,"protein_g":12.58,"sodium_mg":124.0,"saturated_fat_g":3.267,"fat_g":10.61,"carbs_g":1.12},"source_url":"https://fdc.nal.usda.gov/food-details/173424/nutrients"},{"ingredient":"そのまま食べられるセラーノ生ハム","edible_grams":80,"fdc_id":167872,"fdc_description":"Pork, cured, ham, boneless, regular (approximately 11% fat), roasted","per_100g":{"sugar_g":0.0,"fat_g":9.02,"carbs_g":0.0,"calories":178.0,"protein_g":22.62,"fiber_g":0.0,"sodium_mg":1500.0,"saturated_fat_g":3.12},"source_url":"https://fdc.nal.usda.gov/food-details/167872/nutrients","proxy_note":"一般的な塩漬け加熱ハムによる近似です。乾燥熟成したセラーノ生ハムそのもののデータではありません。"},{"ingredient":"加熱不要の熟成チョリソー","edible_grams":60,"fdc_id":174582,"fdc_description":"Salami, dry or hard, pork, beef","per_100g":{"calories":378.0,"saturated_fat_g":11.418,"sodium_mg":1756.0,"protein_g":21.07,"fat_g":31.65,"carbs_g":0.72,"sugar_g":0.26,"fiber_g":0.0},"source_url":"https://fdc.nal.usda.gov/food-details/174582/nutrients","proxy_note":"豚肉・牛肉の乾燥サラミによる近似です。使用する熟成チョリソーそのもののデータではありません。"},{"ingredient":"エクストラバージンオリーブオイル","edible_grams":25,"fdc_id":171413,"fdc_description":"Oil, olive, salad or cooking","per_100g":{"fat_g":100.0,"carbs_g":0.0,"calories":884.0,"sodium_mg":2.0,"protein_g":0.0,"saturated_fat_g":13.808,"fiber_g":0.0,"sugar_g":0.0},"source_url":"https://fdc.nal.usda.gov/food-details/171413/nutrients"},{"ingredient":"皮をむいたにんにく","edible_grams":3,"fdc_id":169230,"fdc_description":"Garlic, raw","per_100g":{"carbs_g":33.06,"calories":149.0,"sugar_g":1.0,"saturated_fat_g":0.089,"fiber_g":2.1,"sodium_mg":17.0,"protein_g":6.36,"fat_g":0.5},"source_url":"https://fdc.nal.usda.gov/food-details/169230/nutrients"},{"ingredient":"白ワイン","edible_grams":15,"fdc_id":174837,"fdc_description":"Alcoholic beverage, wine, table, white","per_100g":{"fat_g":0.0,"sugar_g":0.96,"fiber_g":0.0,"sodium_mg":5.0,"saturated_fat_g":0.0,"carbs_g":2.6,"protein_g":0.07,"calories":82.0},"source_url":"https://fdc.nal.usda.gov/food-details/174837/nutrients"}]},"keywords":["リモン・セラーノ","オレンジとレモンのサラダ","シエラ・デ・フランシアの料理"],"image_url":"/recetas/como-preparar-limon-serrano-la-receta-de-ensalada-mas-buscada/portada.webp","gallery":[{"url":"/recetas/como-preparar-limon-serrano-la-receta-de-ensalada-mas-buscada/portada.webp","alt":"オレンジ、レモン、4等分した固ゆで卵、セラーノ生ハム、熟成チョリソーのリモン・セラーノ"}],"seo":{"title":"柑橘と卵のリモン・セラーノ | Manual de Cocina","description":"オレンジ、レモン、固ゆで卵、生ハム、熟成チョリソーで作るリモン・セラーノ。4人分の分量と、オリーブオイル、にんにく、白ワインのドレッシングを紹介します。","image_alt":"オレンジ、レモン、4等分した固ゆで卵、セラーノ生ハム、熟成チョリソーのリモン・セラーノ","image_variants":["/recetas/como-preparar-limon-serrano-la-receta-de-ensalada-mas-buscada/portada-1x1.webp","/recetas/como-preparar-limon-serrano-la-receta-de-ensalada-mas-buscada/portada-4x3.webp","/recetas/como-preparar-limon-serrano-la-receta-de-ensalada-mas-buscada/portada-16x9.webp"],"faq":[{"q":"苦くならないようにするには？","a":"白い部分と種をすべて取り除きます。皮をむいた後に量り、オレンジ500 gに対してレモン100 gの割合を守ります。"},{"q":"ワインなしでも作れますか？","a":"はい。白ワイン15 mlを同量のオレンジ果汁に置き換えます。味と栄養値は少し変わります。掲載した推定値にはワインを含みます。"},{"q":"生のチョリソーを使えますか？","a":"このレシピは加熱せず食べられる熟成チョリソー用です。生のチョリソーには別の十分な加熱工程が必要で、この手順のまま生で出してはいけません。"}]},"published":false,"editorial_status":"draft","content_html":"<p>リモン・セラーノは、スペインのサラマンカ県シエラ・デ・フランシア地方のサラダです。このレシピでは、オレンジを多め、レモンを少なめに使い、固ゆで卵、生ハム、熟成チョリソーを合わせます。味付けはオリーブオイル、にんにく、白ワインです。分量と手順は独自の提案で、地域によってさまざまな作り方があります。</p><p>4人分、1人分は約245 gです。卵を冷ます5分を含め、全体で約40分を見込んでください。チョリソーは必ず、加熱せず食べられると表示された熟成タイプを使います。</p>"},{"id":"f143e06d-5347-5f67-848a-ff2621074d76","recipe_group_id":"7dcd70ca-9fa9-40cc-95b8-a6444db4a292","slug":"salada-limon-serrano","public_path":"/pt/salada-limon-serrano","source_url":null,"language":"pt","title":"Limón serrano: salada de cítricos, ovo e embutidos","excerpt":"Prepare limón serrano com laranja, limão, ovos cozidos e embutidos curados. Quantidades para 4 porções e molho de azeite, alho e vinho branco.","summary":"O limón serrano é uma salada da Sierra de Francia, na província espanhola de Salamanca. Esta versão combina laranja, uma quantidade menor de limão, ovos bem cozidos, presunto serrano e chorizo espanhol curado, temperados com azeite, alho e vinho branco. As proporções e o método são uma proposta original; há variantes locais.\n\nRende 4 porções de cerca de 245 g. Conte com aproximadamente 40 minutos no total, incluindo 5 minutos para esfriar os ovos. Use apenas chorizo curado cujo rótulo indique que está pronto para consumo.","category":"Saladas","category_slug":"ensaladas","difficulty":"Fácil","course":"Entrada","cuisine":"Salamanca, Espanha","prep_time_minutes":20,"cook_time_minutes":15,"total_time_minutes":40,"servings":4,"ingredients":[{"name":"laranja, peso depois de descascada","amount":"500","unit":"g","group":"Salada"},{"name":"limão, peso depois de descascado","amount":"100","unit":"g","group":"Salada"},{"name":"ovos grandes, cerca de 200 g cozidos sem casca","amount":"4","unit":"unidades","group":"Salada"},{"name":"presunto serrano pronto para consumo","amount":"80","unit":"g","group":"Salada"},{"name":"chorizo espanhol curado pronto para consumo","amount":"60","unit":"g","group":"Salada"},{"name":"azeite virgem extra","amount":"25","unit":"g","group":"Molho"},{"name":"alho descascado","amount":"3","unit":"g","group":"Molho"},{"name":"vinho branco","amount":"15","unit":"ml","group":"Molho"}],"steps":[{"title":"Reúna os ingredientes","content":"Lave as laranjas e o limão antes de descascar. Prepare 4 ovos, 80 g de presunto serrano, 60 g de chorizo curado, 25 g de azeite, 3 g de alho descascado e 15 ml de vinho. Confirme nos rótulos que ambos os embutidos estão prontos para consumo; esta preparação não cozinha chorizo fresco.","image_url":"/recetas/como-preparar-limon-serrano-la-receta-de-ensalada-mas-buscada/paso-01.webp","image_alt":"Limón serrano: salada de cítricos, ovo e embutidos: Reúna os ingredientes"},{"title":"Cozinhe e esfrie os ovos","content":"Coloque os ovos em uma panela e cubra com água fria até cerca de 2 cm acima deles. Leve a ferver e mantenha uma fervura suave durante 12 minutos; a clara e a gema devem ficar firmes. Esfrie em água fria durante cerca de 5 minutos, descasque e corte cada ovo em quatro. Conte aproximadamente 15 minutos de cozimento, incluindo o aquecimento da água.","image_url":"/recetas/como-preparar-limon-serrano-la-receta-de-ensalada-mas-buscada/paso-02.webp","image_alt":"Limón serrano: salada de cítricos, ovo e embutidos: Cozinhe e esfrie os ovos"},{"title":"Descasque e corte os cítricos","content":"Retire com uma faca a casca e a parte branca das laranjas e do limão. Pese 500 g de laranja e 100 g de limão já descascados. Corte em rodelas ou pedaços de cerca de 5 mm, retire as sementes e recolha o suco em uma tigela para o molho.","image_url":"/recetas/como-preparar-limon-serrano-la-receta-de-ensalada-mas-buscada/paso-03.webp","image_alt":"Limón serrano: salada de cítricos, ovo e embutidos: Descasque e corte os cítricos"},{"title":"Corte os embutidos","content":"Corte os 80 g de presunto serrano em tiras curtas e os 60 g de chorizo curado em rodelas finas. Retire a tripa se não for comestível. Mantenha no frio até montar a salada. Não acrescente sal: os embutidos já fornecem bastante.","image_url":"/recetas/como-preparar-limon-serrano-la-receta-de-ensalada-mas-buscada/paso-04.webp","image_alt":"Limón serrano: salada de cítricos, ovo e embutidos: Corte os embutidos"},{"title":"Misture o molho","content":"Pique muito finamente ou rale os 3 g de alho. Misture com os 25 g de azeite, os 15 ml de vinho branco e todo o suco recolhido dos cítricos. Bata com um garfo até unir. O vinho é acrescentado sem cozinhar e conserva álcool.","image_url":"/recetas/como-preparar-limon-serrano-la-receta-de-ensalada-mas-buscada/paso-05.webp","image_alt":"Limón serrano: salada de cítricos, ovo e embutidos: Misture o molho"},{"title":"Monte a salada","content":"Distribua a laranja e o limão em uma travessa larga. Junte o presunto e o chorizo, regue com o molho e envolva suavemente sem desfazer os cítricos. Coloque os 16 quartos de ovo por cima, com as gemas visíveis.","image_url":"/recetas/como-preparar-limon-serrano-la-receta-de-ensalada-mas-buscada/paso-06.webp","image_alt":"Limón serrano: salada de cítricos, ovo e embutidos: Monte a salada"},{"title":"Divida e sirva","content":"Divida em 4 porções, repartindo cítricos, embutidos e um ovo por pessoa. Sirva logo depois de montar. Se não consumir de imediato, cubra e leve ao refrigerador; use dentro de 24 horas para preservar a textura. Não deixe mais de 2 horas à temperatura ambiente.","image_url":"/recetas/como-preparar-limon-serrano-la-receta-de-ensalada-mas-buscada/paso-07.webp","image_alt":"Limón serrano: salada de cítricos, ovo e embutidos: Divida e sirva"}],"notes":"A maior proporção de laranja equilibra o limão. Retire bem a parte branca e as sementes para reduzir o amargo. Para adiantar, conserve ovos cozidos, cítricos, embutidos e molho em recipientes separados no refrigerador e misture ao servir. O vinho fica cru: para uma versão sem álcool, substitua por 15 ml de suco de laranja. O cálculo nutricional corresponde à versão com vinho. Contém ovo; os embutidos e o vinho podem conter outros alérgenos ou sulfitos, conforme os rótulos.","nutrition":{"calories":295.2,"protein_g":15.5,"carbs_g":18.0,"fat_g":18.3,"saturated_fat_g":4.9,"fiber_g":3.7,"sugar_g":13.0,"sodium_mg":626.0,"serving_size":"1 de 4 porções, aproximadamente 245 g","estimated":true,"source":"USDA FoodData Central — SR Legacy (abril de 2018)","source_url":"https://fdc.nal.usda.gov/download-datasets/","method":"Valores USDA verificados por 100 g multiplicados pelos pesos comestíveis dos ingredientes e divididos por 4. Todo o azeite e vinho entram no cálculo; 15 ml de vinho são aproximados a 15 g. Sem sal acrescentado nem acompanhamentos.","note":"Estimativa, não análise laboratorial do prato. Presunto serrano e chorizo curado são aproximados com dados genéricos de presunto curado cozido e salame seco de porco e bovino. Sódio, gordura e energia podem variar muito conforme a marca. Verifique os rótulos para maior precisão.","inputs":[{"ingredient":"laranja, peso depois de descascada","edible_grams":500,"fdc_id":169097,"fdc_description":"Oranges, raw, all commercial varieties","per_100g":{"sugar_g":9.35,"fat_g":0.12,"carbs_g":11.75,"calories":47.0,"saturated_fat_g":0.015,"fiber_g":2.4,"sodium_mg":0.0,"protein_g":0.94},"source_url":"https://fdc.nal.usda.gov/food-details/169097/nutrients"},{"ingredient":"limão, peso depois de descascado","edible_grams":100,"fdc_id":167746,"fdc_description":"Lemons, raw, without peel","per_100g":{"sugar_g":2.5,"protein_g":1.1,"fiber_g":2.8,"sodium_mg":2.0,"saturated_fat_g":0.039,"fat_g":0.3,"carbs_g":9.32,"calories":29.0},"source_url":"https://fdc.nal.usda.gov/food-details/167746/nutrients"},{"ingredient":"ovos grandes, cerca de 200 g cozidos sem casca","edible_grams":200,"fdc_id":173424,"fdc_description":"Egg, whole, cooked, hard-boiled","per_100g":{"sugar_g":1.12,"fiber_g":0.0,"calories":155.0,"protein_g":12.58,"sodium_mg":124.0,"saturated_fat_g":3.267,"fat_g":10.61,"carbs_g":1.12},"source_url":"https://fdc.nal.usda.gov/food-details/173424/nutrients"},{"ingredient":"presunto serrano pronto para consumo","edible_grams":80,"fdc_id":167872,"fdc_description":"Pork, cured, ham, boneless, regular (approximately 11% fat), roasted","per_100g":{"sugar_g":0.0,"fat_g":9.02,"carbs_g":0.0,"calories":178.0,"protein_g":22.62,"fiber_g":0.0,"sodium_mg":1500.0,"saturated_fat_g":3.12},"source_url":"https://fdc.nal.usda.gov/food-details/167872/nutrients","proxy_note":"Aproximação com presunto curado cozido genérico, não uma ficha exata de presunto serrano seco."},{"ingredient":"chorizo espanhol curado pronto para consumo","edible_grams":60,"fdc_id":174582,"fdc_description":"Salami, dry or hard, pork, beef","per_100g":{"calories":378.0,"saturated_fat_g":11.418,"sodium_mg":1756.0,"protein_g":21.07,"fat_g":31.65,"carbs_g":0.72,"sugar_g":0.26,"fiber_g":0.0},"source_url":"https://fdc.nal.usda.gov/food-details/174582/nutrients","proxy_note":"Aproximação com salame seco de porco e bovino, não uma ficha exata do chorizo curado utilizado."},{"ingredient":"azeite virgem extra","edible_grams":25,"fdc_id":171413,"fdc_description":"Oil, olive, salad or cooking","per_100g":{"fat_g":100.0,"carbs_g":0.0,"calories":884.0,"sodium_mg":2.0,"protein_g":0.0,"saturated_fat_g":13.808,"fiber_g":0.0,"sugar_g":0.0},"source_url":"https://fdc.nal.usda.gov/food-details/171413/nutrients"},{"ingredient":"alho descascado","edible_grams":3,"fdc_id":169230,"fdc_description":"Garlic, raw","per_100g":{"carbs_g":33.06,"calories":149.0,"sugar_g":1.0,"saturated_fat_g":0.089,"fiber_g":2.1,"sodium_mg":17.0,"protein_g":6.36,"fat_g":0.5},"source_url":"https://fdc.nal.usda.gov/food-details/169230/nutrients"},{"ingredient":"vinho branco","edible_grams":15,"fdc_id":174837,"fdc_description":"Alcoholic beverage, wine, table, white","per_100g":{"fat_g":0.0,"sugar_g":0.96,"fiber_g":0.0,"sodium_mg":5.0,"saturated_fat_g":0.0,"carbs_g":2.6,"protein_g":0.07,"calories":82.0},"source_url":"https://fdc.nal.usda.gov/food-details/174837/nutrients"}]},"keywords":["limón serrano","salada de laranja e limão","receita da Sierra de Francia"],"image_url":"/recetas/como-preparar-limon-serrano-la-receta-de-ensalada-mas-buscada/portada.webp","gallery":[{"url":"/recetas/como-preparar-limon-serrano-la-receta-de-ensalada-mas-buscada/portada.webp","alt":"Limón serrano com laranja, limão, quartos de ovo cozido, presunto serrano e chorizo curado"}],"seo":{"title":"Limón serrano com cítricos e ovo | Manual de Cocina","description":"Prepare limón serrano com laranja, limão, ovos cozidos e embutidos curados. Quantidades para 4 porções e molho de azeite, alho e vinho branco.","image_alt":"Limón serrano com laranja, limão, quartos de ovo cozido, presunto serrano e chorizo curado","image_variants":["/recetas/como-preparar-limon-serrano-la-receta-de-ensalada-mas-buscada/portada-1x1.webp","/recetas/como-preparar-limon-serrano-la-receta-de-ensalada-mas-buscada/portada-4x3.webp","/recetas/como-preparar-limon-serrano-la-receta-de-ensalada-mas-buscada/portada-16x9.webp"],"faq":[{"q":"Como evito que a salada fique amarga?","a":"Retire completamente a parte branca e as sementes. Pese os cítricos descascados e use 500 g de laranja para 100 g de limão."},{"q":"Posso preparar sem vinho?","a":"Sim. Substitua os 15 ml pela mesma quantidade de suco de laranja. O sabor e a nutrição mudam ligeiramente; a estimativa publicada inclui vinho."},{"q":"Posso usar chorizo fresco?","a":"Esta receita usa chorizo curado pronto para consumo. O chorizo fresco exige uma cozimento completa diferente e não deve ser servido cru seguindo estes passos."}]},"published":false,"editorial_status":"draft","content_html":"<p>O limón serrano é uma salada da Sierra de Francia, na província espanhola de Salamanca. Esta versão combina laranja, uma quantidade menor de limão, ovos bem cozidos, presunto serrano e chorizo espanhol curado, temperados com azeite, alho e vinho branco. As proporções e o método são uma proposta original; há variantes locais.</p><p>Rende 4 porções de cerca de 245 g. Conte com aproximadamente 40 minutos no total, incluindo 5 minutos para esfriar os ovos. Use apenas chorizo curado cujo rótulo indique que está pronto para consumo.</p>"},{"id":"8ae419ae-f12a-4faa-8379-bb4b2c00a77b","recipe_group_id":"8d66b805-5283-43f9-833b-b1ba0875d57f","slug":"receta-jugo-arcoiris","public_path":"/receta-jugo-arcoiris","source_url":"https://manualdecocina.com/receta-jugo-arcoiris/","language":"es","title":"Jugo arcoíris de frutas en cuatro capas","excerpt":"Jugo arcoíris de frutas en cuatro capas: arándano, fresa, kiwi y mango. Cantidades para 4 vasos, congelado previo y montaje paso a paso, sin colorantes.","summary":"Este jugo arcoíris es una bebida espesa de fruta entera, con textura de batido y cuatro capas de colores naturales: violeta de arándano, rosada de fresa, verde de kiwi y dorada de mango. Una pequeña cantidad de banana en cada mezcla ayuda a dar cuerpo. No se cuela ni se añaden colorantes, leche o azúcar.\n\nRinde 4 vasos de unos 270 g. Los 90 minutos totales incluyen 60 minutos de congelado previo. Las capas se sirven recién montadas; sus bordes pueden mezclarse un poco y no se mantienen separados indefinidamente.","category":"Bebidas","category_slug":"bebidas","difficulty":"Fácil","course":"Bebida","cuisine":"Internacional","prep_time_minutes":30,"cook_time_minutes":0,"total_time_minutes":90,"servings":4,"ingredients":[{"name":"arándanos frescos","amount":"200","unit":"g","group":"Frutas"},{"name":"fresas, peso sin hojas","amount":"200","unit":"g","group":"Frutas"},{"name":"kiwi, peso pelado","amount":"200","unit":"g","group":"Frutas"},{"name":"mango, peso pelado y sin hueso","amount":"200","unit":"g","group":"Frutas"},{"name":"banana, peso pelado","amount":"200","unit":"g","group":"Frutas"},{"name":"agua potable fría","amount":"80","unit":"ml","group":"Para triturar"}],"steps":[{"title":"Lava, corta y reparte la fruta","content":"Lávate las manos y lava toda la fruta bajo agua corriente antes de pelar, sin jabón. Retira partes dañadas, hojas de las fresas, piel de kiwi y banana, y piel y hueso del mango. Pesa 200 g comestibles de cada una de las cinco frutas. Corta mango, kiwi, fresa y banana en trozos de unos 2 cm. Divide la banana en cuatro porciones de 50 g y junta cada una con una fruta distinta en cuatro recipientes separados.","image_url":"/recetas/receta-jugo-arcoiris/paso-01.webp","image_alt":"Jugo arcoíris: lava, corta y reparte la fruta"},{"title":"Congela las cuatro mezclas","content":"Extiende por separado los arándanos con 50 g de banana, las fresas con 50 g, el kiwi con 50 g y el mango con los últimos 50 g en recipientes bajos aptos para congelador. Tapa y congela unos 60 minutos, hasta que la fruta esté firme pero los trozos se puedan separar. Si siguen blandos, necesitan más tiempo; no congeles en un bloque grueso. Enfría cuatro vasos de al menos 350 ml en la nevera.","image_url":"/recetas/receta-jugo-arcoiris/paso-02.webp","image_alt":"Jugo arcoíris: congela las cuatro mezclas"},{"title":"Tritura la capa violeta","content":"Pon los 200 g de arándanos y sus 50 g de banana fría en una batidora apta para fruta congelada, con 20 ml de agua. Tritura de 40 a 60 segundos hasta obtener una mezcla espesa y uniforme. Si no mueve bien, apaga y desconecta antes de bajar la fruta con una espátula; deja ablandar 2 minutos en vez de añadir agua de más. Pasa a un cuenco, tapa y reserva en la nevera.","image_url":"/recetas/receta-jugo-arcoiris/paso-03.webp","image_alt":"Jugo arcoíris: tritura la capa violeta"},{"title":"Tritura la capa de fresa","content":"Lava y seca el vaso de la batidora para no teñir la siguiente mezcla. Tritura los 200 g de fresa con sus 50 g de banana y 20 ml de agua de 40 a 60 segundos. Debe quedar rosada y espesa, no líquida. Pasa a otro cuenco, tapa y refrigera mientras terminas las demás capas.","image_url":"/recetas/receta-jugo-arcoiris/paso-04.webp","image_alt":"Jugo arcoíris: tritura la capa de fresa"},{"title":"Tritura la capa verde","content":"Vuelve a lavar y secar el vaso. Tritura los 200 g de kiwi con sus 50 g de banana y 20 ml de agua de 40 a 60 segundos. Mantén las semillas pequeñas del kiwi; no cueles la pulpa. Guarda la mezcla verde tapada en la nevera.","image_url":"/recetas/receta-jugo-arcoiris/paso-05.webp","image_alt":"Jugo arcoíris: tritura la capa verde"},{"title":"Tritura la capa dorada","content":"Lava y seca el vaso una vez más. Tritura los 200 g de mango con los últimos 50 g de banana y 20 ml de agua de 40 a 60 segundos, hasta que quede una crema dorada homogénea. La consistencia debe ser parecida a la de las otras capas; si alguna se ha templado demasiado, refrigérala antes de montar.","image_url":"/recetas/receta-jugo-arcoiris/paso-06.webp","image_alt":"Jugo arcoíris: tritura la capa dorada"},{"title":"Monta las capas despacio","content":"Reparte la mezcla violeta entre los cuatro vasos fríos. Añade una cuarta parte de la mezcla de fresa a cada uno, dejándola caer despacio sobre el dorso de una cuchara situada justo encima de la capa anterior. Repite con el kiwi y termina con el mango. No remuevas ni viertas desde altura; cada vaso recibe un cuarto de las cuatro mezclas.","image_url":"/recetas/receta-jugo-arcoiris/paso-07.webp","image_alt":"Jugo arcoíris: monta las capas despacio"},{"title":"Sirve recién montado","content":"Sirve inmediatamente con una cuchara larga, mientras las cuatro capas conservan su forma. Para guardarlo, tapa y refrigera a 4 °C o menos y consume dentro de 24 horas; el color y la separación cambiarán. Si se mezcla, remueve y sírvelo como un batido de frutas. No lo dejes más de 2 horas a temperatura ambiente.","image_url":"/recetas/receta-jugo-arcoiris/paso-08.webp","image_alt":"Jugo arcoíris: sirve recién montado"}],"notes":"Usa fruta madura para equilibrar la acidez del kiwi. La congelación y el poco líquido ayudan al montaje, pero no garantizan líneas perfectas: las capas son de fruta y pueden difuminarse. Para usar fruta ya congelada, respeta los mismos pesos comestibles y comprueba si su envase pide cocinarla; no uses cruda una fruta que requiera cocción. Adapta el tiempo total si omites el congelado previo. Si tu batidora no admite fruta congelada, deja ablandar los trozos hasta que pueda procesarlos con seguridad; las capas quedarán menos definidas.","nutrition":{"calories":149.5,"protein_g":2.2,"carbs_g":37.3,"fat_g":0.9,"saturated_fat_g":0.1,"fiber_g":5.8,"sugar_g":24.9,"sodium_mg":4.0,"estimated":true,"source":"USDA FoodData Central — SR Legacy (abril de 2018)","source_url":"https://fdc.nal.usda.gov/download-datasets/","inputs":[{"ingredient":"arándanos","edible_grams":200,"fdc_id":171711,"fdc_description":"Blueberries, raw","per_100g":{"sodium_mg":1.0,"carbs_g":14.49,"calories":57.0,"sugar_g":9.96,"fat_g":0.33,"saturated_fat_g":0.028,"fiber_g":2.4,"protein_g":0.74},"source_url":"https://fdc.nal.usda.gov/food-details/171711/nutrients"},{"ingredient":"fresas sin hojas","edible_grams":200,"fdc_id":167762,"fdc_description":"Strawberries, raw","per_100g":{"fat_g":0.3,"fiber_g":2.0,"protein_g":0.67,"sodium_mg":1.0,"sugar_g":4.89,"carbs_g":7.68,"calories":32.0,"saturated_fat_g":0.015},"source_url":"https://fdc.nal.usda.gov/food-details/167762/nutrients"},{"ingredient":"kiwi pelado","edible_grams":200,"fdc_id":168153,"fdc_description":"Kiwifruit, green, raw","per_100g":{"protein_g":1.14,"fiber_g":3.0,"fat_g":0.52,"sugar_g":8.99,"sodium_mg":3.0,"carbs_g":14.66,"calories":61.0,"saturated_fat_g":0.029},"source_url":"https://fdc.nal.usda.gov/food-details/168153/nutrients"},{"ingredient":"mango pelado sin hueso","edible_grams":200,"fdc_id":169910,"fdc_description":"Mangos, raw","per_100g":{"fat_g":0.38,"protein_g":0.82,"fiber_g":1.6,"sodium_mg":1.0,"carbs_g":14.98,"calories":60.0,"sugar_g":13.66,"saturated_fat_g":0.092},"source_url":"https://fdc.nal.usda.gov/food-details/169910/nutrients"},{"ingredient":"banana pelada","edible_grams":200,"fdc_id":173944,"fdc_description":"Bananas, raw","per_100g":{"saturated_fat_g":0.112,"carbs_g":22.84,"calories":89.0,"fiber_g":2.6,"sodium_mg":1.0,"protein_g":1.09,"sugar_g":12.23,"fat_g":0.33},"source_url":"https://fdc.nal.usda.gov/food-details/173944/nutrients"},{"ingredient":"agua potable","edible_grams":80,"fdc_id":173647,"fdc_description":"Beverages, water, tap, drinking","per_100g":{"fat_g":0.0,"carbs_g":0.0,"calories":0.0,"protein_g":0.0,"fiber_g":0.0,"sodium_mg":4.0,"sugar_g":0.0,"saturated_fat_g":0.0},"source_url":"https://fdc.nal.usda.gov/food-details/173647/nutrients"}],"serving_size":"1 de 4 vasos, aproximadamente 270 g","method":"Suma de las fichas USDA verificadas por 100 g, ponderada por el peso comestible de cada fruta antes de congelar y por 80 g de agua, dividida entre 4. Los 80 ml de agua se aproximan a 80 g. Sin azúcar, leche ni adornos añadidos.","note":"Estimación informativa, no análisis del producto preparado. Varía con la madurez de la fruta, el agua utilizada y la mezcla que quede en la batidora. No se cuela: se incluye toda la pulpa de las cantidades indicadas."},"keywords":["jugo arcoíris","batido de frutas en capas","bebida de mango kiwi fresa arándano"],"image_url":"/recetas/receta-jugo-arcoiris/portada.webp","gallery":[{"url":"/recetas/receta-jugo-arcoiris/portada.webp","alt":"Cuatro vasos de jugo arcoíris con capas violeta, rosada, verde y dorada de fruta"}],"seo":{"title":"Jugo arcoíris de frutas en capas | Manual de Cocina","description":"Jugo arcoíris de frutas en cuatro capas: arándano, fresa, kiwi y mango. Cantidades para 4 vasos, congelado previo y montaje paso a paso, sin colorantes.","image_alt":"Cuatro vasos de jugo arcoíris con capas violeta, rosada, verde y dorada de fruta","image_variants":["/recetas/receta-jugo-arcoiris/portada-1x1.webp","/recetas/receta-jugo-arcoiris/portada-4x3.webp","/recetas/receta-jugo-arcoiris/portada-16x9.webp"],"faq":[{"q":"¿Por qué se mezclan los colores?","a":"Las mezclas deben estar frías y espesas. Añade cada capa lentamente sobre una cuchara, sin altura, y sirve enseguida. Son purés de fruta y los bordes pueden difuminarse."},{"q":"¿Es un jugo filtrado?","a":"No. Se conserva toda la pulpa, por lo que tiene textura de batido. Colarlo o añadir mucho líquido haría difícil mantener las capas."},{"q":"¿Puedo prepararlo de un día para otro?","a":"Puedes guardar las cuatro mezclas tapadas por separado a 4 °C o menos hasta 24 horas y montarlas al servir. Cambiarán el color y la textura, especialmente la banana."}]},"published":false,"editorial_status":"draft","content_html":"<p>Este jugo arcoíris es una bebida espesa de fruta entera, con textura de batido y cuatro capas de colores naturales: violeta de arándano, rosada de fresa, verde de kiwi y dorada de mango. Una pequeña cantidad de banana en cada mezcla ayuda a dar cuerpo. No se cuela ni se añaden colorantes, leche o azúcar.</p><p>Rinde 4 vasos de unos 270 g. Los 90 minutos totales incluyen 60 minutos de congelado previo. Las capas se sirven recién montadas; sus bordes pueden mezclarse un poco y no se mantienen separados indefinidamente.</p>"},{"id":"5970f225-143b-5f40-8b8a-0e4c1c7b66e7","recipe_group_id":"8d66b805-5283-43f9-833b-b1ba0875d57f","slug":"regenbogensaft-rezept","public_path":"/de/regenbogensaft-rezept","source_url":"https://manualdecocina.com/de/regenbogensaft-rezept/","language":"de","title":"Regenbogensaft aus Früchten in vier Schichten","excerpt":"Regenbogensaft mit Heidelbeere, Erdbeere, Kiwi und Mango: Mengen für 4 Gläser, Gefrierzeit und Anleitung für vier natürliche Farbschichten ohne Farbstoffe.","summary":"Dieser Regenbogensaft ist ein dickflüssiges Getränk aus ganzen Früchten mit Smoothie-Konsistenz. Vier natürliche Farben entstehen durch violette Heidelbeeren, rosa Erdbeeren, grüne Kiwi und goldene Mango. Etwas Banane gibt jeder Mischung Körper. Der Saft wird nicht abgesiebt; Farbstoffe, Milch und Zucker werden nicht zugesetzt.\n\nErgibt 4 Gläser von ungefähr 270 g. Die insgesamt 90 Minuten enthalten 60 Minuten zum Einfrieren. Frisch geschichtet servieren: Die Ränder können leicht ineinanderlaufen und bleiben nicht unbegrenzt getrennt.","category":"Getränke","category_slug":"bebidas","difficulty":"Einfach","course":"Getränk","cuisine":"International","prep_time_minutes":30,"cook_time_minutes":0,"total_time_minutes":90,"servings":4,"ingredients":[{"name":"frische Heidelbeeren","amount":"200","unit":"g","group":"Früchte"},{"name":"Erdbeeren, ohne Blätter gewogen","amount":"200","unit":"g","group":"Früchte"},{"name":"Kiwi, geschält gewogen","amount":"200","unit":"g","group":"Früchte"},{"name":"Mango, ohne Schale und Stein gewogen","amount":"200","unit":"g","group":"Früchte"},{"name":"Banane, geschält gewogen","amount":"200","unit":"g","group":"Früchte"},{"name":"kaltes Trinkwasser","amount":"80","unit":"ml","group":"Zum Pürieren"}],"steps":[{"title":"Früchte waschen, schneiden und aufteilen","content":"Hände waschen und alle Früchte vor dem Schälen unter fließendem Wasser ohne Seife abspülen. Beschädigte Stellen, Erdbeerblätter, Kiwi- und Bananenschale sowie Mangoschale und Stein entfernen. Je 200 g essbare Frucht von allen fünf Sorten abwiegen. Mango, Kiwi, Erdbeere und Banane in etwa 2 cm große Stücke schneiden. Banane in vier Portionen zu 50 g teilen und jede mit einer anderen Frucht in einen eigenen Behälter geben.","image_url":"/recetas/receta-jugo-arcoiris/paso-01.webp","image_alt":"Regenbogensaft aus Früchten in vier Schichten: Früchte waschen, schneiden und aufteilen"},{"title":"Vier Fruchtmischungen einfrieren","content":"Heidelbeeren mit 50 g Banane, Erdbeeren mit 50 g, Kiwi mit 50 g und Mango mit den letzten 50 g getrennt in flachen gefriergeeigneten Behältern verteilen. Abdecken und etwa 60 Minuten einfrieren, bis die Stücke fest, aber noch voneinander trennbar sind. Weiche Stücke brauchen länger; keinen dicken Block einfrieren. Vier Gläser mit mindestens 350 ml Fassungsvermögen im Kühlschrank kühlen.","image_url":"/recetas/receta-jugo-arcoiris/paso-02.webp","image_alt":"Regenbogensaft aus Früchten in vier Schichten: Vier Fruchtmischungen einfrieren"},{"title":"Violette Schicht pürieren","content":"200 g Heidelbeeren, die zugehörigen 50 g kalte Banane und 20 ml Wasser in einen für gefrorene Früchte geeigneten Mixer geben. 40–60 Sekunden dick und glatt pürieren. Bewegt sich die Frucht nicht, ausschalten und den Stecker ziehen, bevor sie mit dem Spatel nach unten geschoben wird. Lieber 2 Minuten antauen lassen als zu viel Wasser zugeben. In eine Schüssel füllen, abdecken und kühlen.","image_url":"/recetas/receta-jugo-arcoiris/paso-03.webp","image_alt":"Regenbogensaft aus Früchten in vier Schichten: Violette Schicht pürieren"},{"title":"Erdbeerschicht pürieren","content":"Mixbehälter waschen und trocknen, damit die nächste Mischung nicht verfärbt wird. 200 g Erdbeeren mit ihren 50 g Banane und 20 ml Wasser 40–60 Sekunden pürieren. Die Mischung soll rosa und dickflüssig sein. In eine eigene Schüssel geben, abdecken und während der nächsten Schritte kühlen.","image_url":"/recetas/receta-jugo-arcoiris/paso-04.webp","image_alt":"Regenbogensaft aus Früchten in vier Schichten: Erdbeerschicht pürieren"},{"title":"Grüne Schicht pürieren","content":"Behälter erneut waschen und trocknen. 200 g Kiwi mit ihren 50 g Banane und 20 ml Wasser 40–60 Sekunden pürieren. Die kleinen Kiwikerne und das Fruchtfleisch bleiben enthalten; nicht absieben. Grüne Mischung abgedeckt kühlen.","image_url":"/recetas/receta-jugo-arcoiris/paso-05.webp","image_alt":"Regenbogensaft aus Früchten in vier Schichten: Grüne Schicht pürieren"},{"title":"Goldene Schicht pürieren","content":"Behälter nochmals waschen und trocknen. 200 g Mango mit den letzten 50 g Banane und 20 ml Wasser 40–60 Sekunden zu einer gleichmäßig goldenen Creme pürieren. Die Konsistenz sollte den anderen Schichten entsprechen; zu warm gewordene Mischungen vor dem Anrichten kühlen.","image_url":"/recetas/receta-jugo-arcoiris/paso-06.webp","image_alt":"Regenbogensaft aus Früchten in vier Schichten: Goldene Schicht pürieren"},{"title":"Schichten langsam einfüllen","content":"Violette Mischung auf die vier kalten Gläser verteilen. Je ein Viertel der Erdbeermischung langsam über den Rücken eines Löffels direkt über der vorherigen Schicht geben. Mit Kiwi wiederholen und mit Mango abschließen. Nicht rühren oder aus großer Höhe gießen; jedes Glas erhält ein Viertel jeder Mischung.","image_url":"/recetas/receta-jugo-arcoiris/paso-07.webp","image_alt":"Regenbogensaft aus Früchten in vier Schichten: Schichten langsam einfüllen"},{"title":"Frisch geschichtet servieren","content":"Sofort mit einem langen Löffel servieren, solange die Schichten ihre Form behalten. Zum Aufbewahren abdecken, bei höchstens 4 °C kühlen und innerhalb von 24 Stunden verwenden; Farbe und Trennung verändern sich. Vermischte Schichten verrühren und als Fruchtsmoothie servieren. Nicht länger als 2 Stunden bei Zimmertemperatur stehen lassen.","image_url":"/recetas/receta-jugo-arcoiris/paso-08.webp","image_alt":"Regenbogensaft aus Früchten in vier Schichten: Frisch geschichtet servieren"}],"notes":"Reife Früchte gleichen die Säure der Kiwi aus. Gefrieren und wenig Flüssigkeit erleichtern das Schichten, garantieren aber keine perfekten Linien. Bei bereits gefrorenen Früchten dieselben essbaren Gewichte verwenden und die Packung auf eine vorgeschriebene Erhitzung prüfen; solche Früchte nicht roh verwenden. Ohne vorheriges Einfrieren die Gesamtzeit anpassen. Ist der Mixer nicht für gefrorene Früchte geeignet, die Stücke so weit antauen lassen, dass sie sicher verarbeitet werden können; die Schichten werden weniger klar.","nutrition":{"calories":149.5,"protein_g":2.2,"carbs_g":37.3,"fat_g":0.9,"saturated_fat_g":0.1,"fiber_g":5.8,"sugar_g":24.9,"sodium_mg":4.0,"estimated":true,"source":"USDA FoodData Central — SR Legacy (abril de 2018)","source_url":"https://fdc.nal.usda.gov/download-datasets/","inputs":[{"ingredient":"frische Heidelbeeren","edible_grams":200,"fdc_id":171711,"fdc_description":"Blueberries, raw","per_100g":{"sodium_mg":1.0,"carbs_g":14.49,"calories":57.0,"sugar_g":9.96,"fat_g":0.33,"saturated_fat_g":0.028,"fiber_g":2.4,"protein_g":0.74},"source_url":"https://fdc.nal.usda.gov/food-details/171711/nutrients"},{"ingredient":"Erdbeeren, ohne Blätter gewogen","edible_grams":200,"fdc_id":167762,"fdc_description":"Strawberries, raw","per_100g":{"fat_g":0.3,"fiber_g":2.0,"protein_g":0.67,"sodium_mg":1.0,"sugar_g":4.89,"carbs_g":7.68,"calories":32.0,"saturated_fat_g":0.015},"source_url":"https://fdc.nal.usda.gov/food-details/167762/nutrients"},{"ingredient":"Kiwi, geschält gewogen","edible_grams":200,"fdc_id":168153,"fdc_description":"Kiwifruit, green, raw","per_100g":{"protein_g":1.14,"fiber_g":3.0,"fat_g":0.52,"sugar_g":8.99,"sodium_mg":3.0,"carbs_g":14.66,"calories":61.0,"saturated_fat_g":0.029},"source_url":"https://fdc.nal.usda.gov/food-details/168153/nutrients"},{"ingredient":"Mango, ohne Schale und Stein gewogen","edible_grams":200,"fdc_id":169910,"fdc_description":"Mangos, raw","per_100g":{"fat_g":0.38,"protein_g":0.82,"fiber_g":1.6,"sodium_mg":1.0,"carbs_g":14.98,"calories":60.0,"sugar_g":13.66,"saturated_fat_g":0.092},"source_url":"https://fdc.nal.usda.gov/food-details/169910/nutrients"},{"ingredient":"Banane, geschält gewogen","edible_grams":200,"fdc_id":173944,"fdc_description":"Bananas, raw","per_100g":{"saturated_fat_g":0.112,"carbs_g":22.84,"calories":89.0,"fiber_g":2.6,"sodium_mg":1.0,"protein_g":1.09,"sugar_g":12.23,"fat_g":0.33},"source_url":"https://fdc.nal.usda.gov/food-details/173944/nutrients"},{"ingredient":"kaltes Trinkwasser","edible_grams":80,"fdc_id":173647,"fdc_description":"Beverages, water, tap, drinking","per_100g":{"fat_g":0.0,"carbs_g":0.0,"calories":0.0,"protein_g":0.0,"fiber_g":0.0,"sodium_mg":4.0,"sugar_g":0.0,"saturated_fat_g":0.0},"source_url":"https://fdc.nal.usda.gov/food-details/173647/nutrients"}],"serving_size":"1 von 4 Gläsern, ungefähr 270 g","method":"Geprüfte USDA-Werte je 100 g werden mit dem essbaren Fruchtgewicht vor dem Gefrieren und 80 g Wasser gewichtet und durch 4 geteilt. 80 ml Wasser entsprechen näherungsweise 80 g. Ohne zugesetzten Zucker, Milch und Garnierung.","note":"Orientierungswerte, keine Analyse des fertigen Getränks. Reife der Früchte, Wasser und im Mixer verbleibende Reste beeinflussen das Ergebnis. Nicht abgesiebt: Das gesamte Fruchtfleisch der angegebenen Mengen ist enthalten."},"keywords":["Regenbogensaft","Fruchtsmoothie in Schichten","Getränk mit Mango Kiwi Erdbeere Heidelbeere"],"image_url":"/recetas/receta-jugo-arcoiris/portada.webp","gallery":[{"url":"/recetas/receta-jugo-arcoiris/portada.webp","alt":"Vier Gläser Regenbogensaft mit violetten, rosafarbenen, grünen und goldenen Fruchtschichten"}],"seo":{"title":"Regenbogensaft in vier Schichten | Manual de Cocina","description":"Regenbogensaft mit Heidelbeere, Erdbeere, Kiwi und Mango: Mengen für 4 Gläser, Gefrierzeit und Anleitung für vier natürliche Farbschichten ohne Farbstoffe.","image_alt":"Vier Gläser Regenbogensaft mit violetten, rosafarbenen, grünen und goldenen Fruchtschichten","image_variants":["/recetas/receta-jugo-arcoiris/portada-1x1.webp","/recetas/receta-jugo-arcoiris/portada-4x3.webp","/recetas/receta-jugo-arcoiris/portada-16x9.webp"],"faq":[{"q":"Warum vermischen sich die Farben?","a":"Alle Mischungen müssen kalt und dickflüssig sein. Langsam über einen Löffel direkt über der Oberfläche einfüllen und sofort servieren. Die Ränder der Fruchtpürees können weich ineinanderlaufen."},{"q":"Ist das gefilterter Saft?","a":"Nein. Das gesamte Fruchtfleisch bleibt erhalten und ergibt eine Smoothie-Konsistenz. Absieben oder viel Flüssigkeit erschweren das Schichten."},{"q":"Kann ich das Getränk am Vortag vorbereiten?","a":"Die vier Mischungen getrennt und abgedeckt bei höchstens 4 °C bis zu 24 Stunden lagern und erst zum Servieren schichten. Farbe und Konsistenz ändern sich, besonders bei der Banane."}]},"published":false,"editorial_status":"draft","content_html":"<p>Dieser Regenbogensaft ist ein dickflüssiges Getränk aus ganzen Früchten mit Smoothie-Konsistenz. Vier natürliche Farben entstehen durch violette Heidelbeeren, rosa Erdbeeren, grüne Kiwi und goldene Mango. Etwas Banane gibt jeder Mischung Körper. Der Saft wird nicht abgesiebt; Farbstoffe, Milch und Zucker werden nicht zugesetzt.</p><p>Ergibt 4 Gläser von ungefähr 270 g. Die insgesamt 90 Minuten enthalten 60 Minuten zum Einfrieren. Frisch geschichtet servieren: Die Ränder können leicht ineinanderlaufen und bleiben nicht unbegrenzt getrennt.</p>"},{"id":"8c807986-4da8-5388-a5b3-48cafad01068","recipe_group_id":"8d66b805-5283-43f9-833b-b1ba0875d57f","slug":"rainbow-juice-recipe","public_path":"/en/rainbow-juice-recipe","source_url":"https://manualdecocina.com/en/rainbow-juice-recipe/","language":"en","title":"Four-layer rainbow fruit juice","excerpt":"Rainbow fruit juice with blueberry, strawberry, kiwi and mango layers. Ingredients for 4 glasses, freezing time and step-by-step assembly, without colouring.","summary":"This rainbow juice is a thick whole-fruit drink with a smoothie texture and four natural colours: purple blueberry, pink strawberry, green kiwi and golden mango. A little banana gives each mixture body. Nothing is strained, and no colouring, milk or sugar is added.\n\nMakes 4 glasses of approximately 270 g. The 90-minute total includes 60 minutes of freezing beforehand. Serve the layers freshly assembled: their edges may blend slightly, and they will not stay separate indefinitely.","category":"Drinks","category_slug":"bebidas","difficulty":"Easy","course":"Drink","cuisine":"International","prep_time_minutes":30,"cook_time_minutes":0,"total_time_minutes":90,"servings":4,"ingredients":[{"name":"fresh blueberries","amount":"200","unit":"g","group":"Fruit"},{"name":"strawberries, weighed without leafy tops","amount":"200","unit":"g","group":"Fruit"},{"name":"kiwi, weighed after peeling","amount":"200","unit":"g","group":"Fruit"},{"name":"mango, weighed after peeling and removing the stone","amount":"200","unit":"g","group":"Fruit"},{"name":"banana, weighed after peeling","amount":"200","unit":"g","group":"Fruit"},{"name":"cold drinking water","amount":"80","unit":"ml","group":"For blending"}],"steps":[{"title":"Wash, cut and portion the fruit","content":"Wash your hands, then rinse all fruit under running water before peeling, without soap. Remove damaged areas, strawberry tops, kiwi and banana skins, and mango skin and stone. Weigh 200 g edible flesh of each of the five fruits. Cut mango, kiwi, strawberry and banana into roughly 2 cm pieces. Divide banana into four 50 g portions and pair each with a different fruit in four separate containers.","image_url":"/recetas/receta-jugo-arcoiris/paso-01.webp","image_alt":"Four-layer rainbow fruit juice: Wash, cut and portion the fruit"},{"title":"Freeze the four mixtures","content":"Spread blueberries with 50 g banana, strawberries with 50 g, kiwi with 50 g and mango with the final 50 g in separate shallow freezer-safe containers. Cover and freeze for about 60 minutes, until firm but still separable. Soft pieces need longer; avoid freezing a thick solid block. Chill four glasses holding at least 350 ml in the refrigerator.","image_url":"/recetas/receta-jugo-arcoiris/paso-02.webp","image_alt":"Four-layer rainbow fruit juice: Freeze the four mixtures"},{"title":"Blend the purple layer","content":"Place 200 g blueberries and their 50 g chilled banana in a blender suitable for frozen fruit with 20 ml water. Blend for 40–60 seconds until thick and smooth. If the fruit does not move, switch off and unplug before scraping down; soften for 2 minutes instead of adding excess water. Transfer to a bowl, cover and refrigerate.","image_url":"/recetas/receta-jugo-arcoiris/paso-03.webp","image_alt":"Four-layer rainbow fruit juice: Blend the purple layer"},{"title":"Blend the strawberry layer","content":"Wash and dry the blender jug to avoid staining the next mixture. Blend 200 g strawberries with their 50 g banana and 20 ml water for 40–60 seconds. It should be pink and thick, rather than runny. Transfer to another bowl, cover and refrigerate while making the remaining layers.","image_url":"/recetas/receta-jugo-arcoiris/paso-04.webp","image_alt":"Four-layer rainbow fruit juice: Blend the strawberry layer"},{"title":"Blend the green layer","content":"Wash and dry the jug again. Blend 200 g kiwi with its 50 g banana and 20 ml water for 40–60 seconds. Keep the small kiwi seeds and do not strain the pulp. Cover the green mixture and refrigerate.","image_url":"/recetas/receta-jugo-arcoiris/paso-05.webp","image_alt":"Four-layer rainbow fruit juice: Blend the green layer"},{"title":"Blend the golden layer","content":"Wash and dry the jug once more. Blend 200 g mango with the final 50 g banana and 20 ml water for 40–60 seconds until evenly golden and creamy. Its thickness should match the other layers; refrigerate any mixture that has warmed too much before assembling.","image_url":"/recetas/receta-jugo-arcoiris/paso-06.webp","image_alt":"Four-layer rainbow fruit juice: Blend the golden layer"},{"title":"Build the layers slowly","content":"Divide the purple mixture among the four chilled glasses. Add one quarter of the strawberry mixture to each, slowly over the back of a spoon held just above the previous layer. Repeat with kiwi and finish with mango. Do not stir or pour from a height; each glass receives one quarter of all four mixtures.","image_url":"/recetas/receta-jugo-arcoiris/paso-07.webp","image_alt":"Four-layer rainbow fruit juice: Build the layers slowly"},{"title":"Serve freshly layered","content":"Serve immediately with a long spoon while the layers hold their shape. To store, cover, refrigerate at 4 °C or below and use within 24 hours; colour and separation will change. If the layers merge, stir and serve as a fruit smoothie. Do not leave at room temperature for more than 2 hours.","image_url":"/recetas/receta-jugo-arcoiris/paso-08.webp","image_alt":"Four-layer rainbow fruit juice: Serve freshly layered"}],"notes":"Ripe fruit helps balance the tart kiwi. Freezing and a small amount of liquid help with layering but cannot guarantee perfect lines; fruit puree edges may soften. For already frozen fruit, keep the same edible weights and check whether its package requires cooking: do not use it raw if cooking is required. Adjust the total time if skipping the initial freeze. If your blender cannot handle frozen fruit, let the pieces soften until safe to blend; the layers will be less defined.","nutrition":{"calories":149.5,"protein_g":2.2,"carbs_g":37.3,"fat_g":0.9,"saturated_fat_g":0.1,"fiber_g":5.8,"sugar_g":24.9,"sodium_mg":4.0,"estimated":true,"source":"USDA FoodData Central — SR Legacy (abril de 2018)","source_url":"https://fdc.nal.usda.gov/download-datasets/","inputs":[{"ingredient":"fresh blueberries","edible_grams":200,"fdc_id":171711,"fdc_description":"Blueberries, raw","per_100g":{"sodium_mg":1.0,"carbs_g":14.49,"calories":57.0,"sugar_g":9.96,"fat_g":0.33,"saturated_fat_g":0.028,"fiber_g":2.4,"protein_g":0.74},"source_url":"https://fdc.nal.usda.gov/food-details/171711/nutrients"},{"ingredient":"strawberries, weighed without leafy tops","edible_grams":200,"fdc_id":167762,"fdc_description":"Strawberries, raw","per_100g":{"fat_g":0.3,"fiber_g":2.0,"protein_g":0.67,"sodium_mg":1.0,"sugar_g":4.89,"carbs_g":7.68,"calories":32.0,"saturated_fat_g":0.015},"source_url":"https://fdc.nal.usda.gov/food-details/167762/nutrients"},{"ingredient":"kiwi, weighed after peeling","edible_grams":200,"fdc_id":168153,"fdc_description":"Kiwifruit, green, raw","per_100g":{"protein_g":1.14,"fiber_g":3.0,"fat_g":0.52,"sugar_g":8.99,"sodium_mg":3.0,"carbs_g":14.66,"calories":61.0,"saturated_fat_g":0.029},"source_url":"https://fdc.nal.usda.gov/food-details/168153/nutrients"},{"ingredient":"mango, weighed after peeling and removing the stone","edible_grams":200,"fdc_id":169910,"fdc_description":"Mangos, raw","per_100g":{"fat_g":0.38,"protein_g":0.82,"fiber_g":1.6,"sodium_mg":1.0,"carbs_g":14.98,"calories":60.0,"sugar_g":13.66,"saturated_fat_g":0.092},"source_url":"https://fdc.nal.usda.gov/food-details/169910/nutrients"},{"ingredient":"banana, weighed after peeling","edible_grams":200,"fdc_id":173944,"fdc_description":"Bananas, raw","per_100g":{"saturated_fat_g":0.112,"carbs_g":22.84,"calories":89.0,"fiber_g":2.6,"sodium_mg":1.0,"protein_g":1.09,"sugar_g":12.23,"fat_g":0.33},"source_url":"https://fdc.nal.usda.gov/food-details/173944/nutrients"},{"ingredient":"cold drinking water","edible_grams":80,"fdc_id":173647,"fdc_description":"Beverages, water, tap, drinking","per_100g":{"fat_g":0.0,"carbs_g":0.0,"calories":0.0,"protein_g":0.0,"fiber_g":0.0,"sodium_mg":4.0,"sugar_g":0.0,"saturated_fat_g":0.0},"source_url":"https://fdc.nal.usda.gov/food-details/173647/nutrients"}],"serving_size":"1 of 4 glasses, approximately 270 g","method":"Verified USDA values per 100 g are weighted by edible fruit weights before freezing and 80 g water, then divided by 4. The 80 ml water is approximated as 80 g. No added sugar, milk or garnish.","note":"Informational estimate, not an analysis of the prepared drink. Fruit ripeness, water and mixture left in the blender affect the result. Nothing is strained: all pulp from the listed quantities is included."},"keywords":["rainbow fruit juice","layered fruit smoothie","mango kiwi strawberry blueberry drink"],"image_url":"/recetas/receta-jugo-arcoiris/portada.webp","gallery":[{"url":"/recetas/receta-jugo-arcoiris/portada.webp","alt":"Four glasses of rainbow fruit juice with purple, pink, green and golden layers"}],"seo":{"title":"Layered rainbow fruit juice | Manual de Cocina","description":"Rainbow fruit juice with blueberry, strawberry, kiwi and mango layers. Ingredients for 4 glasses, freezing time and step-by-step assembly, without colouring.","image_alt":"Four glasses of rainbow fruit juice with purple, pink, green and golden layers","image_variants":["/recetas/receta-jugo-arcoiris/portada-1x1.webp","/recetas/receta-jugo-arcoiris/portada-4x3.webp","/recetas/receta-jugo-arcoiris/portada-16x9.webp"],"faq":[{"q":"Why do the colours mix?","a":"Keep every mixture cold and thick. Add each slowly over a spoon from just above the surface and serve immediately. These are fruit purees, so the edges may soften."},{"q":"Is this strained juice?","a":"No. All the pulp is retained, giving a smoothie texture. Straining or adding lots of liquid makes layering difficult."},{"q":"Can I prepare it the day before?","a":"Store the four mixtures separately, covered, at 4 °C or below for up to 24 hours, then assemble when serving. Colour and texture will change, especially the banana."}]},"published":false,"editorial_status":"draft","content_html":"<p>This rainbow juice is a thick whole-fruit drink with a smoothie texture and four natural colours: purple blueberry, pink strawberry, green kiwi and golden mango. A little banana gives each mixture body. Nothing is strained, and no colouring, milk or sugar is added.</p><p>Makes 4 glasses of approximately 270 g. The 90-minute total includes 60 minutes of freezing beforehand. Serve the layers freshly assembled: their edges may blend slightly, and they will not stay separate indefinitely.</p>"},{"id":"c82d2c01-c8e2-572c-a05d-ed28fc08d2a8","recipe_group_id":"8d66b805-5283-43f9-833b-b1ba0875d57f","slug":"recette-de-jus-arc-en-ciel","public_path":"/fr/recette-de-jus-arc-en-ciel","source_url":"https://manualdecocina.com/fr/recette-de-jus-arc-en-ciel/","language":"fr","title":"Jus arc-en-ciel aux fruits en quatre couches","excerpt":"Jus arc-en-ciel à la myrtille, fraise, kiwi et mangue. Quantités pour 4 verres, congélation préalable et montage détaillé, sans colorants.","summary":"Ce jus arc-en-ciel est une boisson épaisse aux fruits entiers, à la texture de smoothie et aux quatre couleurs naturelles : violet de myrtille, rose de fraise, vert de kiwi et doré de mangue. Un peu de banane donne du corps à chaque mélange. Rien n’est filtré ; ni colorants, ni lait, ni sucre ne sont ajoutés.\n\nPour 4 verres d’environ 270 g. Les 90 minutes au total comprennent 60 minutes de congélation préalable. Servez juste après le montage : les bords peuvent se mélanger légèrement et les couches ne restent pas séparées indéfiniment.","category":"Boissons","category_slug":"bebidas","difficulty":"Facile","course":"Boisson","cuisine":"Internationale","prep_time_minutes":30,"cook_time_minutes":0,"total_time_minutes":90,"servings":4,"ingredients":[{"name":"myrtilles fraîches","amount":"200","unit":"g","group":"Fruits"},{"name":"fraises, poids sans feuilles","amount":"200","unit":"g","group":"Fruits"},{"name":"kiwi, poids épluché","amount":"200","unit":"g","group":"Fruits"},{"name":"mangue, poids sans peau ni noyau","amount":"200","unit":"g","group":"Fruits"},{"name":"banane, poids épluché","amount":"200","unit":"g","group":"Fruits"},{"name":"eau potable froide","amount":"80","unit":"ml","group":"Pour mixer"}],"steps":[{"title":"Laver, couper et répartir les fruits","content":"Lavez-vous les mains, puis rincez tous les fruits sous l’eau courante avant de les éplucher, sans savon. Retirez parties abîmées, feuilles des fraises, peau des kiwis et bananes, ainsi que peau et noyau de mangue. Pesez 200 g comestibles de chacun des cinq fruits. Coupez mangue, kiwi, fraise et banane en morceaux d’environ 2 cm. Partagez la banane en quatre portions de 50 g, chacune avec un fruit différent dans un récipient séparé.","image_url":"/recetas/receta-jugo-arcoiris/paso-01.webp","image_alt":"Jus arc-en-ciel aux fruits en quatre couches: Laver, couper et répartir les fruits"},{"title":"Congeler les quatre mélanges","content":"Étalez séparément myrtilles avec 50 g de banane, fraises avec 50 g, kiwi avec 50 g et mangue avec les derniers 50 g dans des récipients bas adaptés au congélateur. Couvrez et congelez environ 60 minutes, jusqu’à ce que les morceaux soient fermes mais séparables. S’ils sont mous, prolongez ; évitez un bloc épais. Refroidissez quatre verres d’au moins 350 ml au réfrigérateur.","image_url":"/recetas/receta-jugo-arcoiris/paso-02.webp","image_alt":"Jus arc-en-ciel aux fruits en quatre couches: Congeler les quatre mélanges"},{"title":"Mixer la couche violette","content":"Mettez 200 g de myrtilles, leurs 50 g de banane froide et 20 ml d’eau dans un blender adapté aux fruits congelés. Mixez 40–60 secondes pour obtenir une purée épaisse et homogène. Si les fruits ne bougent pas, arrêtez et débranchez avant de racler à la spatule ; laissez ramollir 2 minutes plutôt que d’ajouter trop d’eau. Transvasez dans un bol, couvrez et réfrigérez.","image_url":"/recetas/receta-jugo-arcoiris/paso-03.webp","image_alt":"Jus arc-en-ciel aux fruits en quatre couches: Mixer la couche violette"},{"title":"Mixer la couche de fraise","content":"Lavez et séchez le bol du blender pour ne pas colorer le mélange suivant. Mixez 200 g de fraises avec leurs 50 g de banane et 20 ml d’eau pendant 40–60 secondes. La purée doit être rose et épaisse, pas liquide. Réservez dans un autre bol couvert au réfrigérateur pendant les étapes suivantes.","image_url":"/recetas/receta-jugo-arcoiris/paso-04.webp","image_alt":"Jus arc-en-ciel aux fruits en quatre couches: Mixer la couche de fraise"},{"title":"Mixer la couche verte","content":"Lavez et séchez à nouveau le bol. Mixez 200 g de kiwi, ses 50 g de banane et 20 ml d’eau pendant 40–60 secondes. Gardez les petites graines de kiwi et toute la pulpe, sans filtrer. Réfrigérez le mélange vert couvert.","image_url":"/recetas/receta-jugo-arcoiris/paso-05.webp","image_alt":"Jus arc-en-ciel aux fruits en quatre couches: Mixer la couche verte"},{"title":"Mixer la couche dorée","content":"Lavez et séchez encore le bol. Mixez 200 g de mangue avec les derniers 50 g de banane et 20 ml d’eau pendant 40–60 secondes, jusqu’à obtenir une crème dorée homogène. La consistance doit ressembler aux autres couches ; réfrigérez tout mélange trop réchauffé avant le montage.","image_url":"/recetas/receta-jugo-arcoiris/paso-06.webp","image_alt":"Jus arc-en-ciel aux fruits en quatre couches: Mixer la couche dorée"},{"title":"Monter les couches doucement","content":"Répartissez la purée violette dans les quatre verres froids. Ajoutez un quart du mélange de fraise dans chacun, lentement sur le dos d’une cuillère juste au-dessus de la couche précédente. Répétez avec le kiwi et terminez par la mangue. Ne remuez pas et ne versez pas de haut : chaque verre reçoit un quart des quatre mélanges.","image_url":"/recetas/receta-jugo-arcoiris/paso-07.webp","image_alt":"Jus arc-en-ciel aux fruits en quatre couches: Monter les couches doucement"},{"title":"Servir juste après le montage","content":"Servez immédiatement avec une longue cuillère tant que les couches gardent leur forme. Pour conserver, couvrez et réfrigérez à 4 °C maximum ; consommez dans les 24 heures. Couleur et séparation évolueront. Si tout se mélange, remuez et servez comme un smoothie. Ne laissez pas plus de 2 heures à température ambiante.","image_url":"/recetas/receta-jugo-arcoiris/paso-08.webp","image_alt":"Jus arc-en-ciel aux fruits en quatre couches: Servir juste après le montage"}],"notes":"Des fruits mûrs équilibrent l’acidité du kiwi. Congélation et faible quantité de liquide facilitent le montage, sans garantir des lignes parfaites. Pour des fruits déjà congelés, gardez les mêmes poids comestibles et vérifiez si l’emballage impose une cuisson ; ne les utilisez pas crus dans ce cas. Adaptez le temps total si vous sautez la congélation préalable. Si votre blender n’accepte pas les fruits congelés, laissez-les ramollir jusqu’à pouvoir les mixer sans risque pour l’appareil ; les couches seront moins nettes.","nutrition":{"calories":149.5,"protein_g":2.2,"carbs_g":37.3,"fat_g":0.9,"saturated_fat_g":0.1,"fiber_g":5.8,"sugar_g":24.9,"sodium_mg":4.0,"estimated":true,"source":"USDA FoodData Central — SR Legacy (abril de 2018)","source_url":"https://fdc.nal.usda.gov/download-datasets/","inputs":[{"ingredient":"myrtilles fraîches","edible_grams":200,"fdc_id":171711,"fdc_description":"Blueberries, raw","per_100g":{"sodium_mg":1.0,"carbs_g":14.49,"calories":57.0,"sugar_g":9.96,"fat_g":0.33,"saturated_fat_g":0.028,"fiber_g":2.4,"protein_g":0.74},"source_url":"https://fdc.nal.usda.gov/food-details/171711/nutrients"},{"ingredient":"fraises, poids sans feuilles","edible_grams":200,"fdc_id":167762,"fdc_description":"Strawberries, raw","per_100g":{"fat_g":0.3,"fiber_g":2.0,"protein_g":0.67,"sodium_mg":1.0,"sugar_g":4.89,"carbs_g":7.68,"calories":32.0,"saturated_fat_g":0.015},"source_url":"https://fdc.nal.usda.gov/food-details/167762/nutrients"},{"ingredient":"kiwi, poids épluché","edible_grams":200,"fdc_id":168153,"fdc_description":"Kiwifruit, green, raw","per_100g":{"protein_g":1.14,"fiber_g":3.0,"fat_g":0.52,"sugar_g":8.99,"sodium_mg":3.0,"carbs_g":14.66,"calories":61.0,"saturated_fat_g":0.029},"source_url":"https://fdc.nal.usda.gov/food-details/168153/nutrients"},{"ingredient":"mangue, poids sans peau ni noyau","edible_grams":200,"fdc_id":169910,"fdc_description":"Mangos, raw","per_100g":{"fat_g":0.38,"protein_g":0.82,"fiber_g":1.6,"sodium_mg":1.0,"carbs_g":14.98,"calories":60.0,"sugar_g":13.66,"saturated_fat_g":0.092},"source_url":"https://fdc.nal.usda.gov/food-details/169910/nutrients"},{"ingredient":"banane, poids épluché","edible_grams":200,"fdc_id":173944,"fdc_description":"Bananas, raw","per_100g":{"saturated_fat_g":0.112,"carbs_g":22.84,"calories":89.0,"fiber_g":2.6,"sodium_mg":1.0,"protein_g":1.09,"sugar_g":12.23,"fat_g":0.33},"source_url":"https://fdc.nal.usda.gov/food-details/173944/nutrients"},{"ingredient":"eau potable froide","edible_grams":80,"fdc_id":173647,"fdc_description":"Beverages, water, tap, drinking","per_100g":{"fat_g":0.0,"carbs_g":0.0,"calories":0.0,"protein_g":0.0,"fiber_g":0.0,"sodium_mg":4.0,"sugar_g":0.0,"saturated_fat_g":0.0},"source_url":"https://fdc.nal.usda.gov/food-details/173647/nutrients"}],"serving_size":"1 des 4 verres, environ 270 g","method":"Valeurs USDA vérifiées pour 100 g, pondérées par les poids comestibles des fruits avant congélation et 80 g d’eau, puis divisées par 4. Les 80 ml d’eau sont assimilés à 80 g. Sans sucre ajouté, lait ni décoration.","note":"Estimation indicative, pas une analyse de la boisson préparée. Maturité des fruits, eau et restes dans le blender modifient le résultat. Rien n’est filtré : toute la pulpe des quantités indiquées est comptée."},"keywords":["jus arc-en-ciel","smoothie aux fruits en couches","boisson mangue kiwi fraise myrtille"],"image_url":"/recetas/receta-jugo-arcoiris/portada.webp","gallery":[{"url":"/recetas/receta-jugo-arcoiris/portada.webp","alt":"Quatre verres de jus arc-en-ciel aux couches de fruits violette, rose, verte et dorée"}],"seo":{"title":"Jus arc-en-ciel en quatre couches | Manual de Cocina","description":"Jus arc-en-ciel à la myrtille, fraise, kiwi et mangue. Quantités pour 4 verres, congélation préalable et montage détaillé, sans colorants.","image_alt":"Quatre verres de jus arc-en-ciel aux couches de fruits violette, rose, verte et dorée","image_variants":["/recetas/receta-jugo-arcoiris/portada-1x1.webp","/recetas/receta-jugo-arcoiris/portada-4x3.webp","/recetas/receta-jugo-arcoiris/portada-16x9.webp"],"faq":[{"q":"Pourquoi les couleurs se mélangent-elles ?","a":"Gardez toutes les purées froides et épaisses. Versez chaque couche lentement sur une cuillère, juste au-dessus de la surface, et servez aussitôt. Les bords des purées de fruits peuvent se fondre."},{"q":"Est-ce un jus filtré ?","a":"Non. Toute la pulpe est conservée, d’où la texture de smoothie. Filtrer ou ajouter beaucoup de liquide rend les couches difficiles à former."},{"q":"Puis-je le préparer la veille ?","a":"Conservez les quatre mélanges séparément, couverts, à 4 °C maximum jusqu’à 24 heures et montez au moment de servir. Couleur et texture évolueront, surtout celles de la banane."}]},"published":false,"editorial_status":"draft","content_html":"<p>Ce jus arc-en-ciel est une boisson épaisse aux fruits entiers, à la texture de smoothie et aux quatre couleurs naturelles : violet de myrtille, rose de fraise, vert de kiwi et doré de mangue. Un peu de banane donne du corps à chaque mélange. Rien n’est filtré ; ni colorants, ni lait, ni sucre ne sont ajoutés.</p><p>Pour 4 verres d’environ 270 g. Les 90 minutes au total comprennent 60 minutes de congélation préalable. Servez juste après le montage : les bords peuvent se mélanger légèrement et les couches ne restent pas séparées indéfiniment.</p>"},{"id":"f07634c4-a15e-543a-b401-0b0dba193515","recipe_group_id":"8d66b805-5283-43f9-833b-b1ba0875d57f","slug":"ricetta-succo-arcobaleno","public_path":"/it/ricetta-succo-arcobaleno","source_url":"https://manualdecocina.com/it/ricetta-succo-arcobaleno/","language":"it","title":"Succo arcobaleno alla frutta in quattro strati","excerpt":"Prepara un succo arcobaleno denso con mirtilli, fragole, kiwi e mango. Quattro strati, dosi precise e istruzioni per versarli senza mescolarli.","summary":"Questo succo arcobaleno conserva tutta la polpa della frutta e ha la consistenza di uno smoothie. I quattro colori naturali sono viola, rosa, verde e dorato, dal fondo del bicchiere verso l’alto.\n\nLa banana addensa ogni miscela; il raffreddamento e poca acqua aiutano a sovrapporre gli strati. Quantità e tempi sono una proposta editoriale, ancora da confermare con una prova in cucina. I bordi possono sfumare.","category":"Bevande","category_slug":"bebidas","difficulty":"Facile","course":"Bevanda","cuisine":"Internazionale","prep_time_minutes":30,"cook_time_minutes":0,"total_time_minutes":90,"servings":4,"ingredients":[{"name":"Mirtilli","amount":"200","unit":"g","group":"Frutta"},{"name":"Fragole senza picciolo","amount":"200","unit":"g","group":"Frutta"},{"name":"Kiwi verde sbucciato","amount":"200","unit":"g","group":"Frutta"},{"name":"Mango senza buccia e nocciolo","amount":"200","unit":"g","group":"Frutta"},{"name":"Banana sbucciata","amount":"200","unit":"g","group":"Frutta"},{"name":"Acqua potabile fredda","amount":"80","unit":"ml","group":"Per frullare"}],"steps":[{"title":"Lavare, tagliare e dividere la frutta","content":"Lava le mani, poi sciacqua tutta la frutta sotto acqua corrente prima di sbucciarla, senza sapone. Elimina parti rovinate, piccioli delle fragole, bucce di kiwi e banana, buccia e nocciolo del mango. Pesa 200 g commestibili di ciascuno dei cinque frutti. Taglia mango, kiwi, fragole e banana in pezzi di circa 2 cm. Dividi la banana in quattro porzioni da 50 g e abbina ciascuna a un frutto diverso, in quattro contenitori separati.","image_url":"/recetas/receta-jugo-arcoiris/paso-01.webp","image_alt":"Succo arcobaleno alla frutta in quattro strati: Lavare, tagliare e dividere la frutta"},{"title":"Congelare le quattro miscele","content":"Distribuisci separatamente mirtilli con 50 g di banana, fragole con 50 g, kiwi con 50 g e mango con gli ultimi 50 g in contenitori bassi adatti al congelatore. Copri e congela per circa 60 minuti, finché i pezzi sono sodi ma separabili. Se sono morbidi, prolunga il tempo; evita un blocco spesso. Raffredda quattro bicchieri da almeno 350 ml in frigorifero.","image_url":"/recetas/receta-jugo-arcoiris/paso-02.webp","image_alt":"Succo arcobaleno alla frutta in quattro strati: Congelare le quattro miscele"},{"title":"Frullare lo strato viola","content":"Metti 200 g di mirtilli, i loro 50 g di banana fredda e 20 ml d’acqua in un frullatore adatto alla frutta congelata. Frulla per 40–60 secondi fino a ottenere una purea densa e uniforme. Se la frutta non si muove, spegni e scollega la spina prima di raccoglierla con una spatola; lasciala ammorbidire per 2 minuti invece di aggiungere troppa acqua. Trasferisci in una ciotola, copri e metti in frigorifero.","image_url":"/recetas/receta-jugo-arcoiris/paso-03.webp","image_alt":"Succo arcobaleno alla frutta in quattro strati: Frullare lo strato viola"},{"title":"Frullare lo strato di fragola","content":"Lava e asciuga il boccale per non colorare la miscela successiva. Frulla 200 g di fragole con i loro 50 g di banana e 20 ml d’acqua per 40–60 secondi. La purea deve essere rosa e densa, non liquida. Tienila in un’altra ciotola coperta in frigorifero mentre procedi.","image_url":"/recetas/receta-jugo-arcoiris/paso-04.webp","image_alt":"Succo arcobaleno alla frutta in quattro strati: Frullare lo strato di fragola"},{"title":"Frullare lo strato verde","content":"Lava e asciuga di nuovo il boccale. Frulla 200 g di kiwi con i loro 50 g di banana e 20 ml d’acqua per 40–60 secondi. Conserva i piccoli semi del kiwi e tutta la polpa, senza filtrare. Copri la miscela verde e mettila in frigorifero.","image_url":"/recetas/receta-jugo-arcoiris/paso-05.webp","image_alt":"Succo arcobaleno alla frutta in quattro strati: Frullare lo strato verde"},{"title":"Frullare lo strato dorato","content":"Lava e asciuga ancora il boccale. Frulla 200 g di mango con gli ultimi 50 g di banana e 20 ml d’acqua per 40–60 secondi, ottenendo una crema dorata uniforme. La consistenza deve essere simile agli altri strati; raffredda in frigorifero una miscela troppo riscaldata prima del montaggio.","image_url":"/recetas/receta-jugo-arcoiris/paso-06.webp","image_alt":"Succo arcobaleno alla frutta in quattro strati: Frullare lo strato dorato"},{"title":"Versare lentamente gli strati","content":"Dividi la purea viola fra i quattro bicchieri freddi. Aggiungi in ciascuno un quarto della miscela di fragole, lentamente sul dorso di un cucchiaio tenuto appena sopra lo strato precedente. Ripeti con il kiwi e termina con il mango. Non mescolare e non versare dall’alto: ogni bicchiere riceve un quarto di tutte e quattro le miscele.","image_url":"/recetas/receta-jugo-arcoiris/paso-07.webp","image_alt":"Succo arcobaleno alla frutta in quattro strati: Versare lentamente gli strati"},{"title":"Servire appena assemblato","content":"Servi subito con un cucchiaio lungo, finché gli strati mantengono la forma. Per conservare, copri e metti in frigorifero a non più di 4 °C; consuma entro 24 ore. Colore e separazione cambieranno. Se gli strati si mescolano, gira e servi come smoothie. Non lasciare a temperatura ambiente per più di 2 ore.","image_url":"/recetas/receta-jugo-arcoiris/paso-08.webp","image_alt":"Succo arcobaleno alla frutta in quattro strati: Servire appena assemblato"}],"notes":"La frutta matura bilancia l’acidità del kiwi. Congelamento e poca acqua aiutano il montaggio, senza garantire linee perfette. Con frutta già congelata mantieni gli stessi pesi commestibili e controlla se la confezione richiede la cottura; in quel caso non usarla cruda. Adatta il tempo totale se salti il congelamento iniziale. Se il frullatore non è adatto alla frutta congelata, lasciala ammorbidire abbastanza da frullarla senza danneggiare l’apparecchio; gli strati saranno meno distinti.","nutrition":{"calories":149.5,"protein_g":2.2,"carbs_g":37.3,"fat_g":0.9,"saturated_fat_g":0.1,"fiber_g":5.8,"sugar_g":24.9,"sodium_mg":4.0,"estimated":true,"source":"USDA FoodData Central — SR Legacy (abril de 2018)","source_url":"https://fdc.nal.usda.gov/download-datasets/","inputs":[{"ingredient":"Mirtilli","edible_grams":200,"fdc_id":171711,"fdc_description":"Blueberries, raw","per_100g":{"sodium_mg":1.0,"carbs_g":14.49,"calories":57.0,"sugar_g":9.96,"fat_g":0.33,"saturated_fat_g":0.028,"fiber_g":2.4,"protein_g":0.74},"source_url":"https://fdc.nal.usda.gov/food-details/171711/nutrients"},{"ingredient":"Fragole senza picciolo","edible_grams":200,"fdc_id":167762,"fdc_description":"Strawberries, raw","per_100g":{"fat_g":0.3,"fiber_g":2.0,"protein_g":0.67,"sodium_mg":1.0,"sugar_g":4.89,"carbs_g":7.68,"calories":32.0,"saturated_fat_g":0.015},"source_url":"https://fdc.nal.usda.gov/food-details/167762/nutrients"},{"ingredient":"Kiwi verde sbucciato","edible_grams":200,"fdc_id":168153,"fdc_description":"Kiwifruit, green, raw","per_100g":{"protein_g":1.14,"fiber_g":3.0,"fat_g":0.52,"sugar_g":8.99,"sodium_mg":3.0,"carbs_g":14.66,"calories":61.0,"saturated_fat_g":0.029},"source_url":"https://fdc.nal.usda.gov/food-details/168153/nutrients"},{"ingredient":"Mango senza buccia e nocciolo","edible_grams":200,"fdc_id":169910,"fdc_description":"Mangos, raw","per_100g":{"fat_g":0.38,"protein_g":0.82,"fiber_g":1.6,"sodium_mg":1.0,"carbs_g":14.98,"calories":60.0,"sugar_g":13.66,"saturated_fat_g":0.092},"source_url":"https://fdc.nal.usda.gov/food-details/169910/nutrients"},{"ingredient":"Banana sbucciata","edible_grams":200,"fdc_id":173944,"fdc_description":"Bananas, raw","per_100g":{"saturated_fat_g":0.112,"carbs_g":22.84,"calories":89.0,"fiber_g":2.6,"sodium_mg":1.0,"protein_g":1.09,"sugar_g":12.23,"fat_g":0.33},"source_url":"https://fdc.nal.usda.gov/food-details/173944/nutrients"},{"ingredient":"Acqua potabile fredda","edible_grams":80,"fdc_id":173647,"fdc_description":"Beverages, water, tap, drinking","per_100g":{"fat_g":0.0,"carbs_g":0.0,"calories":0.0,"protein_g":0.0,"fiber_g":0.0,"sodium_mg":4.0,"sugar_g":0.0,"saturated_fat_g":0.0},"source_url":"https://fdc.nal.usda.gov/food-details/173647/nutrients"}],"serving_size":"1 dei 4 bicchieri, circa 270 g","method":"Valori USDA verificati per 100 g, ponderati con i pesi commestibili della frutta prima del congelamento e 80 g d’acqua, poi divisi per 4. Gli 80 ml d’acqua sono approssimati a 80 g. Senza zucchero aggiunto, latte o decorazioni.","note":"Stima indicativa, non analisi della bevanda preparata. Maturazione della frutta, acqua e residui nel frullatore cambiano il risultato. Nulla viene filtrato: si conteggia tutta la polpa delle quantità indicate."},"keywords":["succo arcobaleno","smoothie alla frutta a strati","bevanda mango kiwi fragola mirtillo"],"image_url":"/recetas/receta-jugo-arcoiris/portada.webp","gallery":[{"url":"/recetas/receta-jugo-arcoiris/portada.webp","alt":"Quattro bicchieri di succo arcobaleno con strati di frutta viola, rosa, verde e dorati"}],"seo":{"title":"Succo arcobaleno: quattro strati di frutta","description":"Prepara un succo arcobaleno denso con mirtilli, fragole, kiwi e mango. Quattro strati, dosi precise e istruzioni per versarli senza mescolarli.","image_alt":"Quattro bicchieri di succo arcobaleno con strati di frutta viola, rosa, verde e dorati","image_variants":["/recetas/receta-jugo-arcoiris/portada-1x1.webp","/recetas/receta-jugo-arcoiris/portada-4x3.webp","/recetas/receta-jugo-arcoiris/portada-16x9.webp"],"faq":[{"q":"Perché i colori si mescolano?","a":"Mantieni tutte le puree fredde e dense. Versa ogni strato lentamente su un cucchiaio, appena sopra la superficie, e servi subito. I bordi delle puree di frutta possono sfumare."},{"q":"È un succo filtrato?","a":"No. Si conserva tutta la polpa, quindi la consistenza è quella di uno smoothie. Filtrare o aggiungere molto liquido rende difficile formare gli strati."},{"q":"Posso prepararlo il giorno prima?","a":"Conserva le quattro miscele separatamente, coperte, a non più di 4 °C per un massimo di 24 ore e assembla al momento di servire. Colore e consistenza cambieranno, soprattutto quelli della banana."}]},"published":false,"editorial_status":"draft","content_html":"<p>Questo succo arcobaleno conserva tutta la polpa della frutta e ha la consistenza di uno smoothie. I quattro colori naturali sono viola, rosa, verde e dorato, dal fondo del bicchiere verso l’alto.</p><p>La banana addensa ogni miscela; il raffreddamento e poca acqua aiutano a sovrapporre gli strati. Quantità e tempi sono una proposta editoriale, ancora da confermare con una prova in cucina. I bordi possono sfumare.</p>"},{"id":"8c7a746e-e8cb-5ac0-8f63-4e4e80f9a725","recipe_group_id":"8d66b805-5283-43f9-833b-b1ba0875d57f","slug":"rainbow-fruit-juice","public_path":"/ja/rainbow-fruit-juice","source_url":null,"language":"ja","title":"4色のフルーツ・レインボージュース","excerpt":"ブルーベリー、いちご、キウイ、マンゴーを4層に重ねるレインボージュース。分量と冷やし方、色を混ぜずに注ぐ手順を紹介します。","summary":"果肉をこさずに使う、スムージーのように濃厚なレインボージュースです。グラスの底から、ブルーベリーの紫、いちごのピンク、キウイの緑、マンゴーの黄色を重ねます。\n\n各色にバナナを加えてとろみをつけ、少量の水と冷却で層を作りやすくします。分量と時間は編集上の提案で、調理試験による確認はまだ行っていません。層の境目が少し混ざることもあります。","category":"飲み物","category_slug":"bebidas","difficulty":"簡単","course":"飲み物","cuisine":"各国料理","prep_time_minutes":30,"cook_time_minutes":0,"total_time_minutes":90,"servings":4,"ingredients":[{"name":"ブルーベリー","amount":"200","unit":"g","group":"果物"},{"name":"へたを取ったいちご","amount":"200","unit":"g","group":"果物"},{"name":"皮をむいたグリーンキウイ","amount":"200","unit":"g","group":"果物"},{"name":"皮と種を除いたマンゴー","amount":"200","unit":"g","group":"果物"},{"name":"皮をむいたバナナ","amount":"200","unit":"g","group":"果物"},{"name":"冷たい飲用水","amount":"80","unit":"ml","group":"攪拌用"}],"steps":[{"title":"果物を洗い、切り分ける","content":"手を洗い、すべての果物を皮をむく前に流水で洗います。石けんは使いません。傷んだ部分、いちごのへた、キウイとバナナの皮、マンゴーの皮と種を除きます。5種類の果物を可食部でそれぞれ200 g量ります。マンゴー、キウイ、いちご、バナナを約2 cmに切ります。バナナを50 gずつ4等分し、4種類の果物それぞれと別々の容器に分けます。","image_url":"/recetas/receta-jugo-arcoiris/paso-01.webp","image_alt":"4色のフルーツ・レインボージュース: 果物を洗い、切り分ける"},{"title":"4種類を別々に冷凍する","content":"ブルーベリーとバナナ50 g、いちごとバナナ50 g、キウイとバナナ50 g、マンゴーと残りのバナナ50 gを、それぞれ浅い冷凍対応容器に広げます。ふたをして約60分冷凍し、硬くても一つずつ離せる状態にします。柔らかければ延長し、厚い塊に凍らせないようにします。容量350 ml以上のグラス4個を冷蔵庫で冷やします。","image_url":"/recetas/receta-jugo-arcoiris/paso-02.webp","image_alt":"4色のフルーツ・レインボージュース: 4種類を別々に冷凍する"},{"title":"紫の層を攪拌する","content":"冷凍果物に対応したミキサーにブルーベリー200 g、その容器の冷たいバナナ50 g、水20 mlを入れ、40〜60秒攪拌して均一で濃厚なピューレにします。果物が動かない場合は停止し、電源プラグを抜いてからへらで寄せます。水を増やしすぎず、2分ほど置いて柔らかくします。ボウルに移し、ふたをして冷蔵庫に入れます。","image_url":"/recetas/receta-jugo-arcoiris/paso-03.webp","image_alt":"4色のフルーツ・レインボージュース: 紫の層を攪拌する"},{"title":"いちごの層を攪拌する","content":"次の色に影響しないようミキサー容器を洗って乾かします。いちご200 g、その容器のバナナ50 g、水20 mlを40〜60秒攪拌します。流れる液体ではなく、濃厚なピンク色のピューレにします。別のボウルに移してふたをし、次の作業中は冷蔵庫に入れます。","image_url":"/recetas/receta-jugo-arcoiris/paso-04.webp","image_alt":"4色のフルーツ・レインボージュース: いちごの層を攪拌する"},{"title":"緑の層を攪拌する","content":"容器をもう一度洗って乾かします。キウイ200 g、その容器のバナナ50 g、水20 mlを40〜60秒攪拌します。キウイの小さな種と果肉はそのまま残し、こしません。緑のピューレにふたをして冷蔵庫に入れます。","image_url":"/recetas/receta-jugo-arcoiris/paso-05.webp","image_alt":"4色のフルーツ・レインボージュース: 緑の層を攪拌する"},{"title":"黄色の層を攪拌する","content":"容器を再び洗って乾かします。マンゴー200 g、最後のバナナ50 g、水20 mlを40〜60秒攪拌し、均一で濃厚な黄色のピューレにします。他の層と同じくらいのとろみに整えます。攪拌で温まった場合は、盛り付け前に冷蔵庫で冷やします。","image_url":"/recetas/receta-jugo-arcoiris/paso-06.webp","image_alt":"4色のフルーツ・レインボージュース: 黄色の層を攪拌する"},{"title":"ゆっくり4層に重ねる","content":"紫のピューレを冷たいグラス4個に等分します。各グラスにいちごのピューレを全量の4分の1ずつ加えます。下の層のすぐ上にスプーンを置き、その背を伝わせてゆっくり注ぎます。同様にキウイを加え、最後にマンゴーを重ねます。混ぜたり高い位置から注いだりせず、各グラスに4種類すべてを4分の1ずつ入れます。","image_url":"/recetas/receta-jugo-arcoiris/paso-07.webp","image_alt":"4色のフルーツ・レインボージュース: ゆっくり4層に重ねる"},{"title":"盛り付けたらすぐに出す","content":"層が形を保っているうちに、長いスプーンを添えてすぐに出します。保存する場合はふたをし、4 °C以下で冷蔵して24時間以内に飲みます。色と層の状態は変化します。混ざったら全体を混ぜ、スムージーとして出します。室温で2時間を超えて放置しないでください。","image_url":"/recetas/receta-jugo-arcoiris/paso-08.webp","image_alt":"4色のフルーツ・レインボージュース: 盛り付けたらすぐに出す"}],"notes":"熟した果物を使うとキウイの酸味とのバランスが取りやすくなります。冷凍と少量の水は層作りを助けますが、境目が完全に分かれるとは限りません。冷凍済みの果物を使う場合も同じ可食部の重量を使い、包装の加熱指示を確認します。加熱が必要な製品は生で使いません。最初の冷凍を省く場合は合計時間も調整します。ミキサーが冷凍果物に対応していなければ、機器を傷めずに攪拌できる硬さまで戻してください。層は分かれにくくなります。","nutrition":{"calories":149.5,"protein_g":2.2,"carbs_g":37.3,"fat_g":0.9,"saturated_fat_g":0.1,"fiber_g":5.8,"sugar_g":24.9,"sodium_mg":4.0,"estimated":true,"source":"USDA FoodData Central — SR Legacy (abril de 2018)","source_url":"https://fdc.nal.usda.gov/download-datasets/","inputs":[{"ingredient":"ブルーベリー","edible_grams":200,"fdc_id":171711,"fdc_description":"Blueberries, raw","per_100g":{"sodium_mg":1.0,"carbs_g":14.49,"calories":57.0,"sugar_g":9.96,"fat_g":0.33,"saturated_fat_g":0.028,"fiber_g":2.4,"protein_g":0.74},"source_url":"https://fdc.nal.usda.gov/food-details/171711/nutrients"},{"ingredient":"へたを取ったいちご","edible_grams":200,"fdc_id":167762,"fdc_description":"Strawberries, raw","per_100g":{"fat_g":0.3,"fiber_g":2.0,"protein_g":0.67,"sodium_mg":1.0,"sugar_g":4.89,"carbs_g":7.68,"calories":32.0,"saturated_fat_g":0.015},"source_url":"https://fdc.nal.usda.gov/food-details/167762/nutrients"},{"ingredient":"皮をむいたグリーンキウイ","edible_grams":200,"fdc_id":168153,"fdc_description":"Kiwifruit, green, raw","per_100g":{"protein_g":1.14,"fiber_g":3.0,"fat_g":0.52,"sugar_g":8.99,"sodium_mg":3.0,"carbs_g":14.66,"calories":61.0,"saturated_fat_g":0.029},"source_url":"https://fdc.nal.usda.gov/food-details/168153/nutrients"},{"ingredient":"皮と種を除いたマンゴー","edible_grams":200,"fdc_id":169910,"fdc_description":"Mangos, raw","per_100g":{"fat_g":0.38,"protein_g":0.82,"fiber_g":1.6,"sodium_mg":1.0,"carbs_g":14.98,"calories":60.0,"sugar_g":13.66,"saturated_fat_g":0.092},"source_url":"https://fdc.nal.usda.gov/food-details/169910/nutrients"},{"ingredient":"皮をむいたバナナ","edible_grams":200,"fdc_id":173944,"fdc_description":"Bananas, raw","per_100g":{"saturated_fat_g":0.112,"carbs_g":22.84,"calories":89.0,"fiber_g":2.6,"sodium_mg":1.0,"protein_g":1.09,"sugar_g":12.23,"fat_g":0.33},"source_url":"https://fdc.nal.usda.gov/food-details/173944/nutrients"},{"ingredient":"冷たい飲用水","edible_grams":80,"fdc_id":173647,"fdc_description":"Beverages, water, tap, drinking","per_100g":{"fat_g":0.0,"carbs_g":0.0,"calories":0.0,"protein_g":0.0,"fiber_g":0.0,"sodium_mg":4.0,"sugar_g":0.0,"saturated_fat_g":0.0},"source_url":"https://fdc.nal.usda.gov/food-details/173647/nutrients"}],"serving_size":"4杯のうち1杯、約270 g","method":"確認したUSDAの100 g当たりの数値を、冷凍前の果物の可食部重量と水80 gで加重計算し、4で割っています。水80 mlは約80 gとして計算しています。追加の砂糖、乳製品、飾りは含みません。","note":"参考用の推定値で、完成した飲み物の実測値ではありません。果物の熟度、水、ミキサーに残った量で変わります。こさずに使用するため、指定量の果肉をすべて計上しています。"},"keywords":["レインボージュース","フルーツの層状スムージー","マンゴー キウイ いちご ブルーベリー"],"image_url":"/recetas/receta-jugo-arcoiris/portada.webp","gallery":[{"url":"/recetas/receta-jugo-arcoiris/portada.webp","alt":"紫、ピンク、緑、黄色の果物の層を重ねたレインボージュース4杯"}],"seo":{"title":"レインボージュースの作り方｜フルーツの4層仕立て","description":"ブルーベリー、いちご、キウイ、マンゴーを4層に重ねるレインボージュース。分量と冷やし方、色を混ぜずに注ぐ手順を紹介します。","image_alt":"紫、ピンク、緑、黄色の果物の層を重ねたレインボージュース4杯","image_variants":["/recetas/receta-jugo-arcoiris/portada-1x1.webp","/recetas/receta-jugo-arcoiris/portada-4x3.webp","/recetas/receta-jugo-arcoiris/portada-16x9.webp"],"faq":[{"q":"色が混ざってしまうのはなぜですか？","a":"各ピューレを冷たく濃厚に保ち、下の層のすぐ上でスプーンの背を伝わせてゆっくり注ぎ、すぐに出してください。果物のピューレなので境目が少し混ざることはあります。"},{"q":"果肉をこしたジュースですか？","a":"いいえ。果肉をすべて残すため、スムージーのような食感です。こしたり水分を多く加えたりすると、層を作りにくくなります。"},{"q":"前日に作れますか？","a":"4種類のピューレを別々にふたをして4 °C以下で最大24時間保存し、飲む直前に重ねます。特にバナナは色や食感が変化します。"}]},"published":false,"editorial_status":"draft","content_html":"<p>果肉をこさずに使う、スムージーのように濃厚なレインボージュースです。グラスの底から、ブルーベリーの紫、いちごのピンク、キウイの緑、マンゴーの黄色を重ねます。</p><p>各色にバナナを加えてとろみをつけ、少量の水と冷却で層を作りやすくします。分量と時間は編集上の提案で、調理試験による確認はまだ行っていません。層の境目が少し混ざることもあります。</p>"},{"id":"cafa2587-2833-512b-8a23-a92d2a130da3","recipe_group_id":"8d66b805-5283-43f9-833b-b1ba0875d57f","slug":"suco-arco-iris","public_path":"/pt/suco-arco-iris","source_url":null,"language":"pt","title":"Suco arco-íris de frutas em quatro camadas","excerpt":"Faça um suco arco-íris cremoso com mirtilo, morango, kiwi e manga. Veja as quantidades e como montar quatro camadas de frutas sem misturar as cores.","summary":"Este suco arco-íris mantém toda a polpa das frutas e tem textura de smoothie. As quatro cores naturais aparecem de baixo para cima: roxo do mirtilo, rosa do morango, verde do kiwi e dourado da manga.\n\nA banana engrossa cada mistura; o resfriamento e pouca água ajudam a formar as camadas. Quantidades e tempos são uma proposta editorial, ainda pendente de teste na cozinha. As bordas podem se misturar um pouco.","category":"Bebidas","category_slug":"bebidas","difficulty":"Fácil","course":"Bebida","cuisine":"Internacional","prep_time_minutes":30,"cook_time_minutes":0,"total_time_minutes":90,"servings":4,"ingredients":[{"name":"Mirtilos","amount":"200","unit":"g","group":"Frutas"},{"name":"Morangos sem folhas e talos","amount":"200","unit":"g","group":"Frutas"},{"name":"Kiwi verde descascado","amount":"200","unit":"g","group":"Frutas"},{"name":"Manga sem casca e caroço","amount":"200","unit":"g","group":"Frutas"},{"name":"Banana descascada","amount":"200","unit":"g","group":"Frutas"},{"name":"Água potável fria","amount":"80","unit":"ml","group":"Para bater"}],"steps":[{"title":"Lavar, cortar e dividir as frutas","content":"Lave as mãos e enxágue todas as frutas em água corrente antes de descascar, sem sabão. Retire partes estragadas, folhas e talos dos morangos, cascas dos kiwis e das bananas, casca e caroço da manga. Pese 200 g da parte comestível de cada uma das cinco frutas. Corte manga, kiwi, morango e banana em pedaços de cerca de 2 cm. Divida a banana em quatro porções de 50 g e coloque cada uma com uma das quatro frutas coloridas em recipientes separados.","image_url":"/recetas/receta-jugo-arcoiris/paso-01.webp","image_alt":"Suco arco-íris de frutas em quatro camadas: Lavar, cortar e dividir as frutas"},{"title":"Congelar as quatro misturas","content":"Espalhe separadamente os mirtilos com 50 g de banana, os morangos com 50 g, o kiwi com 50 g e a manga com os últimos 50 g em recipientes rasos próprios para o congelador. Tampe e congele por cerca de 60 minutos, até os pedaços ficarem firmes, mas ainda separáveis. Se estiverem moles, deixe mais tempo; evite formar um bloco grosso. Esfrie quatro copos de pelo menos 350 ml na geladeira.","image_url":"/recetas/receta-jugo-arcoiris/paso-02.webp","image_alt":"Suco arco-íris de frutas em quatro camadas: Congelar as quatro misturas"},{"title":"Bater a camada roxa","content":"Coloque 200 g de mirtilos, seus 50 g de banana fria e 20 ml de água em um liquidificador adequado para frutas congeladas. Bata por 40–60 segundos até obter um purê espesso e uniforme. Se as frutas não se moverem, desligue e tire da tomada antes de raspar com uma espátula; deixe amolecer por 2 minutos em vez de acrescentar muita água. Transfira para uma tigela, tampe e leve à geladeira.","image_url":"/recetas/receta-jugo-arcoiris/paso-03.webp","image_alt":"Suco arco-íris de frutas em quatro camadas: Bater a camada roxa"},{"title":"Bater a camada de morango","content":"Lave e seque o copo do liquidificador para não tingir a próxima mistura. Bata 200 g de morangos com seus 50 g de banana e 20 ml de água por 40–60 segundos. O purê deve ficar rosa e espesso, não líquido. Reserve em outra tigela tampada na geladeira enquanto continua o preparo.","image_url":"/recetas/receta-jugo-arcoiris/paso-04.webp","image_alt":"Suco arco-íris de frutas em quatro camadas: Bater a camada de morango"},{"title":"Bater a camada verde","content":"Lave e seque novamente o copo. Bata 200 g de kiwi com seus 50 g de banana e 20 ml de água por 40–60 segundos. Mantenha as sementinhas do kiwi e toda a polpa, sem coar. Tampe a mistura verde e leve à geladeira.","image_url":"/recetas/receta-jugo-arcoiris/paso-05.webp","image_alt":"Suco arco-íris de frutas em quatro camadas: Bater a camada verde"},{"title":"Bater a camada dourada","content":"Lave e seque o copo mais uma vez. Bata 200 g de manga com os últimos 50 g de banana e 20 ml de água por 40–60 segundos, até formar um creme dourado uniforme. A consistência deve ser parecida com a das outras camadas; se alguma mistura estiver aquecida, esfrie na geladeira antes de montar.","image_url":"/recetas/receta-jugo-arcoiris/paso-06.webp","image_alt":"Suco arco-íris de frutas em quatro camadas: Bater a camada dourada"},{"title":"Montar as camadas devagar","content":"Divida o purê roxo entre os quatro copos frios. Acrescente um quarto da mistura de morango a cada copo, devagar, sobre as costas de uma colher posicionada logo acima da camada anterior. Repita com o kiwi e termine com a manga. Não mexa nem despeje de uma altura grande: cada copo recebe um quarto de cada uma das quatro misturas.","image_url":"/recetas/receta-jugo-arcoiris/paso-07.webp","image_alt":"Suco arco-íris de frutas em quatro camadas: Montar as camadas devagar"},{"title":"Servir logo após a montagem","content":"Sirva imediatamente com uma colher longa enquanto as camadas mantêm o formato. Para guardar, tampe e leve à geladeira a no máximo 4 °C; consuma em até 24 horas. A cor e a separação vão mudar. Se tudo se misturar, mexa e sirva como smoothie. Não deixe por mais de 2 horas em temperatura ambiente.","image_url":"/recetas/receta-jugo-arcoiris/paso-08.webp","image_alt":"Suco arco-íris de frutas em quatro camadas: Servir logo após a montagem"}],"notes":"Frutas maduras equilibram a acidez do kiwi. Congelar e usar pouca água ajuda na montagem, sem garantir linhas perfeitas. Com frutas já congeladas, mantenha os mesmos pesos comestíveis e confira se a embalagem exige cozimento; nesse caso, não use cruas. Ajuste o tempo total se pular o congelamento inicial. Se o liquidificador não aceitar frutas congeladas, deixe amolecer até poder bater sem danificar o aparelho; as camadas ficarão menos definidas.","nutrition":{"calories":149.5,"protein_g":2.2,"carbs_g":37.3,"fat_g":0.9,"saturated_fat_g":0.1,"fiber_g":5.8,"sugar_g":24.9,"sodium_mg":4.0,"estimated":true,"source":"USDA FoodData Central — SR Legacy (abril de 2018)","source_url":"https://fdc.nal.usda.gov/download-datasets/","inputs":[{"ingredient":"Mirtilos","edible_grams":200,"fdc_id":171711,"fdc_description":"Blueberries, raw","per_100g":{"sodium_mg":1.0,"carbs_g":14.49,"calories":57.0,"sugar_g":9.96,"fat_g":0.33,"saturated_fat_g":0.028,"fiber_g":2.4,"protein_g":0.74},"source_url":"https://fdc.nal.usda.gov/food-details/171711/nutrients"},{"ingredient":"Morangos sem folhas e talos","edible_grams":200,"fdc_id":167762,"fdc_description":"Strawberries, raw","per_100g":{"fat_g":0.3,"fiber_g":2.0,"protein_g":0.67,"sodium_mg":1.0,"sugar_g":4.89,"carbs_g":7.68,"calories":32.0,"saturated_fat_g":0.015},"source_url":"https://fdc.nal.usda.gov/food-details/167762/nutrients"},{"ingredient":"Kiwi verde descascado","edible_grams":200,"fdc_id":168153,"fdc_description":"Kiwifruit, green, raw","per_100g":{"protein_g":1.14,"fiber_g":3.0,"fat_g":0.52,"sugar_g":8.99,"sodium_mg":3.0,"carbs_g":14.66,"calories":61.0,"saturated_fat_g":0.029},"source_url":"https://fdc.nal.usda.gov/food-details/168153/nutrients"},{"ingredient":"Manga sem casca e caroço","edible_grams":200,"fdc_id":169910,"fdc_description":"Mangos, raw","per_100g":{"fat_g":0.38,"protein_g":0.82,"fiber_g":1.6,"sodium_mg":1.0,"carbs_g":14.98,"calories":60.0,"sugar_g":13.66,"saturated_fat_g":0.092},"source_url":"https://fdc.nal.usda.gov/food-details/169910/nutrients"},{"ingredient":"Banana descascada","edible_grams":200,"fdc_id":173944,"fdc_description":"Bananas, raw","per_100g":{"saturated_fat_g":0.112,"carbs_g":22.84,"calories":89.0,"fiber_g":2.6,"sodium_mg":1.0,"protein_g":1.09,"sugar_g":12.23,"fat_g":0.33},"source_url":"https://fdc.nal.usda.gov/food-details/173944/nutrients"},{"ingredient":"Água potável fria","edible_grams":80,"fdc_id":173647,"fdc_description":"Beverages, water, tap, drinking","per_100g":{"fat_g":0.0,"carbs_g":0.0,"calories":0.0,"protein_g":0.0,"fiber_g":0.0,"sodium_mg":4.0,"sugar_g":0.0,"saturated_fat_g":0.0},"source_url":"https://fdc.nal.usda.gov/food-details/173647/nutrients"}],"serving_size":"1 dos 4 copos, cerca de 270 g","method":"Valores USDA verificados por 100 g, ponderados pelos pesos comestíveis das frutas antes do congelamento e 80 g de água, depois divididos por 4. Os 80 ml de água são aproximados para 80 g. Sem açúcar adicionado, leite ou decoração.","note":"Estimativa indicativa, não uma análise da bebida pronta. Maturação das frutas, água e resíduos no liquidificador mudam o resultado. Nada é coado: toda a polpa das quantidades indicadas entra no cálculo."},"keywords":["suco arco-íris","smoothie de frutas em camadas","bebida de manga kiwi morango mirtilo"],"image_url":"/recetas/receta-jugo-arcoiris/portada.webp","gallery":[{"url":"/recetas/receta-jugo-arcoiris/portada.webp","alt":"Quatro copos de suco arco-íris com camadas de frutas roxas, rosas, verdes e douradas"}],"seo":{"title":"Suco arco-íris: quatro camadas de frutas","description":"Faça um suco arco-íris cremoso com mirtilo, morango, kiwi e manga. Veja as quantidades e como montar quatro camadas de frutas sem misturar as cores.","image_alt":"Quatro copos de suco arco-íris com camadas de frutas roxas, rosas, verdes e douradas","image_variants":["/recetas/receta-jugo-arcoiris/portada-1x1.webp","/recetas/receta-jugo-arcoiris/portada-4x3.webp","/recetas/receta-jugo-arcoiris/portada-16x9.webp"],"faq":[{"q":"Por que as cores se misturam?","a":"Mantenha todos os purês frios e espessos. Despeje cada camada devagar sobre uma colher, bem perto da superfície, e sirva na hora. As bordas dos purês de frutas podem se misturar."},{"q":"É um suco coado?","a":"Não. Toda a polpa é mantida, por isso a textura é de smoothie. Coar ou adicionar muito líquido dificulta a formação das camadas."},{"q":"Posso preparar no dia anterior?","a":"Guarde as quatro misturas separadas e tampadas, a no máximo 4 °C por até 24 horas, e monte na hora de servir. Cor e textura vão mudar, principalmente as da banana."}]},"published":false,"editorial_status":"draft","content_html":"<p>Este suco arco-íris mantém toda a polpa das frutas e tem textura de smoothie. As quatro cores naturais aparecem de baixo para cima: roxo do mirtilo, rosa do morango, verde do kiwi e dourado da manga.</p><p>A banana engrossa cada mistura; o resfriamento e pouca água ajudam a formar as camadas. Quantidades e tempos são uma proposta editorial, ainda pendente de teste na cozinha. As bordas podem se misturar um pouco.</p>"},{"id":"669e4cf8-2a80-4cf2-8c5e-e13f78796117","recipe_group_id":"c934c115-46a8-4009-ae75-fb10bd3d184f","slug":"receta-de-alfajores-de-maicena","public_path":"/receta-de-alfajores-de-maicena","source_url":"https://manualdecocina.com/receta-de-alfajores-de-maicena/","language":"es","title":"Alfajores de maicena con dulce de leche y coco","excerpt":"Alfajores de maicena con dulce de leche y coco: cantidades para 20 unidades, masa con yemas, reposo en frío y horneado de las tapas paso a paso.","summary":"Estos alfajores de maicena se forman con dos tapas tiernas de almidón de maíz y harina, relleno de dulce de leche y coco solo en el borde. La ralladura de limón y la vainilla aromatizan una masa con yemas.\n\nLa propuesta rinde 20 alfajores de unos 5 cm: 40 tapas de 6 mm, horneadas en dos tandas. Los 130 minutos estimados incluyen 30 minutos de frío y 30 de enfriado; cantidades, rendimiento y tiempos están pendientes de confirmar mediante prueba de cocina.","category":"Postres","category_slug":"postres","difficulty":"Media","course":"Postre","cuisine":"Argentina","prep_time_minutes":40,"cook_time_minutes":30,"total_time_minutes":130,"servings":20,"ingredients":[{"name":"almidón de maíz","amount":"200","unit":"g","group":"Masa"},{"name":"harina de trigo de todo uso","amount":"100","unit":"g","group":"Masa"},{"name":"mantequilla sin sal","amount":"100","unit":"g","group":"Masa"},{"name":"azúcar blanco","amount":"80","unit":"g","group":"Masa"},{"name":"yemas de huevo, unas 3 grandes; pesar 51 g","amount":"51","unit":"g","group":"Masa"},{"name":"polvo de hornear de doble acción","amount":"6","unit":"g","group":"Masa"},{"name":"extracto de vainilla","amount":"5","unit":"g","group":"Masa"},{"name":"ralladura de limón","amount":"3","unit":"g","group":"Masa"},{"name":"dulce de leche","amount":"350","unit":"g","group":"Relleno y acabado"},{"name":"coco rallado seco sin azúcar","amount":"30","unit":"g","group":"Relleno y acabado"}],"steps":[{"title":"Pesa y tamiza los ingredientes secos","content":"Lávate las manos y limpia la superficie. Pesa todos los ingredientes; las 3 yemas deben sumar unos 51 g. Tamiza juntos los 200 g de almidón de maíz, 100 g de harina y 6 g de polvo de hornear en un cuenco. Lava el limón antes de rallar solo la parte amarilla hasta obtener 3 g. Mantén el dulce de leche y el coco separados de los utensilios que tocarán masa cruda.","image_url":"/recetas/receta-de-alfajores-de-maicena/paso-01.webp","image_alt":"Alfajores de maicena: pesa y tamiza los ingredientes secos"},{"title":"Bate la mantequilla y añade las yemas","content":"Usa los 100 g de mantequilla blanda, que ceda al presionarla pero no esté derretida. Bátela con los 80 g de azúcar durante 2–3 minutos hasta que quede cremosa. Incorpora las yemas en tres adiciones, batiendo hasta integrar cada una. Añade los 5 g de vainilla y los 3 g de ralladura; raspa las paredes del cuenco con una espátula.","image_url":"/recetas/receta-de-alfajores-de-maicena/paso-02.webp","image_alt":"Alfajores de maicena: bate la mantequilla y añade las yemas"},{"title":"Forma la masa y enfría","content":"Añade los ingredientes secos en dos tandas. Mezcla con espátula y termina juntando suavemente con las manos, solo hasta que no queden zonas de polvo; no amases como pan. Aplana la masa en un disco, envuelve y refrigera 30 minutos a 4 °C o menos. No pruebes masa cruda: contiene harina y huevo sin cocinar. Lava manos, cuenco y superficie después de manipularla.","image_url":"/recetas/receta-de-alfajores-de-maicena/paso-03.webp","image_alt":"Alfajores de maicena: forma la masa y enfría"},{"title":"Estira y corta cuarenta discos","content":"Precalienta el horno a 180 °C con calor arriba y abajo, o 160 °C con ventilador. Forra dos bandejas de unos 30 × 40 cm con papel de horno. Estira la masa entre dos hojas de papel hasta unos 6 mm de grosor. Corta círculos de 5 cm de diámetro; junta los recortes sin amasar mucho y vuelve a estirar. Busca 40 discos de tamaño similar, unos 13–14 g de masa cada uno, para formar 20 parejas. Reparte 20 por bandeja con unos 2 cm de separación. Si la masa se ablanda, enfría 10 minutos y añade esa espera al tiempo total.","image_url":"/recetas/receta-de-alfajores-de-maicena/paso-04.webp","image_alt":"Alfajores de maicena: estira y corta cuarenta discos"},{"title":"Hornea las tapas en dos tandas","content":"Hornea una bandeja cada vez en la zona central durante 12–15 minutos: la superficie debe estar mate y firme y la base apenas dorada, sin un centro húmedo. Empieza a revisar a los 12 minutos; el grosor y el horno pueden cambiar el tiempo. Retira con guantes y hornea la segunda bandeja del mismo modo. El cálculo de cocción reserva 30 minutos para las dos tandas; no busques un color tostado intenso.","image_url":"/recetas/receta-de-alfajores-de-maicena/paso-05.webp","image_alt":"Alfajores de maicena: hornea las tapas en dos tandas"},{"title":"Deja enfriar por completo","content":"Deja las tapas 5 minutos en su bandeja porque aún son frágiles. Pásalas con una espátula ancha a una rejilla y enfría unos 25 minutos más, hasta que estén completamente frías. No pongas relleno en tapas tibias: el dulce de leche se ablandaría y las galletas se romperían con más facilidad.","image_url":"/recetas/receta-de-alfajores-de-maicena/paso-06.webp","image_alt":"Alfajores de maicena: deja enfriar por completo"},{"title":"Rellena y cubre el borde con coco","content":"Empareja las 40 tapas por tamaño y coloca una de cada pareja con la base hacia arriba. Reparte los 350 g de dulce de leche espeso entre las 20 bases, unos 17–18 g por alfajor, con una cuchara o manga limpia. Cubre con la segunda tapa y presiona suavemente hasta que el relleno asome apenas. Pon los 30 g de coco en un plato y rueda solo el borde de cada alfajor para que se adhiera al relleno.","image_url":"/recetas/receta-de-alfajores-de-maicena/paso-07.webp","image_alt":"Alfajores de maicena: rellena y cubre el borde con coco"},{"title":"Sirve y guarda los alfajores","content":"Sirve los 20 alfajores cuando el relleno esté asentado y manipúlalos con cuidado. Guárdalos en un recipiente cerrado, separados por papel, en la nevera a 4 °C o menos y consúmelos dentro de 3 días, o antes si lo indica el envase del dulce de leche. Para congelar, envuelve individualmente hasta 1 mes y descongela en la nevera. Estas duraciones son una propuesta conservadora, no un ensayo de vida útil; el coco y las tapas se ablandarán con el tiempo.","image_url":"/recetas/receta-de-alfajores-de-maicena/paso-08.webp","image_alt":"Alfajores de maicena: sirve y guarda los alfajores"}],"notes":"Usa almidón de maíz blanco, no harina de maíz amarilla. El dulce de leche debe ser espeso, preferiblemente de repostería; uno líquido se saldrá del borde. Puedes omitir el coco, aunque cambiarán acabado y nutrición. No se propone una sustitución sin gluten sin probarla: esta masa lleva trigo. Si se agrieta al estirar, deja que pierda algo de frío unos minutos y presiona suavemente entre papeles; no añadas harina sin medir. Contiene trigo, huevo y leche. Evita probar masa cruda y limpia antes de manipular las tapas ya horneadas.","nutrition":{"calories":181.8,"protein_g":2.3,"carbs_g":27.2,"fat_g":7.0,"saturated_fat_g":4.4,"fiber_g":0.5,"sugar_g":12.9,"sodium_mg":50.0,"estimated":true,"source":"USDA FoodData Central — SR Legacy (abril de 2018)","source_url":"https://fdc.nal.usda.gov/download-datasets/","inputs":[{"ingredient":"almidón de maíz","edible_grams":200,"fdc_id":169698,"fdc_description":"Cornstarch","per_100g":{"sugar_g":0.0,"fat_g":0.05,"carbs_g":91.27,"calories":381.0,"protein_g":0.26,"fiber_g":0.9,"sodium_mg":9.0,"saturated_fat_g":0.009},"source_url":"https://fdc.nal.usda.gov/food-details/169698/nutrients"},{"ingredient":"harina de trigo de todo uso","edible_grams":100,"fdc_id":168936,"fdc_description":"Wheat flour, white, all-purpose, enriched, unbleached","per_100g":{"fiber_g":2.7,"fat_g":0.98,"carbs_g":76.31,"calories":364.0,"protein_g":10.33,"sodium_mg":2.0,"saturated_fat_g":0.155,"sugar_g":0.27},"source_url":"https://fdc.nal.usda.gov/food-details/168936/nutrients"},{"ingredient":"mantequilla sin sal","edible_grams":100,"fdc_id":173430,"fdc_description":"Butter, without salt","per_100g":{"sugar_g":0.06,"calories":717.0,"saturated_fat_g":50.489,"fat_g":81.11,"carbs_g":0.06,"protein_g":0.85,"fiber_g":0.0,"sodium_mg":11.0},"source_url":"https://fdc.nal.usda.gov/food-details/173430/nutrients"},{"ingredient":"azúcar blanco","edible_grams":80,"fdc_id":169655,"fdc_description":"Sugars, granulated","per_100g":{"protein_g":0.0,"sodium_mg":1.0,"fat_g":0.0,"calories":387.0,"saturated_fat_g":0.0,"sugar_g":99.8,"carbs_g":99.98,"fiber_g":0.0},"source_url":"https://fdc.nal.usda.gov/food-details/169655/nutrients"},{"ingredient":"yemas de huevo","edible_grams":51,"fdc_id":172184,"fdc_description":"Egg, yolk, raw, fresh","per_100g":{"sugar_g":0.56,"fat_g":26.54,"protein_g":15.86,"sodium_mg":48.0,"carbs_g":3.59,"calories":322.0,"saturated_fat_g":9.551,"fiber_g":0.0},"source_url":"https://fdc.nal.usda.gov/food-details/172184/nutrients"},{"ingredient":"polvo de hornear de doble acción","edible_grams":6,"fdc_id":172804,"fdc_description":"Leavening agents, baking powder, double-acting, straight phosphate","per_100g":{"saturated_fat_g":0.0,"fiber_g":0.2,"fat_g":0.0,"carbs_g":24.1,"calories":51.0,"protein_g":0.1,"sodium_mg":7893.0,"sugar_g":0.0},"source_url":"https://fdc.nal.usda.gov/food-details/172804/nutrients"},{"ingredient":"extracto de vainilla","edible_grams":5,"fdc_id":173471,"fdc_description":"Vanilla extract","per_100g":{"fat_g":0.06,"carbs_g":12.65,"calories":288.0,"protein_g":0.06,"fiber_g":0.0,"sodium_mg":9.0,"saturated_fat_g":0.01,"sugar_g":12.65},"source_url":"https://fdc.nal.usda.gov/food-details/173471/nutrients"},{"ingredient":"ralladura de limón","edible_grams":3,"fdc_id":167749,"fdc_description":"Lemon peel, raw","per_100g":{"sugar_g":4.17,"calories":47.0,"saturated_fat_g":0.039,"fiber_g":10.6,"sodium_mg":6.0,"protein_g":1.5,"fat_g":0.3,"carbs_g":16.0},"source_url":"https://fdc.nal.usda.gov/food-details/167749/nutrients"},{"ingredient":"dulce de leche","edible_grams":350,"fdc_id":173461,"fdc_description":"Dulce de Leche","per_100g":{"fiber_g":0.0,"sugar_g":49.74,"fat_g":7.35,"carbs_g":55.35,"calories":315.0,"protein_g":6.84,"sodium_mg":129.0,"saturated_fat_g":4.534},"source_url":"https://fdc.nal.usda.gov/food-details/173461/nutrients"},{"ingredient":"coco rallado seco sin azúcar","edible_grams":30,"fdc_id":170170,"fdc_description":"Nuts, coconut meat, dried (desiccated), not sweetened","per_100g":{"fiber_g":16.3,"fat_g":64.53,"calories":660.0,"protein_g":6.88,"sodium_mg":37.0,"saturated_fat_g":57.218,"sugar_g":7.35,"carbs_g":23.65},"source_url":"https://fdc.nal.usda.gov/food-details/170170/nutrients"}],"serving_size":"1 de 20 alfajores","method":"Suma de diez fichas USDA verificadas por 100 g, ponderadas por los pesos de todos los ingredientes y dividida entre 20. Se incluyen todo el relleno y el coco previstos; la pérdida de agua durante el horneado no se descuenta del aporte total.","note":"Estimación informativa, no análisis del alfajor preparado. Las marcas de dulce de leche, mantequilla y polvo de hornear cambian el resultado. Se supone que toda la masa, el relleno y el coco se consumen; restos en utensilios reducirían el aporte real."},"keywords":["alfajores de maicena","alfajores con dulce de leche","galletas rellenas con coco"],"image_url":"/recetas/receta-de-alfajores-de-maicena/portada.webp","gallery":[{"url":"/recetas/receta-de-alfajores-de-maicena/portada.webp","alt":"Alfajores de maicena claros con dulce de leche y coco en el borde, uno partido mostrando el relleno"}],"seo":{"title":"Alfajores de maicena con dulce de leche y coco","description":"Alfajores de maicena con dulce de leche y coco: cantidades para 20 unidades, masa con yemas, reposo en frío y horneado de las tapas paso a paso.","image_alt":"Alfajores de maicena claros con dulce de leche y coco en el borde, uno partido mostrando el relleno","image_variants":["/recetas/receta-de-alfajores-de-maicena/portada-1x1.webp","/recetas/receta-de-alfajores-de-maicena/portada-4x3.webp","/recetas/receta-de-alfajores-de-maicena/portada-16x9.webp"],"faq":[{"q":"¿Por qué se rompen las tapas?","a":"Son frágiles al salir del horno. Déjalas 5 minutos en la bandeja, muévelas con una espátula ancha y espera a que estén totalmente frías para rellenar. Amasar demasiado o estirar muy fino también cambia la textura."},{"q":"¿Puedo usar harina de maíz en lugar de maicena?","a":"No como sustitución directa. Esta receta usa almidón de maíz blanco; la harina de maíz amarilla tiene otra composición y textura. La receta también contiene harina de trigo."},{"q":"¿Qué hago si el dulce de leche está muy líquido?","a":"Usa un dulce de leche espeso de repostería para que sostenga las tapas. No rellenes con las galletas calientes. Cambiar de relleno puede alterar consistencia, conservación y nutrición."}]},"published":false,"editorial_status":"draft","content_html":"<p>Estos alfajores de maicena se forman con dos tapas tiernas de almidón de maíz y harina, relleno de dulce de leche y coco solo en el borde. La ralladura de limón y la vainilla aromatizan una masa con yemas.</p><p>La propuesta rinde 20 alfajores de unos 5 cm: 40 tapas de 6 mm, horneadas en dos tandas. Los 130 minutos estimados incluyen 30 minutos de frío y 30 de enfriado; cantidades, rendimiento y tiempos están pendientes de confirmar mediante prueba de cocina.</p>"},{"id":"7c8466af-7510-5654-a28f-65643c7c7b8f","recipe_group_id":"c934c115-46a8-4009-ae75-fb10bd3d184f","slug":"maisstarke-alfajores-rezept","public_path":"/de/maisstarke-alfajores-rezept","source_url":"https://manualdecocina.com/de/maisstarke-alfajores-rezept/","language":"de","title":"Maisstärke-Alfajores mit Dulce de Leche und Kokos","excerpt":"20 Alfajores mit Maisstärke, Dulce de Leche und Kokosrand: genaue Mengen, gekühlter Eigelbteig und helle Keksböden aus zwei Backdurchgängen.","summary":"Diese Alfajores bestehen aus zwei zarten Keksen mit Maisstärke und Weizenmehl, dazwischen dicke Dulce de Leche. Kokos haftet nur am Füllungsrand. Zitronenabrieb und Vanille aromatisieren den Eigelbteig.\n\nDer Vorschlag ergibt 20 Alfajores von etwa 5 cm Durchmesser: 40 Kreise mit 6 mm Dicke, in zwei Durchgängen gebacken. Die geschätzten 130 Minuten enthalten 30 Minuten Kühlen und 30 Minuten Auskühlen. Mengen, Ausbeute und Zeiten wurden noch nicht durch einen Küchentest bestätigt.","category":"Desserts","category_slug":"postres","difficulty":"Mittel","course":"Dessert","cuisine":"Argentinisch","prep_time_minutes":40,"cook_time_minutes":30,"total_time_minutes":130,"servings":20,"ingredients":[{"name":"Maisstärke","amount":"200","unit":"g","group":"Teig"},{"name":"Weizenmehl für alle Zwecke","amount":"100","unit":"g","group":"Teig"},{"name":"Ungesalzene Butter","amount":"100","unit":"g","group":"Teig"},{"name":"Weißer Zucker","amount":"80","unit":"g","group":"Teig"},{"name":"Eigelb, etwa 3 große; 51 g abwiegen","amount":"51","unit":"g","group":"Teig"},{"name":"Doppelt wirkendes Backpulver","amount":"6","unit":"g","group":"Teig"},{"name":"Vanilleextrakt","amount":"5","unit":"g","group":"Teig"},{"name":"Zitronenabrieb","amount":"3","unit":"g","group":"Teig"},{"name":"Dulce de Leche","amount":"350","unit":"g","group":"Füllung und Abschluss"},{"name":"Ungesüßte getrocknete Kokosraspel","amount":"30","unit":"g","group":"Füllung und Abschluss"}],"steps":[{"title":"Trockene Zutaten wiegen und sieben","content":"Hände waschen und die Arbeitsfläche reinigen. Alle Zutaten abwiegen; die 3 Eigelbe sollen zusammen etwa 51 g wiegen. 200 g Maisstärke, 100 g Mehl und 6 g Backpulver gemeinsam in eine Schüssel sieben. Die Zitrone waschen und nur die gelbe Schale abreiben, bis 3 g erreicht sind. Dulce de Leche und Kokos getrennt von Geräten halten, die rohen Teig berühren werden.","image_url":"/recetas/receta-de-alfajores-de-maicena/paso-01.webp","image_alt":"Maisstärke-Alfajores mit Dulce de Leche und Kokos: Trockene Zutaten wiegen und sieben"},{"title":"Butter aufschlagen und Eigelb einarbeiten","content":"100 g weiche Butter verwenden, die auf Druck nachgibt, aber nicht geschmolzen ist. Mit 80 g Zucker 2–3 Minuten cremig schlagen. Die Eigelbe in drei Portionen zugeben und jede vollständig einarbeiten. 5 g Vanille und 3 g Zitronenabrieb untermischen; die Schüsselwände mit einem Teigschaber abstreifen.","image_url":"/recetas/receta-de-alfajores-de-maicena/paso-02.webp","image_alt":"Maisstärke-Alfajores mit Dulce de Leche und Kokos: Butter aufschlagen und Eigelb einarbeiten"},{"title":"Teig formen und kühlen","content":"Die trockenen Zutaten in zwei Portionen zugeben. Mit dem Teigschaber mischen und zuletzt mit den Händen vorsichtig zusammenfügen, bis keine pulvrigen Stellen mehr bleiben; nicht wie Brot kneten. Zu einer flachen Scheibe formen, einwickeln und 30 Minuten bei höchstens 4 °C kühlen. Rohen Teig nicht probieren: Er enthält ungegartes Mehl und Ei. Danach Hände, Schüssel und Arbeitsfläche waschen.","image_url":"/recetas/receta-de-alfajores-de-maicena/paso-03.webp","image_alt":"Maisstärke-Alfajores mit Dulce de Leche und Kokos: Teig formen und kühlen"},{"title":"Vierzig Teigkreise ausstechen","content":"Ofen auf 180 °C Ober-/Unterhitze oder 160 °C Umluft vorheizen. Zwei etwa 30 × 40 cm große Bleche mit Backpapier belegen. Teig zwischen zwei Papierbögen etwa 6 mm dick ausrollen. Kreise mit 5 cm Durchmesser ausstechen; Reste vorsichtig zusammenfügen und erneut ausrollen, ohne viel zu kneten. 40 gleichmäßige Kreise von jeweils etwa 13–14 g Teig für 20 Paare anstreben. Je 20 mit etwa 2 cm Abstand auf ein Blech legen. Wird der Teig weich, 10 Minuten kühlen und diese Wartezeit zur Gesamtzeit addieren.","image_url":"/recetas/receta-de-alfajores-de-maicena/paso-04.webp","image_alt":"Maisstärke-Alfajores mit Dulce de Leche und Kokos: Vierzig Teigkreise ausstechen"},{"title":"Kekse in zwei Durchgängen backen","content":"Jeweils ein Blech auf mittlerer Schiene 12–15 Minuten backen. Die Oberseite soll matt und fest, der Boden nur leicht goldgelb sein, ohne feuchten Kern. Ab Minute 12 prüfen; Dicke und Ofen können die Zeit verändern. Mit Ofenhandschuhen herausnehmen und das zweite Blech genauso backen. Die Garzeitschätzung reserviert 30 Minuten für beide Durchgänge; keine kräftige Bräunung anstreben.","image_url":"/recetas/receta-de-alfajores-de-maicena/paso-05.webp","image_alt":"Maisstärke-Alfajores mit Dulce de Leche und Kokos: Kekse in zwei Durchgängen backen"},{"title":"Vollständig auskühlen lassen","content":"Die Kekse 5 Minuten auf dem Blech lassen, weil sie noch zerbrechlich sind. Mit einem breiten Wender auf ein Gitter setzen und etwa weitere 25 Minuten vollständig abkühlen lassen. Warme Kekse nicht füllen: Dulce de Leche würde weicher und die Kekse könnten leichter brechen.","image_url":"/recetas/receta-de-alfajores-de-maicena/paso-06.webp","image_alt":"Maisstärke-Alfajores mit Dulce de Leche und Kokos: Vollständig auskühlen lassen"},{"title":"Füllen und Rand in Kokos wenden","content":"Die 40 Kekse nach Größe zu Paaren ordnen und jeweils einen mit dem Boden nach oben legen. 350 g dicke Dulce de Leche mit einem sauberen Löffel oder Spritzbeutel auf die 20 Böden verteilen, etwa 17–18 g je Alfajor. Zweiten Keks auflegen und vorsichtig drücken, bis die Füllung knapp am Rand sichtbar wird. 30 g Kokos in einen flachen Teller geben und nur den Rand jedes Alfajors darin rollen, sodass Kokos an der Füllung haftet.","image_url":"/recetas/receta-de-alfajores-de-maicena/paso-07.webp","image_alt":"Maisstärke-Alfajores mit Dulce de Leche und Kokos: Füllen und Rand in Kokos wenden"},{"title":"Servieren und aufbewahren","content":"Die 20 Alfajores vorsichtig servieren, sobald die Füllung sitzt. In einem geschlossenen Behälter mit Papier zwischen den Lagen bei höchstens 4 °C kühlen und innerhalb von 3 Tagen verzehren, oder früher, wenn die Dulce-de-Leche-Packung es verlangt. Zum Einfrieren einzeln einwickeln, höchstens 1 Monat aufbewahren und im Kühlschrank auftauen. Diese Zeiten sind konservative Vorschläge, keine Haltbarkeitsprüfung; Kokos und Kekse werden mit der Zeit weicher.","image_url":"/recetas/receta-de-alfajores-de-maicena/paso-08.webp","image_alt":"Maisstärke-Alfajores mit Dulce de Leche und Kokos: Servieren und aufbewahren"}],"notes":"Weiße Maisstärke verwenden, kein gelbes Maismehl. Dulce de Leche soll dick sein, möglichst eine Backvariante; flüssige Füllung läuft heraus. Kokos kann entfallen, verändert aber Aussehen und Nährwerte. Ein ungetesteter glutenfreier Ersatz wird nicht vorgeschlagen: Der Teig enthält Weizen. Reißt er beim Ausrollen, einige Minuten leicht wärmer werden lassen und sanft zwischen Papier drücken; kein ungewogenes Mehl ergänzen. Enthält Weizen, Ei und Milch. Rohen Teig nicht probieren und vor dem Berühren gebackener Kekse reinigen.","nutrition":{"calories":181.8,"protein_g":2.3,"carbs_g":27.2,"fat_g":7.0,"saturated_fat_g":4.4,"fiber_g":0.5,"sugar_g":12.9,"sodium_mg":50.0,"estimated":true,"source":"USDA FoodData Central — SR Legacy (abril de 2018)","source_url":"https://fdc.nal.usda.gov/download-datasets/","inputs":[{"ingredient":"Maisstärke","edible_grams":200,"fdc_id":169698,"fdc_description":"Cornstarch","per_100g":{"sugar_g":0.0,"fat_g":0.05,"carbs_g":91.27,"calories":381.0,"protein_g":0.26,"fiber_g":0.9,"sodium_mg":9.0,"saturated_fat_g":0.009},"source_url":"https://fdc.nal.usda.gov/food-details/169698/nutrients"},{"ingredient":"Weizenmehl für alle Zwecke","edible_grams":100,"fdc_id":168936,"fdc_description":"Wheat flour, white, all-purpose, enriched, unbleached","per_100g":{"fiber_g":2.7,"fat_g":0.98,"carbs_g":76.31,"calories":364.0,"protein_g":10.33,"sodium_mg":2.0,"saturated_fat_g":0.155,"sugar_g":0.27},"source_url":"https://fdc.nal.usda.gov/food-details/168936/nutrients"},{"ingredient":"Ungesalzene Butter","edible_grams":100,"fdc_id":173430,"fdc_description":"Butter, without salt","per_100g":{"sugar_g":0.06,"calories":717.0,"saturated_fat_g":50.489,"fat_g":81.11,"carbs_g":0.06,"protein_g":0.85,"fiber_g":0.0,"sodium_mg":11.0},"source_url":"https://fdc.nal.usda.gov/food-details/173430/nutrients"},{"ingredient":"Weißer Zucker","edible_grams":80,"fdc_id":169655,"fdc_description":"Sugars, granulated","per_100g":{"protein_g":0.0,"sodium_mg":1.0,"fat_g":0.0,"calories":387.0,"saturated_fat_g":0.0,"sugar_g":99.8,"carbs_g":99.98,"fiber_g":0.0},"source_url":"https://fdc.nal.usda.gov/food-details/169655/nutrients"},{"ingredient":"Eigelb, etwa 3 große; 51 g abwiegen","edible_grams":51,"fdc_id":172184,"fdc_description":"Egg, yolk, raw, fresh","per_100g":{"sugar_g":0.56,"fat_g":26.54,"protein_g":15.86,"sodium_mg":48.0,"carbs_g":3.59,"calories":322.0,"saturated_fat_g":9.551,"fiber_g":0.0},"source_url":"https://fdc.nal.usda.gov/food-details/172184/nutrients"},{"ingredient":"Doppelt wirkendes Backpulver","edible_grams":6,"fdc_id":172804,"fdc_description":"Leavening agents, baking powder, double-acting, straight phosphate","per_100g":{"saturated_fat_g":0.0,"fiber_g":0.2,"fat_g":0.0,"carbs_g":24.1,"calories":51.0,"protein_g":0.1,"sodium_mg":7893.0,"sugar_g":0.0},"source_url":"https://fdc.nal.usda.gov/food-details/172804/nutrients"},{"ingredient":"Vanilleextrakt","edible_grams":5,"fdc_id":173471,"fdc_description":"Vanilla extract","per_100g":{"fat_g":0.06,"carbs_g":12.65,"calories":288.0,"protein_g":0.06,"fiber_g":0.0,"sodium_mg":9.0,"saturated_fat_g":0.01,"sugar_g":12.65},"source_url":"https://fdc.nal.usda.gov/food-details/173471/nutrients"},{"ingredient":"Zitronenabrieb","edible_grams":3,"fdc_id":167749,"fdc_description":"Lemon peel, raw","per_100g":{"sugar_g":4.17,"calories":47.0,"saturated_fat_g":0.039,"fiber_g":10.6,"sodium_mg":6.0,"protein_g":1.5,"fat_g":0.3,"carbs_g":16.0},"source_url":"https://fdc.nal.usda.gov/food-details/167749/nutrients"},{"ingredient":"Dulce de Leche","edible_grams":350,"fdc_id":173461,"fdc_description":"Dulce de Leche","per_100g":{"fiber_g":0.0,"sugar_g":49.74,"fat_g":7.35,"carbs_g":55.35,"calories":315.0,"protein_g":6.84,"sodium_mg":129.0,"saturated_fat_g":4.534},"source_url":"https://fdc.nal.usda.gov/food-details/173461/nutrients"},{"ingredient":"Ungesüßte getrocknete Kokosraspel","edible_grams":30,"fdc_id":170170,"fdc_description":"Nuts, coconut meat, dried (desiccated), not sweetened","per_100g":{"fiber_g":16.3,"fat_g":64.53,"calories":660.0,"protein_g":6.88,"sodium_mg":37.0,"saturated_fat_g":57.218,"sugar_g":7.35,"carbs_g":23.65},"source_url":"https://fdc.nal.usda.gov/food-details/170170/nutrients"}],"serving_size":"1 von 20 Alfajores","method":"Zehn überprüfte USDA-Einträge je 100 g werden mit allen Zutatengewichten gewichtet und durch 20 geteilt. Die gesamte vorgesehene Füllung und der Kokos sind enthalten; Wasserverlust beim Backen wird nicht vom gesamten Nährstoffbeitrag abgezogen.","note":"Informative Schätzung, keine Analyse des fertigen Alfajors. Marken von Dulce de Leche, Butter und Backpulver verändern das Ergebnis. Der Verzehr des gesamten Teigs, der Füllung und des Kokos wird angenommen; Reste an Geräten würden den tatsächlichen Beitrag verringern."},"keywords":["Maisstärke Alfajores","Dulce de Leche Kekse","Alfajores mit Kokos"],"image_url":"/recetas/receta-de-alfajores-de-maicena/portada.webp","gallery":[{"url":"/recetas/receta-de-alfajores-de-maicena/portada.webp","alt":"Helle Maisstärke-Alfajores mit Dulce de Leche und Kokosrand, eines geöffnet mit sichtbarer Füllung"}],"seo":{"title":"Maisstärke-Alfajores mit Dulce de Leche und Kokos","description":"20 Alfajores mit Maisstärke, Dulce de Leche und Kokosrand: genaue Mengen, gekühlter Eigelbteig und helle Keksböden aus zwei Backdurchgängen.","image_alt":"Helle Maisstärke-Alfajores mit Dulce de Leche und Kokosrand, eines geöffnet mit sichtbarer Füllung","image_variants":["/recetas/receta-de-alfajores-de-maicena/portada-1x1.webp","/recetas/receta-de-alfajores-de-maicena/portada-4x3.webp","/recetas/receta-de-alfajores-de-maicena/portada-16x9.webp"],"faq":[{"q":"Warum brechen die Kekse?","a":"Direkt nach dem Backen sind sie zerbrechlich. 5 Minuten auf dem Blech lassen, mit einem breiten Wender bewegen und vor dem Füllen ganz abkühlen. Zu viel Kneten oder zu dünnes Ausrollen verändert ebenfalls die Textur."},{"q":"Kann ich Maismehl statt Maisstärke verwenden?","a":"Nicht als direkten Ersatz. Verwendet wird weiße Maisstärke; gelbes Maismehl hat eine andere Zusammensetzung und Textur. Das Rezept enthält außerdem Weizenmehl."},{"q":"Was tun, wenn Dulce de Leche zu flüssig ist?","a":"Dicke Dulce de Leche zum Backen verwenden, damit sie die Kekse trägt. Nicht warm füllen. Eine andere Füllung kann Konsistenz, Lagerung und Nährwerte verändern."}]},"published":false,"editorial_status":"draft","content_html":"<p>Diese Alfajores bestehen aus zwei zarten Keksen mit Maisstärke und Weizenmehl, dazwischen dicke Dulce de Leche. Kokos haftet nur am Füllungsrand. Zitronenabrieb und Vanille aromatisieren den Eigelbteig.</p><p>Der Vorschlag ergibt 20 Alfajores von etwa 5 cm Durchmesser: 40 Kreise mit 6 mm Dicke, in zwei Durchgängen gebacken. Die geschätzten 130 Minuten enthalten 30 Minuten Kühlen und 30 Minuten Auskühlen. Mengen, Ausbeute und Zeiten wurden noch nicht durch einen Küchentest bestätigt.</p>"},{"id":"8fcff74f-ac5b-57df-8b8b-142947fd6d61","recipe_group_id":"c934c115-46a8-4009-ae75-fb10bd3d184f","slug":"cornstarch-alfajores-recipe","public_path":"/en/cornstarch-alfajores-recipe","source_url":"https://manualdecocina.com/en/cornstarch-alfajores-recipe/","language":"en","title":"Cornstarch alfajores with dulce de leche and coconut","excerpt":"Make 20 cornstarch alfajores with dulce de leche and coconut. Follow measured ingredients, chilled yolk dough and two batches of pale cookie rounds.","summary":"These cornstarch alfajores sandwich thick dulce de leche between two tender cookies made with cornstarch and wheat flour. Coconut coats only the filling edge, while vanilla and lemon zest flavour the yolk dough.\n\nThe proposal makes 20 alfajores about 5 cm across, from 40 rounds rolled 6 mm thick and baked in two batches. The estimated 130 minutes include 30 minutes of chilling and 30 of cooling. Quantities, yield and times still need confirmation in a kitchen test.","category":"Desserts","category_slug":"postres","difficulty":"Medium","course":"Dessert","cuisine":"Argentinian","prep_time_minutes":40,"cook_time_minutes":30,"total_time_minutes":130,"servings":20,"ingredients":[{"name":"Cornstarch","amount":"200","unit":"g","group":"Dough"},{"name":"All-purpose wheat flour","amount":"100","unit":"g","group":"Dough"},{"name":"Unsalted butter","amount":"100","unit":"g","group":"Dough"},{"name":"White sugar","amount":"80","unit":"g","group":"Dough"},{"name":"Egg yolks, about 3 large; weigh 51 g","amount":"51","unit":"g","group":"Dough"},{"name":"Double-acting baking powder","amount":"6","unit":"g","group":"Dough"},{"name":"Vanilla extract","amount":"5","unit":"g","group":"Dough"},{"name":"Lemon zest","amount":"3","unit":"g","group":"Dough"},{"name":"Dulce de leche","amount":"350","unit":"g","group":"Filling and finish"},{"name":"Unsweetened desiccated coconut","amount":"30","unit":"g","group":"Filling and finish"}],"steps":[{"title":"Weigh and sift the dry ingredients","content":"Wash your hands and clean the work surface. Weigh every ingredient; the 3 yolks should total about 51 g. Sift the 200 g cornstarch, 100 g flour and 6 g baking powder together into a bowl. Wash the lemon before grating only its yellow peel to obtain 3 g zest. Keep the dulce de leche and coconut separate from utensils that will touch raw dough.","image_url":"/recetas/receta-de-alfajores-de-maicena/paso-01.webp","image_alt":"Cornstarch alfajores with dulce de leche and coconut: Weigh and sift the dry ingredients"},{"title":"Cream the butter and add the yolks","content":"Use the 100 g butter softened enough to yield when pressed, but not melted. Beat it with the 80 g sugar for 2–3 minutes until creamy. Add the yolks in three additions, beating each one in before adding the next. Mix in the 5 g vanilla and 3 g zest; scrape the bowl sides with a spatula.","image_url":"/recetas/receta-de-alfajores-de-maicena/paso-02.webp","image_alt":"Cornstarch alfajores with dulce de leche and coconut: Cream the butter and add the yolks"},{"title":"Bring the dough together and chill","content":"Add the dry ingredients in two batches. Mix with a spatula, then gently bring together by hand just until no powdery patches remain; do not knead like bread. Flatten into a disc, wrap and refrigerate for 30 minutes at 4 °C or below. Do not taste raw dough: it contains uncooked flour and egg. Wash your hands, bowl and surface after handling it.","image_url":"/recetas/receta-de-alfajores-de-maicena/paso-03.webp","image_alt":"Cornstarch alfajores with dulce de leche and coconut: Bring the dough together and chill"},{"title":"Roll and cut forty rounds","content":"Preheat to 180 °C in a conventional oven or 160 °C fan. Line two trays about 30 × 40 cm with baking parchment. Roll the dough between two sheets of parchment to about 6 mm thick. Cut 5 cm rounds; gently gather scraps and roll again without overworking. Aim for 40 similar rounds, about 13–14 g dough each, to make 20 pairs. Place 20 on each tray with about 2 cm gaps. If the dough softens, chill for 10 minutes and add that waiting time to the total.","image_url":"/recetas/receta-de-alfajores-de-maicena/paso-04.webp","image_alt":"Cornstarch alfajores with dulce de leche and coconut: Roll and cut forty rounds"},{"title":"Bake the cookies in two batches","content":"Bake one tray at a time on the middle shelf for 12–15 minutes. The tops should be matte and firm, the bases only lightly golden, with no damp centre. Check from 12 minutes; thickness and oven performance can change the time. Remove with oven gloves, then bake the second tray the same way. The cooking estimate allows 30 minutes for both batches; do not aim for a deeply toasted colour.","image_url":"/recetas/receta-de-alfajores-de-maicena/paso-05.webp","image_alt":"Cornstarch alfajores with dulce de leche and coconut: Bake the cookies in two batches"},{"title":"Cool completely","content":"Leave the cookies on their tray for 5 minutes because they are still fragile. Transfer with a broad spatula to a wire rack and cool for about 25 more minutes, until completely cold. Do not fill warm cookies: the dulce de leche would soften and the cookies would break more easily.","image_url":"/recetas/receta-de-alfajores-de-maicena/paso-06.webp","image_alt":"Cornstarch alfajores with dulce de leche and coconut: Cool completely"},{"title":"Fill and coat the edges in coconut","content":"Pair the 40 cookies by size and turn one of each pair bottom-side up. Divide the 350 g thick dulce de leche among the 20 bases, about 17–18 g per alfajor, using a clean spoon or piping bag. Top with the second cookie and press gently until the filling barely reaches the edge. Put the 30 g coconut in a shallow dish and roll only each alfajor’s edge in it so it sticks to the filling.","image_url":"/recetas/receta-de-alfajores-de-maicena/paso-07.webp","image_alt":"Cornstarch alfajores with dulce de leche and coconut: Fill and coat the edges in coconut"},{"title":"Serve and store","content":"Serve the 20 alfajores once the filling has settled, handling them gently. Store in a closed container with paper between layers, refrigerated at 4 °C or below, and eat within 3 days or sooner if required by the dulce de leche label. To freeze, wrap individually for up to 1 month and thaw in the refrigerator. These are conservative proposed storage periods, not shelf-life test results; coconut and cookies soften over time.","image_url":"/recetas/receta-de-alfajores-de-maicena/paso-08.webp","image_alt":"Cornstarch alfajores with dulce de leche and coconut: Serve and store"}],"notes":"Use white cornstarch, not yellow corn flour. The dulce de leche should be thick, preferably a baking variety; a runny one will escape the edges. You may omit the coconut, but the finish and nutrition will change. No untested gluten-free substitution is proposed: this dough contains wheat. If it cracks when rolled, let it warm slightly for a few minutes and press gently between parchment; do not add unmeasured flour. Contains wheat, egg and milk. Avoid tasting raw dough and clean up before handling baked cookies.","nutrition":{"calories":181.8,"protein_g":2.3,"carbs_g":27.2,"fat_g":7.0,"saturated_fat_g":4.4,"fiber_g":0.5,"sugar_g":12.9,"sodium_mg":50.0,"estimated":true,"source":"USDA FoodData Central — SR Legacy (abril de 2018)","source_url":"https://fdc.nal.usda.gov/download-datasets/","inputs":[{"ingredient":"Cornstarch","edible_grams":200,"fdc_id":169698,"fdc_description":"Cornstarch","per_100g":{"sugar_g":0.0,"fat_g":0.05,"carbs_g":91.27,"calories":381.0,"protein_g":0.26,"fiber_g":0.9,"sodium_mg":9.0,"saturated_fat_g":0.009},"source_url":"https://fdc.nal.usda.gov/food-details/169698/nutrients"},{"ingredient":"All-purpose wheat flour","edible_grams":100,"fdc_id":168936,"fdc_description":"Wheat flour, white, all-purpose, enriched, unbleached","per_100g":{"fiber_g":2.7,"fat_g":0.98,"carbs_g":76.31,"calories":364.0,"protein_g":10.33,"sodium_mg":2.0,"saturated_fat_g":0.155,"sugar_g":0.27},"source_url":"https://fdc.nal.usda.gov/food-details/168936/nutrients"},{"ingredient":"Unsalted butter","edible_grams":100,"fdc_id":173430,"fdc_description":"Butter, without salt","per_100g":{"sugar_g":0.06,"calories":717.0,"saturated_fat_g":50.489,"fat_g":81.11,"carbs_g":0.06,"protein_g":0.85,"fiber_g":0.0,"sodium_mg":11.0},"source_url":"https://fdc.nal.usda.gov/food-details/173430/nutrients"},{"ingredient":"White sugar","edible_grams":80,"fdc_id":169655,"fdc_description":"Sugars, granulated","per_100g":{"protein_g":0.0,"sodium_mg":1.0,"fat_g":0.0,"calories":387.0,"saturated_fat_g":0.0,"sugar_g":99.8,"carbs_g":99.98,"fiber_g":0.0},"source_url":"https://fdc.nal.usda.gov/food-details/169655/nutrients"},{"ingredient":"Egg yolks, about 3 large; weigh 51 g","edible_grams":51,"fdc_id":172184,"fdc_description":"Egg, yolk, raw, fresh","per_100g":{"sugar_g":0.56,"fat_g":26.54,"protein_g":15.86,"sodium_mg":48.0,"carbs_g":3.59,"calories":322.0,"saturated_fat_g":9.551,"fiber_g":0.0},"source_url":"https://fdc.nal.usda.gov/food-details/172184/nutrients"},{"ingredient":"Double-acting baking powder","edible_grams":6,"fdc_id":172804,"fdc_description":"Leavening agents, baking powder, double-acting, straight phosphate","per_100g":{"saturated_fat_g":0.0,"fiber_g":0.2,"fat_g":0.0,"carbs_g":24.1,"calories":51.0,"protein_g":0.1,"sodium_mg":7893.0,"sugar_g":0.0},"source_url":"https://fdc.nal.usda.gov/food-details/172804/nutrients"},{"ingredient":"Vanilla extract","edible_grams":5,"fdc_id":173471,"fdc_description":"Vanilla extract","per_100g":{"fat_g":0.06,"carbs_g":12.65,"calories":288.0,"protein_g":0.06,"fiber_g":0.0,"sodium_mg":9.0,"saturated_fat_g":0.01,"sugar_g":12.65},"source_url":"https://fdc.nal.usda.gov/food-details/173471/nutrients"},{"ingredient":"Lemon zest","edible_grams":3,"fdc_id":167749,"fdc_description":"Lemon peel, raw","per_100g":{"sugar_g":4.17,"calories":47.0,"saturated_fat_g":0.039,"fiber_g":10.6,"sodium_mg":6.0,"protein_g":1.5,"fat_g":0.3,"carbs_g":16.0},"source_url":"https://fdc.nal.usda.gov/food-details/167749/nutrients"},{"ingredient":"Dulce de leche","edible_grams":350,"fdc_id":173461,"fdc_description":"Dulce de Leche","per_100g":{"fiber_g":0.0,"sugar_g":49.74,"fat_g":7.35,"carbs_g":55.35,"calories":315.0,"protein_g":6.84,"sodium_mg":129.0,"saturated_fat_g":4.534},"source_url":"https://fdc.nal.usda.gov/food-details/173461/nutrients"},{"ingredient":"Unsweetened desiccated coconut","edible_grams":30,"fdc_id":170170,"fdc_description":"Nuts, coconut meat, dried (desiccated), not sweetened","per_100g":{"fiber_g":16.3,"fat_g":64.53,"calories":660.0,"protein_g":6.88,"sodium_mg":37.0,"saturated_fat_g":57.218,"sugar_g":7.35,"carbs_g":23.65},"source_url":"https://fdc.nal.usda.gov/food-details/170170/nutrients"}],"serving_size":"1 of 20 alfajores","method":"Ten verified USDA entries per 100 g are weighted by all ingredient amounts and divided by 20. All planned filling and coconut are included; water lost during baking is not subtracted from the total nutrient contribution.","note":"An informational estimate, not an analysis of the finished alfajor. Dulce de leche, butter and baking powder brands change the result. All dough, filling and coconut are assumed eaten; leftovers on utensils would reduce the actual contribution."},"keywords":["cornstarch alfajores","dulce de leche sandwich cookies","coconut alfajores"],"image_url":"/recetas/receta-de-alfajores-de-maicena/portada.webp","gallery":[{"url":"/recetas/receta-de-alfajores-de-maicena/portada.webp","alt":"Pale cornstarch alfajores with dulce de leche and coconut around the edges, one broken open"}],"seo":{"title":"Cornstarch alfajores with dulce de leche and coconut","description":"Make 20 cornstarch alfajores with dulce de leche and coconut. Follow measured ingredients, chilled yolk dough and two batches of pale cookie rounds.","image_alt":"Pale cornstarch alfajores with dulce de leche and coconut around the edges, one broken open","image_variants":["/recetas/receta-de-alfajores-de-maicena/portada-1x1.webp","/recetas/receta-de-alfajores-de-maicena/portada-4x3.webp","/recetas/receta-de-alfajores-de-maicena/portada-16x9.webp"],"faq":[{"q":"Why do the cookies break?","a":"They are fragile straight from the oven. Leave them on the tray for 5 minutes, move them with a broad spatula and let them cool completely before filling. Overworking the dough or rolling too thin also changes the texture."},{"q":"Can I use corn flour instead of cornstarch?","a":"Not as a direct replacement. This recipe uses white cornstarch; yellow corn flour has a different composition and texture. The recipe also contains wheat flour."},{"q":"What if my dulce de leche is too runny?","a":"Use thick baking-style dulce de leche to support the cookies. Do not fill them while warm. Changing the filling can affect texture, storage and nutrition."}]},"published":false,"editorial_status":"draft","content_html":"<p>These cornstarch alfajores sandwich thick dulce de leche between two tender cookies made with cornstarch and wheat flour. Coconut coats only the filling edge, while vanilla and lemon zest flavour the yolk dough.</p><p>The proposal makes 20 alfajores about 5 cm across, from 40 rounds rolled 6 mm thick and baked in two batches. The estimated 130 minutes include 30 minutes of chilling and 30 of cooling. Quantities, yield and times still need confirmation in a kitchen test.</p>"},{"id":"46f3b95c-2121-5872-95e0-1d1ab57d9078","recipe_group_id":"c934c115-46a8-4009-ae75-fb10bd3d184f","slug":"recette-fecule-de-mais-alfajores","public_path":"/fr/recette-fecule-de-mais-alfajores","source_url":"https://manualdecocina.com/fr/recette-fecule-de-mais-alfajores/","language":"fr","title":"Alfajores à la fécule de maïs, dulce de leche et coco","excerpt":"Préparez 20 alfajores à la fécule de maïs, dulce de leche et coco. Doses précises, pâte aux jaunes refroidie et biscuits clairs cuits en deux fournées.","summary":"Ces alfajores associent deux biscuits tendres à la fécule de maïs et à la farine de blé, une garniture de dulce de leche et de la noix de coco uniquement sur le bord. Vanille et zeste de citron parfument la pâte aux jaunes.\n\nLa proposition donne 20 alfajores d’environ 5 cm : 40 disques de 6 mm, cuits en deux fournées. Les 130 minutes estimées incluent 30 minutes au froid et 30 minutes de refroidissement. Quantités, rendement et temps restent à confirmer par un essai en cuisine.","category":"Desserts","category_slug":"postres","difficulty":"Moyenne","course":"Dessert","cuisine":"Argentine","prep_time_minutes":40,"cook_time_minutes":30,"total_time_minutes":130,"servings":20,"ingredients":[{"name":"Fécule de maïs","amount":"200","unit":"g","group":"Pâte"},{"name":"Farine de blé tous usages","amount":"100","unit":"g","group":"Pâte"},{"name":"Beurre doux","amount":"100","unit":"g","group":"Pâte"},{"name":"Sucre blanc","amount":"80","unit":"g","group":"Pâte"},{"name":"Jaunes d’œufs, environ 3 gros ; peser 51 g","amount":"51","unit":"g","group":"Pâte"},{"name":"Levure chimique à double action","amount":"6","unit":"g","group":"Pâte"},{"name":"Extrait de vanille","amount":"5","unit":"g","group":"Pâte"},{"name":"Zeste de citron","amount":"3","unit":"g","group":"Pâte"},{"name":"Dulce de leche","amount":"350","unit":"g","group":"Garniture et finition"},{"name":"Noix de coco râpée sèche non sucrée","amount":"30","unit":"g","group":"Garniture et finition"}],"steps":[{"title":"Peser et tamiser les ingrédients secs","content":"Lavez-vous les mains et nettoyez le plan de travail. Pesez tous les ingrédients ; les 3 jaunes doivent totaliser environ 51 g. Tamisez ensemble les 200 g de fécule, 100 g de farine et 6 g de levure dans un saladier. Lavez le citron avant de prélever uniquement son zeste jaune pour en obtenir 3 g. Gardez dulce de leche et coco à l’écart des ustensiles destinés à la pâte crue.","image_url":"/recetas/receta-de-alfajores-de-maicena/paso-01.webp","image_alt":"Alfajores à la fécule de maïs, dulce de leche et coco: Peser et tamiser les ingrédients secs"},{"title":"Crémer le beurre et ajouter les jaunes","content":"Utilisez 100 g de beurre souple sous la pression, mais non fondu. Battez avec les 80 g de sucre pendant 2–3 minutes jusqu’à obtenir une crème. Ajoutez les jaunes en trois fois, en incorporant chacun avant le suivant. Ajoutez les 5 g de vanille et 3 g de zeste ; raclez les parois avec une spatule.","image_url":"/recetas/receta-de-alfajores-de-maicena/paso-02.webp","image_alt":"Alfajores à la fécule de maïs, dulce de leche et coco: Crémer le beurre et ajouter les jaunes"},{"title":"Former et refroidir la pâte","content":"Ajoutez les ingrédients secs en deux fois. Mélangez à la spatule puis rassemblez doucement à la main, juste jusqu’à disparition des zones poudreuses ; ne pétrissez pas comme du pain. Aplatissez en disque, emballez et réfrigérez 30 minutes à 4 °C maximum. Ne goûtez pas la pâte crue : elle contient farine et œuf non cuits. Lavez ensuite mains, saladier et surface.","image_url":"/recetas/receta-de-alfajores-de-maicena/paso-03.webp","image_alt":"Alfajores à la fécule de maïs, dulce de leche et coco: Former et refroidir la pâte"},{"title":"Étaler et découper quarante disques","content":"Préchauffez à 180 °C en chaleur traditionnelle ou 160 °C ventilée. Chemisez deux plaques d’environ 30 × 40 cm de papier cuisson. Étalez la pâte entre deux feuilles sur environ 6 mm d’épaisseur. Découpez des cercles de 5 cm ; rassemblez les chutes sans trop pétrir et étalez à nouveau. Visez 40 disques similaires, d’environ 13–14 g de pâte chacun, pour 20 paires. Placez-en 20 par plaque avec environ 2 cm d’écart. Si la pâte ramollit, réfrigérez 10 minutes et ajoutez cette attente au temps total.","image_url":"/recetas/receta-de-alfajores-de-maicena/paso-04.webp","image_alt":"Alfajores à la fécule de maïs, dulce de leche et coco: Étaler et découper quarante disques"},{"title":"Cuire les biscuits en deux fournées","content":"Cuisez une plaque à la fois au milieu du four pendant 12–15 minutes : dessus mat et ferme, dessous à peine doré, sans centre humide. Vérifiez dès 12 minutes ; l’épaisseur et le four peuvent changer la durée. Sortez avec des gants puis cuisez la deuxième plaque de la même façon. Le calcul prévoit 30 minutes pour les deux fournées ; ne cherchez pas une coloration soutenue.","image_url":"/recetas/receta-de-alfajores-de-maicena/paso-05.webp","image_alt":"Alfajores à la fécule de maïs, dulce de leche et coco: Cuire les biscuits en deux fournées"},{"title":"Laisser refroidir complètement","content":"Laissez les biscuits 5 minutes sur leur plaque, car ils sont encore fragiles. Transférez avec une spatule large sur une grille et laissez refroidir environ 25 minutes de plus, jusqu’à refroidissement complet. Ne garnissez pas des biscuits tièdes : le dulce de leche ramollirait et les biscuits se casseraient plus facilement.","image_url":"/recetas/receta-de-alfajores-de-maicena/paso-06.webp","image_alt":"Alfajores à la fécule de maïs, dulce de leche et coco: Laisser refroidir complètement"},{"title":"Garnir et rouler les bords dans la noix de coco","content":"Appariez les 40 biscuits par taille et retournez un biscuit de chaque paire, dessous vers le haut. Répartissez les 350 g de dulce de leche épais sur les 20 bases, environ 17–18 g par alfajor, avec une cuillère ou une poche propre. Posez le second biscuit et pressez doucement jusqu’à faire apparaître un peu de garniture au bord. Mettez les 30 g de coco dans une assiette et roulez seulement le bord de chaque alfajor pour la faire adhérer à la garniture.","image_url":"/recetas/receta-de-alfajores-de-maicena/paso-07.webp","image_alt":"Alfajores à la fécule de maïs, dulce de leche et coco: Garnir et rouler les bords dans la noix de coco"},{"title":"Servir et conserver","content":"Servez les 20 alfajores une fois la garniture en place, en les manipulant avec précaution. Conservez dans une boîte fermée, avec du papier entre les couches, à 4 °C maximum, et consommez sous 3 jours ou plus tôt si l’étiquette du dulce de leche l’exige. Pour congeler, emballez individuellement jusqu’à 1 mois et décongelez au réfrigérateur. Ces durées sont des propositions prudentes, pas un essai de durée de vie ; coco et biscuits ramolliront avec le temps.","image_url":"/recetas/receta-de-alfajores-de-maicena/paso-08.webp","image_alt":"Alfajores à la fécule de maïs, dulce de leche et coco: Servir et conserver"}],"notes":"Utilisez de la fécule blanche, pas de farine de maïs jaune. Le dulce de leche doit être épais, de préférence pour pâtisserie ; une version liquide déborde. La coco peut être omise, mais finition et nutrition changent. Aucune substitution sans gluten non testée n’est proposée : la pâte contient du blé. Si elle se fissure à l’étalage, laissez-la se réchauffer légèrement quelques minutes et pressez doucement entre les papiers ; n’ajoutez pas de farine non pesée. Contient blé, œuf et lait. Ne goûtez pas la pâte crue et nettoyez avant de manipuler les biscuits cuits.","nutrition":{"calories":181.8,"protein_g":2.3,"carbs_g":27.2,"fat_g":7.0,"saturated_fat_g":4.4,"fiber_g":0.5,"sugar_g":12.9,"sodium_mg":50.0,"estimated":true,"source":"USDA FoodData Central — SR Legacy (abril de 2018)","source_url":"https://fdc.nal.usda.gov/download-datasets/","inputs":[{"ingredient":"Fécule de maïs","edible_grams":200,"fdc_id":169698,"fdc_description":"Cornstarch","per_100g":{"sugar_g":0.0,"fat_g":0.05,"carbs_g":91.27,"calories":381.0,"protein_g":0.26,"fiber_g":0.9,"sodium_mg":9.0,"saturated_fat_g":0.009},"source_url":"https://fdc.nal.usda.gov/food-details/169698/nutrients"},{"ingredient":"Farine de blé tous usages","edible_grams":100,"fdc_id":168936,"fdc_description":"Wheat flour, white, all-purpose, enriched, unbleached","per_100g":{"fiber_g":2.7,"fat_g":0.98,"carbs_g":76.31,"calories":364.0,"protein_g":10.33,"sodium_mg":2.0,"saturated_fat_g":0.155,"sugar_g":0.27},"source_url":"https://fdc.nal.usda.gov/food-details/168936/nutrients"},{"ingredient":"Beurre doux","edible_grams":100,"fdc_id":173430,"fdc_description":"Butter, without salt","per_100g":{"sugar_g":0.06,"calories":717.0,"saturated_fat_g":50.489,"fat_g":81.11,"carbs_g":0.06,"protein_g":0.85,"fiber_g":0.0,"sodium_mg":11.0},"source_url":"https://fdc.nal.usda.gov/food-details/173430/nutrients"},{"ingredient":"Sucre blanc","edible_grams":80,"fdc_id":169655,"fdc_description":"Sugars, granulated","per_100g":{"protein_g":0.0,"sodium_mg":1.0,"fat_g":0.0,"calories":387.0,"saturated_fat_g":0.0,"sugar_g":99.8,"carbs_g":99.98,"fiber_g":0.0},"source_url":"https://fdc.nal.usda.gov/food-details/169655/nutrients"},{"ingredient":"Jaunes d’œufs, environ 3 gros ; peser 51 g","edible_grams":51,"fdc_id":172184,"fdc_description":"Egg, yolk, raw, fresh","per_100g":{"sugar_g":0.56,"fat_g":26.54,"protein_g":15.86,"sodium_mg":48.0,"carbs_g":3.59,"calories":322.0,"saturated_fat_g":9.551,"fiber_g":0.0},"source_url":"https://fdc.nal.usda.gov/food-details/172184/nutrients"},{"ingredient":"Levure chimique à double action","edible_grams":6,"fdc_id":172804,"fdc_description":"Leavening agents, baking powder, double-acting, straight phosphate","per_100g":{"saturated_fat_g":0.0,"fiber_g":0.2,"fat_g":0.0,"carbs_g":24.1,"calories":51.0,"protein_g":0.1,"sodium_mg":7893.0,"sugar_g":0.0},"source_url":"https://fdc.nal.usda.gov/food-details/172804/nutrients"},{"ingredient":"Extrait de vanille","edible_grams":5,"fdc_id":173471,"fdc_description":"Vanilla extract","per_100g":{"fat_g":0.06,"carbs_g":12.65,"calories":288.0,"protein_g":0.06,"fiber_g":0.0,"sodium_mg":9.0,"saturated_fat_g":0.01,"sugar_g":12.65},"source_url":"https://fdc.nal.usda.gov/food-details/173471/nutrients"},{"ingredient":"Zeste de citron","edible_grams":3,"fdc_id":167749,"fdc_description":"Lemon peel, raw","per_100g":{"sugar_g":4.17,"calories":47.0,"saturated_fat_g":0.039,"fiber_g":10.6,"sodium_mg":6.0,"protein_g":1.5,"fat_g":0.3,"carbs_g":16.0},"source_url":"https://fdc.nal.usda.gov/food-details/167749/nutrients"},{"ingredient":"Dulce de leche","edible_grams":350,"fdc_id":173461,"fdc_description":"Dulce de Leche","per_100g":{"fiber_g":0.0,"sugar_g":49.74,"fat_g":7.35,"carbs_g":55.35,"calories":315.0,"protein_g":6.84,"sodium_mg":129.0,"saturated_fat_g":4.534},"source_url":"https://fdc.nal.usda.gov/food-details/173461/nutrients"},{"ingredient":"Noix de coco râpée sèche non sucrée","edible_grams":30,"fdc_id":170170,"fdc_description":"Nuts, coconut meat, dried (desiccated), not sweetened","per_100g":{"fiber_g":16.3,"fat_g":64.53,"calories":660.0,"protein_g":6.88,"sodium_mg":37.0,"saturated_fat_g":57.218,"sugar_g":7.35,"carbs_g":23.65},"source_url":"https://fdc.nal.usda.gov/food-details/170170/nutrients"}],"serving_size":"1 des 20 alfajores","method":"Dix fiches USDA vérifiées pour 100 g sont pondérées par tous les poids d’ingrédients et divisées par 20. Toute la garniture et la coco prévues sont incluses ; la perte d’eau à la cuisson n’est pas soustraite de l’apport total.","note":"Estimation informative, pas analyse de l’alfajor préparé. Les marques de dulce de leche, beurre et levure modifient le résultat. Toute la pâte, la garniture et la coco sont supposées consommées ; les restes sur les ustensiles réduiraient l’apport réel."},"keywords":["alfajores fécule de maïs","biscuits au dulce de leche","alfajores noix de coco"],"image_url":"/recetas/receta-de-alfajores-de-maicena/portada.webp","gallery":[{"url":"/recetas/receta-de-alfajores-de-maicena/portada.webp","alt":"Alfajores clairs au dulce de leche et aux bords de noix de coco, un biscuit ouvert montrant la garniture"}],"seo":{"title":"Alfajores à la fécule de maïs et dulce de leche","description":"Préparez 20 alfajores à la fécule de maïs, dulce de leche et coco. Doses précises, pâte aux jaunes refroidie et biscuits clairs cuits en deux fournées.","image_alt":"Alfajores clairs au dulce de leche et aux bords de noix de coco, un biscuit ouvert montrant la garniture","image_variants":["/recetas/receta-de-alfajores-de-maicena/portada-1x1.webp","/recetas/receta-de-alfajores-de-maicena/portada-4x3.webp","/recetas/receta-de-alfajores-de-maicena/portada-16x9.webp"],"faq":[{"q":"Pourquoi les biscuits se cassent-ils ?","a":"Ils sont fragiles à la sortie du four. Laissez-les 5 minutes sur la plaque, déplacez-les avec une spatule large et refroidissez-les complètement avant de garnir. Trop pétrir ou étaler trop fin modifie aussi la texture."},{"q":"Puis-je remplacer la fécule par de la farine de maïs ?","a":"Pas directement. Cette recette utilise de la fécule blanche ; la farine de maïs jaune a une composition et une texture différentes. Elle contient aussi de la farine de blé."},{"q":"Que faire si le dulce de leche est trop liquide ?","a":"Utilisez une version épaisse pour pâtisserie afin de soutenir les biscuits. Ne garnissez pas à chaud. Une autre garniture peut modifier texture, conservation et nutrition."}]},"published":false,"editorial_status":"draft","content_html":"<p>Ces alfajores associent deux biscuits tendres à la fécule de maïs et à la farine de blé, une garniture de dulce de leche et de la noix de coco uniquement sur le bord. Vanille et zeste de citron parfument la pâte aux jaunes.</p><p>La proposition donne 20 alfajores d’environ 5 cm : 40 disques de 6 mm, cuits en deux fournées. Les 130 minutes estimées incluent 30 minutes au froid et 30 minutes de refroidissement. Quantités, rendement et temps restent à confirmer par un essai en cuisine.</p>"},{"id":"8a441deb-0102-5afe-9d87-97ba4d539b3b","recipe_group_id":"c934c115-46a8-4009-ae75-fb10bd3d184f","slug":"amido-di-mais-alfajores-ricetta","public_path":"/it/amido-di-mais-alfajores-ricetta","source_url":"https://manualdecocina.com/it/amido-di-mais-alfajores-ricetta/","language":"it","title":"Alfajores all’amido di mais con dulce de leche e cocco","excerpt":"Prepara 20 alfajores con amido di mais, dulce de leche e cocco. Dosi precise, impasto con tuorli da raffreddare e biscotti chiari in due infornate.","summary":"Questi alfajores uniscono due biscotti teneri di amido di mais e farina di frumento, un ripieno di dulce de leche e cocco solo sul bordo. Vaniglia e scorza di limone aromatizzano l’impasto con tuorli.\n\nLa proposta produce 20 alfajores di circa 5 cm: 40 dischi spessi 6 mm, cotti in due infornate. I 130 minuti stimati comprendono 30 minuti in frigorifero e 30 di raffreddamento. Dosi, resa e tempi devono ancora essere confermati con una prova in cucina.","category":"Dolci","category_slug":"postres","difficulty":"Media","course":"Dolce","cuisine":"Argentina","prep_time_minutes":40,"cook_time_minutes":30,"total_time_minutes":130,"servings":20,"ingredients":[{"name":"Amido di mais","amount":"200","unit":"g","group":"Impasto"},{"name":"Farina di frumento per tutti gli usi","amount":"100","unit":"g","group":"Impasto"},{"name":"Burro non salato","amount":"100","unit":"g","group":"Impasto"},{"name":"Zucchero bianco","amount":"80","unit":"g","group":"Impasto"},{"name":"Tuorli, circa 3 grandi; pesare 51 g","amount":"51","unit":"g","group":"Impasto"},{"name":"Lievito per dolci a doppia azione","amount":"6","unit":"g","group":"Impasto"},{"name":"Estratto di vaniglia","amount":"5","unit":"g","group":"Impasto"},{"name":"Scorza di limone grattugiata","amount":"3","unit":"g","group":"Impasto"},{"name":"Dulce de leche","amount":"350","unit":"g","group":"Ripieno e finitura"},{"name":"Cocco grattugiato essiccato non zuccherato","amount":"30","unit":"g","group":"Ripieno e finitura"}],"steps":[{"title":"Pesa e setaccia gli ingredienti secchi","content":"Lava le mani e pulisci il piano di lavoro. Pesa tutti gli ingredienti; i 3 tuorli devono pesare complessivamente circa 51 g. Setaccia insieme 200 g di amido, 100 g di farina e 6 g di lievito in una ciotola. Lava il limone prima di grattugiare solo la parte gialla fino a ottenere 3 g. Tieni dulce de leche e cocco separati dagli utensili che toccheranno l’impasto crudo.","image_url":"/recetas/receta-de-alfajores-de-maicena/paso-01.webp","image_alt":"Alfajores all’amido di mais con dulce de leche e cocco: Pesa e setaccia gli ingredienti secchi"},{"title":"Lavora il burro e aggiungi i tuorli","content":"Usa 100 g di burro morbido al tatto, ma non sciolto. Sbatti con gli 80 g di zucchero per 2–3 minuti fino a ottenere una crema. Aggiungi i tuorli in tre riprese, incorporando ciascuno prima del successivo. Unisci 5 g di vaniglia e 3 g di scorza; raccogli l’impasto dalle pareti con una spatola.","image_url":"/recetas/receta-de-alfajores-de-maicena/paso-02.webp","image_alt":"Alfajores all’amido di mais con dulce de leche e cocco: Lavora il burro e aggiungi i tuorli"},{"title":"Forma e raffredda l’impasto","content":"Aggiungi gli ingredienti secchi in due riprese. Mescola con una spatola e poi riunisci delicatamente con le mani, solo finché non restano zone polverose; non lavorare come un impasto da pane. Appiattisci in un disco, avvolgi e metti in frigorifero per 30 minuti a non più di 4 °C. Non assaggiare l’impasto crudo: contiene farina e uovo non cotti. Lava poi mani, ciotola e piano di lavoro.","image_url":"/recetas/receta-de-alfajores-de-maicena/paso-03.webp","image_alt":"Alfajores all’amido di mais con dulce de leche e cocco: Forma e raffredda l’impasto"},{"title":"Stendi e ritaglia quaranta dischi","content":"Preriscalda il forno a 180 °C statico o 160 °C ventilato. Rivesti due teglie di circa 30 × 40 cm con carta forno. Stendi l’impasto tra due fogli fino a circa 6 mm. Ritaglia cerchi di 5 cm; riunisci gli scarti senza lavorarli troppo e stendi ancora. Cerca di ottenere 40 dischi simili, di circa 13–14 g ciascuno, per 20 coppie. Distribuiscine 20 per teglia, distanti circa 2 cm. Se l’impasto si ammorbidisce, raffredda 10 minuti e aggiungi l’attesa al tempo totale.","image_url":"/recetas/receta-de-alfajores-de-maicena/paso-04.webp","image_alt":"Alfajores all’amido di mais con dulce de leche e cocco: Stendi e ritaglia quaranta dischi"},{"title":"Cuoci i biscotti in due infornate","content":"Cuoci una teglia alla volta al centro del forno per 12–15 minuti: superficie opaca e soda, base appena dorata e nessun centro umido. Controlla da 12 minuti; spessore e forno possono cambiare il tempo. Estrai con guanti e cuoci allo stesso modo la seconda teglia. La stima di cottura riserva 30 minuti per entrambe; non cercare una doratura intensa.","image_url":"/recetas/receta-de-alfajores-de-maicena/paso-05.webp","image_alt":"Alfajores all’amido di mais con dulce de leche e cocco: Cuoci i biscotti in due infornate"},{"title":"Lascia raffreddare completamente","content":"Lascia i biscotti 5 minuti sulla teglia perché sono ancora fragili. Trasferisci con una spatola larga su una griglia e fai raffreddare per altri 25 minuti circa, finché sono del tutto freddi. Non farcire biscotti tiepidi: il dulce de leche si ammorbidirebbe e i biscotti si romperebbero più facilmente.","image_url":"/recetas/receta-de-alfajores-de-maicena/paso-06.webp","image_alt":"Alfajores all’amido di mais con dulce de leche e cocco: Lascia raffreddare completamente"},{"title":"Farcisci e ricopri i bordi di cocco","content":"Abbina i 40 biscotti per dimensione e gira una base per coppia con il fondo verso l’alto. Distribuisci 350 g di dulce de leche denso sulle 20 basi, circa 17–18 g per alfajor, con un cucchiaio o una tasca pulita. Copri con il secondo biscotto e premi piano finché il ripieno appare appena sul bordo. Metti 30 g di cocco in un piatto e rotola solo il bordo di ogni alfajor per farlo aderire al ripieno.","image_url":"/recetas/receta-de-alfajores-de-maicena/paso-07.webp","image_alt":"Alfajores all’amido di mais con dulce de leche e cocco: Farcisci e ricopri i bordi di cocco"},{"title":"Servi e conserva","content":"Servi i 20 alfajores quando il ripieno è assestato, maneggiandoli delicatamente. Conserva in un contenitore chiuso con carta tra gli strati, in frigorifero a non più di 4 °C, e consuma entro 3 giorni o prima se richiesto dalla confezione del dulce de leche. Per congelare, avvolgi singolarmente fino a 1 mese e scongela in frigorifero. Sono durate proposte prudenti, non prove di conservabilità; cocco e biscotti si ammorbidiranno nel tempo.","image_url":"/recetas/receta-de-alfajores-de-maicena/paso-08.webp","image_alt":"Alfajores all’amido di mais con dulce de leche e cocco: Servi e conserva"}],"notes":"Usa amido di mais bianco, non farina di mais gialla. Il dulce de leche deve essere denso, preferibilmente da pasticceria; uno liquido uscirà dai bordi. Puoi omettere il cocco, ma finitura e nutrizione cambiano. Non si propone una sostituzione senza glutine non provata: l’impasto contiene frumento. Se si crepa mentre lo stendi, lascialo scaldare leggermente per qualche minuto e premi delicatamente tra i fogli; non aggiungere farina senza pesarla. Contiene frumento, uovo e latte. Non assaggiare impasto crudo e pulisci prima di toccare i biscotti cotti.","nutrition":{"calories":181.8,"protein_g":2.3,"carbs_g":27.2,"fat_g":7.0,"saturated_fat_g":4.4,"fiber_g":0.5,"sugar_g":12.9,"sodium_mg":50.0,"estimated":true,"source":"USDA FoodData Central — SR Legacy (abril de 2018)","source_url":"https://fdc.nal.usda.gov/download-datasets/","inputs":[{"ingredient":"Amido di mais","edible_grams":200,"fdc_id":169698,"fdc_description":"Cornstarch","per_100g":{"sugar_g":0.0,"fat_g":0.05,"carbs_g":91.27,"calories":381.0,"protein_g":0.26,"fiber_g":0.9,"sodium_mg":9.0,"saturated_fat_g":0.009},"source_url":"https://fdc.nal.usda.gov/food-details/169698/nutrients"},{"ingredient":"Farina di frumento per tutti gli usi","edible_grams":100,"fdc_id":168936,"fdc_description":"Wheat flour, white, all-purpose, enriched, unbleached","per_100g":{"fiber_g":2.7,"fat_g":0.98,"carbs_g":76.31,"calories":364.0,"protein_g":10.33,"sodium_mg":2.0,"saturated_fat_g":0.155,"sugar_g":0.27},"source_url":"https://fdc.nal.usda.gov/food-details/168936/nutrients"},{"ingredient":"Burro non salato","edible_grams":100,"fdc_id":173430,"fdc_description":"Butter, without salt","per_100g":{"sugar_g":0.06,"calories":717.0,"saturated_fat_g":50.489,"fat_g":81.11,"carbs_g":0.06,"protein_g":0.85,"fiber_g":0.0,"sodium_mg":11.0},"source_url":"https://fdc.nal.usda.gov/food-details/173430/nutrients"},{"ingredient":"Zucchero bianco","edible_grams":80,"fdc_id":169655,"fdc_description":"Sugars, granulated","per_100g":{"protein_g":0.0,"sodium_mg":1.0,"fat_g":0.0,"calories":387.0,"saturated_fat_g":0.0,"sugar_g":99.8,"carbs_g":99.98,"fiber_g":0.0},"source_url":"https://fdc.nal.usda.gov/food-details/169655/nutrients"},{"ingredient":"Tuorli, circa 3 grandi; pesare 51 g","edible_grams":51,"fdc_id":172184,"fdc_description":"Egg, yolk, raw, fresh","per_100g":{"sugar_g":0.56,"fat_g":26.54,"protein_g":15.86,"sodium_mg":48.0,"carbs_g":3.59,"calories":322.0,"saturated_fat_g":9.551,"fiber_g":0.0},"source_url":"https://fdc.nal.usda.gov/food-details/172184/nutrients"},{"ingredient":"Lievito per dolci a doppia azione","edible_grams":6,"fdc_id":172804,"fdc_description":"Leavening agents, baking powder, double-acting, straight phosphate","per_100g":{"saturated_fat_g":0.0,"fiber_g":0.2,"fat_g":0.0,"carbs_g":24.1,"calories":51.0,"protein_g":0.1,"sodium_mg":7893.0,"sugar_g":0.0},"source_url":"https://fdc.nal.usda.gov/food-details/172804/nutrients"},{"ingredient":"Estratto di vaniglia","edible_grams":5,"fdc_id":173471,"fdc_description":"Vanilla extract","per_100g":{"fat_g":0.06,"carbs_g":12.65,"calories":288.0,"protein_g":0.06,"fiber_g":0.0,"sodium_mg":9.0,"saturated_fat_g":0.01,"sugar_g":12.65},"source_url":"https://fdc.nal.usda.gov/food-details/173471/nutrients"},{"ingredient":"Scorza di limone grattugiata","edible_grams":3,"fdc_id":167749,"fdc_description":"Lemon peel, raw","per_100g":{"sugar_g":4.17,"calories":47.0,"saturated_fat_g":0.039,"fiber_g":10.6,"sodium_mg":6.0,"protein_g":1.5,"fat_g":0.3,"carbs_g":16.0},"source_url":"https://fdc.nal.usda.gov/food-details/167749/nutrients"},{"ingredient":"Dulce de leche","edible_grams":350,"fdc_id":173461,"fdc_description":"Dulce de Leche","per_100g":{"fiber_g":0.0,"sugar_g":49.74,"fat_g":7.35,"carbs_g":55.35,"calories":315.0,"protein_g":6.84,"sodium_mg":129.0,"saturated_fat_g":4.534},"source_url":"https://fdc.nal.usda.gov/food-details/173461/nutrients"},{"ingredient":"Cocco grattugiato essiccato non zuccherato","edible_grams":30,"fdc_id":170170,"fdc_description":"Nuts, coconut meat, dried (desiccated), not sweetened","per_100g":{"fiber_g":16.3,"fat_g":64.53,"calories":660.0,"protein_g":6.88,"sodium_mg":37.0,"saturated_fat_g":57.218,"sugar_g":7.35,"carbs_g":23.65},"source_url":"https://fdc.nal.usda.gov/food-details/170170/nutrients"}],"serving_size":"1 dei 20 alfajores","method":"Dieci schede USDA verificate per 100 g sono ponderate con tutti i pesi degli ingredienti e divise per 20. Si include tutto il ripieno e il cocco previsto; la perdita d’acqua in cottura non si sottrae dall’apporto totale.","note":"Stima informativa, non analisi dell’alfajor preparato. Le marche di dulce de leche, burro e lievito modificano il risultato. Si suppone il consumo di tutto l’impasto, il ripieno e il cocco; residui sugli utensili ridurrebbero l’apporto reale."},"keywords":["alfajores amido di mais","biscotti con dulce de leche","alfajores al cocco"],"image_url":"/recetas/receta-de-alfajores-de-maicena/portada.webp","gallery":[{"url":"/recetas/receta-de-alfajores-de-maicena/portada.webp","alt":"Alfajores chiari con dulce de leche e cocco sui bordi, uno aperto con il ripieno visibile"}],"seo":{"title":"Alfajores all’amido di mais con dulce de leche","description":"Prepara 20 alfajores con amido di mais, dulce de leche e cocco. Dosi precise, impasto con tuorli da raffreddare e biscotti chiari in due infornate.","image_alt":"Alfajores chiari con dulce de leche e cocco sui bordi, uno aperto con il ripieno visibile","image_variants":["/recetas/receta-de-alfajores-de-maicena/portada-1x1.webp","/recetas/receta-de-alfajores-de-maicena/portada-4x3.webp","/recetas/receta-de-alfajores-de-maicena/portada-16x9.webp"],"faq":[{"q":"Perché i biscotti si rompono?","a":"Sono fragili appena sfornati. Lasciali 5 minuti sulla teglia, spostali con una spatola larga e raffreddali completamente prima di farcire. Lavorare troppo o stendere troppo sottile modifica anche la consistenza."},{"q":"Posso usare farina di mais al posto dell’amido?","a":"Non direttamente. Questa ricetta usa amido bianco; la farina di mais gialla ha composizione e consistenza diverse. La ricetta contiene anche farina di frumento."},{"q":"Cosa fare se il dulce de leche è troppo liquido?","a":"Usa un dulce de leche denso da pasticceria per sostenere i biscotti. Non farcire quando sono caldi. Cambiare ripieno può modificare consistenza, conservazione e nutrizione."}]},"published":false,"editorial_status":"draft","content_html":"<p>Questi alfajores uniscono due biscotti teneri di amido di mais e farina di frumento, un ripieno di dulce de leche e cocco solo sul bordo. Vaniglia e scorza di limone aromatizzano l’impasto con tuorli.</p><p>La proposta produce 20 alfajores di circa 5 cm: 40 dischi spessi 6 mm, cotti in due infornate. I 130 minuti stimati comprendono 30 minuti in frigorifero e 30 di raffreddamento. Dosi, resa e tempi devono ancora essere confermati con una prova in cucina.</p>"},{"id":"289ff7fe-b09d-5330-96db-9bf041bb93a7","recipe_group_id":"c934c115-46a8-4009-ae75-fb10bd3d184f","slug":"cornstarch-alfajores","public_path":"/ja/cornstarch-alfajores","source_url":null,"language":"ja","title":"ドゥルセ・デ・レチェとココナッツのアルファホーレス","excerpt":"コーンスターチを使ったアルファホーレス20個分。卵黄入り生地の分量、冷やす時間、2回に分ける焼き方とドゥルセ・デ・レチェの詰め方を紹介します。","summary":"コーンスターチと小麦粉のほろっとしたクッキー2枚で、濃厚なドゥルセ・デ・レチェを挟みます。ココナッツは側面だけにつけ、卵黄入り生地をレモンの皮とバニラで香りづけします。\n\n直径約5 cmのアルファホーレス20個を想定した提案です。厚さ6 mmの生地を40枚抜き、2回に分けて焼きます。推定合計130分には冷蔵30分と冷却30分を含みます。分量、出来上がり数、時間は調理試験でまだ確認していません。","category":"デザート","category_slug":"postres","difficulty":"中級","course":"デザート","cuisine":"アルゼンチン料理","prep_time_minutes":40,"cook_time_minutes":30,"total_time_minutes":130,"servings":20,"ingredients":[{"name":"コーンスターチ","amount":"200","unit":"g","group":"生地"},{"name":"中力タイプの小麦粉","amount":"100","unit":"g","group":"生地"},{"name":"無塩バター","amount":"100","unit":"g","group":"生地"},{"name":"白砂糖","amount":"80","unit":"g","group":"生地"},{"name":"卵黄、大きめ約3個分；51 g量る","amount":"51","unit":"g","group":"生地"},{"name":"ダブルアクティング・ベーキングパウダー","amount":"6","unit":"g","group":"生地"},{"name":"バニラエクストラクト","amount":"5","unit":"g","group":"生地"},{"name":"レモンの皮のすりおろし","amount":"3","unit":"g","group":"生地"},{"name":"ドゥルセ・デ・レチェ","amount":"350","unit":"g","group":"詰め物と仕上げ"},{"name":"無糖の乾燥ココナッツ","amount":"30","unit":"g","group":"詰め物と仕上げ"}],"steps":[{"title":"粉類を量ってふるう","content":"手を洗い、作業台を清潔にします。材料をすべて量り、卵黄3個分が合計約51 gになるようにします。コーンスターチ200 g、小麦粉100 g、ベーキングパウダー6 gを一緒にボウルへふるいます。レモンを洗い、黄色い皮だけを3 gすりおろします。ドゥルセ・デ・レチェとココナッツは、生の生地に触れる器具から分けておきます。","image_url":"/recetas/receta-de-alfajores-de-maicena/paso-01.webp","image_alt":"ドゥルセ・デ・レチェとココナッツのアルファホーレス: 粉類を量ってふるう"},{"title":"バターに卵黄を加える","content":"バター100 gは押すとへこむ柔らかさにし、溶かしません。砂糖80 gと2〜3分泡立て、クリーム状にします。卵黄を3回に分け、毎回なじませてから次を加えます。バニラ5 gとレモンの皮3 gを混ぜ、へらでボウルの側面をこそげます。","image_url":"/recetas/receta-de-alfajores-de-maicena/paso-02.webp","image_alt":"ドゥルセ・デ・レチェとココナッツのアルファホーレス: バターに卵黄を加える"},{"title":"生地をまとめて冷やす","content":"粉類を2回に分けて加え、へらで混ぜます。最後は手でそっとまとめ、粉っぽい部分がなくなったら止めます。パン生地のようにこねません。円盤状に平らにし、包んで4 °C以下の冷蔵庫で30分冷やします。生の生地は未加熱の小麦粉と卵を含むため味見しません。扱った後は手、ボウル、作業台を洗います。","image_url":"/recetas/receta-de-alfajores-de-maicena/paso-03.webp","image_alt":"ドゥルセ・デ・レチェとココナッツのアルファホーレス: 生地をまとめて冷やす"},{"title":"生地をのばして40枚抜く","content":"オーブンを上下加熱180 °C、ファン付きなら160 °Cに予熱します。約30 × 40 cmの天板2枚にオーブンシートを敷きます。生地を2枚のシートで挟み、約6 mm厚にのばします。直径5 cmの丸型で抜き、余りをこねすぎずにまとめて再びのばします。20組分として、大きさのそろった約13〜14 gの円を40枚目指します。天板1枚に20枚ずつ、約2 cm間隔で置きます。柔らかくなったら10分冷やし、その待ち時間を合計に加えます。","image_url":"/recetas/receta-de-alfajores-de-maicena/paso-04.webp","image_alt":"ドゥルセ・デ・レチェとココナッツのアルファホーレス: 生地をのばして40枚抜く"},{"title":"2回に分けて焼く","content":"天板1枚ずつオーブン中央で12〜15分焼きます。表面がつやを失って固まり、底がごく薄いきつね色になり、中心が湿っていない状態を目安にします。12分から確認し、厚さやオーブンで時間が変わることを考慮します。ミトンで取り出し、2枚目も同様に焼きます。調理時間は2回で30分を見込んでいます。濃い焼き色はつけません。","image_url":"/recetas/receta-de-alfajores-de-maicena/paso-05.webp","image_alt":"ドゥルセ・デ・レチェとココナッツのアルファホーレス: 2回に分けて焼く"},{"title":"完全に冷ます","content":"焼きたては崩れやすいため、天板に5分置きます。幅の広いへらで網に移し、さらに約25分、完全に冷めるまで置きます。温かいまま詰めるとドゥルセ・デ・レチェが柔らかくなり、クッキーも割れやすくなります。","image_url":"/recetas/receta-de-alfajores-de-maicena/paso-06.webp","image_alt":"ドゥルセ・デ・レチェとココナッツのアルファホーレス: 完全に冷ます"},{"title":"詰めて側面にココナッツをつける","content":"40枚を大きさで組み合わせ、各組の1枚を底面が上になるよう置きます。濃厚なドゥルセ・デ・レチェ350 gを清潔なスプーンか絞り袋で20枚に分け、1個当たり約17〜18 gのせます。もう1枚を重ね、詰め物が端にわずかに見えるまで優しく押します。ココナッツ30 gを皿に入れ、各アルファホーレスの側面だけを転がして詰め物に付着させます。","image_url":"/recetas/receta-de-alfajores-de-maicena/paso-07.webp","image_alt":"ドゥルセ・デ・レチェとココナッツのアルファホーレス: 詰めて側面にココナッツをつける"},{"title":"盛り付けて保存する","content":"詰め物が落ち着いたら20個をそっと扱って盛り付けます。紙を挟んで密閉容器に入れ、4 °C以下で冷蔵し、3日以内、またはドゥルセ・デ・レチェの表示が求めるより早い期限で食べます。冷凍は個別に包んで最長1か月とし、冷蔵庫で解凍します。これらは控えめな保存期間の提案で、保存試験の結果ではありません。ココナッツとクッキーは時間とともに柔らかくなります。","image_url":"/recetas/receta-de-alfajores-de-maicena/paso-08.webp","image_alt":"ドゥルセ・デ・レチェとココナッツのアルファホーレス: 盛り付けて保存する"}],"notes":"白いコーンスターチを使い、黄色いコーンフラワーは使いません。ドゥルセ・デ・レチェは濃厚な製菓用が適し、液状では側面から流れます。ココナッツを省くと仕上がりと栄養値が変わります。この生地は小麦を含み、未検証のグルテンフリー置き換えは提案しません。のばす際に割れたら数分置いて少し冷たさを和らげ、シートの間で優しく押します。量らずに粉を足さないでください。小麦、卵、乳を含みます。生地を味見せず、焼いたクッキーを扱う前に清掃します。","nutrition":{"calories":181.8,"protein_g":2.3,"carbs_g":27.2,"fat_g":7.0,"saturated_fat_g":4.4,"fiber_g":0.5,"sugar_g":12.9,"sodium_mg":50.0,"estimated":true,"source":"USDA FoodData Central — SR Legacy (abril de 2018)","source_url":"https://fdc.nal.usda.gov/download-datasets/","inputs":[{"ingredient":"コーンスターチ","edible_grams":200,"fdc_id":169698,"fdc_description":"Cornstarch","per_100g":{"sugar_g":0.0,"fat_g":0.05,"carbs_g":91.27,"calories":381.0,"protein_g":0.26,"fiber_g":0.9,"sodium_mg":9.0,"saturated_fat_g":0.009},"source_url":"https://fdc.nal.usda.gov/food-details/169698/nutrients"},{"ingredient":"中力タイプの小麦粉","edible_grams":100,"fdc_id":168936,"fdc_description":"Wheat flour, white, all-purpose, enriched, unbleached","per_100g":{"fiber_g":2.7,"fat_g":0.98,"carbs_g":76.31,"calories":364.0,"protein_g":10.33,"sodium_mg":2.0,"saturated_fat_g":0.155,"sugar_g":0.27},"source_url":"https://fdc.nal.usda.gov/food-details/168936/nutrients"},{"ingredient":"無塩バター","edible_grams":100,"fdc_id":173430,"fdc_description":"Butter, without salt","per_100g":{"sugar_g":0.06,"calories":717.0,"saturated_fat_g":50.489,"fat_g":81.11,"carbs_g":0.06,"protein_g":0.85,"fiber_g":0.0,"sodium_mg":11.0},"source_url":"https://fdc.nal.usda.gov/food-details/173430/nutrients"},{"ingredient":"白砂糖","edible_grams":80,"fdc_id":169655,"fdc_description":"Sugars, granulated","per_100g":{"protein_g":0.0,"sodium_mg":1.0,"fat_g":0.0,"calories":387.0,"saturated_fat_g":0.0,"sugar_g":99.8,"carbs_g":99.98,"fiber_g":0.0},"source_url":"https://fdc.nal.usda.gov/food-details/169655/nutrients"},{"ingredient":"卵黄、大きめ約3個分；51 g量る","edible_grams":51,"fdc_id":172184,"fdc_description":"Egg, yolk, raw, fresh","per_100g":{"sugar_g":0.56,"fat_g":26.54,"protein_g":15.86,"sodium_mg":48.0,"carbs_g":3.59,"calories":322.0,"saturated_fat_g":9.551,"fiber_g":0.0},"source_url":"https://fdc.nal.usda.gov/food-details/172184/nutrients"},{"ingredient":"ダブルアクティング・ベーキングパウダー","edible_grams":6,"fdc_id":172804,"fdc_description":"Leavening agents, baking powder, double-acting, straight phosphate","per_100g":{"saturated_fat_g":0.0,"fiber_g":0.2,"fat_g":0.0,"carbs_g":24.1,"calories":51.0,"protein_g":0.1,"sodium_mg":7893.0,"sugar_g":0.0},"source_url":"https://fdc.nal.usda.gov/food-details/172804/nutrients"},{"ingredient":"バニラエクストラクト","edible_grams":5,"fdc_id":173471,"fdc_description":"Vanilla extract","per_100g":{"fat_g":0.06,"carbs_g":12.65,"calories":288.0,"protein_g":0.06,"fiber_g":0.0,"sodium_mg":9.0,"saturated_fat_g":0.01,"sugar_g":12.65},"source_url":"https://fdc.nal.usda.gov/food-details/173471/nutrients"},{"ingredient":"レモンの皮のすりおろし","edible_grams":3,"fdc_id":167749,"fdc_description":"Lemon peel, raw","per_100g":{"sugar_g":4.17,"calories":47.0,"saturated_fat_g":0.039,"fiber_g":10.6,"sodium_mg":6.0,"protein_g":1.5,"fat_g":0.3,"carbs_g":16.0},"source_url":"https://fdc.nal.usda.gov/food-details/167749/nutrients"},{"ingredient":"ドゥルセ・デ・レチェ","edible_grams":350,"fdc_id":173461,"fdc_description":"Dulce de Leche","per_100g":{"fiber_g":0.0,"sugar_g":49.74,"fat_g":7.35,"carbs_g":55.35,"calories":315.0,"protein_g":6.84,"sodium_mg":129.0,"saturated_fat_g":4.534},"source_url":"https://fdc.nal.usda.gov/food-details/173461/nutrients"},{"ingredient":"無糖の乾燥ココナッツ","edible_grams":30,"fdc_id":170170,"fdc_description":"Nuts, coconut meat, dried (desiccated), not sweetened","per_100g":{"fiber_g":16.3,"fat_g":64.53,"calories":660.0,"protein_g":6.88,"sodium_mg":37.0,"saturated_fat_g":57.218,"sugar_g":7.35,"carbs_g":23.65},"source_url":"https://fdc.nal.usda.gov/food-details/170170/nutrients"}],"serving_size":"20個のうち1個","method":"確認したUSDAの10項目の100 g当たりの数値を全材料の重量で加重計算し、20で割っています。予定した詰め物とココナッツはすべて含め、焼成中の水分損失は総栄養量から差し引きません。","note":"参考用の推定値で、完成品の実測値ではありません。ドゥルセ・デ・レチェ、バター、ベーキングパウダーの製品により変わります。生地、詰め物、ココナッツをすべて食べる想定で、器具に残る分があれば実際の摂取量は減ります。"},"keywords":["コーンスターチ アルファホーレス","ドゥルセ・デ・レチェ クッキー","ココナッツのサンドクッキー"],"image_url":"/recetas/receta-de-alfajores-de-maicena/portada.webp","gallery":[{"url":"/recetas/receta-de-alfajores-de-maicena/portada.webp","alt":"淡い色のアルファホーレス、ドゥルセ・デ・レチェの断面と側面のココナッツ"}],"seo":{"title":"コーンスターチのアルファホーレス｜ドゥルセ・デ・レチェ入り","description":"コーンスターチを使ったアルファホーレス20個分。卵黄入り生地の分量、冷やす時間、2回に分ける焼き方とドゥルセ・デ・レチェの詰め方を紹介します。","image_alt":"淡い色のアルファホーレス、ドゥルセ・デ・レチェの断面と側面のココナッツ","image_variants":["/recetas/receta-de-alfajores-de-maicena/portada-1x1.webp","/recetas/receta-de-alfajores-de-maicena/portada-4x3.webp","/recetas/receta-de-alfajores-de-maicena/portada-16x9.webp"],"faq":[{"q":"クッキーが割れるのはなぜですか？","a":"焼きたては崩れやすいので天板に5分置き、幅広いへらで動かし、完全に冷めてから詰めます。こねすぎや薄くのばしすぎも食感を変えます。"},{"q":"コーンスターチをコーンフラワーに替えられますか？","a":"そのままの置き換えはできません。白いコーンスターチと黄色いコーンフラワーは成分と食感が異なります。このレシピには小麦粉も入っています。"},{"q":"ドゥルセ・デ・レチェが緩い場合は？","a":"クッキーを支えられる濃厚な製菓用を使い、温かいクッキーには詰めません。詰め物を替えると食感、保存、栄養値が変わる場合があります。"}]},"published":false,"editorial_status":"draft","content_html":"<p>コーンスターチと小麦粉のほろっとしたクッキー2枚で、濃厚なドゥルセ・デ・レチェを挟みます。ココナッツは側面だけにつけ、卵黄入り生地をレモンの皮とバニラで香りづけします。</p><p>直径約5 cmのアルファホーレス20個を想定した提案です。厚さ6 mmの生地を40枚抜き、2回に分けて焼きます。推定合計130分には冷蔵30分と冷却30分を含みます。分量、出来上がり数、時間は調理試験でまだ確認していません。</p>"},{"id":"dac1c30e-4f14-5a16-aab5-1ae87196e220","recipe_group_id":"c934c115-46a8-4009-ae75-fb10bd3d184f","slug":"alfajores-de-amido-de-milho","public_path":"/pt/alfajores-de-amido-de-milho","source_url":null,"language":"pt","title":"Alfajores de amido de milho com doce de leite e coco","excerpt":"Prepare 20 alfajores de amido de milho com doce de leite e coco. Veja medidas, massa com gemas, descanso na geladeira e biscoitos em duas fornadas.","summary":"Estes alfajores combinam dois biscoitos delicados de amido de milho e farinha de trigo, recheio de doce de leite e coco apenas na borda. Raspas de limão e baunilha perfumam a massa com gemas.\n\nA proposta rende 20 alfajores de cerca de 5 cm: 40 discos com 6 mm de espessura, assados em duas fornadas. Os 130 minutos estimados incluem 30 minutos na geladeira e 30 de resfriamento. Quantidades, rendimento e tempos ainda precisam de confirmação em teste na cozinha.","category":"Sobremesas","category_slug":"postres","difficulty":"Média","course":"Sobremesa","cuisine":"Argentina","prep_time_minutes":40,"cook_time_minutes":30,"total_time_minutes":130,"servings":20,"ingredients":[{"name":"Amido de milho","amount":"200","unit":"g","group":"Massa"},{"name":"Farinha de trigo de uso geral","amount":"100","unit":"g","group":"Massa"},{"name":"Manteiga sem sal","amount":"100","unit":"g","group":"Massa"},{"name":"Açúcar branco","amount":"80","unit":"g","group":"Massa"},{"name":"Gemas, cerca de 3 grandes; pesar 51 g","amount":"51","unit":"g","group":"Massa"},{"name":"Fermento químico de dupla ação","amount":"6","unit":"g","group":"Massa"},{"name":"Extrato de baunilha","amount":"5","unit":"g","group":"Massa"},{"name":"Raspas de limão","amount":"3","unit":"g","group":"Massa"},{"name":"Doce de leite","amount":"350","unit":"g","group":"Recheio e acabamento"},{"name":"Coco ralado seco sem açúcar","amount":"30","unit":"g","group":"Recheio e acabamento"}],"steps":[{"title":"Pese e peneire os ingredientes secos","content":"Lave as mãos e limpe a bancada. Pese todos os ingredientes; as 3 gemas devem somar cerca de 51 g. Peneire juntos os 200 g de amido, 100 g de farinha e 6 g de fermento em uma tigela. Lave o limão antes de raspar só a parte amarela até obter 3 g. Mantenha doce de leite e coco separados dos utensílios que vão tocar a massa crua.","image_url":"/recetas/receta-de-alfajores-de-maicena/paso-01.webp","image_alt":"Alfajores de amido de milho com doce de leite e coco: Pese e peneire os ingredientes secos"},{"title":"Bata a manteiga e acrescente as gemas","content":"Use 100 g de manteiga macia ao pressionar, mas não derretida. Bata com os 80 g de açúcar por 2–3 minutos, até ficar cremosa. Acrescente as gemas em três adições, incorporando cada uma antes da próxima. Junte os 5 g de baunilha e 3 g de raspas; raspe as laterais da tigela com uma espátula.","image_url":"/recetas/receta-de-alfajores-de-maicena/paso-02.webp","image_alt":"Alfajores de amido de milho com doce de leite e coco: Bata a manteiga e acrescente as gemas"},{"title":"Junte a massa e leve à geladeira","content":"Adicione os ingredientes secos em duas etapas. Misture com espátula e termine juntando delicadamente com as mãos, só até não restarem partes com pó; não sove como pão. Achate em um disco, embrulhe e leve à geladeira por 30 minutos a no máximo 4 °C. Não prove a massa crua: contém farinha e ovo sem cozinhar. Lave mãos, tigela e bancada depois de manusear.","image_url":"/recetas/receta-de-alfajores-de-maicena/paso-03.webp","image_alt":"Alfajores de amido de milho com doce de leite e coco: Junte a massa e leve à geladeira"},{"title":"Abra e corte quarenta discos","content":"Preaqueça o forno a 180 °C com calor convencional ou 160 °C com ventilação. Forre duas assadeiras de cerca de 30 × 40 cm com papel próprio para forno. Abra a massa entre duas folhas até cerca de 6 mm. Corte círculos de 5 cm; junte as sobras sem sovar muito e abra novamente. Procure obter 40 discos parecidos, com cerca de 13–14 g cada, formando 20 pares. Distribua 20 por assadeira com cerca de 2 cm de espaço. Se a massa amolecer, leve à geladeira por 10 minutos e acrescente essa espera ao tempo total.","image_url":"/recetas/receta-de-alfajores-de-maicena/paso-04.webp","image_alt":"Alfajores de amido de milho com doce de leite e coco: Abra e corte quarenta discos"},{"title":"Asse os biscoitos em duas fornadas","content":"Asse uma assadeira por vez no centro do forno por 12–15 minutos: a superfície deve ficar fosca e firme, a base só levemente dourada e o centro sem umidade. Confira a partir de 12 minutos; espessura e forno podem mudar o tempo. Retire com luvas e asse a segunda da mesma forma. O cálculo de cozimento reserva 30 minutos para as duas fornadas; não procure uma cor muito tostada.","image_url":"/recetas/receta-de-alfajores-de-maicena/paso-05.webp","image_alt":"Alfajores de amido de milho com doce de leite e coco: Asse os biscoitos em duas fornadas"},{"title":"Deixe esfriar completamente","content":"Deixe os biscoitos 5 minutos na assadeira porque ainda estão frágeis. Transfira com uma espátula larga para uma grade e deixe esfriar por mais cerca de 25 minutos, até estarem totalmente frios. Não recheie biscoitos mornos: o doce de leite amoleceria e eles quebrariam com mais facilidade.","image_url":"/recetas/receta-de-alfajores-de-maicena/paso-06.webp","image_alt":"Alfajores de amido de milho com doce de leite e coco: Deixe esfriar completamente"},{"title":"Recheie e cubra a borda com coco","content":"Junte os 40 biscoitos em pares por tamanho e coloque um de cada par com a base virada para cima. Divida os 350 g de doce de leite espesso entre as 20 bases, cerca de 17–18 g por alfajor, usando colher ou saco de confeitar limpo. Cubra com o segundo biscoito e pressione de leve até o recheio aparecer um pouco na borda. Coloque os 30 g de coco em um prato e role apenas a borda de cada alfajor para grudar no recheio.","image_url":"/recetas/receta-de-alfajores-de-maicena/paso-07.webp","image_alt":"Alfajores de amido de milho com doce de leite e coco: Recheie e cubra a borda com coco"},{"title":"Sirva e guarde","content":"Sirva os 20 alfajores depois que o recheio estiver assentado, manuseando com cuidado. Guarde em recipiente fechado, com papel entre as camadas, na geladeira a no máximo 4 °C, e consuma em até 3 dias, ou antes se a embalagem do doce de leite exigir. Para congelar, embrulhe individualmente por até 1 mês e descongele na geladeira. Esses prazos são propostas conservadoras, não resultados de teste de validade; coco e biscoitos vão amolecer com o tempo.","image_url":"/recetas/receta-de-alfajores-de-maicena/paso-08.webp","image_alt":"Alfajores de amido de milho com doce de leite e coco: Sirva e guarde"}],"notes":"Use amido de milho branco, não farinha de milho amarela. O doce de leite precisa ser espesso, de preferência para confeitaria; um líquido vai escapar pela borda. Você pode omitir o coco, mas acabamento e nutrição mudam. Não se propõe uma troca sem glúten sem testar: a massa contém trigo. Se rachar ao abrir, deixe perder um pouco do frio por alguns minutos e pressione com cuidado entre os papéis; não adicione farinha sem medir. Contém trigo, ovo e leite. Não prove massa crua e limpe antes de manipular os biscoitos assados.","nutrition":{"calories":181.8,"protein_g":2.3,"carbs_g":27.2,"fat_g":7.0,"saturated_fat_g":4.4,"fiber_g":0.5,"sugar_g":12.9,"sodium_mg":50.0,"estimated":true,"source":"USDA FoodData Central — SR Legacy (abril de 2018)","source_url":"https://fdc.nal.usda.gov/download-datasets/","inputs":[{"ingredient":"Amido de milho","edible_grams":200,"fdc_id":169698,"fdc_description":"Cornstarch","per_100g":{"sugar_g":0.0,"fat_g":0.05,"carbs_g":91.27,"calories":381.0,"protein_g":0.26,"fiber_g":0.9,"sodium_mg":9.0,"saturated_fat_g":0.009},"source_url":"https://fdc.nal.usda.gov/food-details/169698/nutrients"},{"ingredient":"Farinha de trigo de uso geral","edible_grams":100,"fdc_id":168936,"fdc_description":"Wheat flour, white, all-purpose, enriched, unbleached","per_100g":{"fiber_g":2.7,"fat_g":0.98,"carbs_g":76.31,"calories":364.0,"protein_g":10.33,"sodium_mg":2.0,"saturated_fat_g":0.155,"sugar_g":0.27},"source_url":"https://fdc.nal.usda.gov/food-details/168936/nutrients"},{"ingredient":"Manteiga sem sal","edible_grams":100,"fdc_id":173430,"fdc_description":"Butter, without salt","per_100g":{"sugar_g":0.06,"calories":717.0,"saturated_fat_g":50.489,"fat_g":81.11,"carbs_g":0.06,"protein_g":0.85,"fiber_g":0.0,"sodium_mg":11.0},"source_url":"https://fdc.nal.usda.gov/food-details/173430/nutrients"},{"ingredient":"Açúcar branco","edible_grams":80,"fdc_id":169655,"fdc_description":"Sugars, granulated","per_100g":{"protein_g":0.0,"sodium_mg":1.0,"fat_g":0.0,"calories":387.0,"saturated_fat_g":0.0,"sugar_g":99.8,"carbs_g":99.98,"fiber_g":0.0},"source_url":"https://fdc.nal.usda.gov/food-details/169655/nutrients"},{"ingredient":"Gemas, cerca de 3 grandes; pesar 51 g","edible_grams":51,"fdc_id":172184,"fdc_description":"Egg, yolk, raw, fresh","per_100g":{"sugar_g":0.56,"fat_g":26.54,"protein_g":15.86,"sodium_mg":48.0,"carbs_g":3.59,"calories":322.0,"saturated_fat_g":9.551,"fiber_g":0.0},"source_url":"https://fdc.nal.usda.gov/food-details/172184/nutrients"},{"ingredient":"Fermento químico de dupla ação","edible_grams":6,"fdc_id":172804,"fdc_description":"Leavening agents, baking powder, double-acting, straight phosphate","per_100g":{"saturated_fat_g":0.0,"fiber_g":0.2,"fat_g":0.0,"carbs_g":24.1,"calories":51.0,"protein_g":0.1,"sodium_mg":7893.0,"sugar_g":0.0},"source_url":"https://fdc.nal.usda.gov/food-details/172804/nutrients"},{"ingredient":"Extrato de baunilha","edible_grams":5,"fdc_id":173471,"fdc_description":"Vanilla extract","per_100g":{"fat_g":0.06,"carbs_g":12.65,"calories":288.0,"protein_g":0.06,"fiber_g":0.0,"sodium_mg":9.0,"saturated_fat_g":0.01,"sugar_g":12.65},"source_url":"https://fdc.nal.usda.gov/food-details/173471/nutrients"},{"ingredient":"Raspas de limão","edible_grams":3,"fdc_id":167749,"fdc_description":"Lemon peel, raw","per_100g":{"sugar_g":4.17,"calories":47.0,"saturated_fat_g":0.039,"fiber_g":10.6,"sodium_mg":6.0,"protein_g":1.5,"fat_g":0.3,"carbs_g":16.0},"source_url":"https://fdc.nal.usda.gov/food-details/167749/nutrients"},{"ingredient":"Doce de leite","edible_grams":350,"fdc_id":173461,"fdc_description":"Dulce de Leche","per_100g":{"fiber_g":0.0,"sugar_g":49.74,"fat_g":7.35,"carbs_g":55.35,"calories":315.0,"protein_g":6.84,"sodium_mg":129.0,"saturated_fat_g":4.534},"source_url":"https://fdc.nal.usda.gov/food-details/173461/nutrients"},{"ingredient":"Coco ralado seco sem açúcar","edible_grams":30,"fdc_id":170170,"fdc_description":"Nuts, coconut meat, dried (desiccated), not sweetened","per_100g":{"fiber_g":16.3,"fat_g":64.53,"calories":660.0,"protein_g":6.88,"sodium_mg":37.0,"saturated_fat_g":57.218,"sugar_g":7.35,"carbs_g":23.65},"source_url":"https://fdc.nal.usda.gov/food-details/170170/nutrients"}],"serving_size":"1 dos 20 alfajores","method":"Dez fichas USDA verificadas por 100 g são ponderadas pelos pesos de todos os ingredientes e divididas por 20. Todo o recheio e o coco previstos são incluídos; a perda de água ao assar não é descontada do aporte total.","note":"Estimativa informativa, não análise do alfajor pronto. As marcas de doce de leite, manteiga e fermento mudam o resultado. Toda a massa, o recheio e o coco são considerados consumidos; restos nos utensílios reduziriam o aporte real."},"keywords":["alfajores de amido de milho","biscoitos com doce de leite","alfajores com coco"],"image_url":"/recetas/receta-de-alfajores-de-maicena/portada.webp","gallery":[{"url":"/recetas/receta-de-alfajores-de-maicena/portada.webp","alt":"Alfajores claros com doce de leite e coco na borda, um partido mostrando o recheio"}],"seo":{"title":"Alfajores de amido de milho com doce de leite","description":"Prepare 20 alfajores de amido de milho com doce de leite e coco. Veja medidas, massa com gemas, descanso na geladeira e biscoitos em duas fornadas.","image_alt":"Alfajores claros com doce de leite e coco na borda, um partido mostrando o recheio","image_variants":["/recetas/receta-de-alfajores-de-maicena/portada-1x1.webp","/recetas/receta-de-alfajores-de-maicena/portada-4x3.webp","/recetas/receta-de-alfajores-de-maicena/portada-16x9.webp"],"faq":[{"q":"Por que os biscoitos quebram?","a":"São frágeis ao sair do forno. Deixe 5 minutos na assadeira, mova com uma espátula larga e espere esfriar totalmente antes de rechear. Sovar demais ou abrir muito fino também muda a textura."},{"q":"Posso usar farinha de milho no lugar do amido?","a":"Não como troca direta. Esta receita usa amido branco; a farinha de milho amarela tem composição e textura diferentes. A receita também contém farinha de trigo."},{"q":"O que fazer se o doce de leite estiver muito líquido?","a":"Use um doce de leite espesso de confeitaria para sustentar os biscoitos. Não recheie enquanto estiverem quentes. Trocar o recheio pode mudar consistência, conservação e nutrição."}]},"published":false,"editorial_status":"draft","content_html":"<p>Estes alfajores combinam dois biscoitos delicados de amido de milho e farinha de trigo, recheio de doce de leite e coco apenas na borda. Raspas de limão e baunilha perfumam a massa com gemas.</p><p>A proposta rende 20 alfajores de cerca de 5 cm: 40 discos com 6 mm de espessura, assados em duas fornadas. Os 130 minutos estimados incluem 30 minutos na geladeira e 30 de resfriamento. Quantidades, rendimento e tempos ainda precisam de confirmação em teste na cozinha.</p>"},{"id":"9fb02391-f9aa-4dd1-bc03-eb8abe6a67f8","recipe_group_id":"b67728b9-bce4-4c97-b366-528cd318140a","slug":"barras-de-cereal","public_path":"/barras-de-cereal","source_url":"https://manualdecocina.com/barras-de-cereal/","language":"es","title":"Barras de cereal con avena, miel y cacahuete","excerpt":"Barras de cereal con avena, miel, cacahuete y pasas: cantidades para 12, tostado en sartén, compactado y enfriado antes de cortar, paso a paso.","summary":"Estas barras de cereal combinan copos de avena tostados, almendras, semillas de girasol y pasas, ligados con miel y crema de cacahuete. Se compactan en un molde y se cortan después de enfriar; la placa no se hornea.\n\nLa propuesta rinde 12 barras blandas y compactas, no crujientes. Los 165 minutos estimados incluyen 10 de cocción, 15 de enfriado y al menos 120 en la nevera. Cantidades, firmeza, rendimiento y tiempos están pendientes de confirmar con una prueba de cocina.","category":"Postres","category_slug":"postres","difficulty":"Fácil","course":"Merienda dulce","cuisine":"Internacional","prep_time_minutes":20,"cook_time_minutes":10,"total_time_minutes":165,"servings":12,"ingredients":[{"name":"copos de avena secos","amount":"200","unit":"g","group":"Mezcla seca"},{"name":"crema de cacahuete suave sin sal","amount":"100","unit":"g","group":"Para ligar"},{"name":"miel","amount":"100","unit":"g","group":"Para ligar"},{"name":"almendras","amount":"50","unit":"g","group":"Mezcla seca"},{"name":"pasas oscuras sin semillas","amount":"50","unit":"g","group":"Mezcla seca"},{"name":"semillas de girasol peladas","amount":"30","unit":"g","group":"Mezcla seca"},{"name":"extracto de vainilla","amount":"3","unit":"g","group":"Para ligar"},{"name":"sal","amount":"1","unit":"g","group":"Para ligar"}],"steps":[{"title":"Prepara el molde y pesa","content":"Lávate las manos y limpia la superficie. Forra un molde cuadrado de 20 × 20 cm con papel de horno, dejando solapas para levantar la mezcla. Pesa los ingredientes y pica los 50 g de almendras en trozos de unos 5 mm; corta las pasas grandes para que no rompan las barras. Remueve la crema de cacahuete en su envase hasta integrar el aceite separado. Usa copos de avena aptos para este uso según su envase, no grano de avena entero.","image_url":"/recetas/barras-de-cereal/paso-01.webp","image_alt":"Barras de cereal: prepara el molde y pesa"},{"title":"Tuesta la avena y las semillas","content":"Calienta una sartén amplia y seca a fuego medio-bajo. Añade los 200 g de copos de avena, 50 g de almendras y 30 g de semillas de girasol. Remueve casi continuamente durante unos 8 minutos, hasta que desprendan aroma y tomen algo de color sin quemarse. Si se doran demasiado rápido, baja el fuego. Pasa a un cuenco grande y deja templar mientras preparas la mezcla ligante.","image_url":"/recetas/barras-de-cereal/paso-02.webp","image_alt":"Barras de cereal: tuesta la avena y las semillas"},{"title":"Calienta la miel con la crema","content":"Pon los 100 g de miel y 100 g de crema de cacahuete en un cazo. Calienta a fuego bajo unos 2 minutos, removiendo hasta que estén fluidos y uniformes, sin hervir ni caramelizar. Retira del fuego y añade los 3 g de vainilla y 1 g de sal. La mezcla caliente puede quemar; manéjala con una espátula, sin tocarla con los dedos.","image_url":"/recetas/barras-de-cereal/paso-03.webp","image_alt":"Barras de cereal: calienta la miel con la crema"},{"title":"Integra las pasas y el ligante","content":"Añade los 50 g de pasas al cuenco de avena templada. Vierte toda la mezcla de miel y cacahuete y remueve con una espátula durante 1–2 minutos, raspando fondo y paredes, hasta que cada copo esté recubierto y no queden bolsas secas. Debe ser una mezcla pegajosa que se aglomere al presionar con la espátula, no un líquido ni una masa batida.","image_url":"/recetas/barras-de-cereal/paso-04.webp","image_alt":"Barras de cereal: integra las pasas y el ligante"},{"title":"Compacta en una capa uniforme","content":"Vuelca en el molde forrado y reparte hasta las esquinas. Coloca otra hoja de papel encima y presiona con la base plana de un vaso o una espátula durante 2–3 minutos. Busca una capa de alrededor de 1–1,5 cm sin huecos, especialmente en los bordes. La presión es importante para que las barras no se desmiguen; no añadas líquido para ablandarlas.","image_url":"/recetas/barras-de-cereal/paso-05.webp","image_alt":"Barras de cereal: compacta en una capa uniforme"},{"title":"Enfría y refrigera antes de cortar","content":"Deja el molde unos 15 minutos a temperatura ambiente para perder el calor intenso. Tapa y refrigera a 4 °C o menos durante al menos 120 minutos, hasta que toda la placa esté firme y fría. El tiempo puede aumentar según la nevera y el grosor; no cortes mientras esté tibia. Los 165 minutos totales previstos incluyen este enfriado y la refrigeración.","image_url":"/recetas/barras-de-cereal/paso-06.webp","image_alt":"Barras de cereal: enfría y refrigera antes de cortar"},{"title":"Corta doce barras","content":"Levanta la placa fría por las solapas y colócala en una tabla limpia. Retira el papel superior y corta con un cuchillo grande en 3 filas y 4 columnas, obteniendo 12 barras de unos 6,7 × 5 cm. Presiona el cuchillo hacia abajo en lugar de serrar; limpia la hoja entre cortes si se pega. Si la placa se ablanda, vuelve a refrigerarla antes de continuar. Las migas se pueden servir aparte con yogur, sin contar ese añadido en la nutrición.","image_url":"/recetas/barras-de-cereal/paso-07.webp","image_alt":"Barras de cereal: corta doce barras"},{"title":"Sirve y conserva en frío","content":"Sirve las barras frías o deja templar solo la porción que vas a comer. Envuelve cada una o guarda en un recipiente cerrado con papel entre capas, a 4 °C o menos, hasta 5 días; respeta una indicación más corta de cualquiera de los ingredientes. Para congelar, envuelve individualmente hasta 1 mes y descongela en la nevera. Son duraciones propuestas, no un ensayo de vida útil. Se ablandan con calor y no se diseñaron para permanecer firmes durante horas fuera de la nevera.","image_url":"/recetas/barras-de-cereal/paso-08.webp","image_alt":"Barras de cereal: sirve y conserva en frío"}],"notes":"Usa crema de cacahuete suave, sin sal y sin azúcar añadido; una muy líquida o con otra formulación cambia la firmeza. Puedes sustituir las pasas por la misma cantidad de albaricoque seco picado, pero cambiarán nutrición y textura. Cambiar la miel por otro jarabe o el cacahuete por otra crema requiere comprobar de nuevo el ligado y los alérgenos; no se promete el mismo resultado. Contiene cacahuete y almendras, y la avena puede tener contaminación con gluten: comprueba los envases si es relevante. Mantén las barras frías para transportarlas y no las presentes como alimento sin azúcar: llevan miel y fruta seca.","nutrition":{"calories":190.2,"protein_g":5.6,"carbs_g":24.7,"fat_g":8.7,"saturated_fat_g":1.3,"fiber_g":3.0,"sugar_g":10.9,"sodium_mg":36.0,"estimated":true,"source":"USDA FoodData Central — SR Legacy (abril de 2018)","source_url":"https://fdc.nal.usda.gov/download-datasets/","inputs":[{"ingredient":"copos de avena secos","edible_grams":200,"fdc_id":173904,"fdc_description":"Cereals, oats, regular and quick, not fortified, dry","per_100g":{"saturated_fat_g":1.11,"fiber_g":10.1,"sugar_g":0.99,"fat_g":6.52,"carbs_g":67.7,"calories":379.0,"sodium_mg":6.0,"protein_g":13.15},"source_url":"https://fdc.nal.usda.gov/food-details/173904/nutrients"},{"ingredient":"crema de cacahuete suave sin sal","edible_grams":100,"fdc_id":172470,"fdc_description":"Peanut butter, smooth style, without salt","per_100g":{"sodium_mg":17.0,"saturated_fat_g":10.325,"protein_g":22.21,"fiber_g":5.0,"sugar_g":10.49,"fat_g":51.36,"carbs_g":22.31,"calories":598.0},"source_url":"https://fdc.nal.usda.gov/food-details/172470/nutrients"},{"ingredient":"miel","edible_grams":100,"fdc_id":169640,"fdc_description":"Honey","per_100g":{"saturated_fat_g":0.0,"protein_g":0.3,"fiber_g":0.2,"sodium_mg":4.0,"fat_g":0.0,"carbs_g":82.4,"calories":304.0,"sugar_g":82.12},"source_url":"https://fdc.nal.usda.gov/food-details/169640/nutrients"},{"ingredient":"almendras","edible_grams":50,"fdc_id":170567,"fdc_description":"Nuts, almonds","per_100g":{"protein_g":21.15,"fiber_g":12.5,"saturated_fat_g":3.802,"fat_g":49.93,"carbs_g":21.55,"calories":579.0,"sodium_mg":1.0,"sugar_g":4.35},"source_url":"https://fdc.nal.usda.gov/food-details/170567/nutrients"},{"ingredient":"pasas oscuras sin semillas","edible_grams":50,"fdc_id":168165,"fdc_description":"Raisins, dark, seedless (Includes foods for USDA's Food Distribution Program)","per_100g":{"saturated_fat_g":0.094,"fiber_g":4.5,"sodium_mg":26.0,"protein_g":3.3,"fat_g":0.25,"carbs_g":79.32,"sugar_g":65.18,"calories":299.0},"source_url":"https://fdc.nal.usda.gov/food-details/168165/nutrients"},{"ingredient":"semillas de girasol peladas","edible_grams":30,"fdc_id":170562,"fdc_description":"Seeds, sunflower seed kernels, dried","per_100g":{"saturated_fat_g":4.455,"protein_g":20.78,"fiber_g":8.6,"sodium_mg":9.0,"fat_g":51.46,"sugar_g":2.62,"carbs_g":20.0,"calories":584.0},"source_url":"https://fdc.nal.usda.gov/food-details/170562/nutrients"},{"ingredient":"extracto de vainilla","edible_grams":3,"fdc_id":173471,"fdc_description":"Vanilla extract","per_100g":{"fat_g":0.06,"carbs_g":12.65,"calories":288.0,"protein_g":0.06,"fiber_g":0.0,"sodium_mg":9.0,"saturated_fat_g":0.01,"sugar_g":12.65},"source_url":"https://fdc.nal.usda.gov/food-details/173471/nutrients"},{"ingredient":"sal","edible_grams":1,"fdc_id":173468,"fdc_description":"Salt, table","per_100g":{"fiber_g":0.0,"sodium_mg":38758.0,"saturated_fat_g":0.0,"protein_g":0.0,"fat_g":0.0,"carbs_g":0.0,"calories":0.0,"sugar_g":0.0},"source_url":"https://fdc.nal.usda.gov/food-details/173468/nutrients"}],"serving_size":"1 de 12 barras, unos 44 g antes de pérdidas de agua","method":"Ocho fichas USDA verificadas por 100 g, ponderadas por los pesos de ingredientes y divididas entre 12. La ficha de avena corresponde a copos regulares o rápidos secos sin fortificar; no a avena cocida. Se supone crema de cacahuete sin sal y sin añadidos; el tostado no descuenta nutrientes del lote.","note":"Estimación informativa, no análisis del producto preparado. Marca de la crema, tamaño de corte y restos de mezcla alteran el resultado. Las cifras incluyen toda la miel y no equivalen a una declaración de bajo contenido de azúcar."},"keywords":["barras de cereal","barritas de avena y miel","barras de cacahuete y pasas"],"image_url":"/recetas/barras-de-cereal/portada.webp","gallery":[{"url":"/recetas/barras-de-cereal/portada.webp","alt":"Barras rectangulares de avena con almendras, semillas y pasas visibles, sin chocolate ni cobertura"}],"seo":{"title":"Barras de cereal con avena, miel y cacahuete","description":"Barras de cereal con avena, miel, cacahuete y pasas: cantidades para 12, tostado en sartén, compactado y enfriado antes de cortar, paso a paso.","image_alt":"Barras rectangulares de avena con almendras, semillas y pasas visibles, sin chocolate ni cobertura","image_variants":["/recetas/barras-de-cereal/portada-1x1.webp","/recetas/barras-de-cereal/portada-4x3.webp","/recetas/barras-de-cereal/portada-16x9.webp"],"faq":[{"q":"¿Por qué se deshacen al cortarlas?","a":"La mezcla necesita suficiente presión y frío. Compacta también las esquinas y refrigera al menos 120 minutos, o más si sigue blanda. Una crema de cacahuete muy líquida y cortes tibios cambian el resultado."},{"q":"¿Se hornean las barras?","a":"No se hornea la placa. Se tuestan avena, almendras y semillas en sartén y se calienta el ligante; después se compacta y se refrigera."},{"q":"¿Puedo llevarlas sin refrigeración?","a":"Esta propuesta se conserva en frío y se ablanda con calor. Para transportarla usa un recipiente con acumulador de frío y saca solo la porción que vayas a comer; no se verificó estabilidad prolongada a temperatura ambiente."}]},"published":false,"editorial_status":"draft","content_html":"<p>Estas barras de cereal combinan copos de avena tostados, almendras, semillas de girasol y pasas, ligados con miel y crema de cacahuete. Se compactan en un molde y se cortan después de enfriar; la placa no se hornea.</p><p>La propuesta rinde 12 barras blandas y compactas, no crujientes. Los 165 minutos estimados incluyen 10 de cocción, 15 de enfriado y al menos 120 en la nevera. Cantidades, firmeza, rendimiento y tiempos están pendientes de confirmar con una prueba de cocina.</p>"},{"id":"d51076bb-1068-506d-8cd6-1656a7f6fd5d","recipe_group_id":"b67728b9-bce4-4c97-b366-528cd318140a","slug":"musliriegel","public_path":"/de/musliriegel","source_url":"https://manualdecocina.com/de/musliriegel/","language":"de","title":"Müsliriegel mit Hafer, Honig und Erdnuss","excerpt":"12 Müsliriegel mit Hafer, Honig, Erdnussmus und Rosinen: Rösten in der Pfanne, festes Andrücken und gründliches Kühlen vor dem Schneiden.","summary":"Diese Müsliriegel verbinden geröstete Haferflocken, Mandeln, Sonnenblumenkerne und Rosinen mit Honig und Erdnussmus. Die Mischung wird in eine Form gedrückt und nach dem Kühlen geschnitten; die Platte wird nicht gebacken.\n\nDer Vorschlag ergibt 12 weiche, kompakte Riegel, keine knusprigen. Die geschätzten 165 Minuten enthalten 10 Minuten Garen, 15 Minuten Abkühlen und mindestens 120 Minuten im Kühlschrank. Mengen, Festigkeit, Ausbeute und Zeiten sind noch nicht durch einen Küchentest bestätigt.","category":"Desserts","category_slug":"postres","difficulty":"Einfach","course":"Süßer Snack","cuisine":"International","prep_time_minutes":20,"cook_time_minutes":10,"total_time_minutes":165,"servings":12,"ingredients":[{"name":"Trockene Haferflocken","amount":"200","unit":"g","group":"Trockene Mischung"},{"name":"Glattes ungesalzenes Erdnussmus","amount":"100","unit":"g","group":"Zum Binden"},{"name":"Honig","amount":"100","unit":"g","group":"Zum Binden"},{"name":"Mandeln","amount":"50","unit":"g","group":"Trockene Mischung"},{"name":"Dunkle kernlose Rosinen","amount":"50","unit":"g","group":"Trockene Mischung"},{"name":"Geschälte Sonnenblumenkerne","amount":"30","unit":"g","group":"Trockene Mischung"},{"name":"Vanilleextrakt","amount":"3","unit":"g","group":"Zum Binden"},{"name":"Salz","amount":"1","unit":"g","group":"Zum Binden"}],"steps":[{"title":"Form vorbereiten und Zutaten wiegen","content":"Hände waschen und die Arbeitsfläche reinigen. Eine quadratische Form von 20 × 20 cm mit Backpapier auslegen und überstehende Laschen zum Herausheben lassen. Zutaten wiegen und 50 g Mandeln in etwa 5 mm große Stücke hacken; große Rosinen zerkleinern, damit sie die Riegel nicht aufreißen. Erdnussmus im Glas verrühren, bis abgesetztes Öl wieder eingebunden ist. Laut Packung für diese Verwendung geeignete Haferflocken verwenden, keine ganzen Haferkörner.","image_url":"/recetas/barras-de-cereal/paso-01.webp","image_alt":"Müsliriegel mit Hafer, Honig und Erdnuss: Form vorbereiten und Zutaten wiegen"},{"title":"Hafer und Kerne rösten","content":"Eine breite trockene Pfanne bei mittlerer bis niedriger Hitze erwärmen. 200 g Haferflocken, 50 g Mandeln und 30 g Sonnenblumenkerne zugeben. Etwa 8 Minuten fast ständig rühren, bis sie duften und etwas Farbe annehmen, ohne zu verbrennen. Bei schneller Bräunung die Hitze senken. In eine große Schüssel geben und leicht abkühlen lassen, während die Bindemischung entsteht.","image_url":"/recetas/barras-de-cereal/paso-02.webp","image_alt":"Müsliriegel mit Hafer, Honig und Erdnuss: Hafer und Kerne rösten"},{"title":"Honig und Erdnussmus erwärmen","content":"100 g Honig und 100 g Erdnussmus in einen kleinen Topf geben. Bei niedriger Hitze etwa 2 Minuten unter Rühren erwärmen, bis die Mischung flüssiger und gleichmäßig ist, ohne Kochen oder Karamellisieren. Vom Herd nehmen und 3 g Vanille sowie 1 g Salz zugeben. Die heiße Mischung kann verbrennen; mit einem Teigschaber statt den Fingern bearbeiten.","image_url":"/recetas/barras-de-cereal/paso-03.webp","image_alt":"Müsliriegel mit Hafer, Honig und Erdnuss: Honig und Erdnussmus erwärmen"},{"title":"Rosinen und Bindemischung einarbeiten","content":"50 g Rosinen zum lauwarmen Hafer geben. Die gesamte Honig-Erdnuss-Mischung zugießen und 1–2 Minuten mit einem Teigschaber rühren, dabei Boden und Wände abstreifen, bis jede Flocke überzogen ist und keine trockenen Stellen bleiben. Die klebrige Mischung soll beim Drücken mit dem Teigschaber zusammenhaften, nicht flüssig oder aufgeschlagen sein.","image_url":"/recetas/barras-de-cereal/paso-04.webp","image_alt":"Müsliriegel mit Hafer, Honig und Erdnuss: Rosinen und Bindemischung einarbeiten"},{"title":"Gleichmäßig festdrücken","content":"In die vorbereitete Form geben und bis in die Ecken verteilen. Einen zweiten Papierbogen auflegen und 2–3 Minuten mit dem flachen Glasboden oder einem Teigschaber festdrücken. Eine etwa 1–1,5 cm dicke Schicht ohne Lücken, besonders an den Rändern, anstreben. Druck verhindert Zerbröseln; keine Flüssigkeit zum Weichmachen ergänzen.","image_url":"/recetas/barras-de-cereal/paso-05.webp","image_alt":"Müsliriegel mit Hafer, Honig und Erdnuss: Gleichmäßig festdrücken"},{"title":"Abkühlen und vor dem Schneiden kühlen","content":"Die Form etwa 15 Minuten bei Raumtemperatur stehen lassen, damit die starke Hitze entweicht. Abdecken und mindestens 120 Minuten bei höchstens 4 °C kühlen, bis die ganze Platte fest und kalt ist. Kühlschrank und Dicke können längeres Kühlen erfordern; nicht lauwarm schneiden. Die vorgeschlagenen 165 Minuten Gesamtzeit enthalten Abkühlen und Kühlen.","image_url":"/recetas/barras-de-cereal/paso-06.webp","image_alt":"Müsliriegel mit Hafer, Honig und Erdnuss: Abkühlen und vor dem Schneiden kühlen"},{"title":"Zwölf Riegel schneiden","content":"Die kalte Platte an den Papierlaschen herausheben und auf ein sauberes Brett legen. Oberes Papier entfernen und mit einem großen Messer in 3 Reihen und 4 Spalten schneiden: 12 Riegel von etwa 6,7 × 5 cm. Messer nach unten drücken statt sägen; bei Kleben zwischen Schnitten reinigen. Wird die Platte weich, vor dem Fortfahren erneut kühlen. Krümel können separat mit Joghurt serviert werden; dieser Zusatz ist nicht in den Nährwerten enthalten.","image_url":"/recetas/barras-de-cereal/paso-07.webp","image_alt":"Müsliriegel mit Hafer, Honig und Erdnuss: Zwölf Riegel schneiden"},{"title":"Servieren und kalt aufbewahren","content":"Riegel kalt servieren oder nur die zu essende Portion kurz temperieren. Einzeln einwickeln oder in einem geschlossenen Behälter mit Papier zwischen Lagen bei höchstens 4 °C bis zu 5 Tage lagern; kürzere Vorgaben einer Zutatenpackung beachten. Zum Einfrieren einzeln verpacken, höchstens 1 Monat lagern und im Kühlschrank auftauen. Dies sind vorgeschlagene Zeiten, keine Haltbarkeitsprüfung. Bei Wärme werden sie weich und sollen nicht stundenlang außerhalb des Kühlschranks fest bleiben.","image_url":"/recetas/barras-de-cereal/paso-08.webp","image_alt":"Müsliriegel mit Hafer, Honig und Erdnuss: Servieren und kalt aufbewahren"}],"notes":"Glattes ungesalzenes Erdnussmus ohne Zuckerzusatz verwenden; sehr flüssige Produkte oder andere Rezepturen ändern die Festigkeit. Rosinen können durch dieselbe Menge gehackter getrockneter Aprikosen ersetzt werden, aber Textur und Nährwerte ändern sich. Honig durch anderen Sirup oder Erdnussmus durch andere Creme zu ersetzen erfordert eine neue Prüfung von Bindung und Allergenen; gleiches Ergebnis wird nicht zugesagt. Enthält Erdnüsse und Mandeln; Hafer kann Glutenkontakt haben, daher bei Bedarf Packungen prüfen. Zum Transport kalt halten und nicht als zuckerfrei darstellen: Honig und Trockenfrüchte sind enthalten.","nutrition":{"calories":190.2,"protein_g":5.6,"carbs_g":24.7,"fat_g":8.7,"saturated_fat_g":1.3,"fiber_g":3.0,"sugar_g":10.9,"sodium_mg":36.0,"estimated":true,"source":"USDA FoodData Central — SR Legacy (abril de 2018)","source_url":"https://fdc.nal.usda.gov/download-datasets/","inputs":[{"ingredient":"Trockene Haferflocken","edible_grams":200,"fdc_id":173904,"fdc_description":"Cereals, oats, regular and quick, not fortified, dry","per_100g":{"saturated_fat_g":1.11,"fiber_g":10.1,"sugar_g":0.99,"fat_g":6.52,"carbs_g":67.7,"calories":379.0,"sodium_mg":6.0,"protein_g":13.15},"source_url":"https://fdc.nal.usda.gov/food-details/173904/nutrients"},{"ingredient":"Glattes ungesalzenes Erdnussmus","edible_grams":100,"fdc_id":172470,"fdc_description":"Peanut butter, smooth style, without salt","per_100g":{"sodium_mg":17.0,"saturated_fat_g":10.325,"protein_g":22.21,"fiber_g":5.0,"sugar_g":10.49,"fat_g":51.36,"carbs_g":22.31,"calories":598.0},"source_url":"https://fdc.nal.usda.gov/food-details/172470/nutrients"},{"ingredient":"Honig","edible_grams":100,"fdc_id":169640,"fdc_description":"Honey","per_100g":{"saturated_fat_g":0.0,"protein_g":0.3,"fiber_g":0.2,"sodium_mg":4.0,"fat_g":0.0,"carbs_g":82.4,"calories":304.0,"sugar_g":82.12},"source_url":"https://fdc.nal.usda.gov/food-details/169640/nutrients"},{"ingredient":"Mandeln","edible_grams":50,"fdc_id":170567,"fdc_description":"Nuts, almonds","per_100g":{"protein_g":21.15,"fiber_g":12.5,"saturated_fat_g":3.802,"fat_g":49.93,"carbs_g":21.55,"calories":579.0,"sodium_mg":1.0,"sugar_g":4.35},"source_url":"https://fdc.nal.usda.gov/food-details/170567/nutrients"},{"ingredient":"Dunkle kernlose Rosinen","edible_grams":50,"fdc_id":168165,"fdc_description":"Raisins, dark, seedless (Includes foods for USDA's Food Distribution Program)","per_100g":{"saturated_fat_g":0.094,"fiber_g":4.5,"sodium_mg":26.0,"protein_g":3.3,"fat_g":0.25,"carbs_g":79.32,"sugar_g":65.18,"calories":299.0},"source_url":"https://fdc.nal.usda.gov/food-details/168165/nutrients"},{"ingredient":"Geschälte Sonnenblumenkerne","edible_grams":30,"fdc_id":170562,"fdc_description":"Seeds, sunflower seed kernels, dried","per_100g":{"saturated_fat_g":4.455,"protein_g":20.78,"fiber_g":8.6,"sodium_mg":9.0,"fat_g":51.46,"sugar_g":2.62,"carbs_g":20.0,"calories":584.0},"source_url":"https://fdc.nal.usda.gov/food-details/170562/nutrients"},{"ingredient":"Vanilleextrakt","edible_grams":3,"fdc_id":173471,"fdc_description":"Vanilla extract","per_100g":{"fat_g":0.06,"carbs_g":12.65,"calories":288.0,"protein_g":0.06,"fiber_g":0.0,"sodium_mg":9.0,"saturated_fat_g":0.01,"sugar_g":12.65},"source_url":"https://fdc.nal.usda.gov/food-details/173471/nutrients"},{"ingredient":"Salz","edible_grams":1,"fdc_id":173468,"fdc_description":"Salt, table","per_100g":{"fiber_g":0.0,"sodium_mg":38758.0,"saturated_fat_g":0.0,"protein_g":0.0,"fat_g":0.0,"carbs_g":0.0,"calories":0.0,"sugar_g":0.0},"source_url":"https://fdc.nal.usda.gov/food-details/173468/nutrients"}],"serving_size":"1 von 12 Riegeln, etwa 44 g vor Wasserverlust","method":"Acht überprüfte USDA-Einträge je 100 g werden nach Zutatengewichten gewichtet und durch 12 geteilt. Der Hafereintrag gilt für trockene, nicht angereicherte normale oder schnelle Flocken, nicht gekochten Hafer. Ungesalzenes Erdnussmus ohne Zusätze wird angenommen; Rösten zieht keine Nährstoffe vom gesamten Ansatz ab.","note":"Informative Schätzung, keine Analyse der fertigen Riegel. Marke des Erdnussmuses, Schnittgröße und Reste verändern das Ergebnis. Der gesamte Honig ist eingerechnet; die Zahlen sind keine Aussage über niedrigen Zuckergehalt."},"keywords":["Müsliriegel","Hafer Honig Riegel","Erdnuss Rosinen Riegel"],"image_url":"/recetas/barras-de-cereal/portada.webp","gallery":[{"url":"/recetas/barras-de-cereal/portada.webp","alt":"Rechteckige Haferriegel mit sichtbaren Mandeln, Kernen und Rosinen, ohne Schokolade oder Überzug"}],"seo":{"title":"Müsliriegel mit Hafer, Honig und Erdnuss","description":"12 Müsliriegel mit Hafer, Honig, Erdnussmus und Rosinen: Rösten in der Pfanne, festes Andrücken und gründliches Kühlen vor dem Schneiden.","image_alt":"Rechteckige Haferriegel mit sichtbaren Mandeln, Kernen und Rosinen, ohne Schokolade oder Überzug","image_variants":["/recetas/barras-de-cereal/portada-1x1.webp","/recetas/barras-de-cereal/portada-4x3.webp","/recetas/barras-de-cereal/portada-16x9.webp"],"faq":[{"q":"Warum zerfallen sie beim Schneiden?","a":"Die Mischung braucht Druck und Kälte. Auch die Ecken festdrücken und mindestens 120 Minuten kühlen, länger wenn noch weich. Sehr flüssiges Erdnussmus und lauwarmes Schneiden verändern das Ergebnis."},{"q":"Werden die Riegel gebacken?","a":"Die Platte wird nicht gebacken. Hafer, Mandeln und Kerne werden in der Pfanne geröstet, die Bindemischung erwärmt; anschließend wird festgedrückt und gekühlt."},{"q":"Kann ich sie ohne Kühlung mitnehmen?","a":"Dieser Vorschlag wird kalt gelagert und bei Wärme weich. Für den Transport einen Behälter mit Kühlakku nutzen und nur die zu essende Portion herausnehmen; längere Stabilität bei Raumtemperatur ist nicht geprüft."}]},"published":false,"editorial_status":"draft","content_html":"<p>Diese Müsliriegel verbinden geröstete Haferflocken, Mandeln, Sonnenblumenkerne und Rosinen mit Honig und Erdnussmus. Die Mischung wird in eine Form gedrückt und nach dem Kühlen geschnitten; die Platte wird nicht gebacken.</p><p>Der Vorschlag ergibt 12 weiche, kompakte Riegel, keine knusprigen. Die geschätzten 165 Minuten enthalten 10 Minuten Garen, 15 Minuten Abkühlen und mindestens 120 Minuten im Kühlschrank. Mengen, Festigkeit, Ausbeute und Zeiten sind noch nicht durch einen Küchentest bestätigt.</p>"},{"id":"57994885-5dc1-5004-bc2f-1b437aa7c8c4","recipe_group_id":"b67728b9-bce4-4c97-b366-528cd318140a","slug":"cereal-bars","public_path":"/en/cereal-bars","source_url":"https://manualdecocina.com/en/cereal-bars/","language":"en","title":"Oat cereal bars with honey and peanut butter","excerpt":"Make 12 oat cereal bars with honey, peanut butter and raisins. Follow pan-toasting, firm pressing and thorough chilling before cutting, step by step.","summary":"These cereal bars combine toasted rolled oats, almonds, sunflower seeds and raisins, bound with honey and peanut butter. The mixture is pressed into a tin and cut after chilling; the slab is not baked.\n\nThe proposal makes 12 soft, compact bars rather than crunchy ones. The estimated 165 minutes include 10 minutes of cooking, 15 of cooling and at least 120 in the refrigerator. Quantities, firmness, yield and times still need confirmation in a kitchen test.","category":"Desserts","category_slug":"postres","difficulty":"Easy","course":"Sweet snack","cuisine":"International","prep_time_minutes":20,"cook_time_minutes":10,"total_time_minutes":165,"servings":12,"ingredients":[{"name":"Dry rolled oats","amount":"200","unit":"g","group":"Dry mixture"},{"name":"Smooth unsalted peanut butter","amount":"100","unit":"g","group":"Binder"},{"name":"Honey","amount":"100","unit":"g","group":"Binder"},{"name":"Almonds","amount":"50","unit":"g","group":"Dry mixture"},{"name":"Dark seedless raisins","amount":"50","unit":"g","group":"Dry mixture"},{"name":"Shelled sunflower seeds","amount":"30","unit":"g","group":"Dry mixture"},{"name":"Vanilla extract","amount":"3","unit":"g","group":"Binder"},{"name":"Salt","amount":"1","unit":"g","group":"Binder"}],"steps":[{"title":"Prepare the tin and weigh","content":"Wash your hands and clean the work surface. Line a 20 × 20 cm square tin with baking parchment, leaving handles to lift the mixture. Weigh the ingredients and chop the 50 g almonds into about 5 mm pieces; cut large raisins so they do not tear the bars apart. Stir the peanut butter in its jar to reincorporate separated oil. Use rolled oats suitable for this preparation according to their label, not whole oat groats.","image_url":"/recetas/barras-de-cereal/paso-01.webp","image_alt":"Oat cereal bars with honey and peanut butter: Prepare the tin and weigh"},{"title":"Toast the oats and seeds","content":"Heat a wide dry frying pan over medium-low heat. Add the 200 g rolled oats, 50 g almonds and 30 g sunflower seeds. Stir almost continuously for about 8 minutes until fragrant and lightly coloured, without burning. Lower the heat if they brown too quickly. Transfer to a large bowl and let cool slightly while preparing the binder.","image_url":"/recetas/barras-de-cereal/paso-02.webp","image_alt":"Oat cereal bars with honey and peanut butter: Toast the oats and seeds"},{"title":"Warm the honey and peanut butter","content":"Put the 100 g honey and 100 g peanut butter in a small saucepan. Heat gently for about 2 minutes, stirring until fluid and smooth, without boiling or caramelising. Remove from the heat and add the 3 g vanilla and 1 g salt. The hot mixture can burn; handle it with a spatula rather than your fingers.","image_url":"/recetas/barras-de-cereal/paso-03.webp","image_alt":"Oat cereal bars with honey and peanut butter: Warm the honey and peanut butter"},{"title":"Mix in the raisins and binder","content":"Add the 50 g raisins to the bowl of warm oats. Pour in all the honey-peanut mixture and stir with a spatula for 1–2 minutes, scraping the bottom and sides, until every flake is coated and no dry pockets remain. The sticky mixture should hold together when pressed with the spatula; it should not be liquid or a whipped batter.","image_url":"/recetas/barras-de-cereal/paso-04.webp","image_alt":"Oat cereal bars with honey and peanut butter: Mix in the raisins and binder"},{"title":"Press into an even layer","content":"Transfer to the lined tin and spread into the corners. Lay another sheet of parchment on top and press with the flat bottom of a glass or a spatula for 2–3 minutes. Aim for a layer about 1–1.5 cm thick without gaps, especially around the edges. Firm pressure helps the bars hold together; do not add liquid to soften them.","image_url":"/recetas/barras-de-cereal/paso-05.webp","image_alt":"Oat cereal bars with honey and peanut butter: Press into an even layer"},{"title":"Cool and refrigerate before cutting","content":"Leave the tin at room temperature for about 15 minutes to lose its intense heat. Cover and refrigerate at 4 °C or below for at least 120 minutes, until the entire slab is cold and firm. It may take longer depending on the refrigerator and thickness; do not cut while warm. The proposed 165-minute total includes this cooling and chilling.","image_url":"/recetas/barras-de-cereal/paso-06.webp","image_alt":"Oat cereal bars with honey and peanut butter: Cool and refrigerate before cutting"},{"title":"Cut twelve bars","content":"Lift the cold slab out by the parchment handles and put it on a clean board. Remove the top paper and cut with a large knife into 3 rows and 4 columns, making 12 bars about 6.7 × 5 cm. Press the knife down rather than sawing; wipe the blade between cuts if sticky. If the slab softens, refrigerate again before continuing. Crumbs can be served separately with yogurt, which is not included in the nutrition calculation.","image_url":"/recetas/barras-de-cereal/paso-07.webp","image_alt":"Oat cereal bars with honey and peanut butter: Cut twelve bars"},{"title":"Serve and store chilled","content":"Serve the bars cold, or let only the portion you will eat warm slightly. Wrap individually or store in a closed container with paper between layers at 4 °C or below for up to 5 days; follow any shorter ingredient-label limit. To freeze, wrap individually for up to 1 month and thaw in the refrigerator. These are proposed storage periods, not shelf-life test results. The bars soften in heat and were not designed to stay firm for hours outside the refrigerator.","image_url":"/recetas/barras-de-cereal/paso-08.webp","image_alt":"Oat cereal bars with honey and peanut butter: Serve and store chilled"}],"notes":"Use smooth unsalted peanut butter without added sugar; a very runny product or different formula changes firmness. You can replace raisins with the same weight of chopped dried apricots, but nutrition and texture change. Switching honey to another syrup or peanut butter to another spread requires checking binding and allergens again; the same result is not promised. Contains peanuts and almonds; oats can have gluten cross-contact, so check labels when relevant. Keep bars chilled for transport and do not present them as sugar-free: they contain honey and dried fruit.","nutrition":{"calories":190.2,"protein_g":5.6,"carbs_g":24.7,"fat_g":8.7,"saturated_fat_g":1.3,"fiber_g":3.0,"sugar_g":10.9,"sodium_mg":36.0,"estimated":true,"source":"USDA FoodData Central — SR Legacy (abril de 2018)","source_url":"https://fdc.nal.usda.gov/download-datasets/","inputs":[{"ingredient":"Dry rolled oats","edible_grams":200,"fdc_id":173904,"fdc_description":"Cereals, oats, regular and quick, not fortified, dry","per_100g":{"saturated_fat_g":1.11,"fiber_g":10.1,"sugar_g":0.99,"fat_g":6.52,"carbs_g":67.7,"calories":379.0,"sodium_mg":6.0,"protein_g":13.15},"source_url":"https://fdc.nal.usda.gov/food-details/173904/nutrients"},{"ingredient":"Smooth unsalted peanut butter","edible_grams":100,"fdc_id":172470,"fdc_description":"Peanut butter, smooth style, without salt","per_100g":{"sodium_mg":17.0,"saturated_fat_g":10.325,"protein_g":22.21,"fiber_g":5.0,"sugar_g":10.49,"fat_g":51.36,"carbs_g":22.31,"calories":598.0},"source_url":"https://fdc.nal.usda.gov/food-details/172470/nutrients"},{"ingredient":"Honey","edible_grams":100,"fdc_id":169640,"fdc_description":"Honey","per_100g":{"saturated_fat_g":0.0,"protein_g":0.3,"fiber_g":0.2,"sodium_mg":4.0,"fat_g":0.0,"carbs_g":82.4,"calories":304.0,"sugar_g":82.12},"source_url":"https://fdc.nal.usda.gov/food-details/169640/nutrients"},{"ingredient":"Almonds","edible_grams":50,"fdc_id":170567,"fdc_description":"Nuts, almonds","per_100g":{"protein_g":21.15,"fiber_g":12.5,"saturated_fat_g":3.802,"fat_g":49.93,"carbs_g":21.55,"calories":579.0,"sodium_mg":1.0,"sugar_g":4.35},"source_url":"https://fdc.nal.usda.gov/food-details/170567/nutrients"},{"ingredient":"Dark seedless raisins","edible_grams":50,"fdc_id":168165,"fdc_description":"Raisins, dark, seedless (Includes foods for USDA's Food Distribution Program)","per_100g":{"saturated_fat_g":0.094,"fiber_g":4.5,"sodium_mg":26.0,"protein_g":3.3,"fat_g":0.25,"carbs_g":79.32,"sugar_g":65.18,"calories":299.0},"source_url":"https://fdc.nal.usda.gov/food-details/168165/nutrients"},{"ingredient":"Shelled sunflower seeds","edible_grams":30,"fdc_id":170562,"fdc_description":"Seeds, sunflower seed kernels, dried","per_100g":{"saturated_fat_g":4.455,"protein_g":20.78,"fiber_g":8.6,"sodium_mg":9.0,"fat_g":51.46,"sugar_g":2.62,"carbs_g":20.0,"calories":584.0},"source_url":"https://fdc.nal.usda.gov/food-details/170562/nutrients"},{"ingredient":"Vanilla extract","edible_grams":3,"fdc_id":173471,"fdc_description":"Vanilla extract","per_100g":{"fat_g":0.06,"carbs_g":12.65,"calories":288.0,"protein_g":0.06,"fiber_g":0.0,"sodium_mg":9.0,"saturated_fat_g":0.01,"sugar_g":12.65},"source_url":"https://fdc.nal.usda.gov/food-details/173471/nutrients"},{"ingredient":"Salt","edible_grams":1,"fdc_id":173468,"fdc_description":"Salt, table","per_100g":{"fiber_g":0.0,"sodium_mg":38758.0,"saturated_fat_g":0.0,"protein_g":0.0,"fat_g":0.0,"carbs_g":0.0,"calories":0.0,"sugar_g":0.0},"source_url":"https://fdc.nal.usda.gov/food-details/173468/nutrients"}],"serving_size":"1 of 12 bars, about 44 g before water loss","method":"Eight verified USDA entries per 100 g are weighted by ingredient amounts and divided by 12. The oat entry is for dry unfortified regular or quick oats, not cooked oats. Unsalted peanut butter without additions is assumed; toasting does not subtract nutrients from the batch.","note":"An informational estimate, not an analysis of the finished bars. Peanut butter brand, cut size and leftover mixture affect the result. All honey is included; these values do not constitute a low-sugar claim."},"keywords":["cereal bars","oat and honey bars","peanut butter raisin bars"],"image_url":"/recetas/barras-de-cereal/portada.webp","gallery":[{"url":"/recetas/barras-de-cereal/portada.webp","alt":"Rectangular oat cereal bars with visible almonds, seeds and raisins, without chocolate or coating"}],"seo":{"title":"Oat cereal bars with honey and peanut butter","description":"Make 12 oat cereal bars with honey, peanut butter and raisins. Follow pan-toasting, firm pressing and thorough chilling before cutting, step by step.","image_alt":"Rectangular oat cereal bars with visible almonds, seeds and raisins, without chocolate or coating","image_variants":["/recetas/barras-de-cereal/portada-1x1.webp","/recetas/barras-de-cereal/portada-4x3.webp","/recetas/barras-de-cereal/portada-16x9.webp"],"faq":[{"q":"Why do they fall apart when cut?","a":"The mixture needs firm pressing and thorough chilling. Press the corners too and refrigerate for at least 120 minutes, longer if still soft. Very runny peanut butter and cutting while warm change the result."},{"q":"Are the bars baked?","a":"The slab is not baked. Oats, almonds and seeds are toasted in a pan and the binder is warmed; the mixture is then pressed and refrigerated."},{"q":"Can I carry them without refrigeration?","a":"This proposal is stored chilled and softens in heat. Use a container with an ice pack for transport and take out only the portion you will eat; prolonged room-temperature stability has not been verified."}]},"published":false,"editorial_status":"draft","content_html":"<p>These cereal bars combine toasted rolled oats, almonds, sunflower seeds and raisins, bound with honey and peanut butter. The mixture is pressed into a tin and cut after chilling; the slab is not baked.</p><p>The proposal makes 12 soft, compact bars rather than crunchy ones. The estimated 165 minutes include 10 minutes of cooking, 15 of cooling and at least 120 in the refrigerator. Quantities, firmness, yield and times still need confirmation in a kitchen test.</p>"},{"id":"d18329f3-dec0-5830-baa8-2cbafc0748f5","recipe_group_id":"b67728b9-bce4-4c97-b366-528cd318140a","slug":"barres-de-cereales","public_path":"/fr/barres-de-cereales","source_url":"https://manualdecocina.com/fr/barres-de-cereales/","language":"fr","title":"Barres de céréales à l’avoine, miel et cacahuète","excerpt":"Préparez 12 barres d’avoine au miel, cacahuète et raisins. Torréfaction à la poêle, tassement ferme et refroidissement avant la découpe, pas à pas.","summary":"Ces barres réunissent flocons d’avoine torréfiés, amandes, graines de tournesol et raisins secs, liés au miel et à la purée de cacahuète. La préparation est tassée dans un moule puis coupée après refroidissement ; la plaque n’est pas cuite au four.\n\nLa proposition donne 12 barres souples et compactes, pas croustillantes. Les 165 minutes estimées comprennent 10 minutes de cuisson, 15 de refroidissement et au moins 120 au réfrigérateur. Doses, fermeté, rendement et temps restent à confirmer par un essai en cuisine.","category":"Desserts","category_slug":"postres","difficulty":"Facile","course":"Goûter sucré","cuisine":"Internationale","prep_time_minutes":20,"cook_time_minutes":10,"total_time_minutes":165,"servings":12,"ingredients":[{"name":"Flocons d’avoine secs","amount":"200","unit":"g","group":"Mélange sec"},{"name":"Purée de cacahuète lisse non salée","amount":"100","unit":"g","group":"Pour lier"},{"name":"Miel","amount":"100","unit":"g","group":"Pour lier"},{"name":"Amandes","amount":"50","unit":"g","group":"Mélange sec"},{"name":"Raisins secs noirs sans pépins","amount":"50","unit":"g","group":"Mélange sec"},{"name":"Graines de tournesol décortiquées","amount":"30","unit":"g","group":"Mélange sec"},{"name":"Extrait de vanille","amount":"3","unit":"g","group":"Pour lier"},{"name":"Sel","amount":"1","unit":"g","group":"Pour lier"}],"steps":[{"title":"Préparer le moule et peser","content":"Lavez-vous les mains et nettoyez le plan de travail. Chemisez un moule carré de 20 × 20 cm de papier cuisson, en laissant des rabats pour soulever la préparation. Pesez les ingrédients et hachez les 50 g d’amandes en morceaux d’environ 5 mm ; coupez les gros raisins pour qu’ils ne déchirent pas les barres. Remuez la purée de cacahuète dans son pot pour réincorporer l’huile séparée. Utilisez des flocons adaptés à cet usage selon leur emballage, pas des grains d’avoine entiers.","image_url":"/recetas/barras-de-cereal/paso-01.webp","image_alt":"Barres de céréales à l’avoine, miel et cacahuète: Préparer le moule et peser"},{"title":"Torréfier l’avoine et les graines","content":"Chauffez une grande poêle sèche à feu moyen-doux. Ajoutez les 200 g de flocons, 50 g d’amandes et 30 g de graines. Remuez presque continuellement environ 8 minutes, jusqu’à ce qu’ils sentent bon et se colorent légèrement sans brûler. Baissez le feu s’ils dorent trop vite. Transférez dans un grand saladier et laissez tiédir pendant la préparation du liant.","image_url":"/recetas/barras-de-cereal/paso-02.webp","image_alt":"Barres de céréales à l’avoine, miel et cacahuète: Torréfier l’avoine et les graines"},{"title":"Chauffer le miel et la purée de cacahuète","content":"Mettez les 100 g de miel et 100 g de purée de cacahuète dans une petite casserole. Chauffez à feu doux environ 2 minutes en remuant, jusqu’à obtenir un mélange fluide et uniforme, sans ébullition ni caramélisation. Retirez du feu et ajoutez les 3 g de vanille et 1 g de sel. Le mélange chaud peut brûler ; manipulez-le avec une spatule, pas avec les doigts.","image_url":"/recetas/barras-de-cereal/paso-03.webp","image_alt":"Barres de céréales à l’avoine, miel et cacahuète: Chauffer le miel et la purée de cacahuète"},{"title":"Ajouter les raisins et le liant","content":"Ajoutez les 50 g de raisins à l’avoine tiède. Versez tout le mélange miel-cacahuète et remuez à la spatule 1–2 minutes, en raclant fond et parois, jusqu’à enrober chaque flocon sans poche sèche. La préparation doit coller et s’agglomérer sous la spatule, sans être liquide ni mousseuse.","image_url":"/recetas/barras-de-cereal/paso-04.webp","image_alt":"Barres de céréales à l’avoine, miel et cacahuète: Ajouter les raisins et le liant"},{"title":"Tasser en couche régulière","content":"Versez dans le moule chemisé et répartissez jusque dans les coins. Posez une autre feuille dessus et pressez 2–3 minutes avec le fond plat d’un verre ou une spatule. Visez une couche d’environ 1–1,5 cm sans trous, surtout aux bords. La pression évite l’émiettement ; n’ajoutez pas de liquide pour assouplir.","image_url":"/recetas/barras-de-cereal/paso-05.webp","image_alt":"Barres de céréales à l’avoine, miel et cacahuète: Tasser en couche régulière"},{"title":"Refroidir et réfrigérer avant de couper","content":"Laissez le moule environ 15 minutes à température ambiante pour dissiper la forte chaleur. Couvrez et réfrigérez à 4 °C maximum au moins 120 minutes, jusqu’à ce que toute la plaque soit froide et ferme. Le réfrigérateur et l’épaisseur peuvent demander plus de temps ; ne découpez pas tiède. Les 165 minutes prévues incluent ce refroidissement et la réfrigération.","image_url":"/recetas/barras-de-cereal/paso-06.webp","image_alt":"Barres de céréales à l’avoine, miel et cacahuète: Refroidir et réfrigérer avant de couper"},{"title":"Découper douze barres","content":"Soulevez la plaque froide par les rabats et posez-la sur une planche propre. Retirez le papier supérieur et découpez avec un grand couteau en 3 rangées et 4 colonnes, soit 12 barres d’environ 6,7 × 5 cm. Appuyez vers le bas sans scier ; nettoyez la lame entre les coupes si elle colle. Si la plaque ramollit, réfrigérez à nouveau. Les miettes peuvent se servir à part avec du yaourt, non inclus dans le calcul nutritionnel.","image_url":"/recetas/barras-de-cereal/paso-07.webp","image_alt":"Barres de céréales à l’avoine, miel et cacahuète: Découper douze barres"},{"title":"Servir et conserver au froid","content":"Servez froid ou laissez tempérer uniquement la portion à manger. Emballez chaque barre ou conservez dans une boîte fermée avec papier entre les couches, à 4 °C maximum jusqu’à 5 jours ; respectez toute indication plus courte d’un ingrédient. Pour congeler, emballez individuellement jusqu’à 1 mois et décongelez au réfrigérateur. Ces durées sont proposées, pas testées en conservation. Les barres ramollissent à la chaleur et ne sont pas conçues pour rester fermes des heures hors du réfrigérateur.","image_url":"/recetas/barras-de-cereal/paso-08.webp","image_alt":"Barres de céréales à l’avoine, miel et cacahuète: Servir et conserver au froid"}],"notes":"Utilisez une purée de cacahuète lisse sans sel ni sucre ajouté ; une version très liquide ou de formulation différente change la fermeté. Remplacez éventuellement les raisins par le même poids d’abricots secs hachés, mais texture et nutrition changent. Remplacer miel ou purée de cacahuète demande de revérifier liaison et allergènes ; le résultat identique n’est pas garanti. Contient cacahuètes et amandes ; l’avoine peut avoir un contact avec le gluten, vérifiez les emballages si nécessaire. Transportez au froid et ne présentez pas les barres comme sans sucre : elles contiennent miel et fruits secs.","nutrition":{"calories":190.2,"protein_g":5.6,"carbs_g":24.7,"fat_g":8.7,"saturated_fat_g":1.3,"fiber_g":3.0,"sugar_g":10.9,"sodium_mg":36.0,"estimated":true,"source":"USDA FoodData Central — SR Legacy (abril de 2018)","source_url":"https://fdc.nal.usda.gov/download-datasets/","inputs":[{"ingredient":"Flocons d’avoine secs","edible_grams":200,"fdc_id":173904,"fdc_description":"Cereals, oats, regular and quick, not fortified, dry","per_100g":{"saturated_fat_g":1.11,"fiber_g":10.1,"sugar_g":0.99,"fat_g":6.52,"carbs_g":67.7,"calories":379.0,"sodium_mg":6.0,"protein_g":13.15},"source_url":"https://fdc.nal.usda.gov/food-details/173904/nutrients"},{"ingredient":"Purée de cacahuète lisse non salée","edible_grams":100,"fdc_id":172470,"fdc_description":"Peanut butter, smooth style, without salt","per_100g":{"sodium_mg":17.0,"saturated_fat_g":10.325,"protein_g":22.21,"fiber_g":5.0,"sugar_g":10.49,"fat_g":51.36,"carbs_g":22.31,"calories":598.0},"source_url":"https://fdc.nal.usda.gov/food-details/172470/nutrients"},{"ingredient":"Miel","edible_grams":100,"fdc_id":169640,"fdc_description":"Honey","per_100g":{"saturated_fat_g":0.0,"protein_g":0.3,"fiber_g":0.2,"sodium_mg":4.0,"fat_g":0.0,"carbs_g":82.4,"calories":304.0,"sugar_g":82.12},"source_url":"https://fdc.nal.usda.gov/food-details/169640/nutrients"},{"ingredient":"Amandes","edible_grams":50,"fdc_id":170567,"fdc_description":"Nuts, almonds","per_100g":{"protein_g":21.15,"fiber_g":12.5,"saturated_fat_g":3.802,"fat_g":49.93,"carbs_g":21.55,"calories":579.0,"sodium_mg":1.0,"sugar_g":4.35},"source_url":"https://fdc.nal.usda.gov/food-details/170567/nutrients"},{"ingredient":"Raisins secs noirs sans pépins","edible_grams":50,"fdc_id":168165,"fdc_description":"Raisins, dark, seedless (Includes foods for USDA's Food Distribution Program)","per_100g":{"saturated_fat_g":0.094,"fiber_g":4.5,"sodium_mg":26.0,"protein_g":3.3,"fat_g":0.25,"carbs_g":79.32,"sugar_g":65.18,"calories":299.0},"source_url":"https://fdc.nal.usda.gov/food-details/168165/nutrients"},{"ingredient":"Graines de tournesol décortiquées","edible_grams":30,"fdc_id":170562,"fdc_description":"Seeds, sunflower seed kernels, dried","per_100g":{"saturated_fat_g":4.455,"protein_g":20.78,"fiber_g":8.6,"sodium_mg":9.0,"fat_g":51.46,"sugar_g":2.62,"carbs_g":20.0,"calories":584.0},"source_url":"https://fdc.nal.usda.gov/food-details/170562/nutrients"},{"ingredient":"Extrait de vanille","edible_grams":3,"fdc_id":173471,"fdc_description":"Vanilla extract","per_100g":{"fat_g":0.06,"carbs_g":12.65,"calories":288.0,"protein_g":0.06,"fiber_g":0.0,"sodium_mg":9.0,"saturated_fat_g":0.01,"sugar_g":12.65},"source_url":"https://fdc.nal.usda.gov/food-details/173471/nutrients"},{"ingredient":"Sel","edible_grams":1,"fdc_id":173468,"fdc_description":"Salt, table","per_100g":{"fiber_g":0.0,"sodium_mg":38758.0,"saturated_fat_g":0.0,"protein_g":0.0,"fat_g":0.0,"carbs_g":0.0,"calories":0.0,"sugar_g":0.0},"source_url":"https://fdc.nal.usda.gov/food-details/173468/nutrients"}],"serving_size":"1 des 12 barres, environ 44 g avant perte d’eau","method":"Huit fiches USDA vérifiées pour 100 g sont pondérées par les poids d’ingrédients et divisées par 12. La fiche d’avoine concerne des flocons réguliers ou rapides secs non enrichis, pas de l’avoine cuite. La purée est supposée sans sel ni ajouts ; la torréfaction ne déduit pas de nutriments du lot.","note":"Estimation informative, pas analyse des barres préparées. Marque de purée, taille de découpe et restes modifient le résultat. Tout le miel est inclus ; ces chiffres ne constituent pas une allégation de faible teneur en sucre."},"keywords":["barres de céréales","barres avoine miel","barres cacahuète raisins"],"image_url":"/recetas/barras-de-cereal/portada.webp","gallery":[{"url":"/recetas/barras-de-cereal/portada.webp","alt":"Barres rectangulaires d’avoine aux amandes, graines et raisins visibles, sans chocolat ni nappage"}],"seo":{"title":"Barres de céréales à l’avoine, miel et cacahuète","description":"Préparez 12 barres d’avoine au miel, cacahuète et raisins. Torréfaction à la poêle, tassement ferme et refroidissement avant la découpe, pas à pas.","image_alt":"Barres rectangulaires d’avoine aux amandes, graines et raisins visibles, sans chocolat ni nappage","image_variants":["/recetas/barras-de-cereal/portada-1x1.webp","/recetas/barras-de-cereal/portada-4x3.webp","/recetas/barras-de-cereal/portada-16x9.webp"],"faq":[{"q":"Pourquoi s’émiettent-elles à la découpe ?","a":"Il faut pression et froid. Tassez aussi les coins et réfrigérez au moins 120 minutes, davantage si la préparation reste souple. Une purée très liquide et une découpe tiède changent le résultat."},{"q":"Les barres sont-elles cuites au four ?","a":"La plaque ne passe pas au four. Avoine, amandes et graines sont torréfiées à la poêle et le liant chauffé ; ensuite la préparation est tassée et réfrigérée."},{"q":"Puis-je les transporter sans réfrigération ?","a":"Cette proposition se conserve au froid et ramollit à la chaleur. Utilisez un contenant avec accumulateur de froid et sortez uniquement la portion à manger ; la stabilité prolongée à température ambiante n’est pas vérifiée."}]},"published":false,"editorial_status":"draft","content_html":"<p>Ces barres réunissent flocons d’avoine torréfiés, amandes, graines de tournesol et raisins secs, liés au miel et à la purée de cacahuète. La préparation est tassée dans un moule puis coupée après refroidissement ; la plaque n’est pas cuite au four.</p><p>La proposition donne 12 barres souples et compactes, pas croustillantes. Les 165 minutes estimées comprennent 10 minutes de cuisson, 15 de refroidissement et au moins 120 au réfrigérateur. Doses, fermeté, rendement et temps restent à confirmer par un essai en cuisine.</p>"},{"id":"37702565-398f-516d-a738-0c48fedf2e2c","recipe_group_id":"b67728b9-bce4-4c97-b366-528cd318140a","slug":"barrette-di-cereali","public_path":"/it/barrette-di-cereali","source_url":"https://manualdecocina.com/it/barrette-di-cereali/","language":"it","title":"Barrette di cereali con avena, miele e arachidi","excerpt":"Prepara 12 barrette di avena con miele, crema di arachidi e uvetta. Tostatura in padella, pressione uniforme e riposo al freddo prima del taglio.","summary":"Queste barrette combinano fiocchi d’avena tostati, mandorle, semi di girasole e uvetta, legati con miele e crema di arachidi. Si compattano in uno stampo e si tagliano dopo il raffreddamento; il blocco non passa in forno.\n\nLa proposta rende 12 barrette morbide e compatte, non croccanti. I 165 minuti stimati comprendono 10 di cottura, 15 di raffreddamento e almeno 120 in frigorifero. Dosi, compattezza, resa e tempi sono ancora da confermare con una prova in cucina.","category":"Dolci","category_slug":"postres","difficulty":"Facile","course":"Spuntino dolce","cuisine":"Internazionale","prep_time_minutes":20,"cook_time_minutes":10,"total_time_minutes":165,"servings":12,"ingredients":[{"name":"Fiocchi d’avena secchi","amount":"200","unit":"g","group":"Miscela secca"},{"name":"Crema di arachidi liscia non salata","amount":"100","unit":"g","group":"Per legare"},{"name":"Miele","amount":"100","unit":"g","group":"Per legare"},{"name":"Mandorle","amount":"50","unit":"g","group":"Miscela secca"},{"name":"Uvetta scura senza semi","amount":"50","unit":"g","group":"Miscela secca"},{"name":"Semi di girasole sgusciati","amount":"30","unit":"g","group":"Miscela secca"},{"name":"Estratto di vaniglia","amount":"3","unit":"g","group":"Per legare"},{"name":"Sale","amount":"1","unit":"g","group":"Per legare"}],"steps":[{"title":"Prepara lo stampo e pesa","content":"Lava le mani e pulisci il piano. Rivesti uno stampo quadrato di 20 × 20 cm con carta forno, lasciando lembi per sollevare il composto. Pesa gli ingredienti e trita 50 g di mandorle in pezzi di circa 5 mm; taglia l’uvetta grande per non rompere le barrette. Mescola la crema di arachidi nel vasetto per riunire l’olio separato. Usa fiocchi adatti a questo impiego secondo la confezione, non chicchi d’avena interi.","image_url":"/recetas/barras-de-cereal/paso-01.webp","image_alt":"Barrette di cereali con avena, miele e arachidi: Prepara lo stampo e pesa"},{"title":"Tosta avena e semi","content":"Scalda una padella larga e asciutta a fuoco medio-basso. Aggiungi 200 g di fiocchi, 50 g di mandorle e 30 g di semi. Mescola quasi continuamente per circa 8 minuti, finché sono profumati e leggermente coloriti senza bruciare. Abbassa il fuoco se dorano troppo in fretta. Trasferisci in una ciotola grande e lascia intiepidire mentre prepari il legante.","image_url":"/recetas/barras-de-cereal/paso-02.webp","image_alt":"Barrette di cereali con avena, miele e arachidi: Tosta avena e semi"},{"title":"Scalda miele e crema di arachidi","content":"Metti 100 g di miele e 100 g di crema di arachidi in un pentolino. Scalda a fuoco basso per circa 2 minuti, mescolando fino a un composto fluido e uniforme, senza bollire o caramellare. Togli dal fuoco e aggiungi 3 g di vaniglia e 1 g di sale. Il composto caldo può ustionare: usa una spatola, non le dita.","image_url":"/recetas/barras-de-cereal/paso-03.webp","image_alt":"Barrette di cereali con avena, miele e arachidi: Scalda miele e crema di arachidi"},{"title":"Unisci uvetta e legante","content":"Aggiungi 50 g di uvetta alla ciotola di avena tiepida. Versa tutto il composto miele-arachidi e mescola con una spatola per 1–2 minuti, raccogliendo fondo e pareti finché ogni fiocco è rivestito e non restano zone asciutte. Deve essere appiccicoso e aggregarsi premendo con la spatola, non liquido o montato.","image_url":"/recetas/barras-de-cereal/paso-04.webp","image_alt":"Barrette di cereali con avena, miele e arachidi: Unisci uvetta e legante"},{"title":"Compatta in uno strato uniforme","content":"Versa nello stampo rivestito e distribuisci fino agli angoli. Copri con un altro foglio e premi con il fondo piatto di un bicchiere o una spatola per 2–3 minuti. Cerca uno strato di circa 1–1,5 cm senza vuoti, soprattutto ai bordi. La pressione aiuta a evitare che le barrette si sbriciolino; non aggiungere liquido per ammorbidirle.","image_url":"/recetas/barras-de-cereal/paso-05.webp","image_alt":"Barrette di cereali con avena, miele e arachidi: Compatta in uno strato uniforme"},{"title":"Raffredda prima di tagliare","content":"Lascia lo stampo circa 15 minuti a temperatura ambiente per perdere il calore intenso. Copri e metti in frigorifero a non più di 4 °C per almeno 120 minuti, finché tutto il blocco è freddo e sodo. Frigorifero e spessore possono allungare il tempo; non tagliare tiepido. I 165 minuti previsti includono raffreddamento e refrigerazione.","image_url":"/recetas/barras-de-cereal/paso-06.webp","image_alt":"Barrette di cereali con avena, miele e arachidi: Raffredda prima di tagliare"},{"title":"Taglia dodici barrette","content":"Solleva il blocco freddo dai lembi e appoggia su un tagliere pulito. Togli la carta superiore e taglia con un coltello grande in 3 file e 4 colonne, ottenendo 12 barrette di circa 6,7 × 5 cm. Premi il coltello verso il basso senza segare e pulisci la lama tra i tagli se si attacca. Se si ammorbidisce, rimetti in frigorifero prima di continuare. Le briciole si possono servire a parte con yogurt, non incluso nella nutrizione.","image_url":"/recetas/barras-de-cereal/paso-07.webp","image_alt":"Barrette di cereali con avena, miele e arachidi: Taglia dodici barrette"},{"title":"Servi e conserva al freddo","content":"Servi fredde o lascia intiepidire solo la porzione da mangiare. Avvolgi singolarmente o conserva in un contenitore chiuso con carta tra gli strati, a non più di 4 °C fino a 5 giorni; rispetta eventuali indicazioni più brevi degli ingredienti. Per congelare, avvolgi singolarmente fino a 1 mese e scongela in frigorifero. Sono durate proposte, non prove di conservabilità. Con il caldo si ammorbidiscono e non sono progettate per restare sode per ore fuori dal frigorifero.","image_url":"/recetas/barras-de-cereal/paso-08.webp","image_alt":"Barrette di cereali con avena, miele e arachidi: Servi e conserva al freddo"}],"notes":"Usa crema di arachidi liscia senza sale e zucchero aggiunto; una molto liquida o diversa cambia la compattezza. Puoi sostituire l’uvetta con lo stesso peso di albicocche secche tritate, ma consistenza e nutrizione cambiano. Sostituire miele o crema richiede una nuova verifica di legame e allergeni; non si promette lo stesso risultato. Contiene arachidi e mandorle; l’avena può avere contaminazione da glutine, controlla le confezioni se rilevante. Trasporta al freddo e non presentare come senza zucchero: ci sono miele e frutta secca.","nutrition":{"calories":190.2,"protein_g":5.6,"carbs_g":24.7,"fat_g":8.7,"saturated_fat_g":1.3,"fiber_g":3.0,"sugar_g":10.9,"sodium_mg":36.0,"estimated":true,"source":"USDA FoodData Central — SR Legacy (abril de 2018)","source_url":"https://fdc.nal.usda.gov/download-datasets/","inputs":[{"ingredient":"Fiocchi d’avena secchi","edible_grams":200,"fdc_id":173904,"fdc_description":"Cereals, oats, regular and quick, not fortified, dry","per_100g":{"saturated_fat_g":1.11,"fiber_g":10.1,"sugar_g":0.99,"fat_g":6.52,"carbs_g":67.7,"calories":379.0,"sodium_mg":6.0,"protein_g":13.15},"source_url":"https://fdc.nal.usda.gov/food-details/173904/nutrients"},{"ingredient":"Crema di arachidi liscia non salata","edible_grams":100,"fdc_id":172470,"fdc_description":"Peanut butter, smooth style, without salt","per_100g":{"sodium_mg":17.0,"saturated_fat_g":10.325,"protein_g":22.21,"fiber_g":5.0,"sugar_g":10.49,"fat_g":51.36,"carbs_g":22.31,"calories":598.0},"source_url":"https://fdc.nal.usda.gov/food-details/172470/nutrients"},{"ingredient":"Miele","edible_grams":100,"fdc_id":169640,"fdc_description":"Honey","per_100g":{"saturated_fat_g":0.0,"protein_g":0.3,"fiber_g":0.2,"sodium_mg":4.0,"fat_g":0.0,"carbs_g":82.4,"calories":304.0,"sugar_g":82.12},"source_url":"https://fdc.nal.usda.gov/food-details/169640/nutrients"},{"ingredient":"Mandorle","edible_grams":50,"fdc_id":170567,"fdc_description":"Nuts, almonds","per_100g":{"protein_g":21.15,"fiber_g":12.5,"saturated_fat_g":3.802,"fat_g":49.93,"carbs_g":21.55,"calories":579.0,"sodium_mg":1.0,"sugar_g":4.35},"source_url":"https://fdc.nal.usda.gov/food-details/170567/nutrients"},{"ingredient":"Uvetta scura senza semi","edible_grams":50,"fdc_id":168165,"fdc_description":"Raisins, dark, seedless (Includes foods for USDA's Food Distribution Program)","per_100g":{"saturated_fat_g":0.094,"fiber_g":4.5,"sodium_mg":26.0,"protein_g":3.3,"fat_g":0.25,"carbs_g":79.32,"sugar_g":65.18,"calories":299.0},"source_url":"https://fdc.nal.usda.gov/food-details/168165/nutrients"},{"ingredient":"Semi di girasole sgusciati","edible_grams":30,"fdc_id":170562,"fdc_description":"Seeds, sunflower seed kernels, dried","per_100g":{"saturated_fat_g":4.455,"protein_g":20.78,"fiber_g":8.6,"sodium_mg":9.0,"fat_g":51.46,"sugar_g":2.62,"carbs_g":20.0,"calories":584.0},"source_url":"https://fdc.nal.usda.gov/food-details/170562/nutrients"},{"ingredient":"Estratto di vaniglia","edible_grams":3,"fdc_id":173471,"fdc_description":"Vanilla extract","per_100g":{"fat_g":0.06,"carbs_g":12.65,"calories":288.0,"protein_g":0.06,"fiber_g":0.0,"sodium_mg":9.0,"saturated_fat_g":0.01,"sugar_g":12.65},"source_url":"https://fdc.nal.usda.gov/food-details/173471/nutrients"},{"ingredient":"Sale","edible_grams":1,"fdc_id":173468,"fdc_description":"Salt, table","per_100g":{"fiber_g":0.0,"sodium_mg":38758.0,"saturated_fat_g":0.0,"protein_g":0.0,"fat_g":0.0,"carbs_g":0.0,"calories":0.0,"sugar_g":0.0},"source_url":"https://fdc.nal.usda.gov/food-details/173468/nutrients"}],"serving_size":"1 delle 12 barrette, circa 44 g prima delle perdite d’acqua","method":"Otto schede USDA verificate per 100 g sono ponderate con i pesi degli ingredienti e divise per 12. La scheda d’avena riguarda fiocchi regolari o rapidi secchi non fortificati, non avena cotta. Si suppone crema di arachidi senza sale né aggiunte; la tostatura non sottrae nutrienti dal lotto.","note":"Stima informativa, non analisi delle barrette pronte. Marca della crema, dimensione del taglio e residui cambiano il risultato. Si include tutto il miele: le cifre non costituiscono una dichiarazione di basso contenuto di zucchero."},"keywords":["barrette di cereali","barrette avena miele","barrette arachidi uvetta"],"image_url":"/recetas/barras-de-cereal/portada.webp","gallery":[{"url":"/recetas/barras-de-cereal/portada.webp","alt":"Barrette rettangolari di avena con mandorle, semi e uvetta visibili, senza cioccolato né copertura"}],"seo":{"title":"Barrette di cereali con avena, miele e arachidi","description":"Prepara 12 barrette di avena con miele, crema di arachidi e uvetta. Tostatura in padella, pressione uniforme e riposo al freddo prima del taglio.","image_alt":"Barrette rettangolari di avena con mandorle, semi e uvetta visibili, senza cioccolato né copertura","image_variants":["/recetas/barras-de-cereal/portada-1x1.webp","/recetas/barras-de-cereal/portada-4x3.webp","/recetas/barras-de-cereal/portada-16x9.webp"],"faq":[{"q":"Perché si sbriciolano al taglio?","a":"Servono pressione e freddo. Compatta anche gli angoli e raffredda almeno 120 minuti, di più se ancora morbide. Una crema molto liquida e il taglio tiepido cambiano il risultato."},{"q":"Si cuociono in forno?","a":"Il blocco non viene cotto in forno. Avena, mandorle e semi si tostano in padella e il legante si scalda; poi si compatta e si refrigera."},{"q":"Posso trasportarle senza refrigerazione?","a":"Questa proposta si conserva al freddo e si ammorbidisce con il caldo. Usa un contenitore con ghiaccio refrigerante e tira fuori solo la porzione da mangiare; la stabilità prolungata a temperatura ambiente non è verificata."}]},"published":false,"editorial_status":"draft","content_html":"<p>Queste barrette combinano fiocchi d’avena tostati, mandorle, semi di girasole e uvetta, legati con miele e crema di arachidi. Si compattano in uno stampo e si tagliano dopo il raffreddamento; il blocco non passa in forno.</p><p>La proposta rende 12 barrette morbide e compatte, non croccanti. I 165 minuti stimati comprendono 10 di cottura, 15 di raffreddamento e almeno 120 in frigorifero. Dosi, compattezza, resa e tempi sono ancora da confermare con una prova in cucina.</p>"},{"id":"d0dc4179-b71c-565b-ace2-9eb2fd2d3b57","recipe_group_id":"b67728b9-bce4-4c97-b366-528cd318140a","slug":"oat-cereal-bars","public_path":"/ja/oat-cereal-bars","source_url":null,"language":"ja","title":"オーツ麦と蜂蜜、ピーナッツのシリアルバー","excerpt":"オーツ麦、蜂蜜、ピーナッツバター、レーズンで作る12本分のシリアルバー。フライパンで煎り、しっかり押し固めて冷やしてから切る手順を紹介します。","summary":"煎ったオーツ麦フレーク、アーモンド、ひまわりの種、レーズンを、蜂蜜とピーナッツバターでまとめるシリアルバーです。型に押し固め、冷やしてから切ります。固めた生地はオーブンで焼きません。\n\nサクサクではなく、柔らかく密にまとまった12本を想定しています。推定165分には加熱10分、冷却15分、冷蔵120分以上を含みます。分量、固さ、出来上がり数、時間は調理試験でまだ確認していません。","category":"デザート","category_slug":"postres","difficulty":"簡単","course":"甘い間食","cuisine":"各国料理","prep_time_minutes":20,"cook_time_minutes":10,"total_time_minutes":165,"servings":12,"ingredients":[{"name":"乾燥オーツ麦フレーク","amount":"200","unit":"g","group":"乾燥材料"},{"name":"無塩の滑らかなピーナッツバター","amount":"100","unit":"g","group":"つなぎ"},{"name":"蜂蜜","amount":"100","unit":"g","group":"つなぎ"},{"name":"アーモンド","amount":"50","unit":"g","group":"乾燥材料"},{"name":"種なしの濃色レーズン","amount":"50","unit":"g","group":"乾燥材料"},{"name":"殻を除いたひまわりの種","amount":"30","unit":"g","group":"乾燥材料"},{"name":"バニラエクストラクト","amount":"3","unit":"g","group":"つなぎ"},{"name":"塩","amount":"1","unit":"g","group":"つなぎ"}],"steps":[{"title":"型を用意して材料を量る","content":"手を洗い、作業台を清潔にします。20 × 20 cmの正方形の型にオーブンシートを敷き、持ち上げるための余りを残します。材料を量り、アーモンド50 gを約5 mmに刻みます。大きなレーズンも切り、バーが裂けにくくします。ピーナッツバターは容器内で混ぜ、分離した油をなじませます。包装に従ってこの使い方に適したフレークを使い、オーツ麦の粒そのものは使いません。","image_url":"/recetas/barras-de-cereal/paso-01.webp","image_alt":"オーツ麦と蜂蜜、ピーナッツのシリアルバー: 型を用意して材料を量る"},{"title":"オーツ麦と種を煎る","content":"広い乾いたフライパンを弱めの中火で温め、フレーク200 g、アーモンド50 g、ひまわりの種30 gを入れます。焦がさず香りと軽い色がつくまで、約8分ほぼ絶えず混ぜます。色づきが速ければ火を弱めます。大きなボウルに移し、つなぎを作る間に少し冷まします。","image_url":"/recetas/barras-de-cereal/paso-02.webp","image_alt":"オーツ麦と蜂蜜、ピーナッツのシリアルバー: オーツ麦と種を煎る"},{"title":"蜂蜜とピーナッツバターを温める","content":"蜂蜜100 gとピーナッツバター100 gを小鍋に入れます。弱火で約2分、流動性が増して均一になるまで混ぜ、沸騰やカラメル化はさせません。火から下ろし、バニラ3 gと塩1 gを加えます。熱い混合物はやけどの原因になるので、指で触れずへらを使います。","image_url":"/recetas/barras-de-cereal/paso-03.webp","image_alt":"オーツ麦と蜂蜜、ピーナッツのシリアルバー: 蜂蜜とピーナッツバターを温める"},{"title":"レーズンとつなぎを混ぜる","content":"少し温かいオーツ麦のボウルにレーズン50 gを加えます。蜂蜜とピーナッツの混合物をすべて注ぎ、底と側面をこそげながらへらで1〜2分混ぜます。すべてのフレークが覆われ、乾いた部分が残らないようにします。へらで押すとまとまる粘りのある状態にし、液体状や泡立てた生地にはしません。","image_url":"/recetas/barras-de-cereal/paso-04.webp","image_alt":"オーツ麦と蜂蜜、ピーナッツのシリアルバー: レーズンとつなぎを混ぜる"},{"title":"均一に押し固める","content":"シートを敷いた型に移し、隅まで広げます。別のシートを上に置き、平らなグラスの底かへらで2〜3分押します。約1〜1.5 cm厚で、特に端に隙間がない層を目指します。しっかり押すと崩れにくくなります。柔らかくするために液体を足さないでください。","image_url":"/recetas/barras-de-cereal/paso-05.webp","image_alt":"オーツ麦と蜂蜜、ピーナッツのシリアルバー: 均一に押し固める"},{"title":"冷蔵してから切る","content":"型を室温で約15分置き、強い熱を逃がします。ふたをし、4 °C以下で120分以上冷蔵し、全体が冷たく固くなるまで待ちます。冷蔵庫や厚さでさらに時間が必要な場合があり、温かいまま切りません。予定の合計165分にはこの冷却と冷蔵を含みます。","image_url":"/recetas/barras-de-cereal/paso-06.webp","image_alt":"オーツ麦と蜂蜜、ピーナッツのシリアルバー: 冷蔵してから切る"},{"title":"12本に切る","content":"冷えた生地をシートの余りで持ち上げ、清潔なまな板に置きます。上のシートを外し、大きな包丁で3行4列に切り、約6.7 × 5 cmの12本にします。のこぎりのように動かさず下に押し、付着する場合は切るたびに刃を拭きます。柔らかくなったら再び冷蔵してから続けます。くずは別にヨーグルトと食べられますが、ヨーグルトは栄養計算に含みません。","image_url":"/recetas/barras-de-cereal/paso-07.webp","image_alt":"オーツ麦と蜂蜜、ピーナッツのシリアルバー: 12本に切る"},{"title":"盛り付けて冷蔵保存する","content":"冷たいまま出すか、食べる分だけ少し室温に戻します。1本ずつ包むか、紙を挟んで密閉容器に入れ、4 °C以下で最長5日保存します。材料の表示がより短い期間を求める場合は従います。冷凍は個別に包んで最長1か月とし、冷蔵庫で解凍します。保存期間は提案で、保存試験の結果ではありません。熱で柔らかくなり、冷蔵庫の外で何時間も固さを保つようには設計していません。","image_url":"/recetas/barras-de-cereal/paso-08.webp","image_alt":"オーツ麦と蜂蜜、ピーナッツのシリアルバー: 盛り付けて冷蔵保存する"}],"notes":"無塩、砂糖無添加の滑らかなピーナッツバターを使います。非常に緩い製品や配合の違いは固さを変えます。レーズンを同重量の刻んだ干しあんずに替えられますが、食感と栄養値は変わります。蜂蜜を別のシロップに、ピーナッツを別のペーストに替える場合は、結着性とアレルゲンを再確認する必要があり、同じ結果は保証しません。ピーナッツとアーモンドを含み、オーツ麦はグルテンと交差接触している場合があるので必要に応じて包装を確認します。持ち運びは冷やし、蜂蜜と乾燥果物を含むため砂糖不使用とは表示しません。","nutrition":{"calories":190.2,"protein_g":5.6,"carbs_g":24.7,"fat_g":8.7,"saturated_fat_g":1.3,"fiber_g":3.0,"sugar_g":10.9,"sodium_mg":36.0,"estimated":true,"source":"USDA FoodData Central — SR Legacy (abril de 2018)","source_url":"https://fdc.nal.usda.gov/download-datasets/","inputs":[{"ingredient":"乾燥オーツ麦フレーク","edible_grams":200,"fdc_id":173904,"fdc_description":"Cereals, oats, regular and quick, not fortified, dry","per_100g":{"saturated_fat_g":1.11,"fiber_g":10.1,"sugar_g":0.99,"fat_g":6.52,"carbs_g":67.7,"calories":379.0,"sodium_mg":6.0,"protein_g":13.15},"source_url":"https://fdc.nal.usda.gov/food-details/173904/nutrients"},{"ingredient":"無塩の滑らかなピーナッツバター","edible_grams":100,"fdc_id":172470,"fdc_description":"Peanut butter, smooth style, without salt","per_100g":{"sodium_mg":17.0,"saturated_fat_g":10.325,"protein_g":22.21,"fiber_g":5.0,"sugar_g":10.49,"fat_g":51.36,"carbs_g":22.31,"calories":598.0},"source_url":"https://fdc.nal.usda.gov/food-details/172470/nutrients"},{"ingredient":"蜂蜜","edible_grams":100,"fdc_id":169640,"fdc_description":"Honey","per_100g":{"saturated_fat_g":0.0,"protein_g":0.3,"fiber_g":0.2,"sodium_mg":4.0,"fat_g":0.0,"carbs_g":82.4,"calories":304.0,"sugar_g":82.12},"source_url":"https://fdc.nal.usda.gov/food-details/169640/nutrients"},{"ingredient":"アーモンド","edible_grams":50,"fdc_id":170567,"fdc_description":"Nuts, almonds","per_100g":{"protein_g":21.15,"fiber_g":12.5,"saturated_fat_g":3.802,"fat_g":49.93,"carbs_g":21.55,"calories":579.0,"sodium_mg":1.0,"sugar_g":4.35},"source_url":"https://fdc.nal.usda.gov/food-details/170567/nutrients"},{"ingredient":"種なしの濃色レーズン","edible_grams":50,"fdc_id":168165,"fdc_description":"Raisins, dark, seedless (Includes foods for USDA's Food Distribution Program)","per_100g":{"saturated_fat_g":0.094,"fiber_g":4.5,"sodium_mg":26.0,"protein_g":3.3,"fat_g":0.25,"carbs_g":79.32,"sugar_g":65.18,"calories":299.0},"source_url":"https://fdc.nal.usda.gov/food-details/168165/nutrients"},{"ingredient":"殻を除いたひまわりの種","edible_grams":30,"fdc_id":170562,"fdc_description":"Seeds, sunflower seed kernels, dried","per_100g":{"saturated_fat_g":4.455,"protein_g":20.78,"fiber_g":8.6,"sodium_mg":9.0,"fat_g":51.46,"sugar_g":2.62,"carbs_g":20.0,"calories":584.0},"source_url":"https://fdc.nal.usda.gov/food-details/170562/nutrients"},{"ingredient":"バニラエクストラクト","edible_grams":3,"fdc_id":173471,"fdc_description":"Vanilla extract","per_100g":{"fat_g":0.06,"carbs_g":12.65,"calories":288.0,"protein_g":0.06,"fiber_g":0.0,"sodium_mg":9.0,"saturated_fat_g":0.01,"sugar_g":12.65},"source_url":"https://fdc.nal.usda.gov/food-details/173471/nutrients"},{"ingredient":"塩","edible_grams":1,"fdc_id":173468,"fdc_description":"Salt, table","per_100g":{"fiber_g":0.0,"sodium_mg":38758.0,"saturated_fat_g":0.0,"protein_g":0.0,"fat_g":0.0,"carbs_g":0.0,"calories":0.0,"sugar_g":0.0},"source_url":"https://fdc.nal.usda.gov/food-details/173468/nutrients"}],"serving_size":"12本のうち1本、水分損失前で約44 g","method":"確認したUSDAの8項目の100 g当たりの数値を材料重量で加重計算し、12で割っています。オーツ麦は調理済みではなく、栄養強化していない乾燥の通常またはクイックタイプのフレークです。ピーナッツバターは無塩で添加物なしと想定し、煎る工程で総栄養量を差し引きません。","note":"参考用の推定値で、完成品の実測値ではありません。ピーナッツバターの製品、切る大きさ、残る混合物で変わります。蜂蜜を全量含めており、低糖の表示を意味しません。"},"keywords":["シリアルバー","オーツ麦 蜂蜜 バー","ピーナッツ レーズン バー"],"image_url":"/recetas/barras-de-cereal/portada.webp","gallery":[{"url":"/recetas/barras-de-cereal/portada.webp","alt":"アーモンド、種、レーズンが見える長方形のオーツ麦バー、チョコレートやコーティングなし"}],"seo":{"title":"オーツ麦のシリアルバー｜蜂蜜とピーナッツ入り","description":"オーツ麦、蜂蜜、ピーナッツバター、レーズンで作る12本分のシリアルバー。フライパンで煎り、しっかり押し固めて冷やしてから切る手順を紹介します。","image_alt":"アーモンド、種、レーズンが見える長方形のオーツ麦バー、チョコレートやコーティングなし","image_variants":["/recetas/barras-de-cereal/portada-1x1.webp","/recetas/barras-de-cereal/portada-4x3.webp","/recetas/barras-de-cereal/portada-16x9.webp"],"faq":[{"q":"切ると崩れるのはなぜですか？","a":"十分に押し固めて冷やす必要があります。隅も押し、120分以上、まだ柔らかければさらに冷蔵します。緩いピーナッツバターや温かい状態での切断も仕上がりを変えます。"},{"q":"オーブンで焼きますか？","a":"固めた生地は焼きません。オーツ麦、アーモンド、種をフライパンで煎り、つなぎを温めた後、押し固めて冷蔵します。"},{"q":"冷やさずに持ち歩けますか？","a":"この提案は冷蔵保存で、熱により柔らかくなります。保冷剤入りの容器で運び、食べる分だけ取り出します。室温での長時間の安定性は未確認です。"}]},"published":false,"editorial_status":"draft","content_html":"<p>煎ったオーツ麦フレーク、アーモンド、ひまわりの種、レーズンを、蜂蜜とピーナッツバターでまとめるシリアルバーです。型に押し固め、冷やしてから切ります。固めた生地はオーブンで焼きません。</p><p>サクサクではなく、柔らかく密にまとまった12本を想定しています。推定165分には加熱10分、冷却15分、冷蔵120分以上を含みます。分量、固さ、出来上がり数、時間は調理試験でまだ確認していません。</p>"},{"id":"76504634-6d62-547c-acbf-285ed75cd2be","recipe_group_id":"b67728b9-bce4-4c97-b366-528cd318140a","slug":"barras-de-cereal","public_path":"/pt/barras-de-cereal","source_url":null,"language":"pt","title":"Barras de cereal com aveia, mel e amendoim","excerpt":"Prepare 12 barras de aveia com mel, pasta de amendoim e passas. Veja o tostado na frigideira, a compactação e o tempo na geladeira antes de cortar.","summary":"Estas barras combinam aveia em flocos tostada, amêndoas, sementes de girassol e passas, ligadas com mel e pasta de amendoim. A mistura é compactada em uma forma e cortada depois de esfriar; a placa não vai ao forno.\n\nA proposta rende 12 barras macias e compactas, não crocantes. Os 165 minutos estimados incluem 10 de cozimento, 15 de resfriamento e pelo menos 120 na geladeira. Quantidades, firmeza, rendimento e tempos ainda precisam de confirmação em teste na cozinha.","category":"Sobremesas","category_slug":"postres","difficulty":"Fácil","course":"Lanche doce","cuisine":"Internacional","prep_time_minutes":20,"cook_time_minutes":10,"total_time_minutes":165,"servings":12,"ingredients":[{"name":"Aveia em flocos seca","amount":"200","unit":"g","group":"Mistura seca"},{"name":"Pasta de amendoim lisa sem sal","amount":"100","unit":"g","group":"Para dar liga"},{"name":"Mel","amount":"100","unit":"g","group":"Para dar liga"},{"name":"Amêndoas","amount":"50","unit":"g","group":"Mistura seca"},{"name":"Uvas-passas escuras sem sementes","amount":"50","unit":"g","group":"Mistura seca"},{"name":"Sementes de girassol sem casca","amount":"30","unit":"g","group":"Mistura seca"},{"name":"Extrato de baunilha","amount":"3","unit":"g","group":"Para dar liga"},{"name":"Sal","amount":"1","unit":"g","group":"Para dar liga"}],"steps":[{"title":"Prepare a forma e pese","content":"Lave as mãos e limpe a bancada. Forre uma forma quadrada de 20 × 20 cm com papel próprio para forno, deixando abas para levantar a mistura. Pese os ingredientes e pique os 50 g de amêndoas em pedaços de cerca de 5 mm; corte passas grandes para não romper as barras. Mexa a pasta de amendoim no pote até incorporar o óleo separado. Use flocos adequados a esse preparo conforme a embalagem, não grãos inteiros de aveia.","image_url":"/recetas/barras-de-cereal/paso-01.webp","image_alt":"Barras de cereal com aveia, mel e amendoim: Prepare a forma e pese"},{"title":"Toste a aveia e as sementes","content":"Aqueça uma frigideira grande e seca em fogo médio-baixo. Adicione os 200 g de flocos, 50 g de amêndoas e 30 g de sementes. Mexa quase continuamente por cerca de 8 minutos, até soltarem aroma e ganharem um pouco de cor sem queimar. Abaixe o fogo se dourarem rápido demais. Passe para uma tigela grande e deixe amornar enquanto prepara o ligante.","image_url":"/recetas/barras-de-cereal/paso-02.webp","image_alt":"Barras de cereal com aveia, mel e amendoim: Toste a aveia e as sementes"},{"title":"Aqueça o mel e a pasta de amendoim","content":"Coloque os 100 g de mel e 100 g de pasta de amendoim em uma panela pequena. Aqueça em fogo baixo por cerca de 2 minutos, mexendo até ficar fluido e uniforme, sem ferver nem caramelizar. Retire do fogo e adicione os 3 g de baunilha e 1 g de sal. A mistura quente pode queimar; use espátula, sem tocar com os dedos.","image_url":"/recetas/barras-de-cereal/paso-03.webp","image_alt":"Barras de cereal com aveia, mel e amendoim: Aqueça o mel e a pasta de amendoim"},{"title":"Misture as passas e o ligante","content":"Adicione os 50 g de passas à tigela de aveia morna. Despeje toda a mistura de mel e amendoim e mexa com espátula por 1–2 minutos, raspando fundo e laterais até cobrir cada floco sem partes secas. Deve ser uma mistura pegajosa que se una ao pressionar com a espátula, não um líquido nem uma massa aerada.","image_url":"/recetas/barras-de-cereal/paso-04.webp","image_alt":"Barras de cereal com aveia, mel e amendoim: Misture as passas e o ligante"},{"title":"Compacte em uma camada uniforme","content":"Passe para a forma forrada e espalhe até os cantos. Cubra com outra folha e pressione com o fundo plano de um copo ou uma espátula por 2–3 minutos. Busque uma camada de cerca de 1–1,5 cm sem espaços, principalmente nas bordas. A pressão ajuda a não esfarelar; não acrescente líquido para amolecer.","image_url":"/recetas/barras-de-cereal/paso-05.webp","image_alt":"Barras de cereal com aveia, mel e amendoim: Compacte em uma camada uniforme"},{"title":"Esfrie e leve à geladeira antes de cortar","content":"Deixe a forma cerca de 15 minutos em temperatura ambiente para perder o calor intenso. Tampe e leve à geladeira a no máximo 4 °C por pelo menos 120 minutos, até toda a placa ficar fria e firme. Geladeira e espessura podem aumentar o tempo; não corte morna. Os 165 minutos previstos incluem esse resfriamento e a refrigeração.","image_url":"/recetas/barras-de-cereal/paso-06.webp","image_alt":"Barras de cereal com aveia, mel e amendoim: Esfrie e leve à geladeira antes de cortar"},{"title":"Corte doze barras","content":"Levante a placa fria pelas abas e coloque em uma tábua limpa. Retire o papel superior e corte com uma faca grande em 3 fileiras e 4 colunas, formando 12 barras de cerca de 6,7 × 5 cm. Pressione a faca para baixo em vez de serrar; limpe a lâmina entre cortes se grudar. Se amolecer, volte à geladeira antes de continuar. As migalhas podem ser servidas à parte com iogurte, que não entra na nutrição calculada.","image_url":"/recetas/barras-de-cereal/paso-07.webp","image_alt":"Barras de cereal com aveia, mel e amendoim: Corte doze barras"},{"title":"Sirva e conserve na geladeira","content":"Sirva frias ou deixe amornar apenas a porção que vai comer. Embrulhe cada uma ou guarde em recipiente fechado com papel entre camadas, a no máximo 4 °C por até 5 dias; siga qualquer prazo menor indicado nos ingredientes. Para congelar, embrulhe individualmente por até 1 mês e descongele na geladeira. São durações propostas, não testes de validade. Amolecem com calor e não foram feitas para ficar firmes por horas fora da geladeira.","image_url":"/recetas/barras-de-cereal/paso-08.webp","image_alt":"Barras de cereal com aveia, mel e amendoim: Sirva e conserve na geladeira"}],"notes":"Use pasta de amendoim lisa sem sal nem açúcar adicionado; uma muito líquida ou com outra formulação muda a firmeza. Você pode trocar passas pelo mesmo peso de damasco seco picado, mas textura e nutrição mudam. Trocar o mel por outro xarope ou o amendoim por outra pasta exige conferir novamente a liga e os alérgenos; não se promete o mesmo resultado. Contém amendoim e amêndoas; a aveia pode ter contato com glúten, confira as embalagens se relevante. Mantenha as barras frias no transporte e não apresente como sem açúcar: levam mel e frutas secas.","nutrition":{"calories":190.2,"protein_g":5.6,"carbs_g":24.7,"fat_g":8.7,"saturated_fat_g":1.3,"fiber_g":3.0,"sugar_g":10.9,"sodium_mg":36.0,"estimated":true,"source":"USDA FoodData Central — SR Legacy (abril de 2018)","source_url":"https://fdc.nal.usda.gov/download-datasets/","inputs":[{"ingredient":"Aveia em flocos seca","edible_grams":200,"fdc_id":173904,"fdc_description":"Cereals, oats, regular and quick, not fortified, dry","per_100g":{"saturated_fat_g":1.11,"fiber_g":10.1,"sugar_g":0.99,"fat_g":6.52,"carbs_g":67.7,"calories":379.0,"sodium_mg":6.0,"protein_g":13.15},"source_url":"https://fdc.nal.usda.gov/food-details/173904/nutrients"},{"ingredient":"Pasta de amendoim lisa sem sal","edible_grams":100,"fdc_id":172470,"fdc_description":"Peanut butter, smooth style, without salt","per_100g":{"sodium_mg":17.0,"saturated_fat_g":10.325,"protein_g":22.21,"fiber_g":5.0,"sugar_g":10.49,"fat_g":51.36,"carbs_g":22.31,"calories":598.0},"source_url":"https://fdc.nal.usda.gov/food-details/172470/nutrients"},{"ingredient":"Mel","edible_grams":100,"fdc_id":169640,"fdc_description":"Honey","per_100g":{"saturated_fat_g":0.0,"protein_g":0.3,"fiber_g":0.2,"sodium_mg":4.0,"fat_g":0.0,"carbs_g":82.4,"calories":304.0,"sugar_g":82.12},"source_url":"https://fdc.nal.usda.gov/food-details/169640/nutrients"},{"ingredient":"Amêndoas","edible_grams":50,"fdc_id":170567,"fdc_description":"Nuts, almonds","per_100g":{"protein_g":21.15,"fiber_g":12.5,"saturated_fat_g":3.802,"fat_g":49.93,"carbs_g":21.55,"calories":579.0,"sodium_mg":1.0,"sugar_g":4.35},"source_url":"https://fdc.nal.usda.gov/food-details/170567/nutrients"},{"ingredient":"Uvas-passas escuras sem sementes","edible_grams":50,"fdc_id":168165,"fdc_description":"Raisins, dark, seedless (Includes foods for USDA's Food Distribution Program)","per_100g":{"saturated_fat_g":0.094,"fiber_g":4.5,"sodium_mg":26.0,"protein_g":3.3,"fat_g":0.25,"carbs_g":79.32,"sugar_g":65.18,"calories":299.0},"source_url":"https://fdc.nal.usda.gov/food-details/168165/nutrients"},{"ingredient":"Sementes de girassol sem casca","edible_grams":30,"fdc_id":170562,"fdc_description":"Seeds, sunflower seed kernels, dried","per_100g":{"saturated_fat_g":4.455,"protein_g":20.78,"fiber_g":8.6,"sodium_mg":9.0,"fat_g":51.46,"sugar_g":2.62,"carbs_g":20.0,"calories":584.0},"source_url":"https://fdc.nal.usda.gov/food-details/170562/nutrients"},{"ingredient":"Extrato de baunilha","edible_grams":3,"fdc_id":173471,"fdc_description":"Vanilla extract","per_100g":{"fat_g":0.06,"carbs_g":12.65,"calories":288.0,"protein_g":0.06,"fiber_g":0.0,"sodium_mg":9.0,"saturated_fat_g":0.01,"sugar_g":12.65},"source_url":"https://fdc.nal.usda.gov/food-details/173471/nutrients"},{"ingredient":"Sal","edible_grams":1,"fdc_id":173468,"fdc_description":"Salt, table","per_100g":{"fiber_g":0.0,"sodium_mg":38758.0,"saturated_fat_g":0.0,"protein_g":0.0,"fat_g":0.0,"carbs_g":0.0,"calories":0.0,"sugar_g":0.0},"source_url":"https://fdc.nal.usda.gov/food-details/173468/nutrients"}],"serving_size":"1 das 12 barras, cerca de 44 g antes da perda de água","method":"Oito fichas USDA verificadas por 100 g são ponderadas pelos pesos dos ingredientes e divididas por 12. A ficha de aveia é de flocos regulares ou rápidos secos sem fortificação, não de aveia cozida. Considera-se pasta de amendoim sem sal nem adições; o tostado não desconta nutrientes do lote.","note":"Estimativa informativa, não análise das barras prontas. Marca da pasta, tamanho do corte e sobras mudam o resultado. Todo o mel é incluído; as cifras não constituem uma alegação de baixo teor de açúcar."},"keywords":["barras de cereal","barras de aveia e mel","barras de amendoim e passas"],"image_url":"/recetas/barras-de-cereal/portada.webp","gallery":[{"url":"/recetas/barras-de-cereal/portada.webp","alt":"Barras retangulares de aveia com amêndoas, sementes e passas visíveis, sem chocolate nem cobertura"}],"seo":{"title":"Barras de cereal com aveia, mel e amendoim","description":"Prepare 12 barras de aveia com mel, pasta de amendoim e passas. Veja o tostado na frigideira, a compactação e o tempo na geladeira antes de cortar.","image_alt":"Barras retangulares de aveia com amêndoas, sementes e passas visíveis, sem chocolate nem cobertura","image_variants":["/recetas/barras-de-cereal/portada-1x1.webp","/recetas/barras-de-cereal/portada-4x3.webp","/recetas/barras-de-cereal/portada-16x9.webp"],"faq":[{"q":"Por que se desfazem ao cortar?","a":"A mistura precisa de pressão e frio. Compacte também os cantos e leve à geladeira por pelo menos 120 minutos, mais se ainda estiver macia. Pasta muito líquida e corte com a placa morna mudam o resultado."},{"q":"As barras vão ao forno?","a":"A placa não é assada. Aveia, amêndoas e sementes são tostadas na frigideira e o ligante aquecido; depois a mistura é compactada e refrigerada."},{"q":"Posso levar sem refrigeração?","a":"Esta proposta é conservada no frio e amolece com calor. Transporte em recipiente com acumulador de frio e retire só a porção que vai comer; a estabilidade prolongada em temperatura ambiente não foi verificada."}]},"published":false,"editorial_status":"draft","content_html":"<p>Estas barras combinam aveia em flocos tostada, amêndoas, sementes de girassol e passas, ligadas com mel e pasta de amendoim. A mistura é compactada em uma forma e cortada depois de esfriar; a placa não vai ao forno.</p><p>A proposta rende 12 barras macias e compactas, não crocantes. Os 165 minutos estimados incluem 10 de cozimento, 15 de resfriamento e pelo menos 120 na geladeira. Quantidades, firmeza, rendimento e tempos ainda precisam de confirmação em teste na cozinha.</p>"},{"id":"035e3edf-8b72-4604-8cd9-ae6883eff1c5","recipe_group_id":"43e5b443-a225-49c7-b432-217b5df787be","slug":"ensalada-de-pollo-con-aguacate-y-mango","public_path":"/ensalada-de-pollo-con-aguacate-y-mango","source_url":"https://manualdecocina.com/ensalada-de-pollo-con-aguacate-y-mango/","language":"es","title":"Ensalada de pollo con aguacate y mango","excerpt":"Ensalada de pollo con aguacate y mango para 4: pollo en sartén, aliño de lima y pasos para lavar, cocinar, cortar y montar sin aplastar la fruta.","summary":"Esta ensalada combina pollo hecho en sartén, dados de aguacate y mango, lechuga, pepino y cebolla roja. Un aliño de lima, aceite de oliva y un poco de miel une los ingredientes sin convertirlos en una salsa espesa.\n\nLa propuesta rinde 4 porciones. Los 55 minutos estimados incluyen 30 de preparación, 20 para cocinar en dos tandas y 5 de reposo. El pollo se comprueba con termómetro a 74 °C como mínimo; cantidades, tiempos y rendimiento están pendientes de confirmar mediante prueba de cocina.","category":"Ensaladas","category_slug":"ensaladas","difficulty":"Fácil","course":"Ensalada principal","cuisine":"Internacional","prep_time_minutes":30,"cook_time_minutes":20,"total_time_minutes":55,"servings":4,"ingredients":[{"name":"pechuga de pollo cruda sin piel ni hueso","amount":"600","unit":"g","group":"Ensalada"},{"name":"aguacate, pulpa","amount":"200","unit":"g","group":"Ensalada"},{"name":"mango, pulpa","amount":"250","unit":"g","group":"Ensalada"},{"name":"pepino con piel","amount":"150","unit":"g","group":"Ensalada"},{"name":"lechuga romana","amount":"100","unit":"g","group":"Ensalada"},{"name":"cebolla roja","amount":"40","unit":"g","group":"Ensalada"},{"name":"zumo de lima","amount":"40","unit":"g","group":"Cocción y aliño"},{"name":"aceite de oliva","amount":"30","unit":"g","group":"Cocción y aliño"},{"name":"miel","amount":"10","unit":"g","group":"Cocción y aliño"},{"name":"sal","amount":"3","unit":"g","group":"Cocción y aliño"},{"name":"pimienta negra","amount":"1","unit":"g","group":"Cocción y aliño"}],"steps":[{"title":"Lava y seca los vegetales","content":"Lávate las manos y prepara una tabla limpia para fruta y verdura, separada de la del pollo. Lava pepino, mango, aguacate y lima bajo agua corriente antes de cortar o pelar, sin jabón. Lava y seca bien los 100 g de lechuga, salvo que el envase indique que está lista para comer. Corta los 150 g de pepino en medias lunas finas y los 40 g de cebolla roja en pluma; reserva con la lechuga en la nevera mientras cocinas.","image_url":"/recetas/ensalada-de-pollo-con-aguacate-y-mango/paso-01.webp","image_alt":"Ensalada de pollo, aguacate y mango: lava y seca los vegetales"},{"title":"Prepara cuatro filetes de pollo","content":"No laves el pollo crudo. Sobre su tabla separada, divide los 600 g de pechuga sin piel ni hueso en cuatro filetes de unos 150 g y grosor uniforme de aproximadamente 1,5 cm. Si hace falta, aplana suavemente entre papeles aptos para alimentos. Sazona con 1 g de la sal y 0,5 g de pimienta. Desecha el papel usado y lava manos y utensilios; no pongas la ensalada ni el pollo cocinado sobre la tabla o plato del pollo crudo.","image_url":"/recetas/ensalada-de-pollo-con-aguacate-y-mango/paso-02.webp","image_alt":"Ensalada de pollo, aguacate y mango: prepara cuatro filetes de pollo"},{"title":"Cocina y comprueba la temperatura","content":"Calienta una sartén amplia a fuego medio con 5 g de aceite. Cocina dos filetes durante unos 4–5 minutos por lado, sin moverlos hasta que se despeguen; ajusta el fuego si se queman. Comprueba con termómetro que el centro más grueso de cada filete alcanza al menos 74 °C, sin tocar la sartén con la sonda. Si falta temperatura, sigue cocinando y vuelve a medir; el color y el reloj no bastan. Retira a un plato limpio y repite con los otros dos filetes y los 5 g restantes de aceite para cocción. Los 20 minutos previstos son orientativos.","image_url":"/recetas/ensalada-de-pollo-con-aguacate-y-mango/paso-03.webp","image_alt":"Ensalada de pollo, aguacate y mango: cocina y comprueba la temperatura"},{"title":"Deja reposar y corta en tiras","content":"Deja reposar el pollo cocinado 5 minutos en el plato limpio. Con cuchillo y tabla limpios, corta cada filete en tiras de alrededor de 1 cm de ancho. Debe dejar de desprender vapor intenso antes de ir a la ensalada; espera un poco más si es necesario y suma esa espera al tiempo total. Reserva solo mientras terminas el montaje, sin dejarlo horas a temperatura ambiente.","image_url":"/recetas/ensalada-de-pollo-con-aguacate-y-mango/paso-04.webp","image_alt":"Ensalada de pollo, aguacate y mango: deja reposar y corta en tiras"},{"title":"Corta el mango y el aguacate","content":"Pela el mango lavado, separa la pulpa del hueso y pesa 250 g. Corta en dados de unos 2 cm. Abre el aguacate lavado, retira el hueso con una cuchara en lugar de golpearlo con el cuchillo, saca la pulpa y pesa 200 g. Corta también en dados de unos 2 cm. Usa la tabla de fruta limpia, sin contacto con pollo crudo, y prepara ambos justo antes de mezclar para reducir el oscurecimiento del aguacate.","image_url":"/recetas/ensalada-de-pollo-con-aguacate-y-mango/paso-05.webp","image_alt":"Ensalada de pollo, aguacate y mango: corta el mango y el aguacate"},{"title":"Bate el aliño de lima","content":"En un cuenco pequeño mezcla los 40 g de zumo de lima, 10 g de miel, los 2 g de sal y 0,5 g de pimienta restantes. Añade los 20 g de aceite reservados para el aliño y bate con un tenedor hasta que se integre de forma temporal. Remueve de nuevo justo antes de usar si se separa. El aliño no sustituye cocinar el pollo ni evita la contaminación cruzada.","image_url":"/recetas/ensalada-de-pollo-con-aguacate-y-mango/paso-06.webp","image_alt":"Ensalada de pollo, aguacate y mango: bate el aliño de lima"},{"title":"Monta la ensalada sin aplastar","content":"Pon la lechuga, pepino y cebolla en un cuenco grande y mezcla con la mitad del aliño. Añade los dados de mango y aguacate y las tiras de pollo templado. Incorpora el resto del aliño con dos cucharas, levantando suavemente desde el fondo para no deshacer el aguacate. Reparte entre cuatro platos, distribuyendo el pollo y la fruta de manera similar.","image_url":"/recetas/ensalada-de-pollo-con-aguacate-y-mango/paso-07.webp","image_alt":"Ensalada de pollo, aguacate y mango: monta la ensalada sin aplastar"},{"title":"Sirve y conserva refrigerada","content":"Sirve recién montada, sola o con un acompañamiento que no se incluye en la nutrición. Si sobra, tapa y refrigera a 4 °C o menos dentro de 2 horas, o 1 hora si el ambiente supera 32 °C. Consume la ensalada montada dentro de 24 horas como propuesta conservadora; lechuga y aguacate perderán textura. Para adelantar, guarda pollo cocinado, vegetales y aliño separados en frío y monta al servir; no congeles la ensalada completa porque cambiará mucho su textura.","image_url":"/recetas/ensalada-de-pollo-con-aguacate-y-mango/paso-08.webp","image_alt":"Ensalada de pollo, aguacate y mango: sirve y conserva refrigerada"}],"notes":"Elige mango maduro pero firme y aguacate que ceda ligeramente sin estar deshecho. Puedes cambiar la lima por el mismo peso de zumo de limón; cambiará el sabor y la nutrición. Si omites la miel, el aliño será más ácido y las cifras nutricionales ya no serán las mismas. La lechuga debe estar seca para no diluirlo. Prepara solo la fruta que vas a usar; el ácido retrasa algo el oscurecimiento, pero no mantiene el aguacate intacto indefinidamente. Usa utensilios separados para pollo crudo y alimentos listos para comer. La cocción se determina por temperatura, no por ausencia de color rosado.","nutrition":{"calories":388.4,"protein_g":36.0,"carbs_g":19.8,"fat_g":19.1,"saturated_fat_g":3.0,"fiber_g":5.3,"sugar_g":12.4,"sodium_mg":366.0,"estimated":true,"source":"USDA FoodData Central — SR Legacy (abril de 2018)","source_url":"https://fdc.nal.usda.gov/download-datasets/","inputs":[{"ingredient":"pechuga de pollo cruda sin piel ni hueso","edible_grams":600,"fdc_id":171077,"fdc_description":"Chicken, broiler or fryers, breast, skinless, boneless, meat only, raw","per_100g":{"fat_g":2.62,"calories":120.0,"saturated_fat_g":0.563,"sodium_mg":45.0,"protein_g":22.5,"sugar_g":0.0,"carbs_g":0.0,"fiber_g":0.0},"source_url":"https://fdc.nal.usda.gov/food-details/171077/nutrients"},{"ingredient":"aguacate, pulpa","edible_grams":200,"fdc_id":171705,"fdc_description":"Avocados, raw, all commercial varieties","per_100g":{"protein_g":2.0,"fiber_g":6.7,"sodium_mg":7.0,"fat_g":14.66,"sugar_g":0.66,"saturated_fat_g":2.126,"carbs_g":8.53,"calories":160.0},"source_url":"https://fdc.nal.usda.gov/food-details/171705/nutrients"},{"ingredient":"mango, pulpa","edible_grams":250,"fdc_id":169910,"fdc_description":"Mangos, raw","per_100g":{"fat_g":0.38,"protein_g":0.82,"fiber_g":1.6,"sodium_mg":1.0,"carbs_g":14.98,"calories":60.0,"sugar_g":13.66,"saturated_fat_g":0.092},"source_url":"https://fdc.nal.usda.gov/food-details/169910/nutrients"},{"ingredient":"pepino con piel","edible_grams":150,"fdc_id":168409,"fdc_description":"Cucumber, with peel, raw","per_100g":{"carbs_g":3.63,"calories":15.0,"sugar_g":1.67,"saturated_fat_g":0.037,"sodium_mg":2.0,"fat_g":0.11,"fiber_g":0.5,"protein_g":0.65},"source_url":"https://fdc.nal.usda.gov/food-details/168409/nutrients"},{"ingredient":"lechuga romana","edible_grams":100,"fdc_id":169247,"fdc_description":"Lettuce, cos or romaine, raw","per_100g":{"carbs_g":3.29,"calories":17.0,"saturated_fat_g":0.039,"sodium_mg":8.0,"fat_g":0.3,"sugar_g":1.19,"fiber_g":2.1,"protein_g":1.23},"source_url":"https://fdc.nal.usda.gov/food-details/169247/nutrients"},{"ingredient":"cebolla roja","edible_grams":40,"fdc_id":170000,"fdc_description":"Onions, raw","per_100g":{"sugar_g":4.24,"fat_g":0.1,"carbs_g":9.34,"calories":40.0,"saturated_fat_g":0.042,"protein_g":1.1,"fiber_g":1.7,"sodium_mg":4.0},"source_url":"https://fdc.nal.usda.gov/food-details/170000/nutrients"},{"ingredient":"zumo de lima","edible_grams":40,"fdc_id":168156,"fdc_description":"Lime juice, raw","per_100g":{"protein_g":0.42,"fiber_g":0.4,"sodium_mg":2.0,"fat_g":0.07,"sugar_g":1.69,"saturated_fat_g":0.008,"carbs_g":8.42,"calories":25.0},"source_url":"https://fdc.nal.usda.gov/food-details/168156/nutrients"},{"ingredient":"aceite de oliva","edible_grams":30,"fdc_id":171413,"fdc_description":"Oil, olive, salad or cooking","per_100g":{"fat_g":100.0,"carbs_g":0.0,"calories":884.0,"sodium_mg":2.0,"protein_g":0.0,"saturated_fat_g":13.808,"fiber_g":0.0,"sugar_g":0.0},"source_url":"https://fdc.nal.usda.gov/food-details/171413/nutrients"},{"ingredient":"miel","edible_grams":10,"fdc_id":169640,"fdc_description":"Honey","per_100g":{"saturated_fat_g":0.0,"protein_g":0.3,"fiber_g":0.2,"sodium_mg":4.0,"fat_g":0.0,"carbs_g":82.4,"calories":304.0,"sugar_g":82.12},"source_url":"https://fdc.nal.usda.gov/food-details/169640/nutrients"},{"ingredient":"sal","edible_grams":3,"fdc_id":173468,"fdc_description":"Salt, table","per_100g":{"fiber_g":0.0,"sodium_mg":38758.0,"saturated_fat_g":0.0,"protein_g":0.0,"fat_g":0.0,"carbs_g":0.0,"calories":0.0,"sugar_g":0.0},"source_url":"https://fdc.nal.usda.gov/food-details/173468/nutrients"},{"ingredient":"pimienta negra","edible_grams":1,"fdc_id":170931,"fdc_description":"Spices, pepper, black","per_100g":{"fat_g":3.26,"sugar_g":0.64,"carbs_g":63.95,"calories":251.0,"protein_g":10.39,"fiber_g":25.3,"sodium_mg":20.0,"saturated_fat_g":1.392},"source_url":"https://fdc.nal.usda.gov/food-details/170931/nutrients"}],"serving_size":"1 de 4 porciones","method":"Once fichas USDA verificadas por 100 g, ponderadas por los pesos comestibles indicados y divididas entre 4. Pollo calculado por 600 g crudos sin piel ni hueso; cebolla roja aproximada con la ficha de cebolla cruda genérica. Se cuentan los 30 g de aceite y todo el aliño, aunque puedan quedar restos en sartén o cuenco.","note":"Estimación informativa, no análisis de la ensalada preparada. Pérdidas de jugos al cocinar, variedad de fruta, aceite retenido y reparto alteran el resultado. No se cuenta pan ni ningún acompañamiento adicional."},"keywords":["ensalada de pollo con aguacate y mango","ensalada de pollo a la sartén","aliño de lima para ensalada"],"image_url":"/recetas/ensalada-de-pollo-con-aguacate-y-mango/portada.webp","gallery":[{"url":"/recetas/ensalada-de-pollo-con-aguacate-y-mango/portada.webp","alt":"Ensalada con tiras de pollo dorado, dados de mango y aguacate, lechuga, pepino y cebolla roja"}],"seo":{"title":"Ensalada de pollo con aguacate y mango","description":"Ensalada de pollo con aguacate y mango para 4: pollo en sartén, aliño de lima y pasos para lavar, cocinar, cortar y montar sin aplastar la fruta.","image_alt":"Ensalada con tiras de pollo dorado, dados de mango y aguacate, lechuga, pepino y cebolla roja","image_variants":["/recetas/ensalada-de-pollo-con-aguacate-y-mango/portada-1x1.webp","/recetas/ensalada-de-pollo-con-aguacate-y-mango/portada-4x3.webp","/recetas/ensalada-de-pollo-con-aguacate-y-mango/portada-16x9.webp"],"faq":[{"q":"¿Puedo preparar la ensalada con antelación?","a":"Guarda pollo ya cocinado, vegetales y aliño separados en frío y monta al servir. Corta el aguacate cerca del montaje. La ensalada ya aliñada pierde textura; se propone consumirla en 24 horas refrigerada."},{"q":"¿Cómo sé si el pollo está bien cocinado?","a":"Mide el centro más grueso de cada filete con un termómetro de alimentos: debe alcanzar al menos 74 °C. Ni un tiempo fijo ni el color de la carne garantizan por sí solos ese punto."},{"q":"¿Por qué queda agua en el fondo?","a":"La lechuga mojada, el mango demasiado blando y el aliño añadido mucho antes pueden soltar líquido. Seca bien las hojas, usa fruta firme y mezcla justo antes de servir."}]},"published":false,"editorial_status":"draft","content_html":"<p>Esta ensalada combina pollo hecho en sartén, dados de aguacate y mango, lechuga, pepino y cebolla roja. Un aliño de lima, aceite de oliva y un poco de miel une los ingredientes sin convertirlos en una salsa espesa.</p><p>La propuesta rinde 4 porciones. Los 55 minutos estimados incluyen 30 de preparación, 20 para cocinar en dos tandas y 5 de reposo. El pollo se comprueba con termómetro a 74 °C como mínimo; cantidades, tiempos y rendimiento están pendientes de confirmar mediante prueba de cocina.</p>"},{"id":"12036540-7844-5628-8ec6-81b39345c11b","recipe_group_id":"43e5b443-a225-49c7-b432-217b5df787be","slug":"huhnersalat-mit-avocado-und-mango","public_path":"/de/huhnersalat-mit-avocado-und-mango","source_url":"https://manualdecocina.com/de/huhnersalat-mit-avocado-und-mango/","language":"de","title":"Hähnchensalat mit Avocado und Mango","excerpt":"Hähnchensalat mit Avocado und Mango für 4: Pfannenhähnchen, Limettendressing und klare Schritte vom Waschen bis zum vorsichtigen Anrichten.","summary":"Dieser Salat verbindet Hähnchen aus der Pfanne, Avocado- und Mangowürfel, Romanasalat, Gurke und rote Zwiebel. Limette, Olivenöl und etwas Honig bilden ein leichtes Dressing ohne dicke Sauce.\n\nDer Vorschlag ergibt 4 Portionen. Die geschätzten 55 Minuten enthalten 30 Minuten Vorbereitung, 20 Minuten Braten in zwei Durchgängen und 5 Minuten Ruhe. Hähnchen mit Thermometer auf mindestens 74 °C prüfen; Mengen, Zeiten und Ausbeute sind noch nicht im Küchentest bestätigt.","category":"Salate","category_slug":"ensaladas","difficulty":"Einfach","course":"Salat als Hauptgericht","cuisine":"International","prep_time_minutes":30,"cook_time_minutes":20,"total_time_minutes":55,"servings":4,"ingredients":[{"name":"Rohe Hähnchenbrust ohne Haut und Knochen","amount":"600","unit":"g","group":"Salat"},{"name":"Avocadofruchtfleisch","amount":"200","unit":"g","group":"Salat"},{"name":"Mangofruchtfleisch","amount":"250","unit":"g","group":"Salat"},{"name":"Gurke mit Schale","amount":"150","unit":"g","group":"Salat"},{"name":"Romanasalat","amount":"100","unit":"g","group":"Salat"},{"name":"Rote Zwiebel","amount":"40","unit":"g","group":"Salat"},{"name":"Limettensaft","amount":"40","unit":"g","group":"Braten und Dressing"},{"name":"Olivenöl","amount":"30","unit":"g","group":"Braten und Dressing"},{"name":"Honig","amount":"10","unit":"g","group":"Braten und Dressing"},{"name":"Salz","amount":"3","unit":"g","group":"Braten und Dressing"},{"name":"Schwarzer Pfeffer","amount":"1","unit":"g","group":"Braten und Dressing"}],"steps":[{"title":"Gemüse waschen und trocknen","content":"Hände waschen und ein sauberes Obst- und Gemüsebrett getrennt vom Hähnchenbrett vorbereiten. Gurke, Mango, Avocado und Limette vor Schneiden oder Schälen unter fließendem Wasser ohne Seife waschen. 100 g Romanasalat waschen und gut trocknen, außer die Packung bezeichnet ihn als verzehrfertig. 150 g Gurke in dünne Halbmonde und 40 g rote Zwiebel in feine Streifen schneiden; mit dem Salat bis zum Anrichten kühlen.","image_url":"/recetas/ensalada-de-pollo-con-aguacate-y-mango/paso-01.webp","image_alt":"Hähnchensalat mit Avocado und Mango: Gemüse waschen und trocknen"},{"title":"Vier Hähnchenfilets vorbereiten","content":"Rohes Hähnchen nicht waschen. Auf seinem getrennten Brett 600 g Brust ohne Haut und Knochen in vier etwa 150 g schwere Filets mit gleichmäßiger Dicke von etwa 1,5 cm teilen. Falls nötig zwischen lebensmittelechten Bögen vorsichtig flach drücken. Mit 1 g Salz und 0,5 g Pfeffer würzen. Benutztes Papier entsorgen, Hände und Geräte waschen; Salat und gebratenes Hähnchen nicht auf Brett oder Teller des rohen Hähnchens legen.","image_url":"/recetas/ensalada-de-pollo-con-aguacate-y-mango/paso-02.webp","image_alt":"Hähnchensalat mit Avocado und Mango: Vier Hähnchenfilets vorbereiten"},{"title":"Braten und Kerntemperatur prüfen","content":"Eine breite Pfanne bei mittlerer Hitze mit 5 g Öl erhitzen. Zwei Filets etwa 4–5 Minuten je Seite braten und liegen lassen, bis sie sich lösen; bei Verbrennen Hitze anpassen. Mit Lebensmittelthermometer prüfen, dass die dickste Mitte jedes Filets mindestens 74 °C erreicht, ohne die Pfanne mit der Sonde zu berühren. Bei zu niedriger Temperatur weiterbraten und erneut messen; Farbe und Uhr allein reichen nicht. Auf sauberen Teller geben und mit den anderen zwei Filets und den übrigen 5 g Bratöl wiederholen. Die vorgesehenen 20 Minuten sind Richtwerte.","image_url":"/recetas/ensalada-de-pollo-con-aguacate-y-mango/paso-03.webp","image_alt":"Hähnchensalat mit Avocado und Mango: Braten und Kerntemperatur prüfen"},{"title":"Ruhen lassen und in Streifen schneiden","content":"Gegartes Hähnchen 5 Minuten auf dem sauberen Teller ruhen lassen. Mit sauberem Messer und Brett jedes Filet in etwa 1 cm breite Streifen schneiden. Vor dem Salat soll es nicht mehr stark dampfen; bei Bedarf länger warten und zur Gesamtzeit addieren. Nur während der restlichen Vorbereitung beiseitestellen, nicht stundenlang bei Raumtemperatur.","image_url":"/recetas/ensalada-de-pollo-con-aguacate-y-mango/paso-04.webp","image_alt":"Hähnchensalat mit Avocado und Mango: Ruhen lassen und in Streifen schneiden"},{"title":"Mango und Avocado würfeln","content":"Gewaschene Mango schälen, Fruchtfleisch vom Stein lösen und 250 g wiegen. In etwa 2 cm große Würfel schneiden. Gewaschene Avocado öffnen, Stein mit einem Löffel entfernen statt mit dem Messer hineinzuschlagen, Fruchtfleisch herauslösen und 200 g wiegen. Ebenfalls etwa 2 cm groß würfeln. Sauberes Obstbrett ohne Kontakt mit rohem Hähnchen verwenden und beides erst kurz vor dem Mischen vorbereiten, um Avocadobräunung zu begrenzen.","image_url":"/recetas/ensalada-de-pollo-con-aguacate-y-mango/paso-05.webp","image_alt":"Hähnchensalat mit Avocado und Mango: Mango und Avocado würfeln"},{"title":"Limettendressing verrühren","content":"40 g Limettensaft, 10 g Honig, übrige 2 g Salz und 0,5 g Pfeffer in einer kleinen Schüssel mischen. Die für das Dressing vorgesehenen 20 g Öl zugeben und mit einer Gabel vorübergehend verbinden. Bei Trennung vor Gebrauch erneut rühren. Dressing ersetzt weder Hähnchengaren noch verhindert es Kreuzkontamination.","image_url":"/recetas/ensalada-de-pollo-con-aguacate-y-mango/paso-06.webp","image_alt":"Hähnchensalat mit Avocado und Mango: Limettendressing verrühren"},{"title":"Salat vorsichtig mischen","content":"Salat, Gurke und Zwiebel in eine große Schüssel geben und mit der Hälfte des Dressings mischen. Mango, Avocado und lauwarme Hähnchenstreifen zugeben. Restliches Dressing mit zwei Löffeln vorsichtig von unten unterheben, ohne die Avocado zu zerdrücken. Auf vier Teller verteilen und Hähnchen sowie Obst ähnlich portionieren.","image_url":"/recetas/ensalada-de-pollo-con-aguacate-y-mango/paso-07.webp","image_alt":"Hähnchensalat mit Avocado und Mango: Salat vorsichtig mischen"},{"title":"Servieren und gekühlt aufbewahren","content":"Frisch angerichtet servieren, allein oder mit einer nicht eingerechneten Beilage. Reste abdecken und innerhalb von 2 Stunden bei höchstens 4 °C kühlen, bei Umgebungstemperatur über 32 °C innerhalb 1 Stunde. Als konservativer Vorschlag den fertigen Salat binnen 24 Stunden essen; Salat und Avocado verlieren Textur. Zum Vorbereiten gegartes Hähnchen, Gemüse und Dressing getrennt kalt lagern und erst beim Servieren mischen. Den vollständigen Salat nicht einfrieren, da sich seine Textur stark verändert.","image_url":"/recetas/ensalada-de-pollo-con-aguacate-y-mango/paso-08.webp","image_alt":"Hähnchensalat mit Avocado und Mango: Servieren und gekühlt aufbewahren"}],"notes":"Reife, feste Mango und leicht nachgebende, nicht zerfallende Avocado wählen. Limette lässt sich durch dasselbe Gewicht Zitronensaft ersetzen; Geschmack und Nährwerte ändern sich. Ohne Honig wird das Dressing saurer und die Nährwerte stimmen nicht mehr unverändert. Salat gut trocknen, damit er nicht verdünnt. Nur benötigtes Obst vorbereiten; Säure verzögert Bräunung etwas, hält Avocado aber nicht unbegrenzt frisch. Getrennte Geräte für rohes Hähnchen und verzehrfertige Lebensmittel verwenden. Die Temperatur bestimmt die Garung, nicht fehlende rosa Farbe.","nutrition":{"calories":388.4,"protein_g":36.0,"carbs_g":19.8,"fat_g":19.1,"saturated_fat_g":3.0,"fiber_g":5.3,"sugar_g":12.4,"sodium_mg":366.0,"estimated":true,"source":"USDA FoodData Central — SR Legacy (abril de 2018)","source_url":"https://fdc.nal.usda.gov/download-datasets/","inputs":[{"ingredient":"Rohe Hähnchenbrust ohne Haut und Knochen","edible_grams":600,"fdc_id":171077,"fdc_description":"Chicken, broiler or fryers, breast, skinless, boneless, meat only, raw","per_100g":{"fat_g":2.62,"calories":120.0,"saturated_fat_g":0.563,"sodium_mg":45.0,"protein_g":22.5,"sugar_g":0.0,"carbs_g":0.0,"fiber_g":0.0},"source_url":"https://fdc.nal.usda.gov/food-details/171077/nutrients"},{"ingredient":"Avocadofruchtfleisch","edible_grams":200,"fdc_id":171705,"fdc_description":"Avocados, raw, all commercial varieties","per_100g":{"protein_g":2.0,"fiber_g":6.7,"sodium_mg":7.0,"fat_g":14.66,"sugar_g":0.66,"saturated_fat_g":2.126,"carbs_g":8.53,"calories":160.0},"source_url":"https://fdc.nal.usda.gov/food-details/171705/nutrients"},{"ingredient":"Mangofruchtfleisch","edible_grams":250,"fdc_id":169910,"fdc_description":"Mangos, raw","per_100g":{"fat_g":0.38,"protein_g":0.82,"fiber_g":1.6,"sodium_mg":1.0,"carbs_g":14.98,"calories":60.0,"sugar_g":13.66,"saturated_fat_g":0.092},"source_url":"https://fdc.nal.usda.gov/food-details/169910/nutrients"},{"ingredient":"Gurke mit Schale","edible_grams":150,"fdc_id":168409,"fdc_description":"Cucumber, with peel, raw","per_100g":{"carbs_g":3.63,"calories":15.0,"sugar_g":1.67,"saturated_fat_g":0.037,"sodium_mg":2.0,"fat_g":0.11,"fiber_g":0.5,"protein_g":0.65},"source_url":"https://fdc.nal.usda.gov/food-details/168409/nutrients"},{"ingredient":"Romanasalat","edible_grams":100,"fdc_id":169247,"fdc_description":"Lettuce, cos or romaine, raw","per_100g":{"carbs_g":3.29,"calories":17.0,"saturated_fat_g":0.039,"sodium_mg":8.0,"fat_g":0.3,"sugar_g":1.19,"fiber_g":2.1,"protein_g":1.23},"source_url":"https://fdc.nal.usda.gov/food-details/169247/nutrients"},{"ingredient":"Rote Zwiebel","edible_grams":40,"fdc_id":170000,"fdc_description":"Onions, raw","per_100g":{"sugar_g":4.24,"fat_g":0.1,"carbs_g":9.34,"calories":40.0,"saturated_fat_g":0.042,"protein_g":1.1,"fiber_g":1.7,"sodium_mg":4.0},"source_url":"https://fdc.nal.usda.gov/food-details/170000/nutrients"},{"ingredient":"Limettensaft","edible_grams":40,"fdc_id":168156,"fdc_description":"Lime juice, raw","per_100g":{"protein_g":0.42,"fiber_g":0.4,"sodium_mg":2.0,"fat_g":0.07,"sugar_g":1.69,"saturated_fat_g":0.008,"carbs_g":8.42,"calories":25.0},"source_url":"https://fdc.nal.usda.gov/food-details/168156/nutrients"},{"ingredient":"Olivenöl","edible_grams":30,"fdc_id":171413,"fdc_description":"Oil, olive, salad or cooking","per_100g":{"fat_g":100.0,"carbs_g":0.0,"calories":884.0,"sodium_mg":2.0,"protein_g":0.0,"saturated_fat_g":13.808,"fiber_g":0.0,"sugar_g":0.0},"source_url":"https://fdc.nal.usda.gov/food-details/171413/nutrients"},{"ingredient":"Honig","edible_grams":10,"fdc_id":169640,"fdc_description":"Honey","per_100g":{"saturated_fat_g":0.0,"protein_g":0.3,"fiber_g":0.2,"sodium_mg":4.0,"fat_g":0.0,"carbs_g":82.4,"calories":304.0,"sugar_g":82.12},"source_url":"https://fdc.nal.usda.gov/food-details/169640/nutrients"},{"ingredient":"Salz","edible_grams":3,"fdc_id":173468,"fdc_description":"Salt, table","per_100g":{"fiber_g":0.0,"sodium_mg":38758.0,"saturated_fat_g":0.0,"protein_g":0.0,"fat_g":0.0,"carbs_g":0.0,"calories":0.0,"sugar_g":0.0},"source_url":"https://fdc.nal.usda.gov/food-details/173468/nutrients"},{"ingredient":"Schwarzer Pfeffer","edible_grams":1,"fdc_id":170931,"fdc_description":"Spices, pepper, black","per_100g":{"fat_g":3.26,"sugar_g":0.64,"carbs_g":63.95,"calories":251.0,"protein_g":10.39,"fiber_g":25.3,"sodium_mg":20.0,"saturated_fat_g":1.392},"source_url":"https://fdc.nal.usda.gov/food-details/170931/nutrients"}],"serving_size":"1 von 4 Portionen","method":"Elf überprüfte USDA-Einträge je 100 g werden mit den angegebenen essbaren Zutatengewichten gewichtet und durch 4 geteilt. Hähnchen basiert auf 600 g roher Brust ohne Haut und Knochen; rote Zwiebel wird mit allgemeiner roher Zwiebel angenähert. Alle 30 g Öl und das gesamte Dressing sind enthalten, auch wenn Reste in Pfanne oder Schüssel bleiben.","note":"Informative Schätzung, keine Analyse des fertigen Salats. Verlorene Bratsäfte, Obstsorten, zurückbleibendes Öl und Verteilung verändern das Ergebnis. Brot und zusätzliche Beilagen sind nicht enthalten."},"keywords":["Hähnchensalat Avocado Mango","Hähnchen aus der Pfanne Salat","Limettendressing"],"image_url":"/recetas/ensalada-de-pollo-con-aguacate-y-mango/portada.webp","gallery":[{"url":"/recetas/ensalada-de-pollo-con-aguacate-y-mango/portada.webp","alt":"Salat mit goldbraunen Hähnchenstreifen, Mango, Avocado, Romanasalat, Gurke und roter Zwiebel"}],"seo":{"title":"Hähnchensalat mit Avocado und Mango","description":"Hähnchensalat mit Avocado und Mango für 4: Pfannenhähnchen, Limettendressing und klare Schritte vom Waschen bis zum vorsichtigen Anrichten.","image_alt":"Salat mit goldbraunen Hähnchenstreifen, Mango, Avocado, Romanasalat, Gurke und roter Zwiebel","image_variants":["/recetas/ensalada-de-pollo-con-aguacate-y-mango/portada-1x1.webp","/recetas/ensalada-de-pollo-con-aguacate-y-mango/portada-4x3.webp","/recetas/ensalada-de-pollo-con-aguacate-y-mango/portada-16x9.webp"],"faq":[{"q":"Kann ich den Salat vorbereiten?","a":"Bereits gegartes Hähnchen, Gemüse und Dressing getrennt kühlen und beim Servieren mischen. Avocado kurz vorher schneiden. Angemachter Salat verliert Textur; Verzehr binnen 24 Stunden gekühlt ist vorgeschlagen."},{"q":"Woran erkenne ich gegartes Hähnchen?","a":"Die dickste Mitte jedes Filets mit Lebensmittelthermometer messen: mindestens 74 °C. Weder eine feste Zeit noch die Fleischfarbe allein garantieren das."},{"q":"Warum sammelt sich Wasser unten?","a":"Nasser Salat, sehr weiche Mango und früh zugegebenes Dressing können Flüssigkeit abgeben. Blätter gut trocknen, festes Obst wählen und erst vor dem Servieren mischen."}]},"published":false,"editorial_status":"draft","content_html":"<p>Dieser Salat verbindet Hähnchen aus der Pfanne, Avocado- und Mangowürfel, Romanasalat, Gurke und rote Zwiebel. Limette, Olivenöl und etwas Honig bilden ein leichtes Dressing ohne dicke Sauce.</p><p>Der Vorschlag ergibt 4 Portionen. Die geschätzten 55 Minuten enthalten 30 Minuten Vorbereitung, 20 Minuten Braten in zwei Durchgängen und 5 Minuten Ruhe. Hähnchen mit Thermometer auf mindestens 74 °C prüfen; Mengen, Zeiten und Ausbeute sind noch nicht im Küchentest bestätigt.</p>"},{"id":"5a7f2988-7a40-5473-b709-dffb3a676e66","recipe_group_id":"43e5b443-a225-49c7-b432-217b5df787be","slug":"chicken-salad-with-avocado-and-mango-2","public_path":"/en/chicken-salad-with-avocado-and-mango-2","source_url":"https://manualdecocina.com/en/chicken-salad-with-avocado-and-mango-2/","language":"en","title":"Chicken salad with avocado and mango","excerpt":"Chicken, avocado and mango salad for 4 with pan-cooked chicken and lime dressing. Follow washing, cooking, slicing and gentle assembly step by step.","summary":"This salad combines pan-cooked chicken, avocado and mango cubes, lettuce, cucumber and red onion. A dressing of lime, olive oil and a little honey brings everything together without a thick sauce.\n\nThe proposal serves 4. The estimated 55 minutes include 30 minutes of preparation, 20 of cooking in two batches and 5 of resting. Check the chicken with a thermometer for at least 74 °C; quantities, times and yield still need confirmation in a kitchen test.","category":"Salads","category_slug":"ensaladas","difficulty":"Easy","course":"Main-course salad","cuisine":"International","prep_time_minutes":30,"cook_time_minutes":20,"total_time_minutes":55,"servings":4,"ingredients":[{"name":"Raw boneless skinless chicken breast","amount":"600","unit":"g","group":"Salad"},{"name":"Avocado flesh","amount":"200","unit":"g","group":"Salad"},{"name":"Mango flesh","amount":"250","unit":"g","group":"Salad"},{"name":"Cucumber with skin","amount":"150","unit":"g","group":"Salad"},{"name":"Romaine lettuce","amount":"100","unit":"g","group":"Salad"},{"name":"Red onion","amount":"40","unit":"g","group":"Salad"},{"name":"Lime juice","amount":"40","unit":"g","group":"Cooking and dressing"},{"name":"Olive oil","amount":"30","unit":"g","group":"Cooking and dressing"},{"name":"Honey","amount":"10","unit":"g","group":"Cooking and dressing"},{"name":"Salt","amount":"3","unit":"g","group":"Cooking and dressing"},{"name":"Black pepper","amount":"1","unit":"g","group":"Cooking and dressing"}],"steps":[{"title":"Wash and dry the produce","content":"Wash your hands and prepare a clean produce board separate from the chicken board. Rinse cucumber, mango, avocado and lime under running water before cutting or peeling, without soap. Wash and thoroughly dry the 100 g lettuce unless its package says ready to eat. Slice the 150 g cucumber into thin half-moons and the 40 g red onion into slivers; refrigerate with the lettuce while cooking.","image_url":"/recetas/ensalada-de-pollo-con-aguacate-y-mango/paso-01.webp","image_alt":"Chicken salad with avocado and mango: Wash and dry the produce"},{"title":"Prepare four chicken fillets","content":"Do not wash raw chicken. On its separate board, divide the 600 g boneless skinless breast into four fillets of about 150 g, with an even thickness of about 1.5 cm. If needed, gently flatten between food-safe sheets. Season with 1 g salt and 0.5 g pepper. Discard used paper and wash hands and utensils; do not put salad or cooked chicken on the raw-chicken board or plate.","image_url":"/recetas/ensalada-de-pollo-con-aguacate-y-mango/paso-02.webp","image_alt":"Chicken salad with avocado and mango: Prepare four chicken fillets"},{"title":"Cook and check the temperature","content":"Heat a wide frying pan over medium heat with 5 g oil. Cook two fillets for about 4–5 minutes per side, leaving them still until they release; adjust the heat if they burn. Use a food thermometer to check that the thickest centre of each fillet reaches at least 74 °C, without touching the pan with the probe. If below temperature, keep cooking and check again; colour and timing alone are insufficient. Transfer to a clean plate and repeat with the other two fillets and the remaining 5 g cooking oil. The planned 20 minutes are only a guide.","image_url":"/recetas/ensalada-de-pollo-con-aguacate-y-mango/paso-03.webp","image_alt":"Chicken salad with avocado and mango: Cook and check the temperature"},{"title":"Rest and slice into strips","content":"Rest the cooked chicken for 5 minutes on the clean plate. With a clean knife and board, cut each fillet into strips about 1 cm wide. It should stop giving off intense steam before going into the salad; wait longer if needed and add that time to the total. Set aside only while finishing assembly, not for hours at room temperature.","image_url":"/recetas/ensalada-de-pollo-con-aguacate-y-mango/paso-04.webp","image_alt":"Chicken salad with avocado and mango: Rest and slice into strips"},{"title":"Dice the mango and avocado","content":"Peel the washed mango, remove the flesh from its stone and weigh 250 g. Cut into cubes about 2 cm across. Open the washed avocado and remove its stone with a spoon rather than striking it with a knife. Scoop out and weigh 200 g flesh, then cut into roughly 2 cm cubes. Use the clean produce board without raw-chicken contact and prepare both just before mixing to limit avocado browning.","image_url":"/recetas/ensalada-de-pollo-con-aguacate-y-mango/paso-05.webp","image_alt":"Chicken salad with avocado and mango: Dice the mango and avocado"},{"title":"Whisk the lime dressing","content":"In a small bowl mix the 40 g lime juice, 10 g honey, remaining 2 g salt and 0.5 g pepper. Add the 20 g oil reserved for dressing and whisk with a fork until temporarily combined. Stir again just before use if it separates. Dressing does not replace cooking chicken or prevent cross-contamination.","image_url":"/recetas/ensalada-de-pollo-con-aguacate-y-mango/paso-06.webp","image_alt":"Chicken salad with avocado and mango: Whisk the lime dressing"},{"title":"Assemble gently","content":"Put lettuce, cucumber and onion in a large bowl and toss with half the dressing. Add mango and avocado cubes and the warm chicken strips. Fold in the remaining dressing with two spoons, lifting gently from below without crushing the avocado. Divide among four plates, distributing chicken and fruit evenly.","image_url":"/recetas/ensalada-de-pollo-con-aguacate-y-mango/paso-07.webp","image_alt":"Chicken salad with avocado and mango: Assemble gently"},{"title":"Serve and refrigerate","content":"Serve freshly assembled, alone or with an accompaniment not included in the nutrition. Cover leftovers and refrigerate at 4 °C or below within 2 hours, or 1 hour if the surrounding temperature exceeds 32 °C. As a conservative proposal, eat assembled salad within 24 hours; lettuce and avocado lose texture. To prepare ahead, keep cooked chicken, vegetables and dressing separately chilled and assemble when serving; do not freeze the complete salad because its texture changes substantially.","image_url":"/recetas/ensalada-de-pollo-con-aguacate-y-mango/paso-08.webp","image_alt":"Chicken salad with avocado and mango: Serve and refrigerate"}],"notes":"Choose ripe but firm mango and avocado that yields slightly without falling apart. Replace lime juice with the same weight of lemon juice if desired; flavour and nutrition change. Omitting honey makes the dressing sharper and changes its nutritional figures. Dry lettuce prevents dilution. Prepare only the fruit needed; acidity slows browning a little but does not preserve avocado indefinitely. Use separate utensils for raw chicken and ready-to-eat foods. Temperature determines cooking, not the absence of a pink colour.","nutrition":{"calories":388.4,"protein_g":36.0,"carbs_g":19.8,"fat_g":19.1,"saturated_fat_g":3.0,"fiber_g":5.3,"sugar_g":12.4,"sodium_mg":366.0,"estimated":true,"source":"USDA FoodData Central — SR Legacy (abril de 2018)","source_url":"https://fdc.nal.usda.gov/download-datasets/","inputs":[{"ingredient":"Raw boneless skinless chicken breast","edible_grams":600,"fdc_id":171077,"fdc_description":"Chicken, broiler or fryers, breast, skinless, boneless, meat only, raw","per_100g":{"fat_g":2.62,"calories":120.0,"saturated_fat_g":0.563,"sodium_mg":45.0,"protein_g":22.5,"sugar_g":0.0,"carbs_g":0.0,"fiber_g":0.0},"source_url":"https://fdc.nal.usda.gov/food-details/171077/nutrients"},{"ingredient":"Avocado flesh","edible_grams":200,"fdc_id":171705,"fdc_description":"Avocados, raw, all commercial varieties","per_100g":{"protein_g":2.0,"fiber_g":6.7,"sodium_mg":7.0,"fat_g":14.66,"sugar_g":0.66,"saturated_fat_g":2.126,"carbs_g":8.53,"calories":160.0},"source_url":"https://fdc.nal.usda.gov/food-details/171705/nutrients"},{"ingredient":"Mango flesh","edible_grams":250,"fdc_id":169910,"fdc_description":"Mangos, raw","per_100g":{"fat_g":0.38,"protein_g":0.82,"fiber_g":1.6,"sodium_mg":1.0,"carbs_g":14.98,"calories":60.0,"sugar_g":13.66,"saturated_fat_g":0.092},"source_url":"https://fdc.nal.usda.gov/food-details/169910/nutrients"},{"ingredient":"Cucumber with skin","edible_grams":150,"fdc_id":168409,"fdc_description":"Cucumber, with peel, raw","per_100g":{"carbs_g":3.63,"calories":15.0,"sugar_g":1.67,"saturated_fat_g":0.037,"sodium_mg":2.0,"fat_g":0.11,"fiber_g":0.5,"protein_g":0.65},"source_url":"https://fdc.nal.usda.gov/food-details/168409/nutrients"},{"ingredient":"Romaine lettuce","edible_grams":100,"fdc_id":169247,"fdc_description":"Lettuce, cos or romaine, raw","per_100g":{"carbs_g":3.29,"calories":17.0,"saturated_fat_g":0.039,"sodium_mg":8.0,"fat_g":0.3,"sugar_g":1.19,"fiber_g":2.1,"protein_g":1.23},"source_url":"https://fdc.nal.usda.gov/food-details/169247/nutrients"},{"ingredient":"Red onion","edible_grams":40,"fdc_id":170000,"fdc_description":"Onions, raw","per_100g":{"sugar_g":4.24,"fat_g":0.1,"carbs_g":9.34,"calories":40.0,"saturated_fat_g":0.042,"protein_g":1.1,"fiber_g":1.7,"sodium_mg":4.0},"source_url":"https://fdc.nal.usda.gov/food-details/170000/nutrients"},{"ingredient":"Lime juice","edible_grams":40,"fdc_id":168156,"fdc_description":"Lime juice, raw","per_100g":{"protein_g":0.42,"fiber_g":0.4,"sodium_mg":2.0,"fat_g":0.07,"sugar_g":1.69,"saturated_fat_g":0.008,"carbs_g":8.42,"calories":25.0},"source_url":"https://fdc.nal.usda.gov/food-details/168156/nutrients"},{"ingredient":"Olive oil","edible_grams":30,"fdc_id":171413,"fdc_description":"Oil, olive, salad or cooking","per_100g":{"fat_g":100.0,"carbs_g":0.0,"calories":884.0,"sodium_mg":2.0,"protein_g":0.0,"saturated_fat_g":13.808,"fiber_g":0.0,"sugar_g":0.0},"source_url":"https://fdc.nal.usda.gov/food-details/171413/nutrients"},{"ingredient":"Honey","edible_grams":10,"fdc_id":169640,"fdc_description":"Honey","per_100g":{"saturated_fat_g":0.0,"protein_g":0.3,"fiber_g":0.2,"sodium_mg":4.0,"fat_g":0.0,"carbs_g":82.4,"calories":304.0,"sugar_g":82.12},"source_url":"https://fdc.nal.usda.gov/food-details/169640/nutrients"},{"ingredient":"Salt","edible_grams":3,"fdc_id":173468,"fdc_description":"Salt, table","per_100g":{"fiber_g":0.0,"sodium_mg":38758.0,"saturated_fat_g":0.0,"protein_g":0.0,"fat_g":0.0,"carbs_g":0.0,"calories":0.0,"sugar_g":0.0},"source_url":"https://fdc.nal.usda.gov/food-details/173468/nutrients"},{"ingredient":"Black pepper","edible_grams":1,"fdc_id":170931,"fdc_description":"Spices, pepper, black","per_100g":{"fat_g":3.26,"sugar_g":0.64,"carbs_g":63.95,"calories":251.0,"protein_g":10.39,"fiber_g":25.3,"sodium_mg":20.0,"saturated_fat_g":1.392},"source_url":"https://fdc.nal.usda.gov/food-details/170931/nutrients"}],"serving_size":"1 of 4 portions","method":"Eleven verified USDA entries per 100 g are weighted by the stated edible ingredient amounts and divided by 4. Chicken uses 600 g raw boneless skinless breast; red onion is approximated with generic raw onion data. All 30 g oil and all dressing are counted even if some remains in the pan or bowl.","note":"An informational estimate, not an analysis of the prepared salad. Cooking juices lost, fruit variety, retained oil and portioning affect the result. Bread and other additional accompaniments are not counted."},"keywords":["chicken avocado mango salad","pan-cooked chicken salad","lime salad dressing"],"image_url":"/recetas/ensalada-de-pollo-con-aguacate-y-mango/portada.webp","gallery":[{"url":"/recetas/ensalada-de-pollo-con-aguacate-y-mango/portada.webp","alt":"Salad with browned chicken strips, mango and avocado cubes, lettuce, cucumber and red onion"}],"seo":{"title":"Chicken salad with avocado and mango","description":"Chicken, avocado and mango salad for 4 with pan-cooked chicken and lime dressing. Follow washing, cooking, slicing and gentle assembly step by step.","image_alt":"Salad with browned chicken strips, mango and avocado cubes, lettuce, cucumber and red onion","image_variants":["/recetas/ensalada-de-pollo-con-aguacate-y-mango/portada-1x1.webp","/recetas/ensalada-de-pollo-con-aguacate-y-mango/portada-4x3.webp","/recetas/ensalada-de-pollo-con-aguacate-y-mango/portada-16x9.webp"],"faq":[{"q":"Can I prepare the salad ahead?","a":"Keep already cooked chicken, vegetables and dressing separately chilled and assemble at serving time. Cut avocado near assembly. Dressed salad loses texture; consumption within 24 hours refrigerated is proposed."},{"q":"How do I know the chicken is cooked?","a":"Measure the thickest centre of each fillet with a food thermometer: it must reach at least 74 °C. Neither a fixed time nor meat colour alone guarantees that point."},{"q":"Why is there water at the bottom?","a":"Wet lettuce, very soft mango and dressing added too far in advance can release liquid. Dry leaves well, use firm fruit and toss just before serving."}]},"published":false,"editorial_status":"draft","content_html":"<p>This salad combines pan-cooked chicken, avocado and mango cubes, lettuce, cucumber and red onion. A dressing of lime, olive oil and a little honey brings everything together without a thick sauce.</p><p>The proposal serves 4. The estimated 55 minutes include 30 minutes of preparation, 20 of cooking in two batches and 5 of resting. Check the chicken with a thermometer for at least 74 °C; quantities, times and yield still need confirmation in a kitchen test.</p>"},{"id":"67f57ec6-9510-5536-a0fa-48aa6270f419","recipe_group_id":"43e5b443-a225-49c7-b432-217b5df787be","slug":"salade-de-poulet-avec-avocat-et-mangue-2","public_path":"/fr/salade-de-poulet-avec-avocat-et-mangue-2","source_url":"https://manualdecocina.com/fr/salade-de-poulet-avec-avocat-et-mangue-2/","language":"fr","title":"Salade de poulet à l’avocat et à la mangue","excerpt":"Salade de poulet, avocat et mangue pour 4, poulet à la poêle et vinaigrette au citron vert. Lavez, cuisez, découpez et assemblez sans écraser les fruits.","summary":"Cette salade associe poulet poêlé, dés d’avocat et de mangue, laitue, concombre et oignon rouge. Citron vert, huile d’olive et un peu de miel lient les ingrédients sans sauce épaisse.\n\nLa proposition donne 4 portions. Les 55 minutes estimées comprennent 30 de préparation, 20 de cuisson en deux fois et 5 de repos. Vérifiez au thermomètre que le poulet atteint au moins 74 °C ; doses, temps et rendement restent à confirmer par un essai en cuisine.","category":"Salades","category_slug":"ensaladas","difficulty":"Facile","course":"Salade en plat principal","cuisine":"Internationale","prep_time_minutes":30,"cook_time_minutes":20,"total_time_minutes":55,"servings":4,"ingredients":[{"name":"Blanc de poulet cru sans peau ni os","amount":"600","unit":"g","group":"Salade"},{"name":"Chair d’avocat","amount":"200","unit":"g","group":"Salade"},{"name":"Chair de mangue","amount":"250","unit":"g","group":"Salade"},{"name":"Concombre avec peau","amount":"150","unit":"g","group":"Salade"},{"name":"Laitue romaine","amount":"100","unit":"g","group":"Salade"},{"name":"Oignon rouge","amount":"40","unit":"g","group":"Salade"},{"name":"Jus de citron vert","amount":"40","unit":"g","group":"Cuisson et vinaigrette"},{"name":"Huile d’olive","amount":"30","unit":"g","group":"Cuisson et vinaigrette"},{"name":"Miel","amount":"10","unit":"g","group":"Cuisson et vinaigrette"},{"name":"Sel","amount":"3","unit":"g","group":"Cuisson et vinaigrette"},{"name":"Poivre noir","amount":"1","unit":"g","group":"Cuisson et vinaigrette"}],"steps":[{"title":"Laver et sécher les végétaux","content":"Lavez-vous les mains et préparez une planche propre pour fruits et légumes, séparée de celle du poulet. Rincez concombre, mangue, avocat et citron vert sous l’eau courante avant de couper ou d’éplucher, sans savon. Lavez et séchez bien les 100 g de laitue, sauf si l’emballage indique prête à consommer. Coupez 150 g de concombre en fines demi-lunes et 40 g d’oignon en lamelles ; réservez avec la laitue au réfrigérateur pendant la cuisson.","image_url":"/recetas/ensalada-de-pollo-con-aguacate-y-mango/paso-01.webp","image_alt":"Salade de poulet à l’avocat et à la mangue: Laver et sécher les végétaux"},{"title":"Préparer quatre filets de poulet","content":"Ne lavez pas le poulet cru. Sur sa planche séparée, partagez les 600 g de blanc sans peau ni os en quatre filets d’environ 150 g, épais régulièrement d’environ 1,5 cm. Si besoin, aplatissez doucement entre feuilles aptes au contact alimentaire. Assaisonnez avec 1 g de sel et 0,5 g de poivre. Jetez le papier utilisé et lavez mains et ustensiles ; ne posez ni salade ni poulet cuit sur la planche ou l’assiette du poulet cru.","image_url":"/recetas/ensalada-de-pollo-con-aguacate-y-mango/paso-02.webp","image_alt":"Salade de poulet à l’avocat et à la mangue: Préparer quatre filets de poulet"},{"title":"Cuire et vérifier la température","content":"Chauffez une grande poêle à feu moyen avec 5 g d’huile. Cuisez deux filets environ 4–5 minutes par face, sans les déplacer avant qu’ils se décollent ; ajustez si cela brûle. Mesurez au thermomètre alimentaire le centre le plus épais de chaque filet : au moins 74 °C, sans toucher la poêle avec la sonde. Sinon, poursuivez et mesurez à nouveau ; couleur et minuterie ne suffisent pas. Transférez dans une assiette propre et recommencez avec les deux autres et les 5 g d’huile de cuisson restants. Les 20 minutes prévues sont indicatives.","image_url":"/recetas/ensalada-de-pollo-con-aguacate-y-mango/paso-03.webp","image_alt":"Salade de poulet à l’avocat et à la mangue: Cuire et vérifier la température"},{"title":"Laisser reposer et couper en lanières","content":"Laissez le poulet cuit reposer 5 minutes dans l’assiette propre. Avec couteau et planche propres, coupez chaque filet en lanières d’environ 1 cm. Il ne doit plus dégager une forte vapeur avant d’aller dans la salade ; attendez davantage si nécessaire et ajoutez ce temps au total. Réservez seulement pendant la fin du montage, pas des heures à température ambiante.","image_url":"/recetas/ensalada-de-pollo-con-aguacate-y-mango/paso-04.webp","image_alt":"Salade de poulet à l’avocat et à la mangue: Laisser reposer et couper en lanières"},{"title":"Couper mangue et avocat","content":"Épluchez la mangue lavée, détachez la chair du noyau et pesez 250 g. Coupez en dés d’environ 2 cm. Ouvrez l’avocat lavé, retirez le noyau avec une cuillère plutôt qu’en frappant avec un couteau, prélevez la chair et pesez 200 g. Coupez aussi en dés de 2 cm. Utilisez la planche à fruits propre sans contact avec du poulet cru et préparez juste avant de mélanger pour limiter le brunissement.","image_url":"/recetas/ensalada-de-pollo-con-aguacate-y-mango/paso-05.webp","image_alt":"Salade de poulet à l’avocat et à la mangue: Couper mangue et avocat"},{"title":"Mélanger la vinaigrette au citron vert","content":"Dans un petit bol mélangez 40 g de jus de citron vert, 10 g de miel, les 2 g de sel et 0,5 g de poivre restants. Ajoutez les 20 g d’huile réservés à la vinaigrette et battez à la fourchette pour une liaison temporaire. Remuez juste avant usage si elle se sépare. La vinaigrette ne remplace pas la cuisson du poulet et n’empêche pas la contamination croisée.","image_url":"/recetas/ensalada-de-pollo-con-aguacate-y-mango/paso-06.webp","image_alt":"Salade de poulet à l’avocat et à la mangue: Mélanger la vinaigrette au citron vert"},{"title":"Assembler délicatement","content":"Mettez laitue, concombre et oignon dans un grand saladier et mélangez avec la moitié de la vinaigrette. Ajoutez mangue, avocat et poulet tiède. Incorporez le reste avec deux cuillères, en soulevant doucement depuis le fond sans écraser l’avocat. Répartissez dans quatre assiettes, avec des quantités similaires de poulet et de fruits.","image_url":"/recetas/ensalada-de-pollo-con-aguacate-y-mango/paso-07.webp","image_alt":"Salade de poulet à l’avocat et à la mangue: Assembler délicatement"},{"title":"Servir et réfrigérer","content":"Servez aussitôt, seule ou avec un accompagnement non compris dans la nutrition. Couvrez les restes et réfrigérez à 4 °C maximum dans les 2 heures, ou 1 heure si l’ambiance dépasse 32 °C. Par prudence, consommez la salade montée sous 24 heures ; laitue et avocat perdront leur texture. Pour anticiper, gardez poulet cuit, végétaux et vinaigrette séparés au froid et montez au service. Ne congelez pas la salade complète : sa texture changerait beaucoup.","image_url":"/recetas/ensalada-de-pollo-con-aguacate-y-mango/paso-08.webp","image_alt":"Salade de poulet à l’avocat et à la mangue: Servir et réfrigérer"}],"notes":"Choisissez une mangue mûre mais ferme et un avocat souple sans être défait. Remplacez éventuellement le citron vert par le même poids de jus de citron jaune ; saveur et nutrition changent. Sans miel, la vinaigrette devient plus acide et les chiffres diffèrent. Séchez la laitue pour ne pas diluer. Préparez seulement les fruits utiles ; l’acide ralentit un peu le brunissement, sans préserver l’avocat indéfiniment. Séparez les ustensiles du poulet cru et des aliments prêts à manger. La température détermine la cuisson, pas l’absence de rose.","nutrition":{"calories":388.4,"protein_g":36.0,"carbs_g":19.8,"fat_g":19.1,"saturated_fat_g":3.0,"fiber_g":5.3,"sugar_g":12.4,"sodium_mg":366.0,"estimated":true,"source":"USDA FoodData Central — SR Legacy (abril de 2018)","source_url":"https://fdc.nal.usda.gov/download-datasets/","inputs":[{"ingredient":"Blanc de poulet cru sans peau ni os","edible_grams":600,"fdc_id":171077,"fdc_description":"Chicken, broiler or fryers, breast, skinless, boneless, meat only, raw","per_100g":{"fat_g":2.62,"calories":120.0,"saturated_fat_g":0.563,"sodium_mg":45.0,"protein_g":22.5,"sugar_g":0.0,"carbs_g":0.0,"fiber_g":0.0},"source_url":"https://fdc.nal.usda.gov/food-details/171077/nutrients"},{"ingredient":"Chair d’avocat","edible_grams":200,"fdc_id":171705,"fdc_description":"Avocados, raw, all commercial varieties","per_100g":{"protein_g":2.0,"fiber_g":6.7,"sodium_mg":7.0,"fat_g":14.66,"sugar_g":0.66,"saturated_fat_g":2.126,"carbs_g":8.53,"calories":160.0},"source_url":"https://fdc.nal.usda.gov/food-details/171705/nutrients"},{"ingredient":"Chair de mangue","edible_grams":250,"fdc_id":169910,"fdc_description":"Mangos, raw","per_100g":{"fat_g":0.38,"protein_g":0.82,"fiber_g":1.6,"sodium_mg":1.0,"carbs_g":14.98,"calories":60.0,"sugar_g":13.66,"saturated_fat_g":0.092},"source_url":"https://fdc.nal.usda.gov/food-details/169910/nutrients"},{"ingredient":"Concombre avec peau","edible_grams":150,"fdc_id":168409,"fdc_description":"Cucumber, with peel, raw","per_100g":{"carbs_g":3.63,"calories":15.0,"sugar_g":1.67,"saturated_fat_g":0.037,"sodium_mg":2.0,"fat_g":0.11,"fiber_g":0.5,"protein_g":0.65},"source_url":"https://fdc.nal.usda.gov/food-details/168409/nutrients"},{"ingredient":"Laitue romaine","edible_grams":100,"fdc_id":169247,"fdc_description":"Lettuce, cos or romaine, raw","per_100g":{"carbs_g":3.29,"calories":17.0,"saturated_fat_g":0.039,"sodium_mg":8.0,"fat_g":0.3,"sugar_g":1.19,"fiber_g":2.1,"protein_g":1.23},"source_url":"https://fdc.nal.usda.gov/food-details/169247/nutrients"},{"ingredient":"Oignon rouge","edible_grams":40,"fdc_id":170000,"fdc_description":"Onions, raw","per_100g":{"sugar_g":4.24,"fat_g":0.1,"carbs_g":9.34,"calories":40.0,"saturated_fat_g":0.042,"protein_g":1.1,"fiber_g":1.7,"sodium_mg":4.0},"source_url":"https://fdc.nal.usda.gov/food-details/170000/nutrients"},{"ingredient":"Jus de citron vert","edible_grams":40,"fdc_id":168156,"fdc_description":"Lime juice, raw","per_100g":{"protein_g":0.42,"fiber_g":0.4,"sodium_mg":2.0,"fat_g":0.07,"sugar_g":1.69,"saturated_fat_g":0.008,"carbs_g":8.42,"calories":25.0},"source_url":"https://fdc.nal.usda.gov/food-details/168156/nutrients"},{"ingredient":"Huile d’olive","edible_grams":30,"fdc_id":171413,"fdc_description":"Oil, olive, salad or cooking","per_100g":{"fat_g":100.0,"carbs_g":0.0,"calories":884.0,"sodium_mg":2.0,"protein_g":0.0,"saturated_fat_g":13.808,"fiber_g":0.0,"sugar_g":0.0},"source_url":"https://fdc.nal.usda.gov/food-details/171413/nutrients"},{"ingredient":"Miel","edible_grams":10,"fdc_id":169640,"fdc_description":"Honey","per_100g":{"saturated_fat_g":0.0,"protein_g":0.3,"fiber_g":0.2,"sodium_mg":4.0,"fat_g":0.0,"carbs_g":82.4,"calories":304.0,"sugar_g":82.12},"source_url":"https://fdc.nal.usda.gov/food-details/169640/nutrients"},{"ingredient":"Sel","edible_grams":3,"fdc_id":173468,"fdc_description":"Salt, table","per_100g":{"fiber_g":0.0,"sodium_mg":38758.0,"saturated_fat_g":0.0,"protein_g":0.0,"fat_g":0.0,"carbs_g":0.0,"calories":0.0,"sugar_g":0.0},"source_url":"https://fdc.nal.usda.gov/food-details/173468/nutrients"},{"ingredient":"Poivre noir","edible_grams":1,"fdc_id":170931,"fdc_description":"Spices, pepper, black","per_100g":{"fat_g":3.26,"sugar_g":0.64,"carbs_g":63.95,"calories":251.0,"protein_g":10.39,"fiber_g":25.3,"sodium_mg":20.0,"saturated_fat_g":1.392},"source_url":"https://fdc.nal.usda.gov/food-details/170931/nutrients"}],"serving_size":"1 des 4 portions","method":"Onze fiches USDA vérifiées pour 100 g sont pondérées par les poids comestibles indiqués et divisées par 4. Poulet calculé sur 600 g de blanc cru sans peau ni os ; oignon rouge approché par l’oignon cru générique. Les 30 g d’huile et toute la vinaigrette sont comptés, même avec des restes dans la poêle ou le bol.","note":"Estimation informative, pas analyse de la salade préparée. Jus perdus à la cuisson, variété des fruits, huile retenue et répartition changent le résultat. Pain et accompagnements supplémentaires ne sont pas comptés."},"keywords":["salade poulet avocat mangue","salade poulet poêlé","vinaigrette citron vert"],"image_url":"/recetas/ensalada-de-pollo-con-aguacate-y-mango/portada.webp","gallery":[{"url":"/recetas/ensalada-de-pollo-con-aguacate-y-mango/portada.webp","alt":"Salade aux lanières de poulet dorées, dés de mangue et avocat, laitue, concombre et oignon rouge"}],"seo":{"title":"Salade de poulet à l’avocat et à la mangue","description":"Salade de poulet, avocat et mangue pour 4, poulet à la poêle et vinaigrette au citron vert. Lavez, cuisez, découpez et assemblez sans écraser les fruits.","image_alt":"Salade aux lanières de poulet dorées, dés de mangue et avocat, laitue, concombre et oignon rouge","image_variants":["/recetas/ensalada-de-pollo-con-aguacate-y-mango/portada-1x1.webp","/recetas/ensalada-de-pollo-con-aguacate-y-mango/portada-4x3.webp","/recetas/ensalada-de-pollo-con-aguacate-y-mango/portada-16x9.webp"],"faq":[{"q":"Puis-je préparer la salade à l’avance ?","a":"Gardez poulet déjà cuit, végétaux et vinaigrette séparés au froid, puis assemblez au service. Coupez l’avocat près du montage. La salade assaisonnée perd sa texture ; consommation réfrigérée sous 24 heures proposée."},{"q":"Comment vérifier la cuisson du poulet ?","a":"Mesurez le centre le plus épais de chaque filet avec un thermomètre alimentaire : au moins 74 °C. Un temps fixe ou la couleur seuls ne le garantissent pas."},{"q":"Pourquoi y a-t-il de l’eau au fond ?","a":"Laitue mouillée, mangue trop molle et assaisonnement trop précoce peuvent libérer du liquide. Séchez les feuilles, choisissez des fruits fermes et mélangez juste avant de servir."}]},"published":false,"editorial_status":"draft","content_html":"<p>Cette salade associe poulet poêlé, dés d’avocat et de mangue, laitue, concombre et oignon rouge. Citron vert, huile d’olive et un peu de miel lient les ingrédients sans sauce épaisse.</p><p>La proposition donne 4 portions. Les 55 minutes estimées comprennent 30 de préparation, 20 de cuisson en deux fois et 5 de repos. Vérifiez au thermomètre que le poulet atteint au moins 74 °C ; doses, temps et rendement restent à confirmer par un essai en cuisine.</p>"},{"id":"e60754b4-6341-52eb-9596-090e394b8268","recipe_group_id":"43e5b443-a225-49c7-b432-217b5df787be","slug":"insalata-di-pollo-con-avocado-e-mango-2","public_path":"/it/insalata-di-pollo-con-avocado-e-mango-2","source_url":"https://manualdecocina.com/it/insalata-di-pollo-con-avocado-e-mango-2/","language":"it","title":"Insalata di pollo con avocado e mango","excerpt":"Insalata di pollo, avocado e mango per 4: pollo in padella e condimento al lime. Lava, cuoci, taglia e assembla senza schiacciare la frutta.","summary":"Questa insalata combina pollo cotto in padella, cubetti di avocado e mango, lattuga, cetriolo e cipolla rossa. Lime, olio d’oliva e poco miele legano gli ingredienti senza una salsa densa.\n\nLa proposta rende 4 porzioni. I 55 minuti stimati comprendono 30 di preparazione, 20 di cottura in due riprese e 5 di riposo. Controlla il pollo con un termometro: almeno 74 °C. Dosi, tempi e resa sono ancora da confermare con una prova in cucina.","category":"Insalate","category_slug":"ensaladas","difficulty":"Facile","course":"Insalata come piatto principale","cuisine":"Internazionale","prep_time_minutes":30,"cook_time_minutes":20,"total_time_minutes":55,"servings":4,"ingredients":[{"name":"Petto di pollo crudo senza pelle e ossa","amount":"600","unit":"g","group":"Insalata"},{"name":"Polpa di avocado","amount":"200","unit":"g","group":"Insalata"},{"name":"Polpa di mango","amount":"250","unit":"g","group":"Insalata"},{"name":"Cetriolo con buccia","amount":"150","unit":"g","group":"Insalata"},{"name":"Lattuga romana","amount":"100","unit":"g","group":"Insalata"},{"name":"Cipolla rossa","amount":"40","unit":"g","group":"Insalata"},{"name":"Succo di lime","amount":"40","unit":"g","group":"Cottura e condimento"},{"name":"Olio d’oliva","amount":"30","unit":"g","group":"Cottura e condimento"},{"name":"Miele","amount":"10","unit":"g","group":"Cottura e condimento"},{"name":"Sale","amount":"3","unit":"g","group":"Cottura e condimento"},{"name":"Pepe nero","amount":"1","unit":"g","group":"Cottura e condimento"}],"steps":[{"title":"Lava e asciuga le verdure","content":"Lava le mani e prepara un tagliere pulito per frutta e verdura, separato da quello del pollo. Sciacqua cetriolo, mango, avocado e lime sotto acqua corrente prima di tagliare o sbucciare, senza sapone. Lava e asciuga bene i 100 g di lattuga, salvo indicazione pronta al consumo sulla confezione. Taglia 150 g di cetriolo a mezze lune sottili e 40 g di cipolla a fettine; tieni in frigorifero con la lattuga mentre cuoci.","image_url":"/recetas/ensalada-de-pollo-con-aguacate-y-mango/paso-01.webp","image_alt":"Insalata di pollo con avocado e mango: Lava e asciuga le verdure"},{"title":"Prepara quattro filetti di pollo","content":"Non lavare il pollo crudo. Sul tagliere separato dividi 600 g di petto senza pelle e ossa in quattro filetti di circa 150 g, spessi uniformemente circa 1,5 cm. Se serve, appiattisci delicatamente tra fogli adatti agli alimenti. Condisci con 1 g di sale e 0,5 g di pepe. Elimina la carta usata e lava mani e utensili; non mettere insalata o pollo cotto sul tagliere o piatto del pollo crudo.","image_url":"/recetas/ensalada-de-pollo-con-aguacate-y-mango/paso-02.webp","image_alt":"Insalata di pollo con avocado e mango: Prepara quattro filetti di pollo"},{"title":"Cuoci e controlla la temperatura","content":"Scalda una padella larga a fuoco medio con 5 g d’olio. Cuoci due filetti per circa 4–5 minuti per lato, senza muoverli finché si staccano; regola il fuoco se bruciano. Controlla con un termometro alimentare che il centro più spesso di ogni filetto raggiunga almeno 74 °C, senza toccare la padella con la sonda. Se manca temperatura, continua e misura ancora: colore e orologio non bastano. Trasferisci su un piatto pulito e ripeti con gli altri due filetti e i restanti 5 g d’olio per cottura. I 20 minuti previsti sono indicativi.","image_url":"/recetas/ensalada-de-pollo-con-aguacate-y-mango/paso-03.webp","image_alt":"Insalata di pollo con avocado e mango: Cuoci e controlla la temperatura"},{"title":"Lascia riposare e taglia a strisce","content":"Lascia riposare il pollo cotto 5 minuti sul piatto pulito. Con coltello e tagliere puliti, taglia ogni filetto in strisce larghe circa 1 cm. Deve smettere di emettere molto vapore prima dell’insalata; aspetta ancora se serve e aggiungi l’attesa al totale. Tieni da parte solo durante il montaggio, non per ore a temperatura ambiente.","image_url":"/recetas/ensalada-de-pollo-con-aguacate-y-mango/paso-04.webp","image_alt":"Insalata di pollo con avocado e mango: Lascia riposare e taglia a strisce"},{"title":"Taglia mango e avocado","content":"Sbuccia il mango lavato, separa la polpa dal nocciolo e pesane 250 g. Taglia a cubetti di circa 2 cm. Apri l’avocado lavato, togli il nocciolo con un cucchiaio anziché colpirlo con il coltello, estrai la polpa e pesane 200 g. Taglia anche questa a cubetti di 2 cm. Usa il tagliere da frutta pulito senza contatto con pollo crudo e prepara entrambi poco prima di mescolare per limitare l’annerimento.","image_url":"/recetas/ensalada-de-pollo-con-aguacate-y-mango/paso-05.webp","image_alt":"Insalata di pollo con avocado e mango: Taglia mango e avocado"},{"title":"Mescola il condimento al lime","content":"In una ciotolina mescola 40 g di succo di lime, 10 g di miele, i restanti 2 g di sale e 0,5 g di pepe. Aggiungi 20 g d’olio riservati al condimento e sbatti con una forchetta fino a una miscela temporanea. Rimescola prima dell’uso se si separa. Il condimento non sostituisce la cottura del pollo né impedisce contaminazioni incrociate.","image_url":"/recetas/ensalada-de-pollo-con-aguacate-y-mango/paso-06.webp","image_alt":"Insalata di pollo con avocado e mango: Mescola il condimento al lime"},{"title":"Assembla delicatamente","content":"Metti lattuga, cetriolo e cipolla in una ciotola grande e mescola con metà condimento. Aggiungi mango, avocado e strisce di pollo tiepido. Incorpora il resto con due cucchiai, sollevando delicatamente dal fondo senza schiacciare l’avocado. Dividi in quattro piatti con quantità simili di pollo e frutta.","image_url":"/recetas/ensalada-de-pollo-con-aguacate-y-mango/paso-07.webp","image_alt":"Insalata di pollo con avocado e mango: Assembla delicatamente"},{"title":"Servi e conserva in frigorifero","content":"Servi appena composta, sola o con un accompagnamento non incluso nella nutrizione. Copri gli avanzi e metti in frigorifero a non più di 4 °C entro 2 ore, o 1 ora se l’ambiente supera 32 °C. Come proposta prudente, consuma l’insalata assemblata entro 24 ore; lattuga e avocado perderanno consistenza. Per anticipare, conserva pollo cotto, verdure e condimento separati al freddo e assembla al servizio. Non congelare l’insalata completa perché la consistenza cambierebbe molto.","image_url":"/recetas/ensalada-de-pollo-con-aguacate-y-mango/paso-08.webp","image_alt":"Insalata di pollo con avocado e mango: Servi e conserva in frigorifero"}],"notes":"Scegli mango maturo ma sodo e avocado appena cedevole, non sfatto. Puoi sostituire il lime con lo stesso peso di succo di limone: cambiano sapore e nutrizione. Senza miele il condimento è più acido e i valori non restano uguali. Asciuga la lattuga per non diluirlo. Prepara solo la frutta necessaria; l’acido rallenta un po’ l’annerimento, senza conservare l’avocado indefinitamente. Separa gli utensili del pollo crudo da quelli degli alimenti pronti. La temperatura determina la cottura, non l’assenza di rosa.","nutrition":{"calories":388.4,"protein_g":36.0,"carbs_g":19.8,"fat_g":19.1,"saturated_fat_g":3.0,"fiber_g":5.3,"sugar_g":12.4,"sodium_mg":366.0,"estimated":true,"source":"USDA FoodData Central — SR Legacy (abril de 2018)","source_url":"https://fdc.nal.usda.gov/download-datasets/","inputs":[{"ingredient":"Petto di pollo crudo senza pelle e ossa","edible_grams":600,"fdc_id":171077,"fdc_description":"Chicken, broiler or fryers, breast, skinless, boneless, meat only, raw","per_100g":{"fat_g":2.62,"calories":120.0,"saturated_fat_g":0.563,"sodium_mg":45.0,"protein_g":22.5,"sugar_g":0.0,"carbs_g":0.0,"fiber_g":0.0},"source_url":"https://fdc.nal.usda.gov/food-details/171077/nutrients"},{"ingredient":"Polpa di avocado","edible_grams":200,"fdc_id":171705,"fdc_description":"Avocados, raw, all commercial varieties","per_100g":{"protein_g":2.0,"fiber_g":6.7,"sodium_mg":7.0,"fat_g":14.66,"sugar_g":0.66,"saturated_fat_g":2.126,"carbs_g":8.53,"calories":160.0},"source_url":"https://fdc.nal.usda.gov/food-details/171705/nutrients"},{"ingredient":"Polpa di mango","edible_grams":250,"fdc_id":169910,"fdc_description":"Mangos, raw","per_100g":{"fat_g":0.38,"protein_g":0.82,"fiber_g":1.6,"sodium_mg":1.0,"carbs_g":14.98,"calories":60.0,"sugar_g":13.66,"saturated_fat_g":0.092},"source_url":"https://fdc.nal.usda.gov/food-details/169910/nutrients"},{"ingredient":"Cetriolo con buccia","edible_grams":150,"fdc_id":168409,"fdc_description":"Cucumber, with peel, raw","per_100g":{"carbs_g":3.63,"calories":15.0,"sugar_g":1.67,"saturated_fat_g":0.037,"sodium_mg":2.0,"fat_g":0.11,"fiber_g":0.5,"protein_g":0.65},"source_url":"https://fdc.nal.usda.gov/food-details/168409/nutrients"},{"ingredient":"Lattuga romana","edible_grams":100,"fdc_id":169247,"fdc_description":"Lettuce, cos or romaine, raw","per_100g":{"carbs_g":3.29,"calories":17.0,"saturated_fat_g":0.039,"sodium_mg":8.0,"fat_g":0.3,"sugar_g":1.19,"fiber_g":2.1,"protein_g":1.23},"source_url":"https://fdc.nal.usda.gov/food-details/169247/nutrients"},{"ingredient":"Cipolla rossa","edible_grams":40,"fdc_id":170000,"fdc_description":"Onions, raw","per_100g":{"sugar_g":4.24,"fat_g":0.1,"carbs_g":9.34,"calories":40.0,"saturated_fat_g":0.042,"protein_g":1.1,"fiber_g":1.7,"sodium_mg":4.0},"source_url":"https://fdc.nal.usda.gov/food-details/170000/nutrients"},{"ingredient":"Succo di lime","edible_grams":40,"fdc_id":168156,"fdc_description":"Lime juice, raw","per_100g":{"protein_g":0.42,"fiber_g":0.4,"sodium_mg":2.0,"fat_g":0.07,"sugar_g":1.69,"saturated_fat_g":0.008,"carbs_g":8.42,"calories":25.0},"source_url":"https://fdc.nal.usda.gov/food-details/168156/nutrients"},{"ingredient":"Olio d’oliva","edible_grams":30,"fdc_id":171413,"fdc_description":"Oil, olive, salad or cooking","per_100g":{"fat_g":100.0,"carbs_g":0.0,"calories":884.0,"sodium_mg":2.0,"protein_g":0.0,"saturated_fat_g":13.808,"fiber_g":0.0,"sugar_g":0.0},"source_url":"https://fdc.nal.usda.gov/food-details/171413/nutrients"},{"ingredient":"Miele","edible_grams":10,"fdc_id":169640,"fdc_description":"Honey","per_100g":{"saturated_fat_g":0.0,"protein_g":0.3,"fiber_g":0.2,"sodium_mg":4.0,"fat_g":0.0,"carbs_g":82.4,"calories":304.0,"sugar_g":82.12},"source_url":"https://fdc.nal.usda.gov/food-details/169640/nutrients"},{"ingredient":"Sale","edible_grams":3,"fdc_id":173468,"fdc_description":"Salt, table","per_100g":{"fiber_g":0.0,"sodium_mg":38758.0,"saturated_fat_g":0.0,"protein_g":0.0,"fat_g":0.0,"carbs_g":0.0,"calories":0.0,"sugar_g":0.0},"source_url":"https://fdc.nal.usda.gov/food-details/173468/nutrients"},{"ingredient":"Pepe nero","edible_grams":1,"fdc_id":170931,"fdc_description":"Spices, pepper, black","per_100g":{"fat_g":3.26,"sugar_g":0.64,"carbs_g":63.95,"calories":251.0,"protein_g":10.39,"fiber_g":25.3,"sodium_mg":20.0,"saturated_fat_g":1.392},"source_url":"https://fdc.nal.usda.gov/food-details/170931/nutrients"}],"serving_size":"1 delle 4 porzioni","method":"Undici schede USDA verificate per 100 g sono ponderate con i pesi commestibili indicati e divise per 4. Pollo calcolato su 600 g di petto crudo senza pelle e ossa; cipolla rossa approssimata con cipolla cruda generica. Tutti i 30 g d’olio e il condimento sono conteggiati, anche con residui in padella o ciotola.","note":"Stima informativa, non analisi dell’insalata pronta. Succhi persi in cottura, varietà della frutta, olio trattenuto e distribuzione cambiano il risultato. Non si conteggiano pane o altri accompagnamenti."},"keywords":["insalata pollo avocado mango","insalata pollo in padella","condimento al lime"],"image_url":"/recetas/ensalada-de-pollo-con-aguacate-y-mango/portada.webp","gallery":[{"url":"/recetas/ensalada-de-pollo-con-aguacate-y-mango/portada.webp","alt":"Insalata con pollo dorato a strisce, mango e avocado a cubetti, lattuga, cetriolo e cipolla rossa"}],"seo":{"title":"Insalata di pollo con avocado e mango","description":"Insalata di pollo, avocado e mango per 4: pollo in padella e condimento al lime. Lava, cuoci, taglia e assembla senza schiacciare la frutta.","image_alt":"Insalata con pollo dorato a strisce, mango e avocado a cubetti, lattuga, cetriolo e cipolla rossa","image_variants":["/recetas/ensalada-de-pollo-con-aguacate-y-mango/portada-1x1.webp","/recetas/ensalada-de-pollo-con-aguacate-y-mango/portada-4x3.webp","/recetas/ensalada-de-pollo-con-aguacate-y-mango/portada-16x9.webp"],"faq":[{"q":"Posso preparare in anticipo?","a":"Conserva pollo già cotto, verdure e condimento separati al freddo, poi assembla al servizio. Taglia l’avocado vicino al montaggio. L’insalata condita perde consistenza; si propone consumo refrigerato entro 24 ore."},{"q":"Come so se il pollo è cotto?","a":"Misura il centro più spesso di ogni filetto con un termometro alimentare: almeno 74 °C. Tempo fisso e colore da soli non lo garantiscono."},{"q":"Perché c’è acqua sul fondo?","a":"Lattuga bagnata, mango troppo morbido e condimento aggiunto molto prima possono rilasciare liquido. Asciuga le foglie, usa frutta soda e mescola poco prima di servire."}]},"published":false,"editorial_status":"draft","content_html":"<p>Questa insalata combina pollo cotto in padella, cubetti di avocado e mango, lattuga, cetriolo e cipolla rossa. Lime, olio d’oliva e poco miele legano gli ingredienti senza una salsa densa.</p><p>La proposta rende 4 porzioni. I 55 minuti stimati comprendono 30 di preparazione, 20 di cottura in due riprese e 5 di riposo. Controlla il pollo con un termometro: almeno 74 °C. Dosi, tempi e resa sono ancora da confermare con una prova in cucina.</p>"},{"id":"37c4199a-4504-5c9a-a573-b8e97b23b67e","recipe_group_id":"43e5b443-a225-49c7-b432-217b5df787be","slug":"chicken-avocado-mango-salad","public_path":"/ja/chicken-avocado-mango-salad","source_url":null,"language":"ja","title":"鶏肉とアボカド、マンゴーのサラダ","excerpt":"フライパンで焼く鶏肉、アボカド、マンゴーの4人分サラダ。ライムのドレッシングと、洗う、焼く、切る、果物をつぶさず混ぜる手順を紹介します。","summary":"フライパンで焼いた鶏肉、角切りのアボカドとマンゴー、レタス、きゅうり、紫玉ねぎを合わせます。ライム、オリーブ油、少量の蜂蜜のドレッシングで、濃厚なソースにせずまとめます。\n\n4人分を想定した提案です。推定55分には準備30分、2回に分ける加熱20分、休ませる時間5分を含みます。鶏肉は温度計で中心が74 °C以上であることを確認します。分量、時間、出来上がり量は調理試験でまだ確認していません。","category":"サラダ","category_slug":"ensaladas","difficulty":"簡単","course":"主菜のサラダ","cuisine":"各国料理","prep_time_minutes":30,"cook_time_minutes":20,"total_time_minutes":55,"servings":4,"ingredients":[{"name":"生の皮なし骨なし鶏むね肉","amount":"600","unit":"g","group":"サラダ"},{"name":"アボカドの果肉","amount":"200","unit":"g","group":"サラダ"},{"name":"マンゴーの果肉","amount":"250","unit":"g","group":"サラダ"},{"name":"皮付ききゅうり","amount":"150","unit":"g","group":"サラダ"},{"name":"ロメインレタス","amount":"100","unit":"g","group":"サラダ"},{"name":"紫玉ねぎ","amount":"40","unit":"g","group":"サラダ"},{"name":"ライム果汁","amount":"40","unit":"g","group":"加熱とドレッシング"},{"name":"オリーブ油","amount":"30","unit":"g","group":"加熱とドレッシング"},{"name":"蜂蜜","amount":"10","unit":"g","group":"加熱とドレッシング"},{"name":"塩","amount":"3","unit":"g","group":"加熱とドレッシング"},{"name":"黒こしょう","amount":"1","unit":"g","group":"加熱とドレッシング"}],"steps":[{"title":"野菜を洗って乾かす","content":"手を洗い、鶏肉用とは別に清潔な果物・野菜用まな板を用意します。きゅうり、マンゴー、アボカド、ライムは切る、または皮をむく前に流水で洗い、石けんは使いません。レタス100 gは包装にそのまま食べられると表示されていない限り洗い、よく水気を切ります。きゅうり150 gを薄い半月切り、紫玉ねぎ40 gを薄切りにし、加熱中はレタスと冷蔵します。","image_url":"/recetas/ensalada-de-pollo-con-aguacate-y-mango/paso-01.webp","image_alt":"鶏肉とアボカド、マンゴーのサラダ: 野菜を洗って乾かす"},{"title":"鶏肉を4枚に整える","content":"生の鶏肉は洗いません。専用のまな板で皮なし骨なしむね肉600 gを約150 gずつ4枚に分け、約1.5 cmの均一な厚さにします。必要なら食品用シートで挟んで優しく平らにします。塩1 gとこしょう0.5 gで下味をつけます。使った紙を捨て、手と器具を洗います。生の鶏肉を置いたまな板や皿に、サラダや加熱済み鶏肉を置かないでください。","image_url":"/recetas/ensalada-de-pollo-con-aguacate-y-mango/paso-02.webp","image_alt":"鶏肉とアボカド、マンゴーのサラダ: 鶏肉を4枚に整える"},{"title":"焼いて中心温度を確認する","content":"広いフライパンを油5 gと中火で温めます。鶏肉2枚を片面約4〜5分ずつ焼き、はがれるまで動かさず、焦げる場合は火を調整します。食品用温度計で各肉の最も厚い中心が74 °C以上になったことを確認し、プローブをフライパンに触れさせません。足りなければさらに焼いて再測定します。色や時間だけでは判断できません。清潔な皿に移し、残り2枚と加熱用の残りの油5 gで繰り返します。予定20分は目安です。","image_url":"/recetas/ensalada-de-pollo-con-aguacate-y-mango/paso-03.webp","image_alt":"鶏肉とアボカド、マンゴーのサラダ: 焼いて中心温度を確認する"},{"title":"休ませて細切りにする","content":"加熱済み鶏肉を清潔な皿で5分休ませます。清潔な包丁とまな板で幅約1 cmの細切りにします。強い湯気が出なくなってからサラダに加え、必要ならさらに待ち、その時間を合計に加えます。盛り付けを終える間だけ取り置き、室温で何時間も放置しません。","image_url":"/recetas/ensalada-de-pollo-con-aguacate-y-mango/paso-04.webp","image_alt":"鶏肉とアボカド、マンゴーのサラダ: 休ませて細切りにする"},{"title":"マンゴーとアボカドを切る","content":"洗ったマンゴーの皮をむき、種から果肉を外して250 g量り、約2 cm角に切ります。洗ったアボカドを開き、包丁で種をたたかずスプーンで取り、果肉200 gを量ります。こちらも約2 cm角にします。生の鶏肉に触れていない清潔な果物用まな板を使い、アボカドの変色を抑えるため混ぜる直前に両方を切ります。","image_url":"/recetas/ensalada-de-pollo-con-aguacate-y-mango/paso-05.webp","image_alt":"鶏肉とアボカド、マンゴーのサラダ: マンゴーとアボカドを切る"},{"title":"ライムのドレッシングを混ぜる","content":"小さなボウルにライム果汁40 g、蜂蜜10 g、残りの塩2 gとこしょう0.5 gを混ぜます。ドレッシング用の油20 gを加え、フォークで一時的になじむまで混ぜます。分離したら使う直前に再び混ぜます。ドレッシングは鶏肉の加熱の代わりにも、交差汚染の防止にもなりません。","image_url":"/recetas/ensalada-de-pollo-con-aguacate-y-mango/paso-06.webp","image_alt":"鶏肉とアボカド、マンゴーのサラダ: ライムのドレッシングを混ぜる"},{"title":"つぶさずに盛り合わせる","content":"大きなボウルにレタス、きゅうり、玉ねぎを入れ、ドレッシングの半分と混ぜます。マンゴーとアボカド、少し温かい鶏肉を加えます。残りのドレッシングをスプーン2本で底から優しく持ち上げるように混ぜ、アボカドをつぶさないようにします。鶏肉と果物を均等に分け、4皿に盛ります。","image_url":"/recetas/ensalada-de-pollo-con-aguacate-y-mango/paso-07.webp","image_alt":"鶏肉とアボカド、マンゴーのサラダ: つぶさずに盛り合わせる"},{"title":"盛り付けて冷蔵保存する","content":"混ぜたてをそのまま、または栄養計算に含まない付け合わせと出します。残りはふたをして2時間以内、周囲が32 °Cを超える場合は1時間以内に4 °C以下で冷蔵します。控えめな提案として、混ぜたサラダは24時間以内に食べます。レタスとアボカドの食感は変わります。前もって用意する場合は加熱済み鶏肉、野菜、ドレッシングを別々に冷蔵し、出すときに混ぜます。食感が大きく変わるため、完成したサラダ全体は冷凍しません。","image_url":"/recetas/ensalada-de-pollo-con-aguacate-y-mango/paso-08.webp","image_alt":"鶏肉とアボカド、マンゴーのサラダ: 盛り付けて冷蔵保存する"}],"notes":"熟していても硬さの残るマンゴーと、少し押せる程度で崩れないアボカドを選びます。ライムを同重量のレモン果汁に替えると、風味と栄養値が変わります。蜂蜜を省くと酸味が増し、栄養値も同じではなくなります。レタスの水気を切り、薄まるのを防ぎます。使う分だけ果物を準備します。酸は変色を少し遅らせますが、アボカドをいつまでも保つわけではありません。生の鶏肉とそのまま食べる食品には別々の器具を使います。加熱はピンク色の有無ではなく温度で判断します。","nutrition":{"calories":388.4,"protein_g":36.0,"carbs_g":19.8,"fat_g":19.1,"saturated_fat_g":3.0,"fiber_g":5.3,"sugar_g":12.4,"sodium_mg":366.0,"estimated":true,"source":"USDA FoodData Central — SR Legacy (abril de 2018)","source_url":"https://fdc.nal.usda.gov/download-datasets/","inputs":[{"ingredient":"生の皮なし骨なし鶏むね肉","edible_grams":600,"fdc_id":171077,"fdc_description":"Chicken, broiler or fryers, breast, skinless, boneless, meat only, raw","per_100g":{"fat_g":2.62,"calories":120.0,"saturated_fat_g":0.563,"sodium_mg":45.0,"protein_g":22.5,"sugar_g":0.0,"carbs_g":0.0,"fiber_g":0.0},"source_url":"https://fdc.nal.usda.gov/food-details/171077/nutrients"},{"ingredient":"アボカドの果肉","edible_grams":200,"fdc_id":171705,"fdc_description":"Avocados, raw, all commercial varieties","per_100g":{"protein_g":2.0,"fiber_g":6.7,"sodium_mg":7.0,"fat_g":14.66,"sugar_g":0.66,"saturated_fat_g":2.126,"carbs_g":8.53,"calories":160.0},"source_url":"https://fdc.nal.usda.gov/food-details/171705/nutrients"},{"ingredient":"マンゴーの果肉","edible_grams":250,"fdc_id":169910,"fdc_description":"Mangos, raw","per_100g":{"fat_g":0.38,"protein_g":0.82,"fiber_g":1.6,"sodium_mg":1.0,"carbs_g":14.98,"calories":60.0,"sugar_g":13.66,"saturated_fat_g":0.092},"source_url":"https://fdc.nal.usda.gov/food-details/169910/nutrients"},{"ingredient":"皮付ききゅうり","edible_grams":150,"fdc_id":168409,"fdc_description":"Cucumber, with peel, raw","per_100g":{"carbs_g":3.63,"calories":15.0,"sugar_g":1.67,"saturated_fat_g":0.037,"sodium_mg":2.0,"fat_g":0.11,"fiber_g":0.5,"protein_g":0.65},"source_url":"https://fdc.nal.usda.gov/food-details/168409/nutrients"},{"ingredient":"ロメインレタス","edible_grams":100,"fdc_id":169247,"fdc_description":"Lettuce, cos or romaine, raw","per_100g":{"carbs_g":3.29,"calories":17.0,"saturated_fat_g":0.039,"sodium_mg":8.0,"fat_g":0.3,"sugar_g":1.19,"fiber_g":2.1,"protein_g":1.23},"source_url":"https://fdc.nal.usda.gov/food-details/169247/nutrients"},{"ingredient":"紫玉ねぎ","edible_grams":40,"fdc_id":170000,"fdc_description":"Onions, raw","per_100g":{"sugar_g":4.24,"fat_g":0.1,"carbs_g":9.34,"calories":40.0,"saturated_fat_g":0.042,"protein_g":1.1,"fiber_g":1.7,"sodium_mg":4.0},"source_url":"https://fdc.nal.usda.gov/food-details/170000/nutrients"},{"ingredient":"ライム果汁","edible_grams":40,"fdc_id":168156,"fdc_description":"Lime juice, raw","per_100g":{"protein_g":0.42,"fiber_g":0.4,"sodium_mg":2.0,"fat_g":0.07,"sugar_g":1.69,"saturated_fat_g":0.008,"carbs_g":8.42,"calories":25.0},"source_url":"https://fdc.nal.usda.gov/food-details/168156/nutrients"},{"ingredient":"オリーブ油","edible_grams":30,"fdc_id":171413,"fdc_description":"Oil, olive, salad or cooking","per_100g":{"fat_g":100.0,"carbs_g":0.0,"calories":884.0,"sodium_mg":2.0,"protein_g":0.0,"saturated_fat_g":13.808,"fiber_g":0.0,"sugar_g":0.0},"source_url":"https://fdc.nal.usda.gov/food-details/171413/nutrients"},{"ingredient":"蜂蜜","edible_grams":10,"fdc_id":169640,"fdc_description":"Honey","per_100g":{"saturated_fat_g":0.0,"protein_g":0.3,"fiber_g":0.2,"sodium_mg":4.0,"fat_g":0.0,"carbs_g":82.4,"calories":304.0,"sugar_g":82.12},"source_url":"https://fdc.nal.usda.gov/food-details/169640/nutrients"},{"ingredient":"塩","edible_grams":3,"fdc_id":173468,"fdc_description":"Salt, table","per_100g":{"fiber_g":0.0,"sodium_mg":38758.0,"saturated_fat_g":0.0,"protein_g":0.0,"fat_g":0.0,"carbs_g":0.0,"calories":0.0,"sugar_g":0.0},"source_url":"https://fdc.nal.usda.gov/food-details/173468/nutrients"},{"ingredient":"黒こしょう","edible_grams":1,"fdc_id":170931,"fdc_description":"Spices, pepper, black","per_100g":{"fat_g":3.26,"sugar_g":0.64,"carbs_g":63.95,"calories":251.0,"protein_g":10.39,"fiber_g":25.3,"sodium_mg":20.0,"saturated_fat_g":1.392},"source_url":"https://fdc.nal.usda.gov/food-details/170931/nutrients"}],"serving_size":"4人分のうち1人分","method":"確認したUSDAの11項目の100 g当たりの数値を指定の可食部重量で加重計算し、4で割っています。鶏肉は生の皮なし骨なしむね肉600 gで計算し、紫玉ねぎは一般的な生玉ねぎの値で近似します。フライパンやボウルに残る場合も油30 gとドレッシングを全量計上します。","note":"参考用の推定値で、完成したサラダの実測値ではありません。加熱で失う肉汁、果物の品種、残る油、分け方で変わります。パンや追加の付け合わせは含みません。"},"keywords":["鶏肉 アボカド マンゴー サラダ","フライパンの鶏肉サラダ","ライムドレッシング"],"image_url":"/recetas/ensalada-de-pollo-con-aguacate-y-mango/portada.webp","gallery":[{"url":"/recetas/ensalada-de-pollo-con-aguacate-y-mango/portada.webp","alt":"焼いた鶏肉の細切り、マンゴーとアボカド、レタス、きゅうり、紫玉ねぎのサラダ"}],"seo":{"title":"鶏肉とアボカド、マンゴーのサラダ｜ライムドレッシング","description":"フライパンで焼く鶏肉、アボカド、マンゴーの4人分サラダ。ライムのドレッシングと、洗う、焼く、切る、果物をつぶさず混ぜる手順を紹介します。","image_alt":"焼いた鶏肉の細切り、マンゴーとアボカド、レタス、きゅうり、紫玉ねぎのサラダ","image_variants":["/recetas/ensalada-de-pollo-con-aguacate-y-mango/portada-1x1.webp","/recetas/ensalada-de-pollo-con-aguacate-y-mango/portada-4x3.webp","/recetas/ensalada-de-pollo-con-aguacate-y-mango/portada-16x9.webp"],"faq":[{"q":"前もって作れますか？","a":"加熱済み鶏肉、野菜、ドレッシングを別々に冷蔵し、食べるときに混ぜます。アボカドは直前に切ります。混ぜたサラダは食感が落ちるため、冷蔵で24時間以内の消費を提案しています。"},{"q":"鶏肉の加熱をどう確認しますか？","a":"各肉の最も厚い中心を食品用温度計で測り、74 °C以上を確認します。決まった時間や肉の色だけでは保証できません。"},{"q":"底に水が出るのはなぜですか？","a":"ぬれたレタス、柔らかすぎるマンゴー、早く加えたドレッシングから水分が出ます。葉の水気を切り、硬さのある果物を使い、出す直前に混ぜます。"}]},"published":false,"editorial_status":"draft","content_html":"<p>フライパンで焼いた鶏肉、角切りのアボカドとマンゴー、レタス、きゅうり、紫玉ねぎを合わせます。ライム、オリーブ油、少量の蜂蜜のドレッシングで、濃厚なソースにせずまとめます。</p><p>4人分を想定した提案です。推定55分には準備30分、2回に分ける加熱20分、休ませる時間5分を含みます。鶏肉は温度計で中心が74 °C以上であることを確認します。分量、時間、出来上がり量は調理試験でまだ確認していません。</p>"},{"id":"efa71bac-1578-52d3-9474-ad2469ed97d7","recipe_group_id":"43e5b443-a225-49c7-b432-217b5df787be","slug":"salada-de-frango-abacate-e-manga","public_path":"/pt/salada-de-frango-abacate-e-manga","source_url":null,"language":"pt","title":"Salada de frango com abacate e manga","excerpt":"Salada de frango com abacate e manga para 4, frango na frigideira e molho de limão. Veja como lavar, cozinhar, cortar e montar sem amassar as frutas.","summary":"Esta salada combina frango na frigideira, cubos de abacate e manga, alface, pepino e cebola roxa. Limão, azeite e um pouco de mel unem os ingredientes sem um molho espesso.\n\nA proposta rende 4 porções. Os 55 minutos estimados incluem 30 de preparo, 20 de cozimento em duas etapas e 5 de descanso. Confira o frango com termômetro: pelo menos 74 °C. Quantidades, tempos e rendimento ainda precisam de confirmação em teste na cozinha.","category":"Saladas","category_slug":"ensaladas","difficulty":"Fácil","course":"Salada como prato principal","cuisine":"Internacional","prep_time_minutes":30,"cook_time_minutes":20,"total_time_minutes":55,"servings":4,"ingredients":[{"name":"Peito de frango cru sem pele e osso","amount":"600","unit":"g","group":"Salada"},{"name":"Polpa de abacate","amount":"200","unit":"g","group":"Salada"},{"name":"Polpa de manga","amount":"250","unit":"g","group":"Salada"},{"name":"Pepino com casca","amount":"150","unit":"g","group":"Salada"},{"name":"Alface romana","amount":"100","unit":"g","group":"Salada"},{"name":"Cebola roxa","amount":"40","unit":"g","group":"Salada"},{"name":"Suco de limão-taiti","amount":"40","unit":"g","group":"Cozimento e molho"},{"name":"Azeite de oliva","amount":"30","unit":"g","group":"Cozimento e molho"},{"name":"Mel","amount":"10","unit":"g","group":"Cozimento e molho"},{"name":"Sal","amount":"3","unit":"g","group":"Cozimento e molho"},{"name":"Pimenta-do-reino","amount":"1","unit":"g","group":"Cozimento e molho"}],"steps":[{"title":"Lave e seque os vegetais","content":"Lave as mãos e prepare uma tábua limpa para frutas e verduras, separada da do frango. Lave pepino, manga, abacate e limão em água corrente antes de cortar ou descascar, sem sabão. Lave e seque bem os 100 g de alface, salvo indicação de pronta para consumo na embalagem. Corte os 150 g de pepino em meias-luas finas e os 40 g de cebola em tiras; reserve com a alface na geladeira enquanto cozinha.","image_url":"/recetas/ensalada-de-pollo-con-aguacate-y-mango/paso-01.webp","image_alt":"Salada de frango com abacate e manga: Lave e seque os vegetais"},{"title":"Prepare quatro filés de frango","content":"Não lave o frango cru. Na tábua separada, divida os 600 g de peito sem pele e osso em quatro filés de cerca de 150 g e espessura uniforme de aproximadamente 1,5 cm. Se necessário, achate delicadamente entre folhas próprias para alimentos. Tempere com 1 g de sal e 0,5 g de pimenta. Descarte o papel usado e lave mãos e utensílios; não coloque salada ou frango cozido na tábua ou prato do frango cru.","image_url":"/recetas/ensalada-de-pollo-con-aguacate-y-mango/paso-02.webp","image_alt":"Salada de frango com abacate e manga: Prepare quatro filés de frango"},{"title":"Cozinhe e confira a temperatura","content":"Aqueça uma frigideira grande em fogo médio com 5 g de azeite. Cozinhe dois filés por cerca de 4–5 minutos de cada lado, sem mexer até soltarem; ajuste o fogo se queimarem. Confira com termômetro de alimentos que o centro mais grosso de cada filé atinge pelo menos 74 °C, sem tocar a frigideira com a sonda. Se faltar temperatura, continue e meça de novo; cor e relógio não bastam. Passe para um prato limpo e repita com os outros dois e os 5 g restantes de azeite para cozinhar. Os 20 minutos previstos são orientativos.","image_url":"/recetas/ensalada-de-pollo-con-aguacate-y-mango/paso-03.webp","image_alt":"Salada de frango com abacate e manga: Cozinhe e confira a temperatura"},{"title":"Deixe descansar e corte em tiras","content":"Deixe o frango cozido descansar 5 minutos no prato limpo. Com faca e tábua limpas, corte cada filé em tiras de cerca de 1 cm. Deve parar de soltar vapor intenso antes de ir à salada; espere mais se necessário e acrescente ao tempo total. Reserve só enquanto termina a montagem, sem deixar por horas em temperatura ambiente.","image_url":"/recetas/ensalada-de-pollo-con-aguacate-y-mango/paso-04.webp","image_alt":"Salada de frango com abacate e manga: Deixe descansar e corte em tiras"},{"title":"Corte manga e abacate","content":"Descasque a manga lavada, separe a polpa do caroço e pese 250 g. Corte em cubos de cerca de 2 cm. Abra o abacate lavado, tire o caroço com colher em vez de golpeá-lo com a faca, retire a polpa e pese 200 g. Corte também em cubos de 2 cm. Use a tábua de frutas limpa sem contato com frango cru e prepare ambos pouco antes de misturar para reduzir o escurecimento.","image_url":"/recetas/ensalada-de-pollo-con-aguacate-y-mango/paso-05.webp","image_alt":"Salada de frango com abacate e manga: Corte manga e abacate"},{"title":"Misture o molho de limão","content":"Em uma tigela pequena misture os 40 g de suco de limão-taiti, 10 g de mel, os 2 g de sal e 0,5 g de pimenta restantes. Junte os 20 g de azeite reservados para o molho e bata com um garfo até integrar temporariamente. Mexa de novo antes de usar se separar. O molho não substitui cozinhar o frango nem evita contaminação cruzada.","image_url":"/recetas/ensalada-de-pollo-con-aguacate-y-mango/paso-06.webp","image_alt":"Salada de frango com abacate e manga: Misture o molho de limão"},{"title":"Monte com cuidado","content":"Coloque alface, pepino e cebola em uma tigela grande e misture com metade do molho. Adicione os cubos de manga e abacate e as tiras de frango morno. Incorpore o restante com duas colheres, levantando delicadamente do fundo para não amassar o abacate. Divida entre quatro pratos com quantidades parecidas de frango e fruta.","image_url":"/recetas/ensalada-de-pollo-con-aguacate-y-mango/paso-07.webp","image_alt":"Salada de frango com abacate e manga: Monte com cuidado"},{"title":"Sirva e guarde na geladeira","content":"Sirva recém-montada, sozinha ou com acompanhamento que não entra na nutrição. Se sobrar, tampe e leve à geladeira a no máximo 4 °C dentro de 2 horas, ou 1 hora se o ambiente superar 32 °C. Como proposta conservadora, consuma a salada montada em até 24 horas; alface e abacate perderão textura. Para adiantar, guarde frango já cozido, vegetais e molho separados no frio e monte ao servir. Não congele a salada completa porque a textura mudará bastante.","image_url":"/recetas/ensalada-de-pollo-con-aguacate-y-mango/paso-08.webp","image_alt":"Salada de frango com abacate e manga: Sirva e guarde na geladeira"}],"notes":"Escolha manga madura, mas firme, e abacate que ceda um pouco sem estar desmanchado. Você pode trocar o limão-taiti pelo mesmo peso de suco de limão-siciliano; sabor e nutrição mudam. Sem mel, o molho fica mais ácido e os valores nutricionais deixam de ser iguais. Seque a alface para não diluir. Prepare só as frutas que vai usar; o ácido atrasa um pouco o escurecimento, mas não preserva o abacate indefinidamente. Separe utensílios para frango cru e alimentos prontos. A temperatura determina o cozimento, não a ausência de cor rosada.","nutrition":{"calories":388.4,"protein_g":36.0,"carbs_g":19.8,"fat_g":19.1,"saturated_fat_g":3.0,"fiber_g":5.3,"sugar_g":12.4,"sodium_mg":366.0,"estimated":true,"source":"USDA FoodData Central — SR Legacy (abril de 2018)","source_url":"https://fdc.nal.usda.gov/download-datasets/","inputs":[{"ingredient":"Peito de frango cru sem pele e osso","edible_grams":600,"fdc_id":171077,"fdc_description":"Chicken, broiler or fryers, breast, skinless, boneless, meat only, raw","per_100g":{"fat_g":2.62,"calories":120.0,"saturated_fat_g":0.563,"sodium_mg":45.0,"protein_g":22.5,"sugar_g":0.0,"carbs_g":0.0,"fiber_g":0.0},"source_url":"https://fdc.nal.usda.gov/food-details/171077/nutrients"},{"ingredient":"Polpa de abacate","edible_grams":200,"fdc_id":171705,"fdc_description":"Avocados, raw, all commercial varieties","per_100g":{"protein_g":2.0,"fiber_g":6.7,"sodium_mg":7.0,"fat_g":14.66,"sugar_g":0.66,"saturated_fat_g":2.126,"carbs_g":8.53,"calories":160.0},"source_url":"https://fdc.nal.usda.gov/food-details/171705/nutrients"},{"ingredient":"Polpa de manga","edible_grams":250,"fdc_id":169910,"fdc_description":"Mangos, raw","per_100g":{"fat_g":0.38,"protein_g":0.82,"fiber_g":1.6,"sodium_mg":1.0,"carbs_g":14.98,"calories":60.0,"sugar_g":13.66,"saturated_fat_g":0.092},"source_url":"https://fdc.nal.usda.gov/food-details/169910/nutrients"},{"ingredient":"Pepino com casca","edible_grams":150,"fdc_id":168409,"fdc_description":"Cucumber, with peel, raw","per_100g":{"carbs_g":3.63,"calories":15.0,"sugar_g":1.67,"saturated_fat_g":0.037,"sodium_mg":2.0,"fat_g":0.11,"fiber_g":0.5,"protein_g":0.65},"source_url":"https://fdc.nal.usda.gov/food-details/168409/nutrients"},{"ingredient":"Alface romana","edible_grams":100,"fdc_id":169247,"fdc_description":"Lettuce, cos or romaine, raw","per_100g":{"carbs_g":3.29,"calories":17.0,"saturated_fat_g":0.039,"sodium_mg":8.0,"fat_g":0.3,"sugar_g":1.19,"fiber_g":2.1,"protein_g":1.23},"source_url":"https://fdc.nal.usda.gov/food-details/169247/nutrients"},{"ingredient":"Cebola roxa","edible_grams":40,"fdc_id":170000,"fdc_description":"Onions, raw","per_100g":{"sugar_g":4.24,"fat_g":0.1,"carbs_g":9.34,"calories":40.0,"saturated_fat_g":0.042,"protein_g":1.1,"fiber_g":1.7,"sodium_mg":4.0},"source_url":"https://fdc.nal.usda.gov/food-details/170000/nutrients"},{"ingredient":"Suco de limão-taiti","edible_grams":40,"fdc_id":168156,"fdc_description":"Lime juice, raw","per_100g":{"protein_g":0.42,"fiber_g":0.4,"sodium_mg":2.0,"fat_g":0.07,"sugar_g":1.69,"saturated_fat_g":0.008,"carbs_g":8.42,"calories":25.0},"source_url":"https://fdc.nal.usda.gov/food-details/168156/nutrients"},{"ingredient":"Azeite de oliva","edible_grams":30,"fdc_id":171413,"fdc_description":"Oil, olive, salad or cooking","per_100g":{"fat_g":100.0,"carbs_g":0.0,"calories":884.0,"sodium_mg":2.0,"protein_g":0.0,"saturated_fat_g":13.808,"fiber_g":0.0,"sugar_g":0.0},"source_url":"https://fdc.nal.usda.gov/food-details/171413/nutrients"},{"ingredient":"Mel","edible_grams":10,"fdc_id":169640,"fdc_description":"Honey","per_100g":{"saturated_fat_g":0.0,"protein_g":0.3,"fiber_g":0.2,"sodium_mg":4.0,"fat_g":0.0,"carbs_g":82.4,"calories":304.0,"sugar_g":82.12},"source_url":"https://fdc.nal.usda.gov/food-details/169640/nutrients"},{"ingredient":"Sal","edible_grams":3,"fdc_id":173468,"fdc_description":"Salt, table","per_100g":{"fiber_g":0.0,"sodium_mg":38758.0,"saturated_fat_g":0.0,"protein_g":0.0,"fat_g":0.0,"carbs_g":0.0,"calories":0.0,"sugar_g":0.0},"source_url":"https://fdc.nal.usda.gov/food-details/173468/nutrients"},{"ingredient":"Pimenta-do-reino","edible_grams":1,"fdc_id":170931,"fdc_description":"Spices, pepper, black","per_100g":{"fat_g":3.26,"sugar_g":0.64,"carbs_g":63.95,"calories":251.0,"protein_g":10.39,"fiber_g":25.3,"sodium_mg":20.0,"saturated_fat_g":1.392},"source_url":"https://fdc.nal.usda.gov/food-details/170931/nutrients"}],"serving_size":"1 das 4 porções","method":"Onze fichas USDA verificadas por 100 g são ponderadas pelos pesos comestíveis indicados e divididas por 4. Frango calculado sobre 600 g de peito cru sem pele e osso; cebola roxa aproximada pela ficha genérica de cebola crua. Os 30 g de azeite e todo o molho são contados, mesmo com sobras na frigideira ou tigela.","note":"Estimativa informativa, não análise da salada pronta. Perdas de sucos no cozimento, variedade das frutas, azeite retido e divisão mudam o resultado. Não se conta pão nem outro acompanhamento adicional."},"keywords":["salada frango abacate manga","salada de frango na frigideira","molho de limão para salada"],"image_url":"/recetas/ensalada-de-pollo-con-aguacate-y-mango/portada.webp","gallery":[{"url":"/recetas/ensalada-de-pollo-con-aguacate-y-mango/portada.webp","alt":"Salada com tiras de frango dourado, cubos de manga e abacate, alface, pepino e cebola roxa"}],"seo":{"title":"Salada de frango com abacate e manga","description":"Salada de frango com abacate e manga para 4, frango na frigideira e molho de limão. Veja como lavar, cozinhar, cortar e montar sem amassar as frutas.","image_alt":"Salada com tiras de frango dourado, cubos de manga e abacate, alface, pepino e cebola roxa","image_variants":["/recetas/ensalada-de-pollo-con-aguacate-y-mango/portada-1x1.webp","/recetas/ensalada-de-pollo-con-aguacate-y-mango/portada-4x3.webp","/recetas/ensalada-de-pollo-con-aguacate-y-mango/portada-16x9.webp"],"faq":[{"q":"Posso preparar com antecedência?","a":"Guarde frango já cozido, vegetais e molho separados no frio e monte ao servir. Corte o abacate perto da montagem. A salada temperada perde textura; propõe-se consumir em até 24 horas na geladeira."},{"q":"Como sei se o frango está cozido?","a":"Meça o centro mais grosso de cada filé com um termômetro de alimentos: deve atingir pelo menos 74 °C. Tempo fixo e cor da carne sozinhos não garantem esse ponto."},{"q":"Por que fica água no fundo?","a":"Alface molhada, manga muito mole e molho colocado cedo podem soltar líquido. Seque as folhas, use frutas firmes e misture pouco antes de servir."}]},"published":false,"editorial_status":"draft","content_html":"<p>Esta salada combina frango na frigideira, cubos de abacate e manga, alface, pepino e cebola roxa. Limão, azeite e um pouco de mel unem os ingredientes sem um molho espesso.</p><p>A proposta rende 4 porções. Os 55 minutos estimados incluem 30 de preparo, 20 de cozimento em duas etapas e 5 de descanso. Confira o frango com termômetro: pelo menos 74 °C. Quantidades, tempos e rendimento ainda precisam de confirmação em teste na cozinha.</p>"},{"id":"baa74cdf-fb7d-4607-9cb1-0a4e135f81b6","recipe_group_id":"592ace5b-ac32-4d7d-91f4-09002a1456aa","slug":"receta-de-feijoada","public_path":"/receta-de-feijoada","source_url":"https://manualdecocina.com/receta-de-feijoada/","language":"es","title":"Feijoada casera de alubias negras y cerdo","excerpt":"Feijoada casera para 8 con alubias negras, cerdo, bacon y salchicha ahumada: remojo, hervor inicial, guiso lento y conservación paso a paso.","summary":"Esta propuesta casera de feijoada combina alubias negras, paleta de cerdo fresca, bacon y salchicha ahumada completamente cocida en un caldo oscuro que se espesa con parte de las propias alubias. Es una adaptación con ingredientes fáciles de identificar, sin carnes saladas que necesiten desalado; no pretende representar todas las variantes brasileñas.\n\nRinde 8 porciones de guiso. Los 680 minutos estimados incluyen 8 horas de remojo refrigerado, 30 de preparación, 160 de cocción y 10 de reposo. El sofrito se hace mientras hierven las alubias. Cantidades, rendimiento y tiempos están pendientes de confirmar mediante prueba de cocina; manda la ternura y la temperatura, no solo el reloj.","category":"Platos principales","category_slug":"platos-principales","difficulty":"Media","course":"Plato principal","cuisine":"Brasileña, adaptación casera","prep_time_minutes":30,"cook_time_minutes":160,"total_time_minutes":680,"servings":8,"ingredients":[{"name":"alubias negras secas","amount":"500","unit":"g","group":"Alubias y cocción"},{"name":"paleta de cerdo fresca sin hueso","amount":"400","unit":"g","group":"Carnes"},{"name":"salchicha ahumada de cerdo completamente cocida","amount":"250","unit":"g","group":"Carnes"},{"name":"bacon crudo","amount":"100","unit":"g","group":"Carnes"},{"name":"cebolla","amount":"200","unit":"g","group":"Sofrito y sazón"},{"name":"ajo","amount":"20","unit":"g","group":"Sofrito y sazón"},{"name":"aceite de oliva","amount":"15","unit":"g","group":"Sofrito y sazón"},{"name":"sal","amount":"4","unit":"g","group":"Sofrito y sazón"},{"name":"pimienta negra","amount":"1","unit":"g","group":"Sofrito y sazón"},{"name":"agua para cocción","amount":"2500","unit":"ml","group":"Alubias y cocción"},{"name":"laurel seco, para retirar","amount":"2","unit":"hojas","group":"Sofrito y sazón"}],"steps":[{"title":"Remoja las alubias en frío","content":"Revisa los 500 g de alubias negras secas, retira piedrecitas o granos dañados y enjuaga. Ponlas en un recipiente amplio con aproximadamente 1,5 litros de agua, cubiertas por varios centímetros. Tapa y remoja 8 horas en la nevera a 4 °C o menos; si absorben el agua, añade más. Al terminar, desecha toda el agua de remojo y enjuaga. Ese agua es adicional a los 2,5 litros de cocción.","image_url":"/recetas/receta-de-feijoada/paso-01.webp","image_alt":"Feijoada casera: remoja las alubias en frío"},{"title":"Prepara ingredientes y separa el crudo","content":"Pica los 200 g de cebolla y los 20 g de ajo sobre una tabla limpia. Corta los 400 g de paleta fresca sin hueso en dados de unos 3 cm y los 100 g de bacon en tiras cortas sobre otra tabla para carne cruda. Corta los 250 g de salchicha en rodajas de 1 cm; usa un producto cuyo envase indique que está completamente cocido, no salchicha fresca ni carne curada que precise desalado. Mantén las carnes en frío hasta cocinar y lava manos y utensilios tras manipular cerdo crudo.","image_url":"/recetas/receta-de-feijoada/paso-02.webp","image_alt":"Feijoada casera: prepara ingredientes y separa el crudo"},{"title":"Hierve las alubias antes de bajar el fuego","content":"Pon las alubias escurridas en una olla de al menos 6 litros con los 2,5 litros de agua fresca y las 2 hojas de laurel. Lleva a ebullición, unos 15 minutos orientativos, y mantén hervor claro durante al menos 30 minutos, sin tapa para controlar espuma y desbordamiento. Retira espuma con una cuchara; añade agua hirviendo si los granos dejan de estar cubiertos. No pruebes alubias crudas o duras ni sustituyas esta fase por una olla de cocción lenta.","image_url":"/recetas/receta-de-feijoada/paso-03.webp","image_alt":"Feijoada casera: hierve las alubias antes de bajar el fuego"},{"title":"Dora las carnes y el sofrito","content":"Durante el hervor, calienta una sartén amplia a fuego medio con los 15 g de aceite. Cocina el bacon unos 5 minutos, moviendo, hasta que empiece a dorarse. Añade el cerdo en dos tandas, unos 4 minutos cada una, solo para dorar la superficie; todavía debe terminar de cocinarse en el guiso. Retira las carnes a un plato reservado para ello. Sofríe la cebolla en la misma sartén 7 minutos, el ajo 1 minuto y la salchicha 4 minutos. Reserva todo el contenido, incluida la grasa: la estimación nutricional la cuenta completa.","image_url":"/recetas/receta-de-feijoada/paso-04.webp","image_alt":"Feijoada casera: dora las carnes y el sofrito"},{"title":"Cuece el guiso hasta que esté tierno","content":"Tras los 30 minutos de hervor, incorpora a la olla carnes, salchicha, sofrito y jugos de la sartén, raspando con un poco de caldo caliente. Añade 1 g de pimienta; deja la sal para el final. Recupera un hervor suave y cocina unos 100 minutos con la tapa entreabierta, removiendo desde el fondo cada 15–20 minutos. Mantén alubias y carnes apenas cubiertas y añade agua hirviendo de 100 en 100 ml si hace falta. No dejes que se peguen; evita hervir tan fuerte que todas las alubias se deshagan.","image_url":"/recetas/receta-de-feijoada/paso-05.webp","image_alt":"Feijoada casera: cuece el guiso hasta que esté tierno"},{"title":"Comprueba cocción y textura","content":"Comprueba con termómetro limpio el centro de varios dados de cerdo: se fija como objetivo práctico de este guiso al menos 74 °C, por encima del mínimo para cortes enteros. La carne debe además ceder fácilmente a la presión de un tenedor, y una alubia sacada con cuchara debe estar cremosa por dentro, sin núcleo duro. Si cualquiera sigue firme o falta temperatura, cocina más y vuelve a comprobar; los tiempos son una propuesta, no una garantía. No pruebes con utensilios que hayan tocado carne cruda.","image_url":"/recetas/receta-de-feijoada/paso-06.webp","image_alt":"Feijoada casera: comprueba cocción y textura"},{"title":"Espesa, sazona y deja reposar","content":"Saca un cucharón de alubias ya blandas sin trozos de carne, aplástalas en un cuenco y devuelve la pasta a la olla. Cuece unos 15 minutos más a fuego suave, removiendo, hasta que el caldo cubra ligeramente el dorso de una cuchara; agrega agua hirviendo si está demasiado espeso. Retira las 2 hojas de laurel. Prueba solo ahora y añade los 4 g de sal previstos, o menos si los embutidos ya salan bastante; si usas menos, cambia la estimación de sodio. Apaga y deja reposar 10 minutos con la olla tapada.","image_url":"/recetas/receta-de-feijoada/paso-07.webp","image_alt":"Feijoada casera: espesa, sazona y deja reposar"},{"title":"Reparte y conserva sin enfriar la olla entera","content":"Reparte el guiso en 8 porciones con cantidades similares de alubias, carnes y caldo. Puedes acompañar con arroz, naranja o farofa, que no se incluyen en los ingredientes ni en la nutrición. Para guardar, divide pronto las sobras en recipientes pequeños y poco profundos y refrigera a 4 °C o menos dentro de 2 horas, o 1 hora si el ambiente supera 32 °C; no esperes a que toda la olla grande se enfríe fuera. Consume en 3–4 días o congela porciones; 2 meses es una propuesta de calidad. Descongela en la nevera y recalienta removiendo hasta al menos 74 °C en varios puntos.","image_url":"/recetas/receta-de-feijoada/paso-08.webp","image_alt":"Feijoada casera: reparte y conserva sin enfriar la olla entera"}],"notes":"Usa alubias negras secas, no sustituir por alubias cocidas manteniendo estos tiempos y cantidades. Esta versión no incluye carne seca, oreja ni pata de cerdo; incorporarlas requiere otro proceso y otro cálculo nutricional. La salchicha debe estar completamente cocida según su envase: ahumado no siempre significa cocido. Puede ser linguiça cocida o salchicha ahumada de cerdo equivalente; la marca cambia sabor y sodio. La paleta fresca no se desala. Para un caldo más ligero añade agua hirviendo; para espesar, aplasta alubias ya cocidas en vez de añadir harina. No añadas ingredientes ácidos antes de que las alubias estén tiernas. El reposo fuera del fuego no sustituye la refrigeración rápida de las sobras.","nutrition":{"calories":507.4,"protein_g":28.0,"carbs_g":42.5,"fat_g":25.3,"saturated_fat_g":8.1,"fiber_g":10.2,"sugar_g":2.7,"sodium_mg":596.0,"estimated":true,"source":"USDA FoodData Central — SR Legacy (abril de 2018)","source_url":"https://fdc.nal.usda.gov/download-datasets/","inputs":[{"ingredient":"alubias negras secas","edible_grams":500,"fdc_id":173734,"fdc_description":"Beans, black, mature seeds, raw","per_100g":{"fiber_g":15.5,"carbs_g":62.36,"calories":341.0,"sugar_g":2.12,"protein_g":21.6,"sodium_mg":5.0,"saturated_fat_g":0.366,"fat_g":1.42},"source_url":"https://fdc.nal.usda.gov/food-details/173734/nutrients"},{"ingredient":"paleta de cerdo fresca sin hueso","edible_grams":400,"fdc_id":167843,"fdc_description":"Pork, fresh, shoulder, whole, separable lean and fat, raw","per_100g":{"sugar_g":0.0,"fat_g":17.99,"carbs_g":0.0,"calories":236.0,"saturated_fat_g":6.24,"fiber_g":0.0,"sodium_mg":65.0,"protein_g":17.18},"source_url":"https://fdc.nal.usda.gov/food-details/167843/nutrients"},{"ingredient":"salchicha ahumada de cerdo completamente cocida","edible_grams":250,"fdc_id":174584,"fdc_description":"Sausage, smoked link sausage, pork","per_100g":{"sugar_g":0.94,"fat_g":28.23,"fiber_g":0.0,"sodium_mg":827.0,"protein_g":11.98,"saturated_fat_g":9.313,"carbs_g":0.94,"calories":309.0},"source_url":"https://fdc.nal.usda.gov/food-details/174584/nutrients"},{"ingredient":"bacon crudo","edible_grams":100,"fdc_id":168277,"fdc_description":"Pork, cured, bacon, unprepared","per_100g":{"protein_g":13.66,"sodium_mg":751.0,"saturated_fat_g":12.615,"fat_g":37.13,"carbs_g":0.0,"calories":393.0,"sugar_g":0.35,"fiber_g":0.0},"source_url":"https://fdc.nal.usda.gov/food-details/168277/nutrients"},{"ingredient":"cebolla","edible_grams":200,"fdc_id":170000,"fdc_description":"Onions, raw","per_100g":{"sugar_g":4.24,"fat_g":0.1,"carbs_g":9.34,"calories":40.0,"saturated_fat_g":0.042,"protein_g":1.1,"fiber_g":1.7,"sodium_mg":4.0},"source_url":"https://fdc.nal.usda.gov/food-details/170000/nutrients"},{"ingredient":"ajo","edible_grams":20,"fdc_id":169230,"fdc_description":"Garlic, raw","per_100g":{"carbs_g":33.06,"calories":149.0,"sugar_g":1.0,"saturated_fat_g":0.089,"fiber_g":2.1,"sodium_mg":17.0,"protein_g":6.36,"fat_g":0.5},"source_url":"https://fdc.nal.usda.gov/food-details/169230/nutrients"},{"ingredient":"aceite de oliva","edible_grams":15,"fdc_id":171413,"fdc_description":"Oil, olive, salad or cooking","per_100g":{"fat_g":100.0,"carbs_g":0.0,"calories":884.0,"sodium_mg":2.0,"protein_g":0.0,"saturated_fat_g":13.808,"fiber_g":0.0,"sugar_g":0.0},"source_url":"https://fdc.nal.usda.gov/food-details/171413/nutrients"},{"ingredient":"sal","edible_grams":4,"fdc_id":173468,"fdc_description":"Salt, table","per_100g":{"fiber_g":0.0,"sodium_mg":38758.0,"saturated_fat_g":0.0,"protein_g":0.0,"fat_g":0.0,"carbs_g":0.0,"calories":0.0,"sugar_g":0.0},"source_url":"https://fdc.nal.usda.gov/food-details/173468/nutrients"},{"ingredient":"pimienta negra","edible_grams":1,"fdc_id":170931,"fdc_description":"Spices, pepper, black","per_100g":{"fat_g":3.26,"sugar_g":0.64,"carbs_g":63.95,"calories":251.0,"protein_g":10.39,"fiber_g":25.3,"sodium_mg":20.0,"saturated_fat_g":1.392},"source_url":"https://fdc.nal.usda.gov/food-details/170931/nutrients"},{"ingredient":"agua para cocción","edible_grams":2500,"fdc_id":173647,"fdc_description":"Beverages, water, tap, drinking","per_100g":{"fat_g":0.0,"carbs_g":0.0,"calories":0.0,"protein_g":0.0,"fiber_g":0.0,"sodium_mg":4.0,"sugar_g":0.0,"saturated_fat_g":0.0},"source_url":"https://fdc.nal.usda.gov/food-details/173647/nutrients"}],"serving_size":"1 de 8 porciones de guiso, sin acompañamientos","method":"Diez fichas USDA verificadas, pesos crudos comestibles para alubias, cerdo y bacon, y peso de la salchicha ya cocida; suma dividida entre 8. La salchicha ahumada se aproxima con la ficha genérica de salchicha ahumada de cerdo, no con una ficha específica de linguiça brasileña. Se cuenta toda la grasa y el caldo retenido. Laurel retirado y agua de remojo desechada no se incluyen.","note":"Estimación informativa, no análisis del guiso terminado. Marca y sal de salchicha y bacon, remojo, rendimiento y reparto del caldo alteran las cifras. No se incluyen arroz, naranja, farofa ni verduras de acompañamiento."},"keywords":["feijoada casera","feijoada de alubias negras","guiso de cerdo y alubias"],"image_url":"/recetas/receta-de-feijoada/portada.webp","gallery":[{"url":"/recetas/receta-de-feijoada/portada.webp","alt":"Feijoada de alubias negras en caldo oscuro con dados de cerdo, bacon y rodajas de salchicha ahumada"}],"seo":{"title":"Feijoada casera de alubias negras y cerdo","description":"Feijoada casera para 8 con alubias negras, cerdo, bacon y salchicha ahumada: remojo, hervor inicial, guiso lento y conservación paso a paso.","image_alt":"Feijoada de alubias negras en caldo oscuro con dados de cerdo, bacon y rodajas de salchicha ahumada","image_variants":["/recetas/receta-de-feijoada/portada-1x1.webp","/recetas/receta-de-feijoada/portada-4x3.webp","/recetas/receta-de-feijoada/portada-16x9.webp"],"faq":[{"q":"¿Puedo saltarme el remojo?","a":"Esta propuesta parte de 8 horas de remojo refrigerado y agua nueva para cocinar. No se ofrece un tiempo equivalente sin remojo; cambia el proceso y no elimina el hervor inicial de 30 minutos."},{"q":"¿Por qué las alubias siguen duras?","a":"Las alubias viejas, el agua dura o ingredientes ácidos tempranos pueden alargar la cocción. Mantén suficiente agua caliente y cocina hasta que no haya núcleo duro; añade la sal prevista al final."},{"q":"¿Cómo espeso el caldo sin harina?","a":"Aplasta un cucharón de alubias blandas, sin carne, y devuélvelo al guiso. Cuece 15 minutos más a fuego suave, removiendo; si queda excesivamente espeso añade agua hirviendo."}]},"published":false,"editorial_status":"draft","content_html":"<p>Esta propuesta casera de feijoada combina alubias negras, paleta de cerdo fresca, bacon y salchicha ahumada completamente cocida en un caldo oscuro que se espesa con parte de las propias alubias. Es una adaptación con ingredientes fáciles de identificar, sin carnes saladas que necesiten desalado; no pretende representar todas las variantes brasileñas.</p><p>Rinde 8 porciones de guiso. Los 680 minutos estimados incluyen 8 horas de remojo refrigerado, 30 de preparación, 160 de cocción y 10 de reposo. El sofrito se hace mientras hierven las alubias. Cantidades, rendimiento y tiempos están pendientes de confirmar mediante prueba de cocina; manda la ternura y la temperatura, no solo el reloj.</p>"},{"id":"7180f48b-6ec2-5fa1-8d69-895acef3d865","recipe_group_id":"592ace5b-ac32-4d7d-91f4-09002a1456aa","slug":"feijoada-rezept","public_path":"/de/feijoada-rezept","source_url":"https://manualdecocina.com/de/feijoada-rezept/","language":"de","title":"Feijoada mit schwarzen Bohnen und Schweinefleisch","excerpt":"Hausgemachte Feijoada für 8 mit schwarzen Bohnen, Schweinefleisch, Speck und Räucherwurst: Einweichen, Aufkochen, Schmoren und Aufbewahren.","summary":"Diese Feijoada für die Hausküche verbindet schwarze Bohnen, frische Schweineschulter, Speck und vollständig gegarte Räucherwurst in einer dunklen Brühe, die mit einem Teil der Bohnen angedickt wird. Es ist eine Anpassung mit klar benannten Zutaten, ohne Salzfleisch, das entsalzt werden muss; sie steht nicht für alle brasilianischen Varianten.\n\nDer Vorschlag ergibt 8 Eintopfportionen. Die geschätzten 680 Minuten enthalten 8 Stunden gekühltes Einweichen, 30 Minuten Vorbereitung, 160 Minuten Garen und 10 Minuten Ruhe. Die Pfannenzutaten werden während des Bohnenkochens angebraten. Mengen, Ausbeute und Zeiten sind noch nicht im Küchentest bestätigt; entscheidend sind Zartheit und Temperatur.","category":"Hauptgerichte","category_slug":"platos-principales","difficulty":"Mittel","course":"Hauptgericht","cuisine":"Brasilianisch, für die Hausküche angepasst","prep_time_minutes":30,"cook_time_minutes":160,"total_time_minutes":680,"servings":8,"ingredients":[{"name":"Getrocknete schwarze Bohnen","amount":"500","unit":"g","group":"Bohnen und Kochwasser"},{"name":"Frische Schweineschulter ohne Knochen","amount":"400","unit":"g","group":"Fleisch"},{"name":"Vollständig gegarte geräucherte Schweinswurst","amount":"250","unit":"g","group":"Fleisch"},{"name":"Roher Speck","amount":"100","unit":"g","group":"Fleisch"},{"name":"Zwiebel","amount":"200","unit":"g","group":"Aromaten und Würzung"},{"name":"Knoblauch","amount":"20","unit":"g","group":"Aromaten und Würzung"},{"name":"Olivenöl","amount":"15","unit":"g","group":"Aromaten und Würzung"},{"name":"Salz","amount":"4","unit":"g","group":"Aromaten und Würzung"},{"name":"Schwarzer Pfeffer","amount":"1","unit":"g","group":"Aromaten und Würzung"},{"name":"Kochwasser","amount":"2500","unit":"ml","group":"Bohnen und Kochwasser"},{"name":"Getrocknete Lorbeerblätter, zum Entfernen","amount":"2","unit":"Blätter","group":"Aromaten und Würzung"}],"steps":[{"title":"Bohnen gekühlt einweichen","content":"500 g getrocknete schwarze Bohnen verlesen, Steinchen und beschädigte Bohnen entfernen und abspülen. In einem großen Behälter mit ungefähr 1,5 Litern Wasser mehrere Zentimeter bedecken. Zugedeckt 8 Stunden im Kühlschrank bei höchstens 4 °C einweichen; bei aufgesogenem Wasser mehr zugeben. Danach das gesamte Einweichwasser wegschütten und Bohnen abspülen. Dieses Wasser kommt zusätzlich zu den 2,5 Litern Kochwasser hinzu.","image_url":"/recetas/receta-de-feijoada/paso-01.webp","image_alt":"Feijoada mit schwarzen Bohnen und Schweinefleisch: Bohnen gekühlt einweichen"},{"title":"Zutaten vorbereiten und Rohes trennen","content":"200 g Zwiebel und 20 g Knoblauch auf einem sauberen Gemüsebrett hacken. 400 g frische knochenlose Schweineschulter in etwa 3 cm große Würfel und 100 g Speck in kurze Streifen schneiden, auf einem getrennten Brett für rohes Fleisch. 250 g Wurst in 1 cm dicke Scheiben schneiden; die Packung muss vollständig gegart ausweisen, keine rohe Wurst oder zu entsalzendes Pökelfleisch. Fleisch bis zum Garen kühlen, nach Kontakt mit rohem Schweinefleisch Hände und Geräte reinigen.","image_url":"/recetas/receta-de-feijoada/paso-02.webp","image_alt":"Feijoada mit schwarzen Bohnen und Schweinefleisch: Zutaten vorbereiten und Rohes trennen"},{"title":"Bohnen zuerst sprudelnd kochen","content":"Abgetropfte Bohnen in einen mindestens 6 Liter großen Topf mit 2,5 Litern frischem Wasser und 2 Lorbeerblättern geben. Aufkochen, als Richtwert etwa 15 Minuten, und mindestens 30 Minuten deutlich sprudelnd kochen lassen, ohne Deckel zur Kontrolle von Schaum und Überlaufen. Schaum abschöpfen; kochendes Wasser zugeben, falls die Bohnen nicht mehr bedeckt sind. Rohe oder harte Bohnen nicht probieren und diesen Schritt nicht durch einen Schongarer ersetzen.","image_url":"/recetas/receta-de-feijoada/paso-03.webp","image_alt":"Feijoada mit schwarzen Bohnen und Schweinefleisch: Bohnen zuerst sprudelnd kochen"},{"title":"Fleisch und Zwiebeln anbraten","content":"Während die Bohnen kochen, 15 g Öl in einer breiten Pfanne bei mittlerer Hitze erhitzen. Speck etwa 5 Minuten unter Rühren anbraten, bis er leicht bräunt. Schweinefleisch in zwei Durchgängen jeweils etwa 4 Minuten nur außen anbraten; fertig garen muss es im Eintopf. Fleisch auf einen dafür reservierten Teller geben. Zwiebel in derselben Pfanne 7 Minuten, Knoblauch 1 Minute und Wurst 4 Minuten braten. Alles einschließlich Fett aufbewahren: Die Nährwertschätzung zählt es vollständig.","image_url":"/recetas/receta-de-feijoada/paso-04.webp","image_alt":"Feijoada mit schwarzen Bohnen und Schweinefleisch: Fleisch und Zwiebeln anbraten"},{"title":"Eintopf weich köcheln lassen","content":"Nach 30 Minuten sprudelndem Kochen Fleisch, Wurst, Aromaten und Pfannensaft in den Topf geben; Pfanne mit etwas heißer Brühe auskratzen. 1 g Pfeffer zugeben, Salz erst am Ende. Wieder sanft aufkochen und etwa 100 Minuten mit leicht geöffnetem Deckel köcheln, alle 15–20 Minuten vom Boden her umrühren. Bohnen und Fleisch knapp bedeckt halten, bei Bedarf kochendes Wasser in Schritten von 100 ml nachgießen. Ansetzen verhindern und nicht so stark kochen, dass alle Bohnen zerfallen.","image_url":"/recetas/receta-de-feijoada/paso-05.webp","image_alt":"Feijoada mit schwarzen Bohnen und Schweinefleisch: Eintopf weich köcheln lassen"},{"title":"Gargrad und Konsistenz prüfen","content":"Mit sauberem Lebensmittelthermometer die Mitte mehrerer Fleischwürfel messen: Als praktisches Ziel dieses Eintopfs gelten mindestens 74 °C, über dem Minimum für ganze Fleischstücke. Fleisch muss außerdem unter einer Gabel leicht nachgeben; eine herausgehobene Bohne muss innen cremig ohne harten Kern sein. Bei fester Konsistenz oder zu niedriger Temperatur länger garen und erneut prüfen; Zeiten sind ein Vorschlag, keine Garantie. Nicht mit Geräten probieren, die rohes Fleisch berührt haben.","image_url":"/recetas/receta-de-feijoada/paso-06.webp","image_alt":"Feijoada mit schwarzen Bohnen und Schweinefleisch: Gargrad und Konsistenz prüfen"},{"title":"Andicken, würzen und ruhen lassen","content":"Eine Kelle weiche Bohnen ohne Fleisch herausheben, in einer Schüssel zerdrücken und zurückgeben. Etwa weitere 15 Minuten sanft unter Rühren köcheln, bis die Brühe den Löffelrücken leicht überzieht; bei zu dicker Konsistenz kochendes Wasser zugeben. Beide Lorbeerblätter entfernen. Erst jetzt probieren und die vorgesehenen 4 g Salz oder weniger bei bereits salzigen Fleischwaren zugeben; weniger Salz verändert die Natriumschätzung. Herd ausschalten und 10 Minuten zugedeckt ruhen lassen.","image_url":"/recetas/receta-de-feijoada/paso-07.webp","image_alt":"Feijoada mit schwarzen Bohnen und Schweinefleisch: Andicken, würzen und ruhen lassen"},{"title":"Portionieren und rasch kühlen","content":"In 8 Portionen mit ähnlichen Mengen Bohnen, Fleisch und Brühe teilen. Reis, Orange oder Farofa passen dazu, sind aber weder Zutaten noch Nährwerten zugerechnet. Reste rasch in kleine flache Behälter aufteilen und innerhalb von 2 Stunden bei höchstens 4 °C kühlen, bei Umgebung über 32 °C innerhalb 1 Stunde; nicht den ganzen großen Topf draußen abkühlen lassen. Binnen 3–4 Tagen verbrauchen oder portionsweise einfrieren; 2 Monate sind ein Qualitätsvorschlag. Im Kühlschrank auftauen und unter Rühren an mehreren Stellen auf mindestens 74 °C erhitzen.","image_url":"/recetas/receta-de-feijoada/paso-08.webp","image_alt":"Feijoada mit schwarzen Bohnen und Schweinefleisch: Portionieren und rasch kühlen"}],"notes":"Getrocknete schwarze Bohnen verwenden; gegarte Bohnen können bei diesen Mengen und Zeiten nicht einfach eingesetzt werden. Diese Variante enthält kein Trockenfleisch, Schweineohr oder Schweinefuß; dafür wären anderer Ablauf und Nährwertberechnung nötig. Laut Packung vollständig gegarte Wurst wählen: geräuchert bedeutet nicht immer gegart. Gegarte Linguiça oder entsprechende geräucherte Schweinswurst passt; die Marke beeinflusst Geschmack und Natrium. Frische Schulter muss nicht entsalzt werden. Für dünnere Brühe kochendes Wasser zugeben, zum Andicken gekochte Bohnen statt Mehl zerdrücken. Saure Zutaten erst zugeben, wenn Bohnen weich sind. Ruhe abseits der Hitze ersetzt keine schnelle Kühlung der Reste.","nutrition":{"calories":507.4,"protein_g":28.0,"carbs_g":42.5,"fat_g":25.3,"saturated_fat_g":8.1,"fiber_g":10.2,"sugar_g":2.7,"sodium_mg":596.0,"estimated":true,"source":"USDA FoodData Central — SR Legacy (abril de 2018)","source_url":"https://fdc.nal.usda.gov/download-datasets/","inputs":[{"ingredient":"Getrocknete schwarze Bohnen","edible_grams":500,"fdc_id":173734,"fdc_description":"Beans, black, mature seeds, raw","per_100g":{"fiber_g":15.5,"carbs_g":62.36,"calories":341.0,"sugar_g":2.12,"protein_g":21.6,"sodium_mg":5.0,"saturated_fat_g":0.366,"fat_g":1.42},"source_url":"https://fdc.nal.usda.gov/food-details/173734/nutrients"},{"ingredient":"Frische Schweineschulter ohne Knochen","edible_grams":400,"fdc_id":167843,"fdc_description":"Pork, fresh, shoulder, whole, separable lean and fat, raw","per_100g":{"sugar_g":0.0,"fat_g":17.99,"carbs_g":0.0,"calories":236.0,"saturated_fat_g":6.24,"fiber_g":0.0,"sodium_mg":65.0,"protein_g":17.18},"source_url":"https://fdc.nal.usda.gov/food-details/167843/nutrients"},{"ingredient":"Vollständig gegarte geräucherte Schweinswurst","edible_grams":250,"fdc_id":174584,"fdc_description":"Sausage, smoked link sausage, pork","per_100g":{"sugar_g":0.94,"fat_g":28.23,"fiber_g":0.0,"sodium_mg":827.0,"protein_g":11.98,"saturated_fat_g":9.313,"carbs_g":0.94,"calories":309.0},"source_url":"https://fdc.nal.usda.gov/food-details/174584/nutrients"},{"ingredient":"Roher Speck","edible_grams":100,"fdc_id":168277,"fdc_description":"Pork, cured, bacon, unprepared","per_100g":{"protein_g":13.66,"sodium_mg":751.0,"saturated_fat_g":12.615,"fat_g":37.13,"carbs_g":0.0,"calories":393.0,"sugar_g":0.35,"fiber_g":0.0},"source_url":"https://fdc.nal.usda.gov/food-details/168277/nutrients"},{"ingredient":"Zwiebel","edible_grams":200,"fdc_id":170000,"fdc_description":"Onions, raw","per_100g":{"sugar_g":4.24,"fat_g":0.1,"carbs_g":9.34,"calories":40.0,"saturated_fat_g":0.042,"protein_g":1.1,"fiber_g":1.7,"sodium_mg":4.0},"source_url":"https://fdc.nal.usda.gov/food-details/170000/nutrients"},{"ingredient":"Knoblauch","edible_grams":20,"fdc_id":169230,"fdc_description":"Garlic, raw","per_100g":{"carbs_g":33.06,"calories":149.0,"sugar_g":1.0,"saturated_fat_g":0.089,"fiber_g":2.1,"sodium_mg":17.0,"protein_g":6.36,"fat_g":0.5},"source_url":"https://fdc.nal.usda.gov/food-details/169230/nutrients"},{"ingredient":"Olivenöl","edible_grams":15,"fdc_id":171413,"fdc_description":"Oil, olive, salad or cooking","per_100g":{"fat_g":100.0,"carbs_g":0.0,"calories":884.0,"sodium_mg":2.0,"protein_g":0.0,"saturated_fat_g":13.808,"fiber_g":0.0,"sugar_g":0.0},"source_url":"https://fdc.nal.usda.gov/food-details/171413/nutrients"},{"ingredient":"Salz","edible_grams":4,"fdc_id":173468,"fdc_description":"Salt, table","per_100g":{"fiber_g":0.0,"sodium_mg":38758.0,"saturated_fat_g":0.0,"protein_g":0.0,"fat_g":0.0,"carbs_g":0.0,"calories":0.0,"sugar_g":0.0},"source_url":"https://fdc.nal.usda.gov/food-details/173468/nutrients"},{"ingredient":"Schwarzer Pfeffer","edible_grams":1,"fdc_id":170931,"fdc_description":"Spices, pepper, black","per_100g":{"fat_g":3.26,"sugar_g":0.64,"carbs_g":63.95,"calories":251.0,"protein_g":10.39,"fiber_g":25.3,"sodium_mg":20.0,"saturated_fat_g":1.392},"source_url":"https://fdc.nal.usda.gov/food-details/170931/nutrients"},{"ingredient":"Kochwasser","edible_grams":2500,"fdc_id":173647,"fdc_description":"Beverages, water, tap, drinking","per_100g":{"fat_g":0.0,"carbs_g":0.0,"calories":0.0,"protein_g":0.0,"fiber_g":0.0,"sodium_mg":4.0,"sugar_g":0.0,"saturated_fat_g":0.0},"source_url":"https://fdc.nal.usda.gov/food-details/173647/nutrients"}],"serving_size":"1 von 8 Eintopfportionen, ohne Beilagen","method":"Zehn geprüfte USDA-Datensätze, rohe essbare Gewichte von Bohnen, Schweinefleisch und Speck sowie Gewicht der bereits gegarten Wurst; Summe durch 8. Räucherwurst wird mit dem allgemeinen Datensatz für geräucherte Schweinswurst angenähert, nicht mit einem speziellen Linguiça-Datensatz. Fett und verbleibende Brühe vollständig gerechnet; entfernte Lorbeerblätter und Einweichwasser ausgeschlossen.","note":"Informationsschätzung, keine Analyse des fertigen Eintopfs. Marke und Salzgehalt von Wurst und Speck, Einweichen, Ausbeute und Brühenverteilung ändern die Werte. Reis, Orange, Farofa und Gemüsebeilagen nicht enthalten."},"keywords":["hausgemachte Feijoada","Feijoada schwarze Bohnen","Schweinefleisch Bohnen Eintopf"],"image_url":"/recetas/receta-de-feijoada/portada.webp","gallery":[{"url":"/recetas/receta-de-feijoada/portada.webp","alt":"Feijoada aus schwarzen Bohnen mit Schweinefleischwürfeln, Speck und geräucherten Wurstscheiben in dunkler Brühe"}],"seo":{"title":"Feijoada mit schwarzen Bohnen und Schweinefleisch","description":"Hausgemachte Feijoada für 8 mit schwarzen Bohnen, Schweinefleisch, Speck und Räucherwurst: Einweichen, Aufkochen, Schmoren und Aufbewahren.","image_alt":"Feijoada aus schwarzen Bohnen mit Schweinefleischwürfeln, Speck und geräucherten Wurstscheiben in dunkler Brühe","image_variants":["/recetas/receta-de-feijoada/portada-1x1.webp","/recetas/receta-de-feijoada/portada-4x3.webp","/recetas/receta-de-feijoada/portada-16x9.webp"],"faq":[{"q":"Kann ich das Einweichen weglassen?","a":"Dieser Vorschlag setzt 8 Stunden gekühltes Einweichen und frisches Kochwasser voraus. Eine gleichwertige Zeit ohne Einweichen wird nicht angegeben; der Ablauf ändert sich, und das erste 30-minütige Kochen entfällt dadurch nicht."},{"q":"Warum bleiben die Bohnen hart?","a":"Alte Bohnen, hartes Wasser oder früh zugegebene Säure können die Garzeit verlängern. Genug heißes Wasser halten und bis ohne harten Kern kochen; vorgesehenes Salz am Ende zugeben."},{"q":"Wie dicke ich ohne Mehl an?","a":"Eine Kelle weiche Bohnen ohne Fleisch zerdrücken und in den Eintopf zurückgeben. Weitere 15 Minuten sanft unter Rühren kochen; bei zu dicker Konsistenz kochendes Wasser zufügen."}]},"published":false,"editorial_status":"draft","content_html":"<p>Diese Feijoada für die Hausküche verbindet schwarze Bohnen, frische Schweineschulter, Speck und vollständig gegarte Räucherwurst in einer dunklen Brühe, die mit einem Teil der Bohnen angedickt wird. Es ist eine Anpassung mit klar benannten Zutaten, ohne Salzfleisch, das entsalzt werden muss; sie steht nicht für alle brasilianischen Varianten.</p><p>Der Vorschlag ergibt 8 Eintopfportionen. Die geschätzten 680 Minuten enthalten 8 Stunden gekühltes Einweichen, 30 Minuten Vorbereitung, 160 Minuten Garen und 10 Minuten Ruhe. Die Pfannenzutaten werden während des Bohnenkochens angebraten. Mengen, Ausbeute und Zeiten sind noch nicht im Küchentest bestätigt; entscheidend sind Zartheit und Temperatur.</p>"},{"id":"ba2c8320-2107-5c4c-97f8-e64eb1bcdb85","recipe_group_id":"592ace5b-ac32-4d7d-91f4-09002a1456aa","slug":"feijoada-recipe","public_path":"/en/feijoada-recipe","source_url":"https://manualdecocina.com/en/feijoada-recipe/","language":"en","title":"Home-style black bean and pork feijoada","excerpt":"Home-style feijoada for 8 with black beans, pork, bacon and smoked sausage: soaking, an initial boil, slow simmering and storage step by step.","summary":"This home-style feijoada combines black beans, fresh pork shoulder, bacon and fully cooked smoked sausage in a dark broth thickened with some of the beans themselves. It is an adaptation with clearly identified ingredients and no salted meats requiring desalting; it does not represent every Brazilian version.\n\nThe proposal makes 8 portions of stew. The estimated 680 minutes include 8 hours of refrigerated soaking, 30 minutes of preparation, 160 of cooking and 10 of resting. Brown the aromatics while the beans boil. Quantities, yield and timing await confirmation in a kitchen test; tenderness and temperature matter more than the clock.","category":"Main dishes","category_slug":"platos-principales","difficulty":"Medium","course":"Main course","cuisine":"Brazilian, home-style adaptation","prep_time_minutes":30,"cook_time_minutes":160,"total_time_minutes":680,"servings":8,"ingredients":[{"name":"Dry black beans","amount":"500","unit":"g","group":"Beans and cooking"},{"name":"Fresh boneless pork shoulder","amount":"400","unit":"g","group":"Meats"},{"name":"Fully cooked smoked pork sausage","amount":"250","unit":"g","group":"Meats"},{"name":"Raw bacon","amount":"100","unit":"g","group":"Meats"},{"name":"Onion","amount":"200","unit":"g","group":"Aromatics and seasoning"},{"name":"Garlic","amount":"20","unit":"g","group":"Aromatics and seasoning"},{"name":"Olive oil","amount":"15","unit":"g","group":"Aromatics and seasoning"},{"name":"Salt","amount":"4","unit":"g","group":"Aromatics and seasoning"},{"name":"Black pepper","amount":"1","unit":"g","group":"Aromatics and seasoning"},{"name":"Cooking water","amount":"2500","unit":"ml","group":"Beans and cooking"},{"name":"Dried bay leaves, to remove","amount":"2","unit":"leaves","group":"Aromatics and seasoning"}],"steps":[{"title":"Soak the beans in the refrigerator","content":"Sort the 500 g dry black beans, removing stones or damaged beans, and rinse. Put them in a roomy container with about 1.5 litres water, covered by several centimetres. Cover and soak for 8 hours in the refrigerator at 4 °C or below; add more water if absorbed. Discard all soaking water and rinse afterwards. This water is additional to the 2.5 litres used for cooking.","image_url":"/recetas/receta-de-feijoada/paso-01.webp","image_alt":"Home-style black bean and pork feijoada: Soak the beans in the refrigerator"},{"title":"Prepare ingredients and separate raw meat","content":"Chop the 200 g onion and 20 g garlic on a clean produce board. Cut the 400 g fresh boneless pork shoulder into roughly 3 cm cubes and the 100 g bacon into short strips on a separate raw-meat board. Slice the 250 g sausage into 1 cm rounds; use a product whose package says fully cooked, not fresh sausage or cured meat needing desalting. Keep meats refrigerated until cooking and wash hands and utensils after handling raw pork.","image_url":"/recetas/receta-de-feijoada/paso-02.webp","image_alt":"Home-style black bean and pork feijoada: Prepare ingredients and separate raw meat"},{"title":"Boil the beans before lowering the heat","content":"Put the drained beans in a pot of at least 6 litres with the 2.5 litres fresh water and 2 bay leaves. Bring to the boil, about 15 minutes as a guide, then maintain a clear rolling boil for at least 30 minutes without a lid to control foam and overflow. Skim foam with a spoon; add boiling water if beans become exposed. Do not taste raw or hard beans or replace this stage with a slow cooker.","image_url":"/recetas/receta-de-feijoada/paso-03.webp","image_alt":"Home-style black bean and pork feijoada: Boil the beans before lowering the heat"},{"title":"Brown the meat and aromatics","content":"During the boil, heat a wide skillet over medium heat with the 15 g oil. Cook the bacon for about 5 minutes, stirring, until it begins to brown. Add the pork in two batches for about 4 minutes each, only browning the surface; it must finish cooking in the stew. Remove meats to a plate reserved for them. Cook the onion in the same pan for 7 minutes, garlic for 1 minute and sausage for 4 minutes. Keep everything, including the rendered fat: the nutrition estimate counts it all.","image_url":"/recetas/receta-de-feijoada/paso-04.webp","image_alt":"Home-style black bean and pork feijoada: Brown the meat and aromatics"},{"title":"Simmer the stew until tender","content":"After the 30-minute boil, add meat, sausage, aromatics and pan juices to the pot, scraping the pan with a little hot broth. Add 1 g pepper; leave salt until the end. Return to a gentle simmer and cook for about 100 minutes with the lid partly open, stirring from the bottom every 15–20 minutes. Keep beans and meats barely covered, adding boiling water in 100 ml increments if needed. Prevent sticking and avoid a hard boil that breaks all the beans.","image_url":"/recetas/receta-de-feijoada/paso-05.webp","image_alt":"Home-style black bean and pork feijoada: Simmer the stew until tender"},{"title":"Check temperature and tenderness","content":"With a clean food thermometer, check the centres of several pork cubes: this stew uses a practical target of at least 74 °C, above the minimum for whole cuts. The meat must also yield easily under a fork, and a bean lifted with a spoon must be creamy inside without a hard core. If anything remains firm or below temperature, cook longer and check again; times are a proposal, not a guarantee. Do not taste with utensils that touched raw meat.","image_url":"/recetas/receta-de-feijoada/paso-06.webp","image_alt":"Home-style black bean and pork feijoada: Check temperature and tenderness"},{"title":"Thicken, season and rest","content":"Lift out a ladleful of tender beans without meat, mash them in a bowl and return the paste to the pot. Simmer for about 15 more minutes, stirring, until broth lightly coats the back of a spoon; add boiling water if too thick. Remove the 2 bay leaves. Taste only now and add the planned 4 g salt, or less if the sausage and bacon are already salty; less salt changes estimated sodium. Turn off the heat and rest for 10 minutes with the lid on.","image_url":"/recetas/receta-de-feijoada/paso-07.webp","image_alt":"Home-style black bean and pork feijoada: Thicken, season and rest"},{"title":"Portion and cool promptly","content":"Divide the stew into 8 portions with similar amounts of beans, meats and broth. Rice, orange or farofa can accompany it but are not included in ingredients or nutrition. For storage, promptly divide leftovers into small shallow containers and refrigerate at 4 °C or below within 2 hours, or 1 hour if ambient temperature exceeds 32 °C; do not leave the whole large pot outside to cool. Use within 3–4 days or freeze portions; 2 months is a proposed quality limit. Thaw in the refrigerator and reheat while stirring to at least 74 °C in several places.","image_url":"/recetas/receta-de-feijoada/paso-08.webp","image_alt":"Home-style black bean and pork feijoada: Portion and cool promptly"}],"notes":"Use dry black beans; do not substitute cooked beans while retaining these times and quantities. This version contains no dried beef, pig ear or trotter; adding them requires a different process and nutrition calculation. The sausage must be fully cooked according to its package: smoked does not always mean cooked. Cooked linguiça or comparable smoked pork sausage is suitable; the brand changes flavour and sodium. Fresh shoulder needs no desalting. For a thinner broth add boiling water; thicken with mashed cooked beans rather than flour. Do not add acidic ingredients before beans are tender. Resting off the heat does not replace prompt refrigeration of leftovers.","nutrition":{"calories":507.4,"protein_g":28.0,"carbs_g":42.5,"fat_g":25.3,"saturated_fat_g":8.1,"fiber_g":10.2,"sugar_g":2.7,"sodium_mg":596.0,"estimated":true,"source":"USDA FoodData Central — SR Legacy (abril de 2018)","source_url":"https://fdc.nal.usda.gov/download-datasets/","inputs":[{"ingredient":"Dry black beans","edible_grams":500,"fdc_id":173734,"fdc_description":"Beans, black, mature seeds, raw","per_100g":{"fiber_g":15.5,"carbs_g":62.36,"calories":341.0,"sugar_g":2.12,"protein_g":21.6,"sodium_mg":5.0,"saturated_fat_g":0.366,"fat_g":1.42},"source_url":"https://fdc.nal.usda.gov/food-details/173734/nutrients"},{"ingredient":"Fresh boneless pork shoulder","edible_grams":400,"fdc_id":167843,"fdc_description":"Pork, fresh, shoulder, whole, separable lean and fat, raw","per_100g":{"sugar_g":0.0,"fat_g":17.99,"carbs_g":0.0,"calories":236.0,"saturated_fat_g":6.24,"fiber_g":0.0,"sodium_mg":65.0,"protein_g":17.18},"source_url":"https://fdc.nal.usda.gov/food-details/167843/nutrients"},{"ingredient":"Fully cooked smoked pork sausage","edible_grams":250,"fdc_id":174584,"fdc_description":"Sausage, smoked link sausage, pork","per_100g":{"sugar_g":0.94,"fat_g":28.23,"fiber_g":0.0,"sodium_mg":827.0,"protein_g":11.98,"saturated_fat_g":9.313,"carbs_g":0.94,"calories":309.0},"source_url":"https://fdc.nal.usda.gov/food-details/174584/nutrients"},{"ingredient":"Raw bacon","edible_grams":100,"fdc_id":168277,"fdc_description":"Pork, cured, bacon, unprepared","per_100g":{"protein_g":13.66,"sodium_mg":751.0,"saturated_fat_g":12.615,"fat_g":37.13,"carbs_g":0.0,"calories":393.0,"sugar_g":0.35,"fiber_g":0.0},"source_url":"https://fdc.nal.usda.gov/food-details/168277/nutrients"},{"ingredient":"Onion","edible_grams":200,"fdc_id":170000,"fdc_description":"Onions, raw","per_100g":{"sugar_g":4.24,"fat_g":0.1,"carbs_g":9.34,"calories":40.0,"saturated_fat_g":0.042,"protein_g":1.1,"fiber_g":1.7,"sodium_mg":4.0},"source_url":"https://fdc.nal.usda.gov/food-details/170000/nutrients"},{"ingredient":"Garlic","edible_grams":20,"fdc_id":169230,"fdc_description":"Garlic, raw","per_100g":{"carbs_g":33.06,"calories":149.0,"sugar_g":1.0,"saturated_fat_g":0.089,"fiber_g":2.1,"sodium_mg":17.0,"protein_g":6.36,"fat_g":0.5},"source_url":"https://fdc.nal.usda.gov/food-details/169230/nutrients"},{"ingredient":"Olive oil","edible_grams":15,"fdc_id":171413,"fdc_description":"Oil, olive, salad or cooking","per_100g":{"fat_g":100.0,"carbs_g":0.0,"calories":884.0,"sodium_mg":2.0,"protein_g":0.0,"saturated_fat_g":13.808,"fiber_g":0.0,"sugar_g":0.0},"source_url":"https://fdc.nal.usda.gov/food-details/171413/nutrients"},{"ingredient":"Salt","edible_grams":4,"fdc_id":173468,"fdc_description":"Salt, table","per_100g":{"fiber_g":0.0,"sodium_mg":38758.0,"saturated_fat_g":0.0,"protein_g":0.0,"fat_g":0.0,"carbs_g":0.0,"calories":0.0,"sugar_g":0.0},"source_url":"https://fdc.nal.usda.gov/food-details/173468/nutrients"},{"ingredient":"Black pepper","edible_grams":1,"fdc_id":170931,"fdc_description":"Spices, pepper, black","per_100g":{"fat_g":3.26,"sugar_g":0.64,"carbs_g":63.95,"calories":251.0,"protein_g":10.39,"fiber_g":25.3,"sodium_mg":20.0,"saturated_fat_g":1.392},"source_url":"https://fdc.nal.usda.gov/food-details/170931/nutrients"},{"ingredient":"Cooking water","edible_grams":2500,"fdc_id":173647,"fdc_description":"Beverages, water, tap, drinking","per_100g":{"fat_g":0.0,"carbs_g":0.0,"calories":0.0,"protein_g":0.0,"fiber_g":0.0,"sodium_mg":4.0,"sugar_g":0.0,"saturated_fat_g":0.0},"source_url":"https://fdc.nal.usda.gov/food-details/173647/nutrients"}],"serving_size":"1 of 8 portions of stew, without sides","method":"Ten verified USDA records, raw edible weights for beans, pork and bacon, and weight of the already cooked sausage; total divided by 8. Smoked sausage is approximated using a generic smoked pork sausage record, not a specific Brazilian linguiça record. All fat and retained broth are counted. Removed bay leaves and discarded soaking water are excluded.","note":"Informational estimate, not analysis of finished stew. Sausage and bacon brands and salt levels, soaking, yield and broth distribution change the values. Rice, orange, farofa and vegetable sides are excluded."},"keywords":["home-style feijoada","black bean feijoada","pork and black bean stew"],"image_url":"/recetas/receta-de-feijoada/portada.webp","gallery":[{"url":"/recetas/receta-de-feijoada/portada.webp","alt":"Black bean feijoada with pork cubes, bacon and smoked sausage slices in dark broth"}],"seo":{"title":"Home-style black bean and pork feijoada","description":"Home-style feijoada for 8 with black beans, pork, bacon and smoked sausage: soaking, an initial boil, slow simmering and storage step by step.","image_alt":"Black bean feijoada with pork cubes, bacon and smoked sausage slices in dark broth","image_variants":["/recetas/receta-de-feijoada/portada-1x1.webp","/recetas/receta-de-feijoada/portada-4x3.webp","/recetas/receta-de-feijoada/portada-16x9.webp"],"faq":[{"q":"Can I skip soaking?","a":"This proposal starts with 8 hours of refrigerated soaking and fresh cooking water. No equivalent unsoaked timing is provided; that changes the process and does not remove the initial 30-minute boil."},{"q":"Why are the beans still hard?","a":"Old beans, hard water or acidic ingredients added early can prolong cooking. Keep enough hot water in the pot and cook until there is no hard core; add the planned salt at the end."},{"q":"How can I thicken the broth without flour?","a":"Mash a ladleful of tender beans without meat and return it to the stew. Simmer for another 15 minutes, stirring; add boiling water if excessively thick."}]},"published":false,"editorial_status":"draft","content_html":"<p>This home-style feijoada combines black beans, fresh pork shoulder, bacon and fully cooked smoked sausage in a dark broth thickened with some of the beans themselves. It is an adaptation with clearly identified ingredients and no salted meats requiring desalting; it does not represent every Brazilian version.</p><p>The proposal makes 8 portions of stew. The estimated 680 minutes include 8 hours of refrigerated soaking, 30 minutes of preparation, 160 of cooking and 10 of resting. Brown the aromatics while the beans boil. Quantities, yield and timing await confirmation in a kitchen test; tenderness and temperature matter more than the clock.</p>"},{"id":"857efaf0-ed1a-5933-9bf8-ec00c7479c01","recipe_group_id":"592ace5b-ac32-4d7d-91f4-09002a1456aa","slug":"recette-de-feijoada","public_path":"/fr/recette-de-feijoada","source_url":"https://manualdecocina.com/fr/recette-de-feijoada/","language":"fr","title":"Feijoada maison aux haricots noirs et au porc","excerpt":"Feijoada maison pour 8 aux haricots noirs, porc, lard et saucisse fumée : trempage, ébullition initiale, mijotage et conservation expliqués.","summary":"Cette feijoada maison associe haricots noirs, épaule de porc fraîche, lard et saucisse fumée entièrement cuite dans un bouillon sombre épaissi avec une partie des haricots. C’est une adaptation aux ingrédients clairement identifiés, sans viandes salées à dessaler ; elle ne représente pas toutes les variantes brésiliennes.\n\nLa proposition donne 8 portions de ragoût. Les 680 minutes estimées comprennent 8 heures de trempage au réfrigérateur, 30 minutes de préparation, 160 de cuisson et 10 de repos. Les aromates sont revenus pendant que les haricots bouillent. Quantités, rendement et durées restent à confirmer par un essai en cuisine ; tendreté et température priment sur le minuteur.","category":"Plats principaux","category_slug":"platos-principales","difficulty":"Moyenne","course":"Plat principal","cuisine":"Brésilienne, adaptation maison","prep_time_minutes":30,"cook_time_minutes":160,"total_time_minutes":680,"servings":8,"ingredients":[{"name":"Haricots noirs secs","amount":"500","unit":"g","group":"Haricots et cuisson"},{"name":"Épaule de porc fraîche désossée","amount":"400","unit":"g","group":"Viandes"},{"name":"Saucisse de porc fumée entièrement cuite","amount":"250","unit":"g","group":"Viandes"},{"name":"Lard cru","amount":"100","unit":"g","group":"Viandes"},{"name":"Oignon","amount":"200","unit":"g","group":"Aromates et assaisonnement"},{"name":"Ail","amount":"20","unit":"g","group":"Aromates et assaisonnement"},{"name":"Huile d’olive","amount":"15","unit":"g","group":"Aromates et assaisonnement"},{"name":"Sel","amount":"4","unit":"g","group":"Aromates et assaisonnement"},{"name":"Poivre noir","amount":"1","unit":"g","group":"Aromates et assaisonnement"},{"name":"Eau de cuisson","amount":"2500","unit":"ml","group":"Haricots et cuisson"},{"name":"Laurier séché, à retirer","amount":"2","unit":"feuilles","group":"Aromates et assaisonnement"}],"steps":[{"title":"Faire tremper les haricots au froid","content":"Triez les 500 g de haricots noirs secs, retirez cailloux et grains abîmés, puis rincez. Placez dans un grand récipient avec environ 1,5 litre d’eau, recouverts de plusieurs centimètres. Couvrez et laissez tremper 8 heures au réfrigérateur à 4 °C ou moins ; ajoutez de l’eau si elle est absorbée. Jetez toute l’eau de trempage et rincez ensuite. Cette eau s’ajoute aux 2,5 litres réservés à la cuisson.","image_url":"/recetas/receta-de-feijoada/paso-01.webp","image_alt":"Feijoada maison aux haricots noirs et au porc: Faire tremper les haricots au froid"},{"title":"Préparer et séparer la viande crue","content":"Hachez les 200 g d’oignon et les 20 g d’ail sur une planche propre pour légumes. Sur une autre planche pour viande crue, coupez les 400 g d’épaule fraîche désossée en cubes d’environ 3 cm et les 100 g de lard en courtes lanières. Coupez les 250 g de saucisse en rondelles de 1 cm ; choisissez un produit étiqueté entièrement cuit, pas une saucisse fraîche ni une viande salée à dessaler. Gardez les viandes au froid jusqu’à cuisson et lavez mains et ustensiles après le porc cru.","image_url":"/recetas/receta-de-feijoada/paso-02.webp","image_alt":"Feijoada maison aux haricots noirs et au porc: Préparer et séparer la viande crue"},{"title":"Faire bouillir les haricots avant de réduire le feu","content":"Mettez les haricots égouttés dans une marmite d’au moins 6 litres avec les 2,5 litres d’eau fraîche et les 2 feuilles de laurier. Portez à ébullition, environ 15 minutes à titre indicatif, puis maintenez une franche ébullition au moins 30 minutes sans couvercle pour surveiller mousse et débordement. Écumez à la cuillère ; ajoutez de l’eau bouillante si les grains ne sont plus couverts. Ne goûtez pas de haricots crus ou durs et ne remplacez pas cette étape par une mijoteuse.","image_url":"/recetas/receta-de-feijoada/paso-03.webp","image_alt":"Feijoada maison aux haricots noirs et au porc: Faire bouillir les haricots avant de réduire le feu"},{"title":"Dorer les viandes et les aromates","content":"Pendant l’ébullition, chauffez une grande poêle à feu moyen avec les 15 g d’huile. Faites revenir le lard environ 5 minutes en remuant, jusqu’au début de coloration. Ajoutez le porc en deux fois, environ 4 minutes par tournée, pour dorer seulement la surface ; la cuisson finira dans le ragoût. Réservez les viandes dans une assiette dédiée. Faites revenir dans la même poêle l’oignon 7 minutes, l’ail 1 minute et la saucisse 4 minutes. Gardez tout, graisse comprise : l’estimation nutritionnelle la compte entièrement.","image_url":"/recetas/receta-de-feijoada/paso-04.webp","image_alt":"Feijoada maison aux haricots noirs et au porc: Dorer les viandes et les aromates"},{"title":"Mijoter jusqu’à tendreté","content":"Après les 30 minutes d’ébullition, ajoutez viandes, saucisse, aromates et jus de poêle à la marmite, en grattant la poêle avec un peu de bouillon chaud. Ajoutez 1 g de poivre ; réservez le sel pour la fin. Retrouvez un léger frémissement et cuisez environ 100 minutes, couvercle entrouvert, en remuant depuis le fond toutes les 15–20 minutes. Gardez haricots et viandes à peine couverts, ajoutez de l’eau bouillante par 100 ml si nécessaire. Évitez qu’ils attachent ou que trop forte ébullition défasse tous les grains.","image_url":"/recetas/receta-de-feijoada/paso-05.webp","image_alt":"Feijoada maison aux haricots noirs et au porc: Mijoter jusqu’à tendreté"},{"title":"Vérifier cuisson et texture","content":"Avec un thermomètre propre, mesurez le cœur de plusieurs cubes de porc : ce ragoût fixe un objectif pratique d’au moins 74 °C, supérieur au minimum pour les morceaux entiers. La viande doit aussi céder facilement sous une fourchette ; un haricot sorti à la cuillère doit être crémeux à cœur, sans noyau dur. Si quelque chose reste ferme ou insuffisamment chaud, prolongez et vérifiez encore ; les durées sont proposées, pas garanties. Ne goûtez pas avec des ustensiles ayant touché la viande crue.","image_url":"/recetas/receta-de-feijoada/paso-06.webp","image_alt":"Feijoada maison aux haricots noirs et au porc: Vérifier cuisson et texture"},{"title":"Épaissir, saler et laisser reposer","content":"Prélevez une louche de haricots tendres sans viande, écrasez-les dans un bol puis remettez la pâte dans la marmite. Mijotez environ 15 minutes supplémentaires en remuant, jusqu’à ce que le bouillon nappe légèrement le dos d’une cuillère ; ajoutez de l’eau bouillante s’il épaissit trop. Retirez les 2 feuilles de laurier. Goûtez seulement maintenant et ajoutez les 4 g de sel prévus, ou moins si les charcuteries salent déjà suffisamment ; moins de sel modifie le sodium estimé. Coupez le feu et laissez reposer 10 minutes à couvert.","image_url":"/recetas/receta-de-feijoada/paso-07.webp","image_alt":"Feijoada maison aux haricots noirs et au porc: Épaissir, saler et laisser reposer"},{"title":"Partager et refroidir rapidement","content":"Répartissez en 8 portions avec des quantités similaires de haricots, viandes et bouillon. Riz, orange ou farofa peuvent accompagner, mais ne sont inclus ni aux ingrédients ni aux valeurs nutritionnelles. Pour conserver, répartissez rapidement les restes en petits récipients peu profonds et réfrigérez à 4 °C ou moins dans les 2 heures, ou 1 heure si l’air dépasse 32 °C ; n’attendez pas que toute la grosse marmite refroidisse dehors. Consommez en 3–4 jours ou congelez par portions ; 2 mois est une proposition de qualité. Décongelez au réfrigérateur et réchauffez en remuant jusqu’à au moins 74 °C en plusieurs points.","image_url":"/recetas/receta-de-feijoada/paso-08.webp","image_alt":"Feijoada maison aux haricots noirs et au porc: Partager et refroidir rapidement"}],"notes":"Utilisez des haricots noirs secs ; les remplacer par des haricots cuits en conservant ces quantités et durées ne convient pas. Cette version ne contient ni viande séchée, ni oreille, ni pied de porc ; leur ajout demande un autre procédé et calcul nutritionnel. La saucisse doit être entièrement cuite selon l’emballage : fumée ne signifie pas toujours cuite. Linguiça cuite ou saucisse de porc fumée équivalente convient ; la marque change saveur et sodium. L’épaule fraîche ne se dessale pas. Allongez avec de l’eau bouillante, épaississez en écrasant des haricots cuits plutôt qu’avec de la farine. N’ajoutez pas d’ingrédients acides avant tendreté des haricots. Le repos hors du feu ne remplace pas la réfrigération rapide des restes.","nutrition":{"calories":507.4,"protein_g":28.0,"carbs_g":42.5,"fat_g":25.3,"saturated_fat_g":8.1,"fiber_g":10.2,"sugar_g":2.7,"sodium_mg":596.0,"estimated":true,"source":"USDA FoodData Central — SR Legacy (abril de 2018)","source_url":"https://fdc.nal.usda.gov/download-datasets/","inputs":[{"ingredient":"Haricots noirs secs","edible_grams":500,"fdc_id":173734,"fdc_description":"Beans, black, mature seeds, raw","per_100g":{"fiber_g":15.5,"carbs_g":62.36,"calories":341.0,"sugar_g":2.12,"protein_g":21.6,"sodium_mg":5.0,"saturated_fat_g":0.366,"fat_g":1.42},"source_url":"https://fdc.nal.usda.gov/food-details/173734/nutrients"},{"ingredient":"Épaule de porc fraîche désossée","edible_grams":400,"fdc_id":167843,"fdc_description":"Pork, fresh, shoulder, whole, separable lean and fat, raw","per_100g":{"sugar_g":0.0,"fat_g":17.99,"carbs_g":0.0,"calories":236.0,"saturated_fat_g":6.24,"fiber_g":0.0,"sodium_mg":65.0,"protein_g":17.18},"source_url":"https://fdc.nal.usda.gov/food-details/167843/nutrients"},{"ingredient":"Saucisse de porc fumée entièrement cuite","edible_grams":250,"fdc_id":174584,"fdc_description":"Sausage, smoked link sausage, pork","per_100g":{"sugar_g":0.94,"fat_g":28.23,"fiber_g":0.0,"sodium_mg":827.0,"protein_g":11.98,"saturated_fat_g":9.313,"carbs_g":0.94,"calories":309.0},"source_url":"https://fdc.nal.usda.gov/food-details/174584/nutrients"},{"ingredient":"Lard cru","edible_grams":100,"fdc_id":168277,"fdc_description":"Pork, cured, bacon, unprepared","per_100g":{"protein_g":13.66,"sodium_mg":751.0,"saturated_fat_g":12.615,"fat_g":37.13,"carbs_g":0.0,"calories":393.0,"sugar_g":0.35,"fiber_g":0.0},"source_url":"https://fdc.nal.usda.gov/food-details/168277/nutrients"},{"ingredient":"Oignon","edible_grams":200,"fdc_id":170000,"fdc_description":"Onions, raw","per_100g":{"sugar_g":4.24,"fat_g":0.1,"carbs_g":9.34,"calories":40.0,"saturated_fat_g":0.042,"protein_g":1.1,"fiber_g":1.7,"sodium_mg":4.0},"source_url":"https://fdc.nal.usda.gov/food-details/170000/nutrients"},{"ingredient":"Ail","edible_grams":20,"fdc_id":169230,"fdc_description":"Garlic, raw","per_100g":{"carbs_g":33.06,"calories":149.0,"sugar_g":1.0,"saturated_fat_g":0.089,"fiber_g":2.1,"sodium_mg":17.0,"protein_g":6.36,"fat_g":0.5},"source_url":"https://fdc.nal.usda.gov/food-details/169230/nutrients"},{"ingredient":"Huile d’olive","edible_grams":15,"fdc_id":171413,"fdc_description":"Oil, olive, salad or cooking","per_100g":{"fat_g":100.0,"carbs_g":0.0,"calories":884.0,"sodium_mg":2.0,"protein_g":0.0,"saturated_fat_g":13.808,"fiber_g":0.0,"sugar_g":0.0},"source_url":"https://fdc.nal.usda.gov/food-details/171413/nutrients"},{"ingredient":"Sel","edible_grams":4,"fdc_id":173468,"fdc_description":"Salt, table","per_100g":{"fiber_g":0.0,"sodium_mg":38758.0,"saturated_fat_g":0.0,"protein_g":0.0,"fat_g":0.0,"carbs_g":0.0,"calories":0.0,"sugar_g":0.0},"source_url":"https://fdc.nal.usda.gov/food-details/173468/nutrients"},{"ingredient":"Poivre noir","edible_grams":1,"fdc_id":170931,"fdc_description":"Spices, pepper, black","per_100g":{"fat_g":3.26,"sugar_g":0.64,"carbs_g":63.95,"calories":251.0,"protein_g":10.39,"fiber_g":25.3,"sodium_mg":20.0,"saturated_fat_g":1.392},"source_url":"https://fdc.nal.usda.gov/food-details/170931/nutrients"},{"ingredient":"Eau de cuisson","edible_grams":2500,"fdc_id":173647,"fdc_description":"Beverages, water, tap, drinking","per_100g":{"fat_g":0.0,"carbs_g":0.0,"calories":0.0,"protein_g":0.0,"fiber_g":0.0,"sodium_mg":4.0,"sugar_g":0.0,"saturated_fat_g":0.0},"source_url":"https://fdc.nal.usda.gov/food-details/173647/nutrients"}],"serving_size":"1 des 8 portions de ragoût, sans accompagnement","method":"Dix fiches USDA vérifiées, poids crus comestibles des haricots, porc et lard, poids de la saucisse déjà cuite ; somme divisée par 8. La saucisse fumée est approximée avec une fiche générique de saucisse de porc fumée, pas une fiche spécifique de linguiça brésilienne. Toute la graisse et le bouillon conservé comptent. Laurier retiré et eau de trempage jetée sont exclus.","note":"Estimation informative, pas analyse du ragoût terminé. Marque et sel des charcuteries, trempage, rendement et répartition du bouillon modifient les chiffres. Riz, orange, farofa et légumes d’accompagnement exclus."},"keywords":["feijoada maison","feijoada haricots noirs","ragoût de porc et haricots noirs"],"image_url":"/recetas/receta-de-feijoada/portada.webp","gallery":[{"url":"/recetas/receta-de-feijoada/portada.webp","alt":"Feijoada de haricots noirs avec porc, lard et rondelles de saucisse fumée dans un bouillon sombre"}],"seo":{"title":"Feijoada maison aux haricots noirs et au porc","description":"Feijoada maison pour 8 aux haricots noirs, porc, lard et saucisse fumée : trempage, ébullition initiale, mijotage et conservation expliqués.","image_alt":"Feijoada de haricots noirs avec porc, lard et rondelles de saucisse fumée dans un bouillon sombre","image_variants":["/recetas/receta-de-feijoada/portada-1x1.webp","/recetas/receta-de-feijoada/portada-4x3.webp","/recetas/receta-de-feijoada/portada-16x9.webp"],"faq":[{"q":"Puis-je supprimer le trempage ?","a":"Cette proposition commence par 8 heures de trempage au froid et de l’eau fraîche pour cuire. Aucune durée équivalente sans trempage n’est donnée ; cela change le procédé et ne supprime pas les 30 minutes d’ébullition initiale."},{"q":"Pourquoi les haricots restent-ils durs ?","a":"Des grains anciens, une eau dure ou des ingrédients acides ajoutés tôt peuvent prolonger la cuisson. Maintenez assez d’eau chaude et cuisez jusqu’à disparition du cœur dur ; salez à la fin comme prévu."},{"q":"Comment épaissir sans farine ?","a":"Écrasez une louche de haricots tendres sans viande et remettez au ragoût. Mijotez encore 15 minutes en remuant ; ajoutez de l’eau bouillante si trop épais."}]},"published":false,"editorial_status":"draft","content_html":"<p>Cette feijoada maison associe haricots noirs, épaule de porc fraîche, lard et saucisse fumée entièrement cuite dans un bouillon sombre épaissi avec une partie des haricots. C’est une adaptation aux ingrédients clairement identifiés, sans viandes salées à dessaler ; elle ne représente pas toutes les variantes brésiliennes.</p><p>La proposition donne 8 portions de ragoût. Les 680 minutes estimées comprennent 8 heures de trempage au réfrigérateur, 30 minutes de préparation, 160 de cuisson et 10 de repos. Les aromates sont revenus pendant que les haricots bouillent. Quantités, rendement et durées restent à confirmer par un essai en cuisine ; tendreté et température priment sur le minuteur.</p>"},{"id":"6b34ceb0-0f0c-5792-8135-794d08830692","recipe_group_id":"592ace5b-ac32-4d7d-91f4-09002a1456aa","slug":"feijoada-ricetta","public_path":"/it/feijoada-ricetta","source_url":"https://manualdecocina.com/it/feijoada-ricetta/","language":"it","title":"Feijoada casalinga con fagioli neri e maiale","excerpt":"Feijoada casalinga per 8 con fagioli neri, maiale, pancetta e salsiccia affumicata: ammollo, bollitura iniziale, cottura lenta e conservazione.","summary":"Questa feijoada casalinga unisce fagioli neri, spalla di maiale fresca, pancetta e salsiccia affumicata completamente cotta in un brodo scuro addensato con parte degli stessi fagioli. È un adattamento con ingredienti ben identificati, senza carni salate da dissalare; non rappresenta tutte le varianti brasiliane.\n\nLa proposta rende 8 porzioni di stufato. I 680 minuti stimati comprendono 8 ore di ammollo in frigorifero, 30 minuti di preparazione, 160 di cottura e 10 di riposo. Il soffritto si prepara mentre bollono i fagioli. Quantità, resa e tempi attendono conferma con una prova in cucina; contano morbidezza e temperatura, non solo l’orologio.","category":"Secondi piatti","category_slug":"platos-principales","difficulty":"Media","course":"Piatto principale","cuisine":"Brasiliana, adattamento casalingo","prep_time_minutes":30,"cook_time_minutes":160,"total_time_minutes":680,"servings":8,"ingredients":[{"name":"Fagioli neri secchi","amount":"500","unit":"g","group":"Fagioli e cottura"},{"name":"Spalla di maiale fresca disossata","amount":"400","unit":"g","group":"Carni"},{"name":"Salsiccia di maiale affumicata completamente cotta","amount":"250","unit":"g","group":"Carni"},{"name":"Pancetta cruda","amount":"100","unit":"g","group":"Carni"},{"name":"Cipolla","amount":"200","unit":"g","group":"Soffritto e condimento"},{"name":"Aglio","amount":"20","unit":"g","group":"Soffritto e condimento"},{"name":"Olio d’oliva","amount":"15","unit":"g","group":"Soffritto e condimento"},{"name":"Sale","amount":"4","unit":"g","group":"Soffritto e condimento"},{"name":"Pepe nero","amount":"1","unit":"g","group":"Soffritto e condimento"},{"name":"Acqua di cottura","amount":"2500","unit":"ml","group":"Fagioli e cottura"},{"name":"Alloro secco, da togliere","amount":"2","unit":"foglie","group":"Soffritto e condimento"}],"steps":[{"title":"Ammolla i fagioli in frigorifero","content":"Controlla i 500 g di fagioli neri secchi, elimina sassolini e chicchi rovinati e sciacqua. Mettili in un recipiente ampio con circa 1,5 litri d’acqua, coperti di diversi centimetri. Copri e ammolla 8 ore in frigorifero a 4 °C o meno; aggiungi acqua se viene assorbita. Alla fine getta tutta l’acqua d’ammollo e sciacqua. Quest’acqua è aggiuntiva rispetto ai 2,5 litri per la cottura.","image_url":"/recetas/receta-de-feijoada/paso-01.webp","image_alt":"Feijoada casalinga con fagioli neri e maiale: Ammolla i fagioli in frigorifero"},{"title":"Prepara e separa la carne cruda","content":"Trita i 200 g di cipolla e i 20 g d’aglio su un tagliere pulito per vegetali. Su un altro tagliere per carne cruda taglia i 400 g di spalla fresca disossata a cubetti di circa 3 cm e i 100 g di pancetta a strisce corte. Affetta i 250 g di salsiccia a rondelle di 1 cm; scegli un prodotto indicato come completamente cotto, non salsiccia fresca né carne salata da dissalare. Tieni le carni al freddo fino alla cottura e lava mani e utensili dopo aver toccato maiale crudo.","image_url":"/recetas/receta-de-feijoada/paso-02.webp","image_alt":"Feijoada casalinga con fagioli neri e maiale: Prepara e separa la carne cruda"},{"title":"Fai bollire i fagioli prima di abbassare il fuoco","content":"Versa i fagioli scolati in una pentola da almeno 6 litri con i 2,5 litri d’acqua fresca e le 2 foglie d’alloro. Porta a ebollizione, circa 15 minuti indicativi, poi mantieni un bollore evidente per almeno 30 minuti senza coperchio, controllando schiuma e traboccamenti. Schiuma con un cucchiaio; aggiungi acqua bollente se i fagioli non sono più coperti. Non assaggiare fagioli crudi o duri e non sostituire questa fase con una slow cooker.","image_url":"/recetas/receta-de-feijoada/paso-03.webp","image_alt":"Feijoada casalinga con fagioli neri e maiale: Fai bollire i fagioli prima di abbassare il fuoco"},{"title":"Rosola carni e aromi","content":"Durante la bollitura scalda una padella ampia a fuoco medio con i 15 g d’olio. Cuoci la pancetta circa 5 minuti, mescolando, finché inizia a dorare. Aggiungi il maiale in due riprese, circa 4 minuti ciascuna, solo per dorare l’esterno; finirà di cuocere nello stufato. Togli le carni su un piatto dedicato. Nella stessa padella fai soffriggere la cipolla 7 minuti, l’aglio 1 minuto e la salsiccia 4 minuti. Conserva tutto, grasso compreso: la stima nutrizionale lo conta interamente.","image_url":"/recetas/receta-de-feijoada/paso-04.webp","image_alt":"Feijoada casalinga con fagioli neri e maiale: Rosola carni e aromi"},{"title":"Cuoci lo stufato finché è tenero","content":"Dopo i 30 minuti di bollitura unisci alla pentola carni, salsiccia, soffritto e succhi della padella, raschiandola con poco brodo caldo. Aggiungi 1 g di pepe; lascia il sale per la fine. Riporta a lieve bollore e cuoci circa 100 minuti con coperchio socchiuso, mescolando dal fondo ogni 15–20 minuti. Tieni fagioli e carni appena coperti e aggiungi acqua bollente a incrementi di 100 ml se necessario. Evita che si attacchino o che un bollore troppo forte disfi tutti i fagioli.","image_url":"/recetas/receta-de-feijoada/paso-05.webp","image_alt":"Feijoada casalinga con fagioli neri e maiale: Cuoci lo stufato finché è tenero"},{"title":"Controlla temperatura e consistenza","content":"Con termometro pulito misura il centro di diversi cubetti di maiale: questo stufato adotta un obiettivo pratico di almeno 74 °C, superiore al minimo per tagli interi. La carne deve inoltre cedere facilmente sotto una forchetta, e un fagiolo preso con cucchiaio deve essere cremoso all’interno senza nucleo duro. Se qualcosa è ancora tenace o la temperatura è insufficiente, prolunga e controlla di nuovo; i tempi sono proposti, non garantiti. Non assaggiare con utensili che hanno toccato carne cruda.","image_url":"/recetas/receta-de-feijoada/paso-06.webp","image_alt":"Feijoada casalinga con fagioli neri e maiale: Controlla temperatura e consistenza"},{"title":"Addensa, sala e lascia riposare","content":"Preleva un mestolo di fagioli morbidi senza carne, schiacciali in una ciotola e rimetti la pasta nella pentola. Cuoci dolcemente circa altri 15 minuti mescolando, finché il brodo vela leggermente il dorso di un cucchiaio; se troppo denso aggiungi acqua bollente. Togli le 2 foglie d’alloro. Assaggia solo ora e aggiungi i 4 g di sale previsti, o meno se gli insaccati sono già sapidi; meno sale modifica la stima del sodio. Spegni e lascia riposare 10 minuti coperto.","image_url":"/recetas/receta-de-feijoada/paso-07.webp","image_alt":"Feijoada casalinga con fagioli neri e maiale: Addensa, sala e lascia riposare"},{"title":"Porziona e raffredda rapidamente","content":"Dividi lo stufato in 8 porzioni con quantità simili di fagioli, carni e brodo. Puoi accompagnare con riso, arancia o farofa, esclusi da ingredienti e nutrizione. Per conservare dividi subito gli avanzi in piccoli contenitori bassi e refrigera a 4 °C o meno entro 2 ore, o 1 ora se l’ambiente supera 32 °C; non aspettare che la pentola grande si raffreddi interamente fuori. Consuma in 3–4 giorni o congela porzioni; 2 mesi è un limite di qualità proposto. Scongela in frigorifero e riscalda mescolando fino ad almeno 74 °C in più punti.","image_url":"/recetas/receta-de-feijoada/paso-08.webp","image_alt":"Feijoada casalinga con fagioli neri e maiale: Porziona e raffredda rapidamente"}],"notes":"Usa fagioli neri secchi; non sostituirli con fagioli già cotti mantenendo queste quantità e tempi. Questa versione non contiene carne essiccata, orecchio o piedino di maiale; aggiungerli richiede un altro procedimento e calcolo nutrizionale. La salsiccia deve risultare completamente cotta dalla confezione: affumicata non significa sempre cotta. Va bene linguiça cotta o salsiccia di maiale affumicata equivalente; marca e prodotto cambiano gusto e sodio. La spalla fresca non si dissala. Diluisci con acqua bollente e addensa schiacciando fagioli cotti anziché aggiungere farina. Non unire ingredienti acidi prima che i fagioli siano teneri. Il riposo fuori dal fuoco non sostituisce la rapida refrigerazione degli avanzi.","nutrition":{"calories":507.4,"protein_g":28.0,"carbs_g":42.5,"fat_g":25.3,"saturated_fat_g":8.1,"fiber_g":10.2,"sugar_g":2.7,"sodium_mg":596.0,"estimated":true,"source":"USDA FoodData Central — SR Legacy (abril de 2018)","source_url":"https://fdc.nal.usda.gov/download-datasets/","inputs":[{"ingredient":"Fagioli neri secchi","edible_grams":500,"fdc_id":173734,"fdc_description":"Beans, black, mature seeds, raw","per_100g":{"fiber_g":15.5,"carbs_g":62.36,"calories":341.0,"sugar_g":2.12,"protein_g":21.6,"sodium_mg":5.0,"saturated_fat_g":0.366,"fat_g":1.42},"source_url":"https://fdc.nal.usda.gov/food-details/173734/nutrients"},{"ingredient":"Spalla di maiale fresca disossata","edible_grams":400,"fdc_id":167843,"fdc_description":"Pork, fresh, shoulder, whole, separable lean and fat, raw","per_100g":{"sugar_g":0.0,"fat_g":17.99,"carbs_g":0.0,"calories":236.0,"saturated_fat_g":6.24,"fiber_g":0.0,"sodium_mg":65.0,"protein_g":17.18},"source_url":"https://fdc.nal.usda.gov/food-details/167843/nutrients"},{"ingredient":"Salsiccia di maiale affumicata completamente cotta","edible_grams":250,"fdc_id":174584,"fdc_description":"Sausage, smoked link sausage, pork","per_100g":{"sugar_g":0.94,"fat_g":28.23,"fiber_g":0.0,"sodium_mg":827.0,"protein_g":11.98,"saturated_fat_g":9.313,"carbs_g":0.94,"calories":309.0},"source_url":"https://fdc.nal.usda.gov/food-details/174584/nutrients"},{"ingredient":"Pancetta cruda","edible_grams":100,"fdc_id":168277,"fdc_description":"Pork, cured, bacon, unprepared","per_100g":{"protein_g":13.66,"sodium_mg":751.0,"saturated_fat_g":12.615,"fat_g":37.13,"carbs_g":0.0,"calories":393.0,"sugar_g":0.35,"fiber_g":0.0},"source_url":"https://fdc.nal.usda.gov/food-details/168277/nutrients"},{"ingredient":"Cipolla","edible_grams":200,"fdc_id":170000,"fdc_description":"Onions, raw","per_100g":{"sugar_g":4.24,"fat_g":0.1,"carbs_g":9.34,"calories":40.0,"saturated_fat_g":0.042,"protein_g":1.1,"fiber_g":1.7,"sodium_mg":4.0},"source_url":"https://fdc.nal.usda.gov/food-details/170000/nutrients"},{"ingredient":"Aglio","edible_grams":20,"fdc_id":169230,"fdc_description":"Garlic, raw","per_100g":{"carbs_g":33.06,"calories":149.0,"sugar_g":1.0,"saturated_fat_g":0.089,"fiber_g":2.1,"sodium_mg":17.0,"protein_g":6.36,"fat_g":0.5},"source_url":"https://fdc.nal.usda.gov/food-details/169230/nutrients"},{"ingredient":"Olio d’oliva","edible_grams":15,"fdc_id":171413,"fdc_description":"Oil, olive, salad or cooking","per_100g":{"fat_g":100.0,"carbs_g":0.0,"calories":884.0,"sodium_mg":2.0,"protein_g":0.0,"saturated_fat_g":13.808,"fiber_g":0.0,"sugar_g":0.0},"source_url":"https://fdc.nal.usda.gov/food-details/171413/nutrients"},{"ingredient":"Sale","edible_grams":4,"fdc_id":173468,"fdc_description":"Salt, table","per_100g":{"fiber_g":0.0,"sodium_mg":38758.0,"saturated_fat_g":0.0,"protein_g":0.0,"fat_g":0.0,"carbs_g":0.0,"calories":0.0,"sugar_g":0.0},"source_url":"https://fdc.nal.usda.gov/food-details/173468/nutrients"},{"ingredient":"Pepe nero","edible_grams":1,"fdc_id":170931,"fdc_description":"Spices, pepper, black","per_100g":{"fat_g":3.26,"sugar_g":0.64,"carbs_g":63.95,"calories":251.0,"protein_g":10.39,"fiber_g":25.3,"sodium_mg":20.0,"saturated_fat_g":1.392},"source_url":"https://fdc.nal.usda.gov/food-details/170931/nutrients"},{"ingredient":"Acqua di cottura","edible_grams":2500,"fdc_id":173647,"fdc_description":"Beverages, water, tap, drinking","per_100g":{"fat_g":0.0,"carbs_g":0.0,"calories":0.0,"protein_g":0.0,"fiber_g":0.0,"sodium_mg":4.0,"sugar_g":0.0,"saturated_fat_g":0.0},"source_url":"https://fdc.nal.usda.gov/food-details/173647/nutrients"}],"serving_size":"1 di 8 porzioni di stufato, senza accompagnamenti","method":"Dieci schede USDA verificate, pesi crudi edibili di fagioli, maiale e pancetta e peso della salsiccia già cotta; somma divisa per 8. La salsiccia affumicata è approssimata con una scheda generica di salsiccia di maiale affumicata, non una scheda specifica di linguiça brasiliana. Sono conteggiati tutto il grasso e il brodo trattenuto. Alloro tolto e acqua d’ammollo gettata esclusi.","note":"Stima informativa, non analisi dello stufato finito. Marca e sale degli insaccati, ammollo, resa e distribuzione del brodo cambiano i valori. Riso, arancia, farofa e verdure di accompagnamento esclusi."},"keywords":["feijoada casalinga","feijoada fagioli neri","stufato di maiale e fagioli neri"],"image_url":"/recetas/receta-de-feijoada/portada.webp","gallery":[{"url":"/recetas/receta-de-feijoada/portada.webp","alt":"Feijoada di fagioli neri con maiale, pancetta e rondelle di salsiccia affumicata in brodo scuro"}],"seo":{"title":"Feijoada casalinga con fagioli neri e maiale","description":"Feijoada casalinga per 8 con fagioli neri, maiale, pancetta e salsiccia affumicata: ammollo, bollitura iniziale, cottura lenta e conservazione.","image_alt":"Feijoada di fagioli neri con maiale, pancetta e rondelle di salsiccia affumicata in brodo scuro","image_variants":["/recetas/receta-de-feijoada/portada-1x1.webp","/recetas/receta-de-feijoada/portada-4x3.webp","/recetas/receta-de-feijoada/portada-16x9.webp"],"faq":[{"q":"Posso saltare l’ammollo?","a":"La proposta parte da 8 ore di ammollo refrigerato e acqua nuova per cuocere. Non viene fornito un tempo equivalente senza ammollo; il procedimento cambia e resta necessaria la bollitura iniziale di 30 minuti."},{"q":"Perché i fagioli rimangono duri?","a":"Fagioli vecchi, acqua dura o ingredienti acidi aggiunti presto possono allungare la cottura. Mantieni acqua calda sufficiente e cuoci finché non resta un nucleo duro; sala alla fine come previsto."},{"q":"Come addenso senza farina?","a":"Schiaccia un mestolo di fagioli teneri senza carne e rimettilo nello stufato. Cuoci dolcemente altri 15 minuti mescolando; aggiungi acqua bollente se troppo denso."}]},"published":false,"editorial_status":"draft","content_html":"<p>Questa feijoada casalinga unisce fagioli neri, spalla di maiale fresca, pancetta e salsiccia affumicata completamente cotta in un brodo scuro addensato con parte degli stessi fagioli. È un adattamento con ingredienti ben identificati, senza carni salate da dissalare; non rappresenta tutte le varianti brasiliane.</p><p>La proposta rende 8 porzioni di stufato. I 680 minuti stimati comprendono 8 ore di ammollo in frigorifero, 30 minuti di preparazione, 160 di cottura e 10 di riposo. Il soffritto si prepara mentre bollono i fagioli. Quantità, resa e tempi attendono conferma con una prova in cucina; contano morbidezza e temperatura, non solo l’orologio.</p>"},{"id":"89b6a72f-9e0e-515e-9528-07ed6432eb74","recipe_group_id":"592ace5b-ac32-4d7d-91f4-09002a1456aa","slug":"feijoada","public_path":"/ja/feijoada","source_url":null,"language":"ja","title":"黒豆と豚肉の家庭風フェイジョアーダ","excerpt":"黒豆、豚肉、ベーコン、燻製ソーセージで作る8人分の家庭風フェイジョアーダ。浸水、沸騰、煮込み、保存まで順に紹介します。","summary":"この家庭風フェイジョアーダは、黒豆、生の豚肩肉、ベーコン、十分に加熱済みの燻製ソーセージを使い、豆の一部をつぶして黒い煮汁にとろみをつけます。材料を明確にした家庭向けのアレンジで、塩抜きが必要な肉は使いません。ブラジルのすべての作り方を代表するものではありません。\n\n煮込み8人分を想定しています。推定680分の内訳は冷蔵庫での浸水8時間、準備30分、調理160分、休ませる時間10分です。炒める工程は豆を沸騰させている間に行います。分量、出来上がり量、時間は調理試作による確認前の目安で、時計だけでなく柔らかさと温度を確かめます。","category":"主菜","category_slug":"platos-principales","difficulty":"中級","course":"主菜","cuisine":"ブラジル料理の家庭向けアレンジ","prep_time_minutes":30,"cook_time_minutes":160,"total_time_minutes":680,"servings":8,"ingredients":[{"name":"乾燥黒豆","amount":"500","unit":"g","group":"豆と煮込み用"},{"name":"生の骨なし豚肩肉","amount":"400","unit":"g","group":"肉類"},{"name":"十分に加熱済みの豚肉の燻製ソーセージ","amount":"250","unit":"g","group":"肉類"},{"name":"未加熱のベーコン","amount":"100","unit":"g","group":"肉類"},{"name":"玉ねぎ","amount":"200","unit":"g","group":"香味野菜と調味料"},{"name":"にんにく","amount":"20","unit":"g","group":"香味野菜と調味料"},{"name":"オリーブオイル","amount":"15","unit":"g","group":"香味野菜と調味料"},{"name":"塩","amount":"4","unit":"g","group":"香味野菜と調味料"},{"name":"黒こしょう","amount":"1","unit":"g","group":"香味野菜と調味料"},{"name":"煮込み用の水","amount":"2500","unit":"ml","group":"豆と煮込み用"},{"name":"乾燥ローリエ、最後に取り除く","amount":"2","unit":"枚","group":"香味野菜と調味料"}],"steps":[{"title":"豆を冷蔵庫で浸水する","content":"乾燥黒豆500 gを確認して小石や傷んだ豆を除き、すすぎます。大きめの容器に入れ、水約1.5リットルで豆の上数cmまで覆います。ふたをして4 °C以下の冷蔵庫で8時間浸し、水が吸収されたら足します。終わったら浸水した水をすべて捨ててすすぎます。この水は煮込み用の2.5リットルとは別です。","image_url":"/recetas/receta-de-feijoada/paso-01.webp","image_alt":"黒豆と豚肉の家庭風フェイジョアーダ: 豆を冷蔵庫で浸水する"},{"title":"材料を準備して生肉を分ける","content":"清潔な野菜用まな板で玉ねぎ200 gとにんにく20 gをみじん切りにします。別の生肉用まな板で、生の骨なし豚肩肉400 gを約3 cm角、ベーコン100 gを短い細切りにします。ソーセージ250 gは厚さ1 cmの輪切りにします。表示が十分に加熱済みの製品を使い、生ソーセージや塩抜きが必要な肉は使いません。肉は調理まで冷蔵し、生の豚肉に触れた後は手と器具を洗います。","image_url":"/recetas/receta-de-feijoada/paso-02.webp","image_alt":"黒豆と豚肉の家庭風フェイジョアーダ: 材料を準備して生肉を分ける"},{"title":"火を弱める前に豆を沸騰させる","content":"水を切った豆を容量6リットル以上の鍋に入れ、新しい水2.5リットルとローリエ2枚を加えます。目安約15分で沸騰させ、泡や吹きこぼれを確認できるようふたをせず、はっきり沸騰した状態を少なくとも30分保ちます。泡はスプーンで取り、豆が水面に出たら熱湯を足します。生の豆や硬い豆を味見しないでください。この工程をスロークッカーに置き換えません。","image_url":"/recetas/receta-de-feijoada/paso-03.webp","image_alt":"黒豆と豚肉の家庭風フェイジョアーダ: 火を弱める前に豆を沸騰させる"},{"title":"肉と香味野菜を炒める","content":"豆を沸騰させている間に、広いフライパンにオイル15 gを入れて中火で温めます。ベーコンを混ぜながら約5分、色づき始めるまで炒めます。豚肉を2回に分けて各約4分、表面だけ焼きつけます。中心までの加熱は煮込みで仕上げます。肉を専用の皿に取り出し、同じフライパンで玉ねぎ7分、にんにく1分、ソーセージ4分の順に炒めます。脂も含めすべて残します。栄養推定にはその脂を全量計上しています。","image_url":"/recetas/receta-de-feijoada/paso-04.webp","image_alt":"黒豆と豚肉の家庭風フェイジョアーダ: 肉と香味野菜を炒める"},{"title":"柔らかくなるまで煮込む","content":"豆を30分沸騰させた後、肉、ソーセージ、炒めた野菜、フライパンの汁を鍋に加えます。フライパンに少量の熱い煮汁を入れてこそげ取ります。黒こしょう1 gを加え、塩は最後まで加えません。再び穏やかに沸かし、ふたを少し開けて約100分煮込み、15–20分おきに底から混ぜます。豆と肉がかろうじて覆われる水位を保ち、必要なら熱湯を100 mlずつ足します。焦げつきや、豆が全部崩れるほど強い沸騰を避けます。","image_url":"/recetas/receta-de-feijoada/paso-05.webp","image_alt":"黒豆と豚肉の家庭風フェイジョアーダ: 柔らかくなるまで煮込む"},{"title":"温度と柔らかさを確認する","content":"清潔な食品用温度計で複数の豚肉の角切りの中心を測ります。この煮込みでは実用上の目標を少なくとも74 °Cとし、塊肉の最低基準より高く設定しています。さらに肉がフォークで押すと容易にほぐれ、スプーンで取り出した豆が芯までなめらかで硬い中心がないことを確認します。硬さや温度が足りなければ煮込みを延長し、再確認します。時間は提案であり保証ではありません。生肉に触れた器具で味見しないでください。","image_url":"/recetas/receta-de-feijoada/paso-06.webp","image_alt":"黒豆と豚肉の家庭風フェイジョアーダ: 温度と柔らかさを確認する"},{"title":"とろみをつけて味を調え休ませる","content":"肉を含まない柔らかい豆をお玉1杯取り、ボウルでつぶして鍋に戻します。混ぜながら弱火で約15分さらに煮て、スプーンの背を薄く覆う濃さにします。濃すぎたら熱湯を足します。ローリエ2枚を取り除きます。ここで初めて味見して、予定の塩4 gを加えます。加工肉の塩味で十分なら減らしますが、推定ナトリウム量も変わります。火を止めてふたをし、10分休ませます。","image_url":"/recetas/receta-de-feijoada/paso-07.webp","image_alt":"黒豆と豚肉の家庭風フェイジョアーダ: とろみをつけて味を調え休ませる"},{"title":"分けて速やかに冷蔵する","content":"豆、肉、煮汁が同じくらいずつになるよう8人分に分けます。ご飯、オレンジ、ファロファを添えてもよいですが、材料や栄養値には含めていません。保存する分は速やかに小さく浅い容器に分け、2時間以内、室温が32 °Cを超える場合は1時間以内に4 °C以下で冷蔵します。大鍋全体が室温で冷めるまで待ちません。3–4日以内に食べるか、小分けで冷凍します。2か月は品質面での提案です。冷蔵庫で解凍し、混ぜながら複数箇所で少なくとも74 °Cに達するまで再加熱します。","image_url":"/recetas/receta-de-feijoada/paso-08.webp","image_alt":"黒豆と豚肉の家庭風フェイジョアーダ: 分けて速やかに冷蔵する"}],"notes":"乾燥黒豆を使います。煮豆への置き換えで同じ分量と時間は使えません。この版には干し肉、豚耳、豚足を含みません。加える場合は別の手順と栄養計算が必要です。ソーセージは表示が十分に加熱済みのものを選びます。燻製というだけでは加熱済みとは限りません。加熱済みリングイッサまたは同等の豚肉の燻製ソーセージを使えますが、製品により味とナトリウム量が変わります。生の豚肩肉は塩抜きしません。さらりとさせるには熱湯、とろみには小麦粉でなく柔らかい豆をつぶして使います。豆が柔らかくなるまで酸味のある材料を加えません。火を止めて休ませても、残りを速やかに冷蔵する必要は変わりません。","nutrition":{"calories":507.4,"protein_g":28.0,"carbs_g":42.5,"fat_g":25.3,"saturated_fat_g":8.1,"fiber_g":10.2,"sugar_g":2.7,"sodium_mg":596.0,"estimated":true,"source":"USDA FoodData Central — SR Legacy (abril de 2018)","source_url":"https://fdc.nal.usda.gov/download-datasets/","inputs":[{"ingredient":"乾燥黒豆","edible_grams":500,"fdc_id":173734,"fdc_description":"Beans, black, mature seeds, raw","per_100g":{"fiber_g":15.5,"carbs_g":62.36,"calories":341.0,"sugar_g":2.12,"protein_g":21.6,"sodium_mg":5.0,"saturated_fat_g":0.366,"fat_g":1.42},"source_url":"https://fdc.nal.usda.gov/food-details/173734/nutrients"},{"ingredient":"生の骨なし豚肩肉","edible_grams":400,"fdc_id":167843,"fdc_description":"Pork, fresh, shoulder, whole, separable lean and fat, raw","per_100g":{"sugar_g":0.0,"fat_g":17.99,"carbs_g":0.0,"calories":236.0,"saturated_fat_g":6.24,"fiber_g":0.0,"sodium_mg":65.0,"protein_g":17.18},"source_url":"https://fdc.nal.usda.gov/food-details/167843/nutrients"},{"ingredient":"十分に加熱済みの豚肉の燻製ソーセージ","edible_grams":250,"fdc_id":174584,"fdc_description":"Sausage, smoked link sausage, pork","per_100g":{"sugar_g":0.94,"fat_g":28.23,"fiber_g":0.0,"sodium_mg":827.0,"protein_g":11.98,"saturated_fat_g":9.313,"carbs_g":0.94,"calories":309.0},"source_url":"https://fdc.nal.usda.gov/food-details/174584/nutrients"},{"ingredient":"未加熱のベーコン","edible_grams":100,"fdc_id":168277,"fdc_description":"Pork, cured, bacon, unprepared","per_100g":{"protein_g":13.66,"sodium_mg":751.0,"saturated_fat_g":12.615,"fat_g":37.13,"carbs_g":0.0,"calories":393.0,"sugar_g":0.35,"fiber_g":0.0},"source_url":"https://fdc.nal.usda.gov/food-details/168277/nutrients"},{"ingredient":"玉ねぎ","edible_grams":200,"fdc_id":170000,"fdc_description":"Onions, raw","per_100g":{"sugar_g":4.24,"fat_g":0.1,"carbs_g":9.34,"calories":40.0,"saturated_fat_g":0.042,"protein_g":1.1,"fiber_g":1.7,"sodium_mg":4.0},"source_url":"https://fdc.nal.usda.gov/food-details/170000/nutrients"},{"ingredient":"にんにく","edible_grams":20,"fdc_id":169230,"fdc_description":"Garlic, raw","per_100g":{"carbs_g":33.06,"calories":149.0,"sugar_g":1.0,"saturated_fat_g":0.089,"fiber_g":2.1,"sodium_mg":17.0,"protein_g":6.36,"fat_g":0.5},"source_url":"https://fdc.nal.usda.gov/food-details/169230/nutrients"},{"ingredient":"オリーブオイル","edible_grams":15,"fdc_id":171413,"fdc_description":"Oil, olive, salad or cooking","per_100g":{"fat_g":100.0,"carbs_g":0.0,"calories":884.0,"sodium_mg":2.0,"protein_g":0.0,"saturated_fat_g":13.808,"fiber_g":0.0,"sugar_g":0.0},"source_url":"https://fdc.nal.usda.gov/food-details/171413/nutrients"},{"ingredient":"塩","edible_grams":4,"fdc_id":173468,"fdc_description":"Salt, table","per_100g":{"fiber_g":0.0,"sodium_mg":38758.0,"saturated_fat_g":0.0,"protein_g":0.0,"fat_g":0.0,"carbs_g":0.0,"calories":0.0,"sugar_g":0.0},"source_url":"https://fdc.nal.usda.gov/food-details/173468/nutrients"},{"ingredient":"黒こしょう","edible_grams":1,"fdc_id":170931,"fdc_description":"Spices, pepper, black","per_100g":{"fat_g":3.26,"sugar_g":0.64,"carbs_g":63.95,"calories":251.0,"protein_g":10.39,"fiber_g":25.3,"sodium_mg":20.0,"saturated_fat_g":1.392},"source_url":"https://fdc.nal.usda.gov/food-details/170931/nutrients"},{"ingredient":"煮込み用の水","edible_grams":2500,"fdc_id":173647,"fdc_description":"Beverages, water, tap, drinking","per_100g":{"fat_g":0.0,"carbs_g":0.0,"calories":0.0,"protein_g":0.0,"fiber_g":0.0,"sodium_mg":4.0,"sugar_g":0.0,"saturated_fat_g":0.0},"source_url":"https://fdc.nal.usda.gov/food-details/173647/nutrients"}],"serving_size":"煮込み8人分のうち1人分、付け合わせなし","method":"確認済みUSDA資料10件を使用し、豆、豚肉、ベーコンは生の可食重量、ソーセージは加熱済みの重量で計算して合計を8で割っています。燻製ソーセージは一般的な豚肉の燻製ソーセージの資料で近似し、ブラジルのリングイッサ専用資料ではありません。脂と残る煮汁は全量計上し、取り除くローリエと捨てる浸水の水は除外しています。","note":"情報用の推定で、出来上がりの分析値ではありません。加工肉の製品と塩分、浸水、出来上がり量、煮汁の分配により変わります。ご飯、オレンジ、ファロファ、野菜の付け合わせは除外しています。"},"keywords":["家庭風フェイジョアーダ","黒豆のフェイジョアーダ","豚肉と黒豆の煮込み"],"image_url":"/recetas/receta-de-feijoada/portada.webp","gallery":[{"url":"/recetas/receta-de-feijoada/portada.webp","alt":"黒豆、豚肉、ベーコン、燻製ソーセージを黒い煮汁で煮たフェイジョアーダ"}],"seo":{"title":"黒豆と豚肉の家庭風フェイジョアーダ","description":"黒豆、豚肉、ベーコン、燻製ソーセージで作る8人分の家庭風フェイジョアーダ。浸水、沸騰、煮込み、保存まで順に紹介します。","image_alt":"黒豆、豚肉、ベーコン、燻製ソーセージを黒い煮汁で煮たフェイジョアーダ","image_variants":["/recetas/receta-de-feijoada/portada-1x1.webp","/recetas/receta-de-feijoada/portada-4x3.webp","/recetas/receta-de-feijoada/portada-16x9.webp"],"faq":[{"q":"浸水を省略できますか？","a":"この提案は冷蔵庫での浸水8時間と、新しい煮込み用の水を前提とします。浸水なしの同等の時間は示していません。工程が変わり、最初の沸騰30分も省略できません。"},{"q":"豆が硬いままなのはなぜですか？","a":"古い豆、硬水、酸味のある材料を早く加えることなどで時間が延びる場合があります。十分な湯を保ち、硬い芯がなくなるまで煮ます。予定の塩は最後に加えます。"},{"q":"小麦粉なしでとろみをつけるには？","a":"肉を含まない柔らかい豆をお玉1杯つぶして鍋に戻します。混ぜながら弱火でさらに15分煮て、濃すぎる場合は熱湯を足します。"}]},"published":false,"editorial_status":"draft","content_html":"<p>この家庭風フェイジョアーダは、黒豆、生の豚肩肉、ベーコン、十分に加熱済みの燻製ソーセージを使い、豆の一部をつぶして黒い煮汁にとろみをつけます。材料を明確にした家庭向けのアレンジで、塩抜きが必要な肉は使いません。ブラジルのすべての作り方を代表するものではありません。</p><p>煮込み8人分を想定しています。推定680分の内訳は冷蔵庫での浸水8時間、準備30分、調理160分、休ませる時間10分です。炒める工程は豆を沸騰させている間に行います。分量、出来上がり量、時間は調理試作による確認前の目安で、時計だけでなく柔らかさと温度を確かめます。</p>"},{"id":"42ef5493-770b-5136-975d-dbc15c2ccbd0","recipe_group_id":"592ace5b-ac32-4d7d-91f4-09002a1456aa","slug":"feijoada","public_path":"/pt/feijoada","source_url":null,"language":"pt","title":"Feijoada caseira de feijão preto e porco","excerpt":"Feijoada caseira para 8 com feijão preto, porco, bacon e linguiça defumada: molho, fervura inicial, cozimento lento e conservação passo a passo.","summary":"Esta proposta de feijoada caseira combina feijão preto, paleta suína fresca, bacon e linguiça defumada completamente cozida em um caldo escuro engrossado com parte do próprio feijão. É uma adaptação com ingredientes fáceis de identificar, sem carnes salgadas que precisem de dessalga; não pretende representar todas as versões brasileiras.\n\nRende 8 porções de feijoada. Os 680 minutos estimados incluem 8 horas de molho na geladeira, 30 minutos de preparo, 160 de cozimento e 10 de descanso. O refogado é feito enquanto o feijão ferve. Quantidades, rendimento e tempos aguardam confirmação por teste de cozinha; a maciez e a temperatura importam mais que o relógio.","category":"Pratos principais","category_slug":"platos-principales","difficulty":"Média","course":"Prato principal","cuisine":"Brasileira, adaptação caseira","prep_time_minutes":30,"cook_time_minutes":160,"total_time_minutes":680,"servings":8,"ingredients":[{"name":"Feijão preto seco","amount":"500","unit":"g","group":"Feijão e cozimento"},{"name":"Paleta suína fresca sem osso","amount":"400","unit":"g","group":"Carnes"},{"name":"Linguiça suína defumada completamente cozida","amount":"250","unit":"g","group":"Carnes"},{"name":"Bacon cru","amount":"100","unit":"g","group":"Carnes"},{"name":"Cebola","amount":"200","unit":"g","group":"Refogado e temperos"},{"name":"Alho","amount":"20","unit":"g","group":"Refogado e temperos"},{"name":"Azeite de oliva","amount":"15","unit":"g","group":"Refogado e temperos"},{"name":"Sal","amount":"4","unit":"g","group":"Refogado e temperos"},{"name":"Pimenta-do-reino","amount":"1","unit":"g","group":"Refogado e temperos"},{"name":"Água para cozinhar","amount":"2500","unit":"ml","group":"Feijão e cozimento"},{"name":"Louro seco, para retirar","amount":"2","unit":"folhas","group":"Refogado e temperos"}],"steps":[{"title":"Deixe o feijão de molho na geladeira","content":"Escolha os 500 g de feijão preto seco, retire pedrinhas ou grãos danificados e enxágue. Coloque em um recipiente grande com cerca de 1,5 litro de água, cobrindo por vários centímetros. Tampe e deixe de molho 8 horas na geladeira a 4 °C ou menos; acrescente água se for absorvida. No fim descarte toda a água do molho e enxágue. Essa água é adicional aos 2,5 litros usados no cozimento.","image_url":"/recetas/receta-de-feijoada/paso-01.webp","image_alt":"Feijoada caseira de feijão preto e porco: Deixe o feijão de molho na geladeira"},{"title":"Prepare os ingredientes e separe a carne crua","content":"Pique os 200 g de cebola e os 20 g de alho em uma tábua limpa para vegetais. Em outra tábua para carne crua, corte os 400 g de paleta fresca sem osso em cubos de cerca de 3 cm e os 100 g de bacon em tiras curtas. Corte os 250 g de linguiça em rodelas de 1 cm; use um produto cuja embalagem indique que está completamente cozido, não linguiça fresca nem carne salgada que precise de dessalga. Mantenha as carnes refrigeradas até cozinhar e lave mãos e utensílios depois de tocar carne suína crua.","image_url":"/recetas/receta-de-feijoada/paso-02.webp","image_alt":"Feijoada caseira de feijão preto e porco: Prepare os ingredientes e separe a carne crua"},{"title":"Ferva o feijão antes de baixar o fogo","content":"Coloque o feijão escorrido em uma panela de pelo menos 6 litros com os 2,5 litros de água nova e as 2 folhas de louro. Leve à fervura, cerca de 15 minutos como referência, e mantenha fervura evidente por pelo menos 30 minutos sem tampa, controlando espuma e transbordamento. Retire a espuma com uma colher; acrescente água fervente se os grãos deixarem de ficar cobertos. Não prove feijão cru ou duro e não substitua esta etapa por uma panela de cozimento lento.","image_url":"/recetas/receta-de-feijoada/paso-03.webp","image_alt":"Feijoada caseira de feijão preto e porco: Ferva o feijão antes de baixar o fogo"},{"title":"Doure as carnes e o refogado","content":"Durante a fervura, aqueça uma frigideira larga em fogo médio com os 15 g de azeite. Cozinhe o bacon por cerca de 5 minutos, mexendo, até começar a dourar. Acrescente o porco em duas levas, cerca de 4 minutos cada, apenas para dourar a superfície; ele terminará de cozinhar na feijoada. Retire as carnes para um prato reservado para isso. Na mesma frigideira refogue a cebola 7 minutos, o alho 1 minuto e a linguiça 4 minutos. Reserve tudo, inclusive a gordura: a estimativa nutricional a conta por inteiro.","image_url":"/recetas/receta-de-feijoada/paso-04.webp","image_alt":"Feijoada caseira de feijão preto e porco: Doure as carnes e o refogado"},{"title":"Cozinhe até ficar macio","content":"Depois dos 30 minutos de fervura, acrescente carnes, linguiça, refogado e líquidos da frigideira à panela, raspando a frigideira com um pouco de caldo quente. Adicione 1 g de pimenta e deixe o sal para o fim. Retome fervura suave e cozinhe por cerca de 100 minutos com a tampa entreaberta, mexendo desde o fundo a cada 15–20 minutos. Mantenha feijão e carnes apenas cobertos, acrescentando água fervente de 100 em 100 ml se necessário. Evite que grudem ou que uma fervura forte desfaça todos os grãos.","image_url":"/recetas/receta-de-feijoada/paso-05.webp","image_alt":"Feijoada caseira de feijão preto e porco: Cozinhe até ficar macio"},{"title":"Confira a temperatura e a textura","content":"Com um termômetro limpo meça o centro de vários cubos de porco: o objetivo prático desta feijoada é pelo menos 74 °C, acima do mínimo para cortes inteiros. A carne também deve ceder facilmente à pressão de um garfo, e um grão retirado com colher deve ficar cremoso por dentro, sem miolo duro. Se algo continuar firme ou abaixo da temperatura, cozinhe mais e confira novamente; os tempos são uma proposta, não uma garantia. Não prove com utensílios que tocaram carne crua.","image_url":"/recetas/receta-de-feijoada/paso-06.webp","image_alt":"Feijoada caseira de feijão preto e porco: Confira a temperatura e a textura"},{"title":"Engrosse, ajuste o sal e deixe descansar","content":"Retire uma concha de feijão macio sem carne, amasse em uma tigela e devolva a pasta à panela. Cozinhe suavemente por mais cerca de 15 minutos, mexendo, até o caldo cobrir levemente as costas de uma colher; acrescente água fervente se ficar espesso demais. Retire as 2 folhas de louro. Prove só agora e acrescente os 4 g de sal previstos, ou menos se os embutidos já salgarem bastante; menos sal muda a estimativa de sódio. Desligue e deixe descansar 10 minutos com a panela tampada.","image_url":"/recetas/receta-de-feijoada/paso-07.webp","image_alt":"Feijoada caseira de feijão preto e porco: Engrosse, ajuste o sal e deixe descansar"},{"title":"Divida e refrigere rapidamente","content":"Divida em 8 porções com quantidades parecidas de feijão, carnes e caldo. Arroz, laranja ou farofa podem acompanhar, mas não entram nos ingredientes nem na nutrição. Para guardar, divida logo as sobras em recipientes pequenos e rasos e refrigere a 4 °C ou menos em até 2 horas, ou 1 hora se o ambiente passar de 32 °C; não espere a panela grande inteira esfriar fora da geladeira. Consuma em 3–4 dias ou congele porções; 2 meses é uma proposta de qualidade. Descongele na geladeira e reaqueça mexendo até pelo menos 74 °C em vários pontos.","image_url":"/recetas/receta-de-feijoada/paso-08.webp","image_alt":"Feijoada caseira de feijão preto e porco: Divida e refrigere rapidamente"}],"notes":"Use feijão preto seco; não troque por feijão já cozido mantendo estes tempos e quantidades. Esta versão não leva carne seca, orelha nem pé de porco; incluí-los exige outro preparo e cálculo nutricional. A linguiça precisa estar completamente cozida conforme a embalagem: defumada nem sempre significa cozida. Pode ser linguiça cozida ou embutido suíno defumado equivalente; a marca muda o sabor e o sódio. A paleta fresca não precisa de dessalga. Para afinar o caldo acrescente água fervente; para engrossar amasse feijão já cozido em vez de usar farinha. Não acrescente ingredientes ácidos antes de o feijão ficar macio. O descanso fora do fogo não substitui a refrigeração rápida das sobras.","nutrition":{"calories":507.4,"protein_g":28.0,"carbs_g":42.5,"fat_g":25.3,"saturated_fat_g":8.1,"fiber_g":10.2,"sugar_g":2.7,"sodium_mg":596.0,"estimated":true,"source":"USDA FoodData Central — SR Legacy (abril de 2018)","source_url":"https://fdc.nal.usda.gov/download-datasets/","inputs":[{"ingredient":"Feijão preto seco","edible_grams":500,"fdc_id":173734,"fdc_description":"Beans, black, mature seeds, raw","per_100g":{"fiber_g":15.5,"carbs_g":62.36,"calories":341.0,"sugar_g":2.12,"protein_g":21.6,"sodium_mg":5.0,"saturated_fat_g":0.366,"fat_g":1.42},"source_url":"https://fdc.nal.usda.gov/food-details/173734/nutrients"},{"ingredient":"Paleta suína fresca sem osso","edible_grams":400,"fdc_id":167843,"fdc_description":"Pork, fresh, shoulder, whole, separable lean and fat, raw","per_100g":{"sugar_g":0.0,"fat_g":17.99,"carbs_g":0.0,"calories":236.0,"saturated_fat_g":6.24,"fiber_g":0.0,"sodium_mg":65.0,"protein_g":17.18},"source_url":"https://fdc.nal.usda.gov/food-details/167843/nutrients"},{"ingredient":"Linguiça suína defumada completamente cozida","edible_grams":250,"fdc_id":174584,"fdc_description":"Sausage, smoked link sausage, pork","per_100g":{"sugar_g":0.94,"fat_g":28.23,"fiber_g":0.0,"sodium_mg":827.0,"protein_g":11.98,"saturated_fat_g":9.313,"carbs_g":0.94,"calories":309.0},"source_url":"https://fdc.nal.usda.gov/food-details/174584/nutrients"},{"ingredient":"Bacon cru","edible_grams":100,"fdc_id":168277,"fdc_description":"Pork, cured, bacon, unprepared","per_100g":{"protein_g":13.66,"sodium_mg":751.0,"saturated_fat_g":12.615,"fat_g":37.13,"carbs_g":0.0,"calories":393.0,"sugar_g":0.35,"fiber_g":0.0},"source_url":"https://fdc.nal.usda.gov/food-details/168277/nutrients"},{"ingredient":"Cebola","edible_grams":200,"fdc_id":170000,"fdc_description":"Onions, raw","per_100g":{"sugar_g":4.24,"fat_g":0.1,"carbs_g":9.34,"calories":40.0,"saturated_fat_g":0.042,"protein_g":1.1,"fiber_g":1.7,"sodium_mg":4.0},"source_url":"https://fdc.nal.usda.gov/food-details/170000/nutrients"},{"ingredient":"Alho","edible_grams":20,"fdc_id":169230,"fdc_description":"Garlic, raw","per_100g":{"carbs_g":33.06,"calories":149.0,"sugar_g":1.0,"saturated_fat_g":0.089,"fiber_g":2.1,"sodium_mg":17.0,"protein_g":6.36,"fat_g":0.5},"source_url":"https://fdc.nal.usda.gov/food-details/169230/nutrients"},{"ingredient":"Azeite de oliva","edible_grams":15,"fdc_id":171413,"fdc_description":"Oil, olive, salad or cooking","per_100g":{"fat_g":100.0,"carbs_g":0.0,"calories":884.0,"sodium_mg":2.0,"protein_g":0.0,"saturated_fat_g":13.808,"fiber_g":0.0,"sugar_g":0.0},"source_url":"https://fdc.nal.usda.gov/food-details/171413/nutrients"},{"ingredient":"Sal","edible_grams":4,"fdc_id":173468,"fdc_description":"Salt, table","per_100g":{"fiber_g":0.0,"sodium_mg":38758.0,"saturated_fat_g":0.0,"protein_g":0.0,"fat_g":0.0,"carbs_g":0.0,"calories":0.0,"sugar_g":0.0},"source_url":"https://fdc.nal.usda.gov/food-details/173468/nutrients"},{"ingredient":"Pimenta-do-reino","edible_grams":1,"fdc_id":170931,"fdc_description":"Spices, pepper, black","per_100g":{"fat_g":3.26,"sugar_g":0.64,"carbs_g":63.95,"calories":251.0,"protein_g":10.39,"fiber_g":25.3,"sodium_mg":20.0,"saturated_fat_g":1.392},"source_url":"https://fdc.nal.usda.gov/food-details/170931/nutrients"},{"ingredient":"Água para cozinhar","edible_grams":2500,"fdc_id":173647,"fdc_description":"Beverages, water, tap, drinking","per_100g":{"fat_g":0.0,"carbs_g":0.0,"calories":0.0,"protein_g":0.0,"fiber_g":0.0,"sodium_mg":4.0,"sugar_g":0.0,"saturated_fat_g":0.0},"source_url":"https://fdc.nal.usda.gov/food-details/173647/nutrients"}],"serving_size":"1 de 8 porções de feijoada, sem acompanhamentos","method":"Dez fichas USDA verificadas, pesos crus comestíveis para feijão, porco e bacon e peso da linguiça já cozida; soma dividida por 8. A linguiça defumada é aproximada por uma ficha genérica de embutido suíno defumado, não por uma ficha específica de linguiça brasileira. Toda a gordura e o caldo retido são contados. Louro retirado e água do molho descartada ficam de fora.","note":"Estimativa informativa, não análise da feijoada pronta. Marca e sal da linguiça e do bacon, molho, rendimento e divisão do caldo alteram os valores. Arroz, laranja, farofa e verduras de acompanhamento não são contados."},"keywords":["feijoada caseira","feijoada de feijão preto","feijão preto com carne de porco"],"image_url":"/recetas/receta-de-feijoada/portada.webp","gallery":[{"url":"/recetas/receta-de-feijoada/portada.webp","alt":"Feijoada de feijão preto com cubos de porco, bacon e rodelas de linguiça defumada em caldo escuro"}],"seo":{"title":"Feijoada caseira de feijão preto e porco","description":"Feijoada caseira para 8 com feijão preto, porco, bacon e linguiça defumada: molho, fervura inicial, cozimento lento e conservação passo a passo.","image_alt":"Feijoada de feijão preto com cubos de porco, bacon e rodelas de linguiça defumada em caldo escuro","image_variants":["/recetas/receta-de-feijoada/portada-1x1.webp","/recetas/receta-de-feijoada/portada-4x3.webp","/recetas/receta-de-feijoada/portada-16x9.webp"],"faq":[{"q":"Posso pular o molho?","a":"Esta proposta começa com 8 horas de molho na geladeira e água nova para cozinhar. Não há tempo equivalente sem molho; o processo muda e a fervura inicial de 30 minutos continua necessária."},{"q":"Por que o feijão continua duro?","a":"Grãos velhos, água dura ou ingredientes ácidos colocados cedo podem prolongar o cozimento. Mantenha água quente suficiente e cozinhe até não haver miolo duro; acrescente o sal previsto no fim."},{"q":"Como engrossar sem farinha?","a":"Amasse uma concha de feijão macio sem carne e devolva à panela. Cozinhe suavemente por mais 15 minutos, mexendo; acrescente água fervente se ficar espesso demais."}]},"published":false,"editorial_status":"draft","content_html":"<p>Esta proposta de feijoada caseira combina feijão preto, paleta suína fresca, bacon e linguiça defumada completamente cozida em um caldo escuro engrossado com parte do próprio feijão. É uma adaptação com ingredientes fáceis de identificar, sem carnes salgadas que precisem de dessalga; não pretende representar todas as versões brasileiras.</p><p>Rende 8 porções de feijoada. Os 680 minutos estimados incluem 8 horas de molho na geladeira, 30 minutos de preparo, 160 de cozimento e 10 de descanso. O refogado é feito enquanto o feijão ferve. Quantidades, rendimento e tempos aguardam confirmação por teste de cozinha; a maciez e a temperatura importam mais que o relógio.</p>"},{"id":"ab45af90-bbfd-45b3-b417-b4c07bc3e7f1","recipe_group_id":"00a8928a-742e-4878-ba98-0539334c3530","slug":"pasta-frutos-del-mar","public_path":"/pasta-frutos-del-mar","source_url":"https://manualdecocina.com/pasta-frutos-del-mar/","language":"es","title":"Pasta de frutos del mar con tomate","excerpt":"Pasta de frutos del mar para 4 con langostinos, calamar y mejillones: salsa de tomate, cocción por fases y pasos para terminar los espaguetis.","summary":"Esta pasta de frutos del mar reúne espaguetis, langostinos, calamar y mejillones en una salsa corta de tomate, ajo, cebolla y perejil. Los mejillones se abren aparte para filtrar su líquido; el resto del marisco se cocina en la salsa y se reserva mientras la pasta termina de cocerse.\n\nLa propuesta rinde 4 platos y estima 25 minutos de preparación y 25 de cocción, 50 en total, con agua, pasta y mejillones en paralelo cuando sea posible. Cantidades, tiempos y rendimiento están pendientes de una prueba de cocina. Para la nutrición se proponen 150 g de carne comestible de los 600 g de mejillones con concha; el rendimiento real debe pesarse.","category":"Pastas","category_slug":"pastas","difficulty":"Media","course":"Plato principal","cuisine":"Mediterránea, propuesta casera","prep_time_minutes":25,"cook_time_minutes":25,"total_time_minutes":50,"servings":4,"ingredients":[{"name":"espaguetis secos","amount":"320","unit":"g","group":"Pasta y marisco"},{"name":"langostinos crudos pelados","amount":"250","unit":"g","group":"Pasta y marisco"},{"name":"calamar crudo limpio","amount":"250","unit":"g","group":"Pasta y marisco"},{"name":"mejillones vivos con concha","amount":"600","unit":"g","group":"Pasta y marisco"},{"name":"tomate triturado en conserva","amount":"400","unit":"g","group":"Salsa"},{"name":"cebolla","amount":"100","unit":"g","group":"Salsa"},{"name":"ajo","amount":"12","unit":"g","group":"Salsa"},{"name":"aceite de oliva","amount":"30","unit":"g","group":"Salsa"},{"name":"perejil fresco","amount":"8","unit":"g","group":"Salsa"},{"name":"sal","amount":"3","unit":"g","group":"Salsa"},{"name":"agua para la pasta, sin sal","amount":"3000","unit":"ml","group":"Cocción"},{"name":"agua para abrir los mejillones","amount":"100","unit":"ml","group":"Cocción"}],"steps":[{"title":"Limpia y revisa el marisco","content":"Usa 250 g de langostinos crudos ya pelados y sin intestino, y 250 g de calamar limpio: cuerpo sin piel ni vísceras, tentáculos sin pico. Corta el cuerpo en anillas de unos 0,5 cm y divide tentáculos grandes. Revisa los 600 g de mejillones vivos con concha de proveedor autorizado: descarta conchas rotas y los abiertos que no se cierren al dar un golpe suave. Cepilla bajo agua fría y retira las barbas justo antes de cocinar; no los dejes sumergidos en agua dulce. Mantén el marisco separado y refrigerado a 4 °C o menos mientras preparas la salsa. Si usas langostino o calamar congelado, descongela antes en la nevera; esa espera no entra en los 50 minutos.","image_url":"/recetas/pasta-frutos-del-mar/paso-01.webp","image_alt":"Pasta de frutos del mar: limpia y revisa el marisco"},{"title":"Pica los aromáticos y calienta el agua","content":"Pica los 100 g de cebolla y los 12 g de ajo en una tabla limpia distinta de la del marisco crudo. Lava y pica los 8 g de perejil. Pon los 3 litros de agua para pasta en una olla amplia y calienta hasta hervir, sin añadir sal: la sazón se incorpora a la salsa. Prepara otra olla con tapa para mejillones y una sartén grande para la salsa. Lava manos y utensilios tras tocar marisco crudo; usa un cuenco limpio para el ya cocinado.","image_url":"/recetas/pasta-frutos-del-mar/paso-02.webp","image_alt":"Pasta de frutos del mar: pica los aromáticos y calienta el agua"},{"title":"Haz una salsa de tomate corta","content":"Calienta los 30 g de aceite en la sartén a fuego medio. Sofríe la cebolla 5 minutos hasta que se ablande, sin quemarla. Añade el ajo y remueve 1 minuto. Incorpora los 400 g de tomate triturado y cocina 8 minutos a hervor suave, removiendo, hasta que pierda parte del agua y deje de saber tan crudo. Mantén la salsa caliente a fuego bajo. Los 14 minutos son orientativos; evita que se seque o se pegue.","image_url":"/recetas/pasta-frutos-del-mar/paso-03.webp","image_alt":"Pasta de frutos del mar: haz una salsa de tomate corta"},{"title":"Abre los mejillones al vapor","content":"Mientras se hace la salsa, vierte los 100 ml de agua en la olla de mejillones y lleva a hervor. Añade los mejillones limpios, tapa y cocina unos 4–5 minutos, agitando la olla con cuidado una vez. Retira a un cuenco limpio los que se abran; descarta los que sigan cerrados al final, sin forzarlos. Conserva hasta 100 ml del líquido y pásalo por colador fino con gasa limpia para quitar arena. Incorpóralo a la salsa. Deja algunos mejillones en su concha para servir y extrae la carne del resto con utensilios limpios. Mantén todo junto solo mientras terminas el plato.","image_url":"/recetas/pasta-frutos-del-mar/paso-04.webp","image_alt":"Pasta de frutos del mar: abre los mejillones al vapor"},{"title":"Cocina langostinos y calamar","content":"Sube la salsa a hervor suave y añade los 250 g de langostinos y los 250 g de calamar. Cocina unos 3–4 minutos, moviendo, hasta que los langostinos estén firmes y opacos y el calamar pierda translucidez. Comprueba con una sonda fina que las partes más gruesas del marisco alcancen al menos 63 °C; si no, sigue y vuelve a medir. El tiempo depende del tamaño y la temperatura inicial. Retira el marisco cocinado a otro cuenco limpio para que no siga cocinándose mientras acabas la pasta. No uses el cuenco del marisco crudo.","image_url":"/recetas/pasta-frutos-del-mar/paso-05.webp","image_alt":"Pasta de frutos del mar: cocina langostinos y calamar"},{"title":"Cuece la pasta y reserva agua","content":"Calcula el inicio para terminar esta fase cerca del marisco, ya que se puede cocer en paralelo. Echa los 320 g de espaguetis en el agua hirviendo sin sal, remueve al principio para separarlos y cuece 2 minutos menos que el tiempo al dente indicado en su envase: se terminarán en la salsa. Antes de escurrir guarda 150 ml del agua de cocción en una taza. Escurre sin enjuagar. Si la pasta o el marisco requieren más tiempo del previsto, amplía el total; no apresures una cocción insuficiente.","image_url":"/recetas/pasta-frutos-del-mar/paso-06.webp","image_alt":"Pasta de frutos del mar: cuece la pasta y reserva agua"},{"title":"Termina la pasta en la salsa","content":"Añade los espaguetis escurridos a la salsa y mezcla a fuego medio unos 2 minutos, hasta que queden al dente. Añade agua reservada de 30 en 30 ml solo si hace falta para que la salsa cubra la pasta sin charco. Durante los últimos 30 segundos incorpora langostinos, calamar, mejillones y perejil, mezclando suavemente para calentarlos sin deshacerlos. Prueba con utensilio limpio y añade los 3 g de sal previstos, o menos si el líquido de mejillón ya sala bastante; menos sal cambia el sodio estimado. No añadas conchas cerradas ni fragmentos de concha.","image_url":"/recetas/pasta-frutos-del-mar/paso-07.webp","image_alt":"Pasta de frutos del mar: termina la pasta en la salsa"},{"title":"Sirve enseguida y enfría las sobras","content":"Reparte en 4 platos distribuyendo por igual la pasta y las tres clases de marisco. Sirve inmediatamente; prolongar el calor endurece langostinos y calamar. Retira las conchas antes de guardar sobras, divide en recipientes pequeños y refrigera a 4 °C o menos dentro de 2 horas, o 1 hora si el ambiente supera 32 °C. Se propone consumir las sobras en 24 horas por calidad; recalienta solo la cantidad que vayas a comer, removiendo hasta al menos 74 °C en varios puntos. No se propone congelar el plato montado: pasta y marisco perderán textura.","image_url":"/recetas/pasta-frutos-del-mar/paso-08.webp","image_alt":"Pasta de frutos del mar: sirve enseguida y enfría las sobras"}],"notes":"La identidad del plato incluye las tres clases de marisco; sustituirlas por una mezcla comercial cambia cantidades, proceso y nutrición. Compra mejillones vivos de origen autorizado y sigue las indicaciones de conservación del proveedor. Elige langostinos crudos pelados y calamar ya limpio para que los pesos sean comestibles. No añadas vino o queso manteniendo el mismo cálculo. Para ajustar la salsa usa pequeñas cantidades de agua de pasta, no toda la taza por obligación. No reutilices tablas o cuencos del marisco crudo sin lavar. Contiene crustáceos, moluscos y trigo; revisa también las etiquetas si hay otros ingredientes o trazas. La temperatura y las señales de cocción mandan sobre el tiempo propuesto.","nutrition":{"calories":544.4,"protein_g":35.3,"carbs_g":74.4,"fat_g":11.4,"saturated_fat_g":1.9,"fiber_g":5.0,"sugar_g":7.6,"sodium_mg":973.0,"estimated":true,"source":"USDA FoodData Central — SR Legacy (abril de 2018)","source_url":"https://fdc.nal.usda.gov/download-datasets/","inputs":[{"ingredient":"espaguetis secos","edible_grams":320,"fdc_id":169736,"fdc_description":"Pasta, dry, enriched","per_100g":{"sodium_mg":6.0,"sugar_g":2.67,"saturated_fat_g":0.277,"carbs_g":74.67,"calories":371.0,"fat_g":1.51,"fiber_g":3.2,"protein_g":13.04},"source_url":"https://fdc.nal.usda.gov/food-details/169736/nutrients"},{"ingredient":"langostinos crudos pelados","edible_grams":250,"fdc_id":174210,"fdc_description":"Crustaceans, shrimp, mixed species, raw (may contain additives to retain moisture)","per_100g":{"fat_g":1.01,"carbs_g":0.91,"calories":71.0,"sugar_g":0.0,"sodium_mg":566.0,"protein_g":13.61,"saturated_fat_g":0.261,"fiber_g":0.0},"source_url":"https://fdc.nal.usda.gov/food-details/174210/nutrients"},{"ingredient":"calamar crudo limpio","edible_grams":250,"fdc_id":174223,"fdc_description":"Mollusks, squid, mixed species, raw","per_100g":{"sugar_g":0.0,"saturated_fat_g":0.358,"protein_g":15.58,"fiber_g":0.0,"sodium_mg":44.0,"fat_g":1.38,"carbs_g":3.08,"calories":92.0},"source_url":"https://fdc.nal.usda.gov/food-details/174223/nutrients"},{"ingredient":"mejillón, carne cruda estimada de 600 g con concha","edible_grams":150,"fdc_id":174216,"fdc_description":"Mollusks, mussel, blue, raw","per_100g":{"sugar_g":0.0,"fat_g":2.24,"carbs_g":3.69,"calories":86.0,"saturated_fat_g":0.425,"fiber_g":0.0,"sodium_mg":286.0,"protein_g":11.9},"source_url":"https://fdc.nal.usda.gov/food-details/174216/nutrients"},{"ingredient":"tomate triturado en conserva","edible_grams":400,"fdc_id":170501,"fdc_description":"Tomatoes, crushed, canned","per_100g":{"sodium_mg":186.0,"fat_g":0.28,"carbs_g":7.29,"calories":32.0,"fiber_g":1.9,"protein_g":1.64,"saturated_fat_g":0.04,"sugar_g":4.4},"source_url":"https://fdc.nal.usda.gov/food-details/170501/nutrients"},{"ingredient":"cebolla","edible_grams":100,"fdc_id":170000,"fdc_description":"Onions, raw","per_100g":{"sugar_g":4.24,"fat_g":0.1,"carbs_g":9.34,"calories":40.0,"saturated_fat_g":0.042,"protein_g":1.1,"fiber_g":1.7,"sodium_mg":4.0},"source_url":"https://fdc.nal.usda.gov/food-details/170000/nutrients"},{"ingredient":"ajo","edible_grams":12,"fdc_id":169230,"fdc_description":"Garlic, raw","per_100g":{"carbs_g":33.06,"calories":149.0,"sugar_g":1.0,"saturated_fat_g":0.089,"fiber_g":2.1,"sodium_mg":17.0,"protein_g":6.36,"fat_g":0.5},"source_url":"https://fdc.nal.usda.gov/food-details/169230/nutrients"},{"ingredient":"aceite de oliva","edible_grams":30,"fdc_id":171413,"fdc_description":"Oil, olive, salad or cooking","per_100g":{"fat_g":100.0,"carbs_g":0.0,"calories":884.0,"sodium_mg":2.0,"protein_g":0.0,"saturated_fat_g":13.808,"fiber_g":0.0,"sugar_g":0.0},"source_url":"https://fdc.nal.usda.gov/food-details/171413/nutrients"},{"ingredient":"perejil fresco","edible_grams":8,"fdc_id":170416,"fdc_description":"Parsley, fresh","per_100g":{"carbs_g":6.33,"calories":36.0,"fat_g":0.79,"protein_g":2.97,"fiber_g":3.3,"sodium_mg":56.0,"saturated_fat_g":0.132,"sugar_g":0.85},"source_url":"https://fdc.nal.usda.gov/food-details/170416/nutrients"},{"ingredient":"sal","edible_grams":3,"fdc_id":173468,"fdc_description":"Salt, table","per_100g":{"fiber_g":0.0,"sodium_mg":38758.0,"saturated_fat_g":0.0,"protein_g":0.0,"fat_g":0.0,"carbs_g":0.0,"calories":0.0,"sugar_g":0.0},"source_url":"https://fdc.nal.usda.gov/food-details/173468/nutrients"}],"serving_size":"1 de 4 platos, sin conchas","method":"Diez fichas USDA verificadas, pesos secos de pasta y crudos comestibles de marisco, total dividido entre 4. Se propone un rendimiento de mejillón de 150 g de carne a partir de 600 g con concha, equivalente al 25 %, pendiente de pesar en cocina. Langostinos y calamar se aproximan con fichas de especies mixtas; mejillón con mejillón azul crudo. Aceite, tomate y sal de salsa contados completos. Pasta cocida en agua sin sal; agua escurrida y conchas no incluidas.","note":"Estimación informativa, no análisis del plato terminado. El rendimiento real de mejillones, descartes, especie, posibles aditivos del langostino y marcas alteran las cifras. No incluye queso, pan ni vino; el líquido de mejillones puede aportar sales no reflejadas completamente por el rendimiento propuesto."},"keywords":["pasta de frutos del mar","espaguetis con marisco","pasta con langostinos calamar y mejillones"],"image_url":"/recetas/pasta-frutos-del-mar/portada.webp","gallery":[{"url":"/recetas/pasta-frutos-del-mar/portada.webp","alt":"Espaguetis con salsa de tomate, langostinos pelados, anillas de calamar, mejillones abiertos y perejil"}],"seo":{"title":"Pasta de frutos del mar con tomate","description":"Pasta de frutos del mar para 4 con langostinos, calamar y mejillones: salsa de tomate, cocción por fases y pasos para terminar los espaguetis.","image_alt":"Espaguetis con salsa de tomate, langostinos pelados, anillas de calamar, mejillones abiertos y perejil","image_variants":["/recetas/pasta-frutos-del-mar/portada-1x1.webp","/recetas/pasta-frutos-del-mar/portada-4x3.webp","/recetas/pasta-frutos-del-mar/portada-16x9.webp"],"faq":[{"q":"¿Qué hago con los mejillones que no se abren?","a":"Descarta los que sigan cerrados después de cocinar; no los fuerces para incorporarlos. Antes de cocinar también se descartan conchas rotas y los abiertos que no se cierren al tocarlos suavemente."},{"q":"¿Puedo usar marisco congelado?","a":"Para langostinos y calamar, descongela en la nevera antes de empezar y pesa ya pelados o limpios. La descongelación no se cuenta en los 50 minutos. Esta propuesta usa mejillones vivos con concha, no un cambio directo por mejillón congelado."},{"q":"¿Cómo evito que la pasta quede seca?","a":"Guarda 150 ml del agua de pasta y añade de 30 en 30 ml solo lo necesario al terminar los espaguetis en la salsa. Reincorpora el marisco al final para evitar un recalentado prolongado."}]},"published":false,"editorial_status":"draft","content_html":"<p>Esta pasta de frutos del mar reúne espaguetis, langostinos, calamar y mejillones en una salsa corta de tomate, ajo, cebolla y perejil. Los mejillones se abren aparte para filtrar su líquido; el resto del marisco se cocina en la salsa y se reserva mientras la pasta termina de cocerse.</p><p>La propuesta rinde 4 platos y estima 25 minutos de preparación y 25 de cocción, 50 en total, con agua, pasta y mejillones en paralelo cuando sea posible. Cantidades, tiempos y rendimiento están pendientes de una prueba de cocina. Para la nutrición se proponen 150 g de carne comestible de los 600 g de mejillones con concha; el rendimiento real debe pesarse.</p>"},{"id":"b0b3d7d0-55a2-574f-bc26-49c8f9ce6e9e","recipe_group_id":"00a8928a-742e-4878-ba98-0539334c3530","slug":"pasta-mit-meeresfruchten","public_path":"/de/pasta-mit-meeresfruchten","source_url":null,"language":"de","title":"Pasta mit Meeresfrüchten und Tomatensauce","excerpt":"Pasta mit Meeresfrüchten für 4: Garnelen, Tintenfisch und Miesmuscheln, Tomatensauce und klare Schritte zum Fertiggaren der Spaghetti.","summary":"Diese Pasta verbindet Spaghetti, Garnelen, Tintenfisch und Miesmuscheln mit einer kurzen Sauce aus Tomaten, Knoblauch, Zwiebel und Petersilie. Muscheln werden getrennt geöffnet, damit ihr Sud gefiltert werden kann; die übrigen Meeresfrüchte garen in der Sauce und werden bis zum Fertiggaren der Pasta herausgenommen.\n\nDer Vorschlag ergibt 4 Teller und schätzt 25 Minuten Vorbereitung plus 25 Minuten Garen, insgesamt 50, mit Wasser, Pasta und Muscheln möglichst parallel. Mengen, Zeiten und Ausbeute sind noch nicht im Küchentest bestätigt. Die Nährwerte setzen vorgeschlagene 150 g essbares Muschelfleisch aus 600 g Muscheln mit Schale an; die tatsächliche Ausbeute muss gewogen werden.","category":"Pasta","category_slug":"pastas","difficulty":"Mittel","course":"Hauptgericht","cuisine":"Mediterran, Vorschlag für die Hausküche","prep_time_minutes":25,"cook_time_minutes":25,"total_time_minutes":50,"servings":4,"ingredients":[{"name":"Getrocknete Spaghetti","amount":"320","unit":"g","group":"Pasta und Meeresfrüchte"},{"name":"Rohe geschälte Garnelen","amount":"250","unit":"g","group":"Pasta und Meeresfrüchte"},{"name":"Roher geputzter Tintenfisch","amount":"250","unit":"g","group":"Pasta und Meeresfrüchte"},{"name":"Lebende Miesmuscheln mit Schale","amount":"600","unit":"g","group":"Pasta und Meeresfrüchte"},{"name":"Zerkleinerte Tomaten aus der Dose","amount":"400","unit":"g","group":"Sauce"},{"name":"Zwiebel","amount":"100","unit":"g","group":"Sauce"},{"name":"Knoblauch","amount":"12","unit":"g","group":"Sauce"},{"name":"Olivenöl","amount":"30","unit":"g","group":"Sauce"},{"name":"Frische Petersilie","amount":"8","unit":"g","group":"Sauce"},{"name":"Salz","amount":"3","unit":"g","group":"Sauce"},{"name":"Ungesalzenes Pastakochwasser","amount":"3000","unit":"ml","group":"Garen"},{"name":"Wasser zum Muscheldämpfen","amount":"100","unit":"ml","group":"Garen"}],"steps":[{"title":"Meeresfrüchte putzen und prüfen","content":"250 g rohe bereits geschälte und entdarmte Garnelen sowie 250 g geputzten Tintenfisch verwenden: Körper ohne Haut und Innereien, Fangarme ohne Schnabel. Körper in etwa 0,5 cm breite Ringe schneiden, große Fangarme teilen. 600 g lebende Miesmuscheln mit Schale von zugelassenem Anbieter prüfen: zerbrochene Schalen und offene Muscheln, die sich bei leichtem Klopfen nicht schließen, entsorgen. Unter kaltem Wasser bürsten und Bärte unmittelbar vor dem Garen entfernen; nicht in Süßwasser liegen lassen. Meeresfrüchte während der Saucenzubereitung getrennt bei höchstens 4 °C kühlen. Gefrorene Garnelen oder Tintenfisch vorher im Kühlschrank auftauen; diese Wartezeit gehört nicht zu den 50 Minuten.","image_url":"/recetas/pasta-frutos-del-mar/paso-01.webp","image_alt":"Pasta mit Meeresfrüchten und Tomatensauce: Meeresfrüchte putzen und prüfen"},{"title":"Aromaten hacken und Wasser erhitzen","content":"100 g Zwiebel und 12 g Knoblauch auf einem sauberen Brett getrennt von rohen Meeresfrüchten hacken. 8 g Petersilie waschen und hacken. 3 Liter Pastawasser in einem großen Topf ohne Salz aufkochen: Gewürzt wird in der Sauce. Einen weiteren Topf mit Deckel für Muscheln und eine große Pfanne für Sauce bereitstellen. Nach Kontakt mit rohen Meeresfrüchten Hände und Geräte waschen; für gegarte eine saubere Schüssel nehmen.","image_url":"/recetas/pasta-frutos-del-mar/paso-02.webp","image_alt":"Pasta mit Meeresfrüchten und Tomatensauce: Aromaten hacken und Wasser erhitzen"},{"title":"Kurze Tomatensauce zubereiten","content":"30 g Öl in der Pfanne bei mittlerer Hitze erhitzen. Zwiebel 5 Minuten weich dünsten, ohne sie zu verbrennen. Knoblauch zufügen, 1 Minute rühren. 400 g zerkleinerte Dosentomaten zufügen und 8 Minuten sanft unter Rühren köcheln, bis etwas Wasser verdampft und der rohe Geschmack abnimmt. Bei kleiner Hitze warm halten. 14 Minuten sind ein Richtwert; Austrocknen und Ansetzen verhindern.","image_url":"/recetas/pasta-frutos-del-mar/paso-03.webp","image_alt":"Pasta mit Meeresfrüchten und Tomatensauce: Kurze Tomatensauce zubereiten"},{"title":"Miesmuscheln dämpfen","content":"Während die Sauce entsteht, 100 ml Wasser im Muscheltopf aufkochen. Geputzte Muscheln zufügen, zudecken und etwa 4–5 Minuten garen, Topf einmal vorsichtig schütteln. Geöffnete Muscheln in eine saubere Schüssel heben; am Ende geschlossene entsorgen, nicht gewaltsam öffnen. Bis zu 100 ml Sud aufheben und durch ein feines Sieb mit sauberem Mull filtern, um Sand zu entfernen. Zur Sauce geben. Einige Muscheln zum Servieren in der Schale lassen, die übrigen mit sauberen Geräten auslösen. Nur während der restlichen Zubereitung zusammen bereithalten.","image_url":"/recetas/pasta-frutos-del-mar/paso-04.webp","image_alt":"Pasta mit Meeresfrüchten und Tomatensauce: Miesmuscheln dämpfen"},{"title":"Garnelen und Tintenfisch garen","content":"Sauce sanft aufkochen und 250 g Garnelen sowie 250 g Tintenfisch zufügen. Etwa 3–4 Minuten unter Bewegen garen, bis Garnelen fest und undurchsichtig sind und Tintenfisch seine Durchsichtigkeit verliert. Mit feiner Thermometersonde mindestens 63 °C an den dicksten Stellen prüfen; sonst weitergaren und erneut messen. Dauer hängt von Größe und Anfangstemperatur ab. Gegarte Meeresfrüchte in eine andere saubere Schüssel heben, damit sie während des Pastafertiggarens nicht weitergaren. Nicht die Rohwarenschüssel nutzen.","image_url":"/recetas/pasta-frutos-del-mar/paso-05.webp","image_alt":"Pasta mit Meeresfrüchten und Tomatensauce: Garnelen und Tintenfisch garen"},{"title":"Pasta kochen und Wasser aufheben","content":"Den Beginn so planen, dass dieser Schritt ungefähr mit den Meeresfrüchten endet; Pasta kann parallel kochen. 320 g Spaghetti in ungesalzenes kochendes Wasser geben, anfangs zum Trennen rühren und 2 Minuten kürzer als die Al-dente-Zeit der Packung kochen: Sie garen in der Sauce fertig. Vor dem Abgießen 150 ml Kochwasser in einer Tasse sichern. Ohne Abspülen abgießen. Wenn Pasta oder Meeresfrüchte länger brauchen, Gesamtzeit verlängern; unzureichendes Garen nicht abkürzen.","image_url":"/recetas/pasta-frutos-del-mar/paso-06.webp","image_alt":"Pasta mit Meeresfrüchten und Tomatensauce: Pasta kochen und Wasser aufheben"},{"title":"Pasta in der Sauce fertig garen","content":"Abgetropfte Spaghetti zur Sauce geben und bei mittlerer Hitze etwa 2 Minuten bis al dente mischen. Aufgehobenes Wasser nur bei Bedarf in Schritten von 30 ml zufügen, damit Sauce die Pasta ohne Pfütze überzieht. In den letzten 30 Sekunden Garnelen, Tintenfisch, Muscheln und Petersilie vorsichtig zum Erwärmen unterheben. Mit sauberem Gerät probieren und die vorgesehenen 3 g Salz oder weniger bei bereits salzigem Muschelsud zufügen; weniger Salz ändert die Natriumschätzung. Keine geschlossenen Schalen oder Schalenstücke zufügen.","image_url":"/recetas/pasta-frutos-del-mar/paso-07.webp","image_alt":"Pasta mit Meeresfrüchten und Tomatensauce: Pasta in der Sauce fertig garen"},{"title":"Sofort servieren und Reste kühlen","content":"Auf 4 Teller verteilen, Pasta und drei Meeresfruchtarten gleichmäßig aufteilen. Sofort servieren; längere Hitze macht Garnelen und Tintenfisch zäh. Vor dem Aufbewahren Schalen entfernen, Reste in kleine Behälter teilen und binnen 2 Stunden bei höchstens 4 °C kühlen, bei Umgebung über 32 °C binnen 1 Stunde. Aus Qualitätsgründen wird Verbrauch innerhalb 24 Stunden vorgeschlagen. Nur die benötigte Menge unter Rühren an mehreren Stellen auf mindestens 74 °C erhitzen. Das fertige Gericht wird nicht zum Einfrieren vorgeschlagen, da Pasta und Meeresfrüchte an Textur verlieren.","image_url":"/recetas/pasta-frutos-del-mar/paso-08.webp","image_alt":"Pasta mit Meeresfrüchten und Tomatensauce: Sofort servieren und Reste kühlen"}],"notes":"Zum Gericht gehören alle drei Meeresfruchtarten; eine Handelsmischung verändert Mengen, Ablauf und Nährwerte. Lebende Muscheln aus zugelassener Quelle kaufen und Lagerhinweise des Anbieters befolgen. Rohe geschälte Garnelen und geputzten Tintenfisch wählen, damit Gewichte essbare Mengen sind. Wein oder Käse verändern die Berechnung. Sauce mit kleinen Wassermengen einstellen, nicht automatisch mit der ganzen Tasse. Rohwarenbretter und Schüsseln erst nach dem Waschen wiederverwenden. Enthält Krebstiere, Weichtiere und Weizen; Etiketten auf weitere Zutaten oder Spuren prüfen. Temperatur und Garzeichen haben Vorrang vor Zeitvorschlägen.","nutrition":{"calories":544.4,"protein_g":35.3,"carbs_g":74.4,"fat_g":11.4,"saturated_fat_g":1.9,"fiber_g":5.0,"sugar_g":7.6,"sodium_mg":973.0,"estimated":true,"source":"USDA FoodData Central — SR Legacy (abril de 2018)","source_url":"https://fdc.nal.usda.gov/download-datasets/","inputs":[{"ingredient":"Getrocknete Spaghetti","edible_grams":320,"fdc_id":169736,"fdc_description":"Pasta, dry, enriched","per_100g":{"sodium_mg":6.0,"sugar_g":2.67,"saturated_fat_g":0.277,"carbs_g":74.67,"calories":371.0,"fat_g":1.51,"fiber_g":3.2,"protein_g":13.04},"source_url":"https://fdc.nal.usda.gov/food-details/169736/nutrients"},{"ingredient":"Rohe geschälte Garnelen","edible_grams":250,"fdc_id":174210,"fdc_description":"Crustaceans, shrimp, mixed species, raw (may contain additives to retain moisture)","per_100g":{"fat_g":1.01,"carbs_g":0.91,"calories":71.0,"sugar_g":0.0,"sodium_mg":566.0,"protein_g":13.61,"saturated_fat_g":0.261,"fiber_g":0.0},"source_url":"https://fdc.nal.usda.gov/food-details/174210/nutrients"},{"ingredient":"Roher geputzter Tintenfisch","edible_grams":250,"fdc_id":174223,"fdc_description":"Mollusks, squid, mixed species, raw","per_100g":{"sugar_g":0.0,"saturated_fat_g":0.358,"protein_g":15.58,"fiber_g":0.0,"sodium_mg":44.0,"fat_g":1.38,"carbs_g":3.08,"calories":92.0},"source_url":"https://fdc.nal.usda.gov/food-details/174223/nutrients"},{"ingredient":"Lebende Miesmuscheln mit Schale","edible_grams":150,"fdc_id":174216,"fdc_description":"Mollusks, mussel, blue, raw","per_100g":{"sugar_g":0.0,"fat_g":2.24,"carbs_g":3.69,"calories":86.0,"saturated_fat_g":0.425,"fiber_g":0.0,"sodium_mg":286.0,"protein_g":11.9},"source_url":"https://fdc.nal.usda.gov/food-details/174216/nutrients"},{"ingredient":"Zerkleinerte Tomaten aus der Dose","edible_grams":400,"fdc_id":170501,"fdc_description":"Tomatoes, crushed, canned","per_100g":{"sodium_mg":186.0,"fat_g":0.28,"carbs_g":7.29,"calories":32.0,"fiber_g":1.9,"protein_g":1.64,"saturated_fat_g":0.04,"sugar_g":4.4},"source_url":"https://fdc.nal.usda.gov/food-details/170501/nutrients"},{"ingredient":"Zwiebel","edible_grams":100,"fdc_id":170000,"fdc_description":"Onions, raw","per_100g":{"sugar_g":4.24,"fat_g":0.1,"carbs_g":9.34,"calories":40.0,"saturated_fat_g":0.042,"protein_g":1.1,"fiber_g":1.7,"sodium_mg":4.0},"source_url":"https://fdc.nal.usda.gov/food-details/170000/nutrients"},{"ingredient":"Knoblauch","edible_grams":12,"fdc_id":169230,"fdc_description":"Garlic, raw","per_100g":{"carbs_g":33.06,"calories":149.0,"sugar_g":1.0,"saturated_fat_g":0.089,"fiber_g":2.1,"sodium_mg":17.0,"protein_g":6.36,"fat_g":0.5},"source_url":"https://fdc.nal.usda.gov/food-details/169230/nutrients"},{"ingredient":"Olivenöl","edible_grams":30,"fdc_id":171413,"fdc_description":"Oil, olive, salad or cooking","per_100g":{"fat_g":100.0,"carbs_g":0.0,"calories":884.0,"sodium_mg":2.0,"protein_g":0.0,"saturated_fat_g":13.808,"fiber_g":0.0,"sugar_g":0.0},"source_url":"https://fdc.nal.usda.gov/food-details/171413/nutrients"},{"ingredient":"Frische Petersilie","edible_grams":8,"fdc_id":170416,"fdc_description":"Parsley, fresh","per_100g":{"carbs_g":6.33,"calories":36.0,"fat_g":0.79,"protein_g":2.97,"fiber_g":3.3,"sodium_mg":56.0,"saturated_fat_g":0.132,"sugar_g":0.85},"source_url":"https://fdc.nal.usda.gov/food-details/170416/nutrients"},{"ingredient":"Salz","edible_grams":3,"fdc_id":173468,"fdc_description":"Salt, table","per_100g":{"fiber_g":0.0,"sodium_mg":38758.0,"saturated_fat_g":0.0,"protein_g":0.0,"fat_g":0.0,"carbs_g":0.0,"calories":0.0,"sugar_g":0.0},"source_url":"https://fdc.nal.usda.gov/food-details/173468/nutrients"}],"serving_size":"1 von 4 Tellern, ohne Schalen","method":"Zehn geprüfte USDA-Datensätze, trockene Pasta und rohe essbare Meeresfruchtgewichte, Summe durch 4. Vorgeschlagene Muschelausbeute: 150 g Fleisch aus 600 g mit Schale, also 25 %, noch in der Küche zu wiegen. Garnelen und Tintenfisch verwenden Datensätze gemischter Arten, Muscheln rohe Blaumuscheln. Öl, Tomaten und Saucensalz vollständig gerechnet. Pasta in ungesalzenem Wasser; abgegossenes Wasser und Schalen ausgeschlossen.","note":"Informationsschätzung, keine Analyse des fertigen Gerichts. Tatsächliche Muschelausbeute, aussortierte Stücke, Art, mögliche Garnelenzusätze und Marken beeinflussen die Zahlen. Käse, Brot und Wein ausgeschlossen; Muschelsud kann zusätzliche, vom angenommenen Ertrag nicht ganz erfasste Salze liefern."},"keywords":["Pasta mit Meeresfrüchten","Spaghetti mit Meeresfrüchten","Pasta Garnelen Tintenfisch Miesmuscheln"],"image_url":"/recetas/pasta-frutos-del-mar/portada.webp","gallery":[{"url":"/recetas/pasta-frutos-del-mar/portada.webp","alt":"Spaghetti mit Tomatensauce, geschälten Garnelen, Tintenfischringen, geöffneten Miesmuscheln und Petersilie"}],"seo":{"title":"Pasta mit Meeresfrüchten und Tomatensauce","description":"Pasta mit Meeresfrüchten für 4: Garnelen, Tintenfisch und Miesmuscheln, Tomatensauce und klare Schritte zum Fertiggaren der Spaghetti.","image_alt":"Spaghetti mit Tomatensauce, geschälten Garnelen, Tintenfischringen, geöffneten Miesmuscheln und Petersilie","image_variants":["/recetas/pasta-frutos-del-mar/portada-1x1.webp","/recetas/pasta-frutos-del-mar/portada-4x3.webp","/recetas/pasta-frutos-del-mar/portada-16x9.webp"],"faq":[{"q":"Was mache ich mit ungeöffneten Muscheln?","a":"Nach dem Garen weiterhin geschlossene Muscheln entsorgen, nicht gewaltsam öffnen. Vorher auch zerbrochene und offene Muscheln, die sich bei leichtem Klopfen nicht schließen, aussortieren."},{"q":"Kann ich tiefgekühlte Meeresfrüchte verwenden?","a":"Garnelen und Tintenfisch vor Beginn im Kühlschrank auftauen und geschält beziehungsweise geputzt wiegen. Auftauen gehört nicht zu den 50 Minuten. Vorgesehen sind lebende Muscheln mit Schale, kein direkter Ersatz durch gefrorene Muscheln."},{"q":"Wie bleibt die Pasta saftig?","a":"150 ml Kochwasser aufheben und beim Fertiggaren nur nötige Mengen in Schritten von 30 ml zugeben. Meeresfrüchte am Schluss zurückgeben, um langes Wiedererhitzen zu vermeiden."}]},"published":false,"editorial_status":"draft","content_html":"<p>Diese Pasta verbindet Spaghetti, Garnelen, Tintenfisch und Miesmuscheln mit einer kurzen Sauce aus Tomaten, Knoblauch, Zwiebel und Petersilie. Muscheln werden getrennt geöffnet, damit ihr Sud gefiltert werden kann; die übrigen Meeresfrüchte garen in der Sauce und werden bis zum Fertiggaren der Pasta herausgenommen.</p><p>Der Vorschlag ergibt 4 Teller und schätzt 25 Minuten Vorbereitung plus 25 Minuten Garen, insgesamt 50, mit Wasser, Pasta und Muscheln möglichst parallel. Mengen, Zeiten und Ausbeute sind noch nicht im Küchentest bestätigt. Die Nährwerte setzen vorgeschlagene 150 g essbares Muschelfleisch aus 600 g Muscheln mit Schale an; die tatsächliche Ausbeute muss gewogen werden.</p>"},{"id":"da91c452-a502-5eb8-9f2a-19d4dc54c718","recipe_group_id":"00a8928a-742e-4878-ba98-0539334c3530","slug":"seafood-pasta","public_path":"/en/seafood-pasta","source_url":null,"language":"en","title":"Seafood pasta with tomato sauce","excerpt":"Seafood pasta for 4 with shrimp, squid and mussels: tomato sauce, cooking in stages and clear steps for finishing the spaghetti.","summary":"This seafood pasta combines spaghetti, shrimp, squid and mussels in a quick sauce of tomato, garlic, onion and parsley. Steam the mussels separately to filter their liquid; cook the remaining seafood in the sauce and set it aside while finishing the pasta.\n\nThe proposal makes 4 plates and estimates 25 minutes of preparation plus 25 of cooking, 50 in total, with water, pasta and mussels cooking in parallel when possible. Quantities, times and yield await a kitchen test. Nutrition proposes 150 g edible mussel flesh from 600 g shell-on mussels; the actual yield needs weighing.","category":"Pasta","category_slug":"pastas","difficulty":"Medium","course":"Main course","cuisine":"Mediterranean, home-style proposal","prep_time_minutes":25,"cook_time_minutes":25,"total_time_minutes":50,"servings":4,"ingredients":[{"name":"Dry spaghetti","amount":"320","unit":"g","group":"Pasta and seafood"},{"name":"Raw peeled shrimp","amount":"250","unit":"g","group":"Pasta and seafood"},{"name":"Raw cleaned squid","amount":"250","unit":"g","group":"Pasta and seafood"},{"name":"Live shell-on mussels","amount":"600","unit":"g","group":"Pasta and seafood"},{"name":"Canned crushed tomatoes","amount":"400","unit":"g","group":"Sauce"},{"name":"Onion","amount":"100","unit":"g","group":"Sauce"},{"name":"Garlic","amount":"12","unit":"g","group":"Sauce"},{"name":"Olive oil","amount":"30","unit":"g","group":"Sauce"},{"name":"Fresh parsley","amount":"8","unit":"g","group":"Sauce"},{"name":"Salt","amount":"3","unit":"g","group":"Sauce"},{"name":"Unsalted pasta cooking water","amount":"3000","unit":"ml","group":"Cooking"},{"name":"Water for steaming mussels","amount":"100","unit":"ml","group":"Cooking"}],"steps":[{"title":"Clean and check the seafood","content":"Use 250 g raw shrimp already peeled and deveined, and 250 g cleaned squid: body without skin or innards, tentacles without the beak. Slice the body into roughly 0.5 cm rings and divide large tentacles. Check the 600 g live shell-on mussels from an approved supplier: discard broken shells and open ones that do not close when gently tapped. Scrub under cold water and remove beards just before cooking; do not leave them submerged in fresh water. Keep seafood separate and refrigerated at 4 °C or below while making the sauce. If shrimp or squid are frozen, thaw in the refrigerator first; this wait is excluded from the 50 minutes.","image_url":"/recetas/pasta-frutos-del-mar/paso-01.webp","image_alt":"Seafood pasta with tomato sauce: Clean and check the seafood"},{"title":"Chop aromatics and heat water","content":"Chop the 100 g onion and 12 g garlic on a clean board separate from raw seafood. Wash and chop the 8 g parsley. Put the 3 litres pasta water in a roomy pot and bring to the boil without salt: seasoning goes into the sauce. Prepare another lidded pot for mussels and a large skillet for sauce. Wash hands and utensils after handling raw seafood; use a clean bowl for cooked seafood.","image_url":"/recetas/pasta-frutos-del-mar/paso-02.webp","image_alt":"Seafood pasta with tomato sauce: Chop aromatics and heat water"},{"title":"Make a quick tomato sauce","content":"Heat the 30 g oil in the skillet over medium heat. Cook onion for 5 minutes until softened without burning. Add garlic and stir for 1 minute. Add the 400 g crushed tomatoes and simmer for 8 minutes, stirring, until some water evaporates and the raw taste diminishes. Keep the sauce hot over low heat. The 14 minutes are a guide; prevent drying out or sticking.","image_url":"/recetas/pasta-frutos-del-mar/paso-03.webp","image_alt":"Seafood pasta with tomato sauce: Make a quick tomato sauce"},{"title":"Steam the mussels open","content":"While making sauce, bring the 100 ml water to the boil in the mussel pot. Add cleaned mussels, cover and cook for about 4–5 minutes, carefully shaking the pot once. Lift opened mussels into a clean bowl; discard ones still closed at the end without forcing them open. Save up to 100 ml liquid and pass through a fine strainer lined with clean muslin to remove sand. Add it to the sauce. Leave some mussels in shells for serving and remove flesh from the rest with clean utensils. Keep together only while finishing the dish.","image_url":"/recetas/pasta-frutos-del-mar/paso-04.webp","image_alt":"Seafood pasta with tomato sauce: Steam the mussels open"},{"title":"Cook shrimp and squid","content":"Bring the sauce to a gentle simmer and add the 250 g shrimp and 250 g squid. Cook for about 3–4 minutes, stirring, until shrimp are firm and opaque and squid loses translucency. Use a fine thermometer probe to check that the thickest seafood parts reach at least 63 °C; if not, continue and check again. Timing depends on size and starting temperature. Transfer cooked seafood to another clean bowl so it does not keep cooking while pasta finishes. Do not use the raw-seafood bowl.","image_url":"/recetas/pasta-frutos-del-mar/paso-05.webp","image_alt":"Seafood pasta with tomato sauce: Cook shrimp and squid"},{"title":"Cook pasta and save water","content":"Time the start so this stage finishes near the seafood; pasta can cook in parallel. Add the 320 g spaghetti to unsalted boiling water, stir initially to separate strands and cook 2 minutes less than the package al dente time: it will finish in sauce. Before draining, save 150 ml cooking water in a cup. Drain without rinsing. If pasta or seafood needs longer, extend the total; do not rush insufficient cooking.","image_url":"/recetas/pasta-frutos-del-mar/paso-06.webp","image_alt":"Seafood pasta with tomato sauce: Cook pasta and save water"},{"title":"Finish the pasta in the sauce","content":"Add drained spaghetti to the sauce and toss over medium heat for about 2 minutes until al dente. Add reserved water in 30 ml increments only as needed for sauce to coat pasta without a pool. In the last 30 seconds fold in shrimp, squid, mussels and parsley gently to warm them without breaking them up. Taste with a clean utensil and add the planned 3 g salt, or less if mussel liquid is salty enough; less salt changes estimated sodium. Do not add closed shells or shell fragments.","image_url":"/recetas/pasta-frutos-del-mar/paso-07.webp","image_alt":"Seafood pasta with tomato sauce: Finish the pasta in the sauce"},{"title":"Serve immediately and chill leftovers","content":"Divide between 4 plates, distributing pasta and all three seafood types evenly. Serve immediately; prolonged heat toughens shrimp and squid. Remove shells before storing leftovers, divide into small containers and refrigerate at 4 °C or below within 2 hours, or 1 hour if ambient temperature exceeds 32 °C. Using leftovers within 24 hours is proposed for quality; reheat only the portion to be eaten, stirring until at least 74 °C in several places. Freezing the assembled dish is not proposed because pasta and seafood textures deteriorate.","image_url":"/recetas/pasta-frutos-del-mar/paso-08.webp","image_alt":"Seafood pasta with tomato sauce: Serve immediately and chill leftovers"}],"notes":"The dish includes all three seafood types; substituting a commercial mix changes amounts, process and nutrition. Buy live mussels from an approved source and follow supplier storage instructions. Choose raw peeled shrimp and already cleaned squid so weights are edible amounts. Adding wine or cheese changes the calculation. Adjust sauce with small amounts of pasta water, not the whole cup automatically. Do not reuse raw-seafood boards or bowls without washing. Contains crustaceans, molluscs and wheat; check package labels for other ingredients or traces. Temperature and doneness signs take precedence over proposed timing.","nutrition":{"calories":544.4,"protein_g":35.3,"carbs_g":74.4,"fat_g":11.4,"saturated_fat_g":1.9,"fiber_g":5.0,"sugar_g":7.6,"sodium_mg":973.0,"estimated":true,"source":"USDA FoodData Central — SR Legacy (abril de 2018)","source_url":"https://fdc.nal.usda.gov/download-datasets/","inputs":[{"ingredient":"Dry spaghetti","edible_grams":320,"fdc_id":169736,"fdc_description":"Pasta, dry, enriched","per_100g":{"sodium_mg":6.0,"sugar_g":2.67,"saturated_fat_g":0.277,"carbs_g":74.67,"calories":371.0,"fat_g":1.51,"fiber_g":3.2,"protein_g":13.04},"source_url":"https://fdc.nal.usda.gov/food-details/169736/nutrients"},{"ingredient":"Raw peeled shrimp","edible_grams":250,"fdc_id":174210,"fdc_description":"Crustaceans, shrimp, mixed species, raw (may contain additives to retain moisture)","per_100g":{"fat_g":1.01,"carbs_g":0.91,"calories":71.0,"sugar_g":0.0,"sodium_mg":566.0,"protein_g":13.61,"saturated_fat_g":0.261,"fiber_g":0.0},"source_url":"https://fdc.nal.usda.gov/food-details/174210/nutrients"},{"ingredient":"Raw cleaned squid","edible_grams":250,"fdc_id":174223,"fdc_description":"Mollusks, squid, mixed species, raw","per_100g":{"sugar_g":0.0,"saturated_fat_g":0.358,"protein_g":15.58,"fiber_g":0.0,"sodium_mg":44.0,"fat_g":1.38,"carbs_g":3.08,"calories":92.0},"source_url":"https://fdc.nal.usda.gov/food-details/174223/nutrients"},{"ingredient":"Live shell-on mussels","edible_grams":150,"fdc_id":174216,"fdc_description":"Mollusks, mussel, blue, raw","per_100g":{"sugar_g":0.0,"fat_g":2.24,"carbs_g":3.69,"calories":86.0,"saturated_fat_g":0.425,"fiber_g":0.0,"sodium_mg":286.0,"protein_g":11.9},"source_url":"https://fdc.nal.usda.gov/food-details/174216/nutrients"},{"ingredient":"Canned crushed tomatoes","edible_grams":400,"fdc_id":170501,"fdc_description":"Tomatoes, crushed, canned","per_100g":{"sodium_mg":186.0,"fat_g":0.28,"carbs_g":7.29,"calories":32.0,"fiber_g":1.9,"protein_g":1.64,"saturated_fat_g":0.04,"sugar_g":4.4},"source_url":"https://fdc.nal.usda.gov/food-details/170501/nutrients"},{"ingredient":"Onion","edible_grams":100,"fdc_id":170000,"fdc_description":"Onions, raw","per_100g":{"sugar_g":4.24,"fat_g":0.1,"carbs_g":9.34,"calories":40.0,"saturated_fat_g":0.042,"protein_g":1.1,"fiber_g":1.7,"sodium_mg":4.0},"source_url":"https://fdc.nal.usda.gov/food-details/170000/nutrients"},{"ingredient":"Garlic","edible_grams":12,"fdc_id":169230,"fdc_description":"Garlic, raw","per_100g":{"carbs_g":33.06,"calories":149.0,"sugar_g":1.0,"saturated_fat_g":0.089,"fiber_g":2.1,"sodium_mg":17.0,"protein_g":6.36,"fat_g":0.5},"source_url":"https://fdc.nal.usda.gov/food-details/169230/nutrients"},{"ingredient":"Olive oil","edible_grams":30,"fdc_id":171413,"fdc_description":"Oil, olive, salad or cooking","per_100g":{"fat_g":100.0,"carbs_g":0.0,"calories":884.0,"sodium_mg":2.0,"protein_g":0.0,"saturated_fat_g":13.808,"fiber_g":0.0,"sugar_g":0.0},"source_url":"https://fdc.nal.usda.gov/food-details/171413/nutrients"},{"ingredient":"Fresh parsley","edible_grams":8,"fdc_id":170416,"fdc_description":"Parsley, fresh","per_100g":{"carbs_g":6.33,"calories":36.0,"fat_g":0.79,"protein_g":2.97,"fiber_g":3.3,"sodium_mg":56.0,"saturated_fat_g":0.132,"sugar_g":0.85},"source_url":"https://fdc.nal.usda.gov/food-details/170416/nutrients"},{"ingredient":"Salt","edible_grams":3,"fdc_id":173468,"fdc_description":"Salt, table","per_100g":{"fiber_g":0.0,"sodium_mg":38758.0,"saturated_fat_g":0.0,"protein_g":0.0,"fat_g":0.0,"carbs_g":0.0,"calories":0.0,"sugar_g":0.0},"source_url":"https://fdc.nal.usda.gov/food-details/173468/nutrients"}],"serving_size":"1 of 4 plates, without shells","method":"Ten verified USDA records, dry pasta and raw edible seafood weights, total divided by 4. Proposed mussel yield is 150 g flesh from 600 g shell-on mussels, equivalent to 25%, awaiting kitchen weighing. Shrimp and squid use mixed-species records and mussels a raw blue-mussel record. Oil, tomato and sauce salt counted fully. Pasta cooked in unsalted water; drained water and shells excluded.","note":"Informational estimate, not analysis of the finished dish. Actual mussel yield, discarded items, species, possible shrimp additives and brands alter values. Cheese, bread and wine excluded; mussel liquid may add salts not fully reflected by the proposed yield."},"keywords":["seafood pasta","spaghetti with seafood","shrimp squid and mussel pasta"],"image_url":"/recetas/pasta-frutos-del-mar/portada.webp","gallery":[{"url":"/recetas/pasta-frutos-del-mar/portada.webp","alt":"Spaghetti with tomato sauce, peeled shrimp, squid rings, open mussels and parsley"}],"seo":{"title":"Seafood pasta with tomato sauce","description":"Seafood pasta for 4 with shrimp, squid and mussels: tomato sauce, cooking in stages and clear steps for finishing the spaghetti.","image_alt":"Spaghetti with tomato sauce, peeled shrimp, squid rings, open mussels and parsley","image_variants":["/recetas/pasta-frutos-del-mar/portada-1x1.webp","/recetas/pasta-frutos-del-mar/portada-4x3.webp","/recetas/pasta-frutos-del-mar/portada-16x9.webp"],"faq":[{"q":"What should I do with mussels that do not open?","a":"Discard any still closed after cooking; do not force them open to add them. Before cooking, also discard broken shells and open ones that do not close after gentle tapping."},{"q":"Can I use frozen seafood?","a":"For shrimp and squid, thaw in the refrigerator before starting and weigh peeled or cleaned. Thawing is excluded from the 50 minutes. This proposal uses live shell-on mussels, not a direct substitution with frozen mussels."},{"q":"How do I prevent dry pasta?","a":"Save 150 ml pasta water and add in 30 ml increments only as needed while finishing spaghetti in sauce. Return seafood at the end to avoid prolonged reheating."}]},"published":false,"editorial_status":"draft","content_html":"<p>This seafood pasta combines spaghetti, shrimp, squid and mussels in a quick sauce of tomato, garlic, onion and parsley. Steam the mussels separately to filter their liquid; cook the remaining seafood in the sauce and set it aside while finishing the pasta.</p><p>The proposal makes 4 plates and estimates 25 minutes of preparation plus 25 of cooking, 50 in total, with water, pasta and mussels cooking in parallel when possible. Quantities, times and yield await a kitchen test. Nutrition proposes 150 g edible mussel flesh from 600 g shell-on mussels; the actual yield needs weighing.</p>"},{"id":"63298892-7eb3-58f0-b5a6-1c640c7b5c6e","recipe_group_id":"00a8928a-742e-4878-ba98-0539334c3530","slug":"pates-aux-fruits-de-mer","public_path":"/fr/pates-aux-fruits-de-mer","source_url":null,"language":"fr","title":"Pâtes aux fruits de mer et à la tomate","excerpt":"Pâtes aux fruits de mer pour 4 avec crevettes, calamar et moules : sauce tomate, cuisson par étapes et finition des spaghetti expliquées.","summary":"Ces pâtes associent spaghetti, crevettes, calamar et moules dans une sauce courte à la tomate, ail, oignon et persil. Les moules s’ouvrent à part pour filtrer leur jus ; les autres fruits de mer cuisent dans la sauce, puis sont réservés pendant la finition des pâtes.\n\nLa proposition donne 4 assiettes : 25 minutes de préparation et 25 de cuisson estimées, 50 au total, avec eau, pâtes et moules en parallèle si possible. Quantités, durées et rendement attendent un essai en cuisine. Le calcul propose 150 g de chair comestible pour 600 g de moules avec coquille ; le rendement réel doit être pesé.","category":"Pâtes","category_slug":"pastas","difficulty":"Moyenne","course":"Plat principal","cuisine":"Méditerranéenne, proposition maison","prep_time_minutes":25,"cook_time_minutes":25,"total_time_minutes":50,"servings":4,"ingredients":[{"name":"Spaghetti secs","amount":"320","unit":"g","group":"Pâtes et fruits de mer"},{"name":"Crevettes crues décortiquées","amount":"250","unit":"g","group":"Pâtes et fruits de mer"},{"name":"Calamar cru nettoyé","amount":"250","unit":"g","group":"Pâtes et fruits de mer"},{"name":"Moules vivantes avec coquille","amount":"600","unit":"g","group":"Pâtes et fruits de mer"},{"name":"Tomates concassées en conserve","amount":"400","unit":"g","group":"Sauce"},{"name":"Oignon","amount":"100","unit":"g","group":"Sauce"},{"name":"Ail","amount":"12","unit":"g","group":"Sauce"},{"name":"Huile d’olive","amount":"30","unit":"g","group":"Sauce"},{"name":"Persil frais","amount":"8","unit":"g","group":"Sauce"},{"name":"Sel","amount":"3","unit":"g","group":"Sauce"},{"name":"Eau de cuisson des pâtes sans sel","amount":"3000","unit":"ml","group":"Cuisson"},{"name":"Eau pour ouvrir les moules","amount":"100","unit":"ml","group":"Cuisson"}],"steps":[{"title":"Nettoyer et vérifier les fruits de mer","content":"Utilisez 250 g de crevettes crues déjà décortiquées et déveinées et 250 g de calamar nettoyé : corps sans peau ni viscères, tentacules sans bec. Coupez le corps en anneaux d’environ 0,5 cm et partagez les gros tentacules. Vérifiez les 600 g de moules vivantes avec coquille venant d’un fournisseur autorisé : jetez les coquilles cassées et les moules ouvertes qui ne se ferment pas après un léger coup. Brossez sous l’eau froide, retirez les filaments juste avant cuisson ; ne laissez pas immergées en eau douce. Gardez les fruits de mer séparés au réfrigérateur à 4 °C ou moins pendant la sauce. Crevettes ou calamar congelés se décongèlent avant au réfrigérateur ; cette attente n’entre pas dans les 50 minutes.","image_url":"/recetas/pasta-frutos-del-mar/paso-01.webp","image_alt":"Pâtes aux fruits de mer et à la tomate: Nettoyer et vérifier les fruits de mer"},{"title":"Hacher les aromates et chauffer l’eau","content":"Hachez les 100 g d’oignon et les 12 g d’ail sur une planche propre distincte de celle des fruits de mer crus. Lavez et hachez les 8 g de persil. Portez les 3 litres d’eau pour pâtes à ébullition dans une grande casserole, sans sel : l’assaisonnement va dans la sauce. Préparez une autre casserole à couvercle pour moules et une grande poêle pour sauce. Lavez mains et ustensiles après les fruits de mer crus ; prenez un bol propre pour les cuits.","image_url":"/recetas/pasta-frutos-del-mar/paso-02.webp","image_alt":"Pâtes aux fruits de mer et à la tomate: Hacher les aromates et chauffer l’eau"},{"title":"Préparer une sauce tomate courte","content":"Chauffez les 30 g d’huile dans la poêle à feu moyen. Faites revenir l’oignon 5 minutes pour l’attendrir sans brûler. Ajoutez l’ail, remuez 1 minute. Ajoutez les 400 g de tomates concassées et mijotez 8 minutes en remuant, jusqu’à perte d’une partie de l’eau et du goût trop cru. Gardez chaud à feu doux. Les 14 minutes sont indicatives ; évitez dessèchement et attachement.","image_url":"/recetas/pasta-frutos-del-mar/paso-03.webp","image_alt":"Pâtes aux fruits de mer et à la tomate: Préparer une sauce tomate courte"},{"title":"Ouvrir les moules à la vapeur","content":"Pendant la sauce, portez les 100 ml d’eau à ébullition dans la casserole à moules. Ajoutez les moules propres, couvrez et cuisez environ 4–5 minutes, en secouant prudemment une fois. Sortez les moules ouvertes dans un bol propre ; jetez celles encore fermées à la fin sans les forcer. Gardez jusqu’à 100 ml de jus, filtrez à travers une passoire fine garnie de gaze propre pour enlever le sable, puis ajoutez à la sauce. Gardez quelques moules dans leur coquille pour servir et retirez la chair des autres avec des ustensiles propres. Réservez seulement le temps de finir le plat.","image_url":"/recetas/pasta-frutos-del-mar/paso-04.webp","image_alt":"Pâtes aux fruits de mer et à la tomate: Ouvrir les moules à la vapeur"},{"title":"Cuire crevettes et calamar","content":"Faites frémir la sauce et ajoutez les 250 g de crevettes et les 250 g de calamar. Cuisez environ 3–4 minutes en remuant jusqu’à crevettes fermes et opaques et calamar non translucide. Avec une sonde fine, vérifiez au moins 63 °C dans les parties les plus épaisses ; sinon poursuivez et mesurez encore. Le temps dépend de la taille et de la température initiale. Sortez les fruits de mer cuits dans un autre bol propre pour arrêter leur cuisson pendant la finition des pâtes. N’utilisez pas le bol des produits crus.","image_url":"/recetas/pasta-frutos-del-mar/paso-05.webp","image_alt":"Pâtes aux fruits de mer et à la tomate: Cuire crevettes et calamar"},{"title":"Cuire les pâtes et garder de l’eau","content":"Calculez le départ pour finir cette étape près de celle des fruits de mer ; la cuisson peut se faire en parallèle. Versez les 320 g de spaghetti dans l’eau bouillante sans sel, remuez au début pour séparer et cuisez 2 minutes de moins que le temps al dente du paquet : la sauce terminera la cuisson. Avant d’égoutter, gardez 150 ml d’eau dans une tasse. Égouttez sans rincer. Si pâtes ou fruits de mer demandent plus de temps, prolongez le total ; ne précipitez pas une cuisson insuffisante.","image_url":"/recetas/pasta-frutos-del-mar/paso-06.webp","image_alt":"Pâtes aux fruits de mer et à la tomate: Cuire les pâtes et garder de l’eau"},{"title":"Terminer les pâtes dans la sauce","content":"Ajoutez les spaghetti égouttés à la sauce et mélangez environ 2 minutes à feu moyen jusqu’à al dente. Ajoutez l’eau réservée par 30 ml seulement si besoin pour enrober sans flaque. Durant les 30 dernières secondes, incorporez délicatement crevettes, calamar, moules et persil pour réchauffer sans défaire. Goûtez avec un ustensile propre et ajoutez les 3 g de sel prévus, ou moins si le jus de moule est assez salé ; moins de sel modifie le sodium estimé. N’ajoutez ni coquilles fermées ni fragments de coquille.","image_url":"/recetas/pasta-frutos-del-mar/paso-07.webp","image_alt":"Pâtes aux fruits de mer et à la tomate: Terminer les pâtes dans la sauce"},{"title":"Servir aussitôt et refroidir les restes","content":"Répartissez entre 4 assiettes avec les pâtes et les trois fruits de mer en parts similaires. Servez aussitôt ; une chaleur prolongée durcit crevettes et calamar. Retirez les coquilles avant de conserver, partagez en petits récipients et réfrigérez à 4 °C ou moins dans les 2 heures, ou 1 heure si l’air dépasse 32 °C. Consommer les restes en 24 heures est proposé pour la qualité ; réchauffez seulement la portion à manger, en remuant jusqu’à au moins 74 °C en plusieurs points. Congeler le plat assemblé n’est pas proposé car pâtes et fruits de mer perdent leur texture.","image_url":"/recetas/pasta-frutos-del-mar/paso-08.webp","image_alt":"Pâtes aux fruits de mer et à la tomate: Servir aussitôt et refroidir les restes"}],"notes":"L’identité du plat comprend les trois fruits de mer ; un mélange commercial change quantités, procédé et nutrition. Achetez des moules vivantes d’origine autorisée et suivez les conseils de conservation du fournisseur. Prenez crevettes crues décortiquées et calamar déjà nettoyé pour des poids comestibles. Ajouter vin ou fromage change le calcul. Ajustez avec de petites quantités d’eau de pâtes, pas automatiquement toute la tasse. Ne réutilisez pas planches et bols des produits crus sans lavage. Contient crustacés, mollusques et blé ; vérifiez aussi les étiquettes pour d’autres ingrédients ou traces. Température et signes de cuisson priment sur les durées proposées.","nutrition":{"calories":544.4,"protein_g":35.3,"carbs_g":74.4,"fat_g":11.4,"saturated_fat_g":1.9,"fiber_g":5.0,"sugar_g":7.6,"sodium_mg":973.0,"estimated":true,"source":"USDA FoodData Central — SR Legacy (abril de 2018)","source_url":"https://fdc.nal.usda.gov/download-datasets/","inputs":[{"ingredient":"Spaghetti secs","edible_grams":320,"fdc_id":169736,"fdc_description":"Pasta, dry, enriched","per_100g":{"sodium_mg":6.0,"sugar_g":2.67,"saturated_fat_g":0.277,"carbs_g":74.67,"calories":371.0,"fat_g":1.51,"fiber_g":3.2,"protein_g":13.04},"source_url":"https://fdc.nal.usda.gov/food-details/169736/nutrients"},{"ingredient":"Crevettes crues décortiquées","edible_grams":250,"fdc_id":174210,"fdc_description":"Crustaceans, shrimp, mixed species, raw (may contain additives to retain moisture)","per_100g":{"fat_g":1.01,"carbs_g":0.91,"calories":71.0,"sugar_g":0.0,"sodium_mg":566.0,"protein_g":13.61,"saturated_fat_g":0.261,"fiber_g":0.0},"source_url":"https://fdc.nal.usda.gov/food-details/174210/nutrients"},{"ingredient":"Calamar cru nettoyé","edible_grams":250,"fdc_id":174223,"fdc_description":"Mollusks, squid, mixed species, raw","per_100g":{"sugar_g":0.0,"saturated_fat_g":0.358,"protein_g":15.58,"fiber_g":0.0,"sodium_mg":44.0,"fat_g":1.38,"carbs_g":3.08,"calories":92.0},"source_url":"https://fdc.nal.usda.gov/food-details/174223/nutrients"},{"ingredient":"Moules vivantes avec coquille","edible_grams":150,"fdc_id":174216,"fdc_description":"Mollusks, mussel, blue, raw","per_100g":{"sugar_g":0.0,"fat_g":2.24,"carbs_g":3.69,"calories":86.0,"saturated_fat_g":0.425,"fiber_g":0.0,"sodium_mg":286.0,"protein_g":11.9},"source_url":"https://fdc.nal.usda.gov/food-details/174216/nutrients"},{"ingredient":"Tomates concassées en conserve","edible_grams":400,"fdc_id":170501,"fdc_description":"Tomatoes, crushed, canned","per_100g":{"sodium_mg":186.0,"fat_g":0.28,"carbs_g":7.29,"calories":32.0,"fiber_g":1.9,"protein_g":1.64,"saturated_fat_g":0.04,"sugar_g":4.4},"source_url":"https://fdc.nal.usda.gov/food-details/170501/nutrients"},{"ingredient":"Oignon","edible_grams":100,"fdc_id":170000,"fdc_description":"Onions, raw","per_100g":{"sugar_g":4.24,"fat_g":0.1,"carbs_g":9.34,"calories":40.0,"saturated_fat_g":0.042,"protein_g":1.1,"fiber_g":1.7,"sodium_mg":4.0},"source_url":"https://fdc.nal.usda.gov/food-details/170000/nutrients"},{"ingredient":"Ail","edible_grams":12,"fdc_id":169230,"fdc_description":"Garlic, raw","per_100g":{"carbs_g":33.06,"calories":149.0,"sugar_g":1.0,"saturated_fat_g":0.089,"fiber_g":2.1,"sodium_mg":17.0,"protein_g":6.36,"fat_g":0.5},"source_url":"https://fdc.nal.usda.gov/food-details/169230/nutrients"},{"ingredient":"Huile d’olive","edible_grams":30,"fdc_id":171413,"fdc_description":"Oil, olive, salad or cooking","per_100g":{"fat_g":100.0,"carbs_g":0.0,"calories":884.0,"sodium_mg":2.0,"protein_g":0.0,"saturated_fat_g":13.808,"fiber_g":0.0,"sugar_g":0.0},"source_url":"https://fdc.nal.usda.gov/food-details/171413/nutrients"},{"ingredient":"Persil frais","edible_grams":8,"fdc_id":170416,"fdc_description":"Parsley, fresh","per_100g":{"carbs_g":6.33,"calories":36.0,"fat_g":0.79,"protein_g":2.97,"fiber_g":3.3,"sodium_mg":56.0,"saturated_fat_g":0.132,"sugar_g":0.85},"source_url":"https://fdc.nal.usda.gov/food-details/170416/nutrients"},{"ingredient":"Sel","edible_grams":3,"fdc_id":173468,"fdc_description":"Salt, table","per_100g":{"fiber_g":0.0,"sodium_mg":38758.0,"saturated_fat_g":0.0,"protein_g":0.0,"fat_g":0.0,"carbs_g":0.0,"calories":0.0,"sugar_g":0.0},"source_url":"https://fdc.nal.usda.gov/food-details/173468/nutrients"}],"serving_size":"1 des 4 assiettes, sans coquilles","method":"Dix fiches USDA vérifiées, poids secs des pâtes et crus comestibles des fruits de mer, somme divisée par 4. Rendement proposé de 150 g de chair pour 600 g de moules avec coquille, soit 25 %, à peser en cuisine. Crevettes et calamar approximés avec fiches d’espèces mélangées, moules avec moule bleue crue. Huile, tomate et sel de sauce comptés intégralement. Pâtes dans l’eau sans sel ; eau égouttée et coquilles exclues.","note":"Estimation informative, pas analyse du plat terminé. Rendement réel des moules, rejets, espèce, éventuels additifs des crevettes et marques modifient les valeurs. Fromage, pain et vin exclus ; le jus de moules peut apporter des sels non entièrement reflétés par le rendement proposé."},"keywords":["pâtes aux fruits de mer","spaghetti aux fruits de mer","pâtes crevettes calamar moules"],"image_url":"/recetas/pasta-frutos-del-mar/portada.webp","gallery":[{"url":"/recetas/pasta-frutos-del-mar/portada.webp","alt":"Spaghetti à la sauce tomate, crevettes décortiquées, anneaux de calamar, moules ouvertes et persil"}],"seo":{"title":"Pâtes aux fruits de mer et à la tomate","description":"Pâtes aux fruits de mer pour 4 avec crevettes, calamar et moules : sauce tomate, cuisson par étapes et finition des spaghetti expliquées.","image_alt":"Spaghetti à la sauce tomate, crevettes décortiquées, anneaux de calamar, moules ouvertes et persil","image_variants":["/recetas/pasta-frutos-del-mar/portada-1x1.webp","/recetas/pasta-frutos-del-mar/portada-4x3.webp","/recetas/pasta-frutos-del-mar/portada-16x9.webp"],"faq":[{"q":"Que faire des moules qui ne s’ouvrent pas ?","a":"Jetez celles encore fermées après cuisson sans les forcer pour les ajouter. Avant cuisson, jetez aussi coquilles cassées et moules ouvertes qui ne se referment pas après un léger coup."},{"q":"Puis-je utiliser des fruits de mer congelés ?","a":"Décongelez crevettes et calamar au réfrigérateur avant de commencer et pesez-les décortiqués ou nettoyés. L’attente n’entre pas dans les 50 minutes. Cette proposition utilise des moules vivantes avec coquille, sans remplacement direct par des moules congelées."},{"q":"Comment éviter des pâtes sèches ?","a":"Gardez 150 ml d’eau de cuisson et ajoutez par 30 ml seulement si nécessaire pour terminer les spaghetti dans la sauce. Remettez les fruits de mer à la fin pour éviter un long réchauffage."}]},"published":false,"editorial_status":"draft","content_html":"<p>Ces pâtes associent spaghetti, crevettes, calamar et moules dans une sauce courte à la tomate, ail, oignon et persil. Les moules s’ouvrent à part pour filtrer leur jus ; les autres fruits de mer cuisent dans la sauce, puis sont réservés pendant la finition des pâtes.</p><p>La proposition donne 4 assiettes : 25 minutes de préparation et 25 de cuisson estimées, 50 au total, avec eau, pâtes et moules en parallèle si possible. Quantités, durées et rendement attendent un essai en cuisine. Le calcul propose 150 g de chair comestible pour 600 g de moules avec coquille ; le rendement réel doit être pesé.</p>"},{"id":"096fa9a3-4d5f-5fba-90b9-d8780dfc6269","recipe_group_id":"00a8928a-742e-4878-ba98-0539334c3530","slug":"pasta-frutti-di-mare","public_path":"/it/pasta-frutti-di-mare","source_url":"https://manualdecocina.com/it/pasta-frutti-di-mare/","language":"it","title":"Pasta ai frutti di mare con pomodoro","excerpt":"Pasta ai frutti di mare per 4 con gamberi, calamari e cozze: salsa di pomodoro, cotture separate e passaggi per finire gli spaghetti.","summary":"Questa pasta ai frutti di mare unisce spaghetti, gamberi, calamari e cozze in una salsa breve di pomodoro, aglio, cipolla e prezzemolo. Le cozze si aprono a parte per filtrare il liquido; gli altri frutti di mare cuociono nella salsa e si tengono da parte mentre la pasta termina la cottura.\n\nLa proposta rende 4 piatti e stima 25 minuti di preparazione e 25 di cottura, 50 in totale, con acqua, pasta e cozze in parallelo quando possibile. Quantità, tempi e resa attendono una prova in cucina. La nutrizione ipotizza 150 g di carne edibile da 600 g di cozze con guscio; la resa reale va pesata.","category":"Pasta","category_slug":"pastas","difficulty":"Media","course":"Piatto principale","cuisine":"Mediterranea, proposta casalinga","prep_time_minutes":25,"cook_time_minutes":25,"total_time_minutes":50,"servings":4,"ingredients":[{"name":"Spaghetti secchi","amount":"320","unit":"g","group":"Pasta e frutti di mare"},{"name":"Gamberi crudi sgusciati","amount":"250","unit":"g","group":"Pasta e frutti di mare"},{"name":"Calamaro crudo pulito","amount":"250","unit":"g","group":"Pasta e frutti di mare"},{"name":"Cozze vive con guscio","amount":"600","unit":"g","group":"Pasta e frutti di mare"},{"name":"Pomodori triturati in conserva","amount":"400","unit":"g","group":"Salsa"},{"name":"Cipolla","amount":"100","unit":"g","group":"Salsa"},{"name":"Aglio","amount":"12","unit":"g","group":"Salsa"},{"name":"Olio d’oliva","amount":"30","unit":"g","group":"Salsa"},{"name":"Prezzemolo fresco","amount":"8","unit":"g","group":"Salsa"},{"name":"Sale","amount":"3","unit":"g","group":"Salsa"},{"name":"Acqua per la pasta senza sale","amount":"3000","unit":"ml","group":"Cottura"},{"name":"Acqua per aprire le cozze","amount":"100","unit":"ml","group":"Cottura"}],"steps":[{"title":"Pulisci e controlla i frutti di mare","content":"Usa 250 g di gamberi crudi già sgusciati e privati dell’intestino e 250 g di calamaro pulito: corpo senza pelle né interiora, tentacoli senza becco. Taglia il corpo ad anelli di circa 0,5 cm e dividi i tentacoli grandi. Controlla i 600 g di cozze vive con guscio da fornitore autorizzato: scarta gusci rotti e cozze aperte che non si chiudono con un leggero colpo. Spazzola sotto acqua fredda e togli il bisso appena prima di cuocere; non lasciarle immerse in acqua dolce. Tieni i frutti di mare separati e refrigerati a 4 °C o meno mentre fai la salsa. Se gamberi o calamaro sono congelati, scongela prima in frigorifero; l’attesa non entra nei 50 minuti.","image_url":"/recetas/pasta-frutos-del-mar/paso-01.webp","image_alt":"Pasta ai frutti di mare con pomodoro: Pulisci e controlla i frutti di mare"},{"title":"Trita gli aromi e scalda l’acqua","content":"Trita i 100 g di cipolla e i 12 g d’aglio su un tagliere pulito diverso da quello dei frutti di mare crudi. Lava e trita gli 8 g di prezzemolo. Metti i 3 litri d’acqua per pasta in una pentola ampia e porta a ebollizione senza sale: si condisce la salsa. Prepara un’altra pentola con coperchio per cozze e una padella grande per salsa. Lava mani e utensili dopo i frutti di mare crudi e usa una ciotola pulita per quelli cotti.","image_url":"/recetas/pasta-frutos-del-mar/paso-02.webp","image_alt":"Pasta ai frutti di mare con pomodoro: Trita gli aromi e scalda l’acqua"},{"title":"Prepara una salsa di pomodoro breve","content":"Scalda i 30 g d’olio nella padella a fuoco medio. Soffriggi la cipolla 5 minuti finché si ammorbidisce senza bruciare. Aggiungi l’aglio e mescola 1 minuto. Unisci i 400 g di pomodori triturati e cuoci dolcemente 8 minuti, mescolando, finché perde parte dell’acqua e del sapore troppo crudo. Tieni la salsa calda a fuoco basso. I 14 minuti sono indicativi; evita che asciughi o si attacchi.","image_url":"/recetas/pasta-frutos-del-mar/paso-03.webp","image_alt":"Pasta ai frutti di mare con pomodoro: Prepara una salsa di pomodoro breve"},{"title":"Apri le cozze al vapore","content":"Mentre fai la salsa porta a bollore i 100 ml d’acqua nella pentola delle cozze. Aggiungi le cozze pulite, copri e cuoci circa 4–5 minuti, scuotendo prudentemente una volta. Togli in una ciotola pulita quelle aperte; scarta quelle rimaste chiuse alla fine senza forzarle. Conserva fino a 100 ml di liquido e filtra con un colino fine rivestito di garza pulita per togliere sabbia, poi uniscilo alla salsa. Lascia alcune cozze nel guscio per servire e togli la carne dalle altre con utensili puliti. Tieni da parte solo mentre finisci il piatto.","image_url":"/recetas/pasta-frutos-del-mar/paso-04.webp","image_alt":"Pasta ai frutti di mare con pomodoro: Apri le cozze al vapore"},{"title":"Cuoci gamberi e calamari","content":"Porta la salsa a lieve bollore e unisci i 250 g di gamberi e i 250 g di calamaro. Cuoci circa 3–4 minuti mescolando finché i gamberi sono sodi e opachi e il calamaro perde traslucenza. Con una sonda sottile controlla almeno 63 °C nelle parti più spesse; se manca temperatura, continua e misura ancora. Il tempo dipende da dimensione e temperatura iniziale. Togli i frutti di mare cotti in un’altra ciotola pulita per non prolungarne la cottura mentre finisce la pasta. Non usare la ciotola del crudo.","image_url":"/recetas/pasta-frutos-del-mar/paso-05.webp","image_alt":"Pasta ai frutti di mare con pomodoro: Cuoci gamberi e calamari"},{"title":"Cuoci la pasta e conserva acqua","content":"Calcola l’inizio per finire questa fase vicino ai frutti di mare, poiché la pasta può cuocere in parallelo. Versa i 320 g di spaghetti nell’acqua bollente senza sale, mescola all’inizio per separarli e cuoci 2 minuti meno del tempo al dente indicato sulla confezione: finiranno nella salsa. Prima di scolare conserva 150 ml d’acqua di cottura in una tazza. Scola senza sciacquare. Se pasta o frutti di mare richiedono più tempo, prolunga il totale; non abbreviare una cottura insufficiente.","image_url":"/recetas/pasta-frutos-del-mar/paso-06.webp","image_alt":"Pasta ai frutti di mare con pomodoro: Cuoci la pasta e conserva acqua"},{"title":"Finisci la pasta nella salsa","content":"Unisci gli spaghetti scolati alla salsa e mescola a fuoco medio circa 2 minuti fino ad al dente. Aggiungi acqua conservata a incrementi di 30 ml solo se serve a rivestire la pasta senza pozzanghere. Negli ultimi 30 secondi unisci gamberi, calamaro, cozze e prezzemolo, mescolando delicatamente per scaldarli senza romperli. Assaggia con utensile pulito e aggiungi i 3 g di sale previsti, o meno se il liquido delle cozze è già sapido; meno sale cambia il sodio stimato. Non aggiungere gusci chiusi né frammenti di guscio.","image_url":"/recetas/pasta-frutos-del-mar/paso-07.webp","image_alt":"Pasta ai frutti di mare con pomodoro: Finisci la pasta nella salsa"},{"title":"Servi subito e raffredda gli avanzi","content":"Dividi in 4 piatti distribuendo allo stesso modo pasta e tre tipi di frutti di mare. Servi immediatamente; il calore prolungato indurisce gamberi e calamaro. Togli i gusci prima di conservare avanzi, dividi in piccoli contenitori e refrigera a 4 °C o meno entro 2 ore, o 1 ora se l’ambiente supera 32 °C. Si propone di consumare entro 24 ore per la qualità; riscalda solo la porzione da mangiare mescolando fino ad almeno 74 °C in più punti. Non si propone di congelare il piatto assemblato perché pasta e frutti di mare perdono consistenza.","image_url":"/recetas/pasta-frutos-del-mar/paso-08.webp","image_alt":"Pasta ai frutti di mare con pomodoro: Servi subito e raffredda gli avanzi"}],"notes":"Il piatto comprende i tre tipi di frutti di mare; una miscela commerciale cambia quantità, procedimento e nutrizione. Compra cozze vive da fonte autorizzata e segui le istruzioni del fornitore per conservarle. Scegli gamberi crudi sgusciati e calamaro già pulito per pesi edibili. Aggiungere vino o formaggio cambia il calcolo. Regola la salsa con poca acqua di pasta per volta, non con tutta la tazza automaticamente. Non riutilizzare taglieri o ciotole del crudo senza lavarli. Contiene crostacei, molluschi e frumento; controlla anche etichette per altri ingredienti o tracce. Temperatura e segnali di cottura prevalgono sui tempi proposti.","nutrition":{"calories":544.4,"protein_g":35.3,"carbs_g":74.4,"fat_g":11.4,"saturated_fat_g":1.9,"fiber_g":5.0,"sugar_g":7.6,"sodium_mg":973.0,"estimated":true,"source":"USDA FoodData Central — SR Legacy (abril de 2018)","source_url":"https://fdc.nal.usda.gov/download-datasets/","inputs":[{"ingredient":"Spaghetti secchi","edible_grams":320,"fdc_id":169736,"fdc_description":"Pasta, dry, enriched","per_100g":{"sodium_mg":6.0,"sugar_g":2.67,"saturated_fat_g":0.277,"carbs_g":74.67,"calories":371.0,"fat_g":1.51,"fiber_g":3.2,"protein_g":13.04},"source_url":"https://fdc.nal.usda.gov/food-details/169736/nutrients"},{"ingredient":"Gamberi crudi sgusciati","edible_grams":250,"fdc_id":174210,"fdc_description":"Crustaceans, shrimp, mixed species, raw (may contain additives to retain moisture)","per_100g":{"fat_g":1.01,"carbs_g":0.91,"calories":71.0,"sugar_g":0.0,"sodium_mg":566.0,"protein_g":13.61,"saturated_fat_g":0.261,"fiber_g":0.0},"source_url":"https://fdc.nal.usda.gov/food-details/174210/nutrients"},{"ingredient":"Calamaro crudo pulito","edible_grams":250,"fdc_id":174223,"fdc_description":"Mollusks, squid, mixed species, raw","per_100g":{"sugar_g":0.0,"saturated_fat_g":0.358,"protein_g":15.58,"fiber_g":0.0,"sodium_mg":44.0,"fat_g":1.38,"carbs_g":3.08,"calories":92.0},"source_url":"https://fdc.nal.usda.gov/food-details/174223/nutrients"},{"ingredient":"Cozze vive con guscio","edible_grams":150,"fdc_id":174216,"fdc_description":"Mollusks, mussel, blue, raw","per_100g":{"sugar_g":0.0,"fat_g":2.24,"carbs_g":3.69,"calories":86.0,"saturated_fat_g":0.425,"fiber_g":0.0,"sodium_mg":286.0,"protein_g":11.9},"source_url":"https://fdc.nal.usda.gov/food-details/174216/nutrients"},{"ingredient":"Pomodori triturati in conserva","edible_grams":400,"fdc_id":170501,"fdc_description":"Tomatoes, crushed, canned","per_100g":{"sodium_mg":186.0,"fat_g":0.28,"carbs_g":7.29,"calories":32.0,"fiber_g":1.9,"protein_g":1.64,"saturated_fat_g":0.04,"sugar_g":4.4},"source_url":"https://fdc.nal.usda.gov/food-details/170501/nutrients"},{"ingredient":"Cipolla","edible_grams":100,"fdc_id":170000,"fdc_description":"Onions, raw","per_100g":{"sugar_g":4.24,"fat_g":0.1,"carbs_g":9.34,"calories":40.0,"saturated_fat_g":0.042,"protein_g":1.1,"fiber_g":1.7,"sodium_mg":4.0},"source_url":"https://fdc.nal.usda.gov/food-details/170000/nutrients"},{"ingredient":"Aglio","edible_grams":12,"fdc_id":169230,"fdc_description":"Garlic, raw","per_100g":{"carbs_g":33.06,"calories":149.0,"sugar_g":1.0,"saturated_fat_g":0.089,"fiber_g":2.1,"sodium_mg":17.0,"protein_g":6.36,"fat_g":0.5},"source_url":"https://fdc.nal.usda.gov/food-details/169230/nutrients"},{"ingredient":"Olio d’oliva","edible_grams":30,"fdc_id":171413,"fdc_description":"Oil, olive, salad or cooking","per_100g":{"fat_g":100.0,"carbs_g":0.0,"calories":884.0,"sodium_mg":2.0,"protein_g":0.0,"saturated_fat_g":13.808,"fiber_g":0.0,"sugar_g":0.0},"source_url":"https://fdc.nal.usda.gov/food-details/171413/nutrients"},{"ingredient":"Prezzemolo fresco","edible_grams":8,"fdc_id":170416,"fdc_description":"Parsley, fresh","per_100g":{"carbs_g":6.33,"calories":36.0,"fat_g":0.79,"protein_g":2.97,"fiber_g":3.3,"sodium_mg":56.0,"saturated_fat_g":0.132,"sugar_g":0.85},"source_url":"https://fdc.nal.usda.gov/food-details/170416/nutrients"},{"ingredient":"Sale","edible_grams":3,"fdc_id":173468,"fdc_description":"Salt, table","per_100g":{"fiber_g":0.0,"sodium_mg":38758.0,"saturated_fat_g":0.0,"protein_g":0.0,"fat_g":0.0,"carbs_g":0.0,"calories":0.0,"sugar_g":0.0},"source_url":"https://fdc.nal.usda.gov/food-details/173468/nutrients"}],"serving_size":"1 di 4 piatti, senza gusci","method":"Dieci schede USDA verificate, peso secco della pasta e crudo edibile dei frutti di mare, totale diviso per 4. Resa proposta delle cozze: 150 g di carne da 600 g con guscio, pari al 25%, da pesare in cucina. Gamberi e calamaro approssimati con schede di specie miste; cozze con cozza blu cruda. Olio, pomodoro e sale di salsa conteggiati interamente. Pasta in acqua senza sale; acqua scolata e gusci esclusi.","note":"Stima informativa, non analisi del piatto finito. Resa reale delle cozze, scarti, specie, possibili additivi dei gamberi e marche modificano i valori. Formaggio, pane e vino esclusi; il liquido delle cozze può apportare sali non interamente rappresentati dalla resa proposta."},"keywords":["pasta ai frutti di mare","spaghetti ai frutti di mare","pasta gamberi calamari cozze"],"image_url":"/recetas/pasta-frutos-del-mar/portada.webp","gallery":[{"url":"/recetas/pasta-frutos-del-mar/portada.webp","alt":"Spaghetti al pomodoro con gamberi sgusciati, anelli di calamaro, cozze aperte e prezzemolo"}],"seo":{"title":"Pasta ai frutti di mare con pomodoro","description":"Pasta ai frutti di mare per 4 con gamberi, calamari e cozze: salsa di pomodoro, cotture separate e passaggi per finire gli spaghetti.","image_alt":"Spaghetti al pomodoro con gamberi sgusciati, anelli di calamaro, cozze aperte e prezzemolo","image_variants":["/recetas/pasta-frutos-del-mar/portada-1x1.webp","/recetas/pasta-frutos-del-mar/portada-4x3.webp","/recetas/pasta-frutos-del-mar/portada-16x9.webp"],"faq":[{"q":"Che cosa faccio con le cozze che non si aprono?","a":"Scarta quelle ancora chiuse dopo la cottura senza forzarle per aggiungerle. Prima di cuocere scarta anche gusci rotti e cozze aperte che non si chiudono con un leggero colpo."},{"q":"Posso usare frutti di mare congelati?","a":"Per gamberi e calamaro scongela in frigorifero prima di iniziare e pesa sgusciati o puliti. Lo scongelamento non rientra nei 50 minuti. Questa proposta usa cozze vive con guscio, non una sostituzione diretta con cozze congelate."},{"q":"Come evito pasta asciutta?","a":"Conserva 150 ml d’acqua di pasta e aggiungi solo il necessario a incrementi di 30 ml durante la finitura nella salsa. Rimetti i frutti di mare alla fine per evitare un riscaldamento prolungato."}]},"published":false,"editorial_status":"draft","content_html":"<p>Questa pasta ai frutti di mare unisce spaghetti, gamberi, calamari e cozze in una salsa breve di pomodoro, aglio, cipolla e prezzemolo. Le cozze si aprono a parte per filtrare il liquido; gli altri frutti di mare cuociono nella salsa e si tengono da parte mentre la pasta termina la cottura.</p><p>La proposta rende 4 piatti e stima 25 minuti di preparazione e 25 di cottura, 50 in totale, con acqua, pasta e cozze in parallelo quando possibile. Quantità, tempi e resa attendono una prova in cucina. La nutrizione ipotizza 150 g di carne edibile da 600 g di cozze con guscio; la resa reale va pesata.</p>"},{"id":"18ed6abc-f549-5a55-8729-5b22f86c1860","recipe_group_id":"00a8928a-742e-4878-ba98-0539334c3530","slug":"seafood-pasta","public_path":"/ja/seafood-pasta","source_url":null,"language":"ja","title":"魚介とトマトソースのスパゲッティ","excerpt":"えび、いか、ムール貝を使う4人分の魚介パスタ。トマトソース、魚介の段階的な加熱、スパゲッティの仕上げを順に紹介します。","summary":"スパゲッティ、えび、いか、ムール貝を、トマト、にんにく、玉ねぎ、パセリの短時間のソースでまとめる魚介パスタです。ムール貝は別鍋で開いて煮汁をこし、ほかの魚介はソースで加熱して取り出し、パスタの仕上げを待ちます。\n\n4皿分を想定し、準備25分、調理25分、合計50分が推定です。可能な範囲で湯、パスタ、ムール貝を並行して加熱します。分量、時間、出来上がり量は調理試作による確認前です。栄養計算では殻付きムール貝600 gから可食部150 gを想定し、実際の歩留まりは計量が必要です。","category":"パスタ","category_slug":"pastas","difficulty":"中級","course":"主菜","cuisine":"地中海料理の家庭向け提案","prep_time_minutes":25,"cook_time_minutes":25,"total_time_minutes":50,"servings":4,"ingredients":[{"name":"乾燥スパゲッティ","amount":"320","unit":"g","group":"パスタと魚介"},{"name":"生のむきえび","amount":"250","unit":"g","group":"パスタと魚介"},{"name":"下処理済みの生いか","amount":"250","unit":"g","group":"パスタと魚介"},{"name":"生きた殻付きムール貝","amount":"600","unit":"g","group":"パスタと魚介"},{"name":"缶詰の粉砕トマト","amount":"400","unit":"g","group":"ソース"},{"name":"玉ねぎ","amount":"100","unit":"g","group":"ソース"},{"name":"にんにく","amount":"12","unit":"g","group":"ソース"},{"name":"オリーブオイル","amount":"30","unit":"g","group":"ソース"},{"name":"生のパセリ","amount":"8","unit":"g","group":"ソース"},{"name":"塩","amount":"3","unit":"g","group":"ソース"},{"name":"パスタ用の水、塩なし","amount":"3000","unit":"ml","group":"加熱用"},{"name":"ムール貝を蒸す水","amount":"100","unit":"ml","group":"加熱用"}],"steps":[{"title":"魚介を下処理して確認する","content":"殻と背わたを取り除いた生えび250 g、下処理済みの生いか250 gを使います。いかの胴は皮と内臓を除き、足からはくちばしを除きます。胴を幅約0.5 cmの輪切りにし、大きな足は分けます。認可された販売元の生きた殻付きムール貝600 gを確認し、割れた貝や軽くたたいても閉じない開いた貝は捨てます。冷水を流しながらこすり、加熱直前に足糸を除きます。真水に漬けたままにしません。ソースを作る間、魚介は分けて4 °C以下で冷蔵します。えびやいかが冷凍なら先に冷蔵庫で解凍します。その待ち時間は50分に含めません。","image_url":"/recetas/pasta-frutos-del-mar/paso-01.webp","image_alt":"魚介とトマトソースのスパゲッティ: 魚介を下処理して確認する"},{"title":"香味野菜を刻み湯を沸かす","content":"生魚介とは別の清潔なまな板で玉ねぎ100 g、にんにく12 gを刻みます。パセリ8 gを洗って刻みます。大きめの鍋にパスタ用の水3リットルを入れ、塩を加えず沸騰させます。味付けはソース側で行います。ムール貝用のふた付き鍋とソース用の大きなフライパンも用意します。生魚介に触れたら手と器具を洗い、加熱済み魚介には清潔なボウルを使います。","image_url":"/recetas/pasta-frutos-del-mar/paso-02.webp","image_alt":"魚介とトマトソースのスパゲッティ: 香味野菜を刻み湯を沸かす"},{"title":"短時間のトマトソースを作る","content":"フライパンでオイル30 gを中火に温めます。玉ねぎを5分、焦がさず柔らかくなるまで炒めます。にんにくを加えて1分混ぜます。粉砕トマト400 gを加え、混ぜながら穏やかに8分煮て、水分と生っぽい味を減らします。弱火で温かく保ちます。14分は目安で、乾燥や焦げつきを避けます。","image_url":"/recetas/pasta-frutos-del-mar/paso-03.webp","image_alt":"魚介とトマトソースのスパゲッティ: 短時間のトマトソースを作る"},{"title":"ムール貝を蒸して開く","content":"ソースを作る間にムール貝用の鍋で水100 mlを沸かします。洗ったムール貝を入れてふたをし、約4–5分加熱して途中で1回慎重に鍋をゆすります。開いた貝を清潔なボウルに取り、最後まで閉じたものは無理に開けず捨てます。煮汁を最大100 ml取り、清潔なガーゼを敷いた細かいこし器で砂を除いてソースへ加えます。一部の貝は盛り付け用に殻に残し、残りは清潔な器具で身を外します。皿を仕上げる短い間だけ取り置きます。","image_url":"/recetas/pasta-frutos-del-mar/paso-04.webp","image_alt":"魚介とトマトソースのスパゲッティ: ムール貝を蒸して開く"},{"title":"えびといかを加熱する","content":"ソースを穏やかに沸かし、えび250 gといか250 gを加えます。混ぜながら約3–4分、えびが引き締まり不透明になり、いかの半透明感がなくなるまで加熱します。細い温度計のプローブで厚い部分が少なくとも63 °Cに達することを確認し、足りなければ加熱を続け再測定します。大きさと開始温度で時間は変わります。パスタの仕上げ中に加熱が続かないよう、魚介を別の清潔なボウルへ取り出します。生魚介のボウルは使いません。","image_url":"/recetas/pasta-frutos-del-mar/paso-05.webp","image_alt":"魚介とトマトソースのスパゲッティ: えびといかを加熱する"},{"title":"パスタをゆでて湯を取り分ける","content":"この工程が魚介の加熱終了に近づくよう開始時点を調整します。パスタは並行してゆでられます。スパゲッティ320 gを塩なしの沸騰した湯に入れ、最初に混ぜてほぐし、袋のアルデンテ表示より2分短くゆでます。ソースで仕上げます。湯を切る前にゆで汁150 mlをカップに取り、水洗いせず湯を切ります。パスタや魚介に時間が必要なら合計時間を延長し、不十分な加熱を急いで終わらせません。","image_url":"/recetas/pasta-frutos-del-mar/paso-06.webp","image_alt":"魚介とトマトソースのスパゲッティ: パスタをゆでて湯を取り分ける"},{"title":"ソースでパスタを仕上げる","content":"湯を切ったスパゲッティをソースへ加え、中火で約2分混ぜてアルデンテに仕上げます。ソースがパスタに絡み、底にたまらないよう、必要な分だけゆで汁を30 mlずつ足します。最後の30秒にえび、いか、ムール貝、パセリを戻し、崩さないよう優しく混ぜて温めます。清潔な器具で味見し、予定の塩3 gを加えます。貝の煮汁で十分塩味があるなら減らしますが、推定ナトリウム量も変わります。閉じた貝や殻の破片は加えません。","image_url":"/recetas/pasta-frutos-del-mar/paso-07.webp","image_alt":"魚介とトマトソースのスパゲッティ: ソースでパスタを仕上げる"},{"title":"すぐに盛り付け残りを冷蔵する","content":"パスタと3種類の魚介を均等に分けて4皿に盛り、すぐに食べます。加熱が長いとえびやいかが硬くなります。残りは殻を除いて小さい容器に分け、2時間以内、室温が32 °Cを超えるなら1時間以内に4 °C以下で冷蔵します。品質のため24時間以内に食べることを提案します。食べる分だけ取り、混ぜながら複数箇所で少なくとも74 °Cまで再加熱します。組み立てた皿の冷凍はパスタと魚介の食感が変わるため提案していません。","image_url":"/recetas/pasta-frutos-del-mar/paso-08.webp","image_alt":"魚介とトマトソースのスパゲッティ: すぐに盛り付け残りを冷蔵する"}],"notes":"この皿は3種類の魚介を含みます。市販のシーフードミックスへの置き換えは分量、工程、栄養値が変わります。認可された販売元から生きたムール貝を買い、販売元の保存指示に従います。生のむきえびと下処理済みいかを使い、重量を可食部にそろえます。ワインやチーズを足すと同じ栄養計算は使えません。ソースの調整にはゆで汁を少しずつ使い、カップ全量を必ず加えるわけではありません。生魚介用まな板やボウルは洗わず再使用しません。甲殻類、軟体動物、小麦を含みます。その他の原材料や混入の表示も確認します。推定時間より温度と加熱状態の確認を優先します。","nutrition":{"calories":544.4,"protein_g":35.3,"carbs_g":74.4,"fat_g":11.4,"saturated_fat_g":1.9,"fiber_g":5.0,"sugar_g":7.6,"sodium_mg":973.0,"estimated":true,"source":"USDA FoodData Central — SR Legacy (abril de 2018)","source_url":"https://fdc.nal.usda.gov/download-datasets/","inputs":[{"ingredient":"乾燥スパゲッティ","edible_grams":320,"fdc_id":169736,"fdc_description":"Pasta, dry, enriched","per_100g":{"sodium_mg":6.0,"sugar_g":2.67,"saturated_fat_g":0.277,"carbs_g":74.67,"calories":371.0,"fat_g":1.51,"fiber_g":3.2,"protein_g":13.04},"source_url":"https://fdc.nal.usda.gov/food-details/169736/nutrients"},{"ingredient":"生のむきえび","edible_grams":250,"fdc_id":174210,"fdc_description":"Crustaceans, shrimp, mixed species, raw (may contain additives to retain moisture)","per_100g":{"fat_g":1.01,"carbs_g":0.91,"calories":71.0,"sugar_g":0.0,"sodium_mg":566.0,"protein_g":13.61,"saturated_fat_g":0.261,"fiber_g":0.0},"source_url":"https://fdc.nal.usda.gov/food-details/174210/nutrients"},{"ingredient":"下処理済みの生いか","edible_grams":250,"fdc_id":174223,"fdc_description":"Mollusks, squid, mixed species, raw","per_100g":{"sugar_g":0.0,"saturated_fat_g":0.358,"protein_g":15.58,"fiber_g":0.0,"sodium_mg":44.0,"fat_g":1.38,"carbs_g":3.08,"calories":92.0},"source_url":"https://fdc.nal.usda.gov/food-details/174223/nutrients"},{"ingredient":"生きた殻付きムール貝","edible_grams":150,"fdc_id":174216,"fdc_description":"Mollusks, mussel, blue, raw","per_100g":{"sugar_g":0.0,"fat_g":2.24,"carbs_g":3.69,"calories":86.0,"saturated_fat_g":0.425,"fiber_g":0.0,"sodium_mg":286.0,"protein_g":11.9},"source_url":"https://fdc.nal.usda.gov/food-details/174216/nutrients"},{"ingredient":"缶詰の粉砕トマト","edible_grams":400,"fdc_id":170501,"fdc_description":"Tomatoes, crushed, canned","per_100g":{"sodium_mg":186.0,"fat_g":0.28,"carbs_g":7.29,"calories":32.0,"fiber_g":1.9,"protein_g":1.64,"saturated_fat_g":0.04,"sugar_g":4.4},"source_url":"https://fdc.nal.usda.gov/food-details/170501/nutrients"},{"ingredient":"玉ねぎ","edible_grams":100,"fdc_id":170000,"fdc_description":"Onions, raw","per_100g":{"sugar_g":4.24,"fat_g":0.1,"carbs_g":9.34,"calories":40.0,"saturated_fat_g":0.042,"protein_g":1.1,"fiber_g":1.7,"sodium_mg":4.0},"source_url":"https://fdc.nal.usda.gov/food-details/170000/nutrients"},{"ingredient":"にんにく","edible_grams":12,"fdc_id":169230,"fdc_description":"Garlic, raw","per_100g":{"carbs_g":33.06,"calories":149.0,"sugar_g":1.0,"saturated_fat_g":0.089,"fiber_g":2.1,"sodium_mg":17.0,"protein_g":6.36,"fat_g":0.5},"source_url":"https://fdc.nal.usda.gov/food-details/169230/nutrients"},{"ingredient":"オリーブオイル","edible_grams":30,"fdc_id":171413,"fdc_description":"Oil, olive, salad or cooking","per_100g":{"fat_g":100.0,"carbs_g":0.0,"calories":884.0,"sodium_mg":2.0,"protein_g":0.0,"saturated_fat_g":13.808,"fiber_g":0.0,"sugar_g":0.0},"source_url":"https://fdc.nal.usda.gov/food-details/171413/nutrients"},{"ingredient":"生のパセリ","edible_grams":8,"fdc_id":170416,"fdc_description":"Parsley, fresh","per_100g":{"carbs_g":6.33,"calories":36.0,"fat_g":0.79,"protein_g":2.97,"fiber_g":3.3,"sodium_mg":56.0,"saturated_fat_g":0.132,"sugar_g":0.85},"source_url":"https://fdc.nal.usda.gov/food-details/170416/nutrients"},{"ingredient":"塩","edible_grams":3,"fdc_id":173468,"fdc_description":"Salt, table","per_100g":{"fiber_g":0.0,"sodium_mg":38758.0,"saturated_fat_g":0.0,"protein_g":0.0,"fat_g":0.0,"carbs_g":0.0,"calories":0.0,"sugar_g":0.0},"source_url":"https://fdc.nal.usda.gov/food-details/173468/nutrients"}],"serving_size":"4皿のうち1皿、殻を除く","method":"確認済みUSDA資料10件を使い、パスタは乾燥重量、魚介は生の可食重量で合計を4で割っています。ムール貝は殻付き600 gから身150 g、25%の歩留まりを提案しており、調理時の計量前です。えびといかは混合種の資料、ムール貝は生のブルームール貝の資料で近似します。油、トマト、ソースの塩は全量計上。パスタは無塩の湯でゆで、捨てる湯と殻を除外しています。","note":"情報用の推定で完成品の分析値ではありません。貝の実際の歩留まり、廃棄、種類、えびの添加物の有無、製品により変わります。チーズ、パン、ワインは除外。貝の煮汁には提案歩留まりに完全には反映されない塩分が含まれる場合があります。"},"keywords":["魚介のパスタ","シーフードスパゲッティ","えびいかムール貝のパスタ"],"image_url":"/recetas/pasta-frutos-del-mar/portada.webp","gallery":[{"url":"/recetas/pasta-frutos-del-mar/portada.webp","alt":"トマトソースのスパゲッティにむきえび、いかの輪切り、開いたムール貝、パセリ"}],"seo":{"title":"魚介とトマトソースのスパゲッティ","description":"えび、いか、ムール貝を使う4人分の魚介パスタ。トマトソース、魚介の段階的な加熱、スパゲッティの仕上げを順に紹介します。","image_alt":"トマトソースのスパゲッティにむきえび、いかの輪切り、開いたムール貝、パセリ","image_variants":["/recetas/pasta-frutos-del-mar/portada-1x1.webp","/recetas/pasta-frutos-del-mar/portada-4x3.webp","/recetas/pasta-frutos-del-mar/portada-16x9.webp"],"faq":[{"q":"開かないムール貝はどうしますか？","a":"加熱後も閉じた貝は無理に開いて加えず捨てます。加熱前にも割れた貝や軽くたたいても閉じない開いた貝を除きます。"},{"q":"冷凍の魚介を使えますか？","a":"えびといかは開始前に冷蔵庫で解凍し、殻や内臓を除いた重量で量ります。解凍は50分に含めません。この提案は生きた殻付きムール貝を使い、冷凍ムール貝へ直接置き換えるものではありません。"},{"q":"パスタが乾くのを防ぐには？","a":"ゆで汁150 mlを取り、ソースで仕上げるときに必要な分だけ30 mlずつ足します。魚介は最後に戻し、長い再加熱を避けます。"}]},"published":false,"editorial_status":"draft","content_html":"<p>スパゲッティ、えび、いか、ムール貝を、トマト、にんにく、玉ねぎ、パセリの短時間のソースでまとめる魚介パスタです。ムール貝は別鍋で開いて煮汁をこし、ほかの魚介はソースで加熱して取り出し、パスタの仕上げを待ちます。</p><p>4皿分を想定し、準備25分、調理25分、合計50分が推定です。可能な範囲で湯、パスタ、ムール貝を並行して加熱します。分量、時間、出来上がり量は調理試作による確認前です。栄養計算では殻付きムール貝600 gから可食部150 gを想定し、実際の歩留まりは計量が必要です。</p>"},{"id":"f8e8cb7e-40b5-59a5-a725-84dbeb0af169","recipe_group_id":"00a8928a-742e-4878-ba98-0539334c3530","slug":"massa-com-frutos-do-mar","public_path":"/pt/massa-com-frutos-do-mar","source_url":null,"language":"pt","title":"Massa com frutos do mar e tomate","excerpt":"Massa com frutos do mar para 4 com camarão, lula e mexilhões: molho de tomate, cozimento por etapas e passos para terminar o espaguete.","summary":"Esta massa combina espaguete, camarão, lula e mexilhões em um molho rápido de tomate, alho, cebola e salsinha. Os mexilhões são abertos à parte para coar o líquido; os outros frutos do mar cozinham no molho e ficam reservados enquanto a massa termina de cozinhar.\n\nA proposta rende 4 pratos e estima 25 minutos de preparo e 25 de cozimento, 50 no total, com água, massa e mexilhões em paralelo quando possível. Quantidades, tempos e rendimento aguardam teste de cozinha. A nutrição propõe 150 g de carne comestível a partir de 600 g de mexilhões com concha; o rendimento real precisa ser pesado.","category":"Massas","category_slug":"pastas","difficulty":"Média","course":"Prato principal","cuisine":"Mediterrânea, proposta caseira","prep_time_minutes":25,"cook_time_minutes":25,"total_time_minutes":50,"servings":4,"ingredients":[{"name":"Espaguete seco","amount":"320","unit":"g","group":"Massa e frutos do mar"},{"name":"Camarão cru sem casca","amount":"250","unit":"g","group":"Massa e frutos do mar"},{"name":"Lula crua limpa","amount":"250","unit":"g","group":"Massa e frutos do mar"},{"name":"Mexilhões vivos com concha","amount":"600","unit":"g","group":"Massa e frutos do mar"},{"name":"Tomate triturado em conserva","amount":"400","unit":"g","group":"Molho"},{"name":"Cebola","amount":"100","unit":"g","group":"Molho"},{"name":"Alho","amount":"12","unit":"g","group":"Molho"},{"name":"Azeite de oliva","amount":"30","unit":"g","group":"Molho"},{"name":"Salsinha fresca","amount":"8","unit":"g","group":"Molho"},{"name":"Sal","amount":"3","unit":"g","group":"Molho"},{"name":"Água para a massa, sem sal","amount":"3000","unit":"ml","group":"Cozimento"},{"name":"Água para abrir os mexilhões","amount":"100","unit":"ml","group":"Cozimento"}],"steps":[{"title":"Limpe e confira os frutos do mar","content":"Use 250 g de camarão cru já sem casca e sem intestino e 250 g de lula limpa: corpo sem pele nem vísceras, tentáculos sem bico. Corte o corpo em anéis de cerca de 0,5 cm e divida os tentáculos grandes. Confira os 600 g de mexilhões vivos com concha de fornecedor autorizado: descarte conchas quebradas e os abertos que não se fecharem com uma batida leve. Escove sob água fria e retire as barbas pouco antes de cozinhar; não os deixe submersos em água doce. Mantenha os frutos do mar separados e refrigerados a 4 °C ou menos enquanto faz o molho. Se camarão ou lula estiverem congelados, descongele antes na geladeira; essa espera não entra nos 50 minutos.","image_url":"/recetas/pasta-frutos-del-mar/paso-01.webp","image_alt":"Massa com frutos do mar e tomate: Limpe e confira os frutos do mar"},{"title":"Pique os aromáticos e aqueça a água","content":"Pique os 100 g de cebola e os 12 g de alho em uma tábua limpa diferente daquela dos frutos do mar crus. Lave e pique os 8 g de salsinha. Coloque os 3 litros de água para massa em uma panela grande e leve à fervura sem sal: o tempero vai no molho. Prepare outra panela com tampa para mexilhões e uma frigideira grande para o molho. Lave mãos e utensílios após tocar frutos do mar crus; use uma tigela limpa para os cozidos.","image_url":"/recetas/pasta-frutos-del-mar/paso-02.webp","image_alt":"Massa com frutos do mar e tomate: Pique os aromáticos e aqueça a água"},{"title":"Faça um molho rápido de tomate","content":"Aqueça os 30 g de azeite na frigideira em fogo médio. Refogue a cebola 5 minutos até amaciar sem queimar. Acrescente o alho e mexa 1 minuto. Junte os 400 g de tomate triturado e cozinhe em fervura suave 8 minutos, mexendo, até perder parte da água e do sabor muito cru. Mantenha quente em fogo baixo. Os 14 minutos são uma referência; evite que seque ou grude.","image_url":"/recetas/pasta-frutos-del-mar/paso-03.webp","image_alt":"Massa com frutos do mar e tomate: Faça um molho rápido de tomate"},{"title":"Abra os mexilhões no vapor","content":"Enquanto faz o molho, ferva os 100 ml de água na panela de mexilhões. Acrescente os limpos, tampe e cozinhe por cerca de 4–5 minutos, sacudindo a panela cuidadosamente uma vez. Retire os abertos para uma tigela limpa; descarte os ainda fechados no final sem forçar a abertura. Guarde até 100 ml do líquido e passe por peneira fina com gaze limpa para retirar areia; acrescente ao molho. Deixe alguns nas conchas para servir e retire a carne dos outros com utensílios limpos. Reserve só enquanto termina o prato.","image_url":"/recetas/pasta-frutos-del-mar/paso-04.webp","image_alt":"Massa com frutos do mar e tomate: Abra os mexilhões no vapor"},{"title":"Cozinhe camarão e lula","content":"Leve o molho à fervura suave e acrescente os 250 g de camarão e os 250 g de lula. Cozinhe cerca de 3–4 minutos, mexendo, até o camarão ficar firme e opaco e a lula perder a transparência. Com uma sonda fina confira pelo menos 63 °C nas partes mais grossas; se faltar temperatura, continue e meça novamente. O tempo depende do tamanho e da temperatura inicial. Retire os frutos do mar cozidos para outra tigela limpa para não continuarem cozinhando enquanto a massa termina. Não use a tigela dos crus.","image_url":"/recetas/pasta-frutos-del-mar/paso-05.webp","image_alt":"Massa com frutos do mar e tomate: Cozinhe camarão e lula"},{"title":"Cozinhe a massa e reserve água","content":"Calcule o início para terminar esta etapa perto dos frutos do mar, pois a massa pode cozinhar em paralelo. Coloque os 320 g de espaguete na água fervente sem sal, mexa no começo para separar e cozinhe 2 minutos menos que o tempo al dente indicado na embalagem: terminará no molho. Antes de escorrer, guarde 150 ml da água em uma xícara. Escorra sem enxaguar. Se massa ou frutos do mar precisarem de mais tempo, aumente o total; não apresse um cozimento insuficiente.","image_url":"/recetas/pasta-frutos-del-mar/paso-06.webp","image_alt":"Massa com frutos do mar e tomate: Cozinhe a massa e reserve água"},{"title":"Termine a massa no molho","content":"Acrescente o espaguete escorrido ao molho e misture em fogo médio por cerca de 2 minutos até ficar al dente. Adicione água reservada de 30 em 30 ml só se necessário para o molho envolver a massa sem poça. Nos últimos 30 segundos incorpore camarão, lula, mexilhões e salsinha com cuidado para aquecer sem desfazer. Prove com utensílio limpo e acrescente os 3 g de sal previstos, ou menos se o líquido de mexilhão já salgar bastante; menos sal altera o sódio estimado. Não acrescente conchas fechadas nem fragmentos de concha.","image_url":"/recetas/pasta-frutos-del-mar/paso-07.webp","image_alt":"Massa com frutos do mar e tomate: Termine a massa no molho"},{"title":"Sirva na hora e refrigere as sobras","content":"Divida em 4 pratos distribuindo igualmente a massa e os três tipos de frutos do mar. Sirva imediatamente; calor prolongado endurece camarão e lula. Retire as conchas antes de guardar sobras, divida em recipientes pequenos e refrigere a 4 °C ou menos em até 2 horas, ou 1 hora se o ambiente passar de 32 °C. Propõe-se consumir em 24 horas por qualidade; reaqueça só a porção que vai comer, mexendo até pelo menos 74 °C em vários pontos. Não se propõe congelar o prato montado, pois massa e frutos do mar perdem textura.","image_url":"/recetas/pasta-frutos-del-mar/paso-08.webp","image_alt":"Massa com frutos do mar e tomate: Sirva na hora e refrigere as sobras"}],"notes":"A identidade do prato inclui os três tipos de frutos do mar; uma mistura comercial muda quantidades, preparo e nutrição. Compre mexilhões vivos de origem autorizada e siga as instruções de conservação do fornecedor. Escolha camarão cru sem casca e lula já limpa para que os pesos sejam comestíveis. Acrescentar vinho ou queijo muda o cálculo. Ajuste o molho com pequenas quantidades de água da massa, não com a xícara inteira obrigatoriamente. Não reutilize tábuas ou tigelas dos crus sem lavar. Contém crustáceos, moluscos e trigo; confira também rótulos para outros ingredientes ou traços. Temperatura e sinais de cozimento prevalecem sobre o tempo proposto.","nutrition":{"calories":544.4,"protein_g":35.3,"carbs_g":74.4,"fat_g":11.4,"saturated_fat_g":1.9,"fiber_g":5.0,"sugar_g":7.6,"sodium_mg":973.0,"estimated":true,"source":"USDA FoodData Central — SR Legacy (abril de 2018)","source_url":"https://fdc.nal.usda.gov/download-datasets/","inputs":[{"ingredient":"Espaguete seco","edible_grams":320,"fdc_id":169736,"fdc_description":"Pasta, dry, enriched","per_100g":{"sodium_mg":6.0,"sugar_g":2.67,"saturated_fat_g":0.277,"carbs_g":74.67,"calories":371.0,"fat_g":1.51,"fiber_g":3.2,"protein_g":13.04},"source_url":"https://fdc.nal.usda.gov/food-details/169736/nutrients"},{"ingredient":"Camarão cru sem casca","edible_grams":250,"fdc_id":174210,"fdc_description":"Crustaceans, shrimp, mixed species, raw (may contain additives to retain moisture)","per_100g":{"fat_g":1.01,"carbs_g":0.91,"calories":71.0,"sugar_g":0.0,"sodium_mg":566.0,"protein_g":13.61,"saturated_fat_g":0.261,"fiber_g":0.0},"source_url":"https://fdc.nal.usda.gov/food-details/174210/nutrients"},{"ingredient":"Lula crua limpa","edible_grams":250,"fdc_id":174223,"fdc_description":"Mollusks, squid, mixed species, raw","per_100g":{"sugar_g":0.0,"saturated_fat_g":0.358,"protein_g":15.58,"fiber_g":0.0,"sodium_mg":44.0,"fat_g":1.38,"carbs_g":3.08,"calories":92.0},"source_url":"https://fdc.nal.usda.gov/food-details/174223/nutrients"},{"ingredient":"Mexilhões vivos com concha","edible_grams":150,"fdc_id":174216,"fdc_description":"Mollusks, mussel, blue, raw","per_100g":{"sugar_g":0.0,"fat_g":2.24,"carbs_g":3.69,"calories":86.0,"saturated_fat_g":0.425,"fiber_g":0.0,"sodium_mg":286.0,"protein_g":11.9},"source_url":"https://fdc.nal.usda.gov/food-details/174216/nutrients"},{"ingredient":"Tomate triturado em conserva","edible_grams":400,"fdc_id":170501,"fdc_description":"Tomatoes, crushed, canned","per_100g":{"sodium_mg":186.0,"fat_g":0.28,"carbs_g":7.29,"calories":32.0,"fiber_g":1.9,"protein_g":1.64,"saturated_fat_g":0.04,"sugar_g":4.4},"source_url":"https://fdc.nal.usda.gov/food-details/170501/nutrients"},{"ingredient":"Cebola","edible_grams":100,"fdc_id":170000,"fdc_description":"Onions, raw","per_100g":{"sugar_g":4.24,"fat_g":0.1,"carbs_g":9.34,"calories":40.0,"saturated_fat_g":0.042,"protein_g":1.1,"fiber_g":1.7,"sodium_mg":4.0},"source_url":"https://fdc.nal.usda.gov/food-details/170000/nutrients"},{"ingredient":"Alho","edible_grams":12,"fdc_id":169230,"fdc_description":"Garlic, raw","per_100g":{"carbs_g":33.06,"calories":149.0,"sugar_g":1.0,"saturated_fat_g":0.089,"fiber_g":2.1,"sodium_mg":17.0,"protein_g":6.36,"fat_g":0.5},"source_url":"https://fdc.nal.usda.gov/food-details/169230/nutrients"},{"ingredient":"Azeite de oliva","edible_grams":30,"fdc_id":171413,"fdc_description":"Oil, olive, salad or cooking","per_100g":{"fat_g":100.0,"carbs_g":0.0,"calories":884.0,"sodium_mg":2.0,"protein_g":0.0,"saturated_fat_g":13.808,"fiber_g":0.0,"sugar_g":0.0},"source_url":"https://fdc.nal.usda.gov/food-details/171413/nutrients"},{"ingredient":"Salsinha fresca","edible_grams":8,"fdc_id":170416,"fdc_description":"Parsley, fresh","per_100g":{"carbs_g":6.33,"calories":36.0,"fat_g":0.79,"protein_g":2.97,"fiber_g":3.3,"sodium_mg":56.0,"saturated_fat_g":0.132,"sugar_g":0.85},"source_url":"https://fdc.nal.usda.gov/food-details/170416/nutrients"},{"ingredient":"Sal","edible_grams":3,"fdc_id":173468,"fdc_description":"Salt, table","per_100g":{"fiber_g":0.0,"sodium_mg":38758.0,"saturated_fat_g":0.0,"protein_g":0.0,"fat_g":0.0,"carbs_g":0.0,"calories":0.0,"sugar_g":0.0},"source_url":"https://fdc.nal.usda.gov/food-details/173468/nutrients"}],"serving_size":"1 de 4 pratos, sem conchas","method":"Dez fichas USDA verificadas, peso seco da massa e cru comestível dos frutos do mar, total dividido por 4. Rendimento proposto de mexilhão: 150 g de carne a partir de 600 g com concha, equivalente a 25%, ainda a pesar em cozinha. Camarão e lula aproximados por fichas de espécies mistas; mexilhão por mexilhão azul cru. Azeite, tomate e sal do molho contados integralmente. Massa em água sem sal; água escorrida e conchas excluídas.","note":"Estimativa informativa, não análise do prato pronto. Rendimento real dos mexilhões, descartes, espécie, possíveis aditivos do camarão e marcas alteram os valores. Queijo, pão e vinho excluídos; o líquido de mexilhões pode acrescentar sais não totalmente refletidos pelo rendimento proposto."},"keywords":["massa com frutos do mar","espaguete com frutos do mar","massa com camarão lula e mexilhão"],"image_url":"/recetas/pasta-frutos-del-mar/portada.webp","gallery":[{"url":"/recetas/pasta-frutos-del-mar/portada.webp","alt":"Espaguete com molho de tomate, camarões sem casca, anéis de lula, mexilhões abertos e salsinha"}],"seo":{"title":"Massa com frutos do mar e tomate","description":"Massa com frutos do mar para 4 com camarão, lula e mexilhões: molho de tomate, cozimento por etapas e passos para terminar o espaguete.","image_alt":"Espaguete com molho de tomate, camarões sem casca, anéis de lula, mexilhões abertos e salsinha","image_variants":["/recetas/pasta-frutos-del-mar/portada-1x1.webp","/recetas/pasta-frutos-del-mar/portada-4x3.webp","/recetas/pasta-frutos-del-mar/portada-16x9.webp"],"faq":[{"q":"O que faço com mexilhões que não abrem?","a":"Descarte os ainda fechados depois de cozinhar sem forçá-los para acrescentar. Antes do cozimento descarte também conchas quebradas e os abertos que não se fecharem com toque suave."},{"q":"Posso usar frutos do mar congelados?","a":"Para camarão e lula, descongele na geladeira antes de começar e pese sem casca ou limpos. A descongelação não entra nos 50 minutos. Esta proposta usa mexilhões vivos com concha, não uma troca direta por mexilhão congelado."},{"q":"Como evito massa seca?","a":"Reserve 150 ml da água da massa e adicione de 30 em 30 ml só o necessário ao terminar o espaguete no molho. Devolva os frutos do mar no fim para evitar aquecimento prolongado."}]},"published":false,"editorial_status":"draft","content_html":"<p>Esta massa combina espaguete, camarão, lula e mexilhões em um molho rápido de tomate, alho, cebola e salsinha. Os mexilhões são abertos à parte para coar o líquido; os outros frutos do mar cozinham no molho e ficam reservados enquanto a massa termina de cozinhar.</p><p>A proposta rende 4 pratos e estima 25 minutos de preparo e 25 de cozimento, 50 no total, com água, massa e mexilhões em paralelo quando possível. Quantidades, tempos e rendimento aguardam teste de cozinha. A nutrição propõe 150 g de carne comestível a partir de 600 g de mexilhões com concha; o rendimento real precisa ser pesado.</p>"},{"id":"82997c99-0b32-42e0-8e22-1617a936c949","recipe_group_id":"e8238258-5fe1-4344-8851-917fa546f20b","slug":"receta-raviolis-caseros","public_path":"/receta-raviolis-caseros","source_url":"https://manualdecocina.com/receta-raviolis-caseros/","language":"es","title":"Raviolis caseros de ricotta y espinaca","excerpt":"Raviolis caseros de ricotta y espinaca para 4: masa fresca de huevo, sellado paso a paso y acabado de mantequilla con salvia.","summary":"Estos raviolis caseros combinan una masa fresca de huevo con un relleno espeso de ricotta, espinaca y parmesano. Se sellan en 24 unidades y se sirven con mantequilla avellanada y salvia, sin ocultar la técnica con una salsa pesada.\n\nLa propuesta rinde 4 porciones de 6 raviolis. Calcula 70 minutos de preparación y 20 de cocción, 90 en total; el escurrido, el reposo y parte de la preparación se solapan. Cantidades, espesor de la masa, tiempos y rendimiento están pendientes de una prueba de cocina.","category":"Pastas","category_slug":"pastas","difficulty":"Media","course":"Plato principal","cuisine":"Italiana, propuesta casera","prep_time_minutes":70,"cook_time_minutes":20,"total_time_minutes":90,"servings":4,"ingredients":[{"name":"harina de trigo de uso común","amount":"320","unit":"g","group":"Masa"},{"name":"huevos grandes, sin cáscara","amount":"3","unit":"unidades (aprox. 150 g)","group":"Masa"},{"name":"agua","amount":"15","unit":"ml, solo si hace falta","group":"Masa"},{"name":"ricotta de leche entera","amount":"300","unit":"g","group":"Relleno"},{"name":"espinaca fresca","amount":"200","unit":"g","group":"Relleno"},{"name":"queso parmesano finamente rallado","amount":"40","unit":"g","group":"Relleno"},{"name":"nuez moscada molida","amount":"0.5","unit":"g","group":"Relleno"},{"name":"sal fina","amount":"5","unit":"g, dividida","group":"Relleno y cocción"},{"name":"mantequilla sin sal","amount":"40","unit":"g","group":"Acabado"},{"name":"hojas de salvia fresca","amount":"6","unit":"g","group":"Acabado"},{"name":"agua para cocer","amount":"3000","unit":"ml","group":"Cocción"}],"steps":[{"title":"Escurre la ricotta","content":"Pon los 300 g de ricotta en un colador fino sobre un cuenco, tapa y deja escurrir 30 minutos en la nevera. No la dejes a temperatura ambiente. Presiona suavemente al final, sin convertirla en una pasta seca. Esta espera está incluida en los 70 minutos de preparación y puede solaparse con la masa y la espinaca.","image_url":"/recetas/receta-raviolis-caseros/paso-01.webp","image_alt":"Raviolis caseros: escurre la ricotta"},{"title":"Cocina y seca la espinaca","content":"Lava los 200 g de espinaca y pásala a una sartén amplia aún húmeda. Cocina a fuego medio 2–3 minutos, moviendo, hasta que se marchite. Extiéndela en un plato limpio para que pierda calor; cuando se pueda manipular, exprímela con las manos limpias o un paño limpio hasta retirar la mayor cantidad de agua posible y pícala fina. La espinaca húmeda puede abrir los raviolis.","image_url":"/recetas/receta-raviolis-caseros/paso-02.webp","image_alt":"Raviolis caseros: cocina y seca la espinaca"},{"title":"Mezcla la masa","content":"Forma un hueco en 300 g de la harina y añade los 3 huevos, aproximadamente 150 g sin cáscara. Bate los huevos con tenedor y ve incorporando harina desde el borde. Amasa hasta reunir una masa firme; añade el agua de 5 en 5 ml solo si quedan partes secas después de varios minutos. Reserva los 20 g restantes de harina para la mesa y la bandeja. La absorción varía: no añadas toda el agua por obligación.","image_url":"/recetas/receta-raviolis-caseros/paso-03.webp","image_alt":"Raviolis caseros: mezcla la masa"},{"title":"Amasa y deja reposar","content":"Amasa 8–10 minutos sobre una superficie limpia hasta que la masa se vea lisa y recupere lentamente la forma al presionarla. Envuelve bien para que no se seque y deja reposar 30 minutos a temperatura ambiente fresca. Limpia la mesa y los utensilios que tocaron huevo crudo antes de preparar el relleno o manipular raviolis cocidos.","image_url":"/recetas/receta-raviolis-caseros/paso-04.webp","image_alt":"Raviolis caseros: amasa y deja reposar"},{"title":"Prepara un relleno seco","content":"Mezcla la ricotta escurrida, la espinaca picada, los 40 g de parmesano, 0,5 g de nuez moscada y 2 g de la sal. Debe quedar espeso y mantener la forma de una cucharadita. Divide visualmente en 24 porciones de unos 20 g; si se extiende o suelta líquido, refrigera 10 minutos y vuelve a comprobar. No añadas huevo al relleno de esta propuesta.","image_url":"/recetas/receta-raviolis-caseros/paso-05.webp","image_alt":"Raviolis caseros: prepara un relleno seco"},{"title":"Estira, rellena y sella","content":"Divide la masa en 4 partes y mantén 3 envueltas. Estira una parte con máquina o rodillo hasta una lámina fina de aproximadamente 1 mm; evita agujeros. Coloca 6 porciones de relleno separadas, humedece apenas el contorno con agua y cubre con otra mitad de la lámina. Expulsa el aire desde el relleno hacia fuera y presiona para sellar. Corta 6 raviolis y revisa cada borde. Repite hasta obtener 24; ponlos en bandeja con parte de la harina reservada, sin apilar. Cocina enseguida o refrigera tapados un máximo propuesto de 2 horas antes de cocer.","image_url":"/recetas/receta-raviolis-caseros/paso-06.webp","image_alt":"Raviolis caseros: estira, rellena y sella"},{"title":"Cuece los raviolis por tandas","content":"Hierve los 3 litros de agua con los 3 g de sal restantes. Mientras, derrite los 40 g de mantequilla a fuego medio-bajo con las hojas de salvia hasta que la mantequilla huela a avellana y los sólidos estén dorados, no negros; retira del fuego. Cuece los raviolis en 2 tandas para que no se peguen: remueve con suavidad y cuenta 3–5 minutos desde que el agua recupere un hervor moderado. Abre uno de prueba de la primera tanda: la pasta debe estar tierna, el sello cocido y el centro alcanzar al menos 71 °C. Si no, prolonga y vuelve a comprobar con un ravioli nuevo.","image_url":"/recetas/receta-raviolis-caseros/paso-07.webp","image_alt":"Raviolis caseros: cuece los raviolis por tandas"},{"title":"Termina, sirve y guarda","content":"Saca los raviolis con espumadera, deja escurrir unos segundos y pásalos a la sartén de mantequilla y salvia. Mueve con cuidado 30–60 segundos para cubrirlos sin romperlos. Reparte 6 raviolis por persona y sirve de inmediato. Refrigera las sobras en recipientes bajos a 4 °C o menos dentro de 2 horas, o 1 hora si el ambiente supera 32 °C; se propone consumirlas en 2 días. Recalienta solo una vez hasta 74 °C en el centro. No guardes sobrante de huevo crudo que haya tocado harina o utensilios sin higienizar.","image_url":"/recetas/receta-raviolis-caseros/paso-08.webp","image_alt":"Raviolis caseros: termina, sirve y guarda"}],"notes":"La masa y el relleno contienen trigo, huevo y lácteos. No se propone una sustitución sin gluten, sin huevo o sin lácteos dentro de esta ficha porque cambiaría hidratación, estructura y nutrición. La ricotta debe escurrirse en frío; la espinaca debe exprimirse bien. Si un ravioli tiene un borde abierto, reséllalo antes de cocer y no lo apiles. El espesor de 1 mm, el rendimiento de 24 unidades y los tiempos son objetivos editoriales pendientes de confirmación en cocina. Para congelar, coloca los raviolis crudos separados en bandeja hasta que estén firmes y pásalos a un recipiente; cocina desde congelados añadiendo tiempo y verifica al menos 71 °C en el centro. No descongeles a temperatura ambiente.","nutrition":{"calories":598.4,"protein_g":26.5,"carbs_g":65.8,"fat_g":24.9,"saturated_fat_g":14.3,"fiber_g":3.3,"sugar_g":0.9,"sodium_mg":761,"estimated":true,"serving_size":"6 raviolis de un total propuesto de 24, con una cuarta parte de la salsa","source":"USDA FoodData Central — SR Legacy (abril de 2018)","source_url":"https://fdc.nal.usda.gov/download-datasets/","method":"Ocho fichas SR Legacy verificadas; pesos comestibles propuestos sumados y divididos entre 4. Se cuentan los 320 g de harina y los 40 g de mantequilla completos, aunque en cocina pueda quedar harina de trabajo o salsa en el recipiente.","note":"Estimación informativa, no análisis del plato terminado. Marca y humedad de ricotta, tamaño real de los huevos, harina no incorporada, agua absorbida, queso y mantequilla que queden en utensilios cambian el resultado. Cantidades y rendimiento están pendientes de prueba de cocina.","inputs":[{"ingredient":"harina de trigo","edible_grams":320,"fdc_id":168936,"fdc_description":"Wheat flour, white, all-purpose, enriched, unbleached","per_100g":{"fiber_g":2.7,"fat_g":0.98,"carbs_g":76.31,"calories":364,"protein_g":10.33,"sodium_mg":2,"saturated_fat_g":0.155,"sugar_g":0.27},"source_url":"https://fdc.nal.usda.gov/food-details/168936/nutrients"},{"ingredient":"huevo entero crudo sin cáscara","edible_grams":150,"fdc_id":171287,"fdc_description":"Egg, whole, raw, fresh","per_100g":{"calories":143,"saturated_fat_g":3.126,"protein_g":12.56,"sodium_mg":142,"sugar_g":0.37,"fat_g":9.51,"carbs_g":0.72,"fiber_g":0},"source_url":"https://fdc.nal.usda.gov/food-details/171287/nutrients"},{"ingredient":"ricotta de leche entera","edible_grams":300,"fdc_id":170851,"fdc_description":"Cheese, ricotta, whole milk","per_100g":{"calories":174,"protein_g":11.26,"carbs_g":3.04,"fat_g":12.98,"saturated_fat_g":8.295,"fiber_g":0,"sugar_g":0.27,"sodium_mg":84},"source_url":"https://fdc.nal.usda.gov/food-details/170851/nutrients"},{"ingredient":"espinaca cruda","edible_grams":200,"fdc_id":168462,"fdc_description":"Spinach, raw","per_100g":{"calories":23,"protein_g":2.86,"carbs_g":3.63,"fat_g":0.39,"saturated_fat_g":0.063,"fiber_g":2.2,"sugar_g":0.42,"sodium_mg":79},"source_url":"https://fdc.nal.usda.gov/food-details/168462/nutrients"},{"ingredient":"queso parmesano duro","edible_grams":40,"fdc_id":170848,"fdc_description":"Cheese, parmesan, hard","per_100g":{"calories":392,"protein_g":35.75,"carbs_g":3.22,"fat_g":25,"saturated_fat_g":16.41,"fiber_g":0,"sugar_g":0.8,"sodium_mg":1184},"source_url":"https://fdc.nal.usda.gov/food-details/170848/nutrients"},{"ingredient":"mantequilla sin sal","edible_grams":40,"fdc_id":173430,"fdc_description":"Butter, without salt","per_100g":{"sugar_g":0.06,"calories":717,"saturated_fat_g":50.489,"fat_g":81.11,"carbs_g":0.06,"protein_g":0.85,"fiber_g":0,"sodium_mg":11},"source_url":"https://fdc.nal.usda.gov/food-details/173430/nutrients"},{"ingredient":"nuez moscada","edible_grams":0.5,"fdc_id":171326,"fdc_description":"Spices, nutmeg, ground","per_100g":{"protein_g":5.84,"sodium_mg":16,"saturated_fat_g":25.94,"fat_g":36.31,"carbs_g":49.29,"calories":525,"sugar_g":2.99,"fiber_g":20.8},"source_url":"https://fdc.nal.usda.gov/food-details/171326/nutrients"},{"ingredient":"sal de mesa","edible_grams":5,"fdc_id":173468,"fdc_description":"Salt, table","per_100g":{"fiber_g":0,"sodium_mg":38758,"saturated_fat_g":0,"protein_g":0,"fat_g":0,"carbs_g":0,"calories":0,"sugar_g":0},"source_url":"https://fdc.nal.usda.gov/food-details/173468/nutrients"}]},"keywords":["raviolis caseros","raviolis de ricotta y espinaca","masa fresca para ravioli"],"image_url":"/recetas/receta-raviolis-caseros/portada.webp","gallery":[{"url":"/recetas/receta-raviolis-caseros/portada.webp","alt":"Raviolis caseros rellenos de ricotta y espinaca con mantequilla dorada y hojas de salvia"}],"seo":{"title":"Raviolis caseros de ricotta y espinaca","description":"Raviolis caseros de ricotta y espinaca para 4: masa fresca de huevo, sellado paso a paso y acabado de mantequilla con salvia.","image_alt":"Raviolis caseros rellenos de ricotta y espinaca con mantequilla dorada y hojas de salvia","image_variants":["/recetas/receta-raviolis-caseros/portada-1x1.webp","/recetas/receta-raviolis-caseros/portada-4x3.webp","/recetas/receta-raviolis-caseros/portada-16x9.webp"],"faq":[{"q":"¿Por qué se abren los raviolis al cocer?","a":"Suelen abrirse por relleno húmedo, aire atrapado, bordes con harina o un sellado débil. Escurre la ricotta, exprime la espinaca, expulsa el aire y humedece apenas el contorno antes de presionar."},{"q":"¿Puedo hacerlos sin máquina de pasta?","a":"Sí, con rodillo y porciones pequeñas. Busca una lámina uniforme de alrededor de 1 mm y mantén cubierta la masa que no estés estirando. El tiempo puede aumentar respecto de los 90 minutos propuestos."},{"q":"¿Se pueden congelar antes de cocer?","a":"Sí. Congélalos crudos y separados en bandeja, luego pásalos a un recipiente. Cuécelos desde congelados, amplía el tiempo según sea necesario y verifica que el centro alcance al menos 71 °C."}]},"published":false,"editorial_status":"draft","content_html":"<p>Estos raviolis caseros combinan una masa fresca de huevo con un relleno espeso de ricotta, espinaca y parmesano. Se sellan en 24 unidades y se sirven con mantequilla avellanada y salvia, sin ocultar la técnica con una salsa pesada.</p><p>La propuesta rinde 4 porciones de 6 raviolis. Calcula 70 minutos de preparación y 20 de cocción, 90 en total; el escurrido, el reposo y parte de la preparación se solapan. Cantidades, espesor de la masa, tiempos y rendimiento están pendientes de una prueba de cocina.</p>"},{"id":"6360a440-039c-553a-893c-cd6cebe608a5","recipe_group_id":"e8238258-5fe1-4344-8851-917fa546f20b","slug":"hausgemachte-ravioli","public_path":"/de/hausgemachte-ravioli","source_url":null,"language":"de","title":"Hausgemachte Ravioli mit Ricotta und Spinat","excerpt":"Hausgemachte Ricotta-Spinat-Ravioli für 4: frischer Eierteig, sicheres Verschließen und braune Butter mit Salbei.","summary":"Diese hausgemachten Ravioli verbinden frischen Eierteig mit einer festen Füllung aus Ricotta, Spinat und Parmesan. Sie werden zu 24 Stück verschlossen und mit gebräunter Butter und Salbei serviert, ohne die Technik unter einer schweren Sauce zu verstecken.\n\nDer Vorschlag ergibt 4 Portionen mit je 6 Ravioli. Vorgesehen sind 70 Minuten Vorbereitung und 20 Minuten Garen, insgesamt 90; Abtropfen, Ruhen und Teile der Vorbereitung überschneiden sich. Mengen, Teigdicke, Zeiten und Ausbeute sind noch nicht im Küchentest bestätigt.","category":"Pasta","category_slug":"pastas","difficulty":"Mittel","course":"Hauptgericht","cuisine":"Italienisch, Vorschlag für die Hausküche","prep_time_minutes":70,"cook_time_minutes":20,"total_time_minutes":90,"servings":4,"ingredients":[{"name":"Weizenmehl Type 405 oder Allzweckmehl","amount":"320","unit":"g","group":"Teig"},{"name":"Große Eier, ohne Schale","amount":"3","unit":"große Eier (etwa 150 g)","group":"Teig"},{"name":"Wasser","amount":"15","unit":"ml, nur bei Bedarf","group":"Teig"},{"name":"Ricotta aus Vollmilch","amount":"300","unit":"g","group":"Füllung"},{"name":"Frischer Spinat","amount":"200","unit":"g","group":"Füllung"},{"name":"Fein geriebener Parmesan","amount":"40","unit":"g","group":"Füllung"},{"name":"Gemahlene Muskatnuss","amount":"0.5","unit":"g","group":"Füllung"},{"name":"Feines Salz","amount":"5","unit":"g, aufgeteilt"},{"name":"Ungesalzene Butter","amount":"40","unit":"g","group":"Fertigstellung"},{"name":"Frische Salbeiblätter","amount":"6","unit":"g","group":"Fertigstellung"},{"name":"Kochwasser","amount":"3000","unit":"ml","group":"Garen"}],"steps":[{"title":"Ricotta abtropfen lassen","content":"300 g Ricotta in ein feines Sieb über eine Schüssel geben, abdecken und 30 Minuten im Kühlschrank abtropfen lassen. Nicht bei Raumtemperatur stehen lassen. Am Ende sanft drücken, ohne ihn zu einer trockenen Paste zu machen. Diese Wartezeit gehört zu den 70 Minuten Vorbereitung und kann sich mit Teig und Spinat überschneiden.","image_url":"/recetas/receta-raviolis-caseros/paso-01.webp","image_alt":"Hausgemachte Ravioli mit Ricotta und Spinat: Ricotta abtropfen lassen"},{"title":"Spinat garen und trocknen","content":"200 g Spinat waschen und noch feucht in eine breite Pfanne geben. Bei mittlerer Hitze 2–3 Minuten unter Bewegen zusammenfallen lassen. Auf einem sauberen Teller abkühlen lassen; sobald er angefasst werden kann, mit sauberen Händen oder einem sauberen Tuch möglichst viel Wasser ausdrücken und fein hacken. Nasser Spinat kann die Ravioli öffnen.","image_url":"/recetas/receta-raviolis-caseros/paso-02.webp","image_alt":"Hausgemachte Ravioli mit Ricotta und Spinat: Spinat garen und trocknen"},{"title":"Teig mischen","content":"In 300 g Mehl eine Mulde bilden und 3 Eier, etwa 150 g ohne Schale, hineingeben. Eier mit einer Gabel verquirlen und nach und nach Mehl vom Rand einarbeiten. Zu einem festen Teig kneten; Wasser nur in Schritten von 5 ml zufügen, wenn nach mehreren Minuten trockene Stellen bleiben. Die übrigen 20 g Mehl für Arbeitsfläche und Blech reservieren. Die Aufnahme variiert; nicht automatisch das ganze Wasser zufügen.","image_url":"/recetas/receta-raviolis-caseros/paso-03.webp","image_alt":"Hausgemachte Ravioli mit Ricotta und Spinat: Teig mischen"},{"title":"Kneten und ruhen lassen","content":"Auf sauberer Fläche 8–10 Minuten kneten, bis der Teig glatt ist und nach Druck langsam zurückfedert. Gut einwickeln, damit er nicht austrocknet, und 30 Minuten bei kühler Raumtemperatur ruhen lassen. Arbeitsfläche und Geräte mit Kontakt zu rohem Ei reinigen, bevor Füllung oder gegarte Ravioli berührt werden.","image_url":"/recetas/receta-raviolis-caseros/paso-04.webp","image_alt":"Hausgemachte Ravioli mit Ricotta und Spinat: Kneten und ruhen lassen"},{"title":"Eine feste Füllung zubereiten","content":"Abgetropften Ricotta, gehackten Spinat, 40 g Parmesan, 0,5 g Muskat und 2 g Salz mischen. Die Masse soll dick sein und die Form eines Teelöffels halten. Sichtbar in 24 Portionen zu etwa 20 g teilen; wenn sie verläuft oder Flüssigkeit abgibt, 10 Minuten kühlen und erneut prüfen. Dieser Füllungsvorschlag enthält kein Ei.","image_url":"/recetas/receta-raviolis-caseros/paso-05.webp","image_alt":"Hausgemachte Ravioli mit Ricotta und Spinat: Eine feste Füllung zubereiten"},{"title":"Ausrollen, füllen und verschließen","content":"Teig in 4 Teile teilen und 3 eingewickelt lassen. Einen Teil mit Maschine oder Nudelholz gleichmäßig auf etwa 1 mm ausrollen; Löcher vermeiden. 6 Füllungsportionen mit Abstand aufsetzen, den Rand ganz leicht mit Wasser befeuchten und mit der anderen Blatthälfte bedecken. Luft von der Füllung nach außen drücken und fest verschließen. 6 Ravioli schneiden und jeden Rand prüfen. Bis 24 Stück wiederholen; mit etwas reserviertem Mehl ohne Stapeln auf ein Blech legen. Sofort garen oder abgedeckt höchstens vorgeschlagene 2 Stunden vor dem Garen kühlen.","image_url":"/recetas/receta-raviolis-caseros/paso-06.webp","image_alt":"Hausgemachte Ravioli mit Ricotta und Spinat: Ausrollen, füllen und verschließen"},{"title":"Ravioli portionsweise garen","content":"3 Liter Wasser mit den übrigen 3 g Salz aufkochen. Gleichzeitig 40 g Butter bei mittlerer bis kleiner Hitze mit Salbei schmelzen, bis sie nussig riecht und die Milchbestandteile goldbraun, nicht schwarz sind; vom Herd nehmen. Ravioli in 2 Portionen garen, damit sie nicht kleben: vorsichtig rühren und nach erneutem mäßigem Kochen 3–5 Minuten rechnen. Einen Raviolo aus der ersten Portion öffnen: Pasta weich, Rand durchgegart und Mitte mindestens 71 °C. Sonst weitergaren und einen neuen Raviolo prüfen.","image_url":"/recetas/receta-raviolis-caseros/paso-07.webp","image_alt":"Hausgemachte Ravioli mit Ricotta und Spinat: Ravioli portionsweise garen"},{"title":"Fertigstellen, servieren und lagern","content":"Ravioli mit Schaumlöffel herausheben, einige Sekunden abtropfen und in die Pfanne mit Salbeibutter geben. 30–60 Sekunden vorsichtig bewegen, ohne sie zu zerbrechen. Sofort 6 Ravioli pro Person servieren. Reste in flachen Behältern binnen 2 Stunden bei höchstens 4 °C kühlen, bei über 32 °C Raumtemperatur binnen 1 Stunde; Verbrauch innerhalb 2 Tagen wird vorgeschlagen. Nur einmal bis 74 °C im Kern erhitzen. Reste von rohem Ei mit Kontakt zu Mehl oder ungereinigten Geräten nicht aufbewahren.","image_url":"/recetas/receta-raviolis-caseros/paso-08.webp","image_alt":"Hausgemachte Ravioli mit Ricotta und Spinat: Fertigstellen, servieren und lagern"}],"notes":"Teig und Füllung enthalten Weizen, Ei und Milch. Diese Karte schlägt keinen gluten-, ei- oder milchfreien Ersatz vor, weil Hydration, Struktur und Nährwerte sich ändern. Ricotta kalt abtropfen und Spinat gut ausdrücken. Offene Ränder vor dem Garen neu verschließen; Ravioli nicht stapeln. 1 mm Dicke, 24 Stück und Zeiten sind redaktionelle Ziele vor Küchenbestätigung. Zum Einfrieren rohe Ravioli getrennt auf einem Blech fest werden lassen und dann umfüllen; gefroren garen, Zeit verlängern und mindestens 71 °C im Kern prüfen. Nicht bei Raumtemperatur auftauen.","nutrition":{"calories":598.4,"protein_g":26.5,"carbs_g":65.8,"fat_g":24.9,"saturated_fat_g":14.3,"fiber_g":3.3,"sugar_g":0.9,"sodium_mg":761,"estimated":true,"serving_size":"6 Ravioli von vorgeschlagenen 24, mit einem Viertel der Sauce","source":"USDA FoodData Central — SR Legacy (abril de 2018)","source_url":"https://fdc.nal.usda.gov/download-datasets/","method":"Acht geprüfte SR-Legacy-Datensätze; vorgeschlagene essbare Gewichte addiert und durch 4 geteilt. Alle 320 g Mehl und 40 g Butter werden gerechnet, obwohl Arbeitsmehl oder Sauce zurückbleiben können. Alle 5 g Salz werden konservativ gerechnet, obwohl ein Teil des gesalzenen Kochwassers verworfen wird.","note":"Informationsschätzung, keine Analyse des fertigen Gerichts. Marke und Feuchte des Ricotta, tatsächliche Eiergröße, nicht eingearbeitetes Mehl, aufgenommenes Wasser sowie Käse und Butter an Geräten verändern das Ergebnis. Mengen und Ausbeute warten auf einen Küchentest.","inputs":[{"ingredient":"Weizenmehl Type 405 oder Allzweckmehl","edible_grams":320,"fdc_id":168936,"fdc_description":"Wheat flour, white, all-purpose, enriched, unbleached","per_100g":{"fiber_g":2.7,"fat_g":0.98,"carbs_g":76.31,"calories":364,"protein_g":10.33,"sodium_mg":2,"saturated_fat_g":0.155,"sugar_g":0.27},"source_url":"https://fdc.nal.usda.gov/food-details/168936/nutrients"},{"ingredient":"Große Eier, ohne Schale","edible_grams":150,"fdc_id":171287,"fdc_description":"Egg, whole, raw, fresh","per_100g":{"calories":143,"saturated_fat_g":3.126,"protein_g":12.56,"sodium_mg":142,"sugar_g":0.37,"fat_g":9.51,"carbs_g":0.72,"fiber_g":0},"source_url":"https://fdc.nal.usda.gov/food-details/171287/nutrients"},{"ingredient":"Ricotta aus Vollmilch","edible_grams":300,"fdc_id":170851,"fdc_description":"Cheese, ricotta, whole milk","per_100g":{"calories":174,"protein_g":11.26,"carbs_g":3.04,"fat_g":12.98,"saturated_fat_g":8.295,"fiber_g":0,"sugar_g":0.27,"sodium_mg":84},"source_url":"https://fdc.nal.usda.gov/food-details/170851/nutrients"},{"ingredient":"Frischer Spinat","edible_grams":200,"fdc_id":168462,"fdc_description":"Spinach, raw","per_100g":{"calories":23,"protein_g":2.86,"carbs_g":3.63,"fat_g":0.39,"saturated_fat_g":0.063,"fiber_g":2.2,"sugar_g":0.42,"sodium_mg":79},"source_url":"https://fdc.nal.usda.gov/food-details/168462/nutrients"},{"ingredient":"Fein geriebener Parmesan","edible_grams":40,"fdc_id":170848,"fdc_description":"Cheese, parmesan, hard","per_100g":{"calories":392,"protein_g":35.75,"carbs_g":3.22,"fat_g":25,"saturated_fat_g":16.41,"fiber_g":0,"sugar_g":0.8,"sodium_mg":1184},"source_url":"https://fdc.nal.usda.gov/food-details/170848/nutrients"},{"ingredient":"Ungesalzene Butter","edible_grams":40,"fdc_id":173430,"fdc_description":"Butter, without salt","per_100g":{"sugar_g":0.06,"calories":717,"saturated_fat_g":50.489,"fat_g":81.11,"carbs_g":0.06,"protein_g":0.85,"fiber_g":0,"sodium_mg":11},"source_url":"https://fdc.nal.usda.gov/food-details/173430/nutrients"},{"ingredient":"Gemahlene Muskatnuss","edible_grams":0.5,"fdc_id":171326,"fdc_description":"Spices, nutmeg, ground","per_100g":{"protein_g":5.84,"sodium_mg":16,"saturated_fat_g":25.94,"fat_g":36.31,"carbs_g":49.29,"calories":525,"sugar_g":2.99,"fiber_g":20.8},"source_url":"https://fdc.nal.usda.gov/food-details/171326/nutrients"},{"ingredient":"Feines Salz","edible_grams":5,"fdc_id":173468,"fdc_description":"Salt, table","per_100g":{"fiber_g":0,"sodium_mg":38758,"saturated_fat_g":0,"protein_g":0,"fat_g":0,"carbs_g":0,"calories":0,"sugar_g":0},"source_url":"https://fdc.nal.usda.gov/food-details/173468/nutrients"}]},"keywords":["hausgemachte Ravioli","Ricotta-Spinat-Ravioli","frischer Ravioliteig"],"image_url":"/recetas/receta-raviolis-caseros/portada.webp","gallery":[{"url":"/recetas/receta-raviolis-caseros/portada.webp","alt":"Hausgemachte Ricotta-Spinat-Ravioli mit brauner Butter und Salbeiblättern"}],"seo":{"title":"Hausgemachte Ravioli mit Ricotta und Spinat","description":"Hausgemachte Ricotta-Spinat-Ravioli für 4: frischer Eierteig, sicheres Verschließen und braune Butter mit Salbei.","image_alt":"Hausgemachte Ricotta-Spinat-Ravioli mit brauner Butter und Salbeiblättern","image_variants":["/recetas/receta-raviolis-caseros/portada-1x1.webp","/recetas/receta-raviolis-caseros/portada-4x3.webp","/recetas/receta-raviolis-caseros/portada-16x9.webp"],"faq":[{"q":"Warum öffnen sich Ravioli beim Garen?","a":"Häufige Ursachen sind feuchte Füllung, eingeschlossene Luft, Mehl am Rand oder ein schwacher Verschluss. Ricotta abtropfen, Spinat ausdrücken, Luft herausdrücken und den Rand vor dem Pressen nur leicht befeuchten."},{"q":"Geht es ohne Pastamaschine?","a":"Ja, mit Nudelholz und kleinen Teigportionen. Ein gleichmäßiges Blatt von etwa 1 mm anstreben und unbenutzten Teig abdecken. Die Arbeit kann länger als die vorgeschlagenen 90 Minuten dauern."},{"q":"Kann ich sie vor dem Garen einfrieren?","a":"Ja. Rohe Ravioli getrennt auf einem Blech einfrieren und dann umfüllen. Gefroren garen, Zeit nach Bedarf verlängern und mindestens 71 °C im Kern prüfen."}]},"published":false,"editorial_status":"draft","content_html":"<p>Diese hausgemachten Ravioli verbinden frischen Eierteig mit einer festen Füllung aus Ricotta, Spinat und Parmesan. Sie werden zu 24 Stück verschlossen und mit gebräunter Butter und Salbei serviert, ohne die Technik unter einer schweren Sauce zu verstecken.</p><p>Der Vorschlag ergibt 4 Portionen mit je 6 Ravioli. Vorgesehen sind 70 Minuten Vorbereitung und 20 Minuten Garen, insgesamt 90; Abtropfen, Ruhen und Teile der Vorbereitung überschneiden sich. Mengen, Teigdicke, Zeiten und Ausbeute sind noch nicht im Küchentest bestätigt.</p>"},{"id":"b78e6eeb-3922-546b-ace2-18727865a6a5","recipe_group_id":"e8238258-5fe1-4344-8851-917fa546f20b","slug":"homemade-ravioli","public_path":"/en/homemade-ravioli","source_url":null,"language":"en","title":"Homemade ricotta and spinach ravioli","excerpt":"Homemade ricotta and spinach ravioli for 4: fresh egg pasta, step-by-step sealing and a brown-butter sage finish.","summary":"These homemade ravioli pair fresh egg pasta with a thick ricotta, spinach and Parmesan filling. They are sealed into 24 pieces and served with brown butter and sage, without hiding the technique under a heavy sauce.\n\nThe proposal makes 4 servings of 6 ravioli. Allow 70 minutes for preparation and 20 for cooking, 90 in total; draining, resting and part of the preparation overlap. Quantities, dough thickness, times and yield await a kitchen test.","category":"Pasta","category_slug":"pastas","difficulty":"Medium","course":"Main course","cuisine":"Italian, home-style proposal","prep_time_minutes":70,"cook_time_minutes":20,"total_time_minutes":90,"servings":4,"ingredients":[{"name":"All-purpose wheat flour","amount":"320","unit":"g","group":"Dough"},{"name":"Large eggs, without shells","amount":"3","unit":"large eggs (about 150 g)","group":"Dough"},{"name":"Water","amount":"15","unit":"ml, only if needed","group":"Dough"},{"name":"Whole-milk ricotta","amount":"300","unit":"g","group":"Filling"},{"name":"Fresh spinach","amount":"200","unit":"g","group":"Filling"},{"name":"Finely grated Parmesan cheese","amount":"40","unit":"g","group":"Filling"},{"name":"Ground nutmeg","amount":"0.5","unit":"g","group":"Filling"},{"name":"Fine salt","amount":"5","unit":"g, divided"},{"name":"Unsalted butter","amount":"40","unit":"g","group":"Finishing"},{"name":"Fresh sage leaves","amount":"6","unit":"g","group":"Finishing"},{"name":"Cooking water","amount":"3000","unit":"ml","group":"Cooking"}],"steps":[{"title":"Drain the ricotta","content":"Put the 300 g ricotta in a fine strainer over a bowl, cover and drain for 30 minutes in the refrigerator. Do not leave it at room temperature. Press gently at the end without turning it into a dry paste. This wait is included in the 70-minute preparation time and can overlap with making the dough and spinach.","image_url":"/recetas/receta-raviolis-caseros/paso-01.webp","image_alt":"Homemade ricotta and spinach ravioli: Drain the ricotta"},{"title":"Cook and dry the spinach","content":"Wash the 200 g spinach and put it, still damp, in a wide skillet. Cook over medium heat for 2–3 minutes, stirring, until wilted. Spread it on a clean plate to lose heat; once safe to handle, squeeze it with clean hands or a clean cloth to remove as much water as possible, then chop finely. Wet spinach can open the ravioli.","image_url":"/recetas/receta-raviolis-caseros/paso-02.webp","image_alt":"Homemade ricotta and spinach ravioli: Cook and dry the spinach"},{"title":"Mix the dough","content":"Make a well in 300 g of the flour and add the 3 eggs, about 150 g without shells. Beat the eggs with a fork and gradually draw in flour from the edge. Knead until a firm dough comes together; add water 5 ml at a time only if dry pieces remain after several minutes. Reserve the remaining 20 g flour for the worktop and tray. Absorption varies, so do not add all the water automatically.","image_url":"/recetas/receta-raviolis-caseros/paso-03.webp","image_alt":"Homemade ricotta and spinach ravioli: Mix the dough"},{"title":"Knead and rest","content":"Knead for 8–10 minutes on a clean surface until the dough looks smooth and slowly springs back when pressed. Wrap well so it does not dry out and rest for 30 minutes at cool room temperature. Clean the worktop and tools that touched raw egg before preparing the filling or handling cooked ravioli.","image_url":"/recetas/receta-raviolis-caseros/paso-04.webp","image_alt":"Homemade ricotta and spinach ravioli: Knead and rest"},{"title":"Make a dry filling","content":"Mix the drained ricotta, chopped spinach, 40 g Parmesan, 0.5 g nutmeg and 2 g of the salt. It should be thick enough to hold the shape of a teaspoon. Visually divide it into 24 portions of about 20 g; if it spreads or releases liquid, refrigerate for 10 minutes and check again. Do not add egg to this proposed filling.","image_url":"/recetas/receta-raviolis-caseros/paso-05.webp","image_alt":"Homemade ricotta and spinach ravioli: Make a dry filling"},{"title":"Roll, fill and seal","content":"Divide the dough into 4 pieces and keep 3 wrapped. Roll one piece by machine or rolling pin to an even sheet about 1 mm thick; avoid holes. Place 6 filling portions apart, barely moisten the outline with water and cover with the other half of the sheet. Press air away from the filling and seal firmly. Cut 6 ravioli and check every edge. Repeat to make 24; place on a tray with some reserved flour, without stacking. Cook immediately or refrigerate covered for a proposed maximum of 2 hours before cooking.","image_url":"/recetas/receta-raviolis-caseros/paso-06.webp","image_alt":"Homemade ricotta and spinach ravioli: Roll, fill and seal"},{"title":"Cook the ravioli in batches","content":"Boil the 3 litres of water with the remaining 3 g salt. Meanwhile, melt the 40 g butter over medium-low heat with the sage leaves until it smells nutty and the milk solids are golden, not black; remove from the heat. Cook the ravioli in 2 batches so they do not stick: stir gently and allow 3–5 minutes after the water returns to a moderate boil. Open one test ravioli from the first batch: pasta should be tender, the seal cooked and the centre at least 71 °C. If not, continue and test another ravioli.","image_url":"/recetas/receta-raviolis-caseros/paso-07.webp","image_alt":"Homemade ricotta and spinach ravioli: Cook the ravioli in batches"},{"title":"Finish, serve and store","content":"Lift out the ravioli with a slotted spoon, drain for a few seconds and transfer to the sage butter skillet. Move gently for 30–60 seconds to coat without breaking. Serve 6 ravioli per person immediately. Refrigerate leftovers in shallow containers at 4 °C or below within 2 hours, or 1 hour if the room exceeds 32 °C; using them within 2 days is proposed. Reheat only once to 74 °C at the centre. Do not keep leftover raw egg that contacted flour or unsanitized tools.","image_url":"/recetas/receta-raviolis-caseros/paso-08.webp","image_alt":"Homemade ricotta and spinach ravioli: Finish, serve and store"}],"notes":"The dough and filling contain wheat, egg and milk. This card does not propose gluten-free, egg-free or dairy-free substitutions because they would change hydration, structure and nutrition. Drain ricotta cold and squeeze spinach thoroughly. Reseal any open edge before cooking and do not stack the ravioli. The 1 mm thickness, 24-piece yield and times are editorial targets awaiting kitchen confirmation. To freeze, arrange raw ravioli separately on a tray until firm, then transfer to a container; cook from frozen, add time as needed and verify at least 71 °C in the centre. Do not thaw at room temperature.","nutrition":{"calories":598.4,"protein_g":26.5,"carbs_g":65.8,"fat_g":24.9,"saturated_fat_g":14.3,"fiber_g":3.3,"sugar_g":0.9,"sodium_mg":761,"estimated":true,"serving_size":"6 ravioli out of a proposed total of 24, with one quarter of the sauce","source":"USDA FoodData Central — SR Legacy (abril de 2018)","source_url":"https://fdc.nal.usda.gov/download-datasets/","method":"Eight verified SR Legacy records; proposed edible weights added and divided by 4. All 320 g flour and 40 g butter are counted, although worktop flour or sauce may remain. All 5 g salt are counted conservatively even though some salted cooking water is discarded.","note":"Informational estimate, not analysis of the finished dish. Ricotta brand and moisture, actual egg size, unincorporated flour, absorbed water, cheese and butter left on utensils change the result. Quantities and yield await a kitchen test.","inputs":[{"ingredient":"All-purpose wheat flour","edible_grams":320,"fdc_id":168936,"fdc_description":"Wheat flour, white, all-purpose, enriched, unbleached","per_100g":{"fiber_g":2.7,"fat_g":0.98,"carbs_g":76.31,"calories":364,"protein_g":10.33,"sodium_mg":2,"saturated_fat_g":0.155,"sugar_g":0.27},"source_url":"https://fdc.nal.usda.gov/food-details/168936/nutrients"},{"ingredient":"Large eggs, without shells","edible_grams":150,"fdc_id":171287,"fdc_description":"Egg, whole, raw, fresh","per_100g":{"calories":143,"saturated_fat_g":3.126,"protein_g":12.56,"sodium_mg":142,"sugar_g":0.37,"fat_g":9.51,"carbs_g":0.72,"fiber_g":0},"source_url":"https://fdc.nal.usda.gov/food-details/171287/nutrients"},{"ingredient":"Whole-milk ricotta","edible_grams":300,"fdc_id":170851,"fdc_description":"Cheese, ricotta, whole milk","per_100g":{"calories":174,"protein_g":11.26,"carbs_g":3.04,"fat_g":12.98,"saturated_fat_g":8.295,"fiber_g":0,"sugar_g":0.27,"sodium_mg":84},"source_url":"https://fdc.nal.usda.gov/food-details/170851/nutrients"},{"ingredient":"Fresh spinach","edible_grams":200,"fdc_id":168462,"fdc_description":"Spinach, raw","per_100g":{"calories":23,"protein_g":2.86,"carbs_g":3.63,"fat_g":0.39,"saturated_fat_g":0.063,"fiber_g":2.2,"sugar_g":0.42,"sodium_mg":79},"source_url":"https://fdc.nal.usda.gov/food-details/168462/nutrients"},{"ingredient":"Finely grated Parmesan cheese","edible_grams":40,"fdc_id":170848,"fdc_description":"Cheese, parmesan, hard","per_100g":{"calories":392,"protein_g":35.75,"carbs_g":3.22,"fat_g":25,"saturated_fat_g":16.41,"fiber_g":0,"sugar_g":0.8,"sodium_mg":1184},"source_url":"https://fdc.nal.usda.gov/food-details/170848/nutrients"},{"ingredient":"Unsalted butter","edible_grams":40,"fdc_id":173430,"fdc_description":"Butter, without salt","per_100g":{"sugar_g":0.06,"calories":717,"saturated_fat_g":50.489,"fat_g":81.11,"carbs_g":0.06,"protein_g":0.85,"fiber_g":0,"sodium_mg":11},"source_url":"https://fdc.nal.usda.gov/food-details/173430/nutrients"},{"ingredient":"Ground nutmeg","edible_grams":0.5,"fdc_id":171326,"fdc_description":"Spices, nutmeg, ground","per_100g":{"protein_g":5.84,"sodium_mg":16,"saturated_fat_g":25.94,"fat_g":36.31,"carbs_g":49.29,"calories":525,"sugar_g":2.99,"fiber_g":20.8},"source_url":"https://fdc.nal.usda.gov/food-details/171326/nutrients"},{"ingredient":"Fine salt","edible_grams":5,"fdc_id":173468,"fdc_description":"Salt, table","per_100g":{"fiber_g":0,"sodium_mg":38758,"saturated_fat_g":0,"protein_g":0,"fat_g":0,"carbs_g":0,"calories":0,"sugar_g":0},"source_url":"https://fdc.nal.usda.gov/food-details/173468/nutrients"}]},"keywords":["homemade ravioli","ricotta spinach ravioli","fresh ravioli dough"],"image_url":"/recetas/receta-raviolis-caseros/portada.webp","gallery":[{"url":"/recetas/receta-raviolis-caseros/portada.webp","alt":"Homemade ricotta and spinach ravioli with brown butter and sage leaves"}],"seo":{"title":"Homemade ricotta and spinach ravioli","description":"Homemade ricotta and spinach ravioli for 4: fresh egg pasta, step-by-step sealing and a brown-butter sage finish.","image_alt":"Homemade ricotta and spinach ravioli with brown butter and sage leaves","image_variants":["/recetas/receta-raviolis-caseros/portada-1x1.webp","/recetas/receta-raviolis-caseros/portada-4x3.webp","/recetas/receta-raviolis-caseros/portada-16x9.webp"],"faq":[{"q":"Why do ravioli open while cooking?","a":"Common causes are wet filling, trapped air, flour on the edges or a weak seal. Drain the ricotta, squeeze the spinach, push out the air and barely moisten the outline before pressing."},{"q":"Can I make them without a pasta machine?","a":"Yes, with a rolling pin and small dough portions. Aim for an even sheet about 1 mm thick and keep unused dough covered. The work may take longer than the proposed 90 minutes."},{"q":"Can I freeze them before cooking?","a":"Yes. Freeze raw ravioli separately on a tray, then transfer them to a container. Cook from frozen, extend the time as needed and verify that the centre reaches at least 71 °C."}]},"published":false,"editorial_status":"draft","content_html":"<p>These homemade ravioli pair fresh egg pasta with a thick ricotta, spinach and Parmesan filling. They are sealed into 24 pieces and served with brown butter and sage, without hiding the technique under a heavy sauce.</p><p>The proposal makes 4 servings of 6 ravioli. Allow 70 minutes for preparation and 20 for cooking, 90 in total; draining, resting and part of the preparation overlap. Quantities, dough thickness, times and yield await a kitchen test.</p>"},{"id":"31fb01d4-8b3c-5723-aeb4-50b7f722d0e4","recipe_group_id":"e8238258-5fe1-4344-8851-917fa546f20b","slug":"raviolis-maison","public_path":"/fr/raviolis-maison","source_url":null,"language":"fr","title":"Raviolis maison à la ricotta et aux épinards","excerpt":"Raviolis maison ricotta-épinards pour 4 : pâte fraîche aux œufs, fermeture détaillée et beurre noisette à la sauge.","summary":"Ces raviolis maison associent une pâte fraîche aux œufs à une farce épaisse de ricotta, épinards et parmesan. Ils sont fermés en 24 pièces et servis avec un beurre noisette à la sauge, sans masquer la technique sous une sauce lourde.\n\nLa proposition donne 4 portions de 6 raviolis. Comptez 70 minutes de préparation et 20 de cuisson, 90 au total ; égouttage, repos et certaines préparations se chevauchent. Quantités, épaisseur, durées et rendement attendent un essai en cuisine.","category":"Pâtes","category_slug":"pastas","difficulty":"Moyenne","course":"Plat principal","cuisine":"Italienne, proposition maison","prep_time_minutes":70,"cook_time_minutes":20,"total_time_minutes":90,"servings":4,"ingredients":[{"name":"Farine de blé tout usage","amount":"320","unit":"g","group":"Pâte"},{"name":"Gros œufs, sans coquille","amount":"3","unit":"gros œufs (environ 150 g)","group":"Pâte"},{"name":"Eau","amount":"15","unit":"ml, seulement si nécessaire","group":"Pâte"},{"name":"Ricotta au lait entier","amount":"300","unit":"g","group":"Farce"},{"name":"Épinards frais","amount":"200","unit":"g","group":"Farce"},{"name":"Parmesan finement râpé","amount":"40","unit":"g","group":"Farce"},{"name":"Muscade moulue","amount":"0.5","unit":"g","group":"Farce"},{"name":"Sel fin","amount":"5","unit":"g, répartis"},{"name":"Beurre doux","amount":"40","unit":"g","group":"Finition"},{"name":"Feuilles de sauge fraîche","amount":"6","unit":"g","group":"Finition"},{"name":"Eau de cuisson","amount":"3000","unit":"ml","group":"Cuisson"}],"steps":[{"title":"Égoutter la ricotta","content":"Mettez les 300 g de ricotta dans une passoire fine au-dessus d’un bol, couvrez et laissez égoutter 30 minutes au réfrigérateur. Ne la laissez pas à température ambiante. Pressez doucement à la fin sans en faire une pâte sèche. Cette attente est comprise dans les 70 minutes de préparation et peut chevaucher la pâte et les épinards.","image_url":"/recetas/receta-raviolis-caseros/paso-01.webp","image_alt":"Raviolis maison à la ricotta et aux épinards: Égoutter la ricotta"},{"title":"Cuire et sécher les épinards","content":"Lavez les 200 g d’épinards et mettez-les encore humides dans une grande poêle. Cuisez 2–3 minutes à feu moyen en remuant, jusqu’à ce qu’ils tombent. Étalez sur une assiette propre pour refroidir ; dès qu’ils sont manipulables, pressez avec des mains propres ou un linge propre pour retirer le plus d’eau possible, puis hachez finement. Des épinards humides peuvent ouvrir les raviolis.","image_url":"/recetas/receta-raviolis-caseros/paso-02.webp","image_alt":"Raviolis maison à la ricotta et aux épinards: Cuire et sécher les épinards"},{"title":"Mélanger la pâte","content":"Creusez un puits dans 300 g de farine et ajoutez les 3 œufs, environ 150 g sans coquille. Battez à la fourchette en incorporant peu à peu la farine du bord. Pétrissez jusqu’à obtenir une pâte ferme ; ajoutez l’eau par 5 ml seulement si des zones sèches subsistent après plusieurs minutes. Réservez les 20 g de farine restants pour le plan et la plaque. L’absorption varie : n’ajoutez pas toute l’eau automatiquement.","image_url":"/recetas/receta-raviolis-caseros/paso-03.webp","image_alt":"Raviolis maison à la ricotta et aux épinards: Mélanger la pâte"},{"title":"Pétrir et laisser reposer","content":"Pétrissez 8–10 minutes sur une surface propre jusqu’à ce que la pâte soit lisse et reprenne lentement sa forme sous la pression. Emballez bien pour éviter le dessèchement et laissez reposer 30 minutes à température ambiante fraîche. Nettoyez plan et ustensiles ayant touché l’œuf cru avant la farce ou les raviolis cuits.","image_url":"/recetas/receta-raviolis-caseros/paso-04.webp","image_alt":"Raviolis maison à la ricotta et aux épinards: Pétrir et laisser reposer"},{"title":"Préparer une farce ferme","content":"Mélangez ricotta égouttée, épinards hachés, 40 g de parmesan, 0,5 g de muscade et 2 g de sel. La farce doit être épaisse et garder la forme d’une cuillerée. Divisez visuellement en 24 portions d’environ 20 g ; si elle s’étale ou rend du liquide, réfrigérez 10 minutes et vérifiez encore. N’ajoutez pas d’œuf à cette farce proposée.","image_url":"/recetas/receta-raviolis-caseros/paso-05.webp","image_alt":"Raviolis maison à la ricotta et aux épinards: Préparer une farce ferme"},{"title":"Abaisser, farcir et fermer","content":"Divisez la pâte en 4 et gardez 3 morceaux emballés. Abaissez-en un à la machine ou au rouleau jusqu’à environ 1 mm, sans trous. Posez 6 portions espacées, humidifiez à peine le contour et couvrez de l’autre moitié. Chassez l’air de la farce vers l’extérieur et pressez pour fermer. Découpez 6 raviolis et vérifiez chaque bord. Répétez jusqu’à 24 ; posez sans empiler sur une plaque avec un peu de farine réservée. Cuisez aussitôt ou réfrigérez couverts pendant un maximum proposé de 2 heures avant cuisson.","image_url":"/recetas/receta-raviolis-caseros/paso-06.webp","image_alt":"Raviolis maison à la ricotta et aux épinards: Abaisser, farcir et fermer"},{"title":"Cuire les raviolis par lots","content":"Faites bouillir les 3 litres d’eau avec les 3 g de sel restants. En parallèle, faites fondre les 40 g de beurre à feu moyen-doux avec la sauge jusqu’à odeur de noisette et solides dorés, non noirs ; retirez du feu. Cuisez en 2 lots pour éviter qu’ils collent : remuez doucement et comptez 3–5 minutes après reprise d’une ébullition modérée. Ouvrez un ravioli test du premier lot : pâte tendre, joint cuit et centre à au moins 71 °C. Sinon, prolongez et testez-en un autre.","image_url":"/recetas/receta-raviolis-caseros/paso-07.webp","image_alt":"Raviolis maison à la ricotta et aux épinards: Cuire les raviolis par lots"},{"title":"Finir, servir et conserver","content":"Sortez avec une écumoire, égouttez quelques secondes et passez dans le beurre à la sauge. Remuez délicatement 30–60 secondes sans casser. Servez aussitôt 6 raviolis par personne. Réfrigérez les restes en contenants peu profonds à 4 °C ou moins dans les 2 heures, ou 1 heure si la pièce dépasse 32 °C ; consommation proposée sous 2 jours. Réchauffez une seule fois jusqu’à 74 °C au centre. Ne gardez pas d’œuf cru restant ayant touché farine ou matériel non assaini.","image_url":"/recetas/receta-raviolis-caseros/paso-08.webp","image_alt":"Raviolis maison à la ricotta et aux épinards: Finir, servir et conserver"}],"notes":"Pâte et farce contiennent blé, œuf et lait. Cette fiche ne propose pas de substitutions sans gluten, sans œuf ou sans lait car elles changeraient hydratation, structure et nutrition. Égouttez la ricotta au froid et pressez bien les épinards. Refermez tout bord ouvert avant cuisson et n’empilez pas. Épaisseur de 1 mm, rendement de 24 pièces et temps sont des objectifs éditoriaux à confirmer en cuisine. Pour congeler, séparez les raviolis crus sur plaque jusqu’à fermeté puis transférez ; cuisez congelés, prolongez au besoin et vérifiez au moins 71 °C au centre. Ne décongelez pas à température ambiante.","nutrition":{"calories":598.4,"protein_g":26.5,"carbs_g":65.8,"fat_g":24.9,"saturated_fat_g":14.3,"fiber_g":3.3,"sugar_g":0.9,"sodium_mg":761,"estimated":true,"serving_size":"6 raviolis sur un total proposé de 24, avec un quart de la sauce","source":"USDA FoodData Central — SR Legacy (abril de 2018)","source_url":"https://fdc.nal.usda.gov/download-datasets/","method":"Huit fiches SR Legacy vérifiées ; poids comestibles proposés additionnés puis divisés par 4. Les 320 g de farine et 40 g de beurre sont comptés entièrement, même si farine de travail ou sauce restent. Les 5 g de sel sont comptés prudemment bien qu’une partie de l’eau salée soit jetée.","note":"Estimation informative, pas une analyse du plat fini. Marque et humidité de la ricotta, taille réelle des œufs, farine non incorporée, eau absorbée, fromage et beurre restant sur les ustensiles modifient le résultat. Quantités et rendement attendent un essai en cuisine.","inputs":[{"ingredient":"Farine de blé tout usage","edible_grams":320,"fdc_id":168936,"fdc_description":"Wheat flour, white, all-purpose, enriched, unbleached","per_100g":{"fiber_g":2.7,"fat_g":0.98,"carbs_g":76.31,"calories":364,"protein_g":10.33,"sodium_mg":2,"saturated_fat_g":0.155,"sugar_g":0.27},"source_url":"https://fdc.nal.usda.gov/food-details/168936/nutrients"},{"ingredient":"Gros œufs, sans coquille","edible_grams":150,"fdc_id":171287,"fdc_description":"Egg, whole, raw, fresh","per_100g":{"calories":143,"saturated_fat_g":3.126,"protein_g":12.56,"sodium_mg":142,"sugar_g":0.37,"fat_g":9.51,"carbs_g":0.72,"fiber_g":0},"source_url":"https://fdc.nal.usda.gov/food-details/171287/nutrients"},{"ingredient":"Ricotta au lait entier","edible_grams":300,"fdc_id":170851,"fdc_description":"Cheese, ricotta, whole milk","per_100g":{"calories":174,"protein_g":11.26,"carbs_g":3.04,"fat_g":12.98,"saturated_fat_g":8.295,"fiber_g":0,"sugar_g":0.27,"sodium_mg":84},"source_url":"https://fdc.nal.usda.gov/food-details/170851/nutrients"},{"ingredient":"Épinards frais","edible_grams":200,"fdc_id":168462,"fdc_description":"Spinach, raw","per_100g":{"calories":23,"protein_g":2.86,"carbs_g":3.63,"fat_g":0.39,"saturated_fat_g":0.063,"fiber_g":2.2,"sugar_g":0.42,"sodium_mg":79},"source_url":"https://fdc.nal.usda.gov/food-details/168462/nutrients"},{"ingredient":"Parmesan finement râpé","edible_grams":40,"fdc_id":170848,"fdc_description":"Cheese, parmesan, hard","per_100g":{"calories":392,"protein_g":35.75,"carbs_g":3.22,"fat_g":25,"saturated_fat_g":16.41,"fiber_g":0,"sugar_g":0.8,"sodium_mg":1184},"source_url":"https://fdc.nal.usda.gov/food-details/170848/nutrients"},{"ingredient":"Beurre doux","edible_grams":40,"fdc_id":173430,"fdc_description":"Butter, without salt","per_100g":{"sugar_g":0.06,"calories":717,"saturated_fat_g":50.489,"fat_g":81.11,"carbs_g":0.06,"protein_g":0.85,"fiber_g":0,"sodium_mg":11},"source_url":"https://fdc.nal.usda.gov/food-details/173430/nutrients"},{"ingredient":"Muscade moulue","edible_grams":0.5,"fdc_id":171326,"fdc_description":"Spices, nutmeg, ground","per_100g":{"protein_g":5.84,"sodium_mg":16,"saturated_fat_g":25.94,"fat_g":36.31,"carbs_g":49.29,"calories":525,"sugar_g":2.99,"fiber_g":20.8},"source_url":"https://fdc.nal.usda.gov/food-details/171326/nutrients"},{"ingredient":"Sel fin","edible_grams":5,"fdc_id":173468,"fdc_description":"Salt, table","per_100g":{"fiber_g":0,"sodium_mg":38758,"saturated_fat_g":0,"protein_g":0,"fat_g":0,"carbs_g":0,"calories":0,"sugar_g":0},"source_url":"https://fdc.nal.usda.gov/food-details/173468/nutrients"}]},"keywords":["raviolis maison","raviolis ricotta épinards","pâte fraîche à raviolis"],"image_url":"/recetas/receta-raviolis-caseros/portada.webp","gallery":[{"url":"/recetas/receta-raviolis-caseros/portada.webp","alt":"Raviolis maison ricotta-épinards avec beurre noisette et feuilles de sauge"}],"seo":{"title":"Raviolis maison à la ricotta et aux épinards","description":"Raviolis maison ricotta-épinards pour 4 : pâte fraîche aux œufs, fermeture détaillée et beurre noisette à la sauge.","image_alt":"Raviolis maison ricotta-épinards avec beurre noisette et feuilles de sauge","image_variants":["/recetas/receta-raviolis-caseros/portada-1x1.webp","/recetas/receta-raviolis-caseros/portada-4x3.webp","/recetas/receta-raviolis-caseros/portada-16x9.webp"],"faq":[{"q":"Pourquoi les raviolis s’ouvrent-ils à la cuisson ?","a":"Une farce humide, de l’air enfermé, de la farine sur les bords ou une fermeture faible sont fréquents. Égouttez la ricotta, pressez les épinards, chassez l’air et humidifiez à peine le contour avant de presser."},{"q":"Puis-je les faire sans machine à pâtes ?","a":"Oui, au rouleau avec de petites portions. Visez une feuille régulière d’environ 1 mm et gardez la pâte inutilisée couverte. Le travail peut dépasser les 90 minutes proposées."},{"q":"Puis-je les congeler avant cuisson ?","a":"Oui. Congelez les raviolis crus séparés sur une plaque puis transférez-les. Cuisez sans décongeler, prolongez au besoin et vérifiez au moins 71 °C au centre."}]},"published":false,"editorial_status":"draft","content_html":"<p>Ces raviolis maison associent une pâte fraîche aux œufs à une farce épaisse de ricotta, épinards et parmesan. Ils sont fermés en 24 pièces et servis avec un beurre noisette à la sauge, sans masquer la technique sous une sauce lourde.</p><p>La proposition donne 4 portions de 6 raviolis. Comptez 70 minutes de préparation et 20 de cuisson, 90 au total ; égouttage, repos et certaines préparations se chevauchent. Quantités, épaisseur, durées et rendement attendent un essai en cuisine.</p>"},{"id":"67dd9ccd-e298-5257-8a97-6419c11ce270","recipe_group_id":"e8238258-5fe1-4344-8851-917fa546f20b","slug":"ravioli-fatti-in-casa","public_path":"/it/ravioli-fatti-in-casa","source_url":null,"language":"it","title":"Ravioli fatti in casa con ricotta e spinaci","excerpt":"Ravioli ricotta e spinaci per 4: pasta fresca all’uovo, chiusura passo passo e burro nocciola alla salvia.","summary":"Questi ravioli fatti in casa uniscono pasta fresca all’uovo e un ripieno sodo di ricotta, spinaci e parmigiano. Si chiudono in 24 pezzi e si servono con burro nocciola e salvia, senza coprire la tecnica con una salsa pesante.\n\nLa proposta rende 4 porzioni da 6 ravioli. Calcola 70 minuti di preparazione e 20 di cottura, 90 in totale; sgocciolatura, riposo e parte del lavoro si sovrappongono. Quantità, spessore, tempi e resa attendono una prova in cucina.","category":"Pasta","category_slug":"pastas","difficulty":"Media","course":"Piatto principale","cuisine":"Italiana, proposta casalinga","prep_time_minutes":70,"cook_time_minutes":20,"total_time_minutes":90,"servings":4,"ingredients":[{"name":"Farina di grano tenero per tutti gli usi","amount":"320","unit":"g","group":"Impasto"},{"name":"Uova grandi, senza guscio","amount":"3","unit":"uova grandi (circa 150 g)","group":"Impasto"},{"name":"Acqua","amount":"15","unit":"ml, solo se necessario","group":"Impasto"},{"name":"Ricotta di latte intero","amount":"300","unit":"g","group":"Ripieno"},{"name":"Spinaci freschi","amount":"200","unit":"g","group":"Ripieno"},{"name":"Parmigiano grattugiato fine","amount":"40","unit":"g","group":"Ripieno"},{"name":"Noce moscata macinata","amount":"0.5","unit":"g","group":"Ripieno"},{"name":"Sale fino","amount":"5","unit":"g, divisi"},{"name":"Burro non salato","amount":"40","unit":"g","group":"Finitura"},{"name":"Foglie di salvia fresca","amount":"6","unit":"g","group":"Finitura"},{"name":"Acqua di cottura","amount":"3000","unit":"ml","group":"Cottura"}],"steps":[{"title":"Fai sgocciolare la ricotta","content":"Metti i 300 g di ricotta in un colino fine sopra una ciotola, copri e lascia sgocciolare 30 minuti in frigorifero. Non lasciarla a temperatura ambiente. Alla fine premi delicatamente senza ridurla a pasta asciutta. L’attesa rientra nei 70 minuti di preparazione e può sovrapporsi a impasto e spinaci.","image_url":"/recetas/receta-raviolis-caseros/paso-01.webp","image_alt":"Ravioli fatti in casa con ricotta e spinaci: Fai sgocciolare la ricotta"},{"title":"Cuoci e asciuga gli spinaci","content":"Lava i 200 g di spinaci e mettili ancora umidi in una padella ampia. Cuoci 2–3 minuti a fuoco medio, muovendo, finché appassiscono. Stendili su un piatto pulito per farli raffreddare; quando si possono toccare, strizzali con mani pulite o un panno pulito per eliminare più acqua possibile, poi tritali fini. Spinaci umidi possono aprire i ravioli.","image_url":"/recetas/receta-raviolis-caseros/paso-02.webp","image_alt":"Ravioli fatti in casa con ricotta e spinaci: Cuoci e asciuga gli spinaci"},{"title":"Mescola l’impasto","content":"Crea una fontana in 300 g di farina e aggiungi le 3 uova, circa 150 g senza guscio. Sbatti con la forchetta incorporando poco a poco farina dal bordo. Impasta fino a riunire un composto sodo; aggiungi acqua 5 ml per volta solo se dopo vari minuti restano parti secche. Conserva i 20 g di farina restanti per piano e vassoio. L’assorbimento varia: non aggiungere tutta l’acqua automaticamente.","image_url":"/recetas/receta-raviolis-caseros/paso-03.webp","image_alt":"Ravioli fatti in casa con ricotta e spinaci: Mescola l’impasto"},{"title":"Impasta e fai riposare","content":"Impasta 8–10 minuti su una superficie pulita finché la pasta è liscia e torna lentamente in forma dopo la pressione. Avvolgi bene per non farla seccare e lascia riposare 30 minuti a temperatura ambiente fresca. Pulisci piano e utensili che hanno toccato uovo crudo prima di fare il ripieno o toccare ravioli cotti.","image_url":"/recetas/receta-raviolis-caseros/paso-04.webp","image_alt":"Ravioli fatti in casa con ricotta e spinaci: Impasta e fai riposare"},{"title":"Prepara un ripieno asciutto","content":"Mescola ricotta sgocciolata, spinaci tritati, 40 g di parmigiano, 0,5 g di noce moscata e 2 g di sale. Deve essere denso e mantenere la forma di un cucchiaino. Dividi visivamente in 24 porzioni da circa 20 g; se si allarga o rilascia liquido, refrigera 10 minuti e ricontrolla. Non aggiungere uovo a questo ripieno proposto.","image_url":"/recetas/receta-raviolis-caseros/paso-05.webp","image_alt":"Ravioli fatti in casa con ricotta e spinaci: Prepara un ripieno asciutto"},{"title":"Stendi, farcisci e sigilla","content":"Dividi l’impasto in 4 parti e tienine 3 avvolte. Stendi una parte a macchina o mattarello fino a circa 1 mm, senza buchi. Disponi 6 porzioni distanziate, inumidisci appena il contorno e copri con l’altra metà della sfoglia. Spingi fuori l’aria e premi per sigillare. Taglia 6 ravioli e controlla ogni bordo. Ripeti fino a 24; metti senza sovrapporre su un vassoio con farina riservata. Cuoci subito o refrigera coperti per un massimo proposto di 2 ore prima della cottura.","image_url":"/recetas/receta-raviolis-caseros/paso-06.webp","image_alt":"Ravioli fatti in casa con ricotta e spinaci: Stendi, farcisci e sigilla"},{"title":"Cuoci i ravioli in due turni","content":"Fai bollire i 3 litri d’acqua con i 3 g di sale restanti. Intanto sciogli i 40 g di burro a fuoco medio-basso con la salvia finché profuma di nocciola e i solidi sono dorati, non neri; togli dal fuoco. Cuoci i ravioli in 2 turni per non farli attaccare: mescola piano e conta 3–5 minuti da quando riprende un bollore moderato. Apri un raviolo di prova del primo turno: pasta tenera, chiusura cotta e centro ad almeno 71 °C. Se manca, prolunga e controllane un altro.","image_url":"/recetas/receta-raviolis-caseros/paso-07.webp","image_alt":"Ravioli fatti in casa con ricotta e spinaci: Cuoci i ravioli in due turni"},{"title":"Finisci, servi e conserva","content":"Togli i ravioli con una schiumarola, scola pochi secondi e passa nella padella di burro e salvia. Muovi delicatamente 30–60 secondi senza romperli. Servi subito 6 ravioli a persona. Refrigera gli avanzi in contenitori bassi a 4 °C o meno entro 2 ore, o 1 ora se l’ambiente supera 32 °C; si propone consumo entro 2 giorni. Riscalda una sola volta fino a 74 °C al centro. Non conservare uovo crudo avanzato che abbia toccato farina o utensili non sanificati.","image_url":"/recetas/receta-raviolis-caseros/paso-08.webp","image_alt":"Ravioli fatti in casa con ricotta e spinaci: Finisci, servi e conserva"}],"notes":"Impasto e ripieno contengono grano, uovo e latte. La scheda non propone sostituzioni senza glutine, uovo o latte perché cambierebbero idratazione, struttura e nutrizione. Fai sgocciolare la ricotta al freddo e strizza bene gli spinaci. Risigilla ogni bordo aperto e non sovrapporre. Spessore di 1 mm, resa di 24 pezzi e tempi sono obiettivi editoriali da confermare in cucina. Per congelare, disponi i ravioli crudi separati su vassoio finché solidi, poi trasferisci; cuoci da congelati, prolunga quanto serve e verifica almeno 71 °C al centro. Non scongelare a temperatura ambiente.","nutrition":{"calories":598.4,"protein_g":26.5,"carbs_g":65.8,"fat_g":24.9,"saturated_fat_g":14.3,"fiber_g":3.3,"sugar_g":0.9,"sodium_mg":761,"estimated":true,"serving_size":"6 ravioli su 24 proposti, con un quarto della salsa","source":"USDA FoodData Central — SR Legacy (abril de 2018)","source_url":"https://fdc.nal.usda.gov/download-datasets/","method":"Otto schede SR Legacy verificate; pesi edibili proposti sommati e divisi per 4. Si contano tutti i 320 g di farina e i 40 g di burro, anche se può restare farina o salsa. Si contano prudentemente tutti i 5 g di sale benché parte dell’acqua salata venga scartata.","note":"Stima informativa, non analisi del piatto finito. Marca e umidità della ricotta, dimensione reale delle uova, farina non incorporata, acqua assorbita, formaggio e burro sugli utensili modificano il risultato. Quantità e resa attendono una prova in cucina.","inputs":[{"ingredient":"Farina di grano tenero per tutti gli usi","edible_grams":320,"fdc_id":168936,"fdc_description":"Wheat flour, white, all-purpose, enriched, unbleached","per_100g":{"fiber_g":2.7,"fat_g":0.98,"carbs_g":76.31,"calories":364,"protein_g":10.33,"sodium_mg":2,"saturated_fat_g":0.155,"sugar_g":0.27},"source_url":"https://fdc.nal.usda.gov/food-details/168936/nutrients"},{"ingredient":"Uova grandi, senza guscio","edible_grams":150,"fdc_id":171287,"fdc_description":"Egg, whole, raw, fresh","per_100g":{"calories":143,"saturated_fat_g":3.126,"protein_g":12.56,"sodium_mg":142,"sugar_g":0.37,"fat_g":9.51,"carbs_g":0.72,"fiber_g":0},"source_url":"https://fdc.nal.usda.gov/food-details/171287/nutrients"},{"ingredient":"Ricotta di latte intero","edible_grams":300,"fdc_id":170851,"fdc_description":"Cheese, ricotta, whole milk","per_100g":{"calories":174,"protein_g":11.26,"carbs_g":3.04,"fat_g":12.98,"saturated_fat_g":8.295,"fiber_g":0,"sugar_g":0.27,"sodium_mg":84},"source_url":"https://fdc.nal.usda.gov/food-details/170851/nutrients"},{"ingredient":"Spinaci freschi","edible_grams":200,"fdc_id":168462,"fdc_description":"Spinach, raw","per_100g":{"calories":23,"protein_g":2.86,"carbs_g":3.63,"fat_g":0.39,"saturated_fat_g":0.063,"fiber_g":2.2,"sugar_g":0.42,"sodium_mg":79},"source_url":"https://fdc.nal.usda.gov/food-details/168462/nutrients"},{"ingredient":"Parmigiano grattugiato fine","edible_grams":40,"fdc_id":170848,"fdc_description":"Cheese, parmesan, hard","per_100g":{"calories":392,"protein_g":35.75,"carbs_g":3.22,"fat_g":25,"saturated_fat_g":16.41,"fiber_g":0,"sugar_g":0.8,"sodium_mg":1184},"source_url":"https://fdc.nal.usda.gov/food-details/170848/nutrients"},{"ingredient":"Burro non salato","edible_grams":40,"fdc_id":173430,"fdc_description":"Butter, without salt","per_100g":{"sugar_g":0.06,"calories":717,"saturated_fat_g":50.489,"fat_g":81.11,"carbs_g":0.06,"protein_g":0.85,"fiber_g":0,"sodium_mg":11},"source_url":"https://fdc.nal.usda.gov/food-details/173430/nutrients"},{"ingredient":"Noce moscata macinata","edible_grams":0.5,"fdc_id":171326,"fdc_description":"Spices, nutmeg, ground","per_100g":{"protein_g":5.84,"sodium_mg":16,"saturated_fat_g":25.94,"fat_g":36.31,"carbs_g":49.29,"calories":525,"sugar_g":2.99,"fiber_g":20.8},"source_url":"https://fdc.nal.usda.gov/food-details/171326/nutrients"},{"ingredient":"Sale fino","edible_grams":5,"fdc_id":173468,"fdc_description":"Salt, table","per_100g":{"fiber_g":0,"sodium_mg":38758,"saturated_fat_g":0,"protein_g":0,"fat_g":0,"carbs_g":0,"calories":0,"sugar_g":0},"source_url":"https://fdc.nal.usda.gov/food-details/173468/nutrients"}]},"keywords":["ravioli fatti in casa","ravioli ricotta e spinaci","pasta fresca per ravioli"],"image_url":"/recetas/receta-raviolis-caseros/portada.webp","gallery":[{"url":"/recetas/receta-raviolis-caseros/portada.webp","alt":"Ravioli fatti in casa con ricotta e spinaci, burro nocciola e foglie di salvia"}],"seo":{"title":"Ravioli fatti in casa con ricotta e spinaci","description":"Ravioli ricotta e spinaci per 4: pasta fresca all’uovo, chiusura passo passo e burro nocciola alla salvia.","image_alt":"Ravioli fatti in casa con ricotta e spinaci, burro nocciola e foglie di salvia","image_variants":["/recetas/receta-raviolis-caseros/portada-1x1.webp","/recetas/receta-raviolis-caseros/portada-4x3.webp","/recetas/receta-raviolis-caseros/portada-16x9.webp"],"faq":[{"q":"Perché i ravioli si aprono in cottura?","a":"Cause frequenti sono ripieno umido, aria intrappolata, farina sui bordi o sigillo debole. Sgocciola la ricotta, strizza gli spinaci, espelli l’aria e inumidisci appena il bordo prima di premere."},{"q":"Posso farli senza macchina per pasta?","a":"Sì, con mattarello e piccole porzioni. Cerca una sfoglia uniforme di circa 1 mm e tieni coperto l’impasto inutilizzato. Il lavoro può superare i 90 minuti proposti."},{"q":"Posso congelarli prima di cuocerli?","a":"Sì. Congelali crudi e separati su vassoio, poi trasferiscili. Cuoci da congelati, prolunga quanto serve e verifica almeno 71 °C al centro."}]},"published":false,"editorial_status":"draft","content_html":"<p>Questi ravioli fatti in casa uniscono pasta fresca all’uovo e un ripieno sodo di ricotta, spinaci e parmigiano. Si chiudono in 24 pezzi e si servono con burro nocciola e salvia, senza coprire la tecnica con una salsa pesante.</p><p>La proposta rende 4 porzioni da 6 ravioli. Calcola 70 minuti di preparazione e 20 di cottura, 90 in totale; sgocciolatura, riposo e parte del lavoro si sovrappongono. Quantità, spessore, tempi e resa attendono una prova in cucina.</p>"},{"id":"9eb92ac0-4c94-529c-ac97-3253fd394638","recipe_group_id":"e8238258-5fe1-4344-8851-917fa546f20b","slug":"homemade-ravioli","public_path":"/ja/homemade-ravioli","source_url":null,"language":"ja","title":"リコッタとほうれん草の手作りラビオリ","excerpt":"4人分の手作りラビオリ。卵入り生地、リコッタとほうれん草の詰め方、セージ入り焦がしバターまで説明します。","summary":"卵入りの生パスタに、リコッタ、ほうれん草、パルメザンの固めのフィリングを包む手作りラビオリです。24個に成形し、重いソースではなくセージ入り焦がしバターで仕上げます。\n\n6個ずつ4人分を想定します。準備70分、加熱20分、合計90分で、水切り、休ませる時間、ほかの準備は一部並行します。分量、生地の厚さ、時間、出来上がり数は調理試作による確認前です。","category":"パスタ","category_slug":"pastas","difficulty":"中級","course":"主菜","cuisine":"イタリア料理の家庭向け提案","prep_time_minutes":70,"cook_time_minutes":20,"total_time_minutes":90,"servings":4,"ingredients":[{"name":"中力粉または薄力粉と強力粉を合わせた小麦粉","amount":"320","unit":"g","group":"生地"},{"name":"殻を除いた大きめの卵","amount":"3","unit":"個（約150 g）","group":"生地"},{"name":"水","amount":"15","unit":"ml、必要な場合のみ","group":"生地"},{"name":"全乳リコッタ","amount":"300","unit":"g","group":"フィリング"},{"name":"生のほうれん草","amount":"200","unit":"g","group":"フィリング"},{"name":"細かくおろしたパルメザン","amount":"40","unit":"g","group":"フィリング"},{"name":"粉末ナツメグ","amount":"0.5","unit":"g","group":"フィリング"},{"name":"細粒塩","amount":"5","unit":"g、分けて使用"},{"name":"無塩バター","amount":"40","unit":"g","group":"仕上げ"},{"name":"生のセージの葉","amount":"6","unit":"g","group":"仕上げ"},{"name":"ゆで水","amount":"3000","unit":"ml","group":"加熱用"}],"steps":[{"title":"リコッタの水を切る","content":"リコッタ300 gをボウルに重ねた細かいこし器へ入れ、覆って冷蔵庫で30分水切りします。室温に放置しません。最後にやさしく押しますが、乾いたペーストにはしません。この待ち時間は準備70分に含み、生地やほうれん草の作業と並行できます。","image_url":"/recetas/receta-raviolis-caseros/paso-01.webp","image_alt":"リコッタとほうれん草の手作りラビオリ: リコッタの水を切る"},{"title":"ほうれん草を加熱して水気を取る","content":"ほうれん草200 gを洗い、ぬれたまま広いフライパンへ入れます。中火で混ぜながら2～3分、しんなりするまで加熱します。清潔な皿に広げ、触れられる温度になったら清潔な手または布でできるだけ水を絞り、細かく刻みます。水分が多いとラビオリが開くことがあります。","image_url":"/recetas/receta-raviolis-caseros/paso-02.webp","image_alt":"リコッタとほうれん草の手作りラビオリ: ほうれん草を加熱して水気を取る"},{"title":"生地を合わせる","content":"小麦粉300 gの中央にくぼみを作り、殻を除いて約150 gの卵3個を加えます。フォークで溶き、縁の粉を少しずつ取り込みます。固い生地にまとまるまでこね、数分後も乾いた部分が残る場合だけ水を5 mlずつ加えます。残り20 gの粉は台とトレー用に残します。吸水は変わるため、水を必ず全量加えません。","image_url":"/recetas/receta-raviolis-caseros/paso-03.webp","image_alt":"リコッタとほうれん草の手作りラビオリ: 生地を合わせる"},{"title":"こねて休ませる","content":"清潔な台で8～10分、生地が滑らかになり、押した跡がゆっくり戻るまでこねます。乾燥しないようしっかり包み、涼しい室温で30分休ませます。生卵に触れた台と器具は、フィリングや加熱済みラビオリを扱う前に洗浄します。","image_url":"/recetas/receta-raviolis-caseros/paso-04.webp","image_alt":"リコッタとほうれん草の手作りラビオリ: こねて休ませる"},{"title":"固めのフィリングを作る","content":"水切りしたリコッタ、刻んだほうれん草、パルメザン40 g、ナツメグ0.5 g、塩2 gを混ぜます。小さじ1杯の形を保つ固さが必要です。約20 gずつ24等分する目安をつけ、広がる、または水が出る場合は10分冷蔵して再確認します。この提案ではフィリングに卵を加えません。","image_url":"/recetas/receta-raviolis-caseros/paso-05.webp","image_alt":"リコッタとほうれん草の手作りラビオリ: 固めのフィリングを作る"},{"title":"伸ばして包み、閉じる","content":"生地を4分割し、3個は包んでおきます。1個を機械または麺棒で約1 mmに均一に伸ばし、穴を避けます。フィリング6個分を間隔を空けて置き、周囲を水でごく軽く湿らせ、シートの反対側をかぶせます。空気を外へ押し出して密着させ、6個に切って全周を確認します。24個まで繰り返し、残した粉を振ったトレーに重ねず並べます。すぐ加熱するか、覆って加熱前最長2時間という提案で冷蔵します。","image_url":"/recetas/receta-raviolis-caseros/paso-06.webp","image_alt":"リコッタとほうれん草の手作りラビオリ: 伸ばして包み、閉じる"},{"title":"2回に分けてゆでる","content":"水3リットルに残りの塩3 gを加えて沸かします。同時にバター40 gとセージを中弱火で溶かし、ナッツの香りがして乳固形分が金色、黒色ではない状態で火から外します。くっつかないようラビオリを2回に分け、やさしく混ぜ、穏やかな沸騰が戻ってから3～5分ゆでます。最初の1個を開き、生地と接着部が加熱され、中心が少なくとも71 °Cか確認します。足りなければ延長し、別の1個を確認します。","image_url":"/recetas/receta-raviolis-caseros/paso-07.webp","image_alt":"リコッタとほうれん草の手作りラビオリ: 2回に分けてゆでる"},{"title":"仕上げて盛り、保存する","content":"穴あきレードルですくい、数秒水を切ってセージバターへ移します。壊さないよう30～60秒やさしく動かします。1人6個をすぐ盛ります。残りは浅い容器に入れ、2時間以内、室温が32 °Cを超えるなら1時間以内に4 °C以下で冷蔵し、2日以内の使用を提案します。再加熱は1回だけ中心74 °Cまで。粉や未洗浄器具に触れた残りの生卵は保存しません。","image_url":"/recetas/receta-raviolis-caseros/paso-08.webp","image_alt":"リコッタとほうれん草の手作りラビオリ: 仕上げて盛り、保存する"}],"notes":"生地とフィリングは小麦、卵、乳を含みます。水分、構造、栄養が変わるため、このカードではグルテン、卵、乳を除く置換は提案しません。リコッタは冷蔵で水切りし、ほうれん草は十分絞ります。開いた縁はゆでる前に閉じ直し、重ねません。厚さ1 mm、24個、時間は調理確認前の編集上の目標です。冷凍する場合は生のラビオリを離してトレーで固め、容器へ移します。凍ったまま加熱し、必要に応じ時間を延ばし、中心71 °C以上を確認します。室温解凍はしません。","nutrition":{"calories":598.4,"protein_g":26.5,"carbs_g":65.8,"fat_g":24.9,"saturated_fat_g":14.3,"fiber_g":3.3,"sugar_g":0.9,"sodium_mg":761,"estimated":true,"serving_size":"提案する24個のうち6個とソース4分の1","source":"USDA FoodData Central — SR Legacy (abril de 2018)","source_url":"https://fdc.nal.usda.gov/download-datasets/","method":"確認済みSR Legacy資料8件を使い、提案可食重量を合計して4で割っています。小麦粉320 gとバター40 gは、作業粉やソースが残る場合も全量計上。塩5 gは、塩を含むゆで水の一部を捨てる場合も保守的に全量計上しています。","note":"情報用の推定で完成品の分析値ではありません。リコッタの製品と水分、卵の実重量、取り込まれない粉、吸水、器具に残るチーズとバターで変わります。分量と出来上がり数は調理試作による確認前です。","inputs":[{"ingredient":"中力粉または薄力粉と強力粉を合わせた小麦粉","edible_grams":320,"fdc_id":168936,"fdc_description":"Wheat flour, white, all-purpose, enriched, unbleached","per_100g":{"fiber_g":2.7,"fat_g":0.98,"carbs_g":76.31,"calories":364,"protein_g":10.33,"sodium_mg":2,"saturated_fat_g":0.155,"sugar_g":0.27},"source_url":"https://fdc.nal.usda.gov/food-details/168936/nutrients"},{"ingredient":"殻を除いた大きめの卵","edible_grams":150,"fdc_id":171287,"fdc_description":"Egg, whole, raw, fresh","per_100g":{"calories":143,"saturated_fat_g":3.126,"protein_g":12.56,"sodium_mg":142,"sugar_g":0.37,"fat_g":9.51,"carbs_g":0.72,"fiber_g":0},"source_url":"https://fdc.nal.usda.gov/food-details/171287/nutrients"},{"ingredient":"全乳リコッタ","edible_grams":300,"fdc_id":170851,"fdc_description":"Cheese, ricotta, whole milk","per_100g":{"calories":174,"protein_g":11.26,"carbs_g":3.04,"fat_g":12.98,"saturated_fat_g":8.295,"fiber_g":0,"sugar_g":0.27,"sodium_mg":84},"source_url":"https://fdc.nal.usda.gov/food-details/170851/nutrients"},{"ingredient":"生のほうれん草","edible_grams":200,"fdc_id":168462,"fdc_description":"Spinach, raw","per_100g":{"calories":23,"protein_g":2.86,"carbs_g":3.63,"fat_g":0.39,"saturated_fat_g":0.063,"fiber_g":2.2,"sugar_g":0.42,"sodium_mg":79},"source_url":"https://fdc.nal.usda.gov/food-details/168462/nutrients"},{"ingredient":"細かくおろしたパルメザン","edible_grams":40,"fdc_id":170848,"fdc_description":"Cheese, parmesan, hard","per_100g":{"calories":392,"protein_g":35.75,"carbs_g":3.22,"fat_g":25,"saturated_fat_g":16.41,"fiber_g":0,"sugar_g":0.8,"sodium_mg":1184},"source_url":"https://fdc.nal.usda.gov/food-details/170848/nutrients"},{"ingredient":"無塩バター","edible_grams":40,"fdc_id":173430,"fdc_description":"Butter, without salt","per_100g":{"sugar_g":0.06,"calories":717,"saturated_fat_g":50.489,"fat_g":81.11,"carbs_g":0.06,"protein_g":0.85,"fiber_g":0,"sodium_mg":11},"source_url":"https://fdc.nal.usda.gov/food-details/173430/nutrients"},{"ingredient":"粉末ナツメグ","edible_grams":0.5,"fdc_id":171326,"fdc_description":"Spices, nutmeg, ground","per_100g":{"protein_g":5.84,"sodium_mg":16,"saturated_fat_g":25.94,"fat_g":36.31,"carbs_g":49.29,"calories":525,"sugar_g":2.99,"fiber_g":20.8},"source_url":"https://fdc.nal.usda.gov/food-details/171326/nutrients"},{"ingredient":"細粒塩","edible_grams":5,"fdc_id":173468,"fdc_description":"Salt, table","per_100g":{"fiber_g":0,"sodium_mg":38758,"saturated_fat_g":0,"protein_g":0,"fat_g":0,"carbs_g":0,"calories":0,"sugar_g":0},"source_url":"https://fdc.nal.usda.gov/food-details/173468/nutrients"}]},"keywords":["手作りラビオリ","リコッタとほうれん草のラビオリ","ラビオリの生地"],"image_url":"/recetas/receta-raviolis-caseros/portada.webp","gallery":[{"url":"/recetas/receta-raviolis-caseros/portada.webp","alt":"リコッタとほうれん草の手作りラビオリ、焦がしバターとセージの葉"}],"seo":{"title":"リコッタとほうれん草の手作りラビオリ","description":"4人分の手作りラビオリ。卵入り生地、リコッタとほうれん草の詰め方、セージ入り焦がしバターまで説明します。","image_alt":"リコッタとほうれん草の手作りラビオリ、焦がしバターとセージの葉","image_variants":["/recetas/receta-raviolis-caseros/portada-1x1.webp","/recetas/receta-raviolis-caseros/portada-4x3.webp","/recetas/receta-raviolis-caseros/portada-16x9.webp"],"faq":[{"q":"ゆでるとラビオリが開くのはなぜですか？","a":"水分の多いフィリング、内部の空気、縁の粉、接着不足が主な原因です。リコッタを水切りし、ほうれん草を絞り、空気を抜き、押す前に周囲をわずかに湿らせます。"},{"q":"パスタマシンなしでも作れますか？","a":"はい。麺棒と小分けした生地を使い、約1 mmの均一なシートを目指します。使わない生地は覆います。作業は提案の90分を超える場合があります。"},{"q":"ゆでる前に冷凍できますか？","a":"はい。生のラビオリをトレーで離して冷凍し、容器へ移します。凍ったままゆで、必要な時間を追加し、中心が少なくとも71 °Cに達することを確認します。"}]},"published":false,"editorial_status":"draft","content_html":"<p>卵入りの生パスタに、リコッタ、ほうれん草、パルメザンの固めのフィリングを包む手作りラビオリです。24個に成形し、重いソースではなくセージ入り焦がしバターで仕上げます。</p><p>6個ずつ4人分を想定します。準備70分、加熱20分、合計90分で、水切り、休ませる時間、ほかの準備は一部並行します。分量、生地の厚さ、時間、出来上がり数は調理試作による確認前です。</p>"},{"id":"170a489c-2c0c-59c4-8b85-b1141e50ae74","recipe_group_id":"e8238258-5fe1-4344-8851-917fa546f20b","slug":"ravioli-caseiro","public_path":"/pt/ravioli-caseiro","source_url":null,"language":"pt","title":"Ravioli caseiro de ricota e espinafre","excerpt":"Ravioli caseiro de ricota e espinafre para 4: massa fresca com ovos, fechamento passo a passo e manteiga dourada com sálvia.","summary":"Este ravioli caseiro combina massa fresca de ovos com um recheio firme de ricota, espinafre e parmesão. São fechadas 24 unidades e servidas com manteiga dourada e sálvia, sem esconder a técnica sob um molho pesado.\n\nA proposta rende 4 porções de 6 raviolis. Calcule 70 minutos de preparo e 20 de cozimento, 90 no total; drenagem, descanso e parte do preparo se sobrepõem. Quantidades, espessura, tempos e rendimento aguardam teste de cozinha.","category":"Massas","category_slug":"pastas","difficulty":"Média","course":"Prato principal","cuisine":"Italiana, proposta caseira","prep_time_minutes":70,"cook_time_minutes":20,"total_time_minutes":90,"servings":4,"ingredients":[{"name":"Farinha de trigo de uso geral","amount":"320","unit":"g","group":"Massa"},{"name":"Ovos grandes, sem casca","amount":"3","unit":"ovos grandes (cerca de 150 g)","group":"Massa"},{"name":"Água","amount":"15","unit":"ml, somente se necessário","group":"Massa"},{"name":"Ricota de leite integral","amount":"300","unit":"g","group":"Recheio"},{"name":"Espinafre fresco","amount":"200","unit":"g","group":"Recheio"},{"name":"Queijo parmesão ralado fino","amount":"40","unit":"g","group":"Recheio"},{"name":"Noz-moscada moída","amount":"0.5","unit":"g","group":"Recheio"},{"name":"Sal fino","amount":"5","unit":"g, divididos"},{"name":"Manteiga sem sal","amount":"40","unit":"g","group":"Finalização"},{"name":"Folhas de sálvia fresca","amount":"6","unit":"g","group":"Finalização"},{"name":"Água para cozinhar","amount":"3000","unit":"ml","group":"Cozimento"}],"steps":[{"title":"Escorra a ricota","content":"Coloque os 300 g de ricota em uma peneira fina sobre uma tigela, cubra e deixe escorrer 30 minutos na geladeira. Não deixe em temperatura ambiente. Pressione de leve no final sem formar uma pasta seca. A espera entra nos 70 minutos de preparo e pode se sobrepor à massa e ao espinafre.","image_url":"/recetas/receta-raviolis-caseros/paso-01.webp","image_alt":"Ravioli caseiro de ricota e espinafre: Escorra a ricota"},{"title":"Cozinhe e seque o espinafre","content":"Lave os 200 g de espinafre e coloque ainda úmido em uma frigideira larga. Cozinhe 2–3 minutos em fogo médio, mexendo, até murchar. Espalhe em prato limpo para perder calor; quando puder tocar, esprema com mãos limpas ou pano limpo para tirar o máximo de água e pique fino. Espinafre úmido pode abrir os raviolis.","image_url":"/recetas/receta-raviolis-caseros/paso-02.webp","image_alt":"Ravioli caseiro de ricota e espinafre: Cozinhe e seque o espinafre"},{"title":"Misture a massa","content":"Faça um poço em 300 g de farinha e junte os 3 ovos, cerca de 150 g sem casca. Bata com garfo e incorpore farinha da borda aos poucos. Amasse até unir uma massa firme; acrescente água de 5 em 5 ml somente se restarem partes secas após vários minutos. Reserve os 20 g de farinha para bancada e assadeira. A absorção varia: não use toda a água por obrigação.","image_url":"/recetas/receta-raviolis-caseros/paso-03.webp","image_alt":"Ravioli caseiro de ricota e espinafre: Misture a massa"},{"title":"Sove e deixe descansar","content":"Sove 8–10 minutos em superfície limpa até a massa ficar lisa e voltar devagar ao ser pressionada. Embrulhe bem para não ressecar e descanse 30 minutos em temperatura ambiente fresca. Higienize bancada e utensílios que tocaram ovo cru antes do recheio ou de raviolis cozidos.","image_url":"/recetas/receta-raviolis-caseros/paso-04.webp","image_alt":"Ravioli caseiro de ricota e espinafre: Sove e deixe descansar"},{"title":"Faça um recheio seco","content":"Misture ricota escorrida, espinafre picado, 40 g de parmesão, 0,5 g de noz-moscada e 2 g de sal. Deve ficar espesso e manter o formato de uma colher de chá. Divida visualmente em 24 porções de cerca de 20 g; se espalhar ou soltar líquido, refrigere 10 minutos e confira de novo. Não acrescente ovo a este recheio proposto.","image_url":"/recetas/receta-raviolis-caseros/paso-05.webp","image_alt":"Ravioli caseiro de ricota e espinafre: Faça um recheio seco"},{"title":"Abra, recheie e feche","content":"Divida a massa em 4 partes e mantenha 3 embrulhadas. Abra uma parte na máquina ou rolo até cerca de 1 mm, sem furos. Coloque 6 porções espaçadas, umedeça quase nada o contorno e cubra com a outra metade. Expulse o ar e pressione para fechar. Corte 6 raviolis e confira cada borda. Repita até 24; ponha sem empilhar em assadeira com farinha reservada. Cozinhe na hora ou refrigere cobertos por no máximo 2 horas propostas antes do cozimento.","image_url":"/recetas/receta-raviolis-caseros/paso-06.webp","image_alt":"Ravioli caseiro de ricota e espinafre: Abra, recheie e feche"},{"title":"Cozinhe em duas levas","content":"Ferva os 3 litros de água com os 3 g de sal restantes. Enquanto isso, derreta os 40 g de manteiga em fogo médio-baixo com a sálvia até cheirar a avelã e os sólidos ficarem dourados, não pretos; tire do fogo. Cozinhe em 2 levas para não grudar: mexa com cuidado e conte 3–5 minutos após voltar a fervura moderada. Abra um ravioli de teste da primeira leva: massa macia, selo cozido e centro a pelo menos 71 °C. Se não, prolongue e teste outro.","image_url":"/recetas/receta-raviolis-caseros/paso-07.webp","image_alt":"Ravioli caseiro de ricota e espinafre: Cozinhe em duas levas"},{"title":"Finalize, sirva e guarde","content":"Retire com escumadeira, escorra por segundos e passe para a frigideira de manteiga e sálvia. Mexa com cuidado 30–60 segundos sem romper. Sirva na hora 6 raviolis por pessoa. Refrigere sobras em recipientes baixos a 4 °C ou menos em até 2 horas, ou 1 hora se o ambiente passar de 32 °C; propõe-se consumo em 2 dias. Reaqueça uma vez até 74 °C no centro. Não guarde ovo cru restante que tocou farinha ou utensílios não higienizados.","image_url":"/recetas/receta-raviolis-caseros/paso-08.webp","image_alt":"Ravioli caseiro de ricota e espinafre: Finalize, sirva e guarde"}],"notes":"Massa e recheio contêm trigo, ovo e leite. A ficha não propõe substituições sem glúten, ovo ou leite porque mudariam hidratação, estrutura e nutrição. Escorra a ricota no frio e esprema bem o espinafre. Sele qualquer borda aberta antes de cozinhar e não empilhe. Espessura de 1 mm, rendimento de 24 unidades e tempos são objetivos editoriais aguardando confirmação em cozinha. Para congelar, separe os raviolis crus em assadeira até firmarem e transfira; cozinhe congelados, aumente o tempo conforme necessário e confira ao menos 71 °C no centro. Não descongele em temperatura ambiente.","nutrition":{"calories":598.4,"protein_g":26.5,"carbs_g":65.8,"fat_g":24.9,"saturated_fat_g":14.3,"fiber_g":3.3,"sugar_g":0.9,"sodium_mg":761,"estimated":true,"serving_size":"6 raviolis de um total proposto de 24, com um quarto do molho","source":"USDA FoodData Central — SR Legacy (abril de 2018)","source_url":"https://fdc.nal.usda.gov/download-datasets/","method":"Oito fichas SR Legacy verificadas; pesos comestíveis propostos somados e divididos por 4. Contam-se todos os 320 g de farinha e os 40 g de manteiga, embora possa sobrar farinha de trabalho ou molho. Contam-se de forma conservadora todos os 5 g de sal, ainda que parte da água salgada seja descartada.","note":"Estimativa informativa, não análise do prato pronto. Marca e umidade da ricota, tamanho real dos ovos, farinha não incorporada, água absorvida, queijo e manteiga nos utensílios alteram o resultado. Quantidades e rendimento aguardam teste de cozinha.","inputs":[{"ingredient":"Farinha de trigo de uso geral","edible_grams":320,"fdc_id":168936,"fdc_description":"Wheat flour, white, all-purpose, enriched, unbleached","per_100g":{"fiber_g":2.7,"fat_g":0.98,"carbs_g":76.31,"calories":364,"protein_g":10.33,"sodium_mg":2,"saturated_fat_g":0.155,"sugar_g":0.27},"source_url":"https://fdc.nal.usda.gov/food-details/168936/nutrients"},{"ingredient":"Ovos grandes, sem casca","edible_grams":150,"fdc_id":171287,"fdc_description":"Egg, whole, raw, fresh","per_100g":{"calories":143,"saturated_fat_g":3.126,"protein_g":12.56,"sodium_mg":142,"sugar_g":0.37,"fat_g":9.51,"carbs_g":0.72,"fiber_g":0},"source_url":"https://fdc.nal.usda.gov/food-details/171287/nutrients"},{"ingredient":"Ricota de leite integral","edible_grams":300,"fdc_id":170851,"fdc_description":"Cheese, ricotta, whole milk","per_100g":{"calories":174,"protein_g":11.26,"carbs_g":3.04,"fat_g":12.98,"saturated_fat_g":8.295,"fiber_g":0,"sugar_g":0.27,"sodium_mg":84},"source_url":"https://fdc.nal.usda.gov/food-details/170851/nutrients"},{"ingredient":"Espinafre fresco","edible_grams":200,"fdc_id":168462,"fdc_description":"Spinach, raw","per_100g":{"calories":23,"protein_g":2.86,"carbs_g":3.63,"fat_g":0.39,"saturated_fat_g":0.063,"fiber_g":2.2,"sugar_g":0.42,"sodium_mg":79},"source_url":"https://fdc.nal.usda.gov/food-details/168462/nutrients"},{"ingredient":"Queijo parmesão ralado fino","edible_grams":40,"fdc_id":170848,"fdc_description":"Cheese, parmesan, hard","per_100g":{"calories":392,"protein_g":35.75,"carbs_g":3.22,"fat_g":25,"saturated_fat_g":16.41,"fiber_g":0,"sugar_g":0.8,"sodium_mg":1184},"source_url":"https://fdc.nal.usda.gov/food-details/170848/nutrients"},{"ingredient":"Manteiga sem sal","edible_grams":40,"fdc_id":173430,"fdc_description":"Butter, without salt","per_100g":{"sugar_g":0.06,"calories":717,"saturated_fat_g":50.489,"fat_g":81.11,"carbs_g":0.06,"protein_g":0.85,"fiber_g":0,"sodium_mg":11},"source_url":"https://fdc.nal.usda.gov/food-details/173430/nutrients"},{"ingredient":"Noz-moscada moída","edible_grams":0.5,"fdc_id":171326,"fdc_description":"Spices, nutmeg, ground","per_100g":{"protein_g":5.84,"sodium_mg":16,"saturated_fat_g":25.94,"fat_g":36.31,"carbs_g":49.29,"calories":525,"sugar_g":2.99,"fiber_g":20.8},"source_url":"https://fdc.nal.usda.gov/food-details/171326/nutrients"},{"ingredient":"Sal fino","edible_grams":5,"fdc_id":173468,"fdc_description":"Salt, table","per_100g":{"fiber_g":0,"sodium_mg":38758,"saturated_fat_g":0,"protein_g":0,"fat_g":0,"carbs_g":0,"calories":0,"sugar_g":0},"source_url":"https://fdc.nal.usda.gov/food-details/173468/nutrients"}]},"keywords":["ravioli caseiro","ravioli de ricota e espinafre","massa fresca para ravioli"],"image_url":"/recetas/receta-raviolis-caseros/portada.webp","gallery":[{"url":"/recetas/receta-raviolis-caseros/portada.webp","alt":"Ravioli caseiro de ricota e espinafre com manteiga dourada e folhas de sálvia"}],"seo":{"title":"Ravioli caseiro de ricota e espinafre","description":"Ravioli caseiro de ricota e espinafre para 4: massa fresca com ovos, fechamento passo a passo e manteiga dourada com sálvia.","image_alt":"Ravioli caseiro de ricota e espinafre com manteiga dourada e folhas de sálvia","image_variants":["/recetas/receta-raviolis-caseros/portada-1x1.webp","/recetas/receta-raviolis-caseros/portada-4x3.webp","/recetas/receta-raviolis-caseros/portada-16x9.webp"],"faq":[{"q":"Por que os raviolis abrem no cozimento?","a":"As causas comuns são recheio úmido, ar preso, farinha nas bordas ou fechamento fraco. Escorra a ricota, esprema o espinafre, expulse o ar e umedeça quase nada o contorno antes de pressionar."},{"q":"Posso fazer sem máquina de massa?","a":"Sim, com rolo e pequenas porções. Busque uma folha uniforme de cerca de 1 mm e mantenha coberta a massa que não usar. O trabalho pode passar dos 90 minutos propostos."},{"q":"Posso congelar antes de cozinhar?","a":"Sim. Congele os raviolis crus separados em assadeira e depois transfira. Cozinhe congelados, aumente o tempo conforme necessário e confira pelo menos 71 °C no centro."}]},"published":false,"editorial_status":"draft","content_html":"<p>Este ravioli caseiro combina massa fresca de ovos com um recheio firme de ricota, espinafre e parmesão. São fechadas 24 unidades e servidas com manteiga dourada e sálvia, sem esconder a técnica sob um molho pesado.</p><p>A proposta rende 4 porções de 6 raviolis. Calcule 70 minutos de preparo e 20 de cozimento, 90 no total; drenagem, descanso e parte do preparo se sobrepõem. Quantidades, espessura, tempos e rendimento aguardam teste de cozinha.</p>"},{"id":"835f1de3-70b7-4d41-a9ff-1695b7ae21fc","recipe_group_id":"8686de2f-500a-4c72-8f1c-1e9c0341e905","slug":"receta-de-bandeja-paisa","public_path":"/receta-de-bandeja-paisa","source_url":"https://manualdecocina.com/receta-de-bandeja-paisa/","language":"es","title":"Bandeja paisa colombiana","excerpt":"Bandeja paisa para 4 con frijoles rojos, arroz, arepa, carne molida, chicharrón, chorizo, plátano maduro, huevo, aguacate y hogao.","summary":"Esta bandeja paisa reúne en un solo plato los componentes más reconocibles de la preparación antioqueña: frijoles rojos espesos, arroz blanco, arepa, carne molida, chicharrón, chorizo, tajadas de plátano maduro, huevo frito, aguacate y hogao.\n\nLa propuesta rinde 4 bandejas abundantes. Requiere 45 minutos de preparación, unos 150 minutos de cocción y 8–12 horas de remojo de los frijoles: entre 675 y 915 minutos en total. La ficha muestra el mínimo de 675 minutos, incluido el remojo de 8 horas; varias tareas de cocina se hacen en paralelo. Las cantidades, tiempos, absorción de aceite y rendimiento están pendientes de confirmación mediante prueba de cocina.","category":"Platos principales","category_slug":"platos-principales","difficulty":"Alta","course":"Plato principal","cuisine":"Colombiana, antioqueña","prep_time_minutes":45,"cook_time_minutes":150,"total_time_minutes":675,"servings":4,"keywords":["bandeja paisa","receta de bandeja paisa","bandeja paisa colombiana","comida antioqueña","frijoles con chicharrón","plato típico colombiano"],"ingredients":[{"name":"frijoles rojos secos","amount":"200","unit":"g","group":"Frijoles"},{"name":"agua limpia para cocer los frijoles","amount":"1000","unit":"ml, más la necesaria para el remojo","group":"Frijoles"},{"name":"arroz blanco de grano largo","amount":"200","unit":"g","group":"Arroz"},{"name":"agua para el arroz","amount":"400","unit":"ml","group":"Arroz"},{"name":"harina de maíz precocida","amount":"120","unit":"g","group":"Arepas"},{"name":"agua tibia para las arepas","amount":"240","unit":"ml","group":"Arepas"},{"name":"tomates maduros, picados","amount":"300","unit":"g","group":"Hogao"},{"name":"cebolla blanca, picada","amount":"160","unit":"g","group":"Hogao"},{"name":"ajo, picado","amount":"12","unit":"g","group":"Hogao"},{"name":"comino molido","amount":"1","unit":"g","group":"Hogao"},{"name":"panceta de cerdo con piel","amount":"240","unit":"g","group":"Carnes"},{"name":"carne molida de res 85/15","amount":"260","unit":"g","group":"Carnes"},{"name":"chorizos pequeños de cerdo","amount":"4","unit":"unidades, 200 g en total","group":"Carnes"},{"name":"huevos grandes","amount":"4","unit":"unidades, aprox. 200 g sin cáscara","group":"Acompañamientos"},{"name":"plátano maduro pelado","amount":"400","unit":"g","group":"Acompañamientos"},{"name":"aguacate, pulpa","amount":"200","unit":"g","group":"Acompañamientos"},{"name":"aceite de canola","amount":"60","unit":"ml, dividido; la nutrición estima 50 g consumidos","group":"Cocción"},{"name":"sal fina","amount":"8","unit":"g, dividida","group":"Sazonado"}],"steps":[{"title":"Remoja los frijoles","content":"Revisa y enjuaga 200 g de frijoles rojos secos. Cúbrelos con abundante agua fría y déjalos 8–12 horas en la nevera. Escurre y desecha el agua de remojo. El total mínimo de 675 minutos incluye 8 horas de remojo; con 12 horas de remojo, calcula 915 minutos en total.","image_url":"/recetas/receta-de-bandeja-paisa/paso-01.webp","image_alt":"Bandeja paisa: frijoles rojos secos cubiertos con agua para el remojo"},{"title":"Cuece los frijoles hasta que estén tiernos","content":"Pon los frijoles escurridos en una olla con 1 litro de agua limpia. Lleva a ebullición, retira la espuma, baja a fuego medio-bajo y cocina parcialmente tapados 90–120 minutos. Remueve cada 20 minutos y añade agua caliente si dejan de estar cubiertos. Están listos cuando se aplastan con facilidad pero conservan la forma; no añadas todavía tomate ni sal.","image_url":"/recetas/receta-de-bandeja-paisa/paso-02.webp","image_alt":"Bandeja paisa: frijoles rojos cociéndose suavemente en una olla"},{"title":"Prepara el hogao","content":"Mientras se cuecen los frijoles, calienta 15 g del aceite en una sartén a fuego medio. Añade 160 g de cebolla picada y cocina 5 minutos. Incorpora 12 g de ajo picado y 1 g de comino; remueve 30 segundos. Agrega 300 g de tomate picado y 2 g de sal. Cocina 12–15 minutos, hasta obtener una salsa espesa. Reserva 40 g para los frijoles y mantén el resto para servir.","image_url":"/recetas/receta-de-bandeja-paisa/paso-03.webp","image_alt":"Bandeja paisa: hogao espeso de tomate y cebolla en una sartén"},{"title":"Termina los frijoles","content":"Cuando los frijoles estén tiernos, añade los 40 g de hogao reservados y 2 g de sal. Cocina destapado 10 minutos a fuego bajo, removiendo, hasta que el caldo cubra la cuchara. Si están muy secos, añade agua caliente de 30 en 30 ml; si están caldosos, prolonga la reducción.","image_url":"/recetas/receta-de-bandeja-paisa/paso-04.webp","image_alt":"Bandeja paisa: frijoles rojos terminados con hogao y caldo espeso"},{"title":"Cocina el arroz","content":"Enjuaga 200 g de arroz blanco hasta que el agua salga casi clara. Ponlo en una olla con 400 ml de agua y 2 g de sal. Lleva a ebullición, tapa, baja al mínimo y cocina 15–18 minutos sin destapar. Apaga y deja reposar 10 minutos; separa los granos con un tenedor.","image_url":"/recetas/receta-de-bandeja-paisa/paso-05.webp","image_alt":"Bandeja paisa: arroz blanco cocido y suelto en una olla"},{"title":"Forma y asa las arepas","content":"Mezcla 120 g de harina de maíz precocida con 240 ml de agua tibia y 1 g de sal. Reposa 5 minutos. Divide en 4 porciones, forma discos de unos 9 cm de diámetro y 1 cm de grosor y alisa los bordes. Asa en plancha ligeramente aceitada 6–8 minutos por lado a fuego medio-bajo, hasta que estén firmes y doradas.","image_url":"/recetas/receta-de-bandeja-paisa/paso-06.webp","image_alt":"Bandeja paisa: cuatro arepas pequeñas dorándose en una plancha"},{"title":"Dora el chicharrón","content":"Corta 240 g de panceta de cerdo con piel en 4 tiras iguales y haz cortes superficiales en la piel sin separar las piezas. Ponlas en una sartén fría con 60 ml de agua, tapa y cocina 10 minutos a fuego medio. Destapa y continúa 20–30 minutos a fuego medio-bajo, girando, mientras se evapora el agua y se funde la grasa. Retira cuando la piel esté crujiente, la carne dorada y el centro alcance al menos 71 °C. Escurre en rejilla; guarda la grasa aparte, no la viertas por el desagüe.","image_url":"/recetas/receta-de-bandeja-paisa/paso-07.webp","image_alt":"Bandeja paisa: tiras de chicharrón doradas y crujientes en una sartén"},{"title":"Cocina la carne y los chorizos","content":"Calienta 10 g del aceite en una sartén limpia. Añade 260 g de carne molida y 1 g de sal; cocina 7–9 minutos a fuego medio-alto, separándola, hasta que no queden zonas rosadas y alcance 71 °C. Retira y mantén caliente. En la misma sartén cocina 4 chorizos pequeños, 200 g en total, durante 10–12 minutos, girándolos, hasta que alcancen 71 °C en el centro.","image_url":"/recetas/receta-de-bandeja-paisa/paso-08.webp","image_alt":"Bandeja paisa: carne molida dorada y cuatro chorizos cocinándose"},{"title":"Fríe el plátano y los huevos","content":"Corta 400 g de plátano maduro pelado en tajadas diagonales. Calienta el aceite restante en una sartén amplia y fríe las tajadas 3–4 minutos por lado a fuego medio, hasta que estén doradas y tiernas; escurre sobre rejilla. En la misma sartén fríe 4 huevos, uno por uno, 3–4 minutos, hasta que la clara esté completamente cuajada. Para embarazadas, niños pequeños, mayores o personas inmunodeprimidas, cocina también la yema hasta que esté firme.","image_url":"/recetas/receta-de-bandeja-paisa/paso-09.webp","image_alt":"Bandeja paisa: tajadas de plátano maduro doradas y huevos fritos con clara cuajada"},{"title":"Monta las cuatro bandejas","content":"Reparte en cada plato una cuarta parte de los frijoles y del arroz, 1 arepa, 1 tira de chicharrón, 1 chorizo, una cuarta parte de la carne molida y del plátano, 1 huevo y 50 g de aguacate. Añade el hogao restante al gusto y sirve inmediatamente. Las cantidades, tiempos y rendimiento son una propuesta editorial pendiente de confirmación en cocina.","image_url":"/recetas/receta-de-bandeja-paisa/paso-10.webp","image_alt":"Bandeja paisa completa con frijoles, arroz, arepa, carnes, plátano, huevo, aguacate y hogao"}],"notes":"Este plato contiene cerdo y huevo; el chorizo puede contener gluten o leche según la marca. Para una bandeja sin gluten, confirma que chorizo y harina de maíz estén certificados. No se propone una versión vegetariana como sustitución directa porque cambiaría identidad, tiempos y nutrición. Cocina carne molida, chorizo y panceta hasta al menos 71 °C en el centro; para personas vulnerables, sirve el huevo con yema firme. Refrigera frijoles, arroz y carnes en recipientes bajos a 4 °C o menos dentro de 2 horas —1 hora si el ambiente supera 32 °C— y consume en 3 días. Guarda aguacate y elementos crujientes por separado. Recalienta una sola vez hasta 74 °C. El remojo, la absorción de aceite, el espesor del chicharrón y el tamaño final de las arepas deben validarse en cocina.","nutrition":{"calories":1483.3,"protein_g":50.5,"carbs_g":138.4,"fat_g":82.9,"saturated_fat_g":24.2,"fiber_g":17.8,"sugar_g":21,"sodium_mg":1346,"estimated":true,"serving_size":"1 bandeja de 4, con todos los componentes","source":"USDA FoodData Central — SR Legacy (abril de 2018)","source_url":"https://fdc.nal.usda.gov/download-datasets/","method":"Quince fichas USDA SR Legacy verificadas; pesos crudos comestibles sumados y divididos entre 4. Se cuentan 200 g de frijol seco, 200 g de arroz crudo, 260 g de carne molida, 240 g de panceta, 200 g de chorizo, 200 g de huevo, 400 g de plátano, 120 g de harina de maíz, 200 g de aguacate, todo el hogao, 1 g de comino, 50 g de aceite estimado como consumido y 8 g de sal. La harina de maíz integral aproxima la harina precocida; la salchicha ahumada de cerdo aproxima el chorizo; el plátano crudo aproxima el plátano maduro.","note":"Estimación informativa, no análisis del plato terminado. Es deliberadamente conservadora: cuenta toda la panceta y 50 g de aceite, aunque parte de la grasa se escurra o quede en la sartén. Marca de chorizo, grasa de la carne, madurez del plátano, harina, absorción de aceite, caldo servido y tamaño real de las porciones pueden cambiar mucho el resultado.","inputs":[{"ingredient":"frijol rojo seco","edible_grams":200,"fdc_id":173734,"fdc_description":"Beans, kidney, red, mature seeds, raw","per_100g":{"calories":337,"protein_g":22.53,"carbs_g":61.29,"fat_g":1.06,"saturated_fat_g":0.154,"fiber_g":15.2,"sugar_g":2.1,"sodium_mg":12},"source_url":"https://fdc.nal.usda.gov/food-details/173734/nutrients"},{"ingredient":"arroz blanco de grano largo crudo","edible_grams":200,"fdc_id":168877,"fdc_description":"Rice, white, long-grain, regular, raw, enriched","per_100g":{"calories":365,"protein_g":7.13,"carbs_g":79.95,"fat_g":0.66,"saturated_fat_g":0.18,"fiber_g":1.3,"sugar_g":0.12,"sodium_mg":5},"source_url":"https://fdc.nal.usda.gov/food-details/168877/nutrients"},{"ingredient":"carne molida de res 85/15 cruda","edible_grams":260,"fdc_id":174036,"fdc_description":"Beef, ground, 85% lean meat / 15% fat, raw","per_100g":{"calories":215,"protein_g":18.59,"carbs_g":0,"fat_g":15,"saturated_fat_g":5.9,"fiber_g":0,"sugar_g":0,"sodium_mg":66},"source_url":"https://fdc.nal.usda.gov/food-details/174036/nutrients"},{"ingredient":"panceta de cerdo cruda con piel","edible_grams":240,"fdc_id":167812,"fdc_description":"Pork, fresh, belly, raw","per_100g":{"calories":518,"protein_g":9.34,"carbs_g":0,"fat_g":53.01,"saturated_fat_g":19.33,"fiber_g":0,"sugar_g":0,"sodium_mg":32},"source_url":"https://fdc.nal.usda.gov/food-details/167812/nutrients"},{"ingredient":"chorizo de cerdo cocido ahumado, proxy","edible_grams":200,"fdc_id":174584,"fdc_description":"Sausage, smoked link sausage, pork","per_100g":{"calories":309,"protein_g":11.98,"carbs_g":0.94,"fat_g":28.23,"saturated_fat_g":9.313,"fiber_g":0,"sugar_g":0.94,"sodium_mg":827},"source_url":"https://fdc.nal.usda.gov/food-details/174584/nutrients"},{"ingredient":"huevo entero crudo","edible_grams":200,"fdc_id":171287,"fdc_description":"Egg, whole, raw, fresh","per_100g":{"calories":143,"protein_g":12.56,"carbs_g":0.72,"fat_g":9.51,"saturated_fat_g":3.126,"fiber_g":0,"sugar_g":0.37,"sodium_mg":142},"source_url":"https://fdc.nal.usda.gov/food-details/171287/nutrients"},{"ingredient":"plátano maduro pelado crudo","edible_grams":400,"fdc_id":168215,"fdc_description":"Plantains, raw (proxy de plátano maduro)","per_100g":{"calories":122,"protein_g":1.3,"carbs_g":31.9,"fat_g":0.37,"saturated_fat_g":0.14,"fiber_g":2.3,"sugar_g":15,"sodium_mg":4},"source_url":"https://fdc.nal.usda.gov/food-details/168215/nutrients"},{"ingredient":"harina de maíz amarilla integral, proxy arepa precocida","edible_grams":120,"fdc_id":170290,"fdc_description":"Corn flour, whole-grain, yellow (proxy de harina de maíz precocida para arepa)","per_100g":{"calories":361,"protein_g":6.93,"carbs_g":76.85,"fat_g":3.86,"saturated_fat_g":0.55,"fiber_g":7.3,"sugar_g":0.64,"sodium_mg":5},"source_url":"https://fdc.nal.usda.gov/food-details/170290/nutrients"},{"ingredient":"aguacate pulpa","edible_grams":200,"fdc_id":171705,"fdc_description":"Avocados, raw, all commercial varieties","per_100g":{"calories":160,"protein_g":2,"carbs_g":8.53,"fat_g":14.66,"saturated_fat_g":2.126,"fiber_g":6.7,"sugar_g":0.66,"sodium_mg":7},"source_url":"https://fdc.nal.usda.gov/food-details/171705/nutrients"},{"ingredient":"tomate rojo crudo","edible_grams":300,"fdc_id":170457,"fdc_description":"Tomatoes, red, ripe, raw, year round average","per_100g":{"calories":18,"protein_g":0.88,"carbs_g":3.89,"fat_g":0.2,"saturated_fat_g":0.028,"fiber_g":1.2,"sugar_g":2.63,"sodium_mg":5},"source_url":"https://fdc.nal.usda.gov/food-details/170457/nutrients"},{"ingredient":"cebolla cruda","edible_grams":160,"fdc_id":170000,"fdc_description":"Onions, raw","per_100g":{"calories":40,"protein_g":1.1,"carbs_g":9.34,"fat_g":0.1,"saturated_fat_g":0.042,"fiber_g":1.7,"sugar_g":4.24,"sodium_mg":4},"source_url":"https://fdc.nal.usda.gov/food-details/170000/nutrients"},{"ingredient":"ajo crudo","edible_grams":12,"fdc_id":169230,"fdc_description":"Garlic, raw","per_100g":{"calories":149,"protein_g":6.36,"carbs_g":33.06,"fat_g":0.5,"saturated_fat_g":0.089,"fiber_g":2.1,"sugar_g":1,"sodium_mg":17},"source_url":"https://fdc.nal.usda.gov/food-details/169230/nutrients"},{"ingredient":"comino molido","edible_grams":1,"fdc_id":170923,"fdc_description":"Spices, cumin seed","per_100g":{"calories":375,"protein_g":17.81,"carbs_g":44.24,"fat_g":22.27,"saturated_fat_g":1.535,"fiber_g":10.5,"sugar_g":2.25,"sodium_mg":168},"source_url":"https://fdc.nal.usda.gov/food-details/170923/nutrients"},{"ingredient":"aceite de canola absorbido","edible_grams":50,"fdc_id":172336,"fdc_description":"Oil, canola","per_100g":{"calories":884,"protein_g":0,"carbs_g":0,"fat_g":100,"saturated_fat_g":7.365,"fiber_g":0,"sugar_g":0,"sodium_mg":0},"source_url":"https://fdc.nal.usda.gov/food-details/172336/nutrients"},{"ingredient":"sal de mesa","edible_grams":8,"fdc_id":173468,"fdc_description":"Salt, table","per_100g":{"calories":0,"protein_g":0,"carbs_g":0,"fat_g":0,"saturated_fat_g":0,"fiber_g":0,"sugar_g":0,"sodium_mg":38758},"source_url":"https://fdc.nal.usda.gov/food-details/173468/nutrients"}]},"image_url":"/recetas/receta-de-bandeja-paisa/portada.webp","gallery":[{"url":"/recetas/receta-de-bandeja-paisa/portada.webp","alt":"Bandeja paisa colombiana completa servida en plato grande"}],"seo":{"title":"Bandeja paisa colombiana completa | Manual de Cocina","description":"Prepara bandeja paisa para 4 con frijoles, arroz, arepa, carne molida, chicharrón, chorizo, plátano, huevo, aguacate y hogao.","image_variants":["/recetas/receta-de-bandeja-paisa/portada-1x1.webp","/recetas/receta-de-bandeja-paisa/portada-4x3.webp","/recetas/receta-de-bandeja-paisa/portada-16x9.webp"],"faq":[{"q":"¿Qué lleva una bandeja paisa completa?","a":"Esta propuesta incluye frijoles rojos, arroz blanco, arepa, carne molida, chicharrón, chorizo, plátano maduro, huevo frito, aguacate y hogao. La composición puede variar entre casas y restaurantes."},{"q":"¿Puedo adelantar componentes de la bandeja paisa?","a":"Sí. Cuece frijoles, arroz y carnes con anticipación, enfría en recipientes bajos y refrigera hasta 3 días. Haz las arepas, el plátano y los huevos cerca del servicio para conservar textura."},{"q":"¿Cómo consigo chicharrón crujiente sin que salpique tanto?","a":"Empieza con la panceta en una sartén fría y 60 ml de agua. Al evaporarse, la grasa se funde gradualmente. Mantén fuego medio-bajo, gira con pinzas y usa una tapa antisalpicaduras sin encerrar el vapor."}],"image_alt":"Bandeja paisa colombiana completa servida en plato grande"},"published":false,"editorial_status":"draft","content_html":"<p>Esta bandeja paisa reúne en un solo plato los componentes más reconocibles de la preparación antioqueña: frijoles rojos espesos, arroz blanco, arepa, carne molida, chicharrón, chorizo, tajadas de plátano maduro, huevo frito, aguacate y hogao.</p><p>La propuesta rinde 4 bandejas abundantes. Requiere 45 minutos de preparación, unos 150 minutos de cocción y 8–12 horas de remojo de los frijoles: entre 675 y 915 minutos en total. La ficha muestra el mínimo de 675 minutos, incluido el remojo de 8 horas; varias tareas de cocina se hacen en paralelo. Las cantidades, tiempos, absorción de aceite y rendimiento están pendientes de confirmación mediante prueba de cocina.</p>"},{"id":"c50bd0e3-f8cd-59d6-ad26-8d357e17b95c","recipe_group_id":"8686de2f-500a-4c72-8f1c-1e9c0341e905","slug":"bandeja-paisa-kolumbianischer-teller","public_path":"/de/bandeja-paisa-kolumbianischer-teller","source_url":null,"language":"de","title":"Kolumbianische Bandeja paisa","excerpt":"Bandeja paisa für 4 mit roten Bohnen, Reis, Arepas, Rinderhack, knusprigem Schweinebauch, Chorizo, reifer Kochbanane, Ei, Avocado und Hogao.","summary":"Diese Bandeja paisa vereint die bekanntesten Bestandteile des Gerichts aus Antioquia auf einem Teller: sämige rote Bohnen, weißen Reis, eine Arepa, Rinderhack, knusprigen Schweinebauch, Chorizo, reife Kochbananenscheiben, Spiegelei, Avocado und Hogao.\n\nDer Vorschlag ergibt 4 großzügige Portionen. Vorgesehen sind 45 Minuten Vorbereitung, etwa 150 Minuten Garzeit und 8–12 Stunden Einweichzeit für die Bohnen: insgesamt 675 bis 915 Minuten. Die Rezeptkarte zeigt den Mindestwert von 675 Minuten einschließlich 8 Stunden Einweichen; mehrere Küchenarbeiten laufen parallel. Mengen, Zeiten, Ölaufnahme und Ausbeute müssen noch durch einen Kochtest bestätigt werden.","category":"Hauptgerichte","category_slug":"platos-principales","difficulty":"Hoch","course":"Hauptgericht","cuisine":"Kolumbianisch, aus Antioquia","prep_time_minutes":45,"cook_time_minutes":150,"total_time_minutes":675,"servings":4,"keywords":["Bandeja paisa","kolumbianische Bandeja paisa","Rezept aus Antioquia","Bohnen mit Schweinebauch","kolumbianischer Teller"],"ingredients":[{"name":"getrocknete rote Kidneybohnen","amount":"200","unit":"g","group":"Bohnen"},{"name":"frisches Wasser zum Kochen der Bohnen","amount":"1000","unit":"ml, zusätzlich Wasser zum Einweichen","group":"Bohnen"},{"name":"weißer Langkornreis","amount":"200","unit":"g","group":"Reis"},{"name":"Wasser für den Reis","amount":"400","unit":"ml","group":"Reis"},{"name":"vorgegartes Maismehl","amount":"120","unit":"g","group":"Arepas"},{"name":"lauwarmes Wasser für die Arepas","amount":"240","unit":"ml","group":"Arepas"},{"name":"reife Tomaten, gehackt","amount":"300","unit":"g","group":"Hogao"},{"name":"weiße Zwiebel, gehackt","amount":"160","unit":"g","group":"Hogao"},{"name":"Knoblauch, gehackt","amount":"12","unit":"g","group":"Hogao"},{"name":"gemahlener Kreuzkümmel","amount":"1","unit":"g","group":"Hogao"},{"name":"Schweinebauch mit Schwarte","amount":"240","unit":"g","group":"Fleisch"},{"name":"Rinderhack mit 15 % Fett","amount":"260","unit":"g","group":"Fleisch"},{"name":"kleine Schweine-Chorizos","amount":"4","unit":"Stück, insgesamt 200 g","group":"Fleisch"},{"name":"große Eier","amount":"4","unit":"Stück, etwa 200 g ohne Schale","group":"Beilagen"},{"name":"geschälte reife Kochbanane","amount":"400","unit":"g","group":"Beilagen"},{"name":"Avocadofruchtfleisch","amount":"200","unit":"g","group":"Beilagen"},{"name":"Rapsöl","amount":"60","unit":"ml, aufgeteilt; die Nährwerte rechnen mit 50 g verbrauchtem Öl","group":"Zum Garen"},{"name":"feines Salz","amount":"8","unit":"g, aufgeteilt","group":"Würzung"}],"steps":[{"title":"Bohnen einweichen","content":"200 g getrocknete rote Kidneybohnen verlesen und abspülen. Mit reichlich kaltem Wasser bedecken und 8–12 Stunden im Kühlschrank einweichen. Abgießen und das Einweichwasser entsorgen. Die Mindestgesamtzeit von 675 Minuten enthält 8 Stunden Einweichen; bei 12 Stunden Einweichen insgesamt 915 Minuten einplanen.","image_url":"/recetas/receta-de-bandeja-paisa/paso-01.webp","image_alt":"Bandeja paisa: getrocknete rote Bohnen im Einweichwasser"},{"title":"Bohnen weich kochen","content":"Die abgetropften Bohnen mit 1 Liter frischem Wasser in einen Topf geben. Aufkochen, Schaum abschöpfen, auf mittlere bis niedrige Hitze reduzieren und mit teilweise aufgelegtem Deckel 90–120 Minuten garen. Alle 20 Minuten umrühren und heißes Wasser ergänzen, wenn die Bohnen nicht mehr bedeckt sind. Sie sind fertig, wenn sie sich leicht zerdrücken lassen, aber ihre Form halten; Tomate und Salz noch nicht zugeben.","image_url":"/recetas/receta-de-bandeja-paisa/paso-02.webp","image_alt":"Bandeja paisa: rote Bohnen garen sanft im Topf"},{"title":"Hogao zubereiten","content":"Während die Bohnen garen, 15 g des Öls in einer Pfanne bei mittlerer Hitze erwärmen. 160 g gehackte Zwiebel zugeben und 5 Minuten garen. 12 g gehackten Knoblauch und 1 g Kreuzkümmel zugeben; 30 Sekunden rühren. 300 g gehackte Tomaten und 2 g Salz hinzufügen. 12–15 Minuten zu einer dicken Sauce einkochen. 40 g für die Bohnen zurückbehalten, den Rest zum Servieren aufheben.","image_url":"/recetas/receta-de-bandeja-paisa/paso-03.webp","image_alt":"Bandeja paisa: dickes Tomaten-Zwiebel-Hogao in einer Pfanne"},{"title":"Bohnen fertigstellen","content":"Zu den weichen Bohnen die zurückbehaltenen 40 g Hogao und 2 g Salz geben. Offen bei niedriger Hitze 10 Minuten unter Rühren garen, bis die Brühe einen Löffel überzieht. Sind sie zu trocken, heißes Wasser in 30-ml-Schritten ergänzen; sind sie zu flüssig, länger einkochen.","image_url":"/recetas/receta-de-bandeja-paisa/paso-04.webp","image_alt":"Bandeja paisa: fertige rote Bohnen mit Hogao und sämiger Brühe"},{"title":"Reis kochen","content":"200 g weißen Reis spülen, bis das Wasser fast klar ist. Mit 400 ml Wasser und 2 g Salz in einen Topf geben. Aufkochen, abdecken, auf kleinste Hitze stellen und 15–18 Minuten garen, ohne den Deckel zu öffnen. Herd ausschalten, 10 Minuten ruhen lassen und mit einer Gabel auflockern.","image_url":"/recetas/receta-de-bandeja-paisa/paso-05.webp","image_alt":"Bandeja paisa: locker gegarter weißer Reis im Topf"},{"title":"Arepas formen und braten","content":"120 g vorgegartes Maismehl mit 240 ml lauwarmem Wasser und 1 g Salz mischen. 5 Minuten ruhen lassen. In 4 Portionen teilen, etwa 9 cm breite und 1 cm dicke Scheiben formen und die Ränder glätten. Auf einer leicht geölten Grillplatte bei mittlerer bis niedriger Hitze 6–8 Minuten je Seite garen, bis sie fest und goldbraun sind.","image_url":"/recetas/receta-de-bandeja-paisa/paso-06.webp","image_alt":"Bandeja paisa: vier kleine Arepas bräunen auf einer Grillplatte"},{"title":"Schweinebauch knusprig braten","content":"240 g Schweinebauch mit Schwarte in 4 gleich große Streifen schneiden und die Schwarte flach einschneiden, ohne die Stücke zu durchtrennen. Mit 60 ml Wasser in eine kalte Pfanne geben, abdecken und bei mittlerer Hitze 10 Minuten garen. Offen bei mittlerer bis niedriger Hitze weitere 20–30 Minuten unter Wenden garen, während Wasser verdampft und Fett austritt. Herausnehmen, wenn die Schwarte knusprig, das Fleisch goldbraun und die Kerntemperatur mindestens 71 °C ist. Auf einem Gitter abtropfen lassen; Fett separat auffangen und nicht in den Abfluss gießen.","image_url":"/recetas/receta-de-bandeja-paisa/paso-07.webp","image_alt":"Bandeja paisa: goldbraune knusprige Schweinebauchstreifen in einer Pfanne"},{"title":"Hackfleisch und Chorizos garen","content":"10 g des Öls in einer sauberen Pfanne erhitzen. 260 g Rinderhack und 1 g Salz zugeben; bei mittlerer bis hoher Hitze 7–9 Minuten unter Zerteilen braten, bis keine rosa Stellen mehr vorhanden sind und 71 °C erreicht werden. Herausnehmen und warm halten. In derselben Pfanne 4 kleine Chorizos, insgesamt 200 g, 10–12 Minuten unter Wenden garen, bis sie im Kern 71 °C erreichen.","image_url":"/recetas/receta-de-bandeja-paisa/paso-08.webp","image_alt":"Bandeja paisa: gebräuntes Rinderhack und vier Chorizos beim Garen"},{"title":"Kochbanane und Eier braten","content":"400 g geschälte reife Kochbanane schräg in Scheiben schneiden. Das restliche Öl in einer breiten Pfanne erhitzen und die Scheiben bei mittlerer Hitze 3–4 Minuten je Seite goldbraun und weich braten; auf einem Gitter abtropfen lassen. In derselben Pfanne 4 Eier einzeln 3–4 Minuten braten, bis das Eiweiß vollständig gestockt ist. Für Schwangere, kleine Kinder, ältere oder immungeschwächte Menschen auch das Eigelb fest garen.","image_url":"/recetas/receta-de-bandeja-paisa/paso-09.webp","image_alt":"Bandeja paisa: goldbraune Kochbananenscheiben und Spiegeleier mit festem Eiweiß"},{"title":"Vier Teller anrichten","content":"Auf jeden Teller ein Viertel der Bohnen und des Reises, 1 Arepa, 1 Streifen knusprigen Schweinebauch, 1 Chorizo, ein Viertel des Hackfleischs und der Kochbanane, 1 Ei und 50 g Avocado geben. Übriges Hogao nach Geschmack zugeben und sofort servieren. Mengen, Zeiten und Ausbeute sind ein redaktioneller Vorschlag, der noch in der Küche bestätigt werden muss.","image_url":"/recetas/receta-de-bandeja-paisa/paso-10.webp","image_alt":"Vollständige Bandeja paisa mit Bohnen, Reis, Arepa, Fleisch, Kochbanane, Ei, Avocado und Hogao"}],"notes":"Dieses Gericht enthält Schweinefleisch und Ei; Chorizo kann je nach Marke Gluten oder Milch enthalten. Für eine glutenfreie Bandeja auf zertifizierte Chorizo und zertifiziertes Maismehl achten. Eine vegetarische Variante wird nicht als direkter Ersatz vorgeschlagen, da sie Identität, Zeiten und Nährwerte ändern würde. Rinderhack, Chorizo und Schweinebauch im Kern auf mindestens 71 °C garen; empfindlichen Personen Eier mit festem Eigelb servieren. Bohnen, Reis und Fleisch innerhalb von 2 Stunden —bei mehr als 32 °C Umgebungstemperatur innerhalb von 1 Stunde— in flachen Behältern bei höchstens 4 °C kühlen und innerhalb von 3 Tagen verzehren. Avocado und knusprige Bestandteile getrennt aufbewahren. Nur einmal auf 74 °C erhitzen. Einweichen, Ölaufnahme, Schweinebauchdicke und endgültige Arepagröße müssen in einem Kochtest überprüft werden.","nutrition":{"calories":1483.3,"protein_g":50.5,"carbs_g":138.4,"fat_g":82.9,"saturated_fat_g":24.2,"fiber_g":17.8,"sugar_g":21,"sodium_mg":1346,"estimated":true,"serving_size":"1 von 4 Tellern mit allen Bestandteilen","source":"USDA FoodData Central — SR Legacy (April 2018)","source_url":"https://fdc.nal.usda.gov/download-datasets/","method":"Fünfzehn überprüfte USDA-SR-Legacy-Einträge; essbare Rohgewichte summiert und durch 4 geteilt. Berechnet werden 200 g trockene Bohnen, 200 g roher Reis, 260 g Rinderhack, 240 g Schweinebauch, 200 g Chorizo, 200 g Ei, 400 g Kochbanane, 120 g Maismehl, 200 g Avocado, das gesamte Hogao, 1 g Kreuzkümmel, geschätzt 50 g verbrauchtes Öl und 8 g Salz. Vollkornmais-Mehl dient als Annäherung an vorgegartes Maismehl, geräucherte Schweinewurst an Chorizo und rohe Kochbanane an reife Kochbanane.","note":"Informative Schätzung, keine Analyse des fertigen Gerichts. Bewusst konservativ: Der gesamte Schweinebauch und 50 g Öl werden eingerechnet, obwohl Fett abtropft oder in der Pfanne bleibt. Chorizomarke, Fettgehalt des Fleischs, Reife der Kochbanane, Mehl, Ölaufnahme, servierte Brühe und tatsächliche Portionen können das Ergebnis stark verändern.","inputs":[{"ingredient":"getrocknete rote Kidneybohnen","edible_grams":200,"fdc_id":173734,"fdc_description":"Beans, kidney, red, mature seeds, raw","per_100g":{"calories":337,"protein_g":22.53,"carbs_g":61.29,"fat_g":1.06,"saturated_fat_g":0.154,"fiber_g":15.2,"sugar_g":2.1,"sodium_mg":12},"source_url":"https://fdc.nal.usda.gov/food-details/173734/nutrients"},{"ingredient":"roher weißer Langkornreis","edible_grams":200,"fdc_id":168877,"fdc_description":"Rice, white, long-grain, regular, raw, enriched","per_100g":{"calories":365,"protein_g":7.13,"carbs_g":79.95,"fat_g":0.66,"saturated_fat_g":0.18,"fiber_g":1.3,"sugar_g":0.12,"sodium_mg":5},"source_url":"https://fdc.nal.usda.gov/food-details/168877/nutrients"},{"ingredient":"rohes Rinderhack mit 15 % Fett","edible_grams":260,"fdc_id":174036,"fdc_description":"Beef, ground, 85% lean meat / 15% fat, raw","per_100g":{"calories":215,"protein_g":18.59,"carbs_g":0,"fat_g":15,"saturated_fat_g":5.9,"fiber_g":0,"sugar_g":0,"sodium_mg":66},"source_url":"https://fdc.nal.usda.gov/food-details/174036/nutrients"},{"ingredient":"roher Schweinebauch mit Schwarte","edible_grams":240,"fdc_id":167812,"fdc_description":"Pork, fresh, belly, raw","per_100g":{"calories":518,"protein_g":9.34,"carbs_g":0,"fat_g":53.01,"saturated_fat_g":19.33,"fiber_g":0,"sugar_g":0,"sodium_mg":32},"source_url":"https://fdc.nal.usda.gov/food-details/167812/nutrients"},{"ingredient":"geräucherte gegarte Schweinewurst, Chorizo-Annäherung","edible_grams":200,"fdc_id":174584,"fdc_description":"Sausage, smoked link sausage, pork","per_100g":{"calories":309,"protein_g":11.98,"carbs_g":0.94,"fat_g":28.23,"saturated_fat_g":9.313,"fiber_g":0,"sugar_g":0.94,"sodium_mg":827},"source_url":"https://fdc.nal.usda.gov/food-details/174584/nutrients"},{"ingredient":"rohes Vollei","edible_grams":200,"fdc_id":171287,"fdc_description":"Egg, whole, raw, fresh","per_100g":{"calories":143,"protein_g":12.56,"carbs_g":0.72,"fat_g":9.51,"saturated_fat_g":3.126,"fiber_g":0,"sugar_g":0.37,"sodium_mg":142},"source_url":"https://fdc.nal.usda.gov/food-details/171287/nutrients"},{"ingredient":"rohe geschälte reife Kochbanane","edible_grams":400,"fdc_id":168215,"fdc_description":"Plantains, raw (proxy de plátano maduro)","per_100g":{"calories":122,"protein_g":1.3,"carbs_g":31.9,"fat_g":0.37,"saturated_fat_g":0.14,"fiber_g":2.3,"sugar_g":15,"sodium_mg":4},"source_url":"https://fdc.nal.usda.gov/food-details/168215/nutrients"},{"ingredient":"gelbes Vollkornmais-Mehl, Annäherung an Arepamehl","edible_grams":120,"fdc_id":170290,"fdc_description":"Corn flour, whole-grain, yellow (proxy de harina de maíz precocida para arepa)","per_100g":{"calories":361,"protein_g":6.93,"carbs_g":76.85,"fat_g":3.86,"saturated_fat_g":0.55,"fiber_g":7.3,"sugar_g":0.64,"sodium_mg":5},"source_url":"https://fdc.nal.usda.gov/food-details/170290/nutrients"},{"ingredient":"Avocadofruchtfleisch","edible_grams":200,"fdc_id":171705,"fdc_description":"Avocados, raw, all commercial varieties","per_100g":{"calories":160,"protein_g":2,"carbs_g":8.53,"fat_g":14.66,"saturated_fat_g":2.126,"fiber_g":6.7,"sugar_g":0.66,"sodium_mg":7},"source_url":"https://fdc.nal.usda.gov/food-details/171705/nutrients"},{"ingredient":"rohe rote Tomate","edible_grams":300,"fdc_id":170457,"fdc_description":"Tomatoes, red, ripe, raw, year round average","per_100g":{"calories":18,"protein_g":0.88,"carbs_g":3.89,"fat_g":0.2,"saturated_fat_g":0.028,"fiber_g":1.2,"sugar_g":2.63,"sodium_mg":5},"source_url":"https://fdc.nal.usda.gov/food-details/170457/nutrients"},{"ingredient":"rohe Zwiebel","edible_grams":160,"fdc_id":170000,"fdc_description":"Onions, raw","per_100g":{"calories":40,"protein_g":1.1,"carbs_g":9.34,"fat_g":0.1,"saturated_fat_g":0.042,"fiber_g":1.7,"sugar_g":4.24,"sodium_mg":4},"source_url":"https://fdc.nal.usda.gov/food-details/170000/nutrients"},{"ingredient":"roher Knoblauch","edible_grams":12,"fdc_id":169230,"fdc_description":"Garlic, raw","per_100g":{"calories":149,"protein_g":6.36,"carbs_g":33.06,"fat_g":0.5,"saturated_fat_g":0.089,"fiber_g":2.1,"sugar_g":1,"sodium_mg":17},"source_url":"https://fdc.nal.usda.gov/food-details/169230/nutrients"},{"ingredient":"gemahlener Kreuzkümmel","edible_grams":1,"fdc_id":170923,"fdc_description":"Spices, cumin seed","per_100g":{"calories":375,"protein_g":17.81,"carbs_g":44.24,"fat_g":22.27,"saturated_fat_g":1.535,"fiber_g":10.5,"sugar_g":2.25,"sodium_mg":168},"source_url":"https://fdc.nal.usda.gov/food-details/170923/nutrients"},{"ingredient":"aufgenommenes Rapsöl","edible_grams":50,"fdc_id":172336,"fdc_description":"Oil, canola","per_100g":{"calories":884,"protein_g":0,"carbs_g":0,"fat_g":100,"saturated_fat_g":7.365,"fiber_g":0,"sugar_g":0,"sodium_mg":0},"source_url":"https://fdc.nal.usda.gov/food-details/172336/nutrients"},{"ingredient":"Speisesalz","edible_grams":8,"fdc_id":173468,"fdc_description":"Salt, table","per_100g":{"calories":0,"protein_g":0,"carbs_g":0,"fat_g":0,"saturated_fat_g":0,"fiber_g":0,"sugar_g":0,"sodium_mg":38758},"source_url":"https://fdc.nal.usda.gov/food-details/173468/nutrients"}]},"image_url":"/recetas/receta-de-bandeja-paisa/portada.webp","gallery":[{"url":"/recetas/receta-de-bandeja-paisa/portada.webp","alt":"Vollständige kolumbianische Bandeja paisa auf einem großen Teller"}],"seo":{"title":"Kolumbianische Bandeja paisa mit allen Beilagen","description":"Bandeja paisa für 4 mit roten Bohnen, Reis, Arepas, Rinderhack, knusprigem Schweinebauch, Chorizo, reifer Kochbanane, Ei, Avocado und Hogao.","image_variants":["/recetas/receta-de-bandeja-paisa/portada-1x1.webp","/recetas/receta-de-bandeja-paisa/portada-4x3.webp","/recetas/receta-de-bandeja-paisa/portada-16x9.webp"],"faq":[{"q":"Was gehört auf eine vollständige Bandeja paisa?","a":"Dieser Vorschlag umfasst rote Bohnen, weißen Reis, Arepa, Rinderhack, knusprigen Schweinebauch, Chorizo, reife Kochbanane, Spiegelei, Avocado und Hogao. Die Zusammenstellung kann zwischen Haushalten und Restaurants variieren."},{"q":"Kann ich Bestandteile der Bandeja paisa vorbereiten?","a":"Ja. Bohnen, Reis und Fleisch vorher garen, in flachen Behältern abkühlen und bis zu 3 Tage kühlen. Arepas, Kochbanane und Eier kurz vor dem Servieren zubereiten, damit ihre Textur erhalten bleibt."},{"q":"Wie wird der Schweinebauch knusprig, ohne stark zu spritzen?","a":"In einer kalten Pfanne mit 60 ml Wasser beginnen. Beim Verdampfen tritt das Fett allmählich aus. Bei mittlerer bis niedriger Hitze mit einer Zange wenden und einen Spritzschutz verwenden, der keinen Dampf einschließt."}],"image_alt":"Vollständige kolumbianische Bandeja paisa auf einem großen Teller"},"published":false,"editorial_status":"draft","content_html":"<p>Diese Bandeja paisa vereint die bekanntesten Bestandteile des Gerichts aus Antioquia auf einem Teller: sämige rote Bohnen, weißen Reis, eine Arepa, Rinderhack, knusprigen Schweinebauch, Chorizo, reife Kochbananenscheiben, Spiegelei, Avocado und Hogao.</p><p>Der Vorschlag ergibt 4 großzügige Portionen. Vorgesehen sind 45 Minuten Vorbereitung, etwa 150 Minuten Garzeit und 8–12 Stunden Einweichzeit für die Bohnen: insgesamt 675 bis 915 Minuten. Die Rezeptkarte zeigt den Mindestwert von 675 Minuten einschließlich 8 Stunden Einweichen; mehrere Küchenarbeiten laufen parallel. Mengen, Zeiten, Ölaufnahme und Ausbeute müssen noch durch einen Kochtest bestätigt werden.</p>"},{"id":"6857b59b-7f19-5cd9-a3cc-930700c6932e","recipe_group_id":"8686de2f-500a-4c72-8f1c-1e9c0341e905","slug":"bandeja-paisa-colombian-platter","public_path":"/en/bandeja-paisa-colombian-platter","source_url":null,"language":"en","title":"Colombian bandeja paisa","excerpt":"Bandeja paisa for 4 with red beans, rice, arepas, ground beef, pork crackling, chorizo, ripe plantain, eggs, avocado and hogao.","summary":"This bandeja paisa brings the best-known components of the Antioquian dish together on one platter: thick red beans, white rice, an arepa, ground beef, pork crackling, chorizo, ripe plantain slices, a fried egg, avocado and hogao.\n\nThe proposal makes 4 generous platters. Allow 45 minutes of preparation, about 150 minutes of cooking and 8–12 hours to soak the beans: 675 to 915 minutes overall. The recipe card shows the minimum of 675 minutes, including an 8-hour soak; several cooking tasks run in parallel. Quantities, times, oil absorption and yield await confirmation through a kitchen test.","category":"Main dishes","category_slug":"platos-principales","difficulty":"High","course":"Main course","cuisine":"Colombian, Antioquian","prep_time_minutes":45,"cook_time_minutes":150,"total_time_minutes":675,"servings":4,"keywords":["bandeja paisa","Colombian bandeja paisa recipe","Antioquian food","beans and pork crackling","Colombian platter"],"ingredients":[{"name":"dried red kidney beans","amount":"200","unit":"g","group":"Beans"},{"name":"clean water for cooking the beans","amount":"1000","unit":"ml, plus enough for soaking","group":"Beans"},{"name":"long-grain white rice","amount":"200","unit":"g","group":"Rice"},{"name":"water for the rice","amount":"400","unit":"ml","group":"Rice"},{"name":"precooked corn flour","amount":"120","unit":"g","group":"Arepas"},{"name":"warm water for the arepas","amount":"240","unit":"ml","group":"Arepas"},{"name":"ripe tomatoes, chopped","amount":"300","unit":"g","group":"Hogao"},{"name":"white onion, chopped","amount":"160","unit":"g","group":"Hogao"},{"name":"garlic, chopped","amount":"12","unit":"g","group":"Hogao"},{"name":"ground cumin","amount":"1","unit":"g","group":"Hogao"},{"name":"skin-on pork belly","amount":"240","unit":"g","group":"Meat"},{"name":"85/15 ground beef","amount":"260","unit":"g","group":"Meat"},{"name":"small pork chorizo sausages","amount":"4","unit":"sausages, 200 g total","group":"Meat"},{"name":"large eggs","amount":"4","unit":"eggs, approx. 200 g without shells","group":"Sides"},{"name":"peeled ripe plantain","amount":"400","unit":"g","group":"Sides"},{"name":"avocado flesh","amount":"200","unit":"g","group":"Sides"},{"name":"canola oil","amount":"60","unit":"ml, divided; nutrition estimates 50 g consumed","group":"Cooking"},{"name":"fine salt","amount":"8","unit":"g, divided","group":"Seasoning"}],"steps":[{"title":"Soak the beans","content":"Sort and rinse 200 g of dried red kidney beans. Cover with plenty of cold water and refrigerate for 8–12 hours. Drain and discard the soaking water. The minimum total of 675 minutes includes an 8-hour soak; with a 12-hour soak, allow 915 minutes overall.","image_url":"/recetas/receta-de-bandeja-paisa/paso-01.webp","image_alt":"Bandeja paisa: dried red beans covered with soaking water"},{"title":"Cook the beans until tender","content":"Put the drained beans in a pot with 1 litre of clean water. Bring to a boil, skim off the foam, reduce to medium-low heat and cook partly covered for 90–120 minutes. Stir every 20 minutes and add hot water if the beans are no longer covered. They are ready when they mash easily but still hold their shape; do not add tomato or salt yet.","image_url":"/recetas/receta-de-bandeja-paisa/paso-02.webp","image_alt":"Bandeja paisa: red beans gently cooking in a pot"},{"title":"Make the hogao","content":"While the beans cook, heat 15 g of the oil in a frying pan over medium heat. Add 160 g of chopped onion and cook for 5 minutes. Add 12 g of chopped garlic and 1 g of cumin; stir for 30 seconds. Add 300 g of chopped tomato and 2 g of salt. Cook for 12–15 minutes until thick. Reserve 40 g for the beans and keep the rest for serving.","image_url":"/recetas/receta-de-bandeja-paisa/paso-03.webp","image_alt":"Bandeja paisa: thick tomato and onion hogao in a frying pan"},{"title":"Finish the beans","content":"When the beans are tender, add the reserved 40 g of hogao and 2 g of salt. Cook uncovered over low heat for 10 minutes, stirring, until the broth coats a spoon. If too dry, add hot water in 30 ml increments; if too soupy, reduce for longer.","image_url":"/recetas/receta-de-bandeja-paisa/paso-04.webp","image_alt":"Bandeja paisa: finished red beans with hogao and thick broth"},{"title":"Cook the rice","content":"Rinse 200 g of white rice until the water is almost clear. Place in a pot with 400 ml of water and 2 g of salt. Bring to a boil, cover, reduce to the lowest heat and cook for 15–18 minutes without lifting the lid. Turn off the heat and rest for 10 minutes; fluff with a fork.","image_url":"/recetas/receta-de-bandeja-paisa/paso-05.webp","image_alt":"Bandeja paisa: fluffy cooked white rice in a pot"},{"title":"Shape and griddle the arepas","content":"Mix 120 g of precooked corn flour with 240 ml of warm water and 1 g of salt. Rest for 5 minutes. Divide into 4 portions, shape into discs about 9 cm across and 1 cm thick, and smooth the edges. Cook on a lightly oiled griddle over medium-low heat for 6–8 minutes per side, until firm and golden.","image_url":"/recetas/receta-de-bandeja-paisa/paso-06.webp","image_alt":"Bandeja paisa: four small arepas browning on a griddle"},{"title":"Brown the pork crackling","content":"Cut 240 g of skin-on pork belly into 4 equal strips and score the skin shallowly without separating the pieces. Place in a cold frying pan with 60 ml of water, cover and cook over medium heat for 10 minutes. Uncover and continue over medium-low heat for 20–30 minutes, turning, while the water evaporates and the fat renders. Remove when the skin is crisp, the meat is golden and the centre reaches at least 71 °C. Drain on a rack; collect the fat separately and do not pour it down the drain.","image_url":"/recetas/receta-de-bandeja-paisa/paso-07.webp","image_alt":"Bandeja paisa: golden crisp pork-crackling strips in a frying pan"},{"title":"Cook the beef and chorizo","content":"Heat 10 g of the oil in a clean frying pan. Add 260 g of ground beef and 1 g of salt; cook over medium-high heat for 7–9 minutes, breaking it up, until no pink areas remain and it reaches 71 °C. Remove and keep warm. In the same pan, cook 4 small chorizo sausages, 200 g total, for 10–12 minutes, turning, until their centres reach 71 °C.","image_url":"/recetas/receta-de-bandeja-paisa/paso-08.webp","image_alt":"Bandeja paisa: browned ground beef and four cooking chorizo sausages"},{"title":"Fry the plantain and eggs","content":"Cut 400 g of peeled ripe plantain into diagonal slices. Heat the remaining oil in a wide frying pan and fry the slices over medium heat for 3–4 minutes per side until golden and tender; drain on a rack. In the same pan fry 4 eggs, one at a time, for 3–4 minutes until the whites are completely set. For pregnant people, young children, older adults or immunocompromised people, also cook the yolks until firm.","image_url":"/recetas/receta-de-bandeja-paisa/paso-09.webp","image_alt":"Bandeja paisa: golden ripe plantain slices and fried eggs with set whites"},{"title":"Assemble the four platters","content":"Put one quarter of the beans and rice, 1 arepa, 1 strip of pork crackling, 1 chorizo, one quarter of the beef and plantain, 1 egg and 50 g of avocado on each plate. Add the remaining hogao to taste and serve immediately. Quantities, times and yield are an editorial proposal awaiting confirmation in the kitchen.","image_url":"/recetas/receta-de-bandeja-paisa/paso-10.webp","image_alt":"Complete bandeja paisa with beans, rice, arepa, meats, plantain, egg, avocado and hogao"}],"notes":"This dish contains pork and eggs; chorizo may contain gluten or milk depending on the brand. For a gluten-free platter, check that the chorizo and corn flour are certified. A vegetarian version is not proposed as a direct substitution because it would change the dish's identity, times and nutrition. Cook ground beef, chorizo and pork belly to at least 71 °C at the centre; for vulnerable people, serve the egg with a firm yolk. Refrigerate beans, rice and meats in shallow containers at 4 °C or below within 2 hours —1 hour if the ambient temperature exceeds 32 °C— and eat within 3 days. Store avocado and crisp components separately. Reheat only once to 74 °C. Soaking, oil absorption, pork-crackling thickness and the final arepa size must be checked in a kitchen test.","nutrition":{"calories":1483.3,"protein_g":50.5,"carbs_g":138.4,"fat_g":82.9,"saturated_fat_g":24.2,"fiber_g":17.8,"sugar_g":21,"sodium_mg":1346,"estimated":true,"serving_size":"1 of 4 platters, including all components","source":"USDA FoodData Central — SR Legacy (April 2018)","source_url":"https://fdc.nal.usda.gov/download-datasets/","method":"Fifteen verified USDA SR Legacy entries; edible raw weights added together and divided by 4. Includes 200 g dried beans, 200 g raw rice, 260 g ground beef, 240 g pork belly, 200 g chorizo, 200 g egg, 400 g plantain, 120 g corn flour, 200 g avocado, all the hogao, 1 g cumin, an estimated 50 g oil consumed and 8 g salt. Whole-grain corn flour approximates precooked flour; smoked pork sausage approximates chorizo; raw plantain approximates ripe plantain.","note":"Informational estimate, not an analysis of the finished dish. Deliberately conservative: counts all the pork belly and 50 g oil even though some fat is drained or left in the pan. Chorizo brand, beef fat content, plantain ripeness, flour, oil absorption, broth served and actual portion sizes can change the result considerably.","inputs":[{"ingredient":"dried red kidney beans","edible_grams":200,"fdc_id":173734,"fdc_description":"Beans, kidney, red, mature seeds, raw","per_100g":{"calories":337,"protein_g":22.53,"carbs_g":61.29,"fat_g":1.06,"saturated_fat_g":0.154,"fiber_g":15.2,"sugar_g":2.1,"sodium_mg":12},"source_url":"https://fdc.nal.usda.gov/food-details/173734/nutrients"},{"ingredient":"raw long-grain white rice","edible_grams":200,"fdc_id":168877,"fdc_description":"Rice, white, long-grain, regular, raw, enriched","per_100g":{"calories":365,"protein_g":7.13,"carbs_g":79.95,"fat_g":0.66,"saturated_fat_g":0.18,"fiber_g":1.3,"sugar_g":0.12,"sodium_mg":5},"source_url":"https://fdc.nal.usda.gov/food-details/168877/nutrients"},{"ingredient":"raw 85/15 ground beef","edible_grams":260,"fdc_id":174036,"fdc_description":"Beef, ground, 85% lean meat / 15% fat, raw","per_100g":{"calories":215,"protein_g":18.59,"carbs_g":0,"fat_g":15,"saturated_fat_g":5.9,"fiber_g":0,"sugar_g":0,"sodium_mg":66},"source_url":"https://fdc.nal.usda.gov/food-details/174036/nutrients"},{"ingredient":"raw skin-on pork belly","edible_grams":240,"fdc_id":167812,"fdc_description":"Pork, fresh, belly, raw","per_100g":{"calories":518,"protein_g":9.34,"carbs_g":0,"fat_g":53.01,"saturated_fat_g":19.33,"fiber_g":0,"sugar_g":0,"sodium_mg":32},"source_url":"https://fdc.nal.usda.gov/food-details/167812/nutrients"},{"ingredient":"smoked cooked pork sausage, chorizo proxy","edible_grams":200,"fdc_id":174584,"fdc_description":"Sausage, smoked link sausage, pork","per_100g":{"calories":309,"protein_g":11.98,"carbs_g":0.94,"fat_g":28.23,"saturated_fat_g":9.313,"fiber_g":0,"sugar_g":0.94,"sodium_mg":827},"source_url":"https://fdc.nal.usda.gov/food-details/174584/nutrients"},{"ingredient":"raw whole egg","edible_grams":200,"fdc_id":171287,"fdc_description":"Egg, whole, raw, fresh","per_100g":{"calories":143,"protein_g":12.56,"carbs_g":0.72,"fat_g":9.51,"saturated_fat_g":3.126,"fiber_g":0,"sugar_g":0.37,"sodium_mg":142},"source_url":"https://fdc.nal.usda.gov/food-details/171287/nutrients"},{"ingredient":"raw peeled ripe plantain","edible_grams":400,"fdc_id":168215,"fdc_description":"Plantains, raw (proxy de plátano maduro)","per_100g":{"calories":122,"protein_g":1.3,"carbs_g":31.9,"fat_g":0.37,"saturated_fat_g":0.14,"fiber_g":2.3,"sugar_g":15,"sodium_mg":4},"source_url":"https://fdc.nal.usda.gov/food-details/168215/nutrients"},{"ingredient":"whole-grain yellow corn flour, precooked arepa-flour proxy","edible_grams":120,"fdc_id":170290,"fdc_description":"Corn flour, whole-grain, yellow (proxy de harina de maíz precocida para arepa)","per_100g":{"calories":361,"protein_g":6.93,"carbs_g":76.85,"fat_g":3.86,"saturated_fat_g":0.55,"fiber_g":7.3,"sugar_g":0.64,"sodium_mg":5},"source_url":"https://fdc.nal.usda.gov/food-details/170290/nutrients"},{"ingredient":"avocado flesh","edible_grams":200,"fdc_id":171705,"fdc_description":"Avocados, raw, all commercial varieties","per_100g":{"calories":160,"protein_g":2,"carbs_g":8.53,"fat_g":14.66,"saturated_fat_g":2.126,"fiber_g":6.7,"sugar_g":0.66,"sodium_mg":7},"source_url":"https://fdc.nal.usda.gov/food-details/171705/nutrients"},{"ingredient":"raw red tomato","edible_grams":300,"fdc_id":170457,"fdc_description":"Tomatoes, red, ripe, raw, year round average","per_100g":{"calories":18,"protein_g":0.88,"carbs_g":3.89,"fat_g":0.2,"saturated_fat_g":0.028,"fiber_g":1.2,"sugar_g":2.63,"sodium_mg":5},"source_url":"https://fdc.nal.usda.gov/food-details/170457/nutrients"},{"ingredient":"raw onion","edible_grams":160,"fdc_id":170000,"fdc_description":"Onions, raw","per_100g":{"calories":40,"protein_g":1.1,"carbs_g":9.34,"fat_g":0.1,"saturated_fat_g":0.042,"fiber_g":1.7,"sugar_g":4.24,"sodium_mg":4},"source_url":"https://fdc.nal.usda.gov/food-details/170000/nutrients"},{"ingredient":"raw garlic","edible_grams":12,"fdc_id":169230,"fdc_description":"Garlic, raw","per_100g":{"calories":149,"protein_g":6.36,"carbs_g":33.06,"fat_g":0.5,"saturated_fat_g":0.089,"fiber_g":2.1,"sugar_g":1,"sodium_mg":17},"source_url":"https://fdc.nal.usda.gov/food-details/169230/nutrients"},{"ingredient":"ground cumin","edible_grams":1,"fdc_id":170923,"fdc_description":"Spices, cumin seed","per_100g":{"calories":375,"protein_g":17.81,"carbs_g":44.24,"fat_g":22.27,"saturated_fat_g":1.535,"fiber_g":10.5,"sugar_g":2.25,"sodium_mg":168},"source_url":"https://fdc.nal.usda.gov/food-details/170923/nutrients"},{"ingredient":"absorbed canola oil","edible_grams":50,"fdc_id":172336,"fdc_description":"Oil, canola","per_100g":{"calories":884,"protein_g":0,"carbs_g":0,"fat_g":100,"saturated_fat_g":7.365,"fiber_g":0,"sugar_g":0,"sodium_mg":0},"source_url":"https://fdc.nal.usda.gov/food-details/172336/nutrients"},{"ingredient":"table salt","edible_grams":8,"fdc_id":173468,"fdc_description":"Salt, table","per_100g":{"calories":0,"protein_g":0,"carbs_g":0,"fat_g":0,"saturated_fat_g":0,"fiber_g":0,"sugar_g":0,"sodium_mg":38758},"source_url":"https://fdc.nal.usda.gov/food-details/173468/nutrients"}]},"image_url":"/recetas/receta-de-bandeja-paisa/portada.webp","gallery":[{"url":"/recetas/receta-de-bandeja-paisa/portada.webp","alt":"Complete Colombian bandeja paisa served on a large platter"}],"seo":{"title":"Complete Colombian bandeja paisa | Manual de Cocina","description":"Bandeja paisa for 4 with red beans, rice, arepas, ground beef, pork crackling, chorizo, ripe plantain, eggs, avocado and hogao.","image_variants":["/recetas/receta-de-bandeja-paisa/portada-1x1.webp","/recetas/receta-de-bandeja-paisa/portada-4x3.webp","/recetas/receta-de-bandeja-paisa/portada-16x9.webp"],"faq":[{"q":"What goes into a complete bandeja paisa?","a":"This proposal includes red beans, white rice, an arepa, ground beef, pork crackling, chorizo, ripe plantain, a fried egg, avocado and hogao. The composition can vary between homes and restaurants."},{"q":"Can I prepare components of bandeja paisa ahead?","a":"Yes. Cook beans, rice and meats ahead, cool in shallow containers and refrigerate for up to 3 days. Make the arepas, plantain and eggs close to serving to retain their texture."},{"q":"How can I make crisp pork crackling with less splashing?","a":"Start the pork belly in a cold frying pan with 60 ml of water. As it evaporates, the fat renders gradually. Keep the heat medium-low, turn with tongs and use a splatter screen that does not trap steam."}],"image_alt":"Complete Colombian bandeja paisa served on a large platter"},"published":false,"editorial_status":"draft","content_html":"<p>This bandeja paisa brings the best-known components of the Antioquian dish together on one platter: thick red beans, white rice, an arepa, ground beef, pork crackling, chorizo, ripe plantain slices, a fried egg, avocado and hogao.</p><p>The proposal makes 4 generous platters. Allow 45 minutes of preparation, about 150 minutes of cooking and 8–12 hours to soak the beans: 675 to 915 minutes overall. The recipe card shows the minimum of 675 minutes, including an 8-hour soak; several cooking tasks run in parallel. Quantities, times, oil absorption and yield await confirmation through a kitchen test.</p>"},{"id":"647e43c1-a9d5-5fd4-8b6d-fabdada6a31c","recipe_group_id":"8686de2f-500a-4c72-8f1c-1e9c0341e905","slug":"bandeja-paisa-assiette-colombienne","public_path":"/fr/bandeja-paisa-assiette-colombienne","source_url":null,"language":"fr","title":"Bandeja paisa colombienne","excerpt":"Bandeja paisa pour 4 avec haricots rouges, riz, arepas, bœuf haché, poitrine croustillante, chorizo, banane plantain mûre, œufs, avocat et hogao.","summary":"Cette bandeja paisa réunit dans une seule assiette les éléments les plus reconnaissables de la cuisine d’Antioquia : haricots rouges épais, riz blanc, arepa, bœuf haché, poitrine de porc croustillante, chorizo, tranches de banane plantain mûre, œuf au plat, avocat et hogao.\n\nLa proposition donne 4 assiettes généreuses. Comptez 45 minutes de préparation, environ 150 minutes de cuisson et 8–12 heures de trempage des haricots : de 675 à 915 minutes au total. La fiche indique le minimum de 675 minutes, avec 8 heures de trempage ; plusieurs tâches de cuisine se font en parallèle. Quantités, durées, absorption d’huile et rendement attendent confirmation par un essai en cuisine.","category":"Plats principaux","category_slug":"platos-principales","difficulty":"Élevée","course":"Plat principal","cuisine":"Colombienne, d’Antioquia","prep_time_minutes":45,"cook_time_minutes":150,"total_time_minutes":675,"servings":4,"keywords":["bandeja paisa","recette de bandeja paisa colombienne","cuisine d’Antioquia","haricots et porc croustillant","assiette colombienne"],"ingredients":[{"name":"haricots rouges secs","amount":"200","unit":"g","group":"Haricots"},{"name":"eau propre pour cuire les haricots","amount":"1000","unit":"ml, plus l’eau nécessaire au trempage","group":"Haricots"},{"name":"riz blanc à grains longs","amount":"200","unit":"g","group":"Riz"},{"name":"eau pour le riz","amount":"400","unit":"ml","group":"Riz"},{"name":"farine de maïs précuite","amount":"120","unit":"g","group":"Arepas"},{"name":"eau tiède pour les arepas","amount":"240","unit":"ml","group":"Arepas"},{"name":"tomates mûres, hachées","amount":"300","unit":"g","group":"Hogao"},{"name":"oignon blanc, haché","amount":"160","unit":"g","group":"Hogao"},{"name":"ail, haché","amount":"12","unit":"g","group":"Hogao"},{"name":"cumin moulu","amount":"1","unit":"g","group":"Hogao"},{"name":"poitrine de porc avec couenne","amount":"240","unit":"g","group":"Viandes"},{"name":"bœuf haché à 15 % de matière grasse","amount":"260","unit":"g","group":"Viandes"},{"name":"petits chorizos de porc","amount":"4","unit":"pièces, 200 g au total","group":"Viandes"},{"name":"gros œufs","amount":"4","unit":"pièces, environ 200 g sans coquille","group":"Accompagnements"},{"name":"banane plantain mûre épluchée","amount":"400","unit":"g","group":"Accompagnements"},{"name":"chair d’avocat","amount":"200","unit":"g","group":"Accompagnements"},{"name":"huile de colza","amount":"60","unit":"ml, répartis ; la nutrition estime 50 g consommés","group":"Cuisson"},{"name":"sel fin","amount":"8","unit":"g, répartis","group":"Assaisonnement"}],"steps":[{"title":"Faire tremper les haricots","content":"Trier et rincer 200 g de haricots rouges secs. Couvrir largement d’eau froide et laisser 8–12 heures au réfrigérateur. Égoutter et jeter l’eau de trempage. Le minimum total de 675 minutes inclut 8 heures de trempage ; avec 12 heures de trempage, comptez 915 minutes au total.","image_url":"/recetas/receta-de-bandeja-paisa/paso-01.webp","image_alt":"Bandeja paisa : haricots rouges secs couverts d’eau de trempage"},{"title":"Cuire les haricots jusqu’à tendreté","content":"Mettre les haricots égouttés dans une casserole avec 1 litre d’eau propre. Porter à ébullition, écumer, baisser à feu moyen-doux et cuire partiellement couvert 90–120 minutes. Remuer toutes les 20 minutes et ajouter de l’eau chaude s’ils ne sont plus immergés. Ils sont prêts lorsqu’ils s’écrasent facilement tout en gardant leur forme ; ne pas encore ajouter de tomate ni de sel.","image_url":"/recetas/receta-de-bandeja-paisa/paso-02.webp","image_alt":"Bandeja paisa : haricots rouges cuisant doucement dans une casserole"},{"title":"Préparer le hogao","content":"Pendant la cuisson des haricots, chauffer 15 g de l’huile dans une poêle à feu moyen. Ajouter 160 g d’oignon haché et cuire 5 minutes. Incorporer 12 g d’ail haché et 1 g de cumin ; remuer 30 secondes. Ajouter 300 g de tomate hachée et 2 g de sel. Cuire 12–15 minutes pour obtenir une sauce épaisse. Réserver 40 g pour les haricots et garder le reste pour le service.","image_url":"/recetas/receta-de-bandeja-paisa/paso-03.webp","image_alt":"Bandeja paisa : hogao épais de tomate et d’oignon dans une poêle"},{"title":"Terminer les haricots","content":"Quand les haricots sont tendres, ajouter les 40 g de hogao réservés et 2 g de sel. Cuire à découvert 10 minutes à feu doux, en remuant, jusqu’à ce que le bouillon nappe la cuillère. S’ils sont trop secs, ajouter de l’eau chaude par portions de 30 ml ; s’ils sont trop liquides, prolonger la réduction.","image_url":"/recetas/receta-de-bandeja-paisa/paso-04.webp","image_alt":"Bandeja paisa : haricots rouges terminés avec hogao et bouillon épais"},{"title":"Cuire le riz","content":"Rincer 200 g de riz blanc jusqu’à ce que l’eau soit presque claire. Mettre dans une casserole avec 400 ml d’eau et 2 g de sel. Porter à ébullition, couvrir, réduire au minimum et cuire 15–18 minutes sans soulever le couvercle. Éteindre et laisser reposer 10 minutes ; détacher les grains à la fourchette.","image_url":"/recetas/receta-de-bandeja-paisa/paso-05.webp","image_alt":"Bandeja paisa : riz blanc cuit et détaché dans une casserole"},{"title":"Former et griller les arepas","content":"Mélanger 120 g de farine de maïs précuite avec 240 ml d’eau tiède et 1 g de sel. Laisser reposer 5 minutes. Diviser en 4 portions, former des disques d’environ 9 cm de diamètre et 1 cm d’épaisseur, puis lisser les bords. Cuire sur une plaque légèrement huilée à feu moyen-doux 6–8 minutes de chaque côté, jusqu’à ce qu’ils soient fermes et dorés.","image_url":"/recetas/receta-de-bandeja-paisa/paso-06.webp","image_alt":"Bandeja paisa : quatre petites arepas dorant sur une plaque"},{"title":"Dorer la poitrine de porc","content":"Couper 240 g de poitrine de porc avec couenne en 4 bandes égales et entailler superficiellement la couenne sans séparer les morceaux. Mettre dans une poêle froide avec 60 ml d’eau, couvrir et cuire 10 minutes à feu moyen. Découvrir et poursuivre 20–30 minutes à feu moyen-doux en retournant, pendant que l’eau s’évapore et que la graisse fond. Retirer lorsque la couenne est croustillante, la viande dorée et le centre à au moins 71 °C. Égoutter sur une grille ; recueillir la graisse à part, sans la verser dans l’évier.","image_url":"/recetas/receta-de-bandeja-paisa/paso-07.webp","image_alt":"Bandeja paisa : bandes de poitrine de porc dorées et croustillantes"},{"title":"Cuire le bœuf et les chorizos","content":"Chauffer 10 g de l’huile dans une poêle propre. Ajouter 260 g de bœuf haché et 1 g de sel ; cuire 7–9 minutes à feu moyen-vif en l’émiettant, jusqu’à disparition des zones roses et jusqu’à 71 °C. Retirer et garder au chaud. Dans la même poêle, cuire 4 petits chorizos, 200 g au total, pendant 10–12 minutes en les retournant, jusqu’à 71 °C au centre.","image_url":"/recetas/receta-de-bandeja-paisa/paso-08.webp","image_alt":"Bandeja paisa : bœuf haché doré et quatre chorizos en cuisson"},{"title":"Frire la banane plantain et les œufs","content":"Couper 400 g de banane plantain mûre épluchée en tranches diagonales. Chauffer le reste d’huile dans une grande poêle et frire les tranches à feu moyen 3–4 minutes par côté, jusqu’à ce qu’elles soient dorées et tendres ; égoutter sur une grille. Dans la même poêle, frire 4 œufs, un par un, 3–4 minutes, jusqu’à ce que le blanc soit entièrement pris. Pour les femmes enceintes, jeunes enfants, personnes âgées ou immunodéprimées, cuire également le jaune jusqu’à ce qu’il soit ferme.","image_url":"/recetas/receta-de-bandeja-paisa/paso-09.webp","image_alt":"Bandeja paisa : banane plantain dorée et œufs frits aux blancs pris"},{"title":"Dresser les quatre assiettes","content":"Mettre sur chaque assiette un quart des haricots et du riz, 1 arepa, 1 bande de poitrine croustillante, 1 chorizo, un quart du bœuf et de la banane plantain, 1 œuf et 50 g d’avocat. Ajouter le hogao restant selon le goût et servir immédiatement. Quantités, durées et rendement constituent une proposition éditoriale à confirmer en cuisine.","image_url":"/recetas/receta-de-bandeja-paisa/paso-10.webp","image_alt":"Bandeja paisa complète avec haricots, riz, arepa, viandes, plantain, œuf, avocat et hogao"}],"notes":"Ce plat contient du porc et des œufs ; le chorizo peut contenir du gluten ou du lait selon la marque. Pour une assiette sans gluten, vérifier la certification du chorizo et de la farine de maïs. Une version végétarienne n’est pas proposée comme remplacement direct, car elle modifierait l’identité, les durées et la nutrition. Cuire bœuf haché, chorizo et poitrine de porc à au moins 71 °C au centre ; pour les personnes vulnérables, servir l’œuf avec le jaune ferme. Réfrigérer haricots, riz et viandes dans des récipients peu profonds à 4 °C ou moins dans les 2 heures —1 heure si la température ambiante dépasse 32 °C— et consommer dans les 3 jours. Conserver avocat et éléments croustillants séparément. Réchauffer une seule fois à 74 °C. Trempage, absorption d’huile, épaisseur de la poitrine et taille finale des arepas doivent être validés en cuisine.","nutrition":{"calories":1483.3,"protein_g":50.5,"carbs_g":138.4,"fat_g":82.9,"saturated_fat_g":24.2,"fiber_g":17.8,"sugar_g":21,"sodium_mg":1346,"estimated":true,"serving_size":"1 assiette sur 4, avec tous les éléments","source":"USDA FoodData Central — SR Legacy (avril 2018)","source_url":"https://fdc.nal.usda.gov/download-datasets/","method":"Quinze fiches USDA SR Legacy vérifiées ; les poids crus comestibles sont additionnés puis divisés par 4. Sont comptés 200 g de haricots secs, 200 g de riz cru, 260 g de bœuf haché, 240 g de poitrine, 200 g de chorizo, 200 g d’œuf, 400 g de plantain, 120 g de farine de maïs, 200 g d’avocat, tout le hogao, 1 g de cumin, une consommation estimée de 50 g d’huile et 8 g de sel. La farine de maïs complète approche la farine précuite ; la saucisse de porc fumée approche le chorizo ; le plantain cru approche le plantain mûr.","note":"Estimation informative, pas une analyse du plat fini. Elle est volontairement prudente : toute la poitrine et 50 g d’huile sont comptés, même si de la graisse est égouttée ou reste dans la poêle. Marque du chorizo, teneur en graisse du bœuf, maturité du plantain, farine, absorption d’huile, bouillon servi et portions réelles peuvent fortement modifier le résultat.","inputs":[{"ingredient":"haricots rouges secs","edible_grams":200,"fdc_id":173734,"fdc_description":"Beans, kidney, red, mature seeds, raw","per_100g":{"calories":337,"protein_g":22.53,"carbs_g":61.29,"fat_g":1.06,"saturated_fat_g":0.154,"fiber_g":15.2,"sugar_g":2.1,"sodium_mg":12},"source_url":"https://fdc.nal.usda.gov/food-details/173734/nutrients"},{"ingredient":"riz blanc à grains longs cru","edible_grams":200,"fdc_id":168877,"fdc_description":"Rice, white, long-grain, regular, raw, enriched","per_100g":{"calories":365,"protein_g":7.13,"carbs_g":79.95,"fat_g":0.66,"saturated_fat_g":0.18,"fiber_g":1.3,"sugar_g":0.12,"sodium_mg":5},"source_url":"https://fdc.nal.usda.gov/food-details/168877/nutrients"},{"ingredient":"bœuf haché cru à 15 % de matière grasse","edible_grams":260,"fdc_id":174036,"fdc_description":"Beef, ground, 85% lean meat / 15% fat, raw","per_100g":{"calories":215,"protein_g":18.59,"carbs_g":0,"fat_g":15,"saturated_fat_g":5.9,"fiber_g":0,"sugar_g":0,"sodium_mg":66},"source_url":"https://fdc.nal.usda.gov/food-details/174036/nutrients"},{"ingredient":"poitrine de porc crue avec couenne","edible_grams":240,"fdc_id":167812,"fdc_description":"Pork, fresh, belly, raw","per_100g":{"calories":518,"protein_g":9.34,"carbs_g":0,"fat_g":53.01,"saturated_fat_g":19.33,"fiber_g":0,"sugar_g":0,"sodium_mg":32},"source_url":"https://fdc.nal.usda.gov/food-details/167812/nutrients"},{"ingredient":"saucisse de porc fumée cuite, approximation du chorizo","edible_grams":200,"fdc_id":174584,"fdc_description":"Sausage, smoked link sausage, pork","per_100g":{"calories":309,"protein_g":11.98,"carbs_g":0.94,"fat_g":28.23,"saturated_fat_g":9.313,"fiber_g":0,"sugar_g":0.94,"sodium_mg":827},"source_url":"https://fdc.nal.usda.gov/food-details/174584/nutrients"},{"ingredient":"œuf entier cru","edible_grams":200,"fdc_id":171287,"fdc_description":"Egg, whole, raw, fresh","per_100g":{"calories":143,"protein_g":12.56,"carbs_g":0.72,"fat_g":9.51,"saturated_fat_g":3.126,"fiber_g":0,"sugar_g":0.37,"sodium_mg":142},"source_url":"https://fdc.nal.usda.gov/food-details/171287/nutrients"},{"ingredient":"banane plantain mûre épluchée crue","edible_grams":400,"fdc_id":168215,"fdc_description":"Plantains, raw (proxy de plátano maduro)","per_100g":{"calories":122,"protein_g":1.3,"carbs_g":31.9,"fat_g":0.37,"saturated_fat_g":0.14,"fiber_g":2.3,"sugar_g":15,"sodium_mg":4},"source_url":"https://fdc.nal.usda.gov/food-details/168215/nutrients"},{"ingredient":"farine de maïs jaune complète, approximation de la farine précuite pour arepa","edible_grams":120,"fdc_id":170290,"fdc_description":"Corn flour, whole-grain, yellow (proxy de harina de maíz precocida para arepa)","per_100g":{"calories":361,"protein_g":6.93,"carbs_g":76.85,"fat_g":3.86,"saturated_fat_g":0.55,"fiber_g":7.3,"sugar_g":0.64,"sodium_mg":5},"source_url":"https://fdc.nal.usda.gov/food-details/170290/nutrients"},{"ingredient":"chair d’avocat","edible_grams":200,"fdc_id":171705,"fdc_description":"Avocados, raw, all commercial varieties","per_100g":{"calories":160,"protein_g":2,"carbs_g":8.53,"fat_g":14.66,"saturated_fat_g":2.126,"fiber_g":6.7,"sugar_g":0.66,"sodium_mg":7},"source_url":"https://fdc.nal.usda.gov/food-details/171705/nutrients"},{"ingredient":"tomate rouge crue","edible_grams":300,"fdc_id":170457,"fdc_description":"Tomatoes, red, ripe, raw, year round average","per_100g":{"calories":18,"protein_g":0.88,"carbs_g":3.89,"fat_g":0.2,"saturated_fat_g":0.028,"fiber_g":1.2,"sugar_g":2.63,"sodium_mg":5},"source_url":"https://fdc.nal.usda.gov/food-details/170457/nutrients"},{"ingredient":"oignon cru","edible_grams":160,"fdc_id":170000,"fdc_description":"Onions, raw","per_100g":{"calories":40,"protein_g":1.1,"carbs_g":9.34,"fat_g":0.1,"saturated_fat_g":0.042,"fiber_g":1.7,"sugar_g":4.24,"sodium_mg":4},"source_url":"https://fdc.nal.usda.gov/food-details/170000/nutrients"},{"ingredient":"ail cru","edible_grams":12,"fdc_id":169230,"fdc_description":"Garlic, raw","per_100g":{"calories":149,"protein_g":6.36,"carbs_g":33.06,"fat_g":0.5,"saturated_fat_g":0.089,"fiber_g":2.1,"sugar_g":1,"sodium_mg":17},"source_url":"https://fdc.nal.usda.gov/food-details/169230/nutrients"},{"ingredient":"cumin moulu","edible_grams":1,"fdc_id":170923,"fdc_description":"Spices, cumin seed","per_100g":{"calories":375,"protein_g":17.81,"carbs_g":44.24,"fat_g":22.27,"saturated_fat_g":1.535,"fiber_g":10.5,"sugar_g":2.25,"sodium_mg":168},"source_url":"https://fdc.nal.usda.gov/food-details/170923/nutrients"},{"ingredient":"huile de colza absorbée","edible_grams":50,"fdc_id":172336,"fdc_description":"Oil, canola","per_100g":{"calories":884,"protein_g":0,"carbs_g":0,"fat_g":100,"saturated_fat_g":7.365,"fiber_g":0,"sugar_g":0,"sodium_mg":0},"source_url":"https://fdc.nal.usda.gov/food-details/172336/nutrients"},{"ingredient":"sel de table","edible_grams":8,"fdc_id":173468,"fdc_description":"Salt, table","per_100g":{"calories":0,"protein_g":0,"carbs_g":0,"fat_g":0,"saturated_fat_g":0,"fiber_g":0,"sugar_g":0,"sodium_mg":38758},"source_url":"https://fdc.nal.usda.gov/food-details/173468/nutrients"}]},"image_url":"/recetas/receta-de-bandeja-paisa/portada.webp","gallery":[{"url":"/recetas/receta-de-bandeja-paisa/portada.webp","alt":"Bandeja paisa colombienne complète servie sur une grande assiette"}],"seo":{"title":"Bandeja paisa colombienne complète | Manual de Cocina","description":"Bandeja paisa pour 4 avec haricots rouges, riz, arepas, bœuf haché, poitrine croustillante, chorizo, banane plantain mûre, œufs, avocat et hogao.","image_variants":["/recetas/receta-de-bandeja-paisa/portada-1x1.webp","/recetas/receta-de-bandeja-paisa/portada-4x3.webp","/recetas/receta-de-bandeja-paisa/portada-16x9.webp"],"faq":[{"q":"Que contient une bandeja paisa complète ?","a":"Cette proposition comprend haricots rouges, riz blanc, arepa, bœuf haché, poitrine croustillante, chorizo, plantain mûr, œuf au plat, avocat et hogao. La composition varie selon les maisons et les restaurants."},{"q":"Peut-on préparer des éléments à l’avance ?","a":"Oui. Cuire haricots, riz et viandes à l’avance, refroidir dans des récipients peu profonds et réfrigérer jusqu’à 3 jours. Préparer arepas, plantain et œufs près du service pour conserver leur texture."},{"q":"Comment rendre la poitrine croustillante avec moins de projections ?","a":"Commencer dans une poêle froide avec 60 ml d’eau. En s’évaporant, l’eau permet à la graisse de fondre progressivement. Garder un feu moyen-doux, retourner à la pince et utiliser un écran anti-projections qui ne retient pas la vapeur."}],"image_alt":"Bandeja paisa colombienne complète servie sur une grande assiette"},"published":false,"editorial_status":"draft","content_html":"<p>Cette bandeja paisa réunit dans une seule assiette les éléments les plus reconnaissables de la cuisine d’Antioquia : haricots rouges épais, riz blanc, arepa, bœuf haché, poitrine de porc croustillante, chorizo, tranches de banane plantain mûre, œuf au plat, avocat et hogao.</p><p>La proposition donne 4 assiettes généreuses. Comptez 45 minutes de préparation, environ 150 minutes de cuisson et 8–12 heures de trempage des haricots : de 675 à 915 minutes au total. La fiche indique le minimum de 675 minutes, avec 8 heures de trempage ; plusieurs tâches de cuisine se font en parallèle. Quantités, durées, absorption d’huile et rendement attendent confirmation par un essai en cuisine.</p>"},{"id":"af83a975-46d3-5abf-adc0-5017f45b69f8","recipe_group_id":"8686de2f-500a-4c72-8f1c-1e9c0341e905","slug":"bandeja-paisa-piatto-colombiano","public_path":"/it/bandeja-paisa-piatto-colombiano","source_url":null,"language":"it","title":"Bandeja paisa colombiana","excerpt":"Bandeja paisa per 4 con fagioli rossi, riso, arepas, carne macinata, pancetta croccante, chorizo, platano maturo, uova, avocado e hogao.","summary":"Questa bandeja paisa riunisce in un unico piatto gli elementi più riconoscibili della preparazione di Antioquia: fagioli rossi densi, riso bianco, arepa, carne macinata, pancetta croccante, chorizo, fette di platano maturo, uovo fritto, avocado e hogao.\n\nLa proposta dà 4 piatti abbondanti. Prevede 45 minuti di preparazione, circa 150 minuti di cottura e 8–12 ore di ammollo dei fagioli: da 675 a 915 minuti in totale. La scheda mostra il minimo di 675 minuti, incluse 8 ore di ammollo; diverse operazioni di cucina si svolgono in parallelo. Quantità, tempi, assorbimento dell’olio e resa attendono conferma con una prova in cucina.","category":"Secondi piatti","category_slug":"platos-principales","difficulty":"Alta","course":"Piatto principale","cuisine":"Colombiana, di Antioquia","prep_time_minutes":45,"cook_time_minutes":150,"total_time_minutes":675,"servings":4,"keywords":["bandeja paisa","ricetta bandeja paisa colombiana","cucina di Antioquia","fagioli e pancetta croccante","piatto colombiano"],"ingredients":[{"name":"fagioli rossi secchi","amount":"200","unit":"g","group":"Fagioli"},{"name":"acqua pulita per cuocere i fagioli","amount":"1000","unit":"ml, più l’acqua necessaria per l’ammollo","group":"Fagioli"},{"name":"riso bianco a chicco lungo","amount":"200","unit":"g","group":"Riso"},{"name":"acqua per il riso","amount":"400","unit":"ml","group":"Riso"},{"name":"farina di mais precotta","amount":"120","unit":"g","group":"Arepas"},{"name":"acqua tiepida per le arepas","amount":"240","unit":"ml","group":"Arepas"},{"name":"pomodori maturi, tritati","amount":"300","unit":"g","group":"Hogao"},{"name":"cipolla bianca, tritata","amount":"160","unit":"g","group":"Hogao"},{"name":"aglio, tritato","amount":"12","unit":"g","group":"Hogao"},{"name":"cumino macinato","amount":"1","unit":"g","group":"Hogao"},{"name":"pancetta fresca di maiale con cotenna","amount":"240","unit":"g","group":"Carni"},{"name":"carne macinata di manzo con 15 % di grasso","amount":"260","unit":"g","group":"Carni"},{"name":"piccoli chorizo di maiale","amount":"4","unit":"pezzi, 200 g in totale","group":"Carni"},{"name":"uova grandi","amount":"4","unit":"pezzi, circa 200 g senza guscio","group":"Accompagnamenti"},{"name":"platano maturo sbucciato","amount":"400","unit":"g","group":"Accompagnamenti"},{"name":"polpa di avocado","amount":"200","unit":"g","group":"Accompagnamenti"},{"name":"olio di colza","amount":"60","unit":"ml, suddivisi; la nutrizione stima 50 g consumati","group":"Cottura"},{"name":"sale fino","amount":"8","unit":"g, suddivisi","group":"Condimento"}],"steps":[{"title":"Metti in ammollo i fagioli","content":"Controlla e sciacqua 200 g di fagioli rossi secchi. Coprili con abbondante acqua fredda e lasciali 8–12 ore in frigorifero. Scola e scarta l’acqua di ammollo. Il totale minimo di 675 minuti include 8 ore di ammollo; con 12 ore di ammollo, calcola 915 minuti in totale.","image_url":"/recetas/receta-de-bandeja-paisa/paso-01.webp","image_alt":"Bandeja paisa: fagioli rossi secchi coperti d’acqua per l’ammollo"},{"title":"Cuoci i fagioli finché sono teneri","content":"Metti i fagioli scolati in una pentola con 1 litro di acqua pulita. Porta a bollore, elimina la schiuma, abbassa a fuoco medio-basso e cuoci con coperchio parzialmente aperto per 90–120 minuti. Mescola ogni 20 minuti e aggiungi acqua calda se non sono più coperti. Sono pronti quando si schiacciano facilmente ma mantengono la forma; non aggiungere ancora pomodoro o sale.","image_url":"/recetas/receta-de-bandeja-paisa/paso-02.webp","image_alt":"Bandeja paisa: fagioli rossi in cottura dolce nella pentola"},{"title":"Prepara l’hogao","content":"Mentre i fagioli cuociono, scalda 15 g dell’olio in padella a fuoco medio. Aggiungi 160 g di cipolla tritata e cuoci 5 minuti. Unisci 12 g di aglio tritato e 1 g di cumino; mescola 30 secondi. Aggiungi 300 g di pomodoro tritato e 2 g di sale. Cuoci 12–15 minuti fino a ottenere una salsa densa. Tieni da parte 40 g per i fagioli e conserva il resto per servire.","image_url":"/recetas/receta-de-bandeja-paisa/paso-03.webp","image_alt":"Bandeja paisa: hogao denso di pomodoro e cipolla in padella"},{"title":"Completa i fagioli","content":"Quando i fagioli sono teneri, aggiungi i 40 g di hogao tenuti da parte e 2 g di sale. Cuoci senza coperchio 10 minuti a fuoco basso, mescolando, finché il brodo vela il cucchiaio. Se sono troppo asciutti, aggiungi acqua calda in incrementi di 30 ml; se sono troppo liquidi, prosegui la riduzione.","image_url":"/recetas/receta-de-bandeja-paisa/paso-04.webp","image_alt":"Bandeja paisa: fagioli rossi finiti con hogao e brodo denso"},{"title":"Cuoci il riso","content":"Sciacqua 200 g di riso bianco finché l’acqua è quasi limpida. Mettilo in pentola con 400 ml di acqua e 2 g di sale. Porta a bollore, copri, abbassa al minimo e cuoci 15–18 minuti senza aprire. Spegni e lascia riposare 10 minuti; sgrana con una forchetta.","image_url":"/recetas/receta-de-bandeja-paisa/paso-05.webp","image_alt":"Bandeja paisa: riso bianco cotto e sgranato in pentola"},{"title":"Forma e cuoci le arepas","content":"Mescola 120 g di farina di mais precotta con 240 ml di acqua tiepida e 1 g di sale. Lascia riposare 5 minuti. Dividi in 4 porzioni, forma dischi di circa 9 cm di diametro e 1 cm di spessore e liscia i bordi. Cuoci su piastra leggermente oliata a fuoco medio-basso 6–8 minuti per lato, finché sono sodi e dorati.","image_url":"/recetas/receta-de-bandeja-paisa/paso-06.webp","image_alt":"Bandeja paisa: quattro piccole arepas che dorano sulla piastra"},{"title":"Dora il chicharrón","content":"Taglia 240 g di pancetta fresca con cotenna in 4 strisce uguali e incidi superficialmente la cotenna senza separare i pezzi. Metti in una padella fredda con 60 ml di acqua, copri e cuoci 10 minuti a fuoco medio. Scopri e prosegui 20–30 minuti a fuoco medio-basso, girando, mentre l’acqua evapora e il grasso si scioglie. Togli quando la cotenna è croccante, la carne dorata e il centro raggiunge almeno 71 °C. Scola su una griglia; raccogli il grasso a parte e non versarlo nello scarico.","image_url":"/recetas/receta-de-bandeja-paisa/paso-07.webp","image_alt":"Bandeja paisa: strisce di pancetta dorate e croccanti in padella"},{"title":"Cuoci la carne e i chorizo","content":"Scalda 10 g dell’olio in una padella pulita. Aggiungi 260 g di carne macinata e 1 g di sale; cuoci 7–9 minuti a fuoco medio-alto, sgranando, finché non restano zone rosa e raggiunge 71 °C. Togli e tieni al caldo. Nella stessa padella cuoci 4 piccoli chorizo, 200 g in totale, per 10–12 minuti, girandoli, finché raggiungono 71 °C al centro.","image_url":"/recetas/receta-de-bandeja-paisa/paso-08.webp","image_alt":"Bandeja paisa: carne macinata dorata e quattro chorizo in cottura"},{"title":"Friggi platano e uova","content":"Taglia 400 g di platano maturo sbucciato a fette diagonali. Scalda l’olio restante in una padella larga e friggi le fette a fuoco medio 3–4 minuti per lato, finché sono dorate e tenere; scola su una griglia. Nella stessa padella friggi 4 uova, una alla volta, per 3–4 minuti, finché l’albume è completamente rappreso. Per donne in gravidanza, bambini piccoli, anziani o persone immunodepresse, cuoci anche il tuorlo finché è sodo.","image_url":"/recetas/receta-de-bandeja-paisa/paso-09.webp","image_alt":"Bandeja paisa: platano dorato e uova fritte con albume rappreso"},{"title":"Componi i quattro piatti","content":"Distribuisci in ogni piatto un quarto dei fagioli e del riso, 1 arepa, 1 striscia di chicharrón, 1 chorizo, un quarto della carne macinata e del platano, 1 uovo e 50 g di avocado. Aggiungi l’hogao restante a piacere e servi subito. Quantità, tempi e resa sono una proposta editoriale in attesa di conferma in cucina.","image_url":"/recetas/receta-de-bandeja-paisa/paso-10.webp","image_alt":"Bandeja paisa completa con fagioli, riso, arepa, carni, platano, uovo, avocado e hogao"}],"notes":"Questo piatto contiene maiale e uova; il chorizo può contenere glutine o latte secondo la marca. Per una bandeja senza glutine, verifica la certificazione di chorizo e farina di mais. Una versione vegetariana non è proposta come sostituzione diretta perché cambierebbe identità, tempi e nutrizione. Cuoci carne macinata, chorizo e pancetta fino ad almeno 71 °C al centro; per persone vulnerabili, servi l’uovo con tuorlo sodo. Refrigerare fagioli, riso e carni in contenitori bassi a 4 °C o meno entro 2 ore —1 ora se l’ambiente supera 32 °C— e consumare entro 3 giorni. Conserva avocado e componenti croccanti separatamente. Riscalda una sola volta fino a 74 °C. Ammollo, assorbimento dell’olio, spessore del chicharrón e dimensione finale delle arepas devono essere verificati in cucina.","nutrition":{"calories":1483.3,"protein_g":50.5,"carbs_g":138.4,"fat_g":82.9,"saturated_fat_g":24.2,"fiber_g":17.8,"sugar_g":21,"sodium_mg":1346,"estimated":true,"serving_size":"1 piatto su 4, con tutti i componenti","source":"USDA FoodData Central — SR Legacy (aprile 2018)","source_url":"https://fdc.nal.usda.gov/download-datasets/","method":"Quindici schede USDA SR Legacy verificate; pesi crudi edibili sommati e divisi per 4. Si contano 200 g di fagioli secchi, 200 g di riso crudo, 260 g di carne macinata, 240 g di pancetta, 200 g di chorizo, 200 g di uovo, 400 g di platano, 120 g di farina di mais, 200 g di avocado, tutto l’hogao, 1 g di cumino, 50 g di olio stimati come consumati e 8 g di sale. La farina di mais integrale approssima quella precotta; la salsiccia di maiale affumicata approssima il chorizo; il platano crudo approssima quello maturo.","note":"Stima informativa, non analisi del piatto finito. Volutamente prudente: conta tutta la pancetta e 50 g di olio, anche se parte del grasso viene scolata o resta in padella. Marca del chorizo, grasso della carne, maturità del platano, farina, assorbimento dell’olio, brodo servito e porzioni reali possono cambiare molto il risultato.","inputs":[{"ingredient":"fagioli rossi secchi","edible_grams":200,"fdc_id":173734,"fdc_description":"Beans, kidney, red, mature seeds, raw","per_100g":{"calories":337,"protein_g":22.53,"carbs_g":61.29,"fat_g":1.06,"saturated_fat_g":0.154,"fiber_g":15.2,"sugar_g":2.1,"sodium_mg":12},"source_url":"https://fdc.nal.usda.gov/food-details/173734/nutrients"},{"ingredient":"riso bianco a chicco lungo crudo","edible_grams":200,"fdc_id":168877,"fdc_description":"Rice, white, long-grain, regular, raw, enriched","per_100g":{"calories":365,"protein_g":7.13,"carbs_g":79.95,"fat_g":0.66,"saturated_fat_g":0.18,"fiber_g":1.3,"sugar_g":0.12,"sodium_mg":5},"source_url":"https://fdc.nal.usda.gov/food-details/168877/nutrients"},{"ingredient":"carne macinata di manzo cruda con 15 % di grasso","edible_grams":260,"fdc_id":174036,"fdc_description":"Beef, ground, 85% lean meat / 15% fat, raw","per_100g":{"calories":215,"protein_g":18.59,"carbs_g":0,"fat_g":15,"saturated_fat_g":5.9,"fiber_g":0,"sugar_g":0,"sodium_mg":66},"source_url":"https://fdc.nal.usda.gov/food-details/174036/nutrients"},{"ingredient":"pancetta fresca cruda con cotenna","edible_grams":240,"fdc_id":167812,"fdc_description":"Pork, fresh, belly, raw","per_100g":{"calories":518,"protein_g":9.34,"carbs_g":0,"fat_g":53.01,"saturated_fat_g":19.33,"fiber_g":0,"sugar_g":0,"sodium_mg":32},"source_url":"https://fdc.nal.usda.gov/food-details/167812/nutrients"},{"ingredient":"salsiccia di maiale affumicata cotta, approssimazione del chorizo","edible_grams":200,"fdc_id":174584,"fdc_description":"Sausage, smoked link sausage, pork","per_100g":{"calories":309,"protein_g":11.98,"carbs_g":0.94,"fat_g":28.23,"saturated_fat_g":9.313,"fiber_g":0,"sugar_g":0.94,"sodium_mg":827},"source_url":"https://fdc.nal.usda.gov/food-details/174584/nutrients"},{"ingredient":"uovo intero crudo","edible_grams":200,"fdc_id":171287,"fdc_description":"Egg, whole, raw, fresh","per_100g":{"calories":143,"protein_g":12.56,"carbs_g":0.72,"fat_g":9.51,"saturated_fat_g":3.126,"fiber_g":0,"sugar_g":0.37,"sodium_mg":142},"source_url":"https://fdc.nal.usda.gov/food-details/171287/nutrients"},{"ingredient":"platano maturo sbucciato crudo","edible_grams":400,"fdc_id":168215,"fdc_description":"Plantains, raw (proxy de plátano maduro)","per_100g":{"calories":122,"protein_g":1.3,"carbs_g":31.9,"fat_g":0.37,"saturated_fat_g":0.14,"fiber_g":2.3,"sugar_g":15,"sodium_mg":4},"source_url":"https://fdc.nal.usda.gov/food-details/168215/nutrients"},{"ingredient":"farina di mais giallo integrale, approssimazione della farina precotta per arepa","edible_grams":120,"fdc_id":170290,"fdc_description":"Corn flour, whole-grain, yellow (proxy de harina de maíz precocida para arepa)","per_100g":{"calories":361,"protein_g":6.93,"carbs_g":76.85,"fat_g":3.86,"saturated_fat_g":0.55,"fiber_g":7.3,"sugar_g":0.64,"sodium_mg":5},"source_url":"https://fdc.nal.usda.gov/food-details/170290/nutrients"},{"ingredient":"polpa di avocado","edible_grams":200,"fdc_id":171705,"fdc_description":"Avocados, raw, all commercial varieties","per_100g":{"calories":160,"protein_g":2,"carbs_g":8.53,"fat_g":14.66,"saturated_fat_g":2.126,"fiber_g":6.7,"sugar_g":0.66,"sodium_mg":7},"source_url":"https://fdc.nal.usda.gov/food-details/171705/nutrients"},{"ingredient":"pomodoro rosso crudo","edible_grams":300,"fdc_id":170457,"fdc_description":"Tomatoes, red, ripe, raw, year round average","per_100g":{"calories":18,"protein_g":0.88,"carbs_g":3.89,"fat_g":0.2,"saturated_fat_g":0.028,"fiber_g":1.2,"sugar_g":2.63,"sodium_mg":5},"source_url":"https://fdc.nal.usda.gov/food-details/170457/nutrients"},{"ingredient":"cipolla cruda","edible_grams":160,"fdc_id":170000,"fdc_description":"Onions, raw","per_100g":{"calories":40,"protein_g":1.1,"carbs_g":9.34,"fat_g":0.1,"saturated_fat_g":0.042,"fiber_g":1.7,"sugar_g":4.24,"sodium_mg":4},"source_url":"https://fdc.nal.usda.gov/food-details/170000/nutrients"},{"ingredient":"aglio crudo","edible_grams":12,"fdc_id":169230,"fdc_description":"Garlic, raw","per_100g":{"calories":149,"protein_g":6.36,"carbs_g":33.06,"fat_g":0.5,"saturated_fat_g":0.089,"fiber_g":2.1,"sugar_g":1,"sodium_mg":17},"source_url":"https://fdc.nal.usda.gov/food-details/169230/nutrients"},{"ingredient":"cumino macinato","edible_grams":1,"fdc_id":170923,"fdc_description":"Spices, cumin seed","per_100g":{"calories":375,"protein_g":17.81,"carbs_g":44.24,"fat_g":22.27,"saturated_fat_g":1.535,"fiber_g":10.5,"sugar_g":2.25,"sodium_mg":168},"source_url":"https://fdc.nal.usda.gov/food-details/170923/nutrients"},{"ingredient":"olio di colza assorbito","edible_grams":50,"fdc_id":172336,"fdc_description":"Oil, canola","per_100g":{"calories":884,"protein_g":0,"carbs_g":0,"fat_g":100,"saturated_fat_g":7.365,"fiber_g":0,"sugar_g":0,"sodium_mg":0},"source_url":"https://fdc.nal.usda.gov/food-details/172336/nutrients"},{"ingredient":"sale da tavola","edible_grams":8,"fdc_id":173468,"fdc_description":"Salt, table","per_100g":{"calories":0,"protein_g":0,"carbs_g":0,"fat_g":0,"saturated_fat_g":0,"fiber_g":0,"sugar_g":0,"sodium_mg":38758},"source_url":"https://fdc.nal.usda.gov/food-details/173468/nutrients"}]},"image_url":"/recetas/receta-de-bandeja-paisa/portada.webp","gallery":[{"url":"/recetas/receta-de-bandeja-paisa/portada.webp","alt":"Bandeja paisa colombiana completa servita su un grande piatto"}],"seo":{"title":"Bandeja paisa colombiana completa | Manual de Cocina","description":"Bandeja paisa per 4 con fagioli rossi, riso, arepas, carne macinata, pancetta croccante, chorizo, platano maturo, uova, avocado e hogao.","image_variants":["/recetas/receta-de-bandeja-paisa/portada-1x1.webp","/recetas/receta-de-bandeja-paisa/portada-4x3.webp","/recetas/receta-de-bandeja-paisa/portada-16x9.webp"],"faq":[{"q":"Che cosa contiene una bandeja paisa completa?","a":"Questa proposta include fagioli rossi, riso bianco, arepa, carne macinata, chicharrón, chorizo, platano maturo, uovo fritto, avocado e hogao. La composizione può variare tra case e ristoranti."},{"q":"Posso preparare alcuni componenti in anticipo?","a":"Sì. Cuoci fagioli, riso e carni prima, raffredda in contenitori bassi e conserva in frigorifero fino a 3 giorni. Prepara arepas, platano e uova vicino al servizio per mantenerne la consistenza."},{"q":"Come ottengo chicharrón croccante con meno schizzi?","a":"Inizia con la pancetta in una padella fredda e 60 ml di acqua. Mentre l’acqua evapora, il grasso si scioglie gradualmente. Mantieni fuoco medio-basso, gira con pinze e usa un paraschizzi che non trattenga il vapore."}],"image_alt":"Bandeja paisa colombiana completa servita su un grande piatto"},"published":false,"editorial_status":"draft","content_html":"<p>Questa bandeja paisa riunisce in un unico piatto gli elementi più riconoscibili della preparazione di Antioquia: fagioli rossi densi, riso bianco, arepa, carne macinata, pancetta croccante, chorizo, fette di platano maturo, uovo fritto, avocado e hogao.</p><p>La proposta dà 4 piatti abbondanti. Prevede 45 minuti di preparazione, circa 150 minuti di cottura e 8–12 ore di ammollo dei fagioli: da 675 a 915 minuti in totale. La scheda mostra il minimo di 675 minuti, incluse 8 ore di ammollo; diverse operazioni di cucina si svolgono in parallelo. Quantità, tempi, assorbimento dell’olio e resa attendono conferma con una prova in cucina.</p>"},{"id":"5dd9ebf9-e855-53af-afae-5ffb6ad9a767","recipe_group_id":"8686de2f-500a-4c72-8f1c-1e9c0341e905","slug":"bandeja-paisa","public_path":"/ja/bandeja-paisa","source_url":null,"language":"ja","title":"コロンビアのバンデハ・パイサ","excerpt":"4人分のバンデハ・パイサ。赤いんげん豆、ご飯、アレパ、牛ひき肉、豚皮付き肉、チョリソー、完熟プランテン、卵、アボカド、ホガオを盛り合わせます。","summary":"アンティオキア地方の料理を代表する具材を一皿に集めたバンデハ・パイサです。とろみのある赤いんげん豆、白いご飯、アレパ、牛ひき肉、カリッと焼いた豚皮付き肉、チョリソー、完熟プランテンのスライス、目玉焼き、アボカド、ホガオを盛り合わせます。\n\nたっぷりした4人分を想定しています。準備45分、加熱約150分、豆を浸す8–12時間を合わせ、全体では675–915分です。レシピカードには8時間の浸水を含む最短の675分を表示しています。複数の調理作業は並行して行います。分量、時間、油の吸収量、出来上がり量は調理試作による確認前の提案です。","category":"主菜","category_slug":"platos-principales","difficulty":"高","course":"主菜","cuisine":"コロンビア、アンティオキア地方","prep_time_minutes":45,"cook_time_minutes":150,"total_time_minutes":675,"servings":4,"keywords":["バンデハパイサ","バンデハパイサのレシピ","コロンビア料理","アンティオキア料理","豆と豚皮付き肉"],"ingredients":[{"name":"乾燥赤いんげん豆","amount":"200","unit":"g","group":"豆"},{"name":"豆を煮るための清潔な水","amount":"1000","unit":"ml、別途浸水用の水","group":"豆"},{"name":"長粒種の白米","amount":"200","unit":"g","group":"ご飯"},{"name":"米を炊く水","amount":"400","unit":"ml","group":"ご飯"},{"name":"加熱処理済みコーンフラワー","amount":"120","unit":"g","group":"アレパ"},{"name":"アレパ用のぬるま湯","amount":"240","unit":"ml","group":"アレパ"},{"name":"完熟トマト、みじん切り","amount":"300","unit":"g","group":"ホガオ"},{"name":"白玉ねぎ、みじん切り","amount":"160","unit":"g","group":"ホガオ"},{"name":"にんにく、みじん切り","amount":"12","unit":"g","group":"ホガオ"},{"name":"クミンパウダー","amount":"1","unit":"g","group":"ホガオ"},{"name":"皮付き豚バラ肉","amount":"240","unit":"g","group":"肉"},{"name":"脂肪15 %の牛ひき肉","amount":"260","unit":"g","group":"肉"},{"name":"小さな豚肉チョリソー","amount":"4","unit":"本、合計200 g","group":"肉"},{"name":"大きめの卵","amount":"4","unit":"個、殻を除いて約200 g","group":"添え物"},{"name":"皮をむいた完熟プランテン","amount":"400","unit":"g","group":"添え物"},{"name":"アボカドの果肉","amount":"200","unit":"g","group":"添え物"},{"name":"キャノーラ油","amount":"60","unit":"ml、分けて使用。栄養計算では50 gの摂取を想定","group":"加熱用"},{"name":"細粒塩","amount":"8","unit":"g、分けて使用","group":"味付け"}],"steps":[{"title":"豆を浸す","content":"乾燥赤いんげん豆200 gを選別して洗います。たっぷりの冷水で覆い、冷蔵庫で8–12時間浸します。水を切り、浸水に使った水は捨てます。最短の合計675分には8時間の浸水を含みます。12時間浸す場合、全体で915分を見込んでください。","image_url":"/recetas/receta-de-bandeja-paisa/paso-01.webp","image_alt":"バンデハ・パイサ：浸水用の水で覆った乾燥赤いんげん豆"},{"title":"豆が柔らかくなるまで煮る","content":"水を切った豆を鍋に入れ、清潔な水1リットルを加えます。沸騰させ、泡を取り、火を中弱火に下げ、ふたを少し開けて90–120分煮ます。20分ごとに混ぜ、豆が水面から出たら熱湯を足します。形を保ちながら簡単につぶせる柔らかさになれば完了です。この段階ではトマトや塩を加えません。","image_url":"/recetas/receta-de-bandeja-paisa/paso-02.webp","image_alt":"バンデハ・パイサ：鍋でゆっくり煮ている赤いんげん豆"},{"title":"ホガオを作る","content":"豆を煮ている間に、フライパンで油のうち15 gを中火で温めます。みじん切りの玉ねぎ160 gを加えて5分加熱します。にんにく12 gとクミン1 gを加え、30秒混ぜます。トマト300 gと塩2 gを加え、とろみのあるソースになるまで12–15分煮ます。豆用に40 g取り分け、残りは盛り付け用に残します。","image_url":"/recetas/receta-de-bandeja-paisa/paso-03.webp","image_alt":"バンデハ・パイサ：フライパンの濃厚なトマトと玉ねぎのホガオ"},{"title":"豆を仕上げる","content":"豆が柔らかくなったら、取り分けたホガオ40 gと塩2 gを加えます。ふたをせず弱火で10分、混ぜながら煮て、煮汁がスプーンを薄く覆う濃さにします。乾きすぎた場合は熱湯を30 mlずつ加え、汁が多い場合はさらに煮詰めます。","image_url":"/recetas/receta-de-bandeja-paisa/paso-04.webp","image_alt":"バンデハ・パイサ：ホガオととろみのある煮汁で仕上げた赤いんげん豆"},{"title":"ご飯を炊く","content":"白米200 gを、水がほぼ透明になるまで洗います。鍋に米、水400 ml、塩2 gを入れます。沸騰したらふたをし、最弱火にして、ふたを開けずに15–18分炊きます。火を止めて10分蒸らし、フォークでほぐします。","image_url":"/recetas/receta-de-bandeja-paisa/paso-05.webp","image_alt":"バンデハ・パイサ：鍋で炊いてほぐした白いご飯"},{"title":"アレパを成形して焼く","content":"加熱処理済みコーンフラワー120 g、ぬるま湯240 ml、塩1 gを混ぜ、5分置きます。4等分し、直径約9 cm、厚さ1 cmの円盤状にして縁を整えます。薄く油を塗った鉄板で中弱火にし、片面6–8分ずつ、しっかりしてきつね色になるまで焼きます。","image_url":"/recetas/receta-de-bandeja-paisa/paso-06.webp","image_alt":"バンデハ・パイサ：鉄板で焼き色を付ける4枚の小さなアレパ"},{"title":"チチャロンを焼く","content":"皮付き豚バラ肉240 gを同じ大きさの4本に切り、肉を切り離さないよう皮に浅い切り込みを入れます。冷たいフライパンに肉と水60 mlを入れ、ふたをして中火で10分加熱します。ふたを取り、中弱火で20–30分、返しながら、水を蒸発させて脂を出します。皮がカリッとし、肉がこんがり焼け、中心が少なくとも71 °Cになったら取り出します。網で油を切り、脂は別に集めて排水口に流しません。","image_url":"/recetas/receta-de-bandeja-paisa/paso-07.webp","image_alt":"バンデハ・パイサ：フライパンのこんがりした豚皮付き肉"},{"title":"牛ひき肉とチョリソーを加熱する","content":"清潔なフライパンで油のうち10 gを温めます。牛ひき肉260 gと塩1 gを加え、中強火で7–9分、ほぐしながら、ピンク色の部分がなくなり71 °Cになるまで加熱します。取り出して温かく保ちます。同じフライパンで小さなチョリソー4本、合計200 gを10–12分、返しながら、中心が71 °Cになるまで加熱します。","image_url":"/recetas/receta-de-bandeja-paisa/paso-08.webp","image_alt":"バンデハ・パイサ：焼いた牛ひき肉と加熱中のチョリソー4本"},{"title":"プランテンと卵を焼く","content":"皮をむいた完熟プランテン400 gを斜めの薄切りにします。広いフライパンで残りの油を温め、中火で片面3–4分ずつ、黄金色で柔らかくなるまで焼き、網で油を切ります。同じフライパンで卵4個を1個ずつ3–4分、白身が完全に固まるまで焼きます。妊娠中の方、幼い子ども、高齢者、免疫機能が低下している方には、黄身も固くなるまで加熱します。","image_url":"/recetas/receta-de-bandeja-paisa/paso-09.webp","image_alt":"バンデハ・パイサ：黄金色のプランテンと白身が固まった目玉焼き"},{"title":"4皿に盛り付ける","content":"各皿に豆とご飯をそれぞれ4分の1、アレパ1枚、チチャロン1本、チョリソー1本、ひき肉とプランテンをそれぞれ4分の1、卵1個、アボカド50 gを盛ります。残りのホガオを好みで添え、すぐに出します。分量、時間、出来上がり量は、調理試作での確認を待つ編集上の提案です。","image_url":"/recetas/receta-de-bandeja-paisa/paso-10.webp","image_alt":"豆、ご飯、アレパ、肉、プランテン、卵、アボカド、ホガオを盛ったバンデハ・パイサ"}],"notes":"豚肉と卵を含みます。チョリソーは製品により小麦などのグルテンや乳を含む場合があります。グルテンを避ける場合は、チョリソーとコーンフラワーの認証を確認してください。ベジタリアン版は料理の内容、時間、栄養値が変わるため、直接の置き換えとしては提案していません。牛ひき肉、チョリソー、豚バラ肉は中心を少なくとも71 °Cまで加熱し、感染症の影響を受けやすい方には黄身まで固く焼いた卵を出します。豆、ご飯、肉は浅い容器に入れ、2時間以内、室温が32 °Cを超える場合は1時間以内に、4 °C以下で冷蔵し、3日以内に食べます。アボカドとカリッとした具材は別に保存します。再加熱は1回だけ、74 °Cまで行います。浸水、油の吸収量、チチャロンの厚さ、アレパの最終サイズは調理試作で確認する必要があります。","nutrition":{"calories":1483.3,"protein_g":50.5,"carbs_g":138.4,"fat_g":82.9,"saturated_fat_g":24.2,"fiber_g":17.8,"sugar_g":21,"sodium_mg":1346,"estimated":true,"serving_size":"全具材を含む4皿中の1皿","source":"USDA FoodData Central — SR Legacy（2018年4月）","source_url":"https://fdc.nal.usda.gov/download-datasets/","method":"確認済みのUSDA SR Legacyデータ15件を使用し、生の可食部重量を合計して4で割りました。乾燥豆200 g、生米200 g、牛ひき肉260 g、豚バラ肉240 g、チョリソー200 g、卵200 g、プランテン400 g、コーンフラワー120 g、アボカド200 g、ホガオ全量、クミン1 g、摂取したと推定する油50 g、塩8 gを計上しています。全粒コーンフラワーを加熱処理済み粉の、燻製豚肉ソーセージをチョリソーの、生プランテンを完熟プランテンの近似値として使用しています。","note":"参考用の推定で、完成した料理の分析値ではありません。油を切ったりフライパンに脂が残ったりしても、豚バラ肉全量と油50 gを計上する保守的な計算です。チョリソーの製品、肉の脂肪、プランテンの熟度、粉、油の吸収、盛り付ける煮汁、実際の分量により値は大きく変わります。","inputs":[{"ingredient":"乾燥赤いんげん豆","edible_grams":200,"fdc_id":173734,"fdc_description":"Beans, kidney, red, mature seeds, raw","per_100g":{"calories":337,"protein_g":22.53,"carbs_g":61.29,"fat_g":1.06,"saturated_fat_g":0.154,"fiber_g":15.2,"sugar_g":2.1,"sodium_mg":12},"source_url":"https://fdc.nal.usda.gov/food-details/173734/nutrients"},{"ingredient":"生の長粒白米","edible_grams":200,"fdc_id":168877,"fdc_description":"Rice, white, long-grain, regular, raw, enriched","per_100g":{"calories":365,"protein_g":7.13,"carbs_g":79.95,"fat_g":0.66,"saturated_fat_g":0.18,"fiber_g":1.3,"sugar_g":0.12,"sodium_mg":5},"source_url":"https://fdc.nal.usda.gov/food-details/168877/nutrients"},{"ingredient":"脂肪15 %の生牛ひき肉","edible_grams":260,"fdc_id":174036,"fdc_description":"Beef, ground, 85% lean meat / 15% fat, raw","per_100g":{"calories":215,"protein_g":18.59,"carbs_g":0,"fat_g":15,"saturated_fat_g":5.9,"fiber_g":0,"sugar_g":0,"sodium_mg":66},"source_url":"https://fdc.nal.usda.gov/food-details/174036/nutrients"},{"ingredient":"生の皮付き豚バラ肉","edible_grams":240,"fdc_id":167812,"fdc_description":"Pork, fresh, belly, raw","per_100g":{"calories":518,"protein_g":9.34,"carbs_g":0,"fat_g":53.01,"saturated_fat_g":19.33,"fiber_g":0,"sugar_g":0,"sodium_mg":32},"source_url":"https://fdc.nal.usda.gov/food-details/167812/nutrients"},{"ingredient":"加熱済み燻製豚肉ソーセージ、チョリソーの近似値","edible_grams":200,"fdc_id":174584,"fdc_description":"Sausage, smoked link sausage, pork","per_100g":{"calories":309,"protein_g":11.98,"carbs_g":0.94,"fat_g":28.23,"saturated_fat_g":9.313,"fiber_g":0,"sugar_g":0.94,"sodium_mg":827},"source_url":"https://fdc.nal.usda.gov/food-details/174584/nutrients"},{"ingredient":"生の全卵","edible_grams":200,"fdc_id":171287,"fdc_description":"Egg, whole, raw, fresh","per_100g":{"calories":143,"protein_g":12.56,"carbs_g":0.72,"fat_g":9.51,"saturated_fat_g":3.126,"fiber_g":0,"sugar_g":0.37,"sodium_mg":142},"source_url":"https://fdc.nal.usda.gov/food-details/171287/nutrients"},{"ingredient":"皮をむいた生の完熟プランテン","edible_grams":400,"fdc_id":168215,"fdc_description":"Plantains, raw (proxy de plátano maduro)","per_100g":{"calories":122,"protein_g":1.3,"carbs_g":31.9,"fat_g":0.37,"saturated_fat_g":0.14,"fiber_g":2.3,"sugar_g":15,"sodium_mg":4},"source_url":"https://fdc.nal.usda.gov/food-details/168215/nutrients"},{"ingredient":"全粒イエローコーンフラワー、加熱処理済みアレパ粉の近似値","edible_grams":120,"fdc_id":170290,"fdc_description":"Corn flour, whole-grain, yellow (proxy de harina de maíz precocida para arepa)","per_100g":{"calories":361,"protein_g":6.93,"carbs_g":76.85,"fat_g":3.86,"saturated_fat_g":0.55,"fiber_g":7.3,"sugar_g":0.64,"sodium_mg":5},"source_url":"https://fdc.nal.usda.gov/food-details/170290/nutrients"},{"ingredient":"アボカドの果肉","edible_grams":200,"fdc_id":171705,"fdc_description":"Avocados, raw, all commercial varieties","per_100g":{"calories":160,"protein_g":2,"carbs_g":8.53,"fat_g":14.66,"saturated_fat_g":2.126,"fiber_g":6.7,"sugar_g":0.66,"sodium_mg":7},"source_url":"https://fdc.nal.usda.gov/food-details/171705/nutrients"},{"ingredient":"生の赤いトマト","edible_grams":300,"fdc_id":170457,"fdc_description":"Tomatoes, red, ripe, raw, year round average","per_100g":{"calories":18,"protein_g":0.88,"carbs_g":3.89,"fat_g":0.2,"saturated_fat_g":0.028,"fiber_g":1.2,"sugar_g":2.63,"sodium_mg":5},"source_url":"https://fdc.nal.usda.gov/food-details/170457/nutrients"},{"ingredient":"生の玉ねぎ","edible_grams":160,"fdc_id":170000,"fdc_description":"Onions, raw","per_100g":{"calories":40,"protein_g":1.1,"carbs_g":9.34,"fat_g":0.1,"saturated_fat_g":0.042,"fiber_g":1.7,"sugar_g":4.24,"sodium_mg":4},"source_url":"https://fdc.nal.usda.gov/food-details/170000/nutrients"},{"ingredient":"生のにんにく","edible_grams":12,"fdc_id":169230,"fdc_description":"Garlic, raw","per_100g":{"calories":149,"protein_g":6.36,"carbs_g":33.06,"fat_g":0.5,"saturated_fat_g":0.089,"fiber_g":2.1,"sugar_g":1,"sodium_mg":17},"source_url":"https://fdc.nal.usda.gov/food-details/169230/nutrients"},{"ingredient":"クミンパウダー","edible_grams":1,"fdc_id":170923,"fdc_description":"Spices, cumin seed","per_100g":{"calories":375,"protein_g":17.81,"carbs_g":44.24,"fat_g":22.27,"saturated_fat_g":1.535,"fiber_g":10.5,"sugar_g":2.25,"sodium_mg":168},"source_url":"https://fdc.nal.usda.gov/food-details/170923/nutrients"},{"ingredient":"吸収したキャノーラ油","edible_grams":50,"fdc_id":172336,"fdc_description":"Oil, canola","per_100g":{"calories":884,"protein_g":0,"carbs_g":0,"fat_g":100,"saturated_fat_g":7.365,"fiber_g":0,"sugar_g":0,"sodium_mg":0},"source_url":"https://fdc.nal.usda.gov/food-details/172336/nutrients"},{"ingredient":"食塩","edible_grams":8,"fdc_id":173468,"fdc_description":"Salt, table","per_100g":{"calories":0,"protein_g":0,"carbs_g":0,"fat_g":0,"saturated_fat_g":0,"fiber_g":0,"sugar_g":0,"sodium_mg":38758},"source_url":"https://fdc.nal.usda.gov/food-details/173468/nutrients"}]},"image_url":"/recetas/receta-de-bandeja-paisa/portada.webp","gallery":[{"url":"/recetas/receta-de-bandeja-paisa/portada.webp","alt":"大皿に盛ったコロンビアのバンデハ・パイサ"}],"seo":{"title":"コロンビアのバンデハ・パイサの作り方","description":"4人分のバンデハ・パイサ。赤いんげん豆、ご飯、アレパ、牛ひき肉、豚皮付き肉、チョリソー、完熟プランテン、卵、アボカド、ホガオを盛り合わせます。","image_variants":["/recetas/receta-de-bandeja-paisa/portada-1x1.webp","/recetas/receta-de-bandeja-paisa/portada-4x3.webp","/recetas/receta-de-bandeja-paisa/portada-16x9.webp"],"faq":[{"q":"バンデハ・パイサには何を盛りますか？","a":"この提案では赤いんげん豆、ご飯、アレパ、牛ひき肉、チチャロン、チョリソー、完熟プランテン、目玉焼き、アボカド、ホガオを盛ります。家庭や店によって組み合わせは異なります。"},{"q":"具材を前もって作れますか？","a":"はい。豆、ご飯、肉は先に加熱し、浅い容器で冷まして最大3日間冷蔵できます。食感を保つため、アレパ、プランテン、卵は盛り付けに近い時間に調理します。"},{"q":"油はねを抑えて豚皮付き肉をカリッと焼くには？","a":"冷たいフライパンに豚バラ肉と水60 mlを入れて始めます。水が蒸発する間に脂が徐々に出ます。中弱火を保ち、トングで返し、蒸気を閉じ込めない油はね防止網を使います。"}],"image_alt":"大皿に盛ったコロンビアのバンデハ・パイサ"},"published":false,"editorial_status":"draft","content_html":"<p>アンティオキア地方の料理を代表する具材を一皿に集めたバンデハ・パイサです。とろみのある赤いんげん豆、白いご飯、アレパ、牛ひき肉、カリッと焼いた豚皮付き肉、チョリソー、完熟プランテンのスライス、目玉焼き、アボカド、ホガオを盛り合わせます。</p><p>たっぷりした4人分を想定しています。準備45分、加熱約150分、豆を浸す8–12時間を合わせ、全体では675–915分です。レシピカードには8時間の浸水を含む最短の675分を表示しています。複数の調理作業は並行して行います。分量、時間、油の吸収量、出来上がり量は調理試作による確認前の提案です。</p>"},{"id":"36034df4-567d-5cc2-bb3a-8bf7520778b4","recipe_group_id":"8686de2f-500a-4c72-8f1c-1e9c0341e905","slug":"bandeja-paisa","public_path":"/pt/bandeja-paisa","source_url":null,"language":"pt","title":"Bandeja paisa colombiana","excerpt":"Bandeja paisa para 4 com feijão vermelho, arroz, arepas, carne moída, torresmo, chorizo, banana-da-terra madura, ovos, abacate e hogao.","summary":"Esta bandeja paisa reúne em um só prato os componentes mais conhecidos da preparação de Antioquia: feijão vermelho encorpado, arroz branco, arepa, carne moída, torresmo, chorizo, fatias de banana-da-terra madura, ovo frito, abacate e hogao.\n\nA proposta rende 4 pratos fartos. São 45 minutos de preparo, cerca de 150 minutos de cozimento e 8–12 horas de molho do feijão: entre 675 e 915 minutos no total. A ficha mostra o mínimo de 675 minutos, incluindo 8 horas de molho; várias tarefas de cozinha são feitas em paralelo. Quantidades, tempos, absorção de óleo e rendimento aguardam confirmação por teste de cozinha.","category":"Pratos principais","category_slug":"platos-principales","difficulty":"Alta","course":"Prato principal","cuisine":"Colombiana, de Antioquia","prep_time_minutes":45,"cook_time_minutes":150,"total_time_minutes":675,"servings":4,"keywords":["bandeja paisa","receita de bandeja paisa colombiana","comida de Antioquia","feijão com torresmo","prato típico colombiano"],"ingredients":[{"name":"feijão vermelho seco","amount":"200","unit":"g","group":"Feijão"},{"name":"água limpa para cozinhar o feijão","amount":"1000","unit":"ml, mais a água necessária para o molho","group":"Feijão"},{"name":"arroz branco de grão longo","amount":"200","unit":"g","group":"Arroz"},{"name":"água para o arroz","amount":"400","unit":"ml","group":"Arroz"},{"name":"farinha de milho pré-cozida","amount":"120","unit":"g","group":"Arepas"},{"name":"água morna para as arepas","amount":"240","unit":"ml","group":"Arepas"},{"name":"tomates maduros, picados","amount":"300","unit":"g","group":"Hogao"},{"name":"cebola branca, picada","amount":"160","unit":"g","group":"Hogao"},{"name":"alho, picado","amount":"12","unit":"g","group":"Hogao"},{"name":"cominho moído","amount":"1","unit":"g","group":"Hogao"},{"name":"barriga de porco com pele","amount":"240","unit":"g","group":"Carnes"},{"name":"carne bovina moída com 15 % de gordura","amount":"260","unit":"g","group":"Carnes"},{"name":"chorizos pequenos de porco","amount":"4","unit":"unidades, 200 g no total","group":"Carnes"},{"name":"ovos grandes","amount":"4","unit":"unidades, cerca de 200 g sem casca","group":"Acompanhamentos"},{"name":"banana-da-terra madura sem casca","amount":"400","unit":"g","group":"Acompanhamentos"},{"name":"polpa de abacate","amount":"200","unit":"g","group":"Acompanhamentos"},{"name":"óleo de canola","amount":"60","unit":"ml, divididos; a nutrição estima 50 g consumidos","group":"Cozimento"},{"name":"sal fino","amount":"8","unit":"g, divididos","group":"Tempero"}],"steps":[{"title":"Deixe o feijão de molho","content":"Escolha e lave 200 g de feijão vermelho seco. Cubra com bastante água fria e deixe 8–12 horas na geladeira. Escorra e descarte a água do molho. O total mínimo de 675 minutos inclui 8 horas de molho; com 12 horas de molho, calcule 915 minutos no total.","image_url":"/recetas/receta-de-bandeja-paisa/paso-01.webp","image_alt":"Bandeja paisa: feijão vermelho seco coberto com água para o molho"},{"title":"Cozinhe o feijão até ficar macio","content":"Coloque o feijão escorrido em uma panela com 1 litro de água limpa. Leve à fervura, retire a espuma, abaixe para fogo médio-baixo e cozinhe com a tampa parcialmente aberta por 90–120 minutos. Mexa a cada 20 minutos e acrescente água quente se os grãos deixarem de ficar cobertos. Estão prontos quando amassam facilmente, mas mantêm o formato; ainda não acrescente tomate nem sal.","image_url":"/recetas/receta-de-bandeja-paisa/paso-02.webp","image_alt":"Bandeja paisa: feijão vermelho cozinhando suavemente na panela"},{"title":"Prepare o hogao","content":"Enquanto o feijão cozinha, aqueça 15 g do óleo em uma frigideira em fogo médio. Junte 160 g de cebola picada e cozinhe 5 minutos. Acrescente 12 g de alho picado e 1 g de cominho; mexa 30 segundos. Junte 300 g de tomate picado e 2 g de sal. Cozinhe 12–15 minutos até obter um molho espesso. Reserve 40 g para o feijão e guarde o restante para servir.","image_url":"/recetas/receta-de-bandeja-paisa/paso-03.webp","image_alt":"Bandeja paisa: hogao espesso de tomate e cebola na frigideira"},{"title":"Finalize o feijão","content":"Quando o feijão estiver macio, junte os 40 g de hogao reservados e 2 g de sal. Cozinhe destampado por 10 minutos em fogo baixo, mexendo, até o caldo cobrir a colher. Se estiver muito seco, acrescente água quente de 30 em 30 ml; se estiver com muito caldo, prolongue a redução.","image_url":"/recetas/receta-de-bandeja-paisa/paso-04.webp","image_alt":"Bandeja paisa: feijão vermelho finalizado com hogao e caldo encorpado"},{"title":"Cozinhe o arroz","content":"Lave 200 g de arroz branco até a água ficar quase transparente. Coloque em uma panela com 400 ml de água e 2 g de sal. Leve à fervura, tampe, abaixe ao mínimo e cozinhe 15–18 minutos sem destampar. Desligue e deixe descansar 10 minutos; solte os grãos com um garfo.","image_url":"/recetas/receta-de-bandeja-paisa/paso-05.webp","image_alt":"Bandeja paisa: arroz branco cozido e soltinho na panela"},{"title":"Modele e asse as arepas","content":"Misture 120 g de farinha de milho pré-cozida com 240 ml de água morna e 1 g de sal. Descanse 5 minutos. Divida em 4 porções, forme discos de cerca de 9 cm de diâmetro e 1 cm de espessura e alise as bordas. Asse em chapa levemente untada em fogo médio-baixo por 6–8 minutos de cada lado, até ficarem firmes e dourados.","image_url":"/recetas/receta-de-bandeja-paisa/paso-06.webp","image_alt":"Bandeja paisa: quatro arepas pequenas dourando na chapa"},{"title":"Doure o torresmo","content":"Corte 240 g de barriga de porco com pele em 4 tiras iguais e faça cortes rasos na pele sem separar os pedaços. Coloque em uma frigideira fria com 60 ml de água, tampe e cozinhe 10 minutos em fogo médio. Destampe e continue 20–30 minutos em fogo médio-baixo, virando, enquanto a água evapora e a gordura derrete. Retire quando a pele estiver crocante, a carne dourada e o centro atingir pelo menos 71 °C. Escorra em grade; recolha a gordura separadamente, sem despejar no ralo.","image_url":"/recetas/receta-de-bandeja-paisa/paso-07.webp","image_alt":"Bandeja paisa: tiras de torresmo douradas e crocantes na frigideira"},{"title":"Cozinhe a carne e os chorizos","content":"Aqueça 10 g do óleo em uma frigideira limpa. Junte 260 g de carne moída e 1 g de sal; cozinhe 7–9 minutos em fogo médio-alto, soltando a carne, até não haver partes rosadas e atingir 71 °C. Retire e mantenha quente. Na mesma frigideira, cozinhe 4 chorizos pequenos, 200 g no total, por 10–12 minutos, virando, até atingirem 71 °C no centro.","image_url":"/recetas/receta-de-bandeja-paisa/paso-08.webp","image_alt":"Bandeja paisa: carne moída dourada e quatro chorizos em cozimento"},{"title":"Frite a banana-da-terra e os ovos","content":"Corte 400 g de banana-da-terra madura sem casca em fatias diagonais. Aqueça o óleo restante em uma frigideira larga e frite as fatias em fogo médio por 3–4 minutos de cada lado, até ficarem douradas e macias; escorra em grade. Na mesma frigideira, frite 4 ovos, um de cada vez, por 3–4 minutos, até a clara ficar totalmente firme. Para gestantes, crianças pequenas, idosos ou pessoas imunodeprimidas, cozinhe também a gema até ficar firme.","image_url":"/recetas/receta-de-bandeja-paisa/paso-09.webp","image_alt":"Bandeja paisa: banana-da-terra dourada e ovos fritos com claras firmes"},{"title":"Monte os quatro pratos","content":"Distribua em cada prato um quarto do feijão e do arroz, 1 arepa, 1 tira de torresmo, 1 chorizo, um quarto da carne moída e da banana-da-terra, 1 ovo e 50 g de abacate. Acrescente o hogao restante a gosto e sirva imediatamente. Quantidades, tempos e rendimento são uma proposta editorial aguardando confirmação em cozinha.","image_url":"/recetas/receta-de-bandeja-paisa/paso-10.webp","image_alt":"Bandeja paisa completa com feijão, arroz, arepa, carnes, banana-da-terra, ovo, abacate e hogao"}],"notes":"Este prato contém porco e ovo; o chorizo pode conter glúten ou leite conforme a marca. Para uma bandeja sem glúten, confirme a certificação do chorizo e da farinha de milho. Não se propõe uma versão vegetariana como substituição direta porque alteraria identidade, tempos e nutrição. Cozinhe carne moída, chorizo e barriga de porco até pelo menos 71 °C no centro; para pessoas vulneráveis, sirva o ovo com gema firme. Refrigere feijão, arroz e carnes em recipientes baixos a 4 °C ou menos em até 2 horas —1 hora se o ambiente passar de 32 °C— e consuma em 3 dias. Guarde abacate e componentes crocantes separados. Reaqueça uma única vez até 74 °C. Molho, absorção de óleo, espessura do torresmo e tamanho final das arepas precisam ser validados em cozinha.","nutrition":{"calories":1483.3,"protein_g":50.5,"carbs_g":138.4,"fat_g":82.9,"saturated_fat_g":24.2,"fiber_g":17.8,"sugar_g":21,"sodium_mg":1346,"estimated":true,"serving_size":"1 prato de um total de 4, com todos os componentes","source":"USDA FoodData Central — SR Legacy (abril de 2018)","source_url":"https://fdc.nal.usda.gov/download-datasets/","method":"Quinze fichas USDA SR Legacy verificadas; pesos crus comestíveis somados e divididos por 4. Contam-se 200 g de feijão seco, 200 g de arroz cru, 260 g de carne moída, 240 g de barriga de porco, 200 g de chorizo, 200 g de ovo, 400 g de banana-da-terra, 120 g de farinha de milho, 200 g de abacate, todo o hogao, 1 g de cominho, 50 g de óleo estimados como consumidos e 8 g de sal. Farinha de milho integral aproxima a pré-cozida; linguiça suína defumada aproxima o chorizo; banana-da-terra crua aproxima a madura.","note":"Estimativa informativa, não análise do prato pronto. É deliberadamente conservadora: conta toda a barriga de porco e 50 g de óleo, embora parte da gordura escorra ou fique na frigideira. Marca do chorizo, gordura da carne, maturação da banana-da-terra, farinha, absorção de óleo, caldo servido e porções reais podem alterar muito o resultado.","inputs":[{"ingredient":"feijão vermelho seco","edible_grams":200,"fdc_id":173734,"fdc_description":"Beans, kidney, red, mature seeds, raw","per_100g":{"calories":337,"protein_g":22.53,"carbs_g":61.29,"fat_g":1.06,"saturated_fat_g":0.154,"fiber_g":15.2,"sugar_g":2.1,"sodium_mg":12},"source_url":"https://fdc.nal.usda.gov/food-details/173734/nutrients"},{"ingredient":"arroz branco de grão longo cru","edible_grams":200,"fdc_id":168877,"fdc_description":"Rice, white, long-grain, regular, raw, enriched","per_100g":{"calories":365,"protein_g":7.13,"carbs_g":79.95,"fat_g":0.66,"saturated_fat_g":0.18,"fiber_g":1.3,"sugar_g":0.12,"sodium_mg":5},"source_url":"https://fdc.nal.usda.gov/food-details/168877/nutrients"},{"ingredient":"carne bovina moída crua com 15 % de gordura","edible_grams":260,"fdc_id":174036,"fdc_description":"Beef, ground, 85% lean meat / 15% fat, raw","per_100g":{"calories":215,"protein_g":18.59,"carbs_g":0,"fat_g":15,"saturated_fat_g":5.9,"fiber_g":0,"sugar_g":0,"sodium_mg":66},"source_url":"https://fdc.nal.usda.gov/food-details/174036/nutrients"},{"ingredient":"barriga de porco crua com pele","edible_grams":240,"fdc_id":167812,"fdc_description":"Pork, fresh, belly, raw","per_100g":{"calories":518,"protein_g":9.34,"carbs_g":0,"fat_g":53.01,"saturated_fat_g":19.33,"fiber_g":0,"sugar_g":0,"sodium_mg":32},"source_url":"https://fdc.nal.usda.gov/food-details/167812/nutrients"},{"ingredient":"linguiça suína defumada cozida, aproximação do chorizo","edible_grams":200,"fdc_id":174584,"fdc_description":"Sausage, smoked link sausage, pork","per_100g":{"calories":309,"protein_g":11.98,"carbs_g":0.94,"fat_g":28.23,"saturated_fat_g":9.313,"fiber_g":0,"sugar_g":0.94,"sodium_mg":827},"source_url":"https://fdc.nal.usda.gov/food-details/174584/nutrients"},{"ingredient":"ovo inteiro cru","edible_grams":200,"fdc_id":171287,"fdc_description":"Egg, whole, raw, fresh","per_100g":{"calories":143,"protein_g":12.56,"carbs_g":0.72,"fat_g":9.51,"saturated_fat_g":3.126,"fiber_g":0,"sugar_g":0.37,"sodium_mg":142},"source_url":"https://fdc.nal.usda.gov/food-details/171287/nutrients"},{"ingredient":"banana-da-terra madura sem casca crua","edible_grams":400,"fdc_id":168215,"fdc_description":"Plantains, raw (proxy de plátano maduro)","per_100g":{"calories":122,"protein_g":1.3,"carbs_g":31.9,"fat_g":0.37,"saturated_fat_g":0.14,"fiber_g":2.3,"sugar_g":15,"sodium_mg":4},"source_url":"https://fdc.nal.usda.gov/food-details/168215/nutrients"},{"ingredient":"farinha de milho amarela integral, aproximação da farinha pré-cozida para arepa","edible_grams":120,"fdc_id":170290,"fdc_description":"Corn flour, whole-grain, yellow (proxy de harina de maíz precocida para arepa)","per_100g":{"calories":361,"protein_g":6.93,"carbs_g":76.85,"fat_g":3.86,"saturated_fat_g":0.55,"fiber_g":7.3,"sugar_g":0.64,"sodium_mg":5},"source_url":"https://fdc.nal.usda.gov/food-details/170290/nutrients"},{"ingredient":"polpa de abacate","edible_grams":200,"fdc_id":171705,"fdc_description":"Avocados, raw, all commercial varieties","per_100g":{"calories":160,"protein_g":2,"carbs_g":8.53,"fat_g":14.66,"saturated_fat_g":2.126,"fiber_g":6.7,"sugar_g":0.66,"sodium_mg":7},"source_url":"https://fdc.nal.usda.gov/food-details/171705/nutrients"},{"ingredient":"tomate vermelho cru","edible_grams":300,"fdc_id":170457,"fdc_description":"Tomatoes, red, ripe, raw, year round average","per_100g":{"calories":18,"protein_g":0.88,"carbs_g":3.89,"fat_g":0.2,"saturated_fat_g":0.028,"fiber_g":1.2,"sugar_g":2.63,"sodium_mg":5},"source_url":"https://fdc.nal.usda.gov/food-details/170457/nutrients"},{"ingredient":"cebola crua","edible_grams":160,"fdc_id":170000,"fdc_description":"Onions, raw","per_100g":{"calories":40,"protein_g":1.1,"carbs_g":9.34,"fat_g":0.1,"saturated_fat_g":0.042,"fiber_g":1.7,"sugar_g":4.24,"sodium_mg":4},"source_url":"https://fdc.nal.usda.gov/food-details/170000/nutrients"},{"ingredient":"alho cru","edible_grams":12,"fdc_id":169230,"fdc_description":"Garlic, raw","per_100g":{"calories":149,"protein_g":6.36,"carbs_g":33.06,"fat_g":0.5,"saturated_fat_g":0.089,"fiber_g":2.1,"sugar_g":1,"sodium_mg":17},"source_url":"https://fdc.nal.usda.gov/food-details/169230/nutrients"},{"ingredient":"cominho moído","edible_grams":1,"fdc_id":170923,"fdc_description":"Spices, cumin seed","per_100g":{"calories":375,"protein_g":17.81,"carbs_g":44.24,"fat_g":22.27,"saturated_fat_g":1.535,"fiber_g":10.5,"sugar_g":2.25,"sodium_mg":168},"source_url":"https://fdc.nal.usda.gov/food-details/170923/nutrients"},{"ingredient":"óleo de canola absorvido","edible_grams":50,"fdc_id":172336,"fdc_description":"Oil, canola","per_100g":{"calories":884,"protein_g":0,"carbs_g":0,"fat_g":100,"saturated_fat_g":7.365,"fiber_g":0,"sugar_g":0,"sodium_mg":0},"source_url":"https://fdc.nal.usda.gov/food-details/172336/nutrients"},{"ingredient":"sal de mesa","edible_grams":8,"fdc_id":173468,"fdc_description":"Salt, table","per_100g":{"calories":0,"protein_g":0,"carbs_g":0,"fat_g":0,"saturated_fat_g":0,"fiber_g":0,"sugar_g":0,"sodium_mg":38758},"source_url":"https://fdc.nal.usda.gov/food-details/173468/nutrients"}]},"image_url":"/recetas/receta-de-bandeja-paisa/portada.webp","gallery":[{"url":"/recetas/receta-de-bandeja-paisa/portada.webp","alt":"Bandeja paisa colombiana completa servida em um prato grande"}],"seo":{"title":"Bandeja paisa colombiana completa | Manual de Cocina","description":"Bandeja paisa para 4 com feijão vermelho, arroz, arepas, carne moída, torresmo, chorizo, banana-da-terra madura, ovos, abacate e hogao.","image_variants":["/recetas/receta-de-bandeja-paisa/portada-1x1.webp","/recetas/receta-de-bandeja-paisa/portada-4x3.webp","/recetas/receta-de-bandeja-paisa/portada-16x9.webp"],"faq":[{"q":"O que vai em uma bandeja paisa completa?","a":"Esta proposta inclui feijão vermelho, arroz branco, arepa, carne moída, torresmo, chorizo, banana-da-terra madura, ovo frito, abacate e hogao. A composição pode variar entre casas e restaurantes."},{"q":"Posso adiantar componentes da bandeja paisa?","a":"Sim. Cozinhe feijão, arroz e carnes antes, resfrie em recipientes baixos e refrigere por até 3 dias. Faça arepas, banana-da-terra e ovos perto do serviço para manter a textura."},{"q":"Como consigo torresmo crocante com menos respingos?","a":"Comece com a barriga de porco em frigideira fria e 60 ml de água. Enquanto a água evapora, a gordura derrete aos poucos. Mantenha fogo médio-baixo, vire com pinça e use tela antirrespingos que não prenda o vapor."}],"image_alt":"Bandeja paisa colombiana completa servida em um prato grande"},"published":false,"editorial_status":"draft","content_html":"<p>Esta bandeja paisa reúne em um só prato os componentes mais conhecidos da preparação de Antioquia: feijão vermelho encorpado, arroz branco, arepa, carne moída, torresmo, chorizo, fatias de banana-da-terra madura, ovo frito, abacate e hogao.</p><p>A proposta rende 4 pratos fartos. São 45 minutos de preparo, cerca de 150 minutos de cozimento e 8–12 horas de molho do feijão: entre 675 e 915 minutos no total. A ficha mostra o mínimo de 675 minutos, incluindo 8 horas de molho; várias tarefas de cozinha são feitas em paralelo. Quantidades, tempos, absorção de óleo e rendimento aguardam confirmação por teste de cozinha.</p>"},{"id":"e25621f2-c633-443c-8cb2-03780274d501","recipe_group_id":"53237760-f2f8-4852-9c3c-ac101fa2f237","language":"es","slug":"arroz-blanco-perfecto","public_path":"/arroz-blanco-perfecto","source_url":"https://manualdecocina.com/arroz-blanco-perfecto/","title":"Arroz blanco suelto por absorción","excerpt":"Arroz blanco de grano largo para 4, con cantidades medidas, cocción tapada y reposo de 10 minutos para separar los granos.","summary":"Un arroz blanco sencillo, de grano largo, cocido con una cantidad medida de agua y terminado con reposo fuera del fuego. Esta guarnición busca granos tiernos y separados, sin caldo ni sofrito, y conserva la URL histórica de arroz blanco perfecto.\n\nLa propuesta rinde 4 guarniciones y estima 10 minutos de preparación, 25 de cocción y 10 de reposo: 45 minutos en total. Tipo y marca de arroz, diámetro de la olla y cierre de la tapa pueden modificar el agua y el tiempo. Cantidades, tiempos y rendimiento están pendientes de prueba de cocina.","category":"Guarniciones","category_slug":"guarniciones","difficulty":"Baja","course":"Guarnición","cuisine":"Internacional","prep_time_minutes":10,"cook_time_minutes":25,"total_time_minutes":45,"servings":4,"keywords":["arroz blanco","arroz blanco suelto","arroz blanco perfecto","arroz por absorción","guarnición de arroz"],"ingredients":[{"name":"arroz blanco de grano largo, no precocido","amount":"240","unit":"g","group":"Base"},{"name":"agua para cocer","amount":"480","unit":"ml, más agua para lavar","group":"Base"},{"name":"aceite de canola","amount":"10","unit":"g","group":"Sazonado"},{"name":"sal fina","amount":"3","unit":"g","group":"Sazonado"}],"steps":[{"title":"Mide el arroz y el agua","content":"Pesa 240 g de arroz blanco de grano largo y mide 480 ml de agua para cocer. Prepara 10 g de aceite y 3 g de sal. Usa una olla de fondo grueso de unos 18–20 cm de diámetro con tapa ajustada; una olla muy ancha o una tapa que pierde vapor cambia la absorción. Esta fórmula no está pensada para arroz integral ni precocido.","image_url":"/recetas/arroz-blanco-perfecto/paso-01.webp","image_alt":"Arroz blanco: arroz, agua, aceite y sal medidos para cuatro guarniciones"},{"title":"Lava y escurre el arroz","content":"Pon el arroz en un cuenco, cúbrelo con agua fría y muévelo suavemente con la mano limpia. Desecha el agua turbia y repite 2–3 veces, hasta que salga menos lechosa; no es necesario que sea transparente. Escurre en colador fino durante 5 minutos. No remojes el arroz en esta propuesta.","image_url":"/recetas/arroz-blanco-perfecto/paso-02.webp","image_alt":"Arroz blanco: lavado del grano y escurrido en colador fino"},{"title":"Lleva el agua a ebullición","content":"Pon en la olla el arroz escurrido, los 480 ml de agua medidos, los 10 g de aceite y los 3 g de sal. Remueve una sola vez para repartir y lleva a ebullición a fuego medio-alto durante unos 3–5 minutos. Vigila hasta que haya burbujas por toda la superficie; no dejes evaporar el agua con la olla destapada.","image_url":"/recetas/arroz-blanco-perfecto/paso-03.webp","image_alt":"Arroz blanco: agua y arroz alcanzan la ebullición en la olla"},{"title":"Cuece tapado a fuego mínimo","content":"En cuanto hierva, tapa bien y baja al mínimo. Cocina 15–18 minutos sin abrir ni remover. Al final, comprueba rápidamente: no debe quedar agua libre y el grano debe estar tierno. Si sigue duro y la olla está seca, añade 30 ml de agua caliente, tapa y cocina 3 minutos más. Si queda agua, tapa y prolonga 2 minutos. Estas correcciones pueden aumentar el tiempo propuesto.","image_url":"/recetas/arroz-blanco-perfecto/paso-04.webp","image_alt":"Arroz blanco: olla tapada durante la cocción a fuego mínimo"},{"title":"Deja reposar fuera del fuego","content":"Apaga y retira la olla del quemador caliente. Déjala tapada 10 minutos para que se redistribuya la humedad. No remuevas ni levantes la tapa durante este reposo, incluido en los 45 minutos totales.","image_url":"/recetas/arroz-blanco-perfecto/paso-05.webp","image_alt":"Arroz blanco: olla retirada del fuego y tapada durante el reposo"},{"title":"Suelta los granos y sirve","content":"Destapa apartando la cara del vapor. Separa el arroz con un tenedor, levantando suavemente en vez de aplastarlo. Reparte en 4 porciones y sirve de inmediato. No dejes las sobras enfriándose dentro de la olla: pásalas a recipientes bajos para enfriarlas y refrigerarlas rápidamente.","image_url":"/recetas/arroz-blanco-perfecto/paso-06.webp","image_alt":"Arroz blanco cocido con granos separados, listo para servir"}],"notes":"La textura depende del arroz y del equipo: esta proporción es una propuesta para grano largo blanco, no una garantía universal. El arroz integral, el arroz para sushi o el precocido requieren otra ficha. Puedes omitir el aceite; la nutrición calculada corresponde a la receta con los 10 g completos. El plato no contiene alérgenos habituales por sus ingredientes, pero revisa las etiquetas y la contaminación cruzada. Guarda las sobras en recipientes bajos, enfría idealmente dentro de 1 hora, refrigera a 4 °C o menos y consume dentro de 24 horas. Recalienta una sola vez hasta que todo esté humeante, al menos 74 °C en el centro, y consume inmediatamente. No uses el olor como garantía de seguridad ni dejes arroz templado en la olla.","nutrition":{"estimated":true,"serving_size":"1 de 4 guarniciones","source":"USDA FoodData Central — SR Legacy (abril de 2018)","source_url":"https://fdc.nal.usda.gov/download-datasets/","method":"Tres fichas USDA verificadas: 240 g de arroz blanco largo crudo, 10 g de aceite de canola y 3 g de sal. Suma de pesos comestibles crudos dividida entre 4; agua sin aporte energético. Se cuenta todo el aceite y toda la sal. El peso final depende de la absorción y no se usa como dato confirmado.","note":"Estimación informativa, no análisis del arroz terminado. Lavado, variedad, enriquecimiento, cantidad realmente servida y aceite que quede en la olla pueden cambiar los valores. Rendimiento y tiempos pendientes de prueba de cocina.","inputs":[{"ingredient":"arroz blanco de grano largo crudo","edible_grams":240,"fdc_id":168877,"fdc_description":"Rice, white, long-grain, regular, raw, enriched","per_100g":{"calories":365,"protein_g":7.13,"carbs_g":79.95,"fat_g":0.66,"saturated_fat_g":0.18,"fiber_g":1.3,"sugar_g":0.12,"sodium_mg":5},"source_url":"https://fdc.nal.usda.gov/food-details/168877/nutrients"},{"ingredient":"aceite de canola","edible_grams":10,"fdc_id":172336,"fdc_description":"Oil, canola","per_100g":{"calories":884,"protein_g":0,"carbs_g":0,"fat_g":100,"saturated_fat_g":7.365,"fiber_g":0,"sugar_g":0,"sodium_mg":0},"source_url":"https://fdc.nal.usda.gov/food-details/172336/nutrients"},{"ingredient":"sal fina","edible_grams":3,"fdc_id":173468,"fdc_description":"Salt, table","per_100g":{"calories":0,"protein_g":0,"carbs_g":0,"fat_g":0,"saturated_fat_g":0,"fiber_g":0,"sugar_g":0,"sodium_mg":38758},"source_url":"https://fdc.nal.usda.gov/food-details/173468/nutrients"}],"calories":241.1,"protein_g":4.3,"carbs_g":48,"fat_g":2.9,"saturated_fat_g":0.3,"fiber_g":0.8,"sugar_g":0.1,"sodium_mg":294},"image_url":"/recetas/arroz-blanco-perfecto/portada.webp","gallery":[{"url":"/recetas/arroz-blanco-perfecto/portada.webp","alt":"Arroz blanco de grano largo cocido y suelto en un cuenco"}],"seo":{"title":"Arroz blanco suelto: método por absorción | Manual de Cocina","description":"Prepara arroz blanco para 4 con agua medida, cocción tapada y 10 minutos de reposo. Aprende a corregir el punto y guardar las sobras.","image_alt":"Arroz blanco de grano largo cocido y suelto en un cuenco","image_variants":["/recetas/arroz-blanco-perfecto/portada-1x1.webp","/recetas/arroz-blanco-perfecto/portada-4x3.webp","/recetas/arroz-blanco-perfecto/portada-16x9.webp"],"faq":[{"q":"¿Cuánta agua uso para este arroz blanco?","a":"Esta propuesta utiliza 480 ml de agua para 240 g de arroz blanco de grano largo lavado y bien escurrido. No confundas gramos con tazas: la proporción depende también de la variedad y del cierre de la olla."},{"q":"¿Por qué el arroz queda pegajoso o apelmazado?","a":"El exceso de almidón superficial, demasiada agua o remover durante la cocción favorecen que se pegue. Lava y escurre, mide el agua, cocina tapado sin remover y respeta los 10 minutos de reposo antes de soltar con tenedor."},{"q":"¿Puedo guardar y recalentar el arroz?","a":"Sí, si lo enfrías rápidamente, idealmente dentro de 1 hora, y lo guardas refrigerado para consumir en 24 horas. Recalienta una sola vez hasta que esté humeante por completo. No lo dejes templado en la olla."}]},"published":false,"editorial_status":"draft","content_html":"<p>Un arroz blanco sencillo, de grano largo, cocido con una cantidad medida de agua y terminado con reposo fuera del fuego. Esta guarnición busca granos tiernos y separados, sin caldo ni sofrito, y conserva la URL histórica de arroz blanco perfecto.</p><p>La propuesta rinde 4 guarniciones y estima 10 minutos de preparación, 25 de cocción y 10 de reposo: 45 minutos en total. Tipo y marca de arroz, diámetro de la olla y cierre de la tapa pueden modificar el agua y el tiempo. Cantidades, tiempos y rendimiento están pendientes de prueba de cocina.</p>"},{"id":"fa99a727-a208-5ea6-9c57-e039b068fe95","recipe_group_id":"53237760-f2f8-4852-9c3c-ac101fa2f237","language":"de","slug":"lockerer-weisser-reis","public_path":"/de/lockerer-weisser-reis","source_url":null,"title":"Lockerer weißer Reis nach der Quellmethode","excerpt":"Weißer Langkornreis für 4 mit abgewogenen Zutaten, geschlossenem Deckel und 10 Minuten Ruhezeit für einzelne Körner.","summary":"Einfacher weißer Langkornreis, der mit einer abgemessenen Wassermenge gart und anschließend abseits der Hitze ruht. Diese Beilage soll zarte, einzelne Körner ergeben, ohne Brühe oder angebratene Zutaten. Die historische URL für perfekten weißen Reis bleibt erhalten.\n\nDer Vorschlag ergibt 4 Beilagenportionen und veranschlagt 10 Minuten Vorbereitung, 25 Minuten Garzeit und 10 Minuten Ruhezeit: insgesamt 45 Minuten. Reissorte und Marke, Topfdurchmesser und Deckel können Wasserbedarf und Zeit verändern. Mengen, Zeiten und Ausbeute müssen noch in der Küche geprüft werden.","category":"Beilagen","category_slug":"guarniciones","difficulty":"Einfach","course":"Beilage","cuisine":"International","prep_time_minutes":10,"cook_time_minutes":25,"total_time_minutes":45,"servings":4,"keywords":["weißer Reis","lockerer Reis","Langkornreis","Quellmethode","Reis als Beilage"],"ingredients":[{"name":"weißer Langkornreis, nicht vorgegart","amount":"240","unit":"g","group":"Grundlage"},{"name":"Wasser zum Garen","amount":"480","unit":"ml, zusätzlich Wasser zum Waschen","group":"Grundlage"},{"name":"Rapsöl","amount":"10","unit":"g","group":"Würzung"},{"name":"feines Salz","amount":"3","unit":"g","group":"Würzung"}],"steps":[{"title":"Reis und Wasser abmessen","content":"240 g weißen Langkornreis abwiegen und 480 ml Wasser zum Garen abmessen. 10 g Öl und 3 g Salz bereitstellen. Einen Topf mit dickem Boden, etwa 18–20 cm Durchmesser und dicht schließendem Deckel verwenden; ein sehr breiter Topf oder entweichender Dampf verändert die Wasseraufnahme. Die Formel ist nicht für Vollkornreis oder vorgegarten Reis gedacht.","image_url":"/recetas/arroz-blanco-perfecto/paso-01.webp","image_alt":"Weißer Reis: Reis, Wasser, Öl und Salz für vier Beilagenportionen abgemessen"},{"title":"Reis waschen und abtropfen lassen","content":"Den Reis in einer Schüssel mit kaltem Wasser bedecken und mit sauberer Hand behutsam bewegen. Das trübe Wasser abgießen und 2–3-mal wiederholen, bis es weniger milchig ist; ganz klar muss es nicht werden. In einem feinen Sieb 5 Minuten abtropfen lassen. Den Reis für diesen Vorschlag nicht einweichen.","image_url":"/recetas/arroz-blanco-perfecto/paso-02.webp","image_alt":"Weißer Reis: Körner waschen und im feinen Sieb abtropfen lassen"},{"title":"Wasser aufkochen","content":"Abgetropften Reis, die abgemessenen 480 ml Wasser, 10 g Öl und 3 g Salz in den Topf geben. Einmal zum Verteilen umrühren und bei mittelhoher Hitze etwa 3–5 Minuten bis zum Kochen erhitzen. Warten, bis auf der ganzen Oberfläche Blasen erscheinen; das Wasser nicht im offenen Topf verdampfen lassen.","image_url":"/recetas/arroz-blanco-perfecto/paso-03.webp","image_alt":"Weißer Reis: Reis und Wasser kochen im Topf auf"},{"title":"Bei kleinster Hitze zugedeckt garen","content":"Sobald es kocht, dicht abdecken und auf die kleinste Stufe stellen. 15–18 Minuten garen, ohne zu öffnen oder umzurühren. Am Ende kurz prüfen: Es darf kein freies Wasser bleiben, die Körner sollen weich sein. Sind sie noch hart und der Topf trocken, 30 ml heißes Wasser zugeben, abdecken und weitere 3 Minuten garen. Bleibt Wasser übrig, abdecken und um 2 Minuten verlängern. Diese Anpassungen können die vorgeschlagene Zeit erhöhen.","image_url":"/recetas/arroz-blanco-perfecto/paso-04.webp","image_alt":"Weißer Reis: geschlossener Topf beim Garen auf kleinster Stufe"},{"title":"Abseits der Hitze ruhen lassen","content":"Hitze ausschalten und den Topf von der heißen Kochstelle nehmen. 10 Minuten zugedeckt stehen lassen, damit sich die Feuchtigkeit verteilt. Während dieser Ruhezeit weder umrühren noch den Deckel anheben; sie ist in den insgesamt 45 Minuten enthalten.","image_url":"/recetas/arroz-blanco-perfecto/paso-05.webp","image_alt":"Weißer Reis: zugedeckter Topf ruht abseits der Kochstelle"},{"title":"Körner auflockern und servieren","content":"Den Deckel so öffnen, dass das Gesicht vom Dampf entfernt bleibt. Den Reis mit einer Gabel behutsam anheben und auflockern, statt ihn zu drücken. Auf 4 Portionen verteilen und sofort servieren. Reste nicht im Topf abkühlen lassen: in flache Behälter umfüllen, rasch abkühlen und kühlen.","image_url":"/recetas/arroz-blanco-perfecto/paso-06.webp","image_alt":"Gekochter weißer Reis mit einzelnen Körnern, servierbereit"}],"notes":"Die Konsistenz hängt von Reis und Ausstattung ab: Dieses Verhältnis ist ein Vorschlag für weißen Langkornreis, keine allgemeine Garantie. Vollkornreis, Sushireis und vorgegarter Reis benötigen ein anderes Rezept. Das Öl kann entfallen; die berechneten Nährwerte enthalten die gesamten 10 g. Die Zutaten enthalten keine üblichen Allergene, dennoch Etiketten und Kreuzkontakt prüfen. Reste in flache Behälter füllen, möglichst innerhalb von 1 Stunde abkühlen, bei höchstens 4 °C kühlen und innerhalb von 24 Stunden essen. Nur einmal erhitzen, bis alles dampfend heiß ist und mindestens 74 °C im Kern erreicht sind, dann sofort essen. Geruch garantiert keine Sicherheit; lauwarmen Reis nicht im Topf stehen lassen.","nutrition":{"estimated":true,"serving_size":"1 von 4 Beilagenportionen","source":"USDA FoodData Central — SR Legacy (abril de 2018)","source_url":"https://fdc.nal.usda.gov/download-datasets/","method":"Drei geprüfte USDA-Datensätze: 240 g roher weißer Langkornreis, 10 g Rapsöl und 3 g Salz. Summe der rohen essbaren Mengen geteilt durch 4; Wasser liefert keine Energie. Öl und Salz werden vollständig berücksichtigt. Das Endgewicht hängt von der Wasseraufnahme ab und gilt nicht als bestätigt.","note":"Informationsschätzung, keine Analyse des fertigen Reises. Waschen, Sorte, Anreicherung, tatsächlich servierte Menge und Ölreste im Topf können die Werte verändern. Ausbeute und Zeiten müssen noch in der Küche geprüft werden.","inputs":[{"ingredient":"weißer Langkornreis, nicht vorgegart","edible_grams":240,"fdc_id":168877,"fdc_description":"Rice, white, long-grain, regular, raw, enriched","per_100g":{"calories":365,"protein_g":7.13,"carbs_g":79.95,"fat_g":0.66,"saturated_fat_g":0.18,"fiber_g":1.3,"sugar_g":0.12,"sodium_mg":5},"source_url":"https://fdc.nal.usda.gov/food-details/168877/nutrients"},{"ingredient":"Rapsöl","edible_grams":10,"fdc_id":172336,"fdc_description":"Oil, canola","per_100g":{"calories":884,"protein_g":0,"carbs_g":0,"fat_g":100,"saturated_fat_g":7.365,"fiber_g":0,"sugar_g":0,"sodium_mg":0},"source_url":"https://fdc.nal.usda.gov/food-details/172336/nutrients"},{"ingredient":"feines Salz","edible_grams":3,"fdc_id":173468,"fdc_description":"Salt, table","per_100g":{"calories":0,"protein_g":0,"carbs_g":0,"fat_g":0,"saturated_fat_g":0,"fiber_g":0,"sugar_g":0,"sodium_mg":38758},"source_url":"https://fdc.nal.usda.gov/food-details/173468/nutrients"}],"calories":241.1,"protein_g":4.3,"carbs_g":48,"fat_g":2.9,"saturated_fat_g":0.3,"fiber_g":0.8,"sugar_g":0.1,"sodium_mg":294},"image_url":"/recetas/arroz-blanco-perfecto/portada.webp","gallery":[{"url":"/recetas/arroz-blanco-perfecto/portada.webp","alt":"Locker gekochter weißer Langkornreis in einer Schüssel"}],"seo":{"title":"Lockerer weißer Reis: Quellmethode | Manual de Cocina","description":"Weißer Reis für 4 mit abgemessenem Wasser, geschlossenem Deckel und 10 Minuten Ruhezeit. Garpunkt anpassen und Reste sicher aufbewahren.","image_alt":"Locker gekochter weißer Langkornreis in einer Schüssel","image_variants":["/recetas/arroz-blanco-perfecto/portada-1x1.webp","/recetas/arroz-blanco-perfecto/portada-4x3.webp","/recetas/arroz-blanco-perfecto/portada-16x9.webp"],"faq":[{"q":"Wie viel Wasser braucht dieser weiße Reis?","a":"Der Vorschlag verwendet 480 ml Wasser für 240 g gewaschenen, gut abgetropften weißen Langkornreis. Gramm nicht mit Tassen verwechseln: Auch Sorte und Deckel beeinflussen das Verhältnis."},{"q":"Warum wird der Reis klebrig oder klumpt?","a":"Zu viel Oberflächenstärke, zu viel Wasser oder Umrühren beim Garen fördern das Verkleben. Waschen und abtropfen lassen, Wasser abmessen, zugedeckt ohne Umrühren garen und vor dem Auflockern mit der Gabel die 10 Minuten Ruhezeit einhalten."},{"q":"Kann ich den Reis aufbewahren und erneut erhitzen?","a":"Ja, wenn er rasch, möglichst innerhalb von 1 Stunde, abgekühlt und gekühlt innerhalb von 24 Stunden gegessen wird. Nur einmal erhitzen, bis er überall dampfend heiß ist. Nicht lauwarm im Topf stehen lassen."}]},"published":false,"editorial_status":"draft","content_html":"<p>Einfacher weißer Langkornreis, der mit einer abgemessenen Wassermenge gart und anschließend abseits der Hitze ruht. Diese Beilage soll zarte, einzelne Körner ergeben, ohne Brühe oder angebratene Zutaten. Die historische URL für perfekten weißen Reis bleibt erhalten.</p><p>Der Vorschlag ergibt 4 Beilagenportionen und veranschlagt 10 Minuten Vorbereitung, 25 Minuten Garzeit und 10 Minuten Ruhezeit: insgesamt 45 Minuten. Reissorte und Marke, Topfdurchmesser und Deckel können Wasserbedarf und Zeit verändern. Mengen, Zeiten und Ausbeute müssen noch in der Küche geprüft werden.</p>"},{"id":"133863ef-e7e6-5e62-9a87-d91624b459e1","recipe_group_id":"53237760-f2f8-4852-9c3c-ac101fa2f237","language":"en","slug":"perfect-white-rice","public_path":"/en/perfect-white-rice","source_url":null,"title":"Fluffy white rice by the absorption method","excerpt":"Long-grain white rice for 4, with measured ingredients, covered cooking and a 10-minute rest to separate the grains.","summary":"Simple long-grain white rice cooked with a measured amount of water and rested off the heat. This side dish aims for tender, separate grains without stock or a sautéed base, while preserving the historical perfect-white-rice URL.\n\nThe proposal makes 4 side portions and estimates 10 minutes of preparation, 25 minutes of cooking and 10 minutes of resting: 45 minutes in total. Rice variety and brand, pan diameter and lid seal can change the water and time required. Quantities, times and yield still need a kitchen test.","category":"Side dishes","category_slug":"guarniciones","difficulty":"Easy","course":"Side dish","cuisine":"International","prep_time_minutes":10,"cook_time_minutes":25,"total_time_minutes":45,"servings":4,"keywords":["white rice","fluffy white rice","perfect white rice","absorption rice","rice side dish"],"ingredients":[{"name":"long-grain white rice, not precooked","amount":"240","unit":"g","group":"Base"},{"name":"cooking water","amount":"480","unit":"ml, plus water for rinsing","group":"Base"},{"name":"canola oil","amount":"10","unit":"g","group":"Seasoning"},{"name":"fine salt","amount":"3","unit":"g","group":"Seasoning"}],"steps":[{"title":"Measure the rice and water","content":"Weigh 240 g of long-grain white rice and measure 480 ml of cooking water. Prepare 10 g of oil and 3 g of salt. Use a heavy-bottomed pan about 18–20 cm in diameter with a tight-fitting lid; a very wide pan or a lid that leaks steam changes absorption. This formula is not intended for brown or precooked rice.","image_url":"/recetas/arroz-blanco-perfecto/paso-01.webp","image_alt":"White rice: rice, water, oil and salt measured for four side portions"},{"title":"Rinse and drain the rice","content":"Put the rice in a bowl, cover with cold water and move it gently with a clean hand. Discard the cloudy water and repeat 2–3 times until it looks less milky; it need not become completely clear. Drain in a fine sieve for 5 minutes. Do not soak the rice for this recipe.","image_url":"/recetas/arroz-blanco-perfecto/paso-02.webp","image_alt":"White rice: rinsing the grains and draining in a fine sieve"},{"title":"Bring the water to the boil","content":"Put the drained rice, the measured 480 ml of water, 10 g of oil and 3 g of salt in the pan. Stir once to distribute and bring to the boil over medium-high heat for about 3–5 minutes. Watch for bubbles across the entire surface; do not let the water evaporate with the pan uncovered.","image_url":"/recetas/arroz-blanco-perfecto/paso-03.webp","image_alt":"White rice: rice and water reaching the boil in the pan"},{"title":"Cook covered over the lowest heat","content":"As soon as it boils, cover tightly and turn the heat to its lowest setting. Cook for 15–18 minutes without opening or stirring. At the end, check briefly: there should be no free water and the grains should be tender. If they are still hard and the pan is dry, add 30 ml of hot water, cover and cook for another 3 minutes. If water remains, cover and extend cooking by 2 minutes. These adjustments may increase the proposed time.","image_url":"/recetas/arroz-blanco-perfecto/paso-04.webp","image_alt":"White rice: covered pan cooking over the lowest heat"},{"title":"Rest off the heat","content":"Turn off the heat and move the pan away from the hot burner. Keep it covered for 10 minutes so moisture redistributes. Do not stir or lift the lid during this rest, which is included in the 45-minute total.","image_url":"/recetas/arroz-blanco-perfecto/paso-05.webp","image_alt":"White rice: pan removed from the heat and covered during resting"},{"title":"Fluff and serve","content":"Uncover with your face away from the steam. Separate the rice with a fork, lifting gently rather than pressing down. Divide into 4 portions and serve immediately. Do not leave leftovers cooling in the pan: transfer them to shallow containers to cool and refrigerate quickly.","image_url":"/recetas/arroz-blanco-perfecto/paso-06.webp","image_alt":"Cooked white rice with separate grains, ready to serve"}],"notes":"Texture depends on the rice and equipment: this ratio is a proposal for long-grain white rice, not a universal guarantee. Brown, sushi or precooked rice needs a different recipe. You may omit the oil; the calculated nutrition includes all 10 g. The ingredients contain no common allergens, but check labels and cross-contamination. Put leftovers in shallow containers, cool ideally within 1 hour, refrigerate at 4 °C or below and eat within 24 hours. Reheat only once until steaming throughout, at least 74 °C at the centre, and eat immediately. Smell does not guarantee safety; do not leave lukewarm rice in the pan.","nutrition":{"estimated":true,"serving_size":"1 of 4 side portions","source":"USDA FoodData Central — SR Legacy (abril de 2018)","source_url":"https://fdc.nal.usda.gov/download-datasets/","method":"Three verified USDA records: 240 g raw long-grain white rice, 10 g canola oil and 3 g salt. Sum of raw edible weights divided by 4; water adds no energy. All oil and salt are counted. Final weight depends on absorption and is not treated as confirmed.","note":"Informational estimate, not an analysis of the finished rice. Rinsing, variety, enrichment, actual serving size and oil remaining in the pan may change values. Yield and times await a kitchen test.","inputs":[{"ingredient":"long-grain white rice, not precooked","edible_grams":240,"fdc_id":168877,"fdc_description":"Rice, white, long-grain, regular, raw, enriched","per_100g":{"calories":365,"protein_g":7.13,"carbs_g":79.95,"fat_g":0.66,"saturated_fat_g":0.18,"fiber_g":1.3,"sugar_g":0.12,"sodium_mg":5},"source_url":"https://fdc.nal.usda.gov/food-details/168877/nutrients"},{"ingredient":"canola oil","edible_grams":10,"fdc_id":172336,"fdc_description":"Oil, canola","per_100g":{"calories":884,"protein_g":0,"carbs_g":0,"fat_g":100,"saturated_fat_g":7.365,"fiber_g":0,"sugar_g":0,"sodium_mg":0},"source_url":"https://fdc.nal.usda.gov/food-details/172336/nutrients"},{"ingredient":"fine salt","edible_grams":3,"fdc_id":173468,"fdc_description":"Salt, table","per_100g":{"calories":0,"protein_g":0,"carbs_g":0,"fat_g":0,"saturated_fat_g":0,"fiber_g":0,"sugar_g":0,"sodium_mg":38758},"source_url":"https://fdc.nal.usda.gov/food-details/173468/nutrients"}],"calories":241.1,"protein_g":4.3,"carbs_g":48,"fat_g":2.9,"saturated_fat_g":0.3,"fiber_g":0.8,"sugar_g":0.1,"sodium_mg":294},"image_url":"/recetas/arroz-blanco-perfecto/portada.webp","gallery":[{"url":"/recetas/arroz-blanco-perfecto/portada.webp","alt":"Cooked, fluffy long-grain white rice in a bowl"}],"seo":{"title":"Fluffy white rice: absorption method | Manual de Cocina","description":"Make white rice for 4 with measured water, covered cooking and a 10-minute rest. Learn how to adjust doneness and store leftovers.","image_alt":"Cooked, fluffy long-grain white rice in a bowl","image_variants":["/recetas/arroz-blanco-perfecto/portada-1x1.webp","/recetas/arroz-blanco-perfecto/portada-4x3.webp","/recetas/arroz-blanco-perfecto/portada-16x9.webp"],"faq":[{"q":"How much water does this white rice need?","a":"This proposal uses 480 ml of water for 240 g of rinsed, well-drained long-grain white rice. Do not confuse grams with cups: the ratio also depends on the variety and the pan's seal."},{"q":"Why does rice turn sticky or clump together?","a":"Excess surface starch, too much water or stirring during cooking encourages sticking. Rinse and drain, measure the water, cook covered without stirring and allow the 10-minute rest before fluffing with a fork."},{"q":"Can I store and reheat the rice?","a":"Yes, if you cool it quickly, ideally within 1 hour, and refrigerate it to eat within 24 hours. Reheat only once until steaming throughout. Do not leave it lukewarm in the pan."}]},"published":false,"editorial_status":"draft","content_html":"<p>Simple long-grain white rice cooked with a measured amount of water and rested off the heat. This side dish aims for tender, separate grains without stock or a sautéed base, while preserving the historical perfect-white-rice URL.</p><p>The proposal makes 4 side portions and estimates 10 minutes of preparation, 25 minutes of cooking and 10 minutes of resting: 45 minutes in total. Rice variety and brand, pan diameter and lid seal can change the water and time required. Quantities, times and yield still need a kitchen test.</p>"},{"id":"0b636d4e-076d-524a-8350-c78b4c45e420","recipe_group_id":"53237760-f2f8-4852-9c3c-ac101fa2f237","language":"fr","slug":"riz-blanc-parfait","public_path":"/fr/riz-blanc-parfait","source_url":null,"title":"Riz blanc aux grains séparés par absorption","excerpt":"Du riz blanc à grain long pour 4, avec des quantités mesurées, une cuisson couverte et 10 minutes de repos pour séparer les grains.","summary":"Un riz blanc à grain long simple, cuit avec une quantité d'eau mesurée puis laissé au repos hors du feu. Cet accompagnement vise des grains tendres et séparés, sans bouillon ni base revenue, tout en conservant l'URL historique du riz blanc parfait.\n\nLa proposition donne 4 portions d'accompagnement et prévoit 10 minutes de préparation, 25 de cuisson et 10 de repos : 45 minutes au total. La variété et la marque de riz, le diamètre de la casserole et l'étanchéité du couvercle peuvent modifier l'eau et le temps nécessaires. Les quantités, les temps et le rendement restent à vérifier en cuisine.","category":"Accompagnements","category_slug":"guarniciones","difficulty":"Facile","course":"Accompagnement","cuisine":"Internationale","prep_time_minutes":10,"cook_time_minutes":25,"total_time_minutes":45,"servings":4,"keywords":["riz blanc","riz aux grains séparés","riz blanc parfait","riz par absorption","accompagnement de riz"],"ingredients":[{"name":"riz blanc à grain long, non précuit","amount":"240","unit":"g","group":"Base"},{"name":"eau de cuisson","amount":"480","unit":"ml, plus de l'eau pour le rinçage","group":"Base"},{"name":"huile de colza","amount":"10","unit":"g","group":"Assaisonnement"},{"name":"sel fin","amount":"3","unit":"g","group":"Assaisonnement"}],"steps":[{"title":"Mesurer le riz et l'eau","content":"Peser 240 g de riz blanc à grain long et mesurer 480 ml d'eau de cuisson. Préparer 10 g d'huile et 3 g de sel. Utiliser une casserole à fond épais d'environ 18–20 cm de diamètre avec un couvercle bien ajusté ; une casserole très large ou un couvercle laissant échapper la vapeur modifie l'absorption. Cette formule ne convient pas au riz complet ni précuit.","image_url":"/recetas/arroz-blanco-perfecto/paso-01.webp","image_alt":"Riz blanc : riz, eau, huile et sel mesurés pour quatre accompagnements"},{"title":"Rincer et égoutter le riz","content":"Mettre le riz dans un bol, couvrir d'eau froide et le remuer doucement avec une main propre. Jeter l'eau trouble et répéter 2–3 fois jusqu'à ce qu'elle soit moins laiteuse ; elle n'a pas besoin d'être transparente. Égoutter dans une passoire fine pendant 5 minutes. Ne pas faire tremper le riz pour cette proposition.","image_url":"/recetas/arroz-blanco-perfecto/paso-02.webp","image_alt":"Riz blanc : rinçage des grains et égouttage dans une passoire fine"},{"title":"Porter l'eau à ébullition","content":"Mettre dans la casserole le riz égoutté, les 480 ml d'eau mesurés, les 10 g d'huile et les 3 g de sel. Remuer une seule fois pour répartir, puis porter à ébullition à feu moyen-vif pendant environ 3–5 minutes. Surveiller jusqu'à ce que des bulles couvrent toute la surface ; ne pas laisser l'eau s'évaporer à découvert.","image_url":"/recetas/arroz-blanco-perfecto/paso-03.webp","image_alt":"Riz blanc : l'eau et le riz atteignent l'ébullition dans la casserole"},{"title":"Cuire couvert à feu minimal","content":"Dès l'ébullition, bien couvrir et baisser au minimum. Cuire 15–18 minutes sans ouvrir ni remuer. À la fin, vérifier brièvement : il ne doit plus rester d'eau libre et le grain doit être tendre. S'il est encore dur et la casserole sèche, ajouter 30 ml d'eau chaude, couvrir et cuire 3 minutes de plus. S'il reste de l'eau, couvrir et prolonger de 2 minutes. Ces corrections peuvent augmenter le temps proposé.","image_url":"/recetas/arroz-blanco-perfecto/paso-04.webp","image_alt":"Riz blanc : casserole couverte pendant la cuisson à feu minimal"},{"title":"Laisser reposer hors du feu","content":"Éteindre et retirer la casserole du brûleur chaud. La laisser couverte 10 minutes pour répartir l'humidité. Ne pas remuer ni soulever le couvercle pendant ce repos, compris dans les 45 minutes totales.","image_url":"/recetas/arroz-blanco-perfecto/paso-05.webp","image_alt":"Riz blanc : casserole retirée du feu et couverte pendant le repos"},{"title":"Séparer les grains et servir","content":"Découvrir en éloignant le visage de la vapeur. Séparer le riz avec une fourchette en le soulevant doucement plutôt qu'en l'écrasant. Répartir en 4 portions et servir immédiatement. Ne pas laisser refroidir les restes dans la casserole : les transférer dans des récipients peu profonds pour les refroidir et les réfrigérer rapidement.","image_url":"/recetas/arroz-blanco-perfecto/paso-06.webp","image_alt":"Riz blanc cuit aux grains séparés, prêt à servir"}],"notes":"La texture dépend du riz et du matériel : cette proportion est une proposition pour le riz blanc à grain long, pas une garantie universelle. Le riz complet, le riz à sushi et le riz précuit nécessitent une autre fiche. L'huile peut être omise ; les valeurs nutritionnelles incluent les 10 g entiers. Les ingrédients ne contiennent pas d'allergènes courants, mais vérifier les étiquettes et les contaminations croisées. Mettre les restes dans des récipients peu profonds, refroidir idéalement dans un délai de 1 heure, réfrigérer à 4 °C ou moins et consommer dans les 24 heures. Réchauffer une seule fois jusqu'à ce que tout soit fumant, au moins 74 °C au centre, puis consommer immédiatement. L'odeur ne garantit pas la sécurité ; ne pas laisser du riz tiède dans la casserole.","nutrition":{"estimated":true,"serving_size":"1 des 4 portions d'accompagnement","source":"USDA FoodData Central — SR Legacy (abril de 2018)","source_url":"https://fdc.nal.usda.gov/download-datasets/","method":"Trois fiches USDA vérifiées : 240 g de riz blanc long cru, 10 g d'huile de colza et 3 g de sel. Somme des poids crus comestibles divisée par 4 ; l'eau n'apporte pas d'énergie. Toute l'huile et tout le sel sont comptés. Le poids final dépend de l'absorption et n'est pas considéré comme confirmé.","note":"Estimation informative, pas une analyse du riz terminé. Rinçage, variété, enrichissement, portion réellement servie et huile restant dans la casserole peuvent modifier les valeurs. Rendement et temps à vérifier en cuisine.","inputs":[{"ingredient":"riz blanc à grain long, non précuit","edible_grams":240,"fdc_id":168877,"fdc_description":"Rice, white, long-grain, regular, raw, enriched","per_100g":{"calories":365,"protein_g":7.13,"carbs_g":79.95,"fat_g":0.66,"saturated_fat_g":0.18,"fiber_g":1.3,"sugar_g":0.12,"sodium_mg":5},"source_url":"https://fdc.nal.usda.gov/food-details/168877/nutrients"},{"ingredient":"huile de colza","edible_grams":10,"fdc_id":172336,"fdc_description":"Oil, canola","per_100g":{"calories":884,"protein_g":0,"carbs_g":0,"fat_g":100,"saturated_fat_g":7.365,"fiber_g":0,"sugar_g":0,"sodium_mg":0},"source_url":"https://fdc.nal.usda.gov/food-details/172336/nutrients"},{"ingredient":"sel fin","edible_grams":3,"fdc_id":173468,"fdc_description":"Salt, table","per_100g":{"calories":0,"protein_g":0,"carbs_g":0,"fat_g":0,"saturated_fat_g":0,"fiber_g":0,"sugar_g":0,"sodium_mg":38758},"source_url":"https://fdc.nal.usda.gov/food-details/173468/nutrients"}],"calories":241.1,"protein_g":4.3,"carbs_g":48,"fat_g":2.9,"saturated_fat_g":0.3,"fiber_g":0.8,"sugar_g":0.1,"sodium_mg":294},"image_url":"/recetas/arroz-blanco-perfecto/portada.webp","gallery":[{"url":"/recetas/arroz-blanco-perfecto/portada.webp","alt":"Riz blanc à grain long cuit et séparé dans un bol"}],"seo":{"title":"Riz blanc aux grains séparés : absorption | Manual de Cocina","description":"Du riz blanc pour 4 avec de l'eau mesurée, une cuisson couverte et 10 minutes de repos. Ajustez la cuisson et conservez les restes.","image_alt":"Riz blanc à grain long cuit et séparé dans un bol","image_variants":["/recetas/arroz-blanco-perfecto/portada-1x1.webp","/recetas/arroz-blanco-perfecto/portada-4x3.webp","/recetas/arroz-blanco-perfecto/portada-16x9.webp"],"faq":[{"q":"Quelle quantité d'eau utiliser pour ce riz blanc ?","a":"Cette proposition emploie 480 ml d'eau pour 240 g de riz blanc à grain long rincé et bien égoutté. Ne pas confondre grammes et tasses : la proportion dépend aussi de la variété et du couvercle."},{"q":"Pourquoi le riz devient-il collant ou compact ?","a":"L'excès d'amidon de surface, trop d'eau ou le fait de remuer pendant la cuisson favorisent l'adhérence. Rincer et égoutter, mesurer l'eau, cuire couvert sans remuer et respecter les 10 minutes de repos avant de séparer les grains à la fourchette."},{"q":"Peut-on conserver et réchauffer le riz ?","a":"Oui, s'il est refroidi rapidement, idéalement dans un délai de 1 heure, puis réfrigéré pour être consommé dans les 24 heures. Réchauffer une seule fois jusqu'à ce qu'il soit fumant partout. Ne pas le laisser tiède dans la casserole."}]},"published":false,"editorial_status":"draft","content_html":"<p>Un riz blanc à grain long simple, cuit avec une quantité d'eau mesurée puis laissé au repos hors du feu. Cet accompagnement vise des grains tendres et séparés, sans bouillon ni base revenue, tout en conservant l'URL historique du riz blanc parfait.</p><p>La proposition donne 4 portions d'accompagnement et prévoit 10 minutes de préparation, 25 de cuisson et 10 de repos : 45 minutes au total. La variété et la marque de riz, le diamètre de la casserole et l'étanchéité du couvercle peuvent modifier l'eau et le temps nécessaires. Les quantités, les temps et le rendement restent à vérifier en cuisine.</p>"},{"id":"7c75fa0e-e389-5f8f-8a96-9024c4582e3c","recipe_group_id":"53237760-f2f8-4852-9c3c-ac101fa2f237","language":"it","slug":"riso-bianco-perfetto","public_path":"/it/riso-bianco-perfetto","source_url":null,"title":"Riso bianco sgranato con cottura per assorbimento","excerpt":"Riso bianco a chicco lungo per 4, con dosi misurate, cottura coperta e 10 minuti di riposo per separare i chicchi.","summary":"Un semplice riso bianco a chicco lungo, cotto con una quantità misurata d'acqua e lasciato riposare fuori dal fuoco. Questo contorno punta a chicchi teneri e separati, senza brodo né soffritto, conservando l'URL storica del riso bianco perfetto.\n\nLa proposta rende 4 porzioni di contorno e stima 10 minuti di preparazione, 25 di cottura e 10 di riposo: 45 minuti in totale. Varietà e marca del riso, diametro della pentola e tenuta del coperchio possono modificare acqua e tempi. Dosi, tempi e resa devono ancora essere verificati in cucina.","category":"Contorni","category_slug":"guarniciones","difficulty":"Facile","course":"Contorno","cuisine":"Internazionale","prep_time_minutes":10,"cook_time_minutes":25,"total_time_minutes":45,"servings":4,"keywords":["riso bianco","riso sgranato","riso bianco perfetto","cottura per assorbimento","contorno di riso"],"ingredients":[{"name":"riso bianco a chicco lungo, non precotto","amount":"240","unit":"g","group":"Base"},{"name":"acqua per la cottura","amount":"480","unit":"ml, più acqua per il lavaggio","group":"Base"},{"name":"olio di colza","amount":"10","unit":"g","group":"Condimento"},{"name":"sale fino","amount":"3","unit":"g","group":"Condimento"}],"steps":[{"title":"Misura riso e acqua","content":"Pesa 240 g di riso bianco a chicco lungo e misura 480 ml d'acqua per la cottura. Prepara 10 g d'olio e 3 g di sale. Usa una pentola dal fondo spesso di circa 18–20 cm di diametro con coperchio ben aderente; una pentola molto larga o un coperchio che perde vapore modifica l'assorbimento. La formula non è pensata per riso integrale o precotto.","image_url":"/recetas/arroz-blanco-perfecto/paso-01.webp","image_alt":"Riso bianco: riso, acqua, olio e sale misurati per quattro contorni"},{"title":"Lava e scola il riso","content":"Metti il riso in una ciotola, coprilo con acqua fredda e muovilo delicatamente con la mano pulita. Elimina l'acqua torbida e ripeti 2–3 volte, finché è meno lattiginosa; non deve essere completamente limpida. Scola in un colino fine per 5 minuti. Non ammollare il riso per questa proposta.","image_url":"/recetas/arroz-blanco-perfecto/paso-02.webp","image_alt":"Riso bianco: lavaggio dei chicchi e scolatura nel colino fine"},{"title":"Porta l'acqua a ebollizione","content":"Metti nella pentola il riso scolato, i 480 ml d'acqua misurati, i 10 g d'olio e i 3 g di sale. Mescola una sola volta per distribuire e porta a ebollizione a fuoco medio-alto per circa 3–5 minuti. Controlla che ci siano bolle su tutta la superficie; non lasciare evaporare l'acqua a pentola scoperta.","image_url":"/recetas/arroz-blanco-perfecto/paso-03.webp","image_alt":"Riso bianco: acqua e riso raggiungono l'ebollizione nella pentola"},{"title":"Cuoci coperto al minimo","content":"Appena bolle, copri bene e abbassa al minimo. Cuoci 15–18 minuti senza aprire né mescolare. Alla fine controlla rapidamente: non deve restare acqua libera e il chicco deve essere tenero. Se è ancora duro e la pentola è asciutta, aggiungi 30 ml d'acqua calda, copri e cuoci per altri 3 minuti. Se resta acqua, copri e prolunga di 2 minuti. Queste correzioni possono aumentare il tempo proposto.","image_url":"/recetas/arroz-blanco-perfecto/paso-04.webp","image_alt":"Riso bianco: pentola coperta durante la cottura al minimo"},{"title":"Lascia riposare fuori dal fuoco","content":"Spegni e allontana la pentola dal fornello caldo. Lasciala coperta per 10 minuti per ridistribuire l'umidità. Non mescolare né sollevare il coperchio durante il riposo, compreso nei 45 minuti totali.","image_url":"/recetas/arroz-blanco-perfecto/paso-05.webp","image_alt":"Riso bianco: pentola tolta dal fuoco e coperta durante il riposo"},{"title":"Sgrana e servi","content":"Scopri tenendo il viso lontano dal vapore. Separa il riso con una forchetta, sollevandolo delicatamente anziché schiacciarlo. Dividi in 4 porzioni e servi subito. Non lasciare raffreddare gli avanzi nella pentola: trasferiscili in contenitori bassi per raffreddarli e refrigerarli rapidamente.","image_url":"/recetas/arroz-blanco-perfecto/paso-06.webp","image_alt":"Riso bianco cotto con chicchi separati, pronto da servire"}],"notes":"La consistenza dipende dal riso e dall'attrezzatura: questa proporzione è una proposta per riso bianco a chicco lungo, non una garanzia universale. Riso integrale, da sushi o precotto richiedono un'altra scheda. Puoi omettere l'olio; i valori calcolati comprendono tutti i 10 g. Gli ingredienti non contengono allergeni comuni, ma controlla etichette e contaminazione crociata. Conserva gli avanzi in contenitori bassi, raffredda idealmente entro 1 ora, refrigera a 4 °C o meno e consuma entro 24 ore. Riscalda una sola volta finché tutto fuma, almeno 74 °C al centro, e consuma subito. L'odore non garantisce la sicurezza; non lasciare riso tiepido nella pentola.","nutrition":{"estimated":true,"serving_size":"1 delle 4 porzioni di contorno","source":"USDA FoodData Central — SR Legacy (abril de 2018)","source_url":"https://fdc.nal.usda.gov/download-datasets/","method":"Tre schede USDA verificate: 240 g di riso bianco lungo crudo, 10 g d'olio di colza e 3 g di sale. Somma dei pesi crudi edibili divisa per 4; l'acqua non apporta energia. Si contano tutto l'olio e tutto il sale. Il peso finale dipende dall'assorbimento e non è un dato confermato.","note":"Stima informativa, non analisi del riso finito. Lavaggio, varietà, arricchimento, porzione effettiva e olio rimasto nella pentola possono modificare i valori. Resa e tempi in attesa di verifica in cucina.","inputs":[{"ingredient":"riso bianco a chicco lungo, non precotto","edible_grams":240,"fdc_id":168877,"fdc_description":"Rice, white, long-grain, regular, raw, enriched","per_100g":{"calories":365,"protein_g":7.13,"carbs_g":79.95,"fat_g":0.66,"saturated_fat_g":0.18,"fiber_g":1.3,"sugar_g":0.12,"sodium_mg":5},"source_url":"https://fdc.nal.usda.gov/food-details/168877/nutrients"},{"ingredient":"olio di colza","edible_grams":10,"fdc_id":172336,"fdc_description":"Oil, canola","per_100g":{"calories":884,"protein_g":0,"carbs_g":0,"fat_g":100,"saturated_fat_g":7.365,"fiber_g":0,"sugar_g":0,"sodium_mg":0},"source_url":"https://fdc.nal.usda.gov/food-details/172336/nutrients"},{"ingredient":"sale fino","edible_grams":3,"fdc_id":173468,"fdc_description":"Salt, table","per_100g":{"calories":0,"protein_g":0,"carbs_g":0,"fat_g":0,"saturated_fat_g":0,"fiber_g":0,"sugar_g":0,"sodium_mg":38758},"source_url":"https://fdc.nal.usda.gov/food-details/173468/nutrients"}],"calories":241.1,"protein_g":4.3,"carbs_g":48,"fat_g":2.9,"saturated_fat_g":0.3,"fiber_g":0.8,"sugar_g":0.1,"sodium_mg":294},"image_url":"/recetas/arroz-blanco-perfecto/portada.webp","gallery":[{"url":"/recetas/arroz-blanco-perfecto/portada.webp","alt":"Riso bianco a chicco lungo cotto e sgranato in una ciotola"}],"seo":{"title":"Riso bianco sgranato: cottura per assorbimento | Manual de Cocina","description":"Riso bianco per 4 con acqua misurata, cottura coperta e 10 minuti di riposo. Come correggere la cottura e conservare gli avanzi.","image_alt":"Riso bianco a chicco lungo cotto e sgranato in una ciotola","image_variants":["/recetas/arroz-blanco-perfecto/portada-1x1.webp","/recetas/arroz-blanco-perfecto/portada-4x3.webp","/recetas/arroz-blanco-perfecto/portada-16x9.webp"],"faq":[{"q":"Quanta acqua serve per questo riso bianco?","a":"La proposta usa 480 ml d'acqua per 240 g di riso bianco a chicco lungo lavato e ben scolato. Non confondere grammi e tazze: la proporzione dipende anche dalla varietà e dalla tenuta del coperchio."},{"q":"Perché il riso risulta colloso o compatto?","a":"Troppo amido superficiale, troppa acqua o mescolare durante la cottura favoriscono l'adesione. Lava e scola, misura l'acqua, cuoci coperto senza mescolare e rispetta i 10 minuti di riposo prima di sgranare con la forchetta."},{"q":"Posso conservare e riscaldare il riso?","a":"Sì, se lo raffreddi rapidamente, idealmente entro 1 ora, e lo refrigeri per consumarlo entro 24 ore. Riscalda una sola volta finché fuma in ogni punto. Non lasciarlo tiepido nella pentola."}]},"published":false,"editorial_status":"draft","content_html":"<p>Un semplice riso bianco a chicco lungo, cotto con una quantità misurata d'acqua e lasciato riposare fuori dal fuoco. Questo contorno punta a chicchi teneri e separati, senza brodo né soffritto, conservando l'URL storica del riso bianco perfetto.</p><p>La proposta rende 4 porzioni di contorno e stima 10 minuti di preparazione, 25 di cottura e 10 di riposo: 45 minuti in totale. Varietà e marca del riso, diametro della pentola e tenuta del coperchio possono modificare acqua e tempi. Dosi, tempi e resa devono ancora essere verificati in cucina.</p>"},{"id":"c1dda7dc-d70c-5163-b9a7-9009c8691a77","recipe_group_id":"53237760-f2f8-4852-9c3c-ac101fa2f237","language":"ja","slug":"完璧な白米","public_path":"/ja/完璧な白米","source_url":null,"title":"吸水法で炊く、粒がほぐれる白米","excerpt":"長粒種の白米を4人分。材料を量り、ふたをして炊き、10分蒸らして粒をほぐします。","summary":"量った水で長粒種の白米を炊き、火から下ろして蒸らすシンプルな付け合わせです。だしや炒めた香味野菜を使わず、柔らかく粒が分かれた仕上がりを目指します。「完璧な白米」の既存URLを維持します。\n\n付け合わせ4人分の提案です。準備10分、加熱25分、蒸らし10分、合計45分を見込んでいます。米の品種や銘柄、鍋の直径、ふたの密閉具合で必要な水と時間は変わります。分量、時間、出来上がり量は調理試験による確認前の目安です。","category":"付け合わせ","category_slug":"guarniciones","difficulty":"簡単","course":"付け合わせ","cuisine":"各国料理","prep_time_minutes":10,"cook_time_minutes":25,"total_time_minutes":45,"servings":4,"keywords":["白米","長粒米","粒がほぐれるご飯","吸水法","ご飯の付け合わせ"],"ingredients":[{"name":"長粒種の白米（加熱済みではないもの）","amount":"240","unit":"g","group":"基本材料"},{"name":"炊くための水","amount":"480","unit":"ml、洗米用の水は別途","group":"基本材料"},{"name":"キャノーラ油","amount":"10","unit":"g","group":"調味料"},{"name":"細粒の塩","amount":"3","unit":"g","group":"調味料"}],"steps":[{"title":"米と水を量る","content":"長粒種の白米240 gと、炊くための水480 mlを量ります。油10 g、塩3 gを用意します。直径約18–20 cmの厚底鍋と、しっかり閉まるふたを使います。広すぎる鍋や蒸気が漏れるふたでは吸水が変わります。この配合は玄米や加熱済みの米には適していません。","image_url":"/recetas/arroz-blanco-perfecto/paso-01.webp","image_alt":"白米：付け合わせ4人分の米、水、油、塩を量った状態"},{"title":"米を洗って水を切る","content":"米をボウルに入れ、冷水を注ぎ、清潔な手で優しく動かします。濁った水を捨て、白い濁りが薄くなるまで2–3回繰り返します。完全に透明になる必要はありません。目の細かいざるで5分水を切ります。この提案では米を浸水させません。","image_url":"/recetas/arroz-blanco-perfecto/paso-02.webp","image_alt":"白米：米を洗い、目の細かいざるで水を切る"},{"title":"沸騰させる","content":"水を切った米、量った水480 ml、油10 g、塩3 gを鍋に入れます。全体をなじませるために1回だけ混ぜ、中強火で約3–5分加熱して沸騰させます。表面全体に泡が出るまで見守り、ふたを開けたまま水を蒸発させ続けないでください。","image_url":"/recetas/arroz-blanco-perfecto/paso-03.webp","image_alt":"白米：鍋の中で米と水が沸騰する"},{"title":"ふたをして最弱火で炊く","content":"沸騰したらふたをしっかり閉め、最弱火にします。ふたを開けたり混ぜたりせず15–18分炊きます。最後に短時間確認し、余分な水がなく米が柔らかければよい状態です。米が硬く鍋が乾いている場合は熱湯30 mlを加え、ふたをしてさらに3分炊きます。水が残る場合はふたをして2分延長します。こうした調整で予定時間が延びることがあります。","image_url":"/recetas/arroz-blanco-perfecto/paso-04.webp","image_alt":"白米：最弱火で加熱するふた付き鍋"},{"title":"火から下ろして蒸らす","content":"火を止め、熱いコンロから鍋を移します。ふたをしたまま10分置き、水分を均等になじませます。蒸らし中は混ぜたりふたを開けたりしません。この時間は合計45分に含まれます。","image_url":"/recetas/arroz-blanco-perfecto/paso-05.webp","image_alt":"白米：火から下ろした鍋をふた付きで蒸らす"},{"title":"粒をほぐして盛り付ける","content":"蒸気に顔を近づけずにふたを開けます。フォークで米を優しく持ち上げてほぐし、押しつぶさないようにします。4人分に分けてすぐに提供します。残りを鍋の中で冷まさず、浅い容器に移して速やかに冷却し、冷蔵してください。","image_url":"/recetas/arroz-blanco-perfecto/paso-06.webp","image_alt":"炊き上がった白米の粒をほぐした盛り付け"}],"notes":"食感は米と道具によって変わります。この水量は長粒種の白米向けの提案で、すべての米に通用する保証ではありません。玄米、すし用の米、加熱済みの米には別のレシピが必要です。油は省略できますが、栄養計算には10 gすべてが含まれています。材料に一般的なアレルゲンは含まれませんが、表示と交差接触を確認してください。残りは浅い容器に移し、できれば1時間以内に冷却し、4 °C以下で冷蔵して24時間以内に食べてください。再加熱は1回だけとし、全体から湯気が出て中心が少なくとも74 °Cになるまで加熱し、すぐに食べます。においは安全性の保証になりません。ぬるいご飯を鍋に放置しないでください。","nutrition":{"estimated":true,"serving_size":"付け合わせ4人分のうち1人分","source":"USDA FoodData Central — SR Legacy (abril de 2018)","source_url":"https://fdc.nal.usda.gov/download-datasets/","method":"確認済みのUSDAデータ3件を使用：生の長粒種白米240 g、キャノーラ油10 g、塩3 g。生の可食部重量の栄養量を合計し4で割ります。水はエネルギーを加えません。油と塩は全量を計上します。完成重量は吸水量で変わるため、確認済みの数値として使いません。","note":"参考の推定値であり、炊き上がった米の分析ではありません。洗米、品種、栄養強化、実際の取り分け量、鍋に残る油によって値は変わります。出来上がり量と時間は調理試験による確認前です。","inputs":[{"ingredient":"長粒種の白米（加熱済みではないもの）","edible_grams":240,"fdc_id":168877,"fdc_description":"Rice, white, long-grain, regular, raw, enriched","per_100g":{"calories":365,"protein_g":7.13,"carbs_g":79.95,"fat_g":0.66,"saturated_fat_g":0.18,"fiber_g":1.3,"sugar_g":0.12,"sodium_mg":5},"source_url":"https://fdc.nal.usda.gov/food-details/168877/nutrients"},{"ingredient":"キャノーラ油","edible_grams":10,"fdc_id":172336,"fdc_description":"Oil, canola","per_100g":{"calories":884,"protein_g":0,"carbs_g":0,"fat_g":100,"saturated_fat_g":7.365,"fiber_g":0,"sugar_g":0,"sodium_mg":0},"source_url":"https://fdc.nal.usda.gov/food-details/172336/nutrients"},{"ingredient":"細粒の塩","edible_grams":3,"fdc_id":173468,"fdc_description":"Salt, table","per_100g":{"calories":0,"protein_g":0,"carbs_g":0,"fat_g":0,"saturated_fat_g":0,"fiber_g":0,"sugar_g":0,"sodium_mg":38758},"source_url":"https://fdc.nal.usda.gov/food-details/173468/nutrients"}],"calories":241.1,"protein_g":4.3,"carbs_g":48,"fat_g":2.9,"saturated_fat_g":0.3,"fiber_g":0.8,"sugar_g":0.1,"sodium_mg":294},"image_url":"/recetas/arroz-blanco-perfecto/portada.webp","gallery":[{"url":"/recetas/arroz-blanco-perfecto/portada.webp","alt":"ボウルに盛った、柔らかく粒がほぐれる長粒種の白米"}],"seo":{"title":"粒がほぐれる白米の炊き方：吸水法 | Manual de Cocina","description":"水を量り、ふたをして炊き、10分蒸らす白米4人分。炊き加減の調整と残りの保存方法も解説します。","image_alt":"ボウルに盛った、柔らかく粒がほぐれる長粒種の白米","image_variants":["/recetas/arroz-blanco-perfecto/portada-1x1.webp","/recetas/arroz-blanco-perfecto/portada-4x3.webp","/recetas/arroz-blanco-perfecto/portada-16x9.webp"],"faq":[{"q":"この白米には水をどれだけ使いますか？","a":"この提案では、洗ってよく水を切った長粒種の白米240 gに水480 mlを使います。グラムとカップを混同しないでください。割合は米の品種やふたの密閉具合にも左右されます。"},{"q":"ご飯が粘ったり固まったりするのはなぜですか？","a":"表面のでんぷん、水の入れすぎ、炊いている途中のかき混ぜで粒が付きやすくなります。洗って水を切り、水を量り、混ぜずにふたをして炊き、10分蒸らしてからフォークでほぐしてください。"},{"q":"保存して温め直せますか？","a":"はい。できれば1時間以内に速やかに冷却し、冷蔵して24時間以内に食べます。再加熱は1回だけとし、全体から湯気が出るまで温めてください。ぬるい状態で鍋に放置しないでください。"}]},"published":false,"editorial_status":"draft","content_html":"<p>量った水で長粒種の白米を炊き、火から下ろして蒸らすシンプルな付け合わせです。だしや炒めた香味野菜を使わず、柔らかく粒が分かれた仕上がりを目指します。「完璧な白米」の既存URLを維持します。</p><p>付け合わせ4人分の提案です。準備10分、加熱25分、蒸らし10分、合計45分を見込んでいます。米の品種や銘柄、鍋の直径、ふたの密閉具合で必要な水と時間は変わります。分量、時間、出来上がり量は調理試験による確認前の目安です。</p>"},{"id":"3454ab24-d2a0-558e-af2e-ef0c28cec22c","recipe_group_id":"53237760-f2f8-4852-9c3c-ac101fa2f237","language":"pt","slug":"arroz-branco-soltinho","public_path":"/pt/arroz-branco-soltinho","source_url":null,"title":"Arroz branco soltinho pelo método de absorção","excerpt":"Arroz branco de grão longo para 4, com quantidades medidas, cozimento tampado e 10 minutos de descanso para soltar os grãos.","summary":"Um arroz branco simples, de grão longo, cozido com uma quantidade medida de água e finalizado com descanso fora do fogo. Este acompanhamento busca grãos macios e separados, sem caldo nem refogado, e mantém a URL histórica de arroz branco perfeito.\n\nA proposta rende 4 porções de acompanhamento e estima 10 minutos de preparo, 25 de cozimento e 10 de descanso: 45 minutos no total. Variedade e marca do arroz, diâmetro da panela e vedação da tampa podem mudar a água e o tempo necessários. Quantidades, tempos e rendimento ainda precisam de teste na cozinha.","category":"Acompanhamentos","category_slug":"guarniciones","difficulty":"Fácil","course":"Acompanhamento","cuisine":"Internacional","prep_time_minutes":10,"cook_time_minutes":25,"total_time_minutes":45,"servings":4,"keywords":["arroz branco","arroz soltinho","arroz branco perfeito","arroz por absorção","acompanhamento de arroz"],"ingredients":[{"name":"arroz branco de grão longo, não pré-cozido","amount":"240","unit":"g","group":"Base"},{"name":"água para cozinhar","amount":"480","unit":"ml, mais água para lavar","group":"Base"},{"name":"óleo de canola","amount":"10","unit":"g","group":"Tempero"},{"name":"sal fino","amount":"3","unit":"g","group":"Tempero"}],"steps":[{"title":"Meça o arroz e a água","content":"Pese 240 g de arroz branco de grão longo e meça 480 ml de água para cozinhar. Separe 10 g de óleo e 3 g de sal. Use uma panela de fundo grosso com cerca de 18–20 cm de diâmetro e tampa bem ajustada; uma panela muito larga ou uma tampa que perde vapor muda a absorção. Esta fórmula não foi pensada para arroz integral nem pré-cozido.","image_url":"/recetas/arroz-blanco-perfecto/paso-01.webp","image_alt":"Arroz branco: arroz, água, óleo e sal medidos para quatro acompanhamentos"},{"title":"Lave e escorra o arroz","content":"Coloque o arroz em uma tigela, cubra com água fria e movimente delicadamente com a mão limpa. Descarte a água turva e repita 2–3 vezes, até ficar menos leitosa; não precisa ficar transparente. Escorra em peneira fina por 5 minutos. Não deixe o arroz de molho nesta proposta.","image_url":"/recetas/arroz-blanco-perfecto/paso-02.webp","image_alt":"Arroz branco: lavagem dos grãos e escorrimento em peneira fina"},{"title":"Leve a água à fervura","content":"Coloque na panela o arroz escorrido, os 480 ml de água medidos, os 10 g de óleo e os 3 g de sal. Mexa uma só vez para distribuir e leve à fervura em fogo médio-alto por cerca de 3–5 minutos. Observe até haver bolhas em toda a superfície; não deixe a água evaporar com a panela destampada.","image_url":"/recetas/arroz-blanco-perfecto/paso-03.webp","image_alt":"Arroz branco: água e arroz chegando à fervura na panela"},{"title":"Cozinhe tampado em fogo mínimo","content":"Assim que ferver, tampe bem e reduza ao mínimo. Cozinhe por 15–18 minutos sem abrir nem mexer. Ao final, confira rapidamente: não deve sobrar água livre e o grão deve estar macio. Se continuar duro e a panela estiver seca, adicione 30 ml de água quente, tampe e cozinhe por mais 3 minutos. Se sobrar água, tampe e prolongue por 2 minutos. Essas correções podem aumentar o tempo proposto.","image_url":"/recetas/arroz-blanco-perfecto/paso-04.webp","image_alt":"Arroz branco: panela tampada durante o cozimento em fogo mínimo"},{"title":"Deixe descansar fora do fogo","content":"Desligue e retire a panela da boca quente. Deixe tampada por 10 minutos para redistribuir a umidade. Não mexa nem levante a tampa durante esse descanso, incluído nos 45 minutos totais.","image_url":"/recetas/arroz-blanco-perfecto/paso-05.webp","image_alt":"Arroz branco: panela retirada do fogo e tampada durante o descanso"},{"title":"Solte os grãos e sirva","content":"Destampe mantendo o rosto longe do vapor. Solte o arroz com um garfo, levantando delicadamente em vez de amassar. Divida em 4 porções e sirva imediatamente. Não deixe as sobras esfriando dentro da panela: transfira para recipientes rasos para resfriar e refrigerar rapidamente.","image_url":"/recetas/arroz-blanco-perfecto/paso-06.webp","image_alt":"Arroz branco cozido com grãos separados, pronto para servir"}],"notes":"A textura depende do arroz e do equipamento: esta proporção é uma proposta para grão longo branco, não uma garantia universal. Arroz integral, para sushi ou pré-cozido exige outra ficha. Você pode omitir o óleo; a nutrição calculada inclui os 10 g completos. Os ingredientes não contêm alérgenos comuns, mas confira rótulos e contaminação cruzada. Guarde as sobras em recipientes rasos, resfrie idealmente em até 1 hora, refrigere a 4 °C ou menos e consuma em até 24 horas. Reaqueça uma só vez até tudo ficar fumegante, pelo menos 74 °C no centro, e consuma imediatamente. O cheiro não garante segurança; não deixe arroz morno na panela.","nutrition":{"estimated":true,"serving_size":"1 de 4 porções de acompanhamento","source":"USDA FoodData Central — SR Legacy (abril de 2018)","source_url":"https://fdc.nal.usda.gov/download-datasets/","method":"Três fichas USDA verificadas: 240 g de arroz branco longo cru, 10 g de óleo de canola e 3 g de sal. Soma dos pesos comestíveis crus dividida por 4; a água não fornece energia. Todo o óleo e todo o sal são contados. O peso final depende da absorção e não é usado como dado confirmado.","note":"Estimativa informativa, não análise do arroz pronto. Lavagem, variedade, enriquecimento, porção realmente servida e óleo que fique na panela podem mudar os valores. Rendimento e tempos aguardam teste na cozinha.","inputs":[{"ingredient":"arroz branco de grão longo, não pré-cozido","edible_grams":240,"fdc_id":168877,"fdc_description":"Rice, white, long-grain, regular, raw, enriched","per_100g":{"calories":365,"protein_g":7.13,"carbs_g":79.95,"fat_g":0.66,"saturated_fat_g":0.18,"fiber_g":1.3,"sugar_g":0.12,"sodium_mg":5},"source_url":"https://fdc.nal.usda.gov/food-details/168877/nutrients"},{"ingredient":"óleo de canola","edible_grams":10,"fdc_id":172336,"fdc_description":"Oil, canola","per_100g":{"calories":884,"protein_g":0,"carbs_g":0,"fat_g":100,"saturated_fat_g":7.365,"fiber_g":0,"sugar_g":0,"sodium_mg":0},"source_url":"https://fdc.nal.usda.gov/food-details/172336/nutrients"},{"ingredient":"sal fino","edible_grams":3,"fdc_id":173468,"fdc_description":"Salt, table","per_100g":{"calories":0,"protein_g":0,"carbs_g":0,"fat_g":0,"saturated_fat_g":0,"fiber_g":0,"sugar_g":0,"sodium_mg":38758},"source_url":"https://fdc.nal.usda.gov/food-details/173468/nutrients"}],"calories":241.1,"protein_g":4.3,"carbs_g":48,"fat_g":2.9,"saturated_fat_g":0.3,"fiber_g":0.8,"sugar_g":0.1,"sodium_mg":294},"image_url":"/recetas/arroz-blanco-perfecto/portada.webp","gallery":[{"url":"/recetas/arroz-blanco-perfecto/portada.webp","alt":"Arroz branco de grão longo cozido e soltinho em uma tigela"}],"seo":{"title":"Arroz branco soltinho: método de absorção | Manual de Cocina","description":"Prepare arroz branco para 4 com água medida, cozimento tampado e 10 minutos de descanso. Veja como ajustar o ponto e guardar as sobras.","image_alt":"Arroz branco de grão longo cozido e soltinho em uma tigela","image_variants":["/recetas/arroz-blanco-perfecto/portada-1x1.webp","/recetas/arroz-blanco-perfecto/portada-4x3.webp","/recetas/arroz-blanco-perfecto/portada-16x9.webp"],"faq":[{"q":"Quanta água uso neste arroz branco?","a":"Esta proposta usa 480 ml de água para 240 g de arroz branco de grão longo lavado e bem escorrido. Não confunda gramas com xícaras: a proporção também depende da variedade e da vedação da panela."},{"q":"Por que o arroz fica pegajoso ou empapado?","a":"Excesso de amido superficial, água demais ou mexer durante o cozimento favorecem que os grãos grudem. Lave e escorra, meça a água, cozinhe tampado sem mexer e respeite os 10 minutos de descanso antes de soltar com o garfo."},{"q":"Posso guardar e reaquecer o arroz?","a":"Sim, se você resfriar rapidamente, idealmente em até 1 hora, e refrigerar para consumir em até 24 horas. Reaqueça uma só vez até ficar fumegante por inteiro. Não deixe morno dentro da panela."}]},"published":false,"editorial_status":"draft","content_html":"<p>Um arroz branco simples, de grão longo, cozido com uma quantidade medida de água e finalizado com descanso fora do fogo. Este acompanhamento busca grãos macios e separados, sem caldo nem refogado, e mantém a URL histórica de arroz branco perfeito.</p><p>A proposta rende 4 porções de acompanhamento e estima 10 minutos de preparo, 25 de cozimento e 10 de descanso: 45 minutos no total. Variedade e marca do arroz, diâmetro da panela e vedação da tampa podem mudar a água e o tempo necessários. Quantidades, tempos e rendimento ainda precisam de teste na cozinha.</p>"},{"id":"2300175e-c47a-4318-a6f9-8ee54387722e","recipe_group_id":"0bbedb8a-3d06-41dd-8bfc-3dc1ebeac0a7","language":"es","slug":"receta-de-ratatouille","public_path":"/receta-de-ratatouille","source_url":"https://manualdecocina.com/receta-de-ratatouille/","title":"Ratatouille de verduras en dados","excerpt":"Ratatouille para 4 con berenjena, calabacín, pimiento y tomate: verduras doradas por tandas y un guiso final sin convertirlas en puré.","summary":"Esta ratatouille reúne berenjena, calabacín, pimiento rojo y tomate en un guiso de verduras cortadas en dados. Dorar por separado la berenjena y el calabacín ayuda a controlar su textura antes de reunirlos con el sofrito y el tomate. La ficha propone una versión en cazuela, no una espiral de láminas al horno.\n\nSe proponen 4 guarniciones generosas, con 20 minutos de preparación y unos 55 de cocción: 75 minutos en total. El agua de las verduras, el tamaño del corte y la amplitud de la cazuela cambian el tiempo de reducción. Cantidades, tiempos y rendimiento son estimados y están pendientes de una prueba de cocina.","category":"Guarniciones","category_slug":"guarniciones","difficulty":"Baja","course":"Guarnición","cuisine":"Francesa, propuesta casera","prep_time_minutes":20,"cook_time_minutes":55,"total_time_minutes":75,"servings":4,"ingredients":[{"name":"berenjena con piel, sin tallo","amount":"400","unit":"g","group":"Verduras"},{"name":"calabacín con piel, sin extremos","amount":"400","unit":"g","group":"Verduras"},{"name":"pimiento rojo sin semillas","amount":"250","unit":"g","group":"Verduras"},{"name":"cebolla pelada","amount":"200","unit":"g","group":"Verduras"},{"name":"tomate maduro sin pedúnculo","amount":"600","unit":"g","group":"Verduras"},{"name":"ajo pelado","amount":"12","unit":"g","group":"Verduras"},{"name":"aceite de oliva","amount":"40","unit":"g, dividido","group":"Sazonado"},{"name":"sal fina","amount":"5","unit":"g","group":"Sazonado"},{"name":"tomillo seco","amount":"1","unit":"g","group":"Sazonado"},{"name":"pimienta negra molida","amount":"0.5","unit":"g","group":"Sazonado"},{"name":"albahaca fresca","amount":"8","unit":"g","group":"Acabado"},{"name":"agua caliente","amount":"60","unit":"ml, solo si hace falta","group":"Corrección de cocción"}],"steps":[{"title":"Lava, pesa y corta las verduras","content":"Lava las verduras y la albahaca con agua corriente. Retira tallos, semillas y partes dañadas; pesa las cantidades comestibles indicadas. Corta berenjena y calabacín en dados de unos 2 cm; pimiento y cebolla, en piezas de 1–2 cm. Pica el tomate y el ajo por separado. Prepara una cazuela ancha de fondo grueso de unos 28–30 cm y capacidad de al menos 4 litros.","image_alt":"Ratatouille: verduras limpias y cortadas en dados antes de cocinar","image_url":"/recetas/receta-de-ratatouille/paso-01.webp"},{"title":"Dora la berenjena por tandas","content":"Calienta 10 g de aceite en la cazuela a fuego medio-alto y añade la mitad de la berenjena. Dora 7–8 minutos, moviendo lo justo para que cambie de cara, hasta que tenga bordes dorados y empiece a ablandarse. Retira a un plato y repite con los otros 10 g de aceite y la berenjena restante. No llenes la cazuela hasta apilarla: si suelta agua, deja que se evapore antes de seguir.","image_alt":"Ratatouille: dados de berenjena dorándose en una sola capa","image_url":"/recetas/receta-de-ratatouille/paso-02.webp"},{"title":"Saltea el calabacín","content":"Añade 10 g de aceite a la misma cazuela y el calabacín. Saltea unos 6 minutos a fuego medio-alto, hasta que algunas caras estén doradas y el centro aún tenga resistencia. Retira junto a la berenjena. No añadas sal todavía ni remuevas sin parar; la intención es dorar, no cocer los dados en su propio líquido.","image_alt":"Ratatouille: calabacín en dados salteado y ligeramente dorado","image_url":"/recetas/receta-de-ratatouille/paso-03.webp"},{"title":"Ablanda cebolla y pimiento","content":"Baja a fuego medio, añade los 10 g de aceite restantes, la cebolla y el pimiento. Cocina 8–10 minutos, removiendo de vez en cuando, hasta que la cebolla esté translúcida y el pimiento se ablande. Si el fondo se pega antes de que estén listos, añade agua caliente de 15 en 15 ml, hasta un máximo de 60 ml para toda la receta, y raspa suavemente sin arrancar partes quemadas.","image_alt":"Ratatouille: cebolla y pimiento rojo ablandándose en la cazuela","image_url":"/recetas/receta-de-ratatouille/paso-04.webp"},{"title":"Forma la base de tomate","content":"Añade el ajo y remueve 30 segundos, sin dejarlo ennegrecer. Incorpora los 600 g de tomate, los 5 g de sal, 1 g de tomillo seco y 0,5 g de pimienta. Cocina unos 5 minutos a fuego medio, removiendo, hasta que el tomate empiece a deshacerse y deje una base jugosa. Mantén la cazuela destapada.","image_alt":"Ratatouille: tomate picado, ajo y tomillo formando la base del guiso","image_url":"/recetas/receta-de-ratatouille/paso-05.webp"},{"title":"Reúne y termina el guiso","content":"Devuelve berenjena y calabacín con sus jugos a la cazuela. Mezcla con suavidad y cocina destapado a fuego medio-bajo 15–18 minutos, removiendo desde el fondo de vez en cuando. Debe quedar jugoso, sin charco de agua, con la berenjena tierna y las piezas aún reconocibles. Si el tomate sigue muy acuoso, prolonga unos minutos; si se seca, usa parte del agua de corrección sin superar los 60 ml. El tiempo puede aumentar.","image_alt":"Ratatouille: todas las verduras en dados guisándose juntas sin tapa","image_url":"/recetas/receta-de-ratatouille/paso-06.webp"},{"title":"Añade albahaca y sirve","content":"Apaga el fuego, añade los 8 g de albahaca troceada y mezcla. Reparte en 4 guarniciones y sirve caliente. Para guardar sobras, pásalas a recipientes bajos y refrigera a 4 °C o menos dentro de 2 horas, o 1 hora si el ambiente supera 32 °C. Se propone consumirlas en 3 días y recalentarlas hasta al menos 74 °C en el centro.","image_alt":"Ratatouille terminada en dados con albahaca fresca, lista para servir","image_url":"/recetas/receta-de-ratatouille/paso-07.webp"}],"notes":"No se sala ni remoja la berenjena en esta propuesta; por eso se controla el dorado en tandas. Puedes cambiar el pimiento rojo por otro pimiento dulce del mismo peso, con cambio de sabor y nutrición. Si omites la albahaca, el acabado será distinto; el cálculo incluye sus 8 g. No se propone sustituir berenjena o calabacín por patata porque cambiaría los tiempos y la intención del plato. Los ingredientes no incluyen alérgenos habituales, pero revisa etiquetas y contaminación cruzada. La textura al día siguiente será más blanda. Enfría en recipientes bajos, no en la cazuela grande; conserva a 4 °C o menos y consume en 3 días. Recalienta solo la porción que vayas a comer hasta 74 °C y evita ciclos repetidos de calentamiento. Para congelar, usa recipientes cerrados por un plazo propuesto de 2 meses, sabiendo que el calabacín perderá firmeza; descongela en la nevera.","nutrition":{"saturated_fat_g":1.6,"sugar_g":14.8,"fat_g":11.1,"carbs_g":24.5,"calories":199.6,"fiber_g":8.2,"sodium_mg":508,"protein_g":5,"estimated":true,"serving_size":"1 de 4 guarniciones propuestas","source":"USDA FoodData Central — SR Legacy, descarga JSON abril de 2018","source_url":"https://fdc.nal.usda.gov/download-datasets/","method":"Once fichas del archivo oficial SR Legacy verificadas por FDC ID; pesos comestibles crudos sumados y divididos entre 4. Se cuentan los 40 g de aceite y los 5 g de sal completos. El agua de corrección no aporta energía. No se usa un peso final supuesto.","note":"Estimación informativa, no análisis del plato terminado. Variedad, reducción del tomate, restos de aceite y tamaño real de cada porción pueden cambiar los valores. Cantidades, tiempos y rendimiento pendientes de prueba de cocina.","inputs":[{"fdc_id":169228,"fdc_description":"Eggplant, raw","per_100g":{"saturated_fat_g":0.034,"sugar_g":3.53,"fat_g":0.18,"carbs_g":5.88,"calories":25,"fiber_g":3,"sodium_mg":2,"protein_g":0.98},"source_url":"https://fdc.nal.usda.gov/food-details/169228/nutrients","ingredient":"berenjena con piel, sin tallo","edible_grams":400},{"fdc_id":169291,"fdc_description":"Squash, summer, zucchini, includes skin, raw","per_100g":{"sugar_g":2.5,"fat_g":0.32,"carbs_g":3.11,"calories":17,"fiber_g":1,"sodium_mg":8,"protein_g":1.21,"saturated_fat_g":0.084},"source_url":"https://fdc.nal.usda.gov/food-details/169291/nutrients","ingredient":"calabacín con piel, sin extremos","edible_grams":400},{"fdc_id":170108,"fdc_description":"Peppers, sweet, red, raw","per_100g":{"fiber_g":2.1,"calories":26,"saturated_fat_g":0.059,"sodium_mg":4,"sugar_g":4.2,"carbs_g":6.03,"protein_g":0.99,"fat_g":0.3},"source_url":"https://fdc.nal.usda.gov/food-details/170108/nutrients","ingredient":"pimiento rojo sin semillas","edible_grams":250},{"fdc_id":170000,"fdc_description":"Onions, raw","per_100g":{"sugar_g":4.24,"fat_g":0.1,"carbs_g":9.34,"calories":40,"saturated_fat_g":0.042,"protein_g":1.1,"fiber_g":1.7,"sodium_mg":4},"source_url":"https://fdc.nal.usda.gov/food-details/170000/nutrients","ingredient":"cebolla pelada","edible_grams":200},{"fdc_id":170457,"fdc_description":"Tomatoes, red, ripe, raw, year round average","per_100g":{"sugar_g":2.63,"carbs_g":3.89,"calories":18,"saturated_fat_g":0.028,"fat_g":0.2,"fiber_g":1.2,"sodium_mg":5,"protein_g":0.88},"source_url":"https://fdc.nal.usda.gov/food-details/170457/nutrients","ingredient":"tomate maduro sin pedúnculo","edible_grams":600},{"fdc_id":169230,"fdc_description":"Garlic, raw","per_100g":{"carbs_g":33.1,"calories":149,"sugar_g":1,"saturated_fat_g":0.089,"fiber_g":2.1,"sodium_mg":17,"protein_g":6.36,"fat_g":0.5},"source_url":"https://fdc.nal.usda.gov/food-details/169230/nutrients","ingredient":"ajo pelado","edible_grams":12},{"fdc_id":171413,"fdc_description":"Oil, olive, salad or cooking","per_100g":{"fat_g":100,"carbs_g":0,"calories":884,"sodium_mg":2,"protein_g":0,"saturated_fat_g":13.8,"fiber_g":0,"sugar_g":0},"source_url":"https://fdc.nal.usda.gov/food-details/171413/nutrients","ingredient":"aceite de oliva","edible_grams":40},{"fdc_id":173468,"fdc_description":"Salt, table","per_100g":{"fiber_g":0,"sodium_mg":38800,"saturated_fat_g":0,"protein_g":0,"fat_g":0,"carbs_g":0,"calories":0,"sugar_g":0},"source_url":"https://fdc.nal.usda.gov/food-details/173468/nutrients","ingredient":"sal fina","edible_grams":5},{"fdc_id":170938,"fdc_description":"Spices, thyme, dried","per_100g":{"fat_g":7.43,"carbs_g":63.9,"calories":276,"protein_g":9.11,"sodium_mg":55,"saturated_fat_g":2.73,"fiber_g":37,"sugar_g":1.71},"source_url":"https://fdc.nal.usda.gov/food-details/170938/nutrients","ingredient":"tomillo seco","edible_grams":1},{"fdc_id":170931,"fdc_description":"Spices, pepper, black","per_100g":{"fat_g":3.26,"sugar_g":0.64,"carbs_g":64,"calories":251,"protein_g":10.4,"fiber_g":25.3,"sodium_mg":20,"saturated_fat_g":1.39},"source_url":"https://fdc.nal.usda.gov/food-details/170931/nutrients","ingredient":"pimienta negra molida","edible_grams":0.5},{"fdc_id":172232,"fdc_description":"Basil, fresh","per_100g":{"saturated_fat_g":0.041,"sugar_g":0.3,"fat_g":0.64,"carbs_g":2.65,"calories":23,"fiber_g":1.6,"sodium_mg":4,"protein_g":3.15},"source_url":"https://fdc.nal.usda.gov/food-details/172232/nutrients","ingredient":"albahaca fresca","edible_grams":8}]},"keywords":["ratatouille","ratatouille en dados","guiso de verduras","ratatouille en cazuela"],"image_url":"/recetas/receta-de-ratatouille/portada.webp","gallery":[{"url":"/recetas/receta-de-ratatouille/portada.webp","alt":"Ratatouille de berenjena, calabacín, pimiento y tomate en dados con albahaca"}],"seo":{"title":"Ratatouille en dados: verduras en cazuela | Manual de Cocina","description":"Ratatouille para 4: dora berenjena y calabacín por tandas y termina con tomate y albahaca. Pasos, tiempos estimados y conservación.","image_alt":"Ratatouille de berenjena, calabacín, pimiento y tomate en dados con albahaca","image_variants":["/recetas/receta-de-ratatouille/portada-1x1.webp","/recetas/receta-de-ratatouille/portada-4x3.webp","/recetas/receta-de-ratatouille/portada-16x9.webp"],"faq":[{"q":"¿La ratatouille tiene que hacerse en láminas al horno?","a":"No. Esta ficha propone verduras en dados guisadas en cazuela. Una presentación en espiral de láminas necesita otro corte y otros tiempos; no se intercambia sin ajustar la receta."},{"q":"¿Cómo evito una ratatouille aguada?","a":"Dora berenjena y calabacín por tandas, no amontones las verduras y termina destapado. El tomate debe reducir hasta quedar jugoso sin agua libre; su contenido de agua puede exigir más tiempo que los 75 minutos estimados."},{"q":"¿Puedo prepararla el día anterior?","a":"Sí, si enfrías en recipientes bajos y refrigeras dentro de 2 horas, o 1 hora por encima de 32 °C. Se propone conservar 3 días a 4 °C o menos y recalentar hasta 74 °C; las verduras quedarán más blandas."}]},"published":false,"editorial_status":"draft","content_html":"<p>Esta ratatouille reúne berenjena, calabacín, pimiento rojo y tomate en un guiso de verduras cortadas en dados. Dorar por separado la berenjena y el calabacín ayuda a controlar su textura antes de reunirlos con el sofrito y el tomate. La ficha propone una versión en cazuela, no una espiral de láminas al horno.</p><p>Se proponen 4 guarniciones generosas, con 20 minutos de preparación y unos 55 de cocción: 75 minutos en total. El agua de las verduras, el tamaño del corte y la amplitud de la cazuela cambian el tiempo de reducción. Cantidades, tiempos y rendimiento son estimados y están pendientes de una prueba de cocina.</p>"},{"id":"c9a81acd-4f74-506b-a665-239df7a4fd81","recipe_group_id":"0bbedb8a-3d06-41dd-8bfc-3dc1ebeac0a7","language":"de","slug":"ratatouille-rezept","public_path":"/de/ratatouille-rezept","source_url":null,"title":"Ratatouille mit gewürfeltem Gemüse","excerpt":"Ratatouille für 4 mit Aubergine, Zucchini, Paprika und Tomate: portionsweise gebräuntes Gemüse, anschließend geschmort statt püriert.","summary":"Diese Ratatouille verbindet gewürfelte Aubergine, Zucchini, rote Paprika und Tomate zu einem Gemüseschmortopf. Aubergine und Zucchini getrennt zu bräunen hilft, ihre Konsistenz zu steuern, bevor sie mit Zwiebel, Paprika und Tomate zusammenkommen. Vorgeschlagen wird eine Zubereitung im Topf, keine Spirale aus Scheiben im Ofen.\n\nGeplant sind 4 großzügige Beilagenportionen, 20 Minuten Vorbereitung und etwa 55 Minuten Garen: insgesamt 75 Minuten. Wassergehalt, Würfelgröße und Topfbreite beeinflussen die Reduktionszeit. Mengen, Zeiten und Ausbeute sind Schätzungen und müssen noch in der Küche geprüft werden.","category":"Beilagen","category_slug":"guarniciones","difficulty":"Einfach","course":"Beilage","cuisine":"Französisch, Vorschlag für die Hausküche","prep_time_minutes":20,"cook_time_minutes":55,"total_time_minutes":75,"servings":4,"ingredients":[{"name":"Aubergine mit Schale, ohne Stiel","amount":"400","unit":"g","group":"Gemüse"},{"name":"Zucchini mit Schale, ohne Enden","amount":"400","unit":"g","group":"Gemüse"},{"name":"rote Paprika, entkernt","amount":"250","unit":"g","group":"Gemüse"},{"name":"geschälte Zwiebel","amount":"200","unit":"g","group":"Gemüse"},{"name":"reife Tomate ohne Stielansatz","amount":"600","unit":"g","group":"Gemüse"},{"name":"geschälter Knoblauch","amount":"12","unit":"g","group":"Gemüse"},{"name":"Olivenöl","amount":"40","unit":"g, aufgeteilt","group":"Würzung"},{"name":"feines Salz","amount":"5","unit":"g","group":"Würzung"},{"name":"getrockneter Thymian","amount":"1","unit":"g","group":"Würzung"},{"name":"gemahlener schwarzer Pfeffer","amount":"0.5","unit":"g","group":"Würzung"},{"name":"frisches Basilikum","amount":"8","unit":"g","group":"Fertigstellung"},{"name":"heißes Wasser","amount":"60","unit":"ml, nur bei Bedarf","group":"Garkorrektur"}],"steps":[{"title":"Gemüse waschen, wiegen und schneiden","content":"Gemüse und Basilikum unter fließendem Wasser waschen. Stiele, Kerne und beschädigte Stellen entfernen; die angegebenen essbaren Mengen wiegen. Aubergine und Zucchini in etwa 2 cm große Würfel, Paprika und Zwiebel in 1–2 cm große Stücke schneiden. Tomate und Knoblauch getrennt hacken. Einen breiten Topf mit dickem Boden, etwa 28–30 cm Durchmesser und mindestens 4 Litern Fassungsvermögen bereitstellen.","image_alt":"Ratatouille: sauberes, gewürfeltes Gemüse vor dem Garen","image_url":"/recetas/receta-de-ratatouille/paso-01.webp"},{"title":"Aubergine portionsweise bräunen","content":"10 g Öl im Topf bei mittelhoher Hitze erhitzen und die Hälfte der Aubergine zugeben. 7–8 Minuten bräunen und nur zum Wenden bewegen, bis die Ränder goldbraun sind und die Stücke weicher werden. Auf einen Teller geben und mit weiteren 10 g Öl und der übrigen Aubergine wiederholen. Nicht übereinanderstapeln; austretendes Wasser erst verdampfen lassen.","image_alt":"Ratatouille: Auberginenwürfel bräunen in einer einzelnen Lage","image_url":"/recetas/receta-de-ratatouille/paso-02.webp"},{"title":"Zucchini anbraten","content":"10 g Öl und die Zucchini in denselben Topf geben. Bei mittelhoher Hitze etwa 6 Minuten anbraten, bis einige Seiten goldbraun sind und das Innere noch etwas Widerstand bietet. Zur Aubergine geben. Noch nicht salzen und nicht ununterbrochen rühren; die Würfel sollen bräunen, statt im eigenen Saft zu kochen.","image_alt":"Ratatouille: angebratene, leicht gebräunte Zucchiniwürfel","image_url":"/recetas/receta-de-ratatouille/paso-03.webp"},{"title":"Zwiebel und Paprika weich garen","content":"Auf mittlere Hitze reduzieren, die übrigen 10 g Öl, Zwiebel und Paprika zugeben. Unter gelegentlichem Rühren 8–10 Minuten garen, bis die Zwiebel glasig und die Paprika weicher ist. Setzt der Boden vorher an, heißes Wasser in Schritten von 15 ml zugeben, höchstens 60 ml für das gesamte Rezept, und den Ansatz behutsam lösen, ohne verbrannte Stellen abzuschaben.","image_alt":"Ratatouille: Zwiebel und rote Paprika werden im Topf weich","image_url":"/recetas/receta-de-ratatouille/paso-04.webp"},{"title":"Tomatenbasis zubereiten","content":"Knoblauch zugeben und 30 Sekunden rühren, ohne ihn schwarz werden zu lassen. 600 g Tomate, 5 g Salz, 1 g getrockneten Thymian und 0,5 g Pfeffer zugeben. Bei mittlerer Hitze unter Rühren etwa 5 Minuten garen, bis die Tomate zerfällt und eine saftige Grundlage bildet. Den Topf offen lassen.","image_alt":"Ratatouille: gehackte Tomate, Knoblauch und Thymian bilden die Schmorgrundlage","image_url":"/recetas/receta-de-ratatouille/paso-05.webp"},{"title":"Zusammenführen und fertig schmoren","content":"Aubergine und Zucchini mit ihrem Saft zurück in den Topf geben. Behutsam mischen und offen bei mittlerer bis kleiner Hitze 15–18 Minuten garen, gelegentlich vom Boden her rühren. Das Ergebnis soll saftig sein, ohne Wasserpfütze, mit zarter Aubergine und erkennbaren Stücken. Ist die Tomate noch sehr wässrig, einige Minuten verlängern; wird es trocken, Korrekturwasser verwenden, insgesamt höchstens 60 ml. Die Zeit kann sich verlängern.","image_alt":"Ratatouille: alle Gemüsewürfel schmoren zusammen im offenen Topf","image_url":"/recetas/receta-de-ratatouille/paso-06.webp"},{"title":"Basilikum zufügen und servieren","content":"Hitze ausschalten, 8 g zerzupftes Basilikum zugeben und mischen. Auf 4 Beilagenportionen verteilen und heiß servieren. Reste in flache Behälter umfüllen und innerhalb von 2 Stunden bei höchstens 4 °C kühlen, innerhalb von 1 Stunde bei einer Umgebung über 32 °C. Vorgeschlagen wird Verbrauch innerhalb von 3 Tagen und erneutes Erhitzen auf mindestens 74 °C im Kern.","image_alt":"Fertige gewürfelte Ratatouille mit frischem Basilikum, servierbereit","image_url":"/recetas/receta-de-ratatouille/paso-07.webp"}],"notes":"Die Aubergine wird hier weder gesalzen noch eingeweicht; das Bräunen wird portionsweise gesteuert. Rote Paprika kann durch eine andere süße Paprika gleichen Gewichts ersetzt werden, mit verändertem Geschmack und Nährwert. Ohne Basilikum verändert sich der Abschluss; die Berechnung enthält seine 8 g. Kartoffeln sind kein vorgeschlagener Ersatz für Aubergine oder Zucchini, da sie Garzeit und Gericht verändern würden. Die Zutaten enthalten keine üblichen Allergene; trotzdem Etiketten und Kreuzkontakt prüfen. Am Folgetag ist die Konsistenz weicher. In flachen Behältern abkühlen, nicht im großen Topf; bei höchstens 4 °C lagern und innerhalb von 3 Tagen essen. Nur die benötigte Portion auf 74 °C erhitzen und wiederholte Erhitzungszyklen vermeiden. Zum Einfrieren geschlossene Behälter für vorgeschlagene 2 Monate nutzen; die Zucchini wird weicher. Im Kühlschrank auftauen.","nutrition":{"saturated_fat_g":1.6,"sugar_g":14.8,"fat_g":11.1,"carbs_g":24.5,"calories":199.6,"fiber_g":8.2,"sodium_mg":508,"protein_g":5,"estimated":true,"serving_size":"1 von 4 vorgeschlagenen Beilagenportionen","source":"USDA FoodData Central — SR Legacy, descarga JSON abril de 2018","source_url":"https://fdc.nal.usda.gov/download-datasets/","method":"Elf Datensätze aus dem offiziellen SR-Legacy-Archiv anhand der FDC-ID geprüft; rohe essbare Mengen addiert und durch 4 geteilt. Die gesamten 40 g Öl und 5 g Salz werden berücksichtigt. Korrekturwasser liefert keine Energie. Kein angenommenes Endgewicht wird verwendet.","note":"Informationsschätzung, keine Analyse des fertigen Gerichts. Sorte, Tomatenreduktion, Ölreste und tatsächliche Portionen können die Werte verändern. Mengen, Zeiten und Ausbeute müssen noch in der Küche geprüft werden.","inputs":[{"fdc_id":169228,"fdc_description":"Eggplant, raw","per_100g":{"saturated_fat_g":0.034,"sugar_g":3.53,"fat_g":0.18,"carbs_g":5.88,"calories":25,"fiber_g":3,"sodium_mg":2,"protein_g":0.98},"source_url":"https://fdc.nal.usda.gov/food-details/169228/nutrients","ingredient":"Aubergine mit Schale, ohne Stiel","edible_grams":400},{"fdc_id":169291,"fdc_description":"Squash, summer, zucchini, includes skin, raw","per_100g":{"sugar_g":2.5,"fat_g":0.32,"carbs_g":3.11,"calories":17,"fiber_g":1,"sodium_mg":8,"protein_g":1.21,"saturated_fat_g":0.084},"source_url":"https://fdc.nal.usda.gov/food-details/169291/nutrients","ingredient":"Zucchini mit Schale, ohne Enden","edible_grams":400},{"fdc_id":170108,"fdc_description":"Peppers, sweet, red, raw","per_100g":{"fiber_g":2.1,"calories":26,"saturated_fat_g":0.059,"sodium_mg":4,"sugar_g":4.2,"carbs_g":6.03,"protein_g":0.99,"fat_g":0.3},"source_url":"https://fdc.nal.usda.gov/food-details/170108/nutrients","ingredient":"rote Paprika, entkernt","edible_grams":250},{"fdc_id":170000,"fdc_description":"Onions, raw","per_100g":{"sugar_g":4.24,"fat_g":0.1,"carbs_g":9.34,"calories":40,"saturated_fat_g":0.042,"protein_g":1.1,"fiber_g":1.7,"sodium_mg":4},"source_url":"https://fdc.nal.usda.gov/food-details/170000/nutrients","ingredient":"geschälte Zwiebel","edible_grams":200},{"fdc_id":170457,"fdc_description":"Tomatoes, red, ripe, raw, year round average","per_100g":{"sugar_g":2.63,"carbs_g":3.89,"calories":18,"saturated_fat_g":0.028,"fat_g":0.2,"fiber_g":1.2,"sodium_mg":5,"protein_g":0.88},"source_url":"https://fdc.nal.usda.gov/food-details/170457/nutrients","ingredient":"reife Tomate ohne Stielansatz","edible_grams":600},{"fdc_id":169230,"fdc_description":"Garlic, raw","per_100g":{"carbs_g":33.1,"calories":149,"sugar_g":1,"saturated_fat_g":0.089,"fiber_g":2.1,"sodium_mg":17,"protein_g":6.36,"fat_g":0.5},"source_url":"https://fdc.nal.usda.gov/food-details/169230/nutrients","ingredient":"geschälter Knoblauch","edible_grams":12},{"fdc_id":171413,"fdc_description":"Oil, olive, salad or cooking","per_100g":{"fat_g":100,"carbs_g":0,"calories":884,"sodium_mg":2,"protein_g":0,"saturated_fat_g":13.8,"fiber_g":0,"sugar_g":0},"source_url":"https://fdc.nal.usda.gov/food-details/171413/nutrients","ingredient":"Olivenöl","edible_grams":40},{"fdc_id":173468,"fdc_description":"Salt, table","per_100g":{"fiber_g":0,"sodium_mg":38800,"saturated_fat_g":0,"protein_g":0,"fat_g":0,"carbs_g":0,"calories":0,"sugar_g":0},"source_url":"https://fdc.nal.usda.gov/food-details/173468/nutrients","ingredient":"feines Salz","edible_grams":5},{"fdc_id":170938,"fdc_description":"Spices, thyme, dried","per_100g":{"fat_g":7.43,"carbs_g":63.9,"calories":276,"protein_g":9.11,"sodium_mg":55,"saturated_fat_g":2.73,"fiber_g":37,"sugar_g":1.71},"source_url":"https://fdc.nal.usda.gov/food-details/170938/nutrients","ingredient":"getrockneter Thymian","edible_grams":1},{"fdc_id":170931,"fdc_description":"Spices, pepper, black","per_100g":{"fat_g":3.26,"sugar_g":0.64,"carbs_g":64,"calories":251,"protein_g":10.4,"fiber_g":25.3,"sodium_mg":20,"saturated_fat_g":1.39},"source_url":"https://fdc.nal.usda.gov/food-details/170931/nutrients","ingredient":"gemahlener schwarzer Pfeffer","edible_grams":0.5},{"fdc_id":172232,"fdc_description":"Basil, fresh","per_100g":{"saturated_fat_g":0.041,"sugar_g":0.3,"fat_g":0.64,"carbs_g":2.65,"calories":23,"fiber_g":1.6,"sodium_mg":4,"protein_g":3.15},"source_url":"https://fdc.nal.usda.gov/food-details/172232/nutrients","ingredient":"frisches Basilikum","edible_grams":8}]},"keywords":["Ratatouille","gewürfelte Ratatouille","Gemüseschmortopf","Ratatouille im Topf"],"image_url":"/recetas/receta-de-ratatouille/portada.webp","gallery":[{"url":"/recetas/receta-de-ratatouille/portada.webp","alt":"Gewürfelte Ratatouille aus Aubergine, Zucchini, Paprika und Tomate mit Basilikum"}],"seo":{"title":"Gewürfelte Ratatouille: Gemüse im Topf | Manual de Cocina","description":"Ratatouille für 4: Aubergine und Zucchini portionsweise bräunen, mit Tomate und Basilikum vollenden. Schritte, geschätzte Zeiten und Lagerung.","image_alt":"Gewürfelte Ratatouille aus Aubergine, Zucchini, Paprika und Tomate mit Basilikum","image_variants":["/recetas/receta-de-ratatouille/portada-1x1.webp","/recetas/receta-de-ratatouille/portada-4x3.webp","/recetas/receta-de-ratatouille/portada-16x9.webp"],"faq":[{"q":"Muss Ratatouille aus Scheiben im Ofen bestehen?","a":"Nein. Dieses Rezept schlägt gewürfeltes Gemüse vor, das im Topf schmort. Eine Spirale aus Scheiben braucht einen anderen Schnitt und andere Zeiten; das Rezept muss dafür angepasst werden."},{"q":"Wie vermeide ich wässrige Ratatouille?","a":"Aubergine und Zucchini portionsweise bräunen, Gemüse nicht häufen und offen fertig garen. Tomate reduzieren, bis alles saftig ohne freies Wasser ist; ihr Wassergehalt kann mehr als die geschätzten 75 Minuten erfordern."},{"q":"Kann ich sie am Vortag zubereiten?","a":"Ja, wenn sie in flachen Behältern abgekühlt und innerhalb von 2 Stunden, bei über 32 °C innerhalb von 1 Stunde, gekühlt wird. Vorgeschlagen sind 3 Tage bei höchstens 4 °C und Erhitzen auf 74 °C; das Gemüse wird weicher."}]},"published":false,"editorial_status":"draft","content_html":"<p>Diese Ratatouille verbindet gewürfelte Aubergine, Zucchini, rote Paprika und Tomate zu einem Gemüseschmortopf. Aubergine und Zucchini getrennt zu bräunen hilft, ihre Konsistenz zu steuern, bevor sie mit Zwiebel, Paprika und Tomate zusammenkommen. Vorgeschlagen wird eine Zubereitung im Topf, keine Spirale aus Scheiben im Ofen.</p><p>Geplant sind 4 großzügige Beilagenportionen, 20 Minuten Vorbereitung und etwa 55 Minuten Garen: insgesamt 75 Minuten. Wassergehalt, Würfelgröße und Topfbreite beeinflussen die Reduktionszeit. Mengen, Zeiten und Ausbeute sind Schätzungen und müssen noch in der Küche geprüft werden.</p>"},{"id":"d3198eac-e0b6-536a-a785-715d5b05d482","recipe_group_id":"0bbedb8a-3d06-41dd-8bfc-3dc1ebeac0a7","language":"en","slug":"ratatouille-recipe","public_path":"/en/ratatouille-recipe","source_url":null,"title":"Chunky vegetable ratatouille","excerpt":"Ratatouille for 4 with eggplant, zucchini, pepper and tomato: vegetables browned in batches, then gently stewed without turning to purée.","summary":"This ratatouille combines diced eggplant, zucchini, red pepper and tomato in a vegetable stew. Browning the eggplant and zucchini separately helps control their texture before adding them to the softened onion, pepper and tomato. This is a stovetop proposal, rather than an oven-baked spiral of vegetable slices.\n\nThe proposal makes 4 generous side portions, with 20 minutes of preparation and about 55 minutes of cooking: 75 minutes in total. Vegetable moisture, dice size and pan width change the reduction time. Quantities, times and yield are estimates awaiting a kitchen test.","category":"Side dishes","category_slug":"guarniciones","difficulty":"Easy","course":"Side dish","cuisine":"French, home-cooking proposal","prep_time_minutes":20,"cook_time_minutes":55,"total_time_minutes":75,"servings":4,"ingredients":[{"name":"eggplant with skin, stem removed","amount":"400","unit":"g","group":"Vegetables"},{"name":"zucchini with skin, ends removed","amount":"400","unit":"g","group":"Vegetables"},{"name":"red pepper, seeds removed","amount":"250","unit":"g","group":"Vegetables"},{"name":"peeled onion","amount":"200","unit":"g","group":"Vegetables"},{"name":"ripe tomato, stalk removed","amount":"600","unit":"g","group":"Vegetables"},{"name":"peeled garlic","amount":"12","unit":"g","group":"Vegetables"},{"name":"olive oil","amount":"40","unit":"g, divided","group":"Seasoning"},{"name":"fine salt","amount":"5","unit":"g","group":"Seasoning"},{"name":"dried thyme","amount":"1","unit":"g","group":"Seasoning"},{"name":"ground black pepper","amount":"0.5","unit":"g","group":"Seasoning"},{"name":"fresh basil","amount":"8","unit":"g","group":"Finishing"},{"name":"hot water","amount":"60","unit":"ml, only if needed","group":"Cooking adjustment"}],"steps":[{"title":"Wash, weigh and dice the vegetables","content":"Wash the vegetables and basil under running water. Remove stems, seeds and damaged parts; weigh the edible amounts listed. Cut eggplant and zucchini into roughly 2 cm cubes, and pepper and onion into 1–2 cm pieces. Chop tomato and garlic separately. Prepare a wide, heavy-bottomed casserole about 28–30 cm across with a capacity of at least 4 litres.","image_alt":"Ratatouille: clean, diced vegetables before cooking","image_url":"/recetas/receta-de-ratatouille/paso-01.webp"},{"title":"Brown the eggplant in batches","content":"Heat 10 g of oil in the casserole over medium-high heat and add half the eggplant. Brown for 7–8 minutes, turning just enough to change sides, until the edges are golden and the pieces start to soften. Transfer to a plate and repeat with another 10 g of oil and the remaining eggplant. Do not pile up the pieces; if they release water, let it evaporate before continuing.","image_alt":"Ratatouille: eggplant cubes browning in a single layer","image_url":"/recetas/receta-de-ratatouille/paso-02.webp"},{"title":"Sauté the zucchini","content":"Add 10 g of oil and the zucchini to the same casserole. Sauté over medium-high heat for about 6 minutes until some sides are golden but the centres still resist slightly. Set aside with the eggplant. Do not add salt yet or stir continuously: the aim is to brown the cubes, rather than boil them in their own liquid.","image_alt":"Ratatouille: lightly browned, sautéed zucchini cubes","image_url":"/recetas/receta-de-ratatouille/paso-03.webp"},{"title":"Soften onion and pepper","content":"Reduce to medium heat and add the remaining 10 g of oil, onion and pepper. Cook for 8–10 minutes, stirring occasionally, until the onion is translucent and the pepper softens. If the base sticks before they are ready, add hot water in 15 ml increments, up to 60 ml for the entire recipe, and gently loosen the base without scraping up burnt patches.","image_alt":"Ratatouille: onion and red pepper softening in the casserole","image_url":"/recetas/receta-de-ratatouille/paso-04.webp"},{"title":"Make the tomato base","content":"Add garlic and stir for 30 seconds without letting it blacken. Add the 600 g of tomato, 5 g of salt, 1 g of dried thyme and 0.5 g of pepper. Cook over medium heat for about 5 minutes, stirring, until the tomato starts to break down into a juicy base. Keep the casserole uncovered.","image_alt":"Ratatouille: chopped tomato, garlic and thyme forming the stew base","image_url":"/recetas/receta-de-ratatouille/paso-05.webp"},{"title":"Combine and finish the stew","content":"Return eggplant, zucchini and their juices to the casserole. Mix gently and cook uncovered over medium-low heat for 15–18 minutes, stirring occasionally from the bottom. It should be juicy without pooled water, with tender eggplant and still-recognizable pieces. If the tomato is very watery, extend cooking by a few minutes; if it dries out, use some adjustment water without exceeding 60 ml. Cooking time may increase.","image_alt":"Ratatouille: all diced vegetables stewing together uncovered","image_url":"/recetas/receta-de-ratatouille/paso-06.webp"},{"title":"Add basil and serve","content":"Turn off the heat, add the 8 g of torn basil and mix. Divide into 4 side portions and serve hot. Transfer leftovers to shallow containers and refrigerate at 4 °C or below within 2 hours, or 1 hour if the room is above 32 °C. The proposed storage limit is 3 days; reheat to at least 74 °C in the centre.","image_alt":"Finished chunky ratatouille with fresh basil, ready to serve","image_url":"/recetas/receta-de-ratatouille/paso-07.webp"}],"notes":"The eggplant is not salted or soaked in this proposal, so browning is controlled in batches. Substitute another sweet pepper for the red pepper at the same weight, allowing for changed flavour and nutrition. Omitting basil changes the finish; its 8 g are included in the calculation. Potato is not proposed as a substitute for eggplant or zucchini because cooking times and the dish's identity would change. The ingredients contain no common allergens, but check labels and cross-contamination. Texture will be softer the next day. Cool in shallow containers, not the large casserole; store at 4 °C or below and eat within 3 days. Reheat only the portion you will eat to 74 °C and avoid repeated heating cycles. For freezing, use sealed containers for a proposed 2 months, allowing for softer zucchini; thaw in the refrigerator.","nutrition":{"saturated_fat_g":1.6,"sugar_g":14.8,"fat_g":11.1,"carbs_g":24.5,"calories":199.6,"fiber_g":8.2,"sodium_mg":508,"protein_g":5,"estimated":true,"serving_size":"1 of 4 proposed side portions","source":"USDA FoodData Central — SR Legacy, descarga JSON abril de 2018","source_url":"https://fdc.nal.usda.gov/download-datasets/","method":"Eleven records in the official SR Legacy archive verified by FDC ID; raw edible weights summed and divided by 4. All 40 g of oil and 5 g of salt are counted. Adjustment water adds no energy. No assumed final weight is used.","note":"Informational estimate, not analysis of the finished dish. Variety, tomato reduction, leftover oil and actual portion sizes can change values. Quantities, times and yield await a kitchen test.","inputs":[{"fdc_id":169228,"fdc_description":"Eggplant, raw","per_100g":{"saturated_fat_g":0.034,"sugar_g":3.53,"fat_g":0.18,"carbs_g":5.88,"calories":25,"fiber_g":3,"sodium_mg":2,"protein_g":0.98},"source_url":"https://fdc.nal.usda.gov/food-details/169228/nutrients","ingredient":"eggplant with skin, stem removed","edible_grams":400},{"fdc_id":169291,"fdc_description":"Squash, summer, zucchini, includes skin, raw","per_100g":{"sugar_g":2.5,"fat_g":0.32,"carbs_g":3.11,"calories":17,"fiber_g":1,"sodium_mg":8,"protein_g":1.21,"saturated_fat_g":0.084},"source_url":"https://fdc.nal.usda.gov/food-details/169291/nutrients","ingredient":"zucchini with skin, ends removed","edible_grams":400},{"fdc_id":170108,"fdc_description":"Peppers, sweet, red, raw","per_100g":{"fiber_g":2.1,"calories":26,"saturated_fat_g":0.059,"sodium_mg":4,"sugar_g":4.2,"carbs_g":6.03,"protein_g":0.99,"fat_g":0.3},"source_url":"https://fdc.nal.usda.gov/food-details/170108/nutrients","ingredient":"red pepper, seeds removed","edible_grams":250},{"fdc_id":170000,"fdc_description":"Onions, raw","per_100g":{"sugar_g":4.24,"fat_g":0.1,"carbs_g":9.34,"calories":40,"saturated_fat_g":0.042,"protein_g":1.1,"fiber_g":1.7,"sodium_mg":4},"source_url":"https://fdc.nal.usda.gov/food-details/170000/nutrients","ingredient":"peeled onion","edible_grams":200},{"fdc_id":170457,"fdc_description":"Tomatoes, red, ripe, raw, year round average","per_100g":{"sugar_g":2.63,"carbs_g":3.89,"calories":18,"saturated_fat_g":0.028,"fat_g":0.2,"fiber_g":1.2,"sodium_mg":5,"protein_g":0.88},"source_url":"https://fdc.nal.usda.gov/food-details/170457/nutrients","ingredient":"ripe tomato, stalk removed","edible_grams":600},{"fdc_id":169230,"fdc_description":"Garlic, raw","per_100g":{"carbs_g":33.1,"calories":149,"sugar_g":1,"saturated_fat_g":0.089,"fiber_g":2.1,"sodium_mg":17,"protein_g":6.36,"fat_g":0.5},"source_url":"https://fdc.nal.usda.gov/food-details/169230/nutrients","ingredient":"peeled garlic","edible_grams":12},{"fdc_id":171413,"fdc_description":"Oil, olive, salad or cooking","per_100g":{"fat_g":100,"carbs_g":0,"calories":884,"sodium_mg":2,"protein_g":0,"saturated_fat_g":13.8,"fiber_g":0,"sugar_g":0},"source_url":"https://fdc.nal.usda.gov/food-details/171413/nutrients","ingredient":"olive oil","edible_grams":40},{"fdc_id":173468,"fdc_description":"Salt, table","per_100g":{"fiber_g":0,"sodium_mg":38800,"saturated_fat_g":0,"protein_g":0,"fat_g":0,"carbs_g":0,"calories":0,"sugar_g":0},"source_url":"https://fdc.nal.usda.gov/food-details/173468/nutrients","ingredient":"fine salt","edible_grams":5},{"fdc_id":170938,"fdc_description":"Spices, thyme, dried","per_100g":{"fat_g":7.43,"carbs_g":63.9,"calories":276,"protein_g":9.11,"sodium_mg":55,"saturated_fat_g":2.73,"fiber_g":37,"sugar_g":1.71},"source_url":"https://fdc.nal.usda.gov/food-details/170938/nutrients","ingredient":"dried thyme","edible_grams":1},{"fdc_id":170931,"fdc_description":"Spices, pepper, black","per_100g":{"fat_g":3.26,"sugar_g":0.64,"carbs_g":64,"calories":251,"protein_g":10.4,"fiber_g":25.3,"sodium_mg":20,"saturated_fat_g":1.39},"source_url":"https://fdc.nal.usda.gov/food-details/170931/nutrients","ingredient":"ground black pepper","edible_grams":0.5},{"fdc_id":172232,"fdc_description":"Basil, fresh","per_100g":{"saturated_fat_g":0.041,"sugar_g":0.3,"fat_g":0.64,"carbs_g":2.65,"calories":23,"fiber_g":1.6,"sodium_mg":4,"protein_g":3.15},"source_url":"https://fdc.nal.usda.gov/food-details/172232/nutrients","ingredient":"fresh basil","edible_grams":8}]},"keywords":["ratatouille","chunky ratatouille","vegetable stew","stovetop ratatouille"],"image_url":"/recetas/receta-de-ratatouille/portada.webp","gallery":[{"url":"/recetas/receta-de-ratatouille/portada.webp","alt":"Diced eggplant, zucchini, pepper and tomato ratatouille with basil"}],"seo":{"title":"Chunky ratatouille: stovetop vegetables | Manual de Cocina","description":"Ratatouille for 4: brown eggplant and zucchini in batches, then finish with tomato and basil. Steps, estimated times and storage.","image_alt":"Diced eggplant, zucchini, pepper and tomato ratatouille with basil","image_variants":["/recetas/receta-de-ratatouille/portada-1x1.webp","/recetas/receta-de-ratatouille/portada-4x3.webp","/recetas/receta-de-ratatouille/portada-16x9.webp"],"faq":[{"q":"Must ratatouille be made from oven-baked slices?","a":"No. This recipe proposes diced vegetables stewed in a casserole. A spiral of slices needs different cuts and cooking times; it cannot be substituted without adjusting the recipe."},{"q":"How do I avoid watery ratatouille?","a":"Brown eggplant and zucchini in batches, avoid crowding the vegetables and finish uncovered. Reduce the tomato until juicy without free water; its moisture may require longer than the estimated 75 minutes."},{"q":"Can I make it the day before?","a":"Yes, if cooled in shallow containers and refrigerated within 2 hours, or 1 hour above 32 °C. The proposal is to store for 3 days at 4 °C or below and reheat to 74 °C; the vegetables will be softer."}]},"published":false,"editorial_status":"draft","content_html":"<p>This ratatouille combines diced eggplant, zucchini, red pepper and tomato in a vegetable stew. Browning the eggplant and zucchini separately helps control their texture before adding them to the softened onion, pepper and tomato. This is a stovetop proposal, rather than an oven-baked spiral of vegetable slices.</p><p>The proposal makes 4 generous side portions, with 20 minutes of preparation and about 55 minutes of cooking: 75 minutes in total. Vegetable moisture, dice size and pan width change the reduction time. Quantities, times and yield are estimates awaiting a kitchen test.</p>"},{"id":"81b88195-0907-5595-9524-aa50ee9b2d64","recipe_group_id":"0bbedb8a-3d06-41dd-8bfc-3dc1ebeac0a7","language":"fr","slug":"recette-ratatouille","public_path":"/fr/recette-ratatouille","source_url":null,"title":"Ratatouille de légumes en dés","excerpt":"Ratatouille pour 4 avec aubergine, courgette, poivron et tomate : légumes dorés par lots puis mijotés sans devenir une purée.","summary":"Cette ratatouille réunit aubergine, courgette, poivron rouge et tomate en dés dans un mijoté de légumes. Dorer séparément l'aubergine et la courgette aide à maîtriser leur texture avant de les réunir avec l'oignon, le poivron et la tomate. La fiche propose une version en cocotte, pas une spirale de rondelles au four.\n\nLa proposition donne 4 accompagnements généreux, avec 20 minutes de préparation et environ 55 de cuisson : 75 minutes au total. L'eau des légumes, la taille des dés et la largeur de la cocotte modifient le temps de réduction. Quantités, temps et rendement sont estimés et restent à vérifier en cuisine.","category":"Accompagnements","category_slug":"guarniciones","difficulty":"Facile","course":"Accompagnement","cuisine":"Française, proposition maison","prep_time_minutes":20,"cook_time_minutes":55,"total_time_minutes":75,"servings":4,"ingredients":[{"name":"aubergine avec peau, sans pédoncule","amount":"400","unit":"g","group":"Légumes"},{"name":"courgette avec peau, sans extrémités","amount":"400","unit":"g","group":"Légumes"},{"name":"poivron rouge épépiné","amount":"250","unit":"g","group":"Légumes"},{"name":"oignon épluché","amount":"200","unit":"g","group":"Légumes"},{"name":"tomate mûre sans pédoncule","amount":"600","unit":"g","group":"Légumes"},{"name":"ail épluché","amount":"12","unit":"g","group":"Légumes"},{"name":"huile d'olive","amount":"40","unit":"g, répartis","group":"Assaisonnement"},{"name":"sel fin","amount":"5","unit":"g","group":"Assaisonnement"},{"name":"thym séché","amount":"1","unit":"g","group":"Assaisonnement"},{"name":"poivre noir moulu","amount":"0.5","unit":"g","group":"Assaisonnement"},{"name":"basilic frais","amount":"8","unit":"g","group":"Finition"},{"name":"eau chaude","amount":"60","unit":"ml, seulement si nécessaire","group":"Correction de cuisson"}],"steps":[{"title":"Laver, peser et couper les légumes","content":"Laver les légumes et le basilic à l'eau courante. Retirer pédoncules, graines et parties abîmées ; peser les quantités comestibles indiquées. Couper aubergine et courgette en dés d'environ 2 cm, poivron et oignon en morceaux de 1–2 cm. Hacher tomate et ail séparément. Préparer une cocotte large à fond épais d'environ 28–30 cm, d'une capacité d'au moins 4 litres.","image_alt":"Ratatouille : légumes propres et coupés en dés avant cuisson","image_url":"/recetas/receta-de-ratatouille/paso-01.webp"},{"title":"Dorer l'aubergine par lots","content":"Chauffer 10 g d'huile dans la cocotte à feu moyen-vif et ajouter la moitié de l'aubergine. Dorer 7–8 minutes en remuant juste pour changer de face, jusqu'à des bords dorés et un début d'attendrissement. Réserver sur une assiette et recommencer avec 10 g d'huile et le reste d'aubergine. Ne pas empiler les morceaux ; s'ils rendent de l'eau, la laisser s'évaporer avant de poursuivre.","image_alt":"Ratatouille : dés d'aubergine dorant en une seule couche","image_url":"/recetas/receta-de-ratatouille/paso-02.webp"},{"title":"Faire sauter la courgette","content":"Ajouter 10 g d'huile et la courgette dans la même cocotte. Faire sauter environ 6 minutes à feu moyen-vif, jusqu'à ce que certaines faces soient dorées et le centre encore un peu ferme. Réserver avec l'aubergine. Ne pas encore saler ni remuer sans arrêt : il faut dorer les dés, pas les cuire dans leur eau.","image_alt":"Ratatouille : dés de courgette sautés et légèrement dorés","image_url":"/recetas/receta-de-ratatouille/paso-03.webp"},{"title":"Attendrir oignon et poivron","content":"Baisser à feu moyen, ajouter les 10 g d'huile restants, l'oignon et le poivron. Cuire 8–10 minutes en remuant de temps en temps, jusqu'à un oignon translucide et un poivron attendri. Si le fond accroche avant la fin, ajouter l'eau chaude par doses de 15 ml, jusqu'à 60 ml pour toute la recette, et décoller doucement sans récupérer les parties brûlées.","image_alt":"Ratatouille : oignon et poivron rouge s'attendrissant dans la cocotte","image_url":"/recetas/receta-de-ratatouille/paso-04.webp"},{"title":"Former la base de tomate","content":"Ajouter l'ail et remuer 30 secondes sans le laisser noircir. Incorporer les 600 g de tomate, 5 g de sel, 1 g de thym séché et 0,5 g de poivre. Cuire environ 5 minutes à feu moyen en remuant, jusqu'à ce que la tomate commence à se défaire et forme une base juteuse. Garder la cocotte découverte.","image_alt":"Ratatouille : tomate hachée, ail et thym formant la base du mijoté","image_url":"/recetas/receta-de-ratatouille/paso-05.webp"},{"title":"Réunir et terminer le mijoté","content":"Remettre aubergine et courgette avec leur jus dans la cocotte. Mélanger doucement et cuire à découvert à feu moyen-doux 15–18 minutes, en remuant depuis le fond de temps en temps. Le plat doit être juteux sans flaque d'eau, avec une aubergine tendre et des morceaux reconnaissables. Si la tomate est très aqueuse, prolonger de quelques minutes ; si le mélange sèche, utiliser l'eau de correction sans dépasser 60 ml. Le temps peut augmenter.","image_alt":"Ratatouille : tous les légumes en dés mijotant ensemble sans couvercle","image_url":"/recetas/receta-de-ratatouille/paso-06.webp"},{"title":"Ajouter le basilic et servir","content":"Éteindre, ajouter les 8 g de basilic déchiré et mélanger. Répartir en 4 accompagnements et servir chaud. Transférer les restes dans des récipients peu profonds et réfrigérer à 4 °C ou moins dans les 2 heures, ou dans 1 heure si la température dépasse 32 °C. Il est proposé de les consommer en 3 jours et de les réchauffer à au moins 74 °C au centre.","image_alt":"Ratatouille en dés terminée avec basilic frais, prête à servir","image_url":"/recetas/receta-de-ratatouille/paso-07.webp"}],"notes":"L'aubergine n'est ni salée ni trempée dans cette proposition ; le dorage est donc contrôlé par lots. Remplacer le poivron rouge par un autre poivron doux du même poids change goût et nutrition. Omettre le basilic modifie la finition ; ses 8 g sont inclus dans le calcul. La pomme de terre n'est pas proposée pour remplacer aubergine ou courgette, car elle modifierait temps et identité du plat. Les ingrédients ne contiennent pas d'allergènes courants, mais vérifier étiquettes et contaminations croisées. La texture sera plus souple le lendemain. Refroidir en récipients peu profonds, pas dans la grande cocotte ; conserver à 4 °C ou moins et consommer en 3 jours. Ne réchauffer que la portion à manger jusqu'à 74 °C et éviter les cycles répétés. Pour congeler, employer des contenants fermés pendant une durée proposée de 2 mois ; la courgette perdra de sa fermeté. Décongeler au réfrigérateur.","nutrition":{"saturated_fat_g":1.6,"sugar_g":14.8,"fat_g":11.1,"carbs_g":24.5,"calories":199.6,"fiber_g":8.2,"sodium_mg":508,"protein_g":5,"estimated":true,"serving_size":"1 des 4 accompagnements proposés","source":"USDA FoodData Central — SR Legacy, descarga JSON abril de 2018","source_url":"https://fdc.nal.usda.gov/download-datasets/","method":"Onze fiches de l'archive officielle SR Legacy vérifiées par identifiant FDC ; poids crus comestibles additionnés et divisés par 4. Toute l'huile, 40 g, et tout le sel, 5 g, sont comptés. L'eau de correction n'apporte pas d'énergie. Aucun poids final supposé n'est utilisé.","note":"Estimation informative, pas une analyse du plat fini. Variété, réduction de la tomate, huile restante et portions réelles peuvent modifier les valeurs. Quantités, temps et rendement à vérifier en cuisine.","inputs":[{"fdc_id":169228,"fdc_description":"Eggplant, raw","per_100g":{"saturated_fat_g":0.034,"sugar_g":3.53,"fat_g":0.18,"carbs_g":5.88,"calories":25,"fiber_g":3,"sodium_mg":2,"protein_g":0.98},"source_url":"https://fdc.nal.usda.gov/food-details/169228/nutrients","ingredient":"aubergine avec peau, sans pédoncule","edible_grams":400},{"fdc_id":169291,"fdc_description":"Squash, summer, zucchini, includes skin, raw","per_100g":{"sugar_g":2.5,"fat_g":0.32,"carbs_g":3.11,"calories":17,"fiber_g":1,"sodium_mg":8,"protein_g":1.21,"saturated_fat_g":0.084},"source_url":"https://fdc.nal.usda.gov/food-details/169291/nutrients","ingredient":"courgette avec peau, sans extrémités","edible_grams":400},{"fdc_id":170108,"fdc_description":"Peppers, sweet, red, raw","per_100g":{"fiber_g":2.1,"calories":26,"saturated_fat_g":0.059,"sodium_mg":4,"sugar_g":4.2,"carbs_g":6.03,"protein_g":0.99,"fat_g":0.3},"source_url":"https://fdc.nal.usda.gov/food-details/170108/nutrients","ingredient":"poivron rouge épépiné","edible_grams":250},{"fdc_id":170000,"fdc_description":"Onions, raw","per_100g":{"sugar_g":4.24,"fat_g":0.1,"carbs_g":9.34,"calories":40,"saturated_fat_g":0.042,"protein_g":1.1,"fiber_g":1.7,"sodium_mg":4},"source_url":"https://fdc.nal.usda.gov/food-details/170000/nutrients","ingredient":"oignon épluché","edible_grams":200},{"fdc_id":170457,"fdc_description":"Tomatoes, red, ripe, raw, year round average","per_100g":{"sugar_g":2.63,"carbs_g":3.89,"calories":18,"saturated_fat_g":0.028,"fat_g":0.2,"fiber_g":1.2,"sodium_mg":5,"protein_g":0.88},"source_url":"https://fdc.nal.usda.gov/food-details/170457/nutrients","ingredient":"tomate mûre sans pédoncule","edible_grams":600},{"fdc_id":169230,"fdc_description":"Garlic, raw","per_100g":{"carbs_g":33.1,"calories":149,"sugar_g":1,"saturated_fat_g":0.089,"fiber_g":2.1,"sodium_mg":17,"protein_g":6.36,"fat_g":0.5},"source_url":"https://fdc.nal.usda.gov/food-details/169230/nutrients","ingredient":"ail épluché","edible_grams":12},{"fdc_id":171413,"fdc_description":"Oil, olive, salad or cooking","per_100g":{"fat_g":100,"carbs_g":0,"calories":884,"sodium_mg":2,"protein_g":0,"saturated_fat_g":13.8,"fiber_g":0,"sugar_g":0},"source_url":"https://fdc.nal.usda.gov/food-details/171413/nutrients","ingredient":"huile d'olive","edible_grams":40},{"fdc_id":173468,"fdc_description":"Salt, table","per_100g":{"fiber_g":0,"sodium_mg":38800,"saturated_fat_g":0,"protein_g":0,"fat_g":0,"carbs_g":0,"calories":0,"sugar_g":0},"source_url":"https://fdc.nal.usda.gov/food-details/173468/nutrients","ingredient":"sel fin","edible_grams":5},{"fdc_id":170938,"fdc_description":"Spices, thyme, dried","per_100g":{"fat_g":7.43,"carbs_g":63.9,"calories":276,"protein_g":9.11,"sodium_mg":55,"saturated_fat_g":2.73,"fiber_g":37,"sugar_g":1.71},"source_url":"https://fdc.nal.usda.gov/food-details/170938/nutrients","ingredient":"thym séché","edible_grams":1},{"fdc_id":170931,"fdc_description":"Spices, pepper, black","per_100g":{"fat_g":3.26,"sugar_g":0.64,"carbs_g":64,"calories":251,"protein_g":10.4,"fiber_g":25.3,"sodium_mg":20,"saturated_fat_g":1.39},"source_url":"https://fdc.nal.usda.gov/food-details/170931/nutrients","ingredient":"poivre noir moulu","edible_grams":0.5},{"fdc_id":172232,"fdc_description":"Basil, fresh","per_100g":{"saturated_fat_g":0.041,"sugar_g":0.3,"fat_g":0.64,"carbs_g":2.65,"calories":23,"fiber_g":1.6,"sodium_mg":4,"protein_g":3.15},"source_url":"https://fdc.nal.usda.gov/food-details/172232/nutrients","ingredient":"basilic frais","edible_grams":8}]},"keywords":["ratatouille","ratatouille en dés","mijoté de légumes","ratatouille en cocotte"],"image_url":"/recetas/receta-de-ratatouille/portada.webp","gallery":[{"url":"/recetas/receta-de-ratatouille/portada.webp","alt":"Ratatouille d'aubergine, courgette, poivron et tomate en dés au basilic"}],"seo":{"title":"Ratatouille en dés : légumes en cocotte | Manual de Cocina","description":"Ratatouille pour 4 : dorer aubergine et courgette par lots, finir avec tomate et basilic. Étapes, temps estimés et conservation.","image_alt":"Ratatouille d'aubergine, courgette, poivron et tomate en dés au basilic","image_variants":["/recetas/receta-de-ratatouille/portada-1x1.webp","/recetas/receta-de-ratatouille/portada-4x3.webp","/recetas/receta-de-ratatouille/portada-16x9.webp"],"faq":[{"q":"La ratatouille doit-elle être faite en rondelles au four ?","a":"Non. Cette fiche propose des légumes en dés mijotés en cocotte. Une spirale de rondelles nécessite une autre coupe et d'autres temps ; elle ne se substitue pas sans adapter la recette."},{"q":"Comment éviter une ratatouille aqueuse ?","a":"Dorer aubergine et courgette par lots, ne pas entasser les légumes et terminer à découvert. Réduire la tomate jusqu'à un résultat juteux sans eau libre ; son eau peut demander plus que les 75 minutes estimées."},{"q":"Peut-on la préparer la veille ?","a":"Oui, en refroidissant dans des récipients peu profonds et en réfrigérant dans les 2 heures, ou 1 heure au-dessus de 32 °C. Il est proposé de conserver 3 jours à 4 °C ou moins et de réchauffer à 74 °C ; les légumes seront plus tendres."}]},"published":false,"editorial_status":"draft","content_html":"<p>Cette ratatouille réunit aubergine, courgette, poivron rouge et tomate en dés dans un mijoté de légumes. Dorer séparément l'aubergine et la courgette aide à maîtriser leur texture avant de les réunir avec l'oignon, le poivron et la tomate. La fiche propose une version en cocotte, pas une spirale de rondelles au four.</p><p>La proposition donne 4 accompagnements généreux, avec 20 minutes de préparation et environ 55 de cuisson : 75 minutes au total. L'eau des légumes, la taille des dés et la largeur de la cocotte modifient le temps de réduction. Quantités, temps et rendement sont estimés et restent à vérifier en cuisine.</p>"},{"id":"e0528e81-86a3-55e9-a4c9-e6036ce6470f","recipe_group_id":"0bbedb8a-3d06-41dd-8bfc-3dc1ebeac0a7","language":"it","slug":"ricetta-ratatouille","public_path":"/it/ricetta-ratatouille","source_url":null,"title":"Ratatouille di verdure a cubetti","excerpt":"Ratatouille per 4 con melanzana, zucchina, peperone e pomodoro: verdure dorate in più riprese e poi stufate senza ridurle in purea.","summary":"Questa ratatouille riunisce melanzana, zucchina, peperone rosso e pomodoro a cubetti in uno stufato di verdure. Dorare separatamente melanzana e zucchina aiuta a controllarne la consistenza prima di unirle a cipolla, peperone e pomodoro. La scheda propone una versione in casseruola, non una spirale di fette al forno.\n\nSi propongono 4 contorni abbondanti, con 20 minuti di preparazione e circa 55 di cottura: 75 minuti in totale. Acqua delle verdure, dimensioni del taglio e larghezza della casseruola cambiano il tempo di riduzione. Quantità, tempi e resa sono stimati e devono ancora essere verificati in cucina.","category":"Contorni","category_slug":"guarniciones","difficulty":"Facile","course":"Contorno","cuisine":"Francese, proposta casalinga","prep_time_minutes":20,"cook_time_minutes":55,"total_time_minutes":75,"servings":4,"ingredients":[{"name":"melanzana con buccia, senza picciolo","amount":"400","unit":"g","group":"Verdure"},{"name":"zucchina con buccia, senza estremità","amount":"400","unit":"g","group":"Verdure"},{"name":"peperone rosso senza semi","amount":"250","unit":"g","group":"Verdure"},{"name":"cipolla sbucciata","amount":"200","unit":"g","group":"Verdure"},{"name":"pomodoro maturo senza picciolo","amount":"600","unit":"g","group":"Verdure"},{"name":"aglio sbucciato","amount":"12","unit":"g","group":"Verdure"},{"name":"olio d'oliva","amount":"40","unit":"g, suddivisi","group":"Condimento"},{"name":"sale fino","amount":"5","unit":"g","group":"Condimento"},{"name":"timo secco","amount":"1","unit":"g","group":"Condimento"},{"name":"pepe nero macinato","amount":"0.5","unit":"g","group":"Condimento"},{"name":"basilico fresco","amount":"8","unit":"g","group":"Finitura"},{"name":"acqua calda","amount":"60","unit":"ml, solo se necessario","group":"Correzione della cottura"}],"steps":[{"title":"Lava, pesa e taglia le verdure","content":"Lava verdure e basilico sotto acqua corrente. Elimina piccioli, semi e parti rovinate; pesa le quantità edibili indicate. Taglia melanzana e zucchina in cubetti di circa 2 cm, peperone e cipolla in pezzi di 1–2 cm. Trita separatamente pomodoro e aglio. Prepara una casseruola larga dal fondo spesso di circa 28–30 cm e capacità di almeno 4 litri.","image_alt":"Ratatouille: verdure pulite e tagliate a cubetti prima della cottura","image_url":"/recetas/receta-de-ratatouille/paso-01.webp"},{"title":"Dora la melanzana in più riprese","content":"Scalda 10 g d'olio nella casseruola a fuoco medio-alto e aggiungi metà melanzana. Dora per 7–8 minuti, muovendo solo per cambiare lato, fino a bordi dorati e un inizio di ammorbidimento. Trasferisci in un piatto e ripeti con altri 10 g d'olio e la melanzana rimasta. Non sovrapporre i pezzi; se rilasciano acqua, lasciala evaporare prima di proseguire.","image_alt":"Ratatouille: cubetti di melanzana dorano in un solo strato","image_url":"/recetas/receta-de-ratatouille/paso-02.webp"},{"title":"Salta la zucchina","content":"Aggiungi 10 g d'olio e la zucchina nella stessa casseruola. Salta per circa 6 minuti a fuoco medio-alto, finché alcune facce sono dorate e il centro ancora resistente. Metti da parte con la melanzana. Non salare ancora né mescolare continuamente: l'obiettivo è dorare i cubetti, non lessarli nel loro liquido.","image_alt":"Ratatouille: cubetti di zucchina saltati e leggermente dorati","image_url":"/recetas/receta-de-ratatouille/paso-03.webp"},{"title":"Ammorbidisci cipolla e peperone","content":"Abbassa a fuoco medio e aggiungi i 10 g d'olio rimasti, cipolla e peperone. Cuoci per 8–10 minuti, mescolando ogni tanto, finché la cipolla è traslucida e il peperone morbido. Se il fondo attacca prima del tempo, aggiungi acqua calda in dosi di 15 ml, fino a 60 ml per tutta la ricetta, e stacca delicatamente senza raschiare parti bruciate.","image_alt":"Ratatouille: cipolla e peperone rosso si ammorbidiscono nella casseruola","image_url":"/recetas/receta-de-ratatouille/paso-04.webp"},{"title":"Forma la base di pomodoro","content":"Aggiungi l'aglio e mescola per 30 secondi senza farlo annerire. Unisci 600 g di pomodoro, 5 g di sale, 1 g di timo secco e 0,5 g di pepe. Cuoci circa 5 minuti a fuoco medio mescolando, finché il pomodoro comincia a disfarsi in una base succosa. Lascia la casseruola scoperta.","image_alt":"Ratatouille: pomodoro tritato, aglio e timo formano la base dello stufato","image_url":"/recetas/receta-de-ratatouille/paso-05.webp"},{"title":"Riunisci e termina lo stufato","content":"Rimetti melanzana e zucchina con i loro succhi nella casseruola. Mescola delicatamente e cuoci scoperto a fuoco medio-basso per 15–18 minuti, muovendo dal fondo ogni tanto. Deve essere succoso senza pozze d'acqua, con melanzana tenera e pezzi riconoscibili. Se il pomodoro è molto acquoso, prolunga di qualche minuto; se asciuga, usa parte dell'acqua di correzione senza superare 60 ml. Il tempo può aumentare.","image_alt":"Ratatouille: tutte le verdure a cubetti stufano insieme senza coperchio","image_url":"/recetas/receta-de-ratatouille/paso-06.webp"},{"title":"Aggiungi basilico e servi","content":"Spegni, unisci gli 8 g di basilico spezzettato e mescola. Dividi in 4 contorni e servi caldo. Trasferisci gli avanzi in contenitori bassi e refrigera a 4 °C o meno entro 2 ore, oppure 1 ora se l'ambiente supera 32 °C. Si propone di consumare in 3 giorni e riscaldare fino ad almeno 74 °C al centro.","image_alt":"Ratatouille a cubetti pronta con basilico fresco","image_url":"/recetas/receta-de-ratatouille/paso-07.webp"}],"notes":"La melanzana non viene salata né ammollata in questa proposta; la doratura si controlla in più riprese. Puoi sostituire il peperone rosso con un altro peperone dolce dello stesso peso, cambiando sapore e nutrizione. Omettere il basilico cambia la finitura; i suoi 8 g sono inclusi nel calcolo. La patata non è proposta al posto di melanzana o zucchina perché cambierebbe tempi e identità del piatto. Gli ingredienti non includono allergeni comuni, ma controlla etichette e contaminazione crociata. Il giorno dopo la consistenza sarà più morbida. Raffredda in contenitori bassi, non nella grande casseruola; conserva a 4 °C o meno e consuma in 3 giorni. Riscalda solo la porzione da mangiare fino a 74 °C ed evita cicli ripetuti. Per congelare usa contenitori chiusi per un periodo proposto di 2 mesi, sapendo che la zucchina perderà consistenza; scongela in frigorifero.","nutrition":{"saturated_fat_g":1.6,"sugar_g":14.8,"fat_g":11.1,"carbs_g":24.5,"calories":199.6,"fiber_g":8.2,"sodium_mg":508,"protein_g":5,"estimated":true,"serving_size":"1 dei 4 contorni proposti","source":"USDA FoodData Central — SR Legacy, descarga JSON abril de 2018","source_url":"https://fdc.nal.usda.gov/download-datasets/","method":"Undici schede dell'archivio ufficiale SR Legacy verificate tramite ID FDC; pesi edibili crudi sommati e divisi per 4. Si contano tutti i 40 g d'olio e 5 g di sale. L'acqua di correzione non fornisce energia. Non si usa un peso finale presunto.","note":"Stima informativa, non analisi del piatto finito. Varietà, riduzione del pomodoro, olio restante e porzioni reali possono modificare i valori. Quantità, tempi e resa attendono verifica in cucina.","inputs":[{"fdc_id":169228,"fdc_description":"Eggplant, raw","per_100g":{"saturated_fat_g":0.034,"sugar_g":3.53,"fat_g":0.18,"carbs_g":5.88,"calories":25,"fiber_g":3,"sodium_mg":2,"protein_g":0.98},"source_url":"https://fdc.nal.usda.gov/food-details/169228/nutrients","ingredient":"melanzana con buccia, senza picciolo","edible_grams":400},{"fdc_id":169291,"fdc_description":"Squash, summer, zucchini, includes skin, raw","per_100g":{"sugar_g":2.5,"fat_g":0.32,"carbs_g":3.11,"calories":17,"fiber_g":1,"sodium_mg":8,"protein_g":1.21,"saturated_fat_g":0.084},"source_url":"https://fdc.nal.usda.gov/food-details/169291/nutrients","ingredient":"zucchina con buccia, senza estremità","edible_grams":400},{"fdc_id":170108,"fdc_description":"Peppers, sweet, red, raw","per_100g":{"fiber_g":2.1,"calories":26,"saturated_fat_g":0.059,"sodium_mg":4,"sugar_g":4.2,"carbs_g":6.03,"protein_g":0.99,"fat_g":0.3},"source_url":"https://fdc.nal.usda.gov/food-details/170108/nutrients","ingredient":"peperone rosso senza semi","edible_grams":250},{"fdc_id":170000,"fdc_description":"Onions, raw","per_100g":{"sugar_g":4.24,"fat_g":0.1,"carbs_g":9.34,"calories":40,"saturated_fat_g":0.042,"protein_g":1.1,"fiber_g":1.7,"sodium_mg":4},"source_url":"https://fdc.nal.usda.gov/food-details/170000/nutrients","ingredient":"cipolla sbucciata","edible_grams":200},{"fdc_id":170457,"fdc_description":"Tomatoes, red, ripe, raw, year round average","per_100g":{"sugar_g":2.63,"carbs_g":3.89,"calories":18,"saturated_fat_g":0.028,"fat_g":0.2,"fiber_g":1.2,"sodium_mg":5,"protein_g":0.88},"source_url":"https://fdc.nal.usda.gov/food-details/170457/nutrients","ingredient":"pomodoro maturo senza picciolo","edible_grams":600},{"fdc_id":169230,"fdc_description":"Garlic, raw","per_100g":{"carbs_g":33.1,"calories":149,"sugar_g":1,"saturated_fat_g":0.089,"fiber_g":2.1,"sodium_mg":17,"protein_g":6.36,"fat_g":0.5},"source_url":"https://fdc.nal.usda.gov/food-details/169230/nutrients","ingredient":"aglio sbucciato","edible_grams":12},{"fdc_id":171413,"fdc_description":"Oil, olive, salad or cooking","per_100g":{"fat_g":100,"carbs_g":0,"calories":884,"sodium_mg":2,"protein_g":0,"saturated_fat_g":13.8,"fiber_g":0,"sugar_g":0},"source_url":"https://fdc.nal.usda.gov/food-details/171413/nutrients","ingredient":"olio d'oliva","edible_grams":40},{"fdc_id":173468,"fdc_description":"Salt, table","per_100g":{"fiber_g":0,"sodium_mg":38800,"saturated_fat_g":0,"protein_g":0,"fat_g":0,"carbs_g":0,"calories":0,"sugar_g":0},"source_url":"https://fdc.nal.usda.gov/food-details/173468/nutrients","ingredient":"sale fino","edible_grams":5},{"fdc_id":170938,"fdc_description":"Spices, thyme, dried","per_100g":{"fat_g":7.43,"carbs_g":63.9,"calories":276,"protein_g":9.11,"sodium_mg":55,"saturated_fat_g":2.73,"fiber_g":37,"sugar_g":1.71},"source_url":"https://fdc.nal.usda.gov/food-details/170938/nutrients","ingredient":"timo secco","edible_grams":1},{"fdc_id":170931,"fdc_description":"Spices, pepper, black","per_100g":{"fat_g":3.26,"sugar_g":0.64,"carbs_g":64,"calories":251,"protein_g":10.4,"fiber_g":25.3,"sodium_mg":20,"saturated_fat_g":1.39},"source_url":"https://fdc.nal.usda.gov/food-details/170931/nutrients","ingredient":"pepe nero macinato","edible_grams":0.5},{"fdc_id":172232,"fdc_description":"Basil, fresh","per_100g":{"saturated_fat_g":0.041,"sugar_g":0.3,"fat_g":0.64,"carbs_g":2.65,"calories":23,"fiber_g":1.6,"sodium_mg":4,"protein_g":3.15},"source_url":"https://fdc.nal.usda.gov/food-details/172232/nutrients","ingredient":"basilico fresco","edible_grams":8}]},"keywords":["ratatouille","ratatouille a cubetti","stufato di verdure","ratatouille in casseruola"],"image_url":"/recetas/receta-de-ratatouille/portada.webp","gallery":[{"url":"/recetas/receta-de-ratatouille/portada.webp","alt":"Ratatouille di melanzana, zucchina, peperone e pomodoro a cubetti con basilico"}],"seo":{"title":"Ratatouille a cubetti: verdure in casseruola | Manual de Cocina","description":"Ratatouille per 4: dora melanzana e zucchina in più riprese e termina con pomodoro e basilico. Passaggi, tempi stimati e conservazione.","image_alt":"Ratatouille di melanzana, zucchina, peperone e pomodoro a cubetti con basilico","image_variants":["/recetas/receta-de-ratatouille/portada-1x1.webp","/recetas/receta-de-ratatouille/portada-4x3.webp","/recetas/receta-de-ratatouille/portada-16x9.webp"],"faq":[{"q":"La ratatouille va fatta a fette nel forno?","a":"No. Questa scheda propone verdure a cubetti stufate in casseruola. Una spirale di fette richiede un altro taglio e altri tempi; non si sostituisce senza adattare la ricetta."},{"q":"Come evito una ratatouille acquosa?","a":"Dora melanzana e zucchina in più riprese, non affollare le verdure e termina scoperto. Riduci il pomodoro fino a un risultato succoso senza acqua libera; la sua umidità può richiedere più dei 75 minuti stimati."},{"q":"Posso prepararla il giorno prima?","a":"Sì, raffreddando in contenitori bassi e refrigerando entro 2 ore, o 1 ora oltre 32 °C. Si propone di conservare per 3 giorni a 4 °C o meno e riscaldare a 74 °C; le verdure saranno più morbide."}]},"published":false,"editorial_status":"draft","content_html":"<p>Questa ratatouille riunisce melanzana, zucchina, peperone rosso e pomodoro a cubetti in uno stufato di verdure. Dorare separatamente melanzana e zucchina aiuta a controllarne la consistenza prima di unirle a cipolla, peperone e pomodoro. La scheda propone una versione in casseruola, non una spirale di fette al forno.</p><p>Si propongono 4 contorni abbondanti, con 20 minuti di preparazione e circa 55 di cottura: 75 minuti in totale. Acqua delle verdure, dimensioni del taglio e larghezza della casseruola cambiano il tempo di riduzione. Quantità, tempi e resa sono stimati e devono ancora essere verificati in cucina.</p>"},{"id":"9eda2000-3d41-582f-b4fa-357bf6bc1b08","recipe_group_id":"0bbedb8a-3d06-41dd-8bfc-3dc1ebeac0a7","language":"ja","slug":"ラタトゥイユのレシピ","public_path":"/ja/ラタトゥイユのレシピ","source_url":null,"title":"角切り野菜のラタトゥイユ","excerpt":"なす、ズッキーニ、パプリカ、トマトのラタトゥイユ4人分。分けて焼き色を付け、形を残して煮込みます。","summary":"なす、ズッキーニ、赤パプリカ、トマトを角切りにして煮込むラタトゥイユです。なすとズッキーニを別々に焼いてから玉ねぎ、パプリカ、トマトと合わせ、食感を調整します。薄切り野菜をらせん状に並べるオーブン料理ではなく、鍋で作る提案です。\n\nたっぷりした付け合わせ4人分を想定し、準備20分、加熱約55分、合計75分を見込んでいます。野菜の水分、切り方、鍋の広さで煮詰め時間が変わります。分量、時間、出来上がり量は推定値で、調理試験による確認前です。","category":"付け合わせ","category_slug":"guarniciones","difficulty":"簡単","course":"付け合わせ","cuisine":"フランス料理、家庭向けの提案","prep_time_minutes":20,"cook_time_minutes":55,"total_time_minutes":75,"servings":4,"ingredients":[{"name":"なす（皮付き、へたを除く）","amount":"400","unit":"g","group":"野菜"},{"name":"ズッキーニ（皮付き、両端を除く）","amount":"400","unit":"g","group":"野菜"},{"name":"赤パプリカ（種を除く）","amount":"250","unit":"g","group":"野菜"},{"name":"玉ねぎ（皮をむく）","amount":"200","unit":"g","group":"野菜"},{"name":"熟したトマト（へたを除く）","amount":"600","unit":"g","group":"野菜"},{"name":"にんにく（皮をむく）","amount":"12","unit":"g","group":"野菜"},{"name":"オリーブ油","amount":"40","unit":"g、分けて使用","group":"調味料"},{"name":"細粒の塩","amount":"5","unit":"g","group":"調味料"},{"name":"乾燥タイム","amount":"1","unit":"g","group":"調味料"},{"name":"挽いた黒こしょう","amount":"0.5","unit":"g","group":"調味料"},{"name":"生のバジル","amount":"8","unit":"g","group":"仕上げ"},{"name":"熱湯","amount":"60","unit":"ml、必要な場合のみ","group":"加熱の調整"}],"steps":[{"title":"野菜を洗い、量って切る","content":"野菜とバジルを流水で洗います。へた、種、傷んだ部分を取り、記載された可食部の量を量ります。なすとズッキーニは約2 cm角、パプリカと玉ねぎは1–2 cmの大きさに切ります。トマトとにんにくは別々に刻みます。直径約28–30 cm、容量が少なくとも4リットルある、広い厚底鍋を用意します。","image_alt":"ラタトゥイユ：調理前の洗って角切りにした野菜","image_url":"/recetas/receta-de-ratatouille/paso-01.webp"},{"title":"なすを分けて焼く","content":"鍋に油10 gを入れて中強火で熱し、なすの半量を加えます。面を変える程度に動かしながら7–8分焼き、縁がきつね色で少し柔らかくなったら皿に取り出します。残りのなすと油10 gで繰り返します。重なるほど詰め込まず、水が出たら蒸発させてから進めます。","image_alt":"ラタトゥイユ：なすの角切りを重ねずに焼く","image_url":"/recetas/receta-de-ratatouille/paso-02.webp"},{"title":"ズッキーニを炒める","content":"同じ鍋に油10 gとズッキーニを加えます。中強火で約6分炒め、所々に焼き色が付き、中心にはまだ少し硬さがある状態でなすと一緒に取り出します。まだ塩を入れず、絶えずかき混ぜないでください。水分でゆでるのではなく、表面に焼き色を付けます。","image_alt":"ラタトゥイユ：軽く焼き色が付いたズッキーニの角切り","image_url":"/recetas/receta-de-ratatouille/paso-03.webp"},{"title":"玉ねぎとパプリカを柔らかくする","content":"中火にして残りの油10 g、玉ねぎ、パプリカを加えます。時々混ぜながら8–10分加熱し、玉ねぎが透き通りパプリカが柔らかくなるまで炒めます。先に底が付く場合は熱湯を15 mlずつ、レシピ全体で最大60 mlまで加えて優しくはがします。焦げた部分は削り取らないでください。","image_alt":"ラタトゥイユ：鍋で玉ねぎと赤パプリカを柔らかくする","image_url":"/recetas/receta-de-ratatouille/paso-04.webp"},{"title":"トマトのベースを作る","content":"にんにくを加えて30秒混ぜ、黒く焦がさないようにします。トマト600 g、塩5 g、乾燥タイム1 g、黒こしょう0.5 gを加えます。中火で混ぜながら約5分加熱し、トマトが崩れ始めて水分のあるベースになるまで煮ます。ふたはしません。","image_alt":"ラタトゥイユ：刻んだトマト、にんにく、タイムで煮込みのベースを作る","image_url":"/recetas/receta-de-ratatouille/paso-05.webp"},{"title":"合わせて煮込む","content":"なすとズッキーニを出た汁ごと鍋に戻します。優しく合わせ、ふたをせず中弱火で15–18分煮込み、時々底から混ぜます。水がたまらずしっとりして、なすが柔らかく、野菜の形が残ればよい状態です。トマトの水分が多ければ数分延長し、乾く場合は調整用の水を全体で60 ml以内に収めて加えます。時間が延びることがあります。","image_alt":"ラタトゥイユ：すべての角切り野菜をふたなしで一緒に煮込む","image_url":"/recetas/receta-de-ratatouille/paso-06.webp"},{"title":"バジルを加えて盛り付ける","content":"火を止め、ちぎったバジル8 gを混ぜます。付け合わせ4人分に分け、温かいうちに提供します。残りは浅い容器に移し、2時間以内、室温が32 °Cを超える場合は1時間以内に4 °C以下で冷蔵します。3日以内に食べ、中心が少なくとも74 °Cになるまで再加熱することを提案します。","image_alt":"生バジルを添えた角切りラタトゥイユの完成","image_url":"/recetas/receta-de-ratatouille/paso-07.webp"}],"notes":"この提案ではなすを塩漬けにしたり水に浸したりせず、分けて焼き色を付けます。赤パプリカを同じ重量の別の甘いパプリカに替えると、味と栄養は変わります。バジルを省くと仕上がりが変わり、栄養計算には8 gが含まれています。じゃがいもはなすやズッキーニの代用として提案していません。加熱時間と料理の意図が変わるためです。一般的なアレルゲンは材料に含まれませんが、表示と交差接触を確認してください。翌日は食感が柔らかくなります。大鍋ではなく浅い容器で冷却し、4 °C以下で保存して3日以内に食べます。食べる分だけ74 °Cまで再加熱し、加熱を繰り返さないでください。冷凍は密閉容器で2か月を目安に提案しますが、ズッキーニは柔らかくなります。冷蔵庫で解凍してください。","nutrition":{"saturated_fat_g":1.6,"sugar_g":14.8,"fat_g":11.1,"carbs_g":24.5,"calories":199.6,"fiber_g":8.2,"sodium_mg":508,"protein_g":5,"estimated":true,"serving_size":"付け合わせ4人分のうち1人分","source":"USDA FoodData Central — SR Legacy, descarga JSON abril de 2018","source_url":"https://fdc.nal.usda.gov/download-datasets/","method":"公式SR Legacyファイルの11件をFDC IDで確認しました。生の可食部重量から栄養を合計し4で割ります。油40 gと塩5 gは全量を計上します。調整用の水はエネルギーを加えません。推測した完成重量は使いません。","note":"参考の推定値であり、完成料理の分析ではありません。品種、トマトの煮詰まり方、残る油、実際の取り分け量で値は変わります。分量、時間、出来上がり量は調理試験による確認前です。","inputs":[{"fdc_id":169228,"fdc_description":"Eggplant, raw","per_100g":{"saturated_fat_g":0.034,"sugar_g":3.53,"fat_g":0.18,"carbs_g":5.88,"calories":25,"fiber_g":3,"sodium_mg":2,"protein_g":0.98},"source_url":"https://fdc.nal.usda.gov/food-details/169228/nutrients","ingredient":"なす（皮付き、へたを除く）","edible_grams":400},{"fdc_id":169291,"fdc_description":"Squash, summer, zucchini, includes skin, raw","per_100g":{"sugar_g":2.5,"fat_g":0.32,"carbs_g":3.11,"calories":17,"fiber_g":1,"sodium_mg":8,"protein_g":1.21,"saturated_fat_g":0.084},"source_url":"https://fdc.nal.usda.gov/food-details/169291/nutrients","ingredient":"ズッキーニ（皮付き、両端を除く）","edible_grams":400},{"fdc_id":170108,"fdc_description":"Peppers, sweet, red, raw","per_100g":{"fiber_g":2.1,"calories":26,"saturated_fat_g":0.059,"sodium_mg":4,"sugar_g":4.2,"carbs_g":6.03,"protein_g":0.99,"fat_g":0.3},"source_url":"https://fdc.nal.usda.gov/food-details/170108/nutrients","ingredient":"赤パプリカ（種を除く）","edible_grams":250},{"fdc_id":170000,"fdc_description":"Onions, raw","per_100g":{"sugar_g":4.24,"fat_g":0.1,"carbs_g":9.34,"calories":40,"saturated_fat_g":0.042,"protein_g":1.1,"fiber_g":1.7,"sodium_mg":4},"source_url":"https://fdc.nal.usda.gov/food-details/170000/nutrients","ingredient":"玉ねぎ（皮をむく）","edible_grams":200},{"fdc_id":170457,"fdc_description":"Tomatoes, red, ripe, raw, year round average","per_100g":{"sugar_g":2.63,"carbs_g":3.89,"calories":18,"saturated_fat_g":0.028,"fat_g":0.2,"fiber_g":1.2,"sodium_mg":5,"protein_g":0.88},"source_url":"https://fdc.nal.usda.gov/food-details/170457/nutrients","ingredient":"熟したトマト（へたを除く）","edible_grams":600},{"fdc_id":169230,"fdc_description":"Garlic, raw","per_100g":{"carbs_g":33.1,"calories":149,"sugar_g":1,"saturated_fat_g":0.089,"fiber_g":2.1,"sodium_mg":17,"protein_g":6.36,"fat_g":0.5},"source_url":"https://fdc.nal.usda.gov/food-details/169230/nutrients","ingredient":"にんにく（皮をむく）","edible_grams":12},{"fdc_id":171413,"fdc_description":"Oil, olive, salad or cooking","per_100g":{"fat_g":100,"carbs_g":0,"calories":884,"sodium_mg":2,"protein_g":0,"saturated_fat_g":13.8,"fiber_g":0,"sugar_g":0},"source_url":"https://fdc.nal.usda.gov/food-details/171413/nutrients","ingredient":"オリーブ油","edible_grams":40},{"fdc_id":173468,"fdc_description":"Salt, table","per_100g":{"fiber_g":0,"sodium_mg":38800,"saturated_fat_g":0,"protein_g":0,"fat_g":0,"carbs_g":0,"calories":0,"sugar_g":0},"source_url":"https://fdc.nal.usda.gov/food-details/173468/nutrients","ingredient":"細粒の塩","edible_grams":5},{"fdc_id":170938,"fdc_description":"Spices, thyme, dried","per_100g":{"fat_g":7.43,"carbs_g":63.9,"calories":276,"protein_g":9.11,"sodium_mg":55,"saturated_fat_g":2.73,"fiber_g":37,"sugar_g":1.71},"source_url":"https://fdc.nal.usda.gov/food-details/170938/nutrients","ingredient":"乾燥タイム","edible_grams":1},{"fdc_id":170931,"fdc_description":"Spices, pepper, black","per_100g":{"fat_g":3.26,"sugar_g":0.64,"carbs_g":64,"calories":251,"protein_g":10.4,"fiber_g":25.3,"sodium_mg":20,"saturated_fat_g":1.39},"source_url":"https://fdc.nal.usda.gov/food-details/170931/nutrients","ingredient":"挽いた黒こしょう","edible_grams":0.5},{"fdc_id":172232,"fdc_description":"Basil, fresh","per_100g":{"saturated_fat_g":0.041,"sugar_g":0.3,"fat_g":0.64,"carbs_g":2.65,"calories":23,"fiber_g":1.6,"sodium_mg":4,"protein_g":3.15},"source_url":"https://fdc.nal.usda.gov/food-details/172232/nutrients","ingredient":"生のバジル","edible_grams":8}]},"keywords":["ラタトゥイユ","角切りラタトゥイユ","野菜の煮込み","鍋で作るラタトゥイユ"],"image_url":"/recetas/receta-de-ratatouille/portada.webp","gallery":[{"url":"/recetas/receta-de-ratatouille/portada.webp","alt":"なす、ズッキーニ、パプリカ、トマトの角切りラタトゥイユとバジル"}],"seo":{"title":"角切り野菜のラタトゥイユ：鍋で作る方法 | Manual de Cocina","description":"ラタトゥイユ4人分。なすとズッキーニを分けて焼き、トマトとバジルで仕上げます。手順、推定時間、保存方法。","image_alt":"なす、ズッキーニ、パプリカ、トマトの角切りラタトゥイユとバジル","image_variants":["/recetas/receta-de-ratatouille/portada-1x1.webp","/recetas/receta-de-ratatouille/portada-4x3.webp","/recetas/receta-de-ratatouille/portada-16x9.webp"],"faq":[{"q":"ラタトゥイユは薄切りにしてオーブンで焼くものですか？","a":"必須ではありません。このレシピは角切り野菜を鍋で煮込む提案です。薄切りをらせん状に並べる場合は切り方と時間が変わるため、そのまま置き換えず調整が必要です。"},{"q":"水っぽくなるのを防ぐには？","a":"なすとズッキーニを分けて焼き、野菜を詰め込みすぎず、最後はふたをせず煮ます。トマトを水がたまらないしっとりした状態まで煮詰めます。水分量によっては推定75分より長くかかります。"},{"q":"前日に作れますか？","a":"はい。浅い容器で冷却し、2時間以内、32 °Cを超える場合は1時間以内に冷蔵します。4 °C以下で3日保存し74 °Cまで再加熱することを提案します。野菜はより柔らかくなります。"}]},"published":false,"editorial_status":"draft","content_html":"<p>なす、ズッキーニ、赤パプリカ、トマトを角切りにして煮込むラタトゥイユです。なすとズッキーニを別々に焼いてから玉ねぎ、パプリカ、トマトと合わせ、食感を調整します。薄切り野菜をらせん状に並べるオーブン料理ではなく、鍋で作る提案です。</p><p>たっぷりした付け合わせ4人分を想定し、準備20分、加熱約55分、合計75分を見込んでいます。野菜の水分、切り方、鍋の広さで煮詰め時間が変わります。分量、時間、出来上がり量は推定値で、調理試験による確認前です。</p>"},{"id":"f5974bf7-8ce6-5c14-8d06-5e3e740c8935","recipe_group_id":"0bbedb8a-3d06-41dd-8bfc-3dc1ebeac0a7","language":"pt","slug":"ratatouille-caseira","public_path":"/pt/ratatouille-caseira","source_url":null,"title":"Ratatouille de legumes em cubos","excerpt":"Ratatouille para 4 com berinjela, abobrinha, pimentão e tomate: legumes dourados em levas e cozidos juntos sem virar purê.","summary":"Esta ratatouille reúne berinjela, abobrinha, pimentão vermelho e tomate em cubos em um ensopado de legumes. Dourar separadamente berinjela e abobrinha ajuda a controlar a textura antes de juntar com cebola, pimentão e tomate. A ficha propõe uma versão na panela, não uma espiral de fatias no forno.\n\nA proposta rende 4 acompanhamentos generosos, com 20 minutos de preparo e cerca de 55 de cozimento: 75 minutos no total. Água dos legumes, tamanho do corte e largura da panela mudam o tempo de redução. Quantidades, tempos e rendimento são estimados e aguardam teste na cozinha.","category":"Acompanhamentos","category_slug":"guarniciones","difficulty":"Fácil","course":"Acompanhamento","cuisine":"Francesa, proposta caseira","prep_time_minutes":20,"cook_time_minutes":55,"total_time_minutes":75,"servings":4,"ingredients":[{"name":"berinjela com casca, sem talo","amount":"400","unit":"g","group":"Legumes"},{"name":"abobrinha com casca, sem pontas","amount":"400","unit":"g","group":"Legumes"},{"name":"pimentão vermelho sem sementes","amount":"250","unit":"g","group":"Legumes"},{"name":"cebola descascada","amount":"200","unit":"g","group":"Legumes"},{"name":"tomate maduro sem pedúnculo","amount":"600","unit":"g","group":"Legumes"},{"name":"alho descascado","amount":"12","unit":"g","group":"Legumes"},{"name":"azeite de oliva","amount":"40","unit":"g, dividido","group":"Tempero"},{"name":"sal fino","amount":"5","unit":"g","group":"Tempero"},{"name":"tomilho seco","amount":"1","unit":"g","group":"Tempero"},{"name":"pimenta-do-reino moída","amount":"0.5","unit":"g","group":"Tempero"},{"name":"manjericão fresco","amount":"8","unit":"g","group":"Finalização"},{"name":"água quente","amount":"60","unit":"ml, apenas se necessário","group":"Correção do cozimento"}],"steps":[{"title":"Lave, pese e corte os legumes","content":"Lave os legumes e o manjericão em água corrente. Retire talos, sementes e partes danificadas; pese as quantidades comestíveis indicadas. Corte berinjela e abobrinha em cubos de cerca de 2 cm; pimentão e cebola em pedaços de 1–2 cm. Pique tomate e alho separadamente. Prepare uma panela larga de fundo grosso com cerca de 28–30 cm e capacidade de pelo menos 4 litros.","image_alt":"Ratatouille: legumes limpos e cortados em cubos antes de cozinhar","image_url":"/recetas/receta-de-ratatouille/paso-01.webp"},{"title":"Doure a berinjela em levas","content":"Aqueça 10 g de azeite na panela em fogo médio-alto e coloque metade da berinjela. Doure 7–8 minutos, mexendo apenas para mudar de lado, até ter bordas douradas e começar a amaciar. Reserve em um prato e repita com outros 10 g de azeite e a berinjela restante. Não empilhe os pedaços; se soltarem água, deixe evaporar antes de continuar.","image_alt":"Ratatouille: cubos de berinjela dourando em uma só camada","image_url":"/recetas/receta-de-ratatouille/paso-02.webp"},{"title":"Salteie a abobrinha","content":"Junte 10 g de azeite à mesma panela e a abobrinha. Salteie cerca de 6 minutos em fogo médio-alto, até algumas faces dourarem e o centro ainda ter resistência. Reserve com a berinjela. Não coloque sal ainda nem mexa sem parar: a intenção é dourar, não cozinhar os cubos no próprio líquido.","image_alt":"Ratatouille: cubos de abobrinha salteados e levemente dourados","image_url":"/recetas/receta-de-ratatouille/paso-03.webp"},{"title":"Amacie cebola e pimentão","content":"Reduza para fogo médio e junte os 10 g restantes de azeite, a cebola e o pimentão. Cozinhe 8–10 minutos, mexendo de vez em quando, até a cebola ficar translúcida e o pimentão amaciar. Se o fundo grudar antes do ponto, acrescente água quente de 15 em 15 ml, até 60 ml para toda a receita, e solte com cuidado sem raspar partes queimadas.","image_alt":"Ratatouille: cebola e pimentão vermelho amaciando na panela","image_url":"/recetas/receta-de-ratatouille/paso-04.webp"},{"title":"Forme a base de tomate","content":"Junte o alho e mexa por 30 segundos, sem deixar escurecer. Acrescente os 600 g de tomate, 5 g de sal, 1 g de tomilho seco e 0,5 g de pimenta. Cozinhe cerca de 5 minutos em fogo médio, mexendo, até o tomate começar a desmanchar e formar uma base suculenta. Mantenha a panela destampada.","image_alt":"Ratatouille: tomate picado, alho e tomilho formando a base do ensopado","image_url":"/recetas/receta-de-ratatouille/paso-05.webp"},{"title":"Junte e termine o ensopado","content":"Devolva berinjela e abobrinha com seus líquidos à panela. Misture com cuidado e cozinhe destampado em fogo médio-baixo por 15–18 minutos, mexendo do fundo de vez em quando. Deve ficar suculento, sem poça de água, com berinjela macia e pedaços reconhecíveis. Se o tomate estiver muito aguado, prolongue alguns minutos; se secar, use parte da água de correção sem ultrapassar 60 ml. O tempo pode aumentar.","image_alt":"Ratatouille: todos os legumes em cubos cozinhando juntos sem tampa","image_url":"/recetas/receta-de-ratatouille/paso-06.webp"},{"title":"Junte manjericão e sirva","content":"Desligue, junte os 8 g de manjericão rasgado e misture. Divida em 4 acompanhamentos e sirva quente. Passe as sobras para recipientes rasos e refrigere a 4 °C ou menos em até 2 horas, ou 1 hora se o ambiente superar 32 °C. Propõe-se consumir em 3 dias e reaquecer até pelo menos 74 °C no centro.","image_alt":"Ratatouille em cubos finalizada com manjericão fresco, pronta para servir","image_url":"/recetas/receta-de-ratatouille/paso-07.webp"}],"notes":"A berinjela não é salgada nem deixada de molho nesta proposta; por isso o dourado é controlado em levas. Você pode trocar o pimentão vermelho por outro pimentão doce do mesmo peso, com mudança de sabor e nutrição. Omitir manjericão muda a finalização; seus 8 g estão no cálculo. Batata não é proposta para substituir berinjela ou abobrinha porque mudaria tempos e intenção do prato. Os ingredientes não incluem alérgenos comuns, mas confira rótulos e contaminação cruzada. A textura fica mais macia no dia seguinte. Resfrie em recipientes rasos, não na panela grande; conserve a 4 °C ou menos e consuma em 3 dias. Reaqueça só a porção que vai comer até 74 °C e evite ciclos repetidos. Para congelar, use recipientes fechados por um prazo proposto de 2 meses, sabendo que a abobrinha perderá firmeza; descongele na geladeira.","nutrition":{"saturated_fat_g":1.6,"sugar_g":14.8,"fat_g":11.1,"carbs_g":24.5,"calories":199.6,"fiber_g":8.2,"sodium_mg":508,"protein_g":5,"estimated":true,"serving_size":"1 de 4 acompanhamentos propostos","source":"USDA FoodData Central — SR Legacy, descarga JSON abril de 2018","source_url":"https://fdc.nal.usda.gov/download-datasets/","method":"Onze fichas do arquivo oficial SR Legacy verificadas pelo ID FDC; pesos comestíveis crus somados e divididos por 4. Contam-se todos os 40 g de azeite e 5 g de sal. A água de correção não fornece energia. Não se usa peso final presumido.","note":"Estimativa informativa, não análise do prato pronto. Variedade, redução do tomate, azeite restante e tamanho real das porções podem alterar os valores. Quantidades, tempos e rendimento aguardam teste na cozinha.","inputs":[{"fdc_id":169228,"fdc_description":"Eggplant, raw","per_100g":{"saturated_fat_g":0.034,"sugar_g":3.53,"fat_g":0.18,"carbs_g":5.88,"calories":25,"fiber_g":3,"sodium_mg":2,"protein_g":0.98},"source_url":"https://fdc.nal.usda.gov/food-details/169228/nutrients","ingredient":"berinjela com casca, sem talo","edible_grams":400},{"fdc_id":169291,"fdc_description":"Squash, summer, zucchini, includes skin, raw","per_100g":{"sugar_g":2.5,"fat_g":0.32,"carbs_g":3.11,"calories":17,"fiber_g":1,"sodium_mg":8,"protein_g":1.21,"saturated_fat_g":0.084},"source_url":"https://fdc.nal.usda.gov/food-details/169291/nutrients","ingredient":"abobrinha com casca, sem pontas","edible_grams":400},{"fdc_id":170108,"fdc_description":"Peppers, sweet, red, raw","per_100g":{"fiber_g":2.1,"calories":26,"saturated_fat_g":0.059,"sodium_mg":4,"sugar_g":4.2,"carbs_g":6.03,"protein_g":0.99,"fat_g":0.3},"source_url":"https://fdc.nal.usda.gov/food-details/170108/nutrients","ingredient":"pimentão vermelho sem sementes","edible_grams":250},{"fdc_id":170000,"fdc_description":"Onions, raw","per_100g":{"sugar_g":4.24,"fat_g":0.1,"carbs_g":9.34,"calories":40,"saturated_fat_g":0.042,"protein_g":1.1,"fiber_g":1.7,"sodium_mg":4},"source_url":"https://fdc.nal.usda.gov/food-details/170000/nutrients","ingredient":"cebola descascada","edible_grams":200},{"fdc_id":170457,"fdc_description":"Tomatoes, red, ripe, raw, year round average","per_100g":{"sugar_g":2.63,"carbs_g":3.89,"calories":18,"saturated_fat_g":0.028,"fat_g":0.2,"fiber_g":1.2,"sodium_mg":5,"protein_g":0.88},"source_url":"https://fdc.nal.usda.gov/food-details/170457/nutrients","ingredient":"tomate maduro sem pedúnculo","edible_grams":600},{"fdc_id":169230,"fdc_description":"Garlic, raw","per_100g":{"carbs_g":33.1,"calories":149,"sugar_g":1,"saturated_fat_g":0.089,"fiber_g":2.1,"sodium_mg":17,"protein_g":6.36,"fat_g":0.5},"source_url":"https://fdc.nal.usda.gov/food-details/169230/nutrients","ingredient":"alho descascado","edible_grams":12},{"fdc_id":171413,"fdc_description":"Oil, olive, salad or cooking","per_100g":{"fat_g":100,"carbs_g":0,"calories":884,"sodium_mg":2,"protein_g":0,"saturated_fat_g":13.8,"fiber_g":0,"sugar_g":0},"source_url":"https://fdc.nal.usda.gov/food-details/171413/nutrients","ingredient":"azeite de oliva","edible_grams":40},{"fdc_id":173468,"fdc_description":"Salt, table","per_100g":{"fiber_g":0,"sodium_mg":38800,"saturated_fat_g":0,"protein_g":0,"fat_g":0,"carbs_g":0,"calories":0,"sugar_g":0},"source_url":"https://fdc.nal.usda.gov/food-details/173468/nutrients","ingredient":"sal fino","edible_grams":5},{"fdc_id":170938,"fdc_description":"Spices, thyme, dried","per_100g":{"fat_g":7.43,"carbs_g":63.9,"calories":276,"protein_g":9.11,"sodium_mg":55,"saturated_fat_g":2.73,"fiber_g":37,"sugar_g":1.71},"source_url":"https://fdc.nal.usda.gov/food-details/170938/nutrients","ingredient":"tomilho seco","edible_grams":1},{"fdc_id":170931,"fdc_description":"Spices, pepper, black","per_100g":{"fat_g":3.26,"sugar_g":0.64,"carbs_g":64,"calories":251,"protein_g":10.4,"fiber_g":25.3,"sodium_mg":20,"saturated_fat_g":1.39},"source_url":"https://fdc.nal.usda.gov/food-details/170931/nutrients","ingredient":"pimenta-do-reino moída","edible_grams":0.5},{"fdc_id":172232,"fdc_description":"Basil, fresh","per_100g":{"saturated_fat_g":0.041,"sugar_g":0.3,"fat_g":0.64,"carbs_g":2.65,"calories":23,"fiber_g":1.6,"sodium_mg":4,"protein_g":3.15},"source_url":"https://fdc.nal.usda.gov/food-details/172232/nutrients","ingredient":"manjericão fresco","edible_grams":8}]},"keywords":["ratatouille","ratatouille em cubos","ensopado de legumes","ratatouille na panela"],"image_url":"/recetas/receta-de-ratatouille/portada.webp","gallery":[{"url":"/recetas/receta-de-ratatouille/portada.webp","alt":"Ratatouille de berinjela, abobrinha, pimentão e tomate em cubos com manjericão"}],"seo":{"title":"Ratatouille em cubos: legumes na panela | Manual de Cocina","description":"Ratatouille para 4: doure berinjela e abobrinha em levas e finalize com tomate e manjericão. Passos, tempos estimados e conservação.","image_alt":"Ratatouille de berinjela, abobrinha, pimentão e tomate em cubos com manjericão","image_variants":["/recetas/receta-de-ratatouille/portada-1x1.webp","/recetas/receta-de-ratatouille/portada-4x3.webp","/recetas/receta-de-ratatouille/portada-16x9.webp"],"faq":[{"q":"A ratatouille precisa ser feita em fatias no forno?","a":"Não. Esta ficha propõe legumes em cubos cozidos na panela. Uma espiral de fatias precisa de outro corte e outros tempos; não se troca sem ajustar a receita."},{"q":"Como evitar ratatouille aguada?","a":"Doure berinjela e abobrinha em levas, não amontoe os legumes e termine destampado. Reduza o tomate até ficar suculento sem água livre; a umidade pode exigir mais que os 75 minutos estimados."},{"q":"Posso preparar no dia anterior?","a":"Sim, se resfriar em recipientes rasos e refrigerar em até 2 horas, ou 1 hora acima de 32 °C. Propõe-se conservar 3 dias a 4 °C ou menos e reaquecer até 74 °C; os legumes ficarão mais macios."}]},"published":false,"editorial_status":"draft","content_html":"<p>Esta ratatouille reúne berinjela, abobrinha, pimentão vermelho e tomate em cubos em um ensopado de legumes. Dourar separadamente berinjela e abobrinha ajuda a controlar a textura antes de juntar com cebola, pimentão e tomate. A ficha propõe uma versão na panela, não uma espiral de fatias no forno.</p><p>A proposta rende 4 acompanhamentos generosos, com 20 minutos de preparo e cerca de 55 de cozimento: 75 minutos no total. Água dos legumes, tamanho do corte e largura da panela mudam o tempo de redução. Quantidades, tempos e rendimento são estimados e aguardam teste na cozinha.</p>"},{"id":"aa9afced-ac23-4e4b-afef-7d28bf2d7af6","recipe_group_id":"675e919b-02fe-4900-95c4-d56849fa0cb7","language":"es","slug":"receta-de-cordon-bleu","public_path":"/receta-de-cordon-bleu","source_url":"https://manualdecocina.com/receta-de-cordon-bleu/","title":"Cordon bleu de pollo al horno","excerpt":"Cordon bleu de pollo para 4, relleno de jamón y queso, con empanado al horno y comprobación de temperatura en el centro.","summary":"Esta propuesta de cordon bleu utiliza pechuga de pollo aplanada y enrollada alrededor de jamón cocido y queso tipo emmental. El empanado se termina al horno con una cantidad medida de aceite, sin freír en una sartén llena de grasa. La receta conserva la URL histórica de cordon bleu.\n\nSe proponen 4 piezas, una por persona, con 30 minutos de preparación, 15 de refrigeración, unos 30 de cocción y 5 de reposo: 80 minutos en total. El grosor del pollo, el diámetro del rollo y el horno pueden ampliar la cocción. Las cantidades, los tiempos y el rendimiento son estimados, pendientes de prueba de cocina; un termómetro confirma la seguridad, no el color del empanado.","category":"Platos principales","category_slug":"platos-principales","difficulty":"Media","course":"Plato principal","cuisine":"Europea, propuesta casera","prep_time_minutes":30,"cook_time_minutes":30,"total_time_minutes":80,"servings":4,"keywords":["cordon bleu","cordon bleu de pollo","pollo relleno de jamón y queso","cordon bleu al horno"],"ingredients":[{"name":"pechuga de pollo cruda sin piel ni hueso","amount":"800","unit":"g, en 4 piezas de unos 200 g","group":"Pollo y relleno"},{"name":"jamón cocido en lonchas, listo para comer","amount":"100","unit":"g","group":"Pollo y relleno"},{"name":"queso tipo emmental o suizo en lonchas","amount":"100","unit":"g","group":"Pollo y relleno"},{"name":"sal fina","amount":"3","unit":"g","group":"Sazonado"},{"name":"pimienta negra molida","amount":"0.5","unit":"g","group":"Sazonado"},{"name":"harina de trigo de uso común","amount":"60","unit":"g","group":"Empanado"},{"name":"huevo entero crudo sin cáscara","amount":"100","unit":"g, aprox. 2 huevos grandes","group":"Empanado"},{"name":"pan rallado seco sin sazonar","amount":"100","unit":"g","group":"Empanado"},{"name":"aceite de oliva","amount":"30","unit":"g","group":"Acabado al horno"}],"steps":[{"title":"Aplana el pollo y prepara la zona","content":"No laves el pollo crudo. Abre cada una de las 4 piezas de unos 200 g en libro sin separar las mitades y colócala entre dos hojas de papel de horno. Aplana con mazo o rodillo hasta unos 4–5 mm de grosor uniforme, sin romperla. Reparte los 3 g de sal y 0,5 g de pimienta entre las piezas. Usa tabla y utensilios separados de los alimentos listos para comer y limpia todo lo que toque pollo crudo.","image_alt":"Cordon bleu: pechuga cruda abierta y aplanada entre hojas de papel","image_url":"/recetas/receta-de-cordon-bleu/paso-01.webp"},{"title":"Rellena, enrolla y cierra","content":"Coloca 25 g de jamón y 25 g de queso en cada pieza, dejando un borde libre de unos 2 cm. Dobla los laterales y enrolla desde el extremo corto para encerrar el relleno. Cierra con palillos de madera sin pintar y cuenta cuántos usas para retirarlos después. Si hay una rotura que deja salir el relleno, acomoda el pollo para cubrirla; no dejes queso expuesto al borde.","image_alt":"Cordon bleu: pollo relleno de jamón y queso durante el enrollado","image_url":"/recetas/receta-de-cordon-bleu/paso-02.webp"},{"title":"Empana las cuatro piezas","content":"Prepara tres platos: los 60 g de harina, los 100 g de huevo batido y los 100 g de pan rallado. Pasa cada rollo por harina y sacude el exceso, después por huevo y finalmente por pan rallado, presionando suavemente para cubrir toda la superficie y los cierres. No viertas el huevo sobre el pan rallado. Desecha cualquier sobrante de empanado que haya tocado pollo crudo; no lo guardes.","image_alt":"Cordon bleu: empanado con platos separados de harina, huevo y pan rallado","image_url":"/recetas/receta-de-cordon-bleu/paso-03.webp"},{"title":"Refrigera y precalienta","content":"Pon las piezas empanadas en una bandeja limpia, cubre y refrigera 15 minutos a 4 °C o menos para que el empanado se asiente. Mientras, precalienta el horno a 200 °C con calor arriba y abajo, sin ventilador. Prepara otra bandeja con papel de horno. Esta refrigeración forma parte de los 80 minutos totales; no dejes los rollos esperando en la encimera.","image_alt":"Cordon bleu: cuatro rollos empanados cubiertos en la nevera","image_url":"/recetas/receta-de-cordon-bleu/paso-04.webp"},{"title":"Pincela y hornea","content":"Distribuye los 30 g de aceite sobre las cuatro piezas con una brocha limpia. Colócalas con el cierre hacia abajo, separadas al menos 3 cm, y hornea a media altura durante unos 25–30 minutos. A los 15 minutos, gira la bandeja si dora de forma desigual. No cortes una pieza para decidir si está hecha; pasa al control de temperatura. Si el empanado se oscurece antes de que el interior esté listo, cubre holgadamente con aluminio.","image_alt":"Cordon bleu: rollos empanados dorándose en una bandeja de horno","image_url":"/recetas/receta-de-cordon-bleu/paso-05.webp"},{"title":"Comprueba el centro con termómetro","content":"Introduce la sonda por un lateral hasta el centro del rollo, atravesando el pollo y llegando junto al relleno, sin tocar la bandeja. Comprueba cada pieza en más de un punto: tanto el pollo como el centro deben alcanzar al menos 74 °C. Si alguna queda por debajo, hornea 3–5 minutos más y vuelve a medir con la sonda limpia. El queso fundido o la corteza dorada no garantizan una cocción segura; prolongar puede superar el tiempo estimado.","image_alt":"Cordon bleu: sonda de termómetro comprobando el centro de un rollo horneado","image_url":"/recetas/receta-de-cordon-bleu/paso-06.webp"},{"title":"Reposa, retira los palillos y sirve","content":"Deja reposar 5 minutos en una superficie resistente al calor. Retira y cuenta todos los palillos antes de servir, avisa de cualquier pieza que no hayas podido recuperar y no sirvas esa porción hasta localizarla. Reparte una pieza por persona; corta con cuchillo limpio si quieres mostrar el relleno. Refrigera las sobras en recipientes bajos a 4 °C o menos dentro de 2 horas, o 1 hora si el ambiente supera 32 °C. Se propone consumirlas en 2 días y recalentar una sola vez hasta 74 °C en el centro.","image_alt":"Cordon bleu de pollo horneado y cortado, con jamón y queso en el interior","image_url":"/recetas/receta-de-cordon-bleu/paso-07.webp"}],"notes":"Contiene trigo, huevo y lácteos; el jamón y el pan rallado pueden añadir otros alérgenos según marca. No se propone aquí una versión sin gluten, sin huevo o sin lácteos porque cambia la cobertura y el relleno. Puedes emplear un queso semiduro que funda, manteniendo el peso, pero sabor, grasa y sodio cambiarán. No sustituyas jamón listo para comer por carne cruda sin otra formulación. Usa pechuga sin salmuera añadida para aproximarte al cálculo. Los palillos se cuentan y se retiran antes de servir. El pollo no se lava; separa zona cruda, platos y brochas, y lávate las manos. La estimación nutricional cuenta toda la harina, huevo, pan rallado y aceite preparados, aunque parte se deseche. No se recomienda congelar los rollos crudos dentro de esta ficha; para las sobras cocidas, enfría y refrigera rápidamente y consume en 2 días.","nutrition":{"fat_g":26.5,"calories":635,"saturated_fat_g":7.9,"sodium_mg":850,"protein_g":64,"sugar_g":1.9,"carbs_g":31,"fiber_g":1.9,"estimated":true,"serving_size":"1 de 4 piezas propuestas","source":"USDA FoodData Central — SR Legacy, descarga JSON abril de 2018","source_url":"https://fdc.nal.usda.gov/download-datasets/","method":"Nueve fichas USDA verificadas en el archivo oficial por FDC ID. Pesos comestibles crudos sumados y divididos entre 4; se cuenta toda la harina, huevo, pan rallado, aceite y sal, aunque parte del empanado se descarte. El jamón cocido se aproxima con Ham, sliced, regular; el queso con Cheese, swiss. No se incluye una guarnición adicional.","note":"Estimación conservadora, no análisis del plato terminado. Marca de jamón y queso, salmuera del pollo, tamaño real y cantidad de empanado que se adhiera cambian el resultado. Cantidades, tiempos y rendimiento pendientes de prueba de cocina.","inputs":[{"fdc_id":171077,"fdc_description":"Chicken, broiler or fryers, breast, skinless, boneless, meat only, raw","per_100g":{"fat_g":2.62,"calories":120,"saturated_fat_g":0.563,"sodium_mg":45,"protein_g":22.5,"sugar_g":0,"carbs_g":0,"fiber_g":0},"source_url":"https://fdc.nal.usda.gov/food-details/171077/nutrients","ingredient":"pechuga de pollo cruda sin piel ni hueso","edible_grams":800},{"fdc_id":173864,"fdc_description":"Ham, sliced, regular (approximately 11% fat)","per_100g":{"fiber_g":1.3,"saturated_fat_g":0.5,"sodium_mg":814,"fat_g":8.8,"carbs_g":3.63,"calories":164,"sugar_g":1,"protein_g":16.6},"source_url":"https://fdc.nal.usda.gov/food-details/173864/nutrients","ingredient":"jamón cocido en lonchas","edible_grams":100},{"fdc_id":171251,"fdc_description":"Cheese, swiss","per_100g":{"fat_g":31,"carbs_g":1.44,"calories":393,"sugar_g":0,"sodium_mg":187,"protein_g":27,"saturated_fat_g":18.2,"fiber_g":0},"source_url":"https://fdc.nal.usda.gov/food-details/171251/nutrients","ingredient":"queso tipo emmental o suizo","edible_grams":100},{"fdc_id":168936,"fdc_description":"Wheat flour, white, all-purpose, enriched, unbleached","per_100g":{"fiber_g":2.7,"fat_g":0.98,"carbs_g":76.3,"calories":364,"protein_g":10.3,"sodium_mg":2,"saturated_fat_g":0.155,"sugar_g":0.27},"source_url":"https://fdc.nal.usda.gov/food-details/168936/nutrients","ingredient":"harina de trigo","edible_grams":60},{"fdc_id":171287,"fdc_description":"Egg, whole, raw, fresh","per_100g":{"calories":143,"saturated_fat_g":3.13,"protein_g":12.6,"sodium_mg":142,"sugar_g":0.37,"fat_g":9.51,"carbs_g":0.72,"fiber_g":0},"source_url":"https://fdc.nal.usda.gov/food-details/171287/nutrients","ingredient":"huevo entero crudo sin cáscara","edible_grams":100},{"fdc_id":174928,"fdc_description":"Bread, crumbs, dry, grated, plain","per_100g":{"fat_g":5.3,"protein_g":13.4,"fiber_g":4.5,"sodium_mg":732,"carbs_g":72,"calories":395,"sugar_g":6.2,"saturated_fat_g":1.2},"source_url":"https://fdc.nal.usda.gov/food-details/174928/nutrients","ingredient":"pan rallado seco sin sazonar","edible_grams":100},{"fdc_id":171413,"fdc_description":"Oil, olive, salad or cooking","per_100g":{"fat_g":100,"carbs_g":0,"calories":884,"sodium_mg":2,"protein_g":0,"saturated_fat_g":13.8,"fiber_g":0,"sugar_g":0},"source_url":"https://fdc.nal.usda.gov/food-details/171413/nutrients","ingredient":"aceite de oliva","edible_grams":30},{"fdc_id":173468,"fdc_description":"Salt, table","per_100g":{"fiber_g":0,"sodium_mg":38800,"saturated_fat_g":0,"protein_g":0,"fat_g":0,"carbs_g":0,"calories":0,"sugar_g":0},"source_url":"https://fdc.nal.usda.gov/food-details/173468/nutrients","ingredient":"sal fina","edible_grams":3},{"fdc_id":170931,"fdc_description":"Spices, pepper, black","per_100g":{"fat_g":3.26,"sugar_g":0.64,"carbs_g":64,"calories":251,"protein_g":10.4,"fiber_g":25.3,"sodium_mg":20,"saturated_fat_g":1.39},"source_url":"https://fdc.nal.usda.gov/food-details/170931/nutrients","ingredient":"pimienta negra molida","edible_grams":0.5}]},"image_url":"/recetas/receta-de-cordon-bleu/portada.webp","gallery":[{"url":"/recetas/receta-de-cordon-bleu/portada.webp","alt":"Cordon bleu de pollo al horno, cortado para mostrar jamón y queso fundido"}],"seo":{"title":"Cordon bleu de pollo al horno: paso a paso | Manual de Cocina","description":"Cordon bleu para 4 con jamón, queso y empanado al horno. Aprende a cerrar el relleno y comprobar 74 °C en el centro antes de servir.","image_alt":"Cordon bleu de pollo al horno, cortado para mostrar jamón y queso fundido","image_variants":["/recetas/receta-de-cordon-bleu/portada-1x1.webp","/recetas/receta-de-cordon-bleu/portada-4x3.webp","/recetas/receta-de-cordon-bleu/portada-16x9.webp"],"faq":[{"q":"¿Cómo evito que se salga el queso?","a":"Aplana sin romper el pollo, deja un borde libre de 2 cm, dobla los laterales, cierra bien y coloca el rollo con el cierre abajo. El queso expuesto al borde se escapará con más facilidad; el reposo de 15 minutos en frío ayuda a asentar el empanado."},{"q":"¿Puedo fiarme del color dorado para saber si está hecho?","a":"No. Comprueba cada rollo con termómetro en varios puntos y verifica al menos 74 °C en el pollo y junto al relleno. El empanado puede dorarse antes de que el centro esté listo."},{"q":"¿Puedo preparar los rollos con antelación?","a":"La ficha solo incluye 15 minutos de refrigeración antes del horno. No se ha validado aquí un reposo prolongado ni la congelación de las piezas crudas. Guarda las sobras cocidas en frío y consúmelas en 2 días."}]},"published":false,"editorial_status":"draft","content_html":"<p>Esta propuesta de cordon bleu utiliza pechuga de pollo aplanada y enrollada alrededor de jamón cocido y queso tipo emmental. El empanado se termina al horno con una cantidad medida de aceite, sin freír en una sartén llena de grasa. La receta conserva la URL histórica de cordon bleu.</p><p>Se proponen 4 piezas, una por persona, con 30 minutos de preparación, 15 de refrigeración, unos 30 de cocción y 5 de reposo: 80 minutos en total. El grosor del pollo, el diámetro del rollo y el horno pueden ampliar la cocción. Las cantidades, los tiempos y el rendimiento son estimados, pendientes de prueba de cocina; un termómetro confirma la seguridad, no el color del empanado.</p>"},{"id":"eeea6f8e-55a0-5954-923c-142e9efd7e80","recipe_group_id":"675e919b-02fe-4900-95c4-d56849fa0cb7","language":"de","slug":"cordon-bleu-rezept","public_path":"/de/cordon-bleu-rezept","source_url":null,"title":"Hähnchen-Cordon-bleu aus dem Ofen","excerpt":"Hähnchen-Cordon-bleu für 4 mit Kochschinken und Käse, im Ofen gebacken und mit Temperaturkontrolle im Kern.","summary":"Dünn geklopfte Hähnchenbrust wird um Kochschinken und Käse nach Emmentaler Art gerollt, paniert und mit einer abgewogenen Ölmenge im Ofen gebacken. Die historische Cordon-bleu-URL bleibt erhalten.\n\nVorgeschlagen sind 4 Rollen, eine pro Person: 30 Minuten Vorbereitung, 15 Kühlen, etwa 30 Garen und 5 Ruhen, insgesamt 80 Minuten. Fleischdicke, Rollendurchmesser und Ofen können die Garzeit verlängern. Mengen, Zeiten und Ausbeute sind Schätzungen und noch nicht in der Küche erprobt. Die Sicherheit mit einem Thermometer prüfen, nicht anhand der Farbe der Panade.","category":"Hauptgerichte","category_slug":"platos-principales","difficulty":"Mittel","course":"Hauptgericht","cuisine":"Europäisch, Vorschlag für die Hausküche","prep_time_minutes":30,"cook_time_minutes":30,"total_time_minutes":80,"servings":4,"keywords":["Hähnchen Cordon bleu","Cordon bleu Ofen","Hähnchen Schinken Käse","Cordon bleu backen"],"ingredients":[{"name":"rohe Hähnchenbrust ohne Haut und Knochen","amount":"800","unit":"g, 4 Stücke zu etwa 200 g","group":"Hähnchen und Füllung"},{"name":"verzehrfertiger Kochschinken in Scheiben","amount":"100","unit":"g","group":"Hähnchen und Füllung"},{"name":"Emmentaler oder Schweizer Käse in Scheiben","amount":"100","unit":"g","group":"Hähnchen und Füllung"},{"name":"feines Salz","amount":"3","unit":"g","group":"Würzung"},{"name":"gemahlener schwarzer Pfeffer","amount":"0.5","unit":"g","group":"Würzung"},{"name":"Weizenmehl","amount":"60","unit":"g","group":"Panade"},{"name":"rohes Vollei ohne Schale","amount":"100","unit":"g, etwa 2 große Eier","group":"Panade"},{"name":"ungewürzte trockene Semmelbrösel","amount":"100","unit":"g","group":"Panade"},{"name":"Olivenöl","amount":"30","unit":"g","group":"Zum Backen"}],"steps":[{"title":"Hähnchen flach klopfen und Arbeitsplatz vorbereiten","content":"Rohes Hähnchen nicht waschen. Jedes der 4 Stücke zu etwa 200 g im Schmetterlingsschnitt öffnen, ohne die Hälften zu trennen, und zwischen zwei Bögen Backpapier legen. Mit Fleischklopfer oder Nudelholz gleichmäßig auf etwa 4–5 mm klopfen, ohne Risse. Die 3 g Salz und 0,5 g Pfeffer verteilen. Brett und Werkzeuge von verzehrfertigen Lebensmitteln trennen und alles reinigen, was rohes Hähnchen berührt.","image_alt":"Rohe geöffnete Hähnchenbrust zwischen Backpapier flach geklopft","image_url":"/recetas/receta-de-cordon-bleu/paso-01.webp"},{"title":"Füllen, rollen und schließen","content":"Je 25 g Schinken und 25 g Käse auflegen und etwa 2 cm Rand frei lassen. Seiten einschlagen und vom kurzen Ende aufrollen, sodass die Füllung eingeschlossen ist. Mit unbemalten Holzzahnstochern sichern und diese zum späteren Entfernen zählen. Risse durch Verschieben des Fleisches abdecken; am Rand darf kein Käse offen liegen.","image_alt":"Hähnchen wird mit Schinken und Käse aufgerollt","image_url":"/recetas/receta-de-cordon-bleu/paso-02.webp"},{"title":"Vier Rollen panieren","content":"Drei Teller mit 60 g Mehl, 100 g verquirltem Ei und 100 g Semmelbröseln bereitstellen. Jede Rolle in Mehl wenden und Überschuss abschütteln, dann durch Ei und Brösel ziehen. Die Brösel sanft auf Oberfläche und Verschlüsse drücken. Ei nicht in die Brösel gießen. Reste, die rohes Hähnchen berührt haben, entsorgen und nicht aufbewahren.","image_alt":"Panieren mit getrennten Tellern für Mehl, Ei und Brösel","image_url":"/recetas/receta-de-cordon-bleu/paso-03.webp"},{"title":"Kühlen und Ofen vorheizen","content":"Panierte Rollen auf ein sauberes Blech setzen, abdecken und 15 Minuten bei höchstens 4 °C kühlen. Währenddessen den Ofen auf 200 °C Ober-/Unterhitze ohne Umluft vorheizen. Ein weiteres Blech mit Backpapier belegen. Das Kühlen gehört zu den insgesamt 80 Minuten; die Rollen nicht auf der Arbeitsplatte warten lassen.","image_alt":"Vier abgedeckte panierte Hähnchenrollen im Kühlschrank","image_url":"/recetas/receta-de-cordon-bleu/paso-04.webp"},{"title":"Einölen und backen","content":"Die 30 g Öl mit einem sauberen Pinsel auf die vier Rollen verteilen. Mit Naht nach unten und mindestens 3 cm Abstand auflegen. Auf mittlerer Schiene etwa 25–30 Minuten backen. Nach 15 Minuten das Blech drehen, falls es ungleichmäßig bräunt. Zum Prüfen nicht anschneiden, sondern die Temperatur messen. Wird die Panade zu dunkel, bevor der Kern gar ist, locker mit Alufolie abdecken.","image_alt":"Panierte Hähnchenrollen werden auf einem Ofenblech goldbraun","image_url":"/recetas/receta-de-cordon-bleu/paso-05.webp"},{"title":"Kerntemperatur messen","content":"Die Sonde seitlich durch das Fleisch bis zur Mitte neben der Füllung einführen, ohne das Blech zu berühren. Jede Rolle an mehreren Stellen prüfen: Hähnchen und Kern müssen mindestens 74 °C erreichen. Bei zu niedriger Temperatur weitere 3–5 Minuten backen und mit sauberer Sonde erneut messen. Geschmolzener Käse und goldene Kruste beweisen keine sichere Garung; die geschätzte Zeit kann überschritten werden.","image_alt":"Thermometersonde prüft den Kern einer gebackenen Hähnchenrolle","image_url":"/recetas/receta-de-cordon-bleu/paso-06.webp"},{"title":"Ruhen lassen, Zahnstocher entfernen und servieren","content":"Auf hitzefester Unterlage 5 Minuten ruhen lassen. Alle Zahnstocher vor dem Servieren entfernen und zählen. Fehlt einer, die betroffene Rolle kennzeichnen und erst servieren, wenn er gefunden ist. Eine Rolle pro Person servieren; bei Bedarf mit sauberem Messer aufschneiden. Reste in flachen Behältern innerhalb von 2 Stunden bei höchstens 4 °C kühlen, bei Umgebungstemperatur über 32 °C innerhalb von 1 Stunde. Vorgeschlagen sind 2 Tage Lagerung und nur einmaliges Wiedererhitzen auf 74 °C im Kern.","image_alt":"Aufgeschnittenes gebackenes Cordon bleu mit Schinken und Käse","image_url":"/recetas/receta-de-cordon-bleu/paso-07.webp"}],"notes":"Enthält Weizen, Ei und Milchprodukte; Schinken und Brösel können je nach Marke weitere Allergene enthalten. Gluten-, ei- oder milchfreie Varianten sind hier nicht vorgesehen, da sie Panade und Füllung verändern. Ein schmelzender halbfester Käse kann bei gleichem Gewicht eingesetzt werden; Geschmack, Fett und Natrium ändern sich. Verzehrfertigen Schinken nicht ohne neue Rezeptur durch rohes Fleisch ersetzen. Für die Nährwertannäherung Hähnchen ohne zugesetzte Lake verwenden. Zahnstocher zählen und vor dem Servieren entfernen. Hähnchen nicht waschen; rohe Arbeitsbereiche, Teller und Pinsel trennen und Hände waschen. Die Schätzung zählt das gesamte vorbereitete Mehl, Ei, die Brösel und das Öl, auch bei Verlusten. Das Einfrieren roher Rollen wird in diesem Vorschlag nicht empfohlen. Gegarte Reste rasch abkühlen, kühlen und innerhalb von 2 Tagen verbrauchen.","nutrition":{"fat_g":26.5,"calories":635,"saturated_fat_g":7.9,"sodium_mg":850,"protein_g":64,"sugar_g":1.9,"carbs_g":31,"fiber_g":1.9,"estimated":true,"serving_size":"1 von 4 vorgeschlagenen Rollen","source":"USDA FoodData Central — SR Legacy, April 2018 JSON","source_url":"https://fdc.nal.usda.gov/download-datasets/","method":"Neun USDA-Datensätze anhand der FDC-ID im offiziellen Archiv geprüft. Rohe essbare Gewichte addiert und durch 4 geteilt. Mehl, Ei, Brösel, Öl und Salz werden vollständig gezählt, auch bei Panadenresten. Kochschinken wird mit Ham, sliced, regular und Käse mit Cheese, swiss angenähert. Ohne Beilage.","note":"Konservative Schätzung, keine Analyse des fertigen Gerichts. Schinken- und Käsemarke, Hähnchenlake, tatsächliche Größe und haftende Panade beeinflussen die Werte. Mengen, Zeiten und Ausbeute sind noch nicht in der Küche erprobt.","inputs":[{"fdc_id":171077,"fdc_description":"Chicken, broiler or fryers, breast, skinless, boneless, meat only, raw","per_100g":{"fat_g":2.62,"calories":120,"saturated_fat_g":0.563,"sodium_mg":45,"protein_g":22.5,"sugar_g":0,"carbs_g":0,"fiber_g":0},"source_url":"https://fdc.nal.usda.gov/food-details/171077/nutrients","ingredient":"rohe Hähnchenbrust ohne Haut und Knochen","edible_grams":800},{"fdc_id":173864,"fdc_description":"Ham, sliced, regular (approximately 11% fat)","per_100g":{"fiber_g":1.3,"saturated_fat_g":0.5,"sodium_mg":814,"fat_g":8.8,"carbs_g":3.63,"calories":164,"sugar_g":1,"protein_g":16.6},"source_url":"https://fdc.nal.usda.gov/food-details/173864/nutrients","ingredient":"verzehrfertiger Kochschinken in Scheiben","edible_grams":100},{"fdc_id":171251,"fdc_description":"Cheese, swiss","per_100g":{"fat_g":31,"carbs_g":1.44,"calories":393,"sugar_g":0,"sodium_mg":187,"protein_g":27,"saturated_fat_g":18.2,"fiber_g":0},"source_url":"https://fdc.nal.usda.gov/food-details/171251/nutrients","ingredient":"Emmentaler oder Schweizer Käse in Scheiben","edible_grams":100},{"fdc_id":168936,"fdc_description":"Wheat flour, white, all-purpose, enriched, unbleached","per_100g":{"fiber_g":2.7,"fat_g":0.98,"carbs_g":76.3,"calories":364,"protein_g":10.3,"sodium_mg":2,"saturated_fat_g":0.155,"sugar_g":0.27},"source_url":"https://fdc.nal.usda.gov/food-details/168936/nutrients","ingredient":"Weizenmehl","edible_grams":60},{"fdc_id":171287,"fdc_description":"Egg, whole, raw, fresh","per_100g":{"calories":143,"saturated_fat_g":3.13,"protein_g":12.6,"sodium_mg":142,"sugar_g":0.37,"fat_g":9.51,"carbs_g":0.72,"fiber_g":0},"source_url":"https://fdc.nal.usda.gov/food-details/171287/nutrients","ingredient":"rohes Vollei ohne Schale","edible_grams":100},{"fdc_id":174928,"fdc_description":"Bread, crumbs, dry, grated, plain","per_100g":{"fat_g":5.3,"protein_g":13.4,"fiber_g":4.5,"sodium_mg":732,"carbs_g":72,"calories":395,"sugar_g":6.2,"saturated_fat_g":1.2},"source_url":"https://fdc.nal.usda.gov/food-details/174928/nutrients","ingredient":"ungewürzte trockene Semmelbrösel","edible_grams":100},{"fdc_id":171413,"fdc_description":"Oil, olive, salad or cooking","per_100g":{"fat_g":100,"carbs_g":0,"calories":884,"sodium_mg":2,"protein_g":0,"saturated_fat_g":13.8,"fiber_g":0,"sugar_g":0},"source_url":"https://fdc.nal.usda.gov/food-details/171413/nutrients","ingredient":"Olivenöl","edible_grams":30},{"fdc_id":173468,"fdc_description":"Salt, table","per_100g":{"fiber_g":0,"sodium_mg":38800,"saturated_fat_g":0,"protein_g":0,"fat_g":0,"carbs_g":0,"calories":0,"sugar_g":0},"source_url":"https://fdc.nal.usda.gov/food-details/173468/nutrients","ingredient":"feines Salz","edible_grams":3},{"fdc_id":170931,"fdc_description":"Spices, pepper, black","per_100g":{"fat_g":3.26,"sugar_g":0.64,"carbs_g":64,"calories":251,"protein_g":10.4,"fiber_g":25.3,"sodium_mg":20,"saturated_fat_g":1.39},"source_url":"https://fdc.nal.usda.gov/food-details/170931/nutrients","ingredient":"gemahlener schwarzer Pfeffer","edible_grams":0.5}]},"image_url":"/recetas/receta-de-cordon-bleu/portada.webp","gallery":[{"url":"/recetas/receta-de-cordon-bleu/portada.webp","alt":"Ofen-Cordon-bleu aus Hähnchen, aufgeschnitten mit Schinken und geschmolzenem Käse"}],"seo":{"title":"Hähnchen-Cordon-bleu aus dem Ofen | Manual de Cocina","description":"Cordon bleu für 4 mit Kochschinken, Käse und Ofenpanade. Füllung sicher einschließen und vor dem Servieren 74 °C im Kern prüfen.","image_alt":"Ofen-Cordon-bleu aus Hähnchen, aufgeschnitten mit Schinken und geschmolzenem Käse","image_variants":["/recetas/receta-de-cordon-bleu/portada-1x1.webp","/recetas/receta-de-cordon-bleu/portada-4x3.webp","/recetas/receta-de-cordon-bleu/portada-16x9.webp"],"faq":[{"q":"Wie verhindere ich auslaufenden Käse?","a":"Das Hähnchen ohne Risse klopfen, 2 cm Rand lassen, Seiten einschlagen und fest schließen. Mit der Naht nach unten auflegen. Offenliegender Käse läuft leichter aus; 15 Minuten Kühlen festigen die Panade."},{"q":"Reicht eine goldene Panade als Garprobe?","a":"Nein. Jede Rolle an mehreren Stellen messen: im Fleisch und neben der Füllung mindestens 74 °C. Die Panade kann vor dem Kern bräunen."},{"q":"Kann ich die Rollen vorbereiten?","a":"Vorgesehen sind nur 15 Minuten Kühlen vor dem Backen. Längere Lagerung und Einfrieren roher Rollen sind hier nicht geprüft. Gegarte Reste kühlen und innerhalb von 2 Tagen verbrauchen."}]},"published":false,"editorial_status":"draft","content_html":"<p>Dünn geklopfte Hähnchenbrust wird um Kochschinken und Käse nach Emmentaler Art gerollt, paniert und mit einer abgewogenen Ölmenge im Ofen gebacken. Die historische Cordon-bleu-URL bleibt erhalten.</p><p>Vorgeschlagen sind 4 Rollen, eine pro Person: 30 Minuten Vorbereitung, 15 Kühlen, etwa 30 Garen und 5 Ruhen, insgesamt 80 Minuten. Fleischdicke, Rollendurchmesser und Ofen können die Garzeit verlängern. Mengen, Zeiten und Ausbeute sind Schätzungen und noch nicht in der Küche erprobt. Die Sicherheit mit einem Thermometer prüfen, nicht anhand der Farbe der Panade.</p>"},{"id":"1a4bb757-e88f-55a2-941a-17188419b5ce","recipe_group_id":"675e919b-02fe-4900-95c4-d56849fa0cb7","language":"en","slug":"cordon-bleu-recipe","public_path":"/en/cordon-bleu-recipe","source_url":null,"title":"Oven-baked chicken cordon bleu","excerpt":"Chicken cordon bleu for 4, filled with ham and cheese, breadcrumb-coated and oven-baked, with a temperature check at the centre.","summary":"Thin chicken breasts are rolled around cooked ham and Swiss-style cheese, then breadcrumb-coated and baked with a measured amount of oil. This version retains the historical cordon bleu URL.\n\nThe proposed yield is 4 rolls, one per person: 30 minutes preparation, 15 chilling, about 30 cooking and 5 resting, or 80 minutes overall. Thickness, roll diameter and the oven can increase cooking time. Quantities, timings and yield are estimates awaiting a kitchen trial. Check safety with a thermometer, rather than the crust colour.","category":"Main dishes","category_slug":"platos-principales","difficulty":"Medium","course":"Main course","cuisine":"European, home-style proposal","prep_time_minutes":30,"cook_time_minutes":30,"total_time_minutes":80,"servings":4,"keywords":["chicken cordon bleu","baked cordon bleu","ham and cheese chicken","oven-baked chicken"],"ingredients":[{"name":"raw boneless skinless chicken breast","amount":"800","unit":"g, in 4 pieces of about 200 g","group":"Chicken and filling"},{"name":"ready-to-eat sliced cooked ham","amount":"100","unit":"g","group":"Chicken and filling"},{"name":"sliced Emmental or Swiss-style cheese","amount":"100","unit":"g","group":"Chicken and filling"},{"name":"fine salt","amount":"3","unit":"g","group":"Seasoning"},{"name":"ground black pepper","amount":"0.5","unit":"g","group":"Seasoning"},{"name":"plain all-purpose wheat flour","amount":"60","unit":"g","group":"Breading"},{"name":"raw whole egg without shell","amount":"100","unit":"g, about 2 large eggs","group":"Breading"},{"name":"plain dry breadcrumbs","amount":"100","unit":"g","group":"Breading"},{"name":"olive oil","amount":"30","unit":"g","group":"Oven finish"}],"steps":[{"title":"Flatten the chicken and prepare the work area","content":"Do not wash raw chicken. Butterfly each of the 4 pieces of about 200 g, leaving the halves joined, and place between two sheets of baking paper. Flatten with a mallet or rolling pin to an even 4–5 mm without tearing. Divide the 3 g salt and 0.5 g pepper among the pieces. Keep the board and utensils separate from ready-to-eat food, and clean everything that touches raw chicken.","image_alt":"Raw butterflied chicken flattened between baking paper","image_url":"/recetas/receta-de-cordon-bleu/paso-01.webp"},{"title":"Fill, roll and close","content":"Place 25 g ham and 25 g cheese on each piece, leaving about 2 cm clear at the edges. Fold in the sides and roll from the short end to enclose the filling. Secure with plain unpainted wooden toothpicks, counting them for removal later. Cover any tear by adjusting the chicken; leave no cheese exposed at the edges.","image_alt":"Chicken being rolled around ham and cheese","image_url":"/recetas/receta-de-cordon-bleu/paso-02.webp"},{"title":"Bread all four rolls","content":"Set out three dishes containing 60 g flour, 100 g beaten egg and 100 g breadcrumbs. Coat each roll in flour, shake off excess, dip in egg, then press gently into breadcrumbs to cover the surface and seams. Do not pour egg into the breadcrumbs. Discard any leftover coating that has touched raw chicken; do not keep it.","image_alt":"Chicken breading with separate flour, egg and breadcrumb dishes","image_url":"/recetas/receta-de-cordon-bleu/paso-03.webp"},{"title":"Chill and preheat","content":"Put the breaded rolls on a clean tray, cover and refrigerate for 15 minutes at 4 °C or below to set the coating. Meanwhile preheat a conventional oven, top and bottom heat without fan, to 200 °C. Line another tray with baking paper. Chilling is included in the 80 minutes overall; do not leave rolls waiting on the counter.","image_alt":"Four covered breaded chicken rolls chilling in a refrigerator","image_url":"/recetas/receta-de-cordon-bleu/paso-04.webp"},{"title":"Brush with oil and bake","content":"Brush the four rolls with the 30 g oil using a clean brush. Arrange seam-side down at least 3 cm apart. Bake on the middle shelf for about 25–30 minutes, rotating the tray at 15 minutes if browning unevenly. Do not cut a roll to judge doneness; proceed to the temperature check. Loosely cover with foil if the crumbs darken before the centre is ready.","image_alt":"Breaded chicken rolls turning golden on an oven tray","image_url":"/recetas/receta-de-cordon-bleu/paso-05.webp"},{"title":"Check the centre with a thermometer","content":"Insert the probe through the side into the centre, through the chicken and beside the filling, without touching the tray. Check every roll in more than one spot: both chicken and centre must reach at least 74 °C. If a roll is cooler, bake for another 3–5 minutes and check again with a clean probe. Melted cheese or a golden crust does not prove safety; cooking may exceed the estimate.","image_alt":"Thermometer probe checking the centre of a baked chicken roll","image_url":"/recetas/receta-de-cordon-bleu/paso-06.webp"},{"title":"Rest, remove toothpicks and serve","content":"Rest for 5 minutes on a heatproof surface. Remove and count every toothpick before serving. If one is missing, identify the affected piece and do not serve it until found. Serve one roll per person; use a clean knife to reveal the filling if desired. Refrigerate leftovers in shallow containers at 4 °C or below within 2 hours, or 1 hour if the room exceeds 32 °C. The proposed limit is 2 days; reheat only once to 74 °C at the centre.","image_alt":"Baked chicken cordon bleu cut to show ham and cheese","image_url":"/recetas/receta-de-cordon-bleu/paso-07.webp"}],"notes":"Contains wheat, egg and dairy; ham and breadcrumbs may contain other allergens depending on the brand. Gluten-free, egg-free and dairy-free versions are not proposed here because they alter coating and filling. A melting semi-hard cheese can replace the cheese at the same weight, changing flavour, fat and sodium. Do not replace ready-to-eat ham with raw meat without reformulating. Use chicken without added brine to approximate the calculation. Count and remove toothpicks before serving. Do not wash chicken; separate raw preparation areas, dishes and brushes, and wash hands. The nutrition estimate includes all prepared flour, egg, breadcrumbs and oil even though some are discarded. Freezing the raw rolls is not recommended within this proposal. Cool cooked leftovers promptly, refrigerate and use within 2 days.","nutrition":{"fat_g":26.5,"calories":635,"saturated_fat_g":7.9,"sodium_mg":850,"protein_g":64,"sugar_g":1.9,"carbs_g":31,"fiber_g":1.9,"estimated":true,"serving_size":"1 of 4 proposed rolls","source":"USDA FoodData Central — SR Legacy, April 2018 JSON","source_url":"https://fdc.nal.usda.gov/download-datasets/","method":"Nine USDA records verified by FDC ID in the official archive. Raw edible weights are summed and divided by 4. All prepared flour, egg, breadcrumbs, oil and salt are counted even when coating is discarded. Cooked ham uses Ham, sliced, regular as a proxy and cheese uses Cheese, swiss. No side dish is included.","note":"Conservative estimate, not an analysis of the finished dish. Ham and cheese brands, chicken brine, actual size and adhered coating change the result. Quantities, timings and yield await a kitchen trial.","inputs":[{"fdc_id":171077,"fdc_description":"Chicken, broiler or fryers, breast, skinless, boneless, meat only, raw","per_100g":{"fat_g":2.62,"calories":120,"saturated_fat_g":0.563,"sodium_mg":45,"protein_g":22.5,"sugar_g":0,"carbs_g":0,"fiber_g":0},"source_url":"https://fdc.nal.usda.gov/food-details/171077/nutrients","ingredient":"raw boneless skinless chicken breast","edible_grams":800},{"fdc_id":173864,"fdc_description":"Ham, sliced, regular (approximately 11% fat)","per_100g":{"fiber_g":1.3,"saturated_fat_g":0.5,"sodium_mg":814,"fat_g":8.8,"carbs_g":3.63,"calories":164,"sugar_g":1,"protein_g":16.6},"source_url":"https://fdc.nal.usda.gov/food-details/173864/nutrients","ingredient":"ready-to-eat sliced cooked ham","edible_grams":100},{"fdc_id":171251,"fdc_description":"Cheese, swiss","per_100g":{"fat_g":31,"carbs_g":1.44,"calories":393,"sugar_g":0,"sodium_mg":187,"protein_g":27,"saturated_fat_g":18.2,"fiber_g":0},"source_url":"https://fdc.nal.usda.gov/food-details/171251/nutrients","ingredient":"sliced Emmental or Swiss-style cheese","edible_grams":100},{"fdc_id":168936,"fdc_description":"Wheat flour, white, all-purpose, enriched, unbleached","per_100g":{"fiber_g":2.7,"fat_g":0.98,"carbs_g":76.3,"calories":364,"protein_g":10.3,"sodium_mg":2,"saturated_fat_g":0.155,"sugar_g":0.27},"source_url":"https://fdc.nal.usda.gov/food-details/168936/nutrients","ingredient":"plain all-purpose wheat flour","edible_grams":60},{"fdc_id":171287,"fdc_description":"Egg, whole, raw, fresh","per_100g":{"calories":143,"saturated_fat_g":3.13,"protein_g":12.6,"sodium_mg":142,"sugar_g":0.37,"fat_g":9.51,"carbs_g":0.72,"fiber_g":0},"source_url":"https://fdc.nal.usda.gov/food-details/171287/nutrients","ingredient":"raw whole egg without shell","edible_grams":100},{"fdc_id":174928,"fdc_description":"Bread, crumbs, dry, grated, plain","per_100g":{"fat_g":5.3,"protein_g":13.4,"fiber_g":4.5,"sodium_mg":732,"carbs_g":72,"calories":395,"sugar_g":6.2,"saturated_fat_g":1.2},"source_url":"https://fdc.nal.usda.gov/food-details/174928/nutrients","ingredient":"plain dry breadcrumbs","edible_grams":100},{"fdc_id":171413,"fdc_description":"Oil, olive, salad or cooking","per_100g":{"fat_g":100,"carbs_g":0,"calories":884,"sodium_mg":2,"protein_g":0,"saturated_fat_g":13.8,"fiber_g":0,"sugar_g":0},"source_url":"https://fdc.nal.usda.gov/food-details/171413/nutrients","ingredient":"olive oil","edible_grams":30},{"fdc_id":173468,"fdc_description":"Salt, table","per_100g":{"fiber_g":0,"sodium_mg":38800,"saturated_fat_g":0,"protein_g":0,"fat_g":0,"carbs_g":0,"calories":0,"sugar_g":0},"source_url":"https://fdc.nal.usda.gov/food-details/173468/nutrients","ingredient":"fine salt","edible_grams":3},{"fdc_id":170931,"fdc_description":"Spices, pepper, black","per_100g":{"fat_g":3.26,"sugar_g":0.64,"carbs_g":64,"calories":251,"protein_g":10.4,"fiber_g":25.3,"sodium_mg":20,"saturated_fat_g":1.39},"source_url":"https://fdc.nal.usda.gov/food-details/170931/nutrients","ingredient":"ground black pepper","edible_grams":0.5}]},"image_url":"/recetas/receta-de-cordon-bleu/portada.webp","gallery":[{"url":"/recetas/receta-de-cordon-bleu/portada.webp","alt":"Oven-baked chicken cordon bleu cut to show ham and melted cheese"}],"seo":{"title":"Oven-baked chicken cordon bleu: step by step | Manual de Cocina","description":"Chicken cordon bleu for 4 with ham, cheese and oven-baked breadcrumbs. Close the filling and check 74 °C at the centre before serving.","image_alt":"Oven-baked chicken cordon bleu cut to show ham and melted cheese","image_variants":["/recetas/receta-de-cordon-bleu/portada-1x1.webp","/recetas/receta-de-cordon-bleu/portada-4x3.webp","/recetas/receta-de-cordon-bleu/portada-16x9.webp"],"faq":[{"q":"How can I stop the cheese leaking?","a":"Flatten without tearing, leave a 2 cm border, fold in the sides, close firmly and put the seam underneath. Cheese exposed at an edge leaks more easily; 15 minutes of chilling helps the coating set."},{"q":"Does a golden crust mean the chicken is cooked?","a":"No. Check every roll at several points with a thermometer: chicken and the area beside the filling must reach at least 74 °C. The crumbs can brown before the centre is ready."},{"q":"Can I prepare the rolls ahead?","a":"This proposal includes only 15 minutes of chilling before baking. Longer storage and freezing the raw rolls have not been validated here. Refrigerate cooked leftovers and use within 2 days."}]},"published":false,"editorial_status":"draft","content_html":"<p>Thin chicken breasts are rolled around cooked ham and Swiss-style cheese, then breadcrumb-coated and baked with a measured amount of oil. This version retains the historical cordon bleu URL.</p><p>The proposed yield is 4 rolls, one per person: 30 minutes preparation, 15 chilling, about 30 cooking and 5 resting, or 80 minutes overall. Thickness, roll diameter and the oven can increase cooking time. Quantities, timings and yield are estimates awaiting a kitchen trial. Check safety with a thermometer, rather than the crust colour.</p>"},{"id":"292b3cd1-9285-5378-b433-f067c6a7b9e3","recipe_group_id":"675e919b-02fe-4900-95c4-d56849fa0cb7","language":"fr","slug":"recette-cordon-bleu","public_path":"/fr/recette-cordon-bleu","source_url":null,"title":"Cordon bleu de poulet au four","excerpt":"Cordon bleu de poulet pour 4, garni de jambon et de fromage, pané au four avec contrôle de la température à cœur.","summary":"Des blancs de poulet aplatis sont roulés autour de jambon cuit et de fromage de type emmental, puis panés et cuits au four avec une quantité mesurée d’huile. Cette version conserve l’URL historique du cordon bleu.\n\nLe rendement proposé est de 4 rouleaux, un par personne : 30 minutes de préparation, 15 au froid, environ 30 de cuisson et 5 de repos, soit 80 minutes au total. L’épaisseur, le diamètre et le four peuvent allonger la cuisson. Quantités, durées et rendement sont estimés, en attente d’un essai en cuisine. La sécurité se vérifie au thermomètre, pas à la couleur de la panure.","category":"Plats principaux","category_slug":"platos-principales","difficulty":"Moyenne","course":"Plat principal","cuisine":"Européenne, proposition maison","prep_time_minutes":30,"cook_time_minutes":30,"total_time_minutes":80,"servings":4,"keywords":["cordon bleu poulet","cordon bleu au four","poulet jambon fromage","cordon bleu maison"],"ingredients":[{"name":"blanc de poulet cru sans peau ni os","amount":"800","unit":"g, 4 morceaux d’environ 200 g","group":"Poulet et garniture"},{"name":"jambon cuit en tranches prêt à consommer","amount":"100","unit":"g","group":"Poulet et garniture"},{"name":"emmental ou fromage suisse en tranches","amount":"100","unit":"g","group":"Poulet et garniture"},{"name":"sel fin","amount":"3","unit":"g","group":"Assaisonnement"},{"name":"poivre noir moulu","amount":"0.5","unit":"g","group":"Assaisonnement"},{"name":"farine de blé courante","amount":"60","unit":"g","group":"Panure"},{"name":"œuf entier cru sans coquille","amount":"100","unit":"g, environ 2 gros œufs","group":"Panure"},{"name":"chapelure sèche nature","amount":"100","unit":"g","group":"Panure"},{"name":"huile d’olive","amount":"30","unit":"g","group":"Finition au four"}],"steps":[{"title":"Aplatir le poulet et préparer le plan de travail","content":"Ne lavez pas le poulet cru. Ouvrez chacun des 4 morceaux d’environ 200 g en portefeuille sans détacher les moitiés. Placez entre deux feuilles de papier cuisson et aplatissez au maillet ou au rouleau à environ 4–5 mm, sans déchirer. Répartissez les 3 g de sel et 0,5 g de poivre. Séparez planche et ustensiles des aliments prêts à consommer et nettoyez tout ce qui touche le poulet cru.","image_alt":"Blanc de poulet cru ouvert et aplati entre des feuilles de papier","image_url":"/recetas/receta-de-cordon-bleu/paso-01.webp"},{"title":"Garnir, rouler et fermer","content":"Posez 25 g de jambon et 25 g de fromage sur chaque morceau en laissant environ 2 cm libres au bord. Repliez les côtés et roulez depuis le petit côté pour enfermer la garniture. Fixez avec des cure-dents en bois non peints et comptez-les pour les retirer ensuite. Recouvrez toute déchirure en ajustant le poulet ; ne laissez pas de fromage exposé au bord.","image_alt":"Poulet roulé autour de jambon et de fromage","image_url":"/recetas/receta-de-cordon-bleu/paso-02.webp"},{"title":"Paner les quatre rouleaux","content":"Préparez trois assiettes avec 60 g de farine, 100 g d’œuf battu et 100 g de chapelure. Passez chaque rouleau dans la farine, secouez l’excédent, puis dans l’œuf et la chapelure. Pressez doucement pour couvrir toute la surface et les fermetures. Ne versez pas l’œuf dans la chapelure. Jetez les restes de panure ayant touché le poulet cru ; ne les conservez pas.","image_alt":"Panure avec assiettes séparées de farine, œuf et chapelure","image_url":"/recetas/receta-de-cordon-bleu/paso-03.webp"},{"title":"Réfrigérer et préchauffer","content":"Placez les rouleaux panés sur une plaque propre, couvrez et réfrigérez 15 minutes à 4 °C ou moins pour fixer la panure. Préchauffez le four à 200 °C, chaleur traditionnelle haut et bas sans ventilation. Garnissez une autre plaque de papier cuisson. Ce passage au froid fait partie des 80 minutes ; ne laissez pas les rouleaux attendre sur le plan de travail.","image_alt":"Quatre rouleaux de poulet panés couverts au réfrigérateur","image_url":"/recetas/receta-de-cordon-bleu/paso-04.webp"},{"title":"Huiler et enfourner","content":"Répartissez les 30 g d’huile sur les quatre pièces avec un pinceau propre. Placez la fermeture dessous et espacez d’au moins 3 cm. Faites cuire à mi-hauteur environ 25–30 minutes. Tournez la plaque après 15 minutes si elle dore inégalement. Ne coupez pas une pièce pour juger la cuisson : passez au thermomètre. Si la panure fonce avant que le cœur soit prêt, couvrez lâchement d’aluminium.","image_alt":"Rouleaux panés dorant sur une plaque au four","image_url":"/recetas/receta-de-cordon-bleu/paso-05.webp"},{"title":"Vérifier la température à cœur","content":"Introduisez la sonde par le côté, à travers le poulet jusqu’au centre près de la garniture, sans toucher la plaque. Mesurez chaque pièce à plusieurs endroits : poulet et cœur doivent atteindre au moins 74 °C. Sinon, poursuivez 3–5 minutes et mesurez de nouveau avec une sonde propre. Fromage fondu et croûte dorée ne prouvent pas une cuisson sûre ; la durée estimée peut être dépassée.","image_alt":"Sonde du thermomètre au centre d’un rouleau de poulet cuit","image_url":"/recetas/receta-de-cordon-bleu/paso-06.webp"},{"title":"Laisser reposer, retirer les cure-dents et servir","content":"Laissez reposer 5 minutes sur une surface résistante à la chaleur. Retirez et comptez tous les cure-dents avant de servir. S’il en manque un, identifiez la pièce concernée et ne la servez pas avant de le retrouver. Servez une pièce par personne, découpée au couteau propre si souhaité. Réfrigérez les restes dans des contenants peu profonds à 4 °C ou moins sous 2 heures, ou 1 heure si la température ambiante dépasse 32 °C. Conservation proposée : 2 jours ; réchauffez une seule fois à 74 °C à cœur.","image_alt":"Cordon bleu de poulet cuit et coupé avec jambon et fromage","image_url":"/recetas/receta-de-cordon-bleu/paso-07.webp"}],"notes":"Contient blé, œuf et produits laitiers ; jambon et chapelure peuvent contenir d’autres allergènes selon la marque. Aucune variante sans gluten, œuf ou lait n’est proposée ici car elle modifie panure et garniture. Un fromage demi-dur fondant peut remplacer le fromage au même poids, mais goût, matières grasses et sodium changent. Ne remplacez pas le jambon prêt à consommer par de la viande crue sans nouvelle formulation. Choisissez du poulet sans saumure ajoutée pour approcher le calcul. Comptez et retirez les cure-dents avant de servir. Ne lavez pas le poulet ; séparez zone crue, assiettes et pinceaux, et lavez les mains. Le calcul compte toute la farine, l’œuf, la chapelure et l’huile préparés, même si une partie est jetée. La congélation des rouleaux crus n’est pas recommandée dans cette fiche. Refroidissez et réfrigérez rapidement les restes cuits et consommez sous 2 jours.","nutrition":{"fat_g":26.5,"calories":635,"saturated_fat_g":7.9,"sodium_mg":850,"protein_g":64,"sugar_g":1.9,"carbs_g":31,"fiber_g":1.9,"estimated":true,"serving_size":"1 des 4 rouleaux proposés","source":"USDA FoodData Central — SR Legacy, April 2018 JSON","source_url":"https://fdc.nal.usda.gov/download-datasets/","method":"Neuf fiches USDA vérifiées par FDC ID dans l’archive officielle. Poids crus comestibles additionnés et divisés par 4. Farine, œuf, chapelure, huile et sel sont intégralement comptés, même si de la panure est jetée. Le jambon est approché par Ham, sliced, regular et le fromage par Cheese, swiss. Sans accompagnement.","note":"Estimation conservatrice, pas une analyse du plat fini. Marques de jambon et de fromage, saumure du poulet, taille réelle et panure adhérente modifient le résultat. Quantités, durées et rendement en attente d’un essai en cuisine.","inputs":[{"fdc_id":171077,"fdc_description":"Chicken, broiler or fryers, breast, skinless, boneless, meat only, raw","per_100g":{"fat_g":2.62,"calories":120,"saturated_fat_g":0.563,"sodium_mg":45,"protein_g":22.5,"sugar_g":0,"carbs_g":0,"fiber_g":0},"source_url":"https://fdc.nal.usda.gov/food-details/171077/nutrients","ingredient":"blanc de poulet cru sans peau ni os","edible_grams":800},{"fdc_id":173864,"fdc_description":"Ham, sliced, regular (approximately 11% fat)","per_100g":{"fiber_g":1.3,"saturated_fat_g":0.5,"sodium_mg":814,"fat_g":8.8,"carbs_g":3.63,"calories":164,"sugar_g":1,"protein_g":16.6},"source_url":"https://fdc.nal.usda.gov/food-details/173864/nutrients","ingredient":"jambon cuit en tranches prêt à consommer","edible_grams":100},{"fdc_id":171251,"fdc_description":"Cheese, swiss","per_100g":{"fat_g":31,"carbs_g":1.44,"calories":393,"sugar_g":0,"sodium_mg":187,"protein_g":27,"saturated_fat_g":18.2,"fiber_g":0},"source_url":"https://fdc.nal.usda.gov/food-details/171251/nutrients","ingredient":"emmental ou fromage suisse en tranches","edible_grams":100},{"fdc_id":168936,"fdc_description":"Wheat flour, white, all-purpose, enriched, unbleached","per_100g":{"fiber_g":2.7,"fat_g":0.98,"carbs_g":76.3,"calories":364,"protein_g":10.3,"sodium_mg":2,"saturated_fat_g":0.155,"sugar_g":0.27},"source_url":"https://fdc.nal.usda.gov/food-details/168936/nutrients","ingredient":"farine de blé courante","edible_grams":60},{"fdc_id":171287,"fdc_description":"Egg, whole, raw, fresh","per_100g":{"calories":143,"saturated_fat_g":3.13,"protein_g":12.6,"sodium_mg":142,"sugar_g":0.37,"fat_g":9.51,"carbs_g":0.72,"fiber_g":0},"source_url":"https://fdc.nal.usda.gov/food-details/171287/nutrients","ingredient":"œuf entier cru sans coquille","edible_grams":100},{"fdc_id":174928,"fdc_description":"Bread, crumbs, dry, grated, plain","per_100g":{"fat_g":5.3,"protein_g":13.4,"fiber_g":4.5,"sodium_mg":732,"carbs_g":72,"calories":395,"sugar_g":6.2,"saturated_fat_g":1.2},"source_url":"https://fdc.nal.usda.gov/food-details/174928/nutrients","ingredient":"chapelure sèche nature","edible_grams":100},{"fdc_id":171413,"fdc_description":"Oil, olive, salad or cooking","per_100g":{"fat_g":100,"carbs_g":0,"calories":884,"sodium_mg":2,"protein_g":0,"saturated_fat_g":13.8,"fiber_g":0,"sugar_g":0},"source_url":"https://fdc.nal.usda.gov/food-details/171413/nutrients","ingredient":"huile d’olive","edible_grams":30},{"fdc_id":173468,"fdc_description":"Salt, table","per_100g":{"fiber_g":0,"sodium_mg":38800,"saturated_fat_g":0,"protein_g":0,"fat_g":0,"carbs_g":0,"calories":0,"sugar_g":0},"source_url":"https://fdc.nal.usda.gov/food-details/173468/nutrients","ingredient":"sel fin","edible_grams":3},{"fdc_id":170931,"fdc_description":"Spices, pepper, black","per_100g":{"fat_g":3.26,"sugar_g":0.64,"carbs_g":64,"calories":251,"protein_g":10.4,"fiber_g":25.3,"sodium_mg":20,"saturated_fat_g":1.39},"source_url":"https://fdc.nal.usda.gov/food-details/170931/nutrients","ingredient":"poivre noir moulu","edible_grams":0.5}]},"image_url":"/recetas/receta-de-cordon-bleu/portada.webp","gallery":[{"url":"/recetas/receta-de-cordon-bleu/portada.webp","alt":"Cordon bleu de poulet au four coupé pour montrer le jambon et le fromage fondu"}],"seo":{"title":"Cordon bleu de poulet au four, étape par étape | Manual de Cocina","description":"Cordon bleu pour 4 avec jambon, fromage et panure au four. Fermez la garniture et vérifiez 74 °C à cœur avant de servir.","image_alt":"Cordon bleu de poulet au four coupé pour montrer le jambon et le fromage fondu","image_variants":["/recetas/receta-de-cordon-bleu/portada-1x1.webp","/recetas/receta-de-cordon-bleu/portada-4x3.webp","/recetas/receta-de-cordon-bleu/portada-16x9.webp"],"faq":[{"q":"Comment éviter une fuite de fromage ?","a":"Aplatissez sans déchirer, laissez 2 cm de bord, repliez les côtés, fermez bien et placez la fermeture dessous. Le fromage exposé fuit plus facilement ; 15 minutes au froid fixent la panure."},{"q":"Une croûte dorée suffit-elle à prouver la cuisson ?","a":"Non. Mesurez chaque rouleau à plusieurs endroits et vérifiez au moins 74 °C dans le poulet et près de la garniture. La panure peut dorer avant le cœur."},{"q":"Peut-on préparer les rouleaux à l’avance ?","a":"La fiche prévoit seulement 15 minutes au froid avant le four. Un stockage prolongé ou la congélation à cru n’ont pas été validés ici. Réfrigérez les restes cuits et consommez sous 2 jours."}]},"published":false,"editorial_status":"draft","content_html":"<p>Des blancs de poulet aplatis sont roulés autour de jambon cuit et de fromage de type emmental, puis panés et cuits au four avec une quantité mesurée d’huile. Cette version conserve l’URL historique du cordon bleu.</p><p>Le rendement proposé est de 4 rouleaux, un par personne : 30 minutes de préparation, 15 au froid, environ 30 de cuisson et 5 de repos, soit 80 minutes au total. L’épaisseur, le diamètre et le four peuvent allonger la cuisson. Quantités, durées et rendement sont estimés, en attente d’un essai en cuisine. La sécurité se vérifie au thermomètre, pas à la couleur de la panure.</p>"},{"id":"8914841f-9d16-5c4b-a28c-6d4358e399ef","recipe_group_id":"675e919b-02fe-4900-95c4-d56849fa0cb7","language":"it","slug":"cordon-bleu-ricetta","public_path":"/it/cordon-bleu-ricetta","source_url":null,"title":"Cordon bleu di pollo al forno","excerpt":"Cordon bleu di pollo per 4, ripieno di prosciutto cotto e formaggio, impanato al forno con controllo della temperatura al cuore.","summary":"Il petto di pollo viene appiattito, arrotolato intorno a prosciutto cotto e formaggio tipo Emmental, impanato e cotto al forno con una quantità pesata di olio. Si conserva l’URL storica del cordon bleu.\n\nSi propongono 4 involtini, uno a persona: 30 minuti di preparazione, 15 in frigorifero, circa 30 di cottura e 5 di riposo, per 80 minuti totali. Spessore, diametro e forno possono allungare la cottura. Dosi, tempi e resa sono stime in attesa di prova in cucina. La sicurezza si controlla con il termometro, non dal colore della panatura.","category":"Secondi piatti","category_slug":"platos-principales","difficulty":"Media","course":"Secondo piatto","cuisine":"Europea, proposta casalinga","prep_time_minutes":30,"cook_time_minutes":30,"total_time_minutes":80,"servings":4,"keywords":["cordon bleu pollo","cordon bleu al forno","pollo prosciutto formaggio","cordon bleu casalingo"],"ingredients":[{"name":"petto di pollo crudo senza pelle né ossa","amount":"800","unit":"g, in 4 pezzi da circa 200 g","group":"Pollo e ripieno"},{"name":"prosciutto cotto a fette pronto al consumo","amount":"100","unit":"g","group":"Pollo e ripieno"},{"name":"Emmental o formaggio svizzero a fette","amount":"100","unit":"g","group":"Pollo e ripieno"},{"name":"sale fino","amount":"3","unit":"g","group":"Condimento"},{"name":"pepe nero macinato","amount":"0.5","unit":"g","group":"Condimento"},{"name":"farina di frumento comune","amount":"60","unit":"g","group":"Panatura"},{"name":"uovo intero crudo senza guscio","amount":"100","unit":"g, circa 2 uova grandi","group":"Panatura"},{"name":"pangrattato secco non condito","amount":"100","unit":"g","group":"Panatura"},{"name":"olio d’oliva","amount":"30","unit":"g","group":"Finitura al forno"}],"steps":[{"title":"Appiattire il pollo e preparare la zona","content":"Non lavare il pollo crudo. Aprire a libro ciascuno dei 4 pezzi da circa 200 g senza separare le metà, mettere fra due fogli di carta forno e appiattire con batticarne o matterello a circa 4–5 mm uniformi, senza strappi. Distribuire i 3 g di sale e 0,5 g di pepe. Tenere tagliere e utensili separati dai cibi pronti al consumo e pulire tutto ciò che tocca il pollo crudo.","image_alt":"Petto di pollo crudo aperto e appiattito fra carta forno","image_url":"/recetas/receta-de-cordon-bleu/paso-01.webp"},{"title":"Farcire, arrotolare e chiudere","content":"Mettere 25 g di prosciutto e 25 g di formaggio su ogni pezzo, lasciando circa 2 cm liberi ai bordi. Ripiegare i lati e arrotolare dal lato corto per racchiudere il ripieno. Fissare con stuzzicadenti di legno non verniciato, contando quelli usati per rimuoverli dopo. Coprire eventuali strappi sistemando la carne; non lasciare formaggio esposto ai bordi.","image_alt":"Pollo arrotolato con prosciutto cotto e formaggio","image_url":"/recetas/receta-de-cordon-bleu/paso-02.webp"},{"title":"Impanare i quattro involtini","content":"Preparare tre piatti con 60 g di farina, 100 g di uovo sbattuto e 100 g di pangrattato. Passare ogni involtino nella farina, scuotere l’eccesso, poi nell’uovo e nel pangrattato, premendo delicatamente su tutta la superficie e sulle chiusure. Non versare l’uovo nel pangrattato. Eliminare ogni avanzo di panatura che abbia toccato pollo crudo; non conservarlo.","image_alt":"Panatura con piatti separati di farina, uovo e pangrattato","image_url":"/recetas/receta-de-cordon-bleu/paso-03.webp"},{"title":"Refrigerare e preriscaldare","content":"Mettere su una teglia pulita, coprire e refrigerare 15 minuti a 4 °C o meno per fissare la panatura. Intanto preriscaldare il forno a 200 °C, statico con calore sopra e sotto, senza ventilazione. Rivestire un’altra teglia con carta forno. Il passaggio al freddo è incluso negli 80 minuti; non lasciare gli involtini sul piano di lavoro.","image_alt":"Quattro involtini impanati coperti in frigorifero","image_url":"/recetas/receta-de-cordon-bleu/paso-04.webp"},{"title":"Spennellare e cuocere","content":"Distribuire i 30 g di olio sui quattro pezzi con un pennello pulito. Posare con la chiusura sotto, distanti almeno 3 cm, e cuocere al ripiano centrale per circa 25–30 minuti. Dopo 15 minuti ruotare la teglia se la doratura è irregolare. Non tagliare per decidere la cottura: controllare la temperatura. Se la panatura scurisce prima che il centro sia pronto, coprire morbidamente con alluminio.","image_alt":"Involtini di pollo impanati che dorano in forno","image_url":"/recetas/receta-de-cordon-bleu/paso-05.webp"},{"title":"Misurare al cuore","content":"Inserire la sonda dal fianco fino al centro, attraversando il pollo e arrivando vicino al ripieno, senza toccare la teglia. Controllare ogni pezzo in più punti: pollo e centro devono raggiungere almeno 74 °C. Se la temperatura è inferiore, cuocere altri 3–5 minuti e rimisurare con sonda pulita. Formaggio fuso e crosta dorata non garantiscono sicurezza; si può superare il tempo stimato.","image_alt":"Sonda del termometro al cuore di un involtino cotto","image_url":"/recetas/receta-de-cordon-bleu/paso-06.webp"},{"title":"Riposare, rimuovere gli stuzzicadenti e servire","content":"Lasciare riposare 5 minuti su una superficie resistente al calore. Togliere e contare tutti gli stuzzicadenti prima di servire. Se ne manca uno, segnalare il pezzo interessato e non servirlo finché non è stato trovato. Servire un pezzo a persona e tagliare con coltello pulito, se desiderato. Refrigerare gli avanzi in contenitori bassi a 4 °C o meno entro 2 ore, oppure 1 ora se l’ambiente supera 32 °C. Si propone di consumare entro 2 giorni e riscaldare una sola volta a 74 °C al centro.","image_alt":"Cordon bleu cotto e tagliato con prosciutto e formaggio","image_url":"/recetas/receta-de-cordon-bleu/paso-07.webp"}],"notes":"Contiene frumento, uovo e latticini; prosciutto e pangrattato possono contenere altri allergeni secondo la marca. Non si propongono versioni senza glutine, uovo o latte, perché cambiano panatura e ripieno. Un formaggio semiduro fondente può sostituire il formaggio allo stesso peso, cambiando sapore, grassi e sodio. Non sostituire il prosciutto pronto al consumo con carne cruda senza una nuova formulazione. Usare pollo senza salamoia aggiunta per avvicinarsi al calcolo. Contare e rimuovere gli stuzzicadenti. Non lavare il pollo; separare zona cruda, piatti e pennelli e lavare le mani. La stima conta tutta la farina, l’uovo, il pangrattato e l’olio preparati anche se parte viene eliminata. Non si raccomanda di congelare gli involtini crudi in questa scheda. Raffreddare e refrigerare rapidamente gli avanzi cotti e consumare entro 2 giorni.","nutrition":{"fat_g":26.5,"calories":635,"saturated_fat_g":7.9,"sodium_mg":850,"protein_g":64,"sugar_g":1.9,"carbs_g":31,"fiber_g":1.9,"estimated":true,"serving_size":"1 dei 4 involtini proposti","source":"USDA FoodData Central — SR Legacy, April 2018 JSON","source_url":"https://fdc.nal.usda.gov/download-datasets/","method":"Nove schede USDA verificate tramite FDC ID nell’archivio ufficiale. Pesi crudi edibili sommati e divisi per 4; tutta la farina, uovo, pangrattato, olio e sale vengono conteggiati anche con scarti. Prosciutto approssimato con Ham, sliced, regular e formaggio con Cheese, swiss. Nessun contorno incluso.","note":"Stima conservativa, non analisi del piatto finito. Marca di prosciutto e formaggio, salamoia del pollo, dimensioni reali e panatura aderente cambiano il risultato. Dosi, tempi e resa in attesa di prova in cucina.","inputs":[{"fdc_id":171077,"fdc_description":"Chicken, broiler or fryers, breast, skinless, boneless, meat only, raw","per_100g":{"fat_g":2.62,"calories":120,"saturated_fat_g":0.563,"sodium_mg":45,"protein_g":22.5,"sugar_g":0,"carbs_g":0,"fiber_g":0},"source_url":"https://fdc.nal.usda.gov/food-details/171077/nutrients","ingredient":"petto di pollo crudo senza pelle né ossa","edible_grams":800},{"fdc_id":173864,"fdc_description":"Ham, sliced, regular (approximately 11% fat)","per_100g":{"fiber_g":1.3,"saturated_fat_g":0.5,"sodium_mg":814,"fat_g":8.8,"carbs_g":3.63,"calories":164,"sugar_g":1,"protein_g":16.6},"source_url":"https://fdc.nal.usda.gov/food-details/173864/nutrients","ingredient":"prosciutto cotto a fette pronto al consumo","edible_grams":100},{"fdc_id":171251,"fdc_description":"Cheese, swiss","per_100g":{"fat_g":31,"carbs_g":1.44,"calories":393,"sugar_g":0,"sodium_mg":187,"protein_g":27,"saturated_fat_g":18.2,"fiber_g":0},"source_url":"https://fdc.nal.usda.gov/food-details/171251/nutrients","ingredient":"Emmental o formaggio svizzero a fette","edible_grams":100},{"fdc_id":168936,"fdc_description":"Wheat flour, white, all-purpose, enriched, unbleached","per_100g":{"fiber_g":2.7,"fat_g":0.98,"carbs_g":76.3,"calories":364,"protein_g":10.3,"sodium_mg":2,"saturated_fat_g":0.155,"sugar_g":0.27},"source_url":"https://fdc.nal.usda.gov/food-details/168936/nutrients","ingredient":"farina di frumento comune","edible_grams":60},{"fdc_id":171287,"fdc_description":"Egg, whole, raw, fresh","per_100g":{"calories":143,"saturated_fat_g":3.13,"protein_g":12.6,"sodium_mg":142,"sugar_g":0.37,"fat_g":9.51,"carbs_g":0.72,"fiber_g":0},"source_url":"https://fdc.nal.usda.gov/food-details/171287/nutrients","ingredient":"uovo intero crudo senza guscio","edible_grams":100},{"fdc_id":174928,"fdc_description":"Bread, crumbs, dry, grated, plain","per_100g":{"fat_g":5.3,"protein_g":13.4,"fiber_g":4.5,"sodium_mg":732,"carbs_g":72,"calories":395,"sugar_g":6.2,"saturated_fat_g":1.2},"source_url":"https://fdc.nal.usda.gov/food-details/174928/nutrients","ingredient":"pangrattato secco non condito","edible_grams":100},{"fdc_id":171413,"fdc_description":"Oil, olive, salad or cooking","per_100g":{"fat_g":100,"carbs_g":0,"calories":884,"sodium_mg":2,"protein_g":0,"saturated_fat_g":13.8,"fiber_g":0,"sugar_g":0},"source_url":"https://fdc.nal.usda.gov/food-details/171413/nutrients","ingredient":"olio d’oliva","edible_grams":30},{"fdc_id":173468,"fdc_description":"Salt, table","per_100g":{"fiber_g":0,"sodium_mg":38800,"saturated_fat_g":0,"protein_g":0,"fat_g":0,"carbs_g":0,"calories":0,"sugar_g":0},"source_url":"https://fdc.nal.usda.gov/food-details/173468/nutrients","ingredient":"sale fino","edible_grams":3},{"fdc_id":170931,"fdc_description":"Spices, pepper, black","per_100g":{"fat_g":3.26,"sugar_g":0.64,"carbs_g":64,"calories":251,"protein_g":10.4,"fiber_g":25.3,"sodium_mg":20,"saturated_fat_g":1.39},"source_url":"https://fdc.nal.usda.gov/food-details/170931/nutrients","ingredient":"pepe nero macinato","edible_grams":0.5}]},"image_url":"/recetas/receta-de-cordon-bleu/portada.webp","gallery":[{"url":"/recetas/receta-de-cordon-bleu/portada.webp","alt":"Cordon bleu di pollo al forno tagliato con prosciutto e formaggio fuso"}],"seo":{"title":"Cordon bleu di pollo al forno: tutti i passaggi | Manual de Cocina","description":"Cordon bleu per 4 con prosciutto, formaggio e panatura al forno. Chiudi il ripieno e verifica 74 °C al cuore prima di servire.","image_alt":"Cordon bleu di pollo al forno tagliato con prosciutto e formaggio fuso","image_variants":["/recetas/receta-de-cordon-bleu/portada-1x1.webp","/recetas/receta-de-cordon-bleu/portada-4x3.webp","/recetas/receta-de-cordon-bleu/portada-16x9.webp"],"faq":[{"q":"Come evitare che il formaggio esca?","a":"Appiattire senza strappi, lasciare 2 cm di bordo, ripiegare i lati e chiudere bene con la giunzione sotto. Il formaggio esposto fuoriesce più facilmente; 15 minuti al freddo fissano la panatura."},{"q":"La doratura basta a capire se è cotto?","a":"No. Misurare ogni involtino in vari punti: almeno 74 °C nel pollo e accanto al ripieno. La panatura può dorare prima del centro."},{"q":"Si possono preparare in anticipo?","a":"La scheda include solo 15 minuti in frigorifero prima del forno. Non sono stati validati riposo prolungato o congelamento a crudo. Refrigerare gli avanzi cotti e consumare entro 2 giorni."}]},"published":false,"editorial_status":"draft","content_html":"<p>Il petto di pollo viene appiattito, arrotolato intorno a prosciutto cotto e formaggio tipo Emmental, impanato e cotto al forno con una quantità pesata di olio. Si conserva l’URL storica del cordon bleu.</p><p>Si propongono 4 involtini, uno a persona: 30 minuti di preparazione, 15 in frigorifero, circa 30 di cottura e 5 di riposo, per 80 minuti totali. Spessore, diametro e forno possono allungare la cottura. Dosi, tempi e resa sono stime in attesa di prova in cucina. La sicurezza si controlla con il termometro, non dal colore della panatura.</p>"},{"id":"3ce1e3c6-0409-5356-ba77-1c97a929a42f","recipe_group_id":"675e919b-02fe-4900-95c4-d56849fa0cb7","language":"ja","slug":"コルドンブルーのレシピ","public_path":"/ja/コルドンブルーのレシピ","source_url":null,"title":"鶏肉のコルドンブルー、オーブン焼き","excerpt":"4人分の鶏肉のコルドンブルー。加熱済みハムとチーズを包み、パン粉を付けてオーブンで焼き、中心温度を確認します。","summary":"薄くのばした鶏むね肉で加熱済みハムとエメンタール系チーズを巻き、パン粉を付けます。計量した油を塗ってオーブンで焼く案で、歴史的なコルドンブルーのURLを維持します。\n\n提案する出来上がりは4本で、1人1本です。準備30分、冷蔵15分、加熱約30分、休ませる時間5分、合計80分。肉の厚さ、巻いた直径、オーブンによって加熱が長くなります。分量、時間、出来上がり量は推定で、実際の調理試験は未実施です。衣の色ではなく温度計で安全を確認してください。","category":"主菜","category_slug":"platos-principales","difficulty":"中級","course":"主菜","cuisine":"ヨーロッパ風の家庭料理案","prep_time_minutes":30,"cook_time_minutes":30,"total_time_minutes":80,"servings":4,"keywords":["鶏肉のコルドンブルー","コルドンブルー オーブン","ハム チーズ 鶏肉","コルドンブルー 作り方"],"ingredients":[{"name":"皮と骨のない生の鶏むね肉","amount":"800","unit":"g、約200 gのもの4枚","group":"鶏肉と詰め物"},{"name":"そのまま食べられる加熱済みハムの薄切り","amount":"100","unit":"g","group":"鶏肉と詰め物"},{"name":"エメンタールまたはスイス系チーズの薄切り","amount":"100","unit":"g","group":"鶏肉と詰め物"},{"name":"細粒の塩","amount":"3","unit":"g","group":"味付け"},{"name":"粗びきではない黒こしょう","amount":"0.5","unit":"g","group":"味付け"},{"name":"一般的な小麦粉","amount":"60","unit":"g","group":"衣"},{"name":"殻を除いた生の全卵","amount":"100","unit":"g、大きい卵約2個","group":"衣"},{"name":"味付けのない乾燥パン粉","amount":"100","unit":"g","group":"衣"},{"name":"オリーブ油","amount":"30","unit":"g","group":"オーブン焼き用"}],"steps":[{"title":"鶏肉をのばして作業場所を整える","content":"生の鶏肉は洗いません。約200 gの肉4枚をそれぞれ、両側を切り離さずに観音開きにします。オーブン用紙2枚ではさみ、肉たたきや麺棒で破らずに厚さ約4–5 mmに均一にのばします。塩3 gとこしょう0.5 gを分配します。そのまま食べる食品とはまな板や道具を分け、生の鶏肉に触れたものをすべて洗浄します。","image_alt":"オーブン用紙にはさんで開き、薄くのばした生の鶏むね肉","image_url":"/recetas/receta-de-cordon-bleu/paso-01.webp"},{"title":"詰め物を包んで閉じる","content":"各肉にハム25 gとチーズ25 gをのせ、縁を約2 cm空けます。左右を内側に折り、短辺から巻いて詰め物を包みます。無塗装の木製つまようじで留め、後で抜けるよう使用本数を数えます。裂け目は肉を調整して覆い、縁にチーズが露出しないようにします。","image_alt":"ハムとチーズを鶏肉で巻いているところ","image_url":"/recetas/receta-de-cordon-bleu/paso-02.webp"},{"title":"4本に衣を付ける","content":"小麦粉60 g、溶き卵100 g、パン粉100 gを別々の皿に用意します。肉を小麦粉にまぶして余分を落とし、卵、パン粉の順に付けます。軽く押し、表面と閉じ目を覆います。卵をパン粉へ注がないでください。生の鶏肉に触れた衣の残りは保存せず捨てます。","image_alt":"小麦粉、卵、パン粉を別皿にした衣付け","image_url":"/recetas/receta-de-cordon-bleu/paso-03.webp"},{"title":"冷蔵して予熱する","content":"衣を付けた肉を清潔なトレーに置いて覆い、4 °C以下で15分冷蔵して衣を落ち着かせます。その間にファンを使わない上下加熱のオーブンを200 °Cに予熱し、別の天板にオーブン用紙を敷きます。冷蔵時間も合計80分に含まれます。肉を調理台で待たせないでください。","image_alt":"覆って冷蔵庫に入れた衣付きの鶏肉4本","image_url":"/recetas/receta-de-cordon-bleu/paso-04.webp"},{"title":"油を塗って焼く","content":"清潔な刷毛で油30 gを4本に分けて塗ります。閉じ目を下にし、少なくとも3 cm空け、オーブン中段で約25–30分焼きます。15分で焼きむらがあれば天板の向きを変えます。切って焼けたか判断せず、次の温度確認へ進みます。中心が焼ける前に衣が濃く色付いたら、アルミホイルをふんわりかぶせます。","image_alt":"オーブンの天板できつね色に焼ける鶏肉","image_url":"/recetas/receta-de-cordon-bleu/paso-05.webp"},{"title":"温度計で中心を確認する","content":"側面から肉を通して中心の詰め物付近にプローブを差し、天板に触れないようにします。各肉を複数の位置で測り、鶏肉も中心も少なくとも74 °Cに達していることを確認します。低ければさらに3–5分焼き、清潔なプローブで再測定します。溶けたチーズやきつね色の衣は安全の証拠ではなく、推定時間を超える場合があります。","image_alt":"焼いた鶏肉の中心に温度計のプローブを差す","image_url":"/recetas/receta-de-cordon-bleu/paso-06.webp"},{"title":"休ませてつまようじを抜き、盛り付ける","content":"耐熱面で5分休ませます。提供前につまようじをすべて抜き、数を照合します。不足した場合は該当する肉を特定し、見つかるまで提供しません。1人1本を盛り、断面を見せる場合は清潔な包丁で切ります。残りは浅い容器に入れ、2時間以内、室温が32 °Cを超える場合は1時間以内に4 °C以下で冷蔵します。保存は2日以内を提案し、再加熱は1回だけ、中心を74 °Cにします。","image_alt":"切った鶏肉のコルドンブルーのハムとチーズ","image_url":"/recetas/receta-de-cordon-bleu/paso-07.webp"}],"notes":"小麦、卵、乳製品を含みます。ハムとパン粉は製品によりほかのアレルゲンを含むため表示を確認してください。衣や詰め物が変わるため、グルテン、卵、乳不使用版はここでは提案しません。溶けるセミハードチーズを同じ重さで代用できますが、風味、脂質、ナトリウムは変わります。そのまま食べられるハムを、新たな配合なしに生肉へ替えないでください。計算に近づけるには塩水を加えていない鶏肉を使います。つまようじを数え、提供前に抜きます。鶏肉は洗わず、生肉用の場所、皿、刷毛を分け、手を洗います。栄養推定は廃棄分も含め用意した小麦粉、卵、パン粉、油の全量を計上しています。この案では生の巻いた肉の冷凍は推奨しません。加熱後の残りを速やかに冷やして冷蔵し、2日以内に食べます。","nutrition":{"fat_g":26.5,"calories":635,"saturated_fat_g":7.9,"sodium_mg":850,"protein_g":64,"sugar_g":1.9,"carbs_g":31,"fiber_g":1.9,"estimated":true,"serving_size":"提案する4本のうち1本","source":"USDA FoodData Central — SR Legacy, April 2018 JSON","source_url":"https://fdc.nal.usda.gov/download-datasets/","method":"公式アーカイブでFDC IDからUSDAの9項目を確認。生の可食重量の合計を4で割り、廃棄する衣も含め小麦粉、卵、パン粉、油、塩の全量を計上。ハムはHam, sliced, regular、チーズはCheese, swissで近似。付け合わせは含まない。","note":"完成品の分析ではなく、保守的な推定。ハム・チーズの製品、鶏肉の塩水、実際の大きさ、付着する衣により値は変わる。分量、時間、出来上がり量は調理試験待ち。","inputs":[{"fdc_id":171077,"fdc_description":"Chicken, broiler or fryers, breast, skinless, boneless, meat only, raw","per_100g":{"fat_g":2.62,"calories":120,"saturated_fat_g":0.563,"sodium_mg":45,"protein_g":22.5,"sugar_g":0,"carbs_g":0,"fiber_g":0},"source_url":"https://fdc.nal.usda.gov/food-details/171077/nutrients","ingredient":"皮と骨のない生の鶏むね肉","edible_grams":800},{"fdc_id":173864,"fdc_description":"Ham, sliced, regular (approximately 11% fat)","per_100g":{"fiber_g":1.3,"saturated_fat_g":0.5,"sodium_mg":814,"fat_g":8.8,"carbs_g":3.63,"calories":164,"sugar_g":1,"protein_g":16.6},"source_url":"https://fdc.nal.usda.gov/food-details/173864/nutrients","ingredient":"そのまま食べられる加熱済みハムの薄切り","edible_grams":100},{"fdc_id":171251,"fdc_description":"Cheese, swiss","per_100g":{"fat_g":31,"carbs_g":1.44,"calories":393,"sugar_g":0,"sodium_mg":187,"protein_g":27,"saturated_fat_g":18.2,"fiber_g":0},"source_url":"https://fdc.nal.usda.gov/food-details/171251/nutrients","ingredient":"エメンタールまたはスイス系チーズの薄切り","edible_grams":100},{"fdc_id":168936,"fdc_description":"Wheat flour, white, all-purpose, enriched, unbleached","per_100g":{"fiber_g":2.7,"fat_g":0.98,"carbs_g":76.3,"calories":364,"protein_g":10.3,"sodium_mg":2,"saturated_fat_g":0.155,"sugar_g":0.27},"source_url":"https://fdc.nal.usda.gov/food-details/168936/nutrients","ingredient":"一般的な小麦粉","edible_grams":60},{"fdc_id":171287,"fdc_description":"Egg, whole, raw, fresh","per_100g":{"calories":143,"saturated_fat_g":3.13,"protein_g":12.6,"sodium_mg":142,"sugar_g":0.37,"fat_g":9.51,"carbs_g":0.72,"fiber_g":0},"source_url":"https://fdc.nal.usda.gov/food-details/171287/nutrients","ingredient":"殻を除いた生の全卵","edible_grams":100},{"fdc_id":174928,"fdc_description":"Bread, crumbs, dry, grated, plain","per_100g":{"fat_g":5.3,"protein_g":13.4,"fiber_g":4.5,"sodium_mg":732,"carbs_g":72,"calories":395,"sugar_g":6.2,"saturated_fat_g":1.2},"source_url":"https://fdc.nal.usda.gov/food-details/174928/nutrients","ingredient":"味付けのない乾燥パン粉","edible_grams":100},{"fdc_id":171413,"fdc_description":"Oil, olive, salad or cooking","per_100g":{"fat_g":100,"carbs_g":0,"calories":884,"sodium_mg":2,"protein_g":0,"saturated_fat_g":13.8,"fiber_g":0,"sugar_g":0},"source_url":"https://fdc.nal.usda.gov/food-details/171413/nutrients","ingredient":"オリーブ油","edible_grams":30},{"fdc_id":173468,"fdc_description":"Salt, table","per_100g":{"fiber_g":0,"sodium_mg":38800,"saturated_fat_g":0,"protein_g":0,"fat_g":0,"carbs_g":0,"calories":0,"sugar_g":0},"source_url":"https://fdc.nal.usda.gov/food-details/173468/nutrients","ingredient":"細粒の塩","edible_grams":3},{"fdc_id":170931,"fdc_description":"Spices, pepper, black","per_100g":{"fat_g":3.26,"sugar_g":0.64,"carbs_g":64,"calories":251,"protein_g":10.4,"fiber_g":25.3,"sodium_mg":20,"saturated_fat_g":1.39},"source_url":"https://fdc.nal.usda.gov/food-details/170931/nutrients","ingredient":"粗びきではない黒こしょう","edible_grams":0.5}]},"image_url":"/recetas/receta-de-cordon-bleu/portada.webp","gallery":[{"url":"/recetas/receta-de-cordon-bleu/portada.webp","alt":"オーブンで焼いた鶏肉のコルドンブルーを切り、ハムと溶けたチーズを見せた断面"}],"seo":{"title":"鶏肉のコルドンブルー、オーブン焼きの手順 | Manual de Cocina","description":"4人分のハムとチーズ入り鶏肉のコルドンブルー。詰め物を閉じ、オーブンで焼いて中心74 °Cを確認する手順。","image_alt":"オーブンで焼いた鶏肉のコルドンブルーを切り、ハムと溶けたチーズを見せた断面","image_variants":["/recetas/receta-de-cordon-bleu/portada-1x1.webp","/recetas/receta-de-cordon-bleu/portada-4x3.webp","/recetas/receta-de-cordon-bleu/portada-16x9.webp"],"faq":[{"q":"チーズが漏れないようにするには？","a":"肉を破らず薄くし、縁を2 cm空け、左右を折ってしっかり閉じ、閉じ目を下にします。縁に出たチーズは漏れやすく、15分の冷蔵は衣を安定させます。"},{"q":"衣がきつね色なら加熱完了ですか？","a":"いいえ。各肉の複数箇所を温度計で測り、鶏肉と詰め物付近が少なくとも74 °Cになることを確認します。中心が焼ける前に衣が色付くことがあります。"},{"q":"先に準備しておけますか？","a":"この案は焼く前の冷蔵15分だけを含みます。長時間の生の保存や冷凍は検証していません。加熱後の残りは冷蔵し、2日以内に食べます。"}]},"published":false,"editorial_status":"draft","content_html":"<p>薄くのばした鶏むね肉で加熱済みハムとエメンタール系チーズを巻き、パン粉を付けます。計量した油を塗ってオーブンで焼く案で、歴史的なコルドンブルーのURLを維持します。</p><p>提案する出来上がりは4本で、1人1本です。準備30分、冷蔵15分、加熱約30分、休ませる時間5分、合計80分。肉の厚さ、巻いた直径、オーブンによって加熱が長くなります。分量、時間、出来上がり量は推定で、実際の調理試験は未実施です。衣の色ではなく温度計で安全を確認してください。</p>"},{"id":"172f09c9-39e9-5c84-87b0-675776cdf64e","recipe_group_id":"675e919b-02fe-4900-95c4-d56849fa0cb7","language":"pt","slug":"cordon-bleu-de-frango","public_path":"/pt/cordon-bleu-de-frango","source_url":null,"title":"Cordon bleu de frango assado","excerpt":"Cordon bleu de frango para 4, recheado com presunto e queijo, empanado no forno com verificação da temperatura no centro.","summary":"Peitos de frango achatados são enrolados com presunto cozido e queijo tipo emmental, empanados e assados com uma quantidade pesada de azeite. Esta versão mantém a URL histórica do cordon bleu.\n\nA proposta rende 4 rolinhos, um por pessoa: 30 minutos de preparo, 15 de geladeira, cerca de 30 de cozimento e 5 de descanso, totalizando 80 minutos. Espessura, diâmetro e forno podem aumentar o tempo. Quantidades, tempos e rendimento são estimados, aguardando teste de cozinha. Confirme a segurança com termômetro, não pela cor do empanado.","category":"Pratos principais","category_slug":"platos-principales","difficulty":"Média","course":"Prato principal","cuisine":"Europeia, proposta caseira","prep_time_minutes":30,"cook_time_minutes":30,"total_time_minutes":80,"servings":4,"keywords":["cordon bleu de frango","cordon bleu assado","frango presunto queijo","cordon bleu no forno"],"ingredients":[{"name":"peito de frango cru sem pele e sem osso","amount":"800","unit":"g, em 4 peças de cerca de 200 g","group":"Frango e recheio"},{"name":"presunto cozido fatiado, pronto para consumo","amount":"100","unit":"g","group":"Frango e recheio"},{"name":"queijo tipo emmental ou suíço fatiado","amount":"100","unit":"g","group":"Frango e recheio"},{"name":"sal fino","amount":"3","unit":"g","group":"Tempero"},{"name":"pimenta-do-reino moída","amount":"0.5","unit":"g","group":"Tempero"},{"name":"farinha de trigo comum","amount":"60","unit":"g","group":"Empanado"},{"name":"ovo inteiro cru sem casca","amount":"100","unit":"g, aproximadamente 2 ovos grandes","group":"Empanado"},{"name":"farinha de rosca seca sem tempero","amount":"100","unit":"g","group":"Empanado"},{"name":"azeite de oliva","amount":"30","unit":"g","group":"Finalização no forno"}],"steps":[{"title":"Achate o frango e prepare a área","content":"Não lave o frango cru. Abra cada uma das 4 peças de cerca de 200 g como um livro, sem separar as metades. Coloque entre duas folhas de papel-manteiga e bata com martelo ou rolo até cerca de 4–5 mm uniformes, sem rasgar. Divida os 3 g de sal e 0,5 g de pimenta. Separe tábua e utensílios dos alimentos prontos para consumo e limpe tudo que tocar o frango cru.","image_alt":"Peito de frango cru aberto e achatado entre folhas de papel-manteiga","image_url":"/recetas/receta-de-cordon-bleu/paso-01.webp"},{"title":"Recheie, enrole e feche","content":"Coloque 25 g de presunto e 25 g de queijo em cada peça, deixando cerca de 2 cm livres nas bordas. Dobre as laterais e enrole pelo lado curto para envolver o recheio. Prenda com palitos de madeira sem pintura e conte quantos usar para retirar depois. Ajuste o frango para cobrir qualquer rasgo; não deixe queijo exposto na borda.","image_alt":"Frango sendo enrolado com presunto e queijo","image_url":"/recetas/receta-de-cordon-bleu/paso-02.webp"},{"title":"Empane os quatro rolinhos","content":"Prepare três pratos com 60 g de farinha, 100 g de ovo batido e 100 g de farinha de rosca. Passe cada rolinho na farinha e sacuda o excesso, depois no ovo e na farinha de rosca, apertando delicadamente para cobrir a superfície e os fechamentos. Não despeje o ovo sobre a farinha de rosca. Descarte qualquer sobra do empanado que tenha tocado frango cru; não guarde.","image_alt":"Empanado com pratos separados de farinha, ovo e farinha de rosca","image_url":"/recetas/receta-de-cordon-bleu/paso-03.webp"},{"title":"Refrigere e preaqueça","content":"Coloque as peças empanadas em uma assadeira limpa, cubra e refrigere 15 minutos a 4 °C ou menos para firmar a cobertura. Enquanto isso, preaqueça o forno a 200 °C, com calor superior e inferior, sem ventilação. Forre outra assadeira com papel-manteiga. A refrigeração faz parte dos 80 minutos totais; não deixe os rolinhos esperando na bancada.","image_alt":"Quatro rolinhos empanados cobertos na geladeira","image_url":"/recetas/receta-de-cordon-bleu/paso-04.webp"},{"title":"Pincele e asse","content":"Distribua os 30 g de azeite nas quatro peças com pincel limpo. Coloque a emenda para baixo e deixe pelo menos 3 cm de espaço. Asse na altura média por cerca de 25–30 minutos. Aos 15 minutos, gire a assadeira se dourar de modo desigual. Não corte para decidir se está pronto: verifique a temperatura. Se a cobertura escurecer antes de o centro cozinhar, cubra frouxamente com papel-alumínio.","image_alt":"Rolinhos empanados dourando em assadeira no forno","image_url":"/recetas/receta-de-cordon-bleu/paso-05.webp"},{"title":"Confira o centro com termômetro","content":"Insira a sonda pela lateral até o centro, atravessando o frango e chegando junto ao recheio, sem tocar a assadeira. Meça cada peça em mais de um ponto: frango e centro devem atingir pelo menos 74 °C. Se alguma ficar abaixo, asse mais 3–5 minutos e meça de novo com a sonda limpa. Queijo derretido e crosta dourada não garantem segurança; o tempo estimado pode ser ultrapassado.","image_alt":"Sonda do termômetro verificando o centro de um rolinho assado","image_url":"/recetas/receta-de-cordon-bleu/paso-06.webp"},{"title":"Descanse, retire os palitos e sirva","content":"Deixe descansar 5 minutos em superfície resistente ao calor. Retire e conte todos os palitos antes de servir. Se faltar algum, identifique a peça e não sirva até encontrá-lo. Sirva uma peça por pessoa; corte com faca limpa para mostrar o recheio, se desejar. Refrigere sobras em recipientes rasos a 4 °C ou menos dentro de 2 horas, ou 1 hora se o ambiente superar 32 °C. Propõe-se consumir em 2 dias e reaquecer uma única vez até 74 °C no centro.","image_alt":"Cordon bleu de frango assado cortado com presunto e queijo","image_url":"/recetas/receta-de-cordon-bleu/paso-07.webp"}],"notes":"Contém trigo, ovo e laticínios; presunto e farinha de rosca podem conter outros alérgenos conforme a marca. Não se propõem versões sem glúten, ovo ou leite porque alteram cobertura e recheio. Pode usar queijo semiduro que derreta com o mesmo peso, mas sabor, gordura e sódio mudam. Não substitua presunto pronto para consumo por carne crua sem outra formulação. Use frango sem salmoura adicionada para aproximar o cálculo. Conte e retire os palitos antes de servir. Não lave o frango; separe área crua, pratos e pincéis e lave as mãos. A estimativa conta toda a farinha, ovo, farinha de rosca e azeite preparados, embora parte seja descartada. Não se recomenda congelar os rolinhos crus nesta ficha. Resfrie e refrigere rapidamente as sobras cozidas e consuma em 2 dias.","nutrition":{"fat_g":26.5,"calories":635,"saturated_fat_g":7.9,"sodium_mg":850,"protein_g":64,"sugar_g":1.9,"carbs_g":31,"fiber_g":1.9,"estimated":true,"serving_size":"1 dos 4 rolinhos propostos","source":"USDA FoodData Central — SR Legacy, April 2018 JSON","source_url":"https://fdc.nal.usda.gov/download-datasets/","method":"Nove fichas USDA verificadas por FDC ID no arquivo oficial. Pesos comestíveis crus somados e divididos por 4. Toda a farinha, ovo, farinha de rosca, azeite e sal são contabilizados, mesmo com descarte de cobertura. Presunto aproximado por Ham, sliced, regular e queijo por Cheese, swiss. Sem acompanhamento.","note":"Estimativa conservadora, não análise do prato pronto. Marcas do presunto e queijo, salmoura do frango, tamanho real e cobertura aderida mudam o resultado. Quantidades, tempos e rendimento aguardam teste de cozinha.","inputs":[{"fdc_id":171077,"fdc_description":"Chicken, broiler or fryers, breast, skinless, boneless, meat only, raw","per_100g":{"fat_g":2.62,"calories":120,"saturated_fat_g":0.563,"sodium_mg":45,"protein_g":22.5,"sugar_g":0,"carbs_g":0,"fiber_g":0},"source_url":"https://fdc.nal.usda.gov/food-details/171077/nutrients","ingredient":"peito de frango cru sem pele e sem osso","edible_grams":800},{"fdc_id":173864,"fdc_description":"Ham, sliced, regular (approximately 11% fat)","per_100g":{"fiber_g":1.3,"saturated_fat_g":0.5,"sodium_mg":814,"fat_g":8.8,"carbs_g":3.63,"calories":164,"sugar_g":1,"protein_g":16.6},"source_url":"https://fdc.nal.usda.gov/food-details/173864/nutrients","ingredient":"presunto cozido fatiado, pronto para consumo","edible_grams":100},{"fdc_id":171251,"fdc_description":"Cheese, swiss","per_100g":{"fat_g":31,"carbs_g":1.44,"calories":393,"sugar_g":0,"sodium_mg":187,"protein_g":27,"saturated_fat_g":18.2,"fiber_g":0},"source_url":"https://fdc.nal.usda.gov/food-details/171251/nutrients","ingredient":"queijo tipo emmental ou suíço fatiado","edible_grams":100},{"fdc_id":168936,"fdc_description":"Wheat flour, white, all-purpose, enriched, unbleached","per_100g":{"fiber_g":2.7,"fat_g":0.98,"carbs_g":76.3,"calories":364,"protein_g":10.3,"sodium_mg":2,"saturated_fat_g":0.155,"sugar_g":0.27},"source_url":"https://fdc.nal.usda.gov/food-details/168936/nutrients","ingredient":"farinha de trigo comum","edible_grams":60},{"fdc_id":171287,"fdc_description":"Egg, whole, raw, fresh","per_100g":{"calories":143,"saturated_fat_g":3.13,"protein_g":12.6,"sodium_mg":142,"sugar_g":0.37,"fat_g":9.51,"carbs_g":0.72,"fiber_g":0},"source_url":"https://fdc.nal.usda.gov/food-details/171287/nutrients","ingredient":"ovo inteiro cru sem casca","edible_grams":100},{"fdc_id":174928,"fdc_description":"Bread, crumbs, dry, grated, plain","per_100g":{"fat_g":5.3,"protein_g":13.4,"fiber_g":4.5,"sodium_mg":732,"carbs_g":72,"calories":395,"sugar_g":6.2,"saturated_fat_g":1.2},"source_url":"https://fdc.nal.usda.gov/food-details/174928/nutrients","ingredient":"farinha de rosca seca sem tempero","edible_grams":100},{"fdc_id":171413,"fdc_description":"Oil, olive, salad or cooking","per_100g":{"fat_g":100,"carbs_g":0,"calories":884,"sodium_mg":2,"protein_g":0,"saturated_fat_g":13.8,"fiber_g":0,"sugar_g":0},"source_url":"https://fdc.nal.usda.gov/food-details/171413/nutrients","ingredient":"azeite de oliva","edible_grams":30},{"fdc_id":173468,"fdc_description":"Salt, table","per_100g":{"fiber_g":0,"sodium_mg":38800,"saturated_fat_g":0,"protein_g":0,"fat_g":0,"carbs_g":0,"calories":0,"sugar_g":0},"source_url":"https://fdc.nal.usda.gov/food-details/173468/nutrients","ingredient":"sal fino","edible_grams":3},{"fdc_id":170931,"fdc_description":"Spices, pepper, black","per_100g":{"fat_g":3.26,"sugar_g":0.64,"carbs_g":64,"calories":251,"protein_g":10.4,"fiber_g":25.3,"sodium_mg":20,"saturated_fat_g":1.39},"source_url":"https://fdc.nal.usda.gov/food-details/170931/nutrients","ingredient":"pimenta-do-reino moída","edible_grams":0.5}]},"image_url":"/recetas/receta-de-cordon-bleu/portada.webp","gallery":[{"url":"/recetas/receta-de-cordon-bleu/portada.webp","alt":"Cordon bleu de frango assado cortado para mostrar presunto e queijo derretido"}],"seo":{"title":"Cordon bleu de frango assado: passo a passo | Manual de Cocina","description":"Cordon bleu para 4 com presunto, queijo e empanado no forno. Feche o recheio e confira 74 °C no centro antes de servir.","image_alt":"Cordon bleu de frango assado cortado para mostrar presunto e queijo derretido","image_variants":["/recetas/receta-de-cordon-bleu/portada-1x1.webp","/recetas/receta-de-cordon-bleu/portada-4x3.webp","/recetas/receta-de-cordon-bleu/portada-16x9.webp"],"faq":[{"q":"Como evitar que o queijo vaze?","a":"Achate sem rasgar, deixe borda de 2 cm, dobre as laterais, feche bem e coloque a emenda para baixo. Queijo exposto vaza mais facilmente; 15 minutos de geladeira ajudam a firmar o empanado."},{"q":"A cor dourada comprova o cozimento?","a":"Não. Confira cada rolinho em vários pontos com termômetro e verifique pelo menos 74 °C no frango e junto ao recheio. O empanado pode dourar antes de o centro ficar pronto."},{"q":"Posso preparar os rolinhos antes?","a":"A ficha só inclui 15 minutos de geladeira antes de assar. Repouso prolongado e congelamento das peças cruas não foram validados aqui. Refrigere sobras cozidas e consuma em 2 dias."}]},"published":false,"editorial_status":"draft","content_html":"<p>Peitos de frango achatados são enrolados com presunto cozido e queijo tipo emmental, empanados e assados com uma quantidade pesada de azeite. Esta versão mantém a URL histórica do cordon bleu.</p><p>A proposta rende 4 rolinhos, um por pessoa: 30 minutos de preparo, 15 de geladeira, cerca de 30 de cozimento e 5 de descanso, totalizando 80 minutos. Espessura, diâmetro e forno podem aumentar o tempo. Quantidades, tempos e rendimento são estimados, aguardando teste de cozinha. Confirme a segurança com termômetro, não pela cor do empanado.</p>"},{"id":"f1ba021c-866e-4b37-a577-485a64b44ae9","recipe_group_id":"cc320b67-294e-4420-b904-4bd3d12d4c1b","language":"es","slug":"receta-de-capuchino","public_path":"/receta-de-capuchino","source_url":"https://manualdecocina.com/receta-de-capuchino/","title":"Capuchino casero con espresso y leche","excerpt":"Un capuchino sin azúcar añadida con 36 g de espresso y 120 g de leche entera, espuma fina y control de la temperatura.","summary":"Este capuchino combina un espresso recién preparado con leche entera pasteurizada y una capa de espuma fina. No lleva cacao, chocolate, nata ni azúcar añadida; los azúcares del cálculo proceden principalmente de la leche. Se necesita una cafetera de espresso y una lanza de vapor apta para pequeñas cantidades, una jarra y un termómetro.\n\nLa propuesta rinde una taza de unos 180–200 ml según el aire incorporado. Se estiman 5 minutos de preparación y 5 para preparar el café y calentar la leche, 10 en total una vez que la máquina está lista. El precalentamiento de cada cafetera puede añadir tiempo. Cantidades, tiempos y volumen final están pendientes de prueba de cocina; no se afirma una proporción tradicional universal de tres partes iguales.","category":"Bebidas","category_slug":"bebidas","difficulty":"Media","course":"Bebida","cuisine":"Italiana, propuesta casera","prep_time_minutes":5,"cook_time_minutes":5,"total_time_minutes":10,"servings":1,"keywords":["capuchino","cappuccino casero","espresso con leche","espuma de leche"],"ingredients":[{"name":"espresso recién preparado","amount":"36","unit":"g de bebida, no de café molido","group":"Café"},{"name":"leche entera pasteurizada fría","amount":"120","unit":"g","group":"Leche"}],"steps":[{"title":"Prepara la taza, la jarra y la leche","content":"Usa una taza de 180–200 ml, una jarra de vapor pequeña compatible con la cantidad de leche y un termómetro limpio. Precalienta la taza con agua caliente y vacíala completamente. Pesa los 120 g de leche fría a 4 °C o menos en la jarra; no la dejes esperar a temperatura ambiente. Sigue el manual de tu máquina para su precalentamiento y purga.","image_alt":"Jarra metálica con leche fría junto a una taza vacía y una cafetera","image_url":"/recetas/receta-de-capuchino/paso-01.webp"},{"title":"Prepara y pesa el espresso","content":"Prepara café espresso en la taza caliente y pesa 36 g de bebida recién extraída, sin contar el peso de la taza. Si tu cafetera no permite extracción y vapor a la vez, sigue la secuencia de su manual y evita dejar el café mucho tiempo. El peso indicado es de líquido preparado, no de café seco. No añadas azúcar ni cacao en esta versión.","image_alt":"Espresso recién extraído en una taza bajo el portafiltro","image_url":"/recetas/receta-de-capuchino/paso-02.webp"},{"title":"Texturiza la leche sin hervir","content":"Purga brevemente la lanza apuntando a la bandeja y sin acercar las manos al vapor. Introduce la punta cerca de la superficie de los 120 g de leche y abre el vapor para incorporar aire con un siseo suave, no grandes burbujas. Sumerge un poco la punta para formar un remolino y detén el vapor cuando el termómetro marque 55–60 °C. Cierra el vapor antes de retirar la jarra. No hiervas ni calientes solo por un tiempo fijo; la potencia de cada máquina cambia.","image_alt":"Lanza de vapor texturizando leche en una jarra metálica","image_url":"/recetas/receta-de-capuchino/paso-03.webp"},{"title":"Integra la espuma y limpia la lanza","content":"Limpia enseguida la lanza con un paño limpio destinado a ella y purga según el manual, evitando quemaduras. Da un golpe suave a la base de la jarra sobre un paño y mueve la leche en círculos para unir espuma y líquido. Debe verse brillante y fluida, sin una capa de burbujas grandes separada. No vuelvas a vaporizar leche que ya se ha calentado.","image_alt":"Leche texturizada brillante en una jarra tras girarla suavemente","image_url":"/recetas/receta-de-capuchino/paso-04.webp"},{"title":"Vierte y sirve de inmediato","content":"Vierte la leche sobre los 36 g de espresso con un hilo continuo y acerca la jarra al final para depositar la espuma fina. Utiliza toda la leche medida para mantener la estimación; no hace falta dibujar una figura. Sirve enseguida y comprueba que la taza no queme. El volumen propuesto de 180–200 ml depende de la espuma. Esta bebida no se guarda para recalentar: desecha la leche texturizada sobrante y conserva la leche sin usar en frío.","image_alt":"Capuchino terminado con espuma fina en una taza de cerámica","image_url":"/recetas/receta-de-capuchino/paso-05.webp"}],"notes":"Contiene leche y cafeína. Para el espresso puedes usar como punto de partida 18 g de café molido y obtener 36 g de bebida, relación 1:2, en unos 25–35 segundos; ajusta molienda y receta a tu equipo. Esa preparación sustituye al ingrediente espresso listo, no se suma a él, y los posos no se ingieren ni se cuentan como 18 g de café comestible. Usa la dosis adecuada a la cesta de tu máquina y sigue su manual. Si la jarra o lanza requiere más leche que 120 g, el equipo no es apropiado para esta formulación de una taza; no calientes de nuevo el sobrante. La leche sin lactosa puede espumar, pero su perfil nutricional cambia. Una bebida vegetal modifica espuma, sabor y nutrientes y requiere otra ficha; esta no se presenta como vegana. No se incluyen azúcar, cacao ni canela opcionales en los ingredientes o cálculo. No prometemos un contenido exacto de cafeína: depende de variedad, dosis y extracción. Mantén la leche fría y usa solo pasteurizada. El vapor y la taza pueden quemar; no dejes que el termómetro toque la lanza caliente.","nutrition":{"fiber_g":0,"sodium_mg":57,"saturated_fat_g":2.3,"fat_g":4,"protein_g":3.8,"sugar_g":6.1,"carbs_g":6.4,"calories":76.4,"estimated":true,"serving_size":"1 taza propuesta, toda la leche medida","source":"USDA FoodData Central — SR Legacy, abril de 2018","source_url":"https://fdc.nal.usda.gov/download-datasets/","method":"Dos fichas USDA verificadas por FDC ID en el archivo oficial: 36 g de espresso preparado y 120 g de leche entera. Una ración; no se cuentan posos de café, agua de precalentar la taza ni aire incorporado. Se supone que toda la leche medida se vierte en la taza.","note":"Estimación, no análisis de la bebida. Leche real, extracción y líquido que quede en la jarra cambian el resultado; el volumen, los tiempos y el rendimiento esperan prueba de cocina. No incluye azúcar añadida ni cálculo de cafeína.","inputs":[{"fdc_id":171891,"fdc_description":"Beverages, coffee, brewed, espresso, restaurant-prepared","per_100g":{"fiber_g":0,"sodium_mg":14,"saturated_fat_g":0.092,"fat_g":0.18,"protein_g":0.12,"sugar_g":0,"carbs_g":1.67,"calories":9},"source_url":"https://fdc.nal.usda.gov/food-details/171891/nutrients","ingredient":"espresso preparado","edible_grams":36},{"fdc_id":171265,"fdc_description":"Milk, whole, 3.25% milkfat, with added vitamin D","per_100g":{"fat_g":3.25,"sugar_g":5.05,"carbs_g":4.8,"calories":61,"saturated_fat_g":1.86,"fiber_g":0,"sodium_mg":43,"protein_g":3.15},"source_url":"https://fdc.nal.usda.gov/food-details/171265/nutrients","ingredient":"leche entera pasteurizada","edible_grams":120}]},"image_url":"/recetas/receta-de-capuchino/portada.webp","gallery":[{"url":"/recetas/receta-de-capuchino/portada.webp","alt":"Capuchino casero con espuma fina y crema de espresso en taza"}],"seo":{"title":"Capuchino casero con espresso: paso a paso | Manual de Cocina","description":"Capuchino sin azúcar añadida con espresso y leche medida. Texturiza a 55–60 °C y sirve con espuma fina; receta propuesta para una taza.","image_alt":"Capuchino casero con espuma fina y crema de espresso en taza","image_variants":["/recetas/receta-de-capuchino/portada-1x1.webp","/recetas/receta-de-capuchino/portada-4x3.webp","/recetas/receta-de-capuchino/portada-16x9.webp"],"faq":[{"q":"¿Por qué aparecen 36 g de espresso y no 36 g de café molido?","a":"Son el peso de la bebida ya preparada. Como punto de partida se pueden usar 18 g de café seco para obtener 36 g de espresso, relación 1:2. Los posos se desechan; no se añaden a la taza ni al cálculo nutricional."},{"q":"¿Por qué la espuma queda con burbujas grandes?","a":"Suele entrar demasiado aire o la punta queda demasiado alta. Incorpora aire suavemente al principio y forma después un remolino; gira la jarra al terminar. Detén el calentamiento a 55–60 °C y no vuelvas a vaporizar la misma leche."},{"q":"¿Puedo guardarlo o usar otra leche?","a":"Se propone servirlo inmediatamente, sin guardar para recalentar. La leche sin lactosa o vegetal cambia la espuma y la nutrición; el cálculo solo corresponde a leche entera pasteurizada y todo el peso medido."}]},"published":false,"editorial_status":"draft","content_html":"<p>Este capuchino combina un espresso recién preparado con leche entera pasteurizada y una capa de espuma fina. No lleva cacao, chocolate, nata ni azúcar añadida; los azúcares del cálculo proceden principalmente de la leche. Se necesita una cafetera de espresso y una lanza de vapor apta para pequeñas cantidades, una jarra y un termómetro.</p><p>La propuesta rinde una taza de unos 180–200 ml según el aire incorporado. Se estiman 5 minutos de preparación y 5 para preparar el café y calentar la leche, 10 en total una vez que la máquina está lista. El precalentamiento de cada cafetera puede añadir tiempo. Cantidades, tiempos y volumen final están pendientes de prueba de cocina; no se afirma una proporción tradicional universal de tres partes iguales.</p>"},{"id":"03eaadba-327c-58eb-a350-9cfae3aec584","recipe_group_id":"cc320b67-294e-4420-b904-4bd3d12d4c1b","language":"de","slug":"cappuccino-rezept","public_path":"/de/cappuccino-rezept","source_url":null,"title":"Cappuccino mit Espresso und Milch selbst machen","excerpt":"Cappuccino ohne zugesetzten Zucker mit 36 g Espresso, 120 g Vollmilch, feinem Schaum und Temperaturkontrolle.","summary":"Frischer Espresso wird mit pasteurisierter Vollmilch und feinem Milchschaum kombiniert. Ohne Kakao, Schokolade, Sahne oder zugesetzten Zucker; der berechnete Zucker stammt überwiegend aus Milch. Benötigt werden Espressomaschine, eine für kleine Mengen geeignete Dampflanze, Kännchen und Thermometer.\n\nVorgeschlagen ist eine Tasse mit etwa 180–200 ml je nach eingebrachter Luft. Geschätzt werden 5 Minuten Vorbereitung und 5 für Kaffee und Milch, insgesamt 10 nach Betriebsbereitschaft der Maschine. Das Aufheizen kann Zeit hinzufügen. Mengen, Zeiten und Volumen sind noch nicht in der Küche erprobt. Ein allgemeingültiges traditionelles Verhältnis dreier gleicher Teile wird nicht behauptet.","category":"Getränke","category_slug":"bebidas","difficulty":"Mittel","course":"Getränk","cuisine":"Italienisch, Vorschlag für zu Hause","prep_time_minutes":5,"cook_time_minutes":5,"total_time_minutes":10,"servings":1,"keywords":["Cappuccino selbst machen","Espresso mit Milch","Milchschaum","Cappuccino Rezept"],"ingredients":[{"name":"frisch zubereiteter Espresso","amount":"36","unit":"g fertiges Getränk, nicht Kaffeepulver","group":"Kaffee"},{"name":"kalte pasteurisierte Vollmilch","amount":"120","unit":"g","group":"Milch"}],"steps":[{"title":"Tasse, Kännchen und Milch vorbereiten","content":"Eine Tasse mit 180–200 ml, ein zur Milchmenge passendes kleines Dampfkännchen und ein sauberes Thermometer verwenden. Tasse mit heißem Wasser wärmen und vollständig leeren. 120 g kalte Milch bei höchstens 4 °C ins Kännchen wiegen; nicht bei Raumtemperatur stehen lassen. Aufheizen und Spülen nach Maschinenanleitung.","image_alt":"Milchkännchen neben leerer Tasse und Espressomaschine","image_url":"/recetas/receta-de-capuchino/paso-01.webp"},{"title":"Espresso zubereiten und wiegen","content":"Espresso in die warme Tasse beziehen und 36 g frisch extrahiertes Getränk ohne Tassengewicht abwiegen. Kann die Maschine nicht gleichzeitig brühen und dampfen, die Reihenfolge der Anleitung beachten und den Kaffee nicht lange stehen lassen. Gemeint ist fertige Flüssigkeit, nicht trockenes Kaffeepulver. Keinen Zucker oder Kakao hinzufügen.","image_alt":"Frischer Espresso läuft aus dem Siebträger in eine Tasse","image_url":"/recetas/receta-de-capuchino/paso-02.webp"},{"title":"Milch ohne Kochen texturieren","content":"Dampflanze kurz zur Abtropfschale ausblasen; Hände vom Dampf fernhalten. Spitze nahe der Oberfläche der 120 g Milch einsetzen und mit sanftem Zischen Luft einbringen, ohne große Blasen. Spitze etwas tiefer halten, sodass ein Wirbel entsteht. Bei Thermometeranzeige 55–60 °C den Dampf stoppen, bevor das Kännchen entfernt wird. Nicht kochen und nicht nur nach Zeit erhitzen; die Maschinenleistung variiert.","image_alt":"Dampflanze texturiert Milch im Edelstahlkännchen","image_url":"/recetas/receta-de-capuchino/paso-03.webp"},{"title":"Schaum verbinden und Lanze reinigen","content":"Lanze sofort mit einem sauberen, dafür bestimmten Tuch abwischen und nach Anleitung ausblasen; Verbrennungen vermeiden. Kännchen sanft auf einem Tuch aufklopfen und schwenken, damit Schaum und Milch sich verbinden. Die Milch soll glänzend und fließend sein, ohne getrennte große Blasen. Bereits erhitzte Milch nicht erneut dampfen.","image_alt":"Glänzende texturierte Milch nach sanftem Schwenken","image_url":"/recetas/receta-de-capuchino/paso-04.webp"},{"title":"Eingießen und sofort servieren","content":"Milch in einem gleichmäßigen Strahl zum 36 g Espresso gießen, zum Schluss das Kännchen annähern und feinen Schaum auflegen. Für die Schätzung die gesamte gewogene Milch verwenden; ein Muster ist nicht nötig. Sofort servieren und prüfen, dass die Tasse nicht verbrennt. Das vorgeschlagene Volumen von 180–200 ml hängt vom Schaum ab. Nicht zum Wiedererhitzen lagern: übrige texturierte Milch entsorgen, unbenutzte kalte Milch gekühlt halten.","image_alt":"Fertiger Cappuccino mit feinem Schaum in einer Keramiktasse","image_url":"/recetas/receta-de-capuchino/paso-05.webp"}],"notes":"Enthält Milch und Koffein. Ausgangspunkt für Espresso: 18 g Kaffeepulver für 36 g Getränk, Verhältnis 1:2, in etwa 25–35 Sekunden; Mahlgrad und Rezept ans Gerät anpassen. Das ersetzt die Zutat fertiger Espresso und wird nicht zusätzlich verwendet. Kaffeesatz wird nicht gegessen oder als 18 g essbarer Kaffee berechnet. Passende Siebdosis und Maschinenanleitung beachten. Benötigen Kännchen oder Lanze mehr als 120 g Milch, ist das Gerät für diese Einzeltassenformel ungeeignet; Überschuss nicht erneut erhitzen. Laktosefreie Milch kann schäumen, verändert aber Nährwerte. Pflanzendrinks verändern Schaum, Geschmack und Nährwerte und brauchen eine andere Rezeptur; diese ist nicht vegan. Zucker, Kakao und Zimt sind nicht enthalten. Kein exakter Koffeingehalt versprochen: Sorte, Dosis und Extraktion wirken sich aus. Milch kalt halten und nur pasteurisierte verwenden. Dampf und Tasse können verbrennen; Thermometer nicht an die heiße Lanze legen.","nutrition":{"fiber_g":0,"sodium_mg":57,"saturated_fat_g":2.3,"fat_g":4,"protein_g":3.8,"sugar_g":6.1,"carbs_g":6.4,"calories":76.4,"estimated":true,"serving_size":"1 vorgeschlagene Tasse mit der gesamten Milch","source":"USDA FoodData Central — SR Legacy, April 2018 JSON","source_url":"https://fdc.nal.usda.gov/download-datasets/","method":"Zwei USDA-Datensätze im offiziellen Archiv über FDC-ID geprüft: 36 g fertiger Espresso und 120 g Vollmilch. Eine Portion. Ohne Kaffeesatz, Wasser zum Tassenwärmen und eingebrachte Luft. Die gesamte gewogene Milch wird in der Tasse angenommen.","note":"Schätzung, keine Getränkeanalyse. Milch, Extraktion und Reste im Kännchen verändern das Ergebnis. Volumen, Zeiten und Ausbeute sind noch nicht in der Küche erprobt. Ohne zugesetzten Zucker oder Koffeinberechnung.","inputs":[{"fdc_id":171891,"fdc_description":"Beverages, coffee, brewed, espresso, restaurant-prepared","per_100g":{"fiber_g":0,"sodium_mg":14,"saturated_fat_g":0.092,"fat_g":0.18,"protein_g":0.12,"sugar_g":0,"carbs_g":1.67,"calories":9},"source_url":"https://fdc.nal.usda.gov/food-details/171891/nutrients","ingredient":"frisch zubereiteter Espresso","edible_grams":36},{"fdc_id":171265,"fdc_description":"Milk, whole, 3.25% milkfat, with added vitamin D","per_100g":{"fat_g":3.25,"sugar_g":5.05,"carbs_g":4.8,"calories":61,"saturated_fat_g":1.86,"fiber_g":0,"sodium_mg":43,"protein_g":3.15},"source_url":"https://fdc.nal.usda.gov/food-details/171265/nutrients","ingredient":"kalte pasteurisierte Vollmilch","edible_grams":120}]},"image_url":"/recetas/receta-de-capuchino/portada.webp","gallery":[{"url":"/recetas/receta-de-capuchino/portada.webp","alt":"Selbst gemachter Cappuccino mit feinem Milchschaum und Espressocrema"}],"seo":{"title":"Cappuccino selbst machen mit Espresso | Manual de Cocina","description":"Cappuccino ohne zugesetzten Zucker aus abgewogenem Espresso und Milch. Bei 55–60 °C texturieren und mit feinem Schaum servieren.","image_alt":"Selbst gemachter Cappuccino mit feinem Milchschaum und Espressocrema","image_variants":["/recetas/receta-de-capuchino/portada-1x1.webp","/recetas/receta-de-capuchino/portada-4x3.webp","/recetas/receta-de-capuchino/portada-16x9.webp"],"faq":[{"q":"Warum 36 g Espresso statt 36 g Kaffeepulver?","a":"Es ist das Gewicht des fertigen Getränks. Als Ausgangspunkt ergeben 18 g trockener Kaffee 36 g Espresso, Verhältnis 1:2. Kaffeesatz entsorgen; er kommt weder in die Tasse noch in die Nährwertberechnung."},{"q":"Warum entstehen große Schaumblasen?","a":"Oft wird zu viel Luft eingebracht oder die Spitze liegt zu hoch. Anfangs sanft Luft einbringen, dann einen Wirbel bilden und das Kännchen schwenken. Bei 55–60 °C stoppen und dieselbe Milch nicht erneut dampfen."},{"q":"Kann ich den Cappuccino lagern oder andere Milch verwenden?","a":"Sofort servieren, nicht zum Wiedererhitzen lagern. Laktosefreie Milch und Pflanzendrinks verändern Schaum und Nährwerte. Die Berechnung gilt nur für pasteurisierte Vollmilch und das gesamte abgewogene Gewicht."}]},"published":false,"editorial_status":"draft","content_html":"<p>Frischer Espresso wird mit pasteurisierter Vollmilch und feinem Milchschaum kombiniert. Ohne Kakao, Schokolade, Sahne oder zugesetzten Zucker; der berechnete Zucker stammt überwiegend aus Milch. Benötigt werden Espressomaschine, eine für kleine Mengen geeignete Dampflanze, Kännchen und Thermometer.</p><p>Vorgeschlagen ist eine Tasse mit etwa 180–200 ml je nach eingebrachter Luft. Geschätzt werden 5 Minuten Vorbereitung und 5 für Kaffee und Milch, insgesamt 10 nach Betriebsbereitschaft der Maschine. Das Aufheizen kann Zeit hinzufügen. Mengen, Zeiten und Volumen sind noch nicht in der Küche erprobt. Ein allgemeingültiges traditionelles Verhältnis dreier gleicher Teile wird nicht behauptet.</p>"},{"id":"78ffb3c0-b2eb-53b0-acb6-4378773615f0","recipe_group_id":"cc320b67-294e-4420-b904-4bd3d12d4c1b","language":"en","slug":"cappuccino-recipe","public_path":"/en/cappuccino-recipe","source_url":null,"title":"Homemade cappuccino with espresso and milk","excerpt":"A cappuccino without added sugar, using 36 g espresso and 120 g whole milk, fine foam and a temperature check.","summary":"Fresh espresso is combined with pasteurised whole milk and fine foam. No cocoa, chocolate, cream or added sugar is included; the calculated sugars come mainly from milk. You need an espresso machine with a steam wand suitable for small quantities, a pitcher and a thermometer.\n\nThe proposed yield is one cup of about 180–200 ml depending on incorporated air. Allow an estimated 5 minutes preparation and 5 for coffee and milk, 10 overall once the machine is ready. Machine warm-up may add time. Quantities, timings and volume await a kitchen trial. This is not claimed to follow a universal traditional ratio of three equal parts.","category":"Drinks","category_slug":"bebidas","difficulty":"Medium","course":"Drink","cuisine":"Italian, home-style proposal","prep_time_minutes":5,"cook_time_minutes":5,"total_time_minutes":10,"servings":1,"keywords":["homemade cappuccino","espresso with milk","milk foam","cappuccino recipe"],"ingredients":[{"name":"freshly prepared espresso","amount":"36","unit":"g of beverage, not ground coffee","group":"Coffee"},{"name":"cold pasteurised whole milk","amount":"120","unit":"g","group":"Milk"}],"steps":[{"title":"Prepare the cup, pitcher and milk","content":"Use a 180–200 ml cup, a small steaming pitcher compatible with the milk quantity and a clean thermometer. Warm the cup with hot water and empty completely. Weigh 120 g cold milk at 4 °C or below into the pitcher; do not leave it at room temperature. Follow your machine manual for warm-up and purging.","image_alt":"Pitcher of cold milk beside an empty cup and espresso machine","image_url":"/recetas/receta-de-capuchino/paso-01.webp"},{"title":"Prepare and weigh the espresso","content":"Brew espresso into the warm cup and weigh 36 g freshly extracted beverage, excluding the cup weight. If your machine cannot brew and steam simultaneously, follow its manual sequence and avoid leaving coffee for long. This is prepared liquid weight, not dry coffee. Add no sugar or cocoa in this version.","image_alt":"Fresh espresso being extracted into a cup under the portafilter","image_url":"/recetas/receta-de-capuchino/paso-02.webp"},{"title":"Texture the milk without boiling","content":"Briefly purge the wand toward the drip tray, keeping hands away from steam. Put the tip near the surface of the 120 g milk and open the steam to introduce air with a gentle hiss, rather than large bubbles. Lower the tip slightly to create a whirlpool. Stop steam when the thermometer reads 55–60 °C, before removing the pitcher. Do not boil or rely on a fixed time: machine power varies.","image_alt":"Steam wand texturing milk in a stainless pitcher","image_url":"/recetas/receta-de-capuchino/paso-03.webp"},{"title":"Combine foam and clean the wand","content":"Immediately wipe the wand with a clean dedicated cloth and purge as directed by the manual, avoiding burns. Tap the pitcher base gently on a cloth and swirl to combine foam and liquid. It should look glossy and fluid, without separate large bubbles. Do not steam already heated milk again.","image_alt":"Glossy textured milk after gently swirling the pitcher","image_url":"/recetas/receta-de-capuchino/paso-04.webp"},{"title":"Pour and serve immediately","content":"Pour milk into the 36 g espresso in a continuous stream, bringing the pitcher closer at the end to deposit fine foam. Use all weighed milk for the estimate to apply; no pattern is required. Serve immediately and make sure the cup will not burn. The proposed 180–200 ml volume depends on foam. Do not store this drink for reheating: discard leftover textured milk and keep unused cold milk refrigerated.","image_alt":"Finished cappuccino with fine foam in a ceramic cup","image_url":"/recetas/receta-de-capuchino/paso-05.webp"}],"notes":"Contains milk and caffeine. For espresso, a starting point is 18 g grounds yielding 36 g beverage, a 1:2 ratio, in about 25–35 seconds; adjust grind and recipe to your equipment. This preparation replaces the ready espresso ingredient, rather than being added to it. Grounds are discarded, not eaten or counted as 18 g edible coffee. Use the dose suited to the basket and follow the machine manual. If the pitcher or wand needs more than 120 g milk, the equipment is unsuitable for this single-cup formula; never reheat the excess. Lactose-free milk can foam but changes nutrition. Plant drinks alter foam, flavour and nutrients and need another formulation; this one is not vegan. Optional sugar, cocoa and cinnamon are excluded. No exact caffeine content is promised: variety, dose and extraction vary. Keep milk cold and use pasteurised milk only. Steam and the cup can burn; do not let the thermometer touch the hot wand.","nutrition":{"fiber_g":0,"sodium_mg":57,"saturated_fat_g":2.3,"fat_g":4,"protein_g":3.8,"sugar_g":6.1,"carbs_g":6.4,"calories":76.4,"estimated":true,"serving_size":"1 proposed cup with all measured milk","source":"USDA FoodData Central — SR Legacy, April 2018 JSON","source_url":"https://fdc.nal.usda.gov/download-datasets/","method":"Two USDA records verified by FDC ID in the official archive: 36 g prepared espresso and 120 g whole milk. One serving. Coffee grounds, cup-warming water and incorporated air are excluded. All weighed milk is assumed to reach the cup.","note":"Estimate, not beverage analysis. Actual milk, extraction and liquid left in the pitcher change the result. Volume, timings and yield await a kitchen trial. No added sugar or caffeine calculation.","inputs":[{"fdc_id":171891,"fdc_description":"Beverages, coffee, brewed, espresso, restaurant-prepared","per_100g":{"fiber_g":0,"sodium_mg":14,"saturated_fat_g":0.092,"fat_g":0.18,"protein_g":0.12,"sugar_g":0,"carbs_g":1.67,"calories":9},"source_url":"https://fdc.nal.usda.gov/food-details/171891/nutrients","ingredient":"freshly prepared espresso","edible_grams":36},{"fdc_id":171265,"fdc_description":"Milk, whole, 3.25% milkfat, with added vitamin D","per_100g":{"fat_g":3.25,"sugar_g":5.05,"carbs_g":4.8,"calories":61,"saturated_fat_g":1.86,"fiber_g":0,"sodium_mg":43,"protein_g":3.15},"source_url":"https://fdc.nal.usda.gov/food-details/171265/nutrients","ingredient":"cold pasteurised whole milk","edible_grams":120}]},"image_url":"/recetas/receta-de-capuchino/portada.webp","gallery":[{"url":"/recetas/receta-de-capuchino/portada.webp","alt":"Homemade cappuccino with fine milk foam and espresso crema"}],"seo":{"title":"Homemade espresso cappuccino: step by step | Manual de Cocina","description":"Cappuccino without added sugar using measured espresso and milk. Texture at 55–60 °C and serve with fine foam; a proposed single-cup recipe.","image_alt":"Homemade cappuccino with fine milk foam and espresso crema","image_variants":["/recetas/receta-de-capuchino/portada-1x1.webp","/recetas/receta-de-capuchino/portada-4x3.webp","/recetas/receta-de-capuchino/portada-16x9.webp"],"faq":[{"q":"Why 36 g espresso rather than 36 g ground coffee?","a":"It is the weight of prepared beverage. A starting point is 18 g dry coffee yielding 36 g espresso, a 1:2 ratio. Discard the grounds; they are not added to the cup or nutrition calculation."},{"q":"Why does the foam have large bubbles?","a":"Too much air or a tip placed too high is often responsible. Introduce air gently at first, then create a whirlpool and swirl the pitcher afterwards. Stop at 55–60 °C and do not steam the same milk again."},{"q":"Can I store it or use another milk?","a":"Serve immediately without storing for reheating. Lactose-free or plant milk changes foam and nutrition; this calculation covers pasteurised whole milk and its full measured weight only."}]},"published":false,"editorial_status":"draft","content_html":"<p>Fresh espresso is combined with pasteurised whole milk and fine foam. No cocoa, chocolate, cream or added sugar is included; the calculated sugars come mainly from milk. You need an espresso machine with a steam wand suitable for small quantities, a pitcher and a thermometer.</p><p>The proposed yield is one cup of about 180–200 ml depending on incorporated air. Allow an estimated 5 minutes preparation and 5 for coffee and milk, 10 overall once the machine is ready. Machine warm-up may add time. Quantities, timings and volume await a kitchen trial. This is not claimed to follow a universal traditional ratio of three equal parts.</p>"},{"id":"96f5b007-9415-54c7-9b10-4f1c8d711607","recipe_group_id":"cc320b67-294e-4420-b904-4bd3d12d4c1b","language":"fr","slug":"recette-de-cappuccino","public_path":"/fr/recette-de-cappuccino","source_url":null,"title":"Cappuccino maison avec espresso et lait","excerpt":"Un cappuccino sans sucre ajouté avec 36 g d’espresso, 120 g de lait entier, mousse fine et contrôle de température.","summary":"Un espresso frais est associé à du lait entier pasteurisé et une mousse fine. Sans cacao, chocolat, crème ni sucre ajouté ; les sucres calculés proviennent surtout du lait. Il faut une machine à espresso, une buse adaptée aux petites quantités, un pichet et un thermomètre.\n\nLa proposition donne une tasse d’environ 180–200 ml selon l’air incorporé. Comptez 5 minutes de préparation et 5 pour le café et le lait, soit 10 une fois la machine prête. Son préchauffage peut ajouter du temps. Quantités, durées et volume attendent un essai en cuisine. Aucun ratio traditionnel universel de trois parts égales n’est affirmé.","category":"Boissons","category_slug":"bebidas","difficulty":"Moyenne","course":"Boisson","cuisine":"Italienne, proposition maison","prep_time_minutes":5,"cook_time_minutes":5,"total_time_minutes":10,"servings":1,"keywords":["cappuccino maison","espresso au lait","mousse de lait","recette cappuccino"],"ingredients":[{"name":"espresso fraîchement préparé","amount":"36","unit":"g de boisson, pas de café moulu","group":"Café"},{"name":"lait entier pasteurisé froid","amount":"120","unit":"g","group":"Lait"}],"steps":[{"title":"Préparer tasse, pichet et lait","content":"Utilisez une tasse de 180–200 ml, un petit pichet compatible avec la quantité de lait et un thermomètre propre. Chauffez la tasse à l’eau chaude et videz-la complètement. Pesez 120 g de lait froid à 4 °C ou moins dans le pichet ; ne le laissez pas à température ambiante. Suivez le manuel pour préchauffage et purge.","image_alt":"Pichet de lait froid près d’une tasse vide et d’une machine espresso","image_url":"/recetas/receta-de-capuchino/paso-01.webp"},{"title":"Préparer et peser l’espresso","content":"Extrayez le café dans la tasse chaude et pesez 36 g de boisson fraîche, sans le poids de la tasse. Si la machine ne permet pas extraction et vapeur simultanées, suivez son ordre de fonctionnement et ne laissez pas attendre le café longtemps. Il s’agit de liquide préparé, pas de café sec. N’ajoutez ni sucre ni cacao.","image_alt":"Espresso fraîchement extrait sous le porte-filtre","image_url":"/recetas/receta-de-capuchino/paso-02.webp"},{"title":"Texturer le lait sans le faire bouillir","content":"Purgez brièvement la buse vers le bac, mains loin de la vapeur. Placez la pointe près de la surface des 120 g de lait et ouvrez la vapeur pour incorporer l’air avec un léger sifflement, sans grosses bulles. Enfoncez légèrement pour créer un tourbillon. Arrêtez à 55–60 °C au thermomètre, avant de retirer le pichet. Ne faites pas bouillir et ne chauffez pas selon une durée fixe ; la puissance varie.","image_alt":"Buse vapeur texturant le lait dans un pichet métallique","image_url":"/recetas/receta-de-capuchino/paso-03.webp"},{"title":"Unir la mousse et nettoyer la buse","content":"Essuyez aussitôt la buse avec un linge propre réservé à cet usage et purgez selon le manuel sans vous brûler. Tapotez doucement le fond du pichet sur un linge, puis faites tourner le lait pour unir liquide et mousse. Il doit être brillant et fluide, sans grosses bulles séparées. Ne repassez pas à la vapeur un lait déjà chauffé.","image_alt":"Lait texturé brillant après rotation douce du pichet","image_url":"/recetas/receta-de-capuchino/paso-04.webp"},{"title":"Verser et servir immédiatement","content":"Versez le lait sur les 36 g d’espresso en filet continu, puis approchez le pichet pour déposer la mousse fine. Utilisez tout le lait pesé pour respecter le calcul ; aucun dessin n’est nécessaire. Servez aussitôt et vérifiez que la tasse ne brûle pas. Le volume proposé de 180–200 ml dépend de la mousse. Ne gardez pas cette boisson pour la réchauffer : jetez le lait texturé restant et gardez le lait froid inutilisé au réfrigérateur.","image_alt":"Cappuccino fini avec mousse fine dans une tasse","image_url":"/recetas/receta-de-capuchino/paso-05.webp"}],"notes":"Contient lait et caféine. Point de départ possible : 18 g de café moulu pour 36 g de boisson, ratio 1:2, en environ 25–35 secondes ; adaptez mouture et recette à la machine. Cela remplace l’ingrédient espresso préparé, sans s’y ajouter. Le marc n’est pas consommé ni compté comme 18 g de café comestible. Respectez dose du panier et manuel. Si pichet ou buse exige plus de 120 g de lait, l’équipement ne convient pas à cette tasse ; ne réchauffez pas le surplus. Le lait sans lactose peut mousser mais change la nutrition. Une boisson végétale change mousse, goût et nutriments et demande une autre fiche ; celle-ci n’est pas végétalienne. Sucre, cacao et cannelle ne sont pas inclus. Aucun taux précis de caféine n’est promis : variété, dose et extraction le modifient. Gardez le lait froid et utilisez uniquement du lait pasteurisé. Vapeur et tasse peuvent brûler ; ne laissez pas le thermomètre toucher la buse chaude.","nutrition":{"fiber_g":0,"sodium_mg":57,"saturated_fat_g":2.3,"fat_g":4,"protein_g":3.8,"sugar_g":6.1,"carbs_g":6.4,"calories":76.4,"estimated":true,"serving_size":"1 tasse proposée avec tout le lait pesé","source":"USDA FoodData Central — SR Legacy, April 2018 JSON","source_url":"https://fdc.nal.usda.gov/download-datasets/","method":"Deux fiches USDA vérifiées par FDC ID dans l’archive officielle : 36 g d’espresso préparé et 120 g de lait entier. Une portion. Marc, eau de préchauffage de la tasse et air exclus. Tout le lait pesé est supposé versé.","note":"Estimation, pas analyse de la boisson. Lait, extraction et liquide restant au pichet changent le résultat. Volume, durées et rendement attendent un essai en cuisine. Sans sucre ajouté ni calcul de caféine.","inputs":[{"fdc_id":171891,"fdc_description":"Beverages, coffee, brewed, espresso, restaurant-prepared","per_100g":{"fiber_g":0,"sodium_mg":14,"saturated_fat_g":0.092,"fat_g":0.18,"protein_g":0.12,"sugar_g":0,"carbs_g":1.67,"calories":9},"source_url":"https://fdc.nal.usda.gov/food-details/171891/nutrients","ingredient":"espresso fraîchement préparé","edible_grams":36},{"fdc_id":171265,"fdc_description":"Milk, whole, 3.25% milkfat, with added vitamin D","per_100g":{"fat_g":3.25,"sugar_g":5.05,"carbs_g":4.8,"calories":61,"saturated_fat_g":1.86,"fiber_g":0,"sodium_mg":43,"protein_g":3.15},"source_url":"https://fdc.nal.usda.gov/food-details/171265/nutrients","ingredient":"lait entier pasteurisé froid","edible_grams":120}]},"image_url":"/recetas/receta-de-capuchino/portada.webp","gallery":[{"url":"/recetas/receta-de-capuchino/portada.webp","alt":"Cappuccino maison à la mousse fine et à la crema d’espresso"}],"seo":{"title":"Cappuccino maison avec espresso, pas à pas | Manual de Cocina","description":"Cappuccino sans sucre ajouté avec espresso et lait pesés. Texturez à 55–60 °C et servez avec une mousse fine ; proposition pour une tasse.","image_alt":"Cappuccino maison à la mousse fine et à la crema d’espresso","image_variants":["/recetas/receta-de-capuchino/portada-1x1.webp","/recetas/receta-de-capuchino/portada-4x3.webp","/recetas/receta-de-capuchino/portada-16x9.webp"],"faq":[{"q":"Pourquoi 36 g d’espresso et non de café moulu ?","a":"C’est le poids de la boisson préparée. On peut partir de 18 g de café sec pour obtenir 36 g d’espresso, ratio 1:2. Jetez le marc ; il ne va ni dans la tasse ni dans le calcul nutritionnel."},{"q":"Pourquoi la mousse a-t-elle de grosses bulles ?","a":"Trop d’air ou une pointe trop haute en sont souvent la cause. Incorporez doucement l’air au début, puis formez un tourbillon et faites tourner le pichet. Arrêtez à 55–60 °C et ne vaporisez pas de nouveau le même lait."},{"q":"Peut-on conserver la boisson ou changer de lait ?","a":"Servez immédiatement sans conserver pour réchauffer. Lait sans lactose et boissons végétales changent mousse et nutrition ; le calcul concerne seulement le lait entier pasteurisé et tout son poids mesuré."}]},"published":false,"editorial_status":"draft","content_html":"<p>Un espresso frais est associé à du lait entier pasteurisé et une mousse fine. Sans cacao, chocolat, crème ni sucre ajouté ; les sucres calculés proviennent surtout du lait. Il faut une machine à espresso, une buse adaptée aux petites quantités, un pichet et un thermomètre.</p><p>La proposition donne une tasse d’environ 180–200 ml selon l’air incorporé. Comptez 5 minutes de préparation et 5 pour le café et le lait, soit 10 une fois la machine prête. Son préchauffage peut ajouter du temps. Quantités, durées et volume attendent un essai en cuisine. Aucun ratio traditionnel universel de trois parts égales n’est affirmé.</p>"},{"id":"3021dce8-571d-5969-91f7-84d3733a5482","recipe_group_id":"cc320b67-294e-4420-b904-4bd3d12d4c1b","language":"it","slug":"ricetta-cappuccino","public_path":"/it/ricetta-cappuccino","source_url":null,"title":"Cappuccino fatto in casa con espresso e latte","excerpt":"Cappuccino senza zucchero aggiunto con 36 g di espresso, 120 g di latte intero, schiuma fine e temperatura controllata.","summary":"Espresso appena fatto, latte intero pastorizzato e schiuma fine. Senza cacao, cioccolato, panna o zucchero aggiunto; gli zuccheri calcolati provengono soprattutto dal latte. Servono macchina espresso, lancia adatta a piccole quantità, bricco e termometro.\n\nLa proposta rende una tazza di circa 180–200 ml secondo l’aria incorporata. Si stimano 5 minuti di preparazione e 5 per caffè e latte, 10 totali quando la macchina è pronta. Il riscaldamento della macchina può aggiungere tempo. Dosi, tempi e volume attendono prova in cucina; non si afferma un rapporto tradizionale universale di tre parti uguali.","category":"Bevande","category_slug":"bebidas","difficulty":"Media","course":"Bevanda","cuisine":"Italiana, proposta casalinga","prep_time_minutes":5,"cook_time_minutes":5,"total_time_minutes":10,"servings":1,"keywords":["cappuccino fatto in casa","espresso e latte","schiuma di latte","ricetta cappuccino"],"ingredients":[{"name":"espresso appena preparato","amount":"36","unit":"g di bevanda, non di caffè macinato","group":"Caffè"},{"name":"latte intero pastorizzato freddo","amount":"120","unit":"g","group":"Latte"}],"steps":[{"title":"Preparare tazza, bricco e latte","content":"Usare una tazza da 180–200 ml, un piccolo bricco adatto alla quantità di latte e un termometro pulito. Scaldare la tazza con acqua calda e svuotarla completamente. Pesare 120 g di latte freddo a 4 °C o meno nel bricco; non lasciarlo a temperatura ambiente. Seguire il manuale per riscaldamento e spurgo.","image_alt":"Bricco con latte freddo accanto a tazza vuota e macchina espresso","image_url":"/recetas/receta-de-capuchino/paso-01.webp"},{"title":"Preparare e pesare l’espresso","content":"Estrarre espresso nella tazza calda e pesare 36 g di bevanda fresca, escludendo il peso della tazza. Se non si possono usare estrazione e vapore insieme, seguire la sequenza del manuale senza far attendere a lungo il caffè. È peso di liquido preparato, non caffè secco. Non aggiungere zucchero o cacao.","image_alt":"Espresso appena estratto sotto il portafiltro","image_url":"/recetas/receta-de-capuchino/paso-02.webp"},{"title":"Montare il latte senza bollirlo","content":"Spurgare brevemente la lancia verso la vaschetta, tenendo le mani lontane dal vapore. Mettere la punta vicino alla superficie dei 120 g di latte e aprire il vapore per introdurre aria con un sibilo delicato, senza grandi bolle. Immergere un poco per creare un vortice. Fermare il vapore quando il termometro indica 55–60 °C, prima di togliere il bricco. Non bollire o basarsi su un tempo fisso: la potenza cambia.","image_alt":"Lancia che monta il latte in un bricco metallico","image_url":"/recetas/receta-de-capuchino/paso-03.webp"},{"title":"Unire la schiuma e pulire la lancia","content":"Pulire subito la lancia con un panno pulito dedicato e spurgare secondo il manuale, evitando scottature. Battere delicatamente la base del bricco su un panno e ruotare il latte per unire schiuma e liquido. Deve essere lucido e fluido, senza grandi bolle separate. Non vaporizzare di nuovo latte già scaldato.","image_alt":"Latte montato lucido dopo aver ruotato il bricco","image_url":"/recetas/receta-de-capuchino/paso-04.webp"},{"title":"Versare e servire subito","content":"Versare il latte sui 36 g di espresso a filo continuo, avvicinando il bricco alla fine per depositare la schiuma fine. Usare tutto il latte pesato per rispettare la stima; non serve disegnare. Servire subito e verificare che la tazza non scotti. Il volume proposto di 180–200 ml dipende dalla schiuma. Non conservare per riscaldare: eliminare il latte montato avanzato e tenere al freddo quello inutilizzato.","image_alt":"Cappuccino pronto con schiuma fine in tazza","image_url":"/recetas/receta-de-capuchino/paso-05.webp"}],"notes":"Contiene latte e caffeina. Per l’espresso si può partire da 18 g di caffè macinato per 36 g di bevanda, rapporto 1:2, in circa 25–35 secondi; adattare macinatura e ricetta. Questo sostituisce l’ingrediente espresso pronto, non si aggiunge. I fondi non si mangiano e non si contano come 18 g di caffè edibile. Usare dose adatta al filtro e seguire il manuale. Se bricco o lancia richiedono più di 120 g di latte, l’attrezzatura non è adatta a questa tazza; non riscaldare gli avanzi. Il latte senza lattosio può montare ma cambia la nutrizione. Bevande vegetali cambiano schiuma, sapore e nutrienti e richiedono altra formulazione; questa non è vegana. Non sono inclusi zucchero, cacao o cannella. Non si promette una quantità precisa di caffeina: varietà, dose ed estrazione la modificano. Tenere il latte freddo e usare solo pastorizzato. Vapore e tazza possono scottare; il termometro non deve toccare la lancia calda.","nutrition":{"fiber_g":0,"sodium_mg":57,"saturated_fat_g":2.3,"fat_g":4,"protein_g":3.8,"sugar_g":6.1,"carbs_g":6.4,"calories":76.4,"estimated":true,"serving_size":"1 tazza proposta con tutto il latte pesato","source":"USDA FoodData Central — SR Legacy, April 2018 JSON","source_url":"https://fdc.nal.usda.gov/download-datasets/","method":"Due schede USDA verificate tramite FDC ID nell’archivio ufficiale: 36 g di espresso preparato e 120 g di latte intero. Una porzione. Esclusi fondi, acqua per scaldare la tazza e aria. Si presume che tutto il latte pesato finisca nella tazza.","note":"Stima, non analisi della bevanda. Latte, estrazione e liquido rimasto nel bricco cambiano il risultato. Volume, tempi e resa attendono prova in cucina. Senza zucchero aggiunto o calcolo della caffeina.","inputs":[{"fdc_id":171891,"fdc_description":"Beverages, coffee, brewed, espresso, restaurant-prepared","per_100g":{"fiber_g":0,"sodium_mg":14,"saturated_fat_g":0.092,"fat_g":0.18,"protein_g":0.12,"sugar_g":0,"carbs_g":1.67,"calories":9},"source_url":"https://fdc.nal.usda.gov/food-details/171891/nutrients","ingredient":"espresso appena preparato","edible_grams":36},{"fdc_id":171265,"fdc_description":"Milk, whole, 3.25% milkfat, with added vitamin D","per_100g":{"fat_g":3.25,"sugar_g":5.05,"carbs_g":4.8,"calories":61,"saturated_fat_g":1.86,"fiber_g":0,"sodium_mg":43,"protein_g":3.15},"source_url":"https://fdc.nal.usda.gov/food-details/171265/nutrients","ingredient":"latte intero pastorizzato freddo","edible_grams":120}]},"image_url":"/recetas/receta-de-capuchino/portada.webp","gallery":[{"url":"/recetas/receta-de-capuchino/portada.webp","alt":"Cappuccino casalingo con schiuma fine e crema dell’espresso"}],"seo":{"title":"Cappuccino casalingo con espresso: i passaggi | Manual de Cocina","description":"Cappuccino senza zucchero aggiunto con espresso e latte pesati. Monta a 55–60 °C e servi con schiuma fine; proposta per una tazza.","image_alt":"Cappuccino casalingo con schiuma fine e crema dell’espresso","image_variants":["/recetas/receta-de-capuchino/portada-1x1.webp","/recetas/receta-de-capuchino/portada-4x3.webp","/recetas/receta-de-capuchino/portada-16x9.webp"],"faq":[{"q":"Perché 36 g di espresso e non di caffè macinato?","a":"È il peso della bevanda pronta. Un punto di partenza è 18 g di caffè secco per ottenere 36 g di espresso, rapporto 1:2. Eliminare i fondi; non si aggiungono alla tazza né al calcolo nutrizionale."},{"q":"Perché la schiuma ha bolle grandi?","a":"Spesso entra troppa aria o la punta è troppo alta. Introdurre aria dolcemente all’inizio, poi creare un vortice e ruotare il bricco. Fermarsi a 55–60 °C e non vaporizzare lo stesso latte di nuovo."},{"q":"Posso conservarlo o cambiare latte?","a":"Servire subito senza conservare per riscaldare. Latte senza lattosio e bevande vegetali cambiano schiuma e nutrienti; il calcolo riguarda solo latte intero pastorizzato e tutto il peso misurato."}]},"published":false,"editorial_status":"draft","content_html":"<p>Espresso appena fatto, latte intero pastorizzato e schiuma fine. Senza cacao, cioccolato, panna o zucchero aggiunto; gli zuccheri calcolati provengono soprattutto dal latte. Servono macchina espresso, lancia adatta a piccole quantità, bricco e termometro.</p><p>La proposta rende una tazza di circa 180–200 ml secondo l’aria incorporata. Si stimano 5 minuti di preparazione e 5 per caffè e latte, 10 totali quando la macchina è pronta. Il riscaldamento della macchina può aggiungere tempo. Dosi, tempi e volume attendono prova in cucina; non si afferma un rapporto tradizionale universale di tre parti uguali.</p>"},{"id":"73ed4995-9d93-5e75-99f0-b0d50a6126e0","recipe_group_id":"cc320b67-294e-4420-b904-4bd3d12d4c1b","language":"ja","slug":"カプチーノのレシピ","public_path":"/ja/カプチーノのレシピ","source_url":null,"title":"エスプレッソと牛乳で作る自家製カプチーノ","excerpt":"エスプレッソ36 gと全乳120 gを使う砂糖無添加のカプチーノ。細かな泡と温度を確認します。","summary":"淹れたてのエスプレッソに、殺菌済み全乳と細かな泡を合わせます。ココア、チョコレート、生クリーム、添加糖は使わず、栄養計算の糖類は主に牛乳由来です。少量に対応するスチームノズル付きエスプレッソマシン、ピッチャー、温度計が必要です。\n\n出来上がりは空気の量により約180–200 mlの1杯を提案します。準備5分、コーヒーと牛乳の加熱5分、マシンが使える状態になってから合計10分の推定です。マシンの予熱時間は別途必要になる場合があります。分量、時間、容量は調理試験待ちです。伝統的に必ず3等分する普遍的な比率とは主張しません。","category":"飲み物","category_slug":"bebidas","difficulty":"中級","course":"飲み物","cuisine":"イタリア風の家庭用レシピ案","prep_time_minutes":5,"cook_time_minutes":5,"total_time_minutes":10,"servings":1,"keywords":["カプチーノ 作り方","自家製カプチーノ","エスプレッソ 牛乳","ミルクフォーム"],"ingredients":[{"name":"淹れたてのエスプレッソ","amount":"36","unit":"g、粉ではなく抽出済みの飲料","group":"コーヒー"},{"name":"冷たい殺菌済み全乳","amount":"120","unit":"g","group":"牛乳"}],"steps":[{"title":"カップ、ピッチャー、牛乳を用意する","content":"180–200 mlのカップ、牛乳の量に適した小さなピッチャー、清潔な温度計を用意します。カップを湯で温め、完全に空にします。4 °C以下の冷たい牛乳120 gをピッチャーに量り、室温で放置しません。マシンの予熱とパージは説明書に従います。","image_alt":"空のカップとマシンの横に置いた冷たい牛乳のピッチャー","image_url":"/recetas/receta-de-capuchino/paso-01.webp"},{"title":"エスプレッソを淹れて量る","content":"温めたカップにエスプレッソを抽出し、カップの重さを除いて飲料36 gを量ります。抽出とスチームを同時に使えない機種は説明書の順序に従い、コーヒーを長く待たせません。指定重量は抽出済みの液体で、乾いたコーヒー粉ではありません。この版では砂糖やココアを加えません。","image_alt":"ポルタフィルターからカップへ抽出するエスプレッソ","image_url":"/recetas/receta-de-capuchino/paso-02.webp"},{"title":"沸騰させずに牛乳を泡立てる","content":"ノズルを受け皿へ向けて短くパージし、手を蒸気から離します。牛乳120 gの表面近くに先端を置き、蒸気を開いて柔らかな音で空気を入れ、大きな泡を作らないようにします。少し沈めて渦を作り、温度計が55–60 °Cを示したら蒸気を止めてからピッチャーを外します。沸騰させず、一定時間だけで判断しません。機種の出力が異なります。","image_alt":"金属ピッチャーの牛乳をスチームで泡立てる","image_url":"/recetas/receta-de-capuchino/paso-03.webp"},{"title":"泡をなじませ、ノズルを清掃する","content":"専用の清潔な布でノズルをすぐ拭き、やけどを避けて説明書通りにパージします。ピッチャーの底を布の上で軽くたたき、回して牛乳と泡を一体化させます。大きな泡が分離せず、つやがあり流れる状態にします。一度温めた牛乳を再度スチームにかけません。","image_alt":"ピッチャーを回してなじませたつやのある牛乳","image_url":"/recetas/receta-de-capuchino/paso-04.webp"},{"title":"注いですぐ提供する","content":"エスプレッソ36 gへ牛乳を一定の流れで注ぎ、最後にピッチャーを近づけて細かい泡をのせます。推定栄養値に合わせ、量った牛乳をすべて使います。模様は不要です。すぐ提供し、カップでやけどしないか確認します。提案する180–200 mlの容量は泡の量で変わります。保存して再加熱せず、残った泡立てた牛乳は捨て、未使用の冷たい牛乳は冷蔵します。","image_alt":"陶器のカップに入った細かい泡のカプチーノ","image_url":"/recetas/receta-de-capuchino/paso-05.webp"}],"notes":"牛乳とカフェインを含みます。エスプレッソはコーヒー粉18 gから飲料36 gを得る1:2の比率、約25–35秒を出発点にし、挽き目と配合を機器に合わせられます。これは抽出済みエスプレッソの材料を置き換える方法で、追加する材料ではありません。粉のかすは食べず、可食コーヒー18 gとして計算しません。バスケットに合う量と説明書に従ってください。ピッチャーやノズルが牛乳120 gを超える量を必要とするなら、この1杯の配合には不適切です。余りを再加熱しません。乳糖不使用の牛乳は泡立つ場合がありますが栄養値が変わります。植物性飲料は泡、味、栄養が変わり別配合が必要で、この案はヴィーガンではありません。任意の砂糖、ココア、シナモンは含めません。カフェイン量は豆、量、抽出で変わるため正確な量を保証しません。牛乳を冷蔵し、殺菌済みだけを使います。蒸気とカップでやけどに注意し、温度計を熱いノズルに当てません。","nutrition":{"fiber_g":0,"sodium_mg":57,"saturated_fat_g":2.3,"fat_g":4,"protein_g":3.8,"sugar_g":6.1,"carbs_g":6.4,"calories":76.4,"estimated":true,"serving_size":"計量した牛乳全量を使う提案の1杯","source":"USDA FoodData Central — SR Legacy, April 2018 JSON","source_url":"https://fdc.nal.usda.gov/download-datasets/","method":"公式アーカイブでFDC IDからUSDA2項目を確認。抽出済みエスプレッソ36 gと全乳120 gで1人分。コーヒーかす、カップを温める湯、空気は除外。量った牛乳全量をカップへ注ぐと仮定。","note":"飲料の分析ではなく推定。実際の牛乳、抽出、ピッチャーに残る液体により変わる。容量、時間、出来上がり量は調理試験待ち。添加糖とカフェイン計算は含まない。","inputs":[{"fdc_id":171891,"fdc_description":"Beverages, coffee, brewed, espresso, restaurant-prepared","per_100g":{"fiber_g":0,"sodium_mg":14,"saturated_fat_g":0.092,"fat_g":0.18,"protein_g":0.12,"sugar_g":0,"carbs_g":1.67,"calories":9},"source_url":"https://fdc.nal.usda.gov/food-details/171891/nutrients","ingredient":"淹れたてのエスプレッソ","edible_grams":36},{"fdc_id":171265,"fdc_description":"Milk, whole, 3.25% milkfat, with added vitamin D","per_100g":{"fat_g":3.25,"sugar_g":5.05,"carbs_g":4.8,"calories":61,"saturated_fat_g":1.86,"fiber_g":0,"sodium_mg":43,"protein_g":3.15},"source_url":"https://fdc.nal.usda.gov/food-details/171265/nutrients","ingredient":"冷たい殺菌済み全乳","edible_grams":120}]},"image_url":"/recetas/receta-de-capuchino/portada.webp","gallery":[{"url":"/recetas/receta-de-capuchino/portada.webp","alt":"細かなミルクフォームとエスプレッソのクレマがある自家製カプチーノ"}],"seo":{"title":"自家製カプチーノ：エスプレッソと牛乳の手順 | Manual de Cocina","description":"計量したエスプレッソと牛乳で砂糖無添加のカプチーノ。55–60 °Cで細かく泡立てて提供する1杯分の案。","image_alt":"細かなミルクフォームとエスプレッソのクレマがある自家製カプチーノ","image_variants":["/recetas/receta-de-capuchino/portada-1x1.webp","/recetas/receta-de-capuchino/portada-4x3.webp","/recetas/receta-de-capuchino/portada-16x9.webp"],"faq":[{"q":"なぜコーヒー粉36 gではなくエスプレッソ36 gですか？","a":"抽出後の飲料の重さです。粉18 gからエスプレッソ36 gを得る1:2の比率を出発点にできます。かすは捨て、カップにも栄養計算にも加えません。"},{"q":"大きな泡ができるのはなぜですか？","a":"空気を入れすぎるか、先端が高すぎる場合があります。最初は柔らかく空気を入れ、次に渦を作り、最後にピッチャーを回します。55–60 °Cで止め、同じ牛乳を再度スチームにかけません。"},{"q":"保存や別の牛乳への変更はできますか？","a":"再加熱用に保存せず、すぐ提供する案です。乳糖不使用や植物性飲料では泡と栄養が変わります。計算は殺菌済み全乳の計量した全量に限ります。"}]},"published":false,"editorial_status":"draft","content_html":"<p>淹れたてのエスプレッソに、殺菌済み全乳と細かな泡を合わせます。ココア、チョコレート、生クリーム、添加糖は使わず、栄養計算の糖類は主に牛乳由来です。少量に対応するスチームノズル付きエスプレッソマシン、ピッチャー、温度計が必要です。</p><p>出来上がりは空気の量により約180–200 mlの1杯を提案します。準備5分、コーヒーと牛乳の加熱5分、マシンが使える状態になってから合計10分の推定です。マシンの予熱時間は別途必要になる場合があります。分量、時間、容量は調理試験待ちです。伝統的に必ず3等分する普遍的な比率とは主張しません。</p>"},{"id":"d732722e-4121-5c08-bd12-0637e49601cf","recipe_group_id":"cc320b67-294e-4420-b904-4bd3d12d4c1b","language":"pt","slug":"cappuccino-caseiro","public_path":"/pt/cappuccino-caseiro","source_url":null,"title":"Cappuccino caseiro com espresso e leite","excerpt":"Cappuccino sem açúcar adicionado com 36 g de espresso, 120 g de leite integral, espuma fina e temperatura controlada.","summary":"Espresso recém-preparado é combinado com leite integral pasteurizado e espuma fina. Sem cacau, chocolate, creme de leite ou açúcar adicionado; os açúcares calculados vêm principalmente do leite. É preciso máquina de espresso, vaporizador adequado a pequenas quantidades, jarra e termômetro.\n\nA proposta rende uma xícara de cerca de 180–200 ml conforme o ar incorporado. Estimam-se 5 minutos de preparo e 5 para café e leite, 10 no total depois que a máquina estiver pronta. O preaquecimento pode acrescentar tempo. Quantidades, tempos e volume aguardam teste de cozinha; não se afirma uma proporção tradicional universal de três partes iguais.","category":"Bebidas","category_slug":"bebidas","difficulty":"Média","course":"Bebida","cuisine":"Italiana, proposta caseira","prep_time_minutes":5,"cook_time_minutes":5,"total_time_minutes":10,"servings":1,"keywords":["cappuccino caseiro","espresso com leite","espuma de leite","receita cappuccino"],"ingredients":[{"name":"espresso recém-preparado","amount":"36","unit":"g de bebida, não de café moído","group":"Café"},{"name":"leite integral pasteurizado frio","amount":"120","unit":"g","group":"Leite"}],"steps":[{"title":"Prepare xícara, jarra e leite","content":"Use xícara de 180–200 ml, jarra pequena compatível com a quantidade de leite e termômetro limpo. Aqueça a xícara com água quente e esvazie completamente. Pese 120 g de leite frio a 4 °C ou menos na jarra; não deixe em temperatura ambiente. Siga o manual para preaquecimento e purga.","image_alt":"Jarra de leite frio ao lado de xícara vazia e máquina espresso","image_url":"/recetas/receta-de-capuchino/paso-01.webp"},{"title":"Prepare e pese o espresso","content":"Extraia espresso na xícara quente e pese 36 g de bebida fresca, sem o peso da xícara. Se a máquina não permite extração e vapor juntos, siga a sequência do manual sem deixar o café esperando muito. O peso é de líquido preparado, não de café seco. Não adicione açúcar ou cacau.","image_alt":"Espresso recém-extraído na xícara sob o porta-filtro","image_url":"/recetas/receta-de-capuchino/paso-02.webp"},{"title":"Texturize o leite sem ferver","content":"Purgue brevemente a lança apontando para a bandeja e afaste as mãos do vapor. Coloque a ponta perto da superfície dos 120 g de leite e abra o vapor para incorporar ar com um chiado suave, sem bolhas grandes. Mergulhe um pouco para criar redemoinho e pare quando o termômetro marcar 55–60 °C. Feche o vapor antes de retirar a jarra. Não ferva nem aqueça apenas por tempo fixo; a potência varia.","image_alt":"Lança texturizando leite em jarra metálica","image_url":"/recetas/receta-de-capuchino/paso-03.webp"},{"title":"Integre a espuma e limpe a lança","content":"Limpe logo a lança com pano limpo exclusivo e purgue conforme o manual, evitando queimaduras. Bata suavemente o fundo da jarra em um pano e gire o leite para unir espuma e líquido. Deve estar brilhante e fluido, sem bolhas grandes separadas. Não vaporize novamente leite já aquecido.","image_alt":"Leite texturizado brilhante após girar a jarra","image_url":"/recetas/receta-de-capuchino/paso-04.webp"},{"title":"Despeje e sirva imediatamente","content":"Despeje o leite sobre os 36 g de espresso em fio contínuo e aproxime a jarra no final para depositar espuma fina. Use todo o leite pesado para manter a estimativa; não precisa fazer desenho. Sirva logo e confira se a xícara não queima. O volume proposto de 180–200 ml depende da espuma. Não guarde para reaquecer: descarte sobra de leite texturizado e mantenha o leite frio não usado na geladeira.","image_alt":"Cappuccino pronto com espuma fina em xícara de cerâmica","image_url":"/recetas/receta-de-capuchino/paso-05.webp"}],"notes":"Contém leite e cafeína. Para espresso, pode começar com 18 g de café moído para obter 36 g de bebida, proporção 1:2, em cerca de 25–35 segundos; ajuste moagem e receita ao equipamento. Isso substitui o ingrediente espresso pronto, sem se somar a ele. A borra não é ingerida nem contada como 18 g de café comestível. Use dose adequada ao filtro e siga o manual. Se a jarra ou lança exige mais de 120 g de leite, o equipamento não serve para esta fórmula de uma xícara; não aqueça novamente a sobra. Leite sem lactose pode espumar, mas muda a nutrição. Bebida vegetal altera espuma, sabor e nutrientes e exige outra formulação; esta não é vegana. Açúcar, cacau e canela opcionais não estão incluídos. Não se promete cafeína exata: variedade, dose e extração influem. Mantenha o leite frio e use apenas pasteurizado. Vapor e xícara podem queimar; não encoste o termômetro na lança quente.","nutrition":{"fiber_g":0,"sodium_mg":57,"saturated_fat_g":2.3,"fat_g":4,"protein_g":3.8,"sugar_g":6.1,"carbs_g":6.4,"calories":76.4,"estimated":true,"serving_size":"1 xícara proposta com todo o leite pesado","source":"USDA FoodData Central — SR Legacy, April 2018 JSON","source_url":"https://fdc.nal.usda.gov/download-datasets/","method":"Duas fichas USDA verificadas por FDC ID no arquivo oficial: 36 g de espresso pronto e 120 g de leite integral. Uma porção. Exclui borra, água para aquecer a xícara e ar incorporado. Supõe todo o leite pesado na xícara.","note":"Estimativa, não análise da bebida. Leite, extração e líquido deixado na jarra mudam o resultado. Volume, tempos e rendimento aguardam teste de cozinha. Sem açúcar adicionado ou cálculo de cafeína.","inputs":[{"fdc_id":171891,"fdc_description":"Beverages, coffee, brewed, espresso, restaurant-prepared","per_100g":{"fiber_g":0,"sodium_mg":14,"saturated_fat_g":0.092,"fat_g":0.18,"protein_g":0.12,"sugar_g":0,"carbs_g":1.67,"calories":9},"source_url":"https://fdc.nal.usda.gov/food-details/171891/nutrients","ingredient":"espresso recém-preparado","edible_grams":36},{"fdc_id":171265,"fdc_description":"Milk, whole, 3.25% milkfat, with added vitamin D","per_100g":{"fat_g":3.25,"sugar_g":5.05,"carbs_g":4.8,"calories":61,"saturated_fat_g":1.86,"fiber_g":0,"sodium_mg":43,"protein_g":3.15},"source_url":"https://fdc.nal.usda.gov/food-details/171265/nutrients","ingredient":"leite integral pasteurizado frio","edible_grams":120}]},"image_url":"/recetas/receta-de-capuchino/portada.webp","gallery":[{"url":"/recetas/receta-de-capuchino/portada.webp","alt":"Cappuccino caseiro com espuma fina e crema do espresso"}],"seo":{"title":"Cappuccino caseiro com espresso: passo a passo | Manual de Cocina","description":"Cappuccino sem açúcar adicionado com espresso e leite medidos. Texturize a 55–60 °C e sirva com espuma fina; proposta para uma xícara.","image_alt":"Cappuccino caseiro com espuma fina e crema do espresso","image_variants":["/recetas/receta-de-capuchino/portada-1x1.webp","/recetas/receta-de-capuchino/portada-4x3.webp","/recetas/receta-de-capuchino/portada-16x9.webp"],"faq":[{"q":"Por que 36 g de espresso e não de café moído?","a":"É o peso da bebida pronta. Pode começar com 18 g de café seco para obter 36 g de espresso, proporção 1:2. Descarte a borra; ela não vai à xícara nem ao cálculo nutricional."},{"q":"Por que a espuma tem bolhas grandes?","a":"Costuma entrar ar demais ou a ponta fica alta. Incorpore ar suavemente no início, depois faça redemoinho e gire a jarra. Pare a 55–60 °C e não vaporize o mesmo leite de novo."},{"q":"Posso guardar ou trocar o leite?","a":"Sirva imediatamente sem guardar para reaquecer. Leite sem lactose ou vegetal muda espuma e nutrição; o cálculo corresponde só ao leite integral pasteurizado e todo o peso medido."}]},"published":false,"editorial_status":"draft","content_html":"<p>Espresso recém-preparado é combinado com leite integral pasteurizado e espuma fina. Sem cacau, chocolate, creme de leite ou açúcar adicionado; os açúcares calculados vêm principalmente do leite. É preciso máquina de espresso, vaporizador adequado a pequenas quantidades, jarra e termômetro.</p><p>A proposta rende uma xícara de cerca de 180–200 ml conforme o ar incorporado. Estimam-se 5 minutos de preparo e 5 para café e leite, 10 no total depois que a máquina estiver pronta. O preaquecimento pode acrescentar tempo. Quantidades, tempos e volume aguardam teste de cozinha; não se afirma uma proporção tradicional universal de três partes iguais.</p>"},{"id":"3a512fac-c4ae-40ad-92b1-412c608da8ed","recipe_group_id":"14f34319-2bdc-478f-b55b-909be0df6964","language":"es","slug":"receta-de-lasana-de-pollo-con-champinones","public_path":"/receta-de-lasana-de-pollo-con-champinones","source_url":"https://manualdecocina.com/receta-de-lasana-de-pollo-con-champinones/","title":"Lasaña de pollo con champiñones y bechamel","excerpt":"Lasaña de pollo y champiñones para 6, con pasta precocida, relleno sin exceso de líquido, bechamel casera y mozzarella gratinada.","summary":"Esta propuesta de lasaña combina pollo cocinado en dados, champiñones salteados y una bechamel de leche entera. Se monta con tres capas de pasta previamente cocida y dos capas de relleno, y termina con mozzarella de baja humedad. Conserva la URL histórica de la lasaña de pollo con champiñones y su clasificación aprobada como receta.\n\nSe proponen 6 porciones en una fuente de unos 20 × 30 cm, 20 minutos de preparación, 60 de cocción con algunas tareas en paralelo y 10 de reposo: 90 minutos en total. La marca y el tamaño de las láminas pueden cambiar el montaje y la cocción. Cantidades, tiempos y rendimiento son estimados y pendientes de prueba de cocina; la temperatura del pollo y del centro se comprueba con termómetro.","category":"Pastas","category_slug":"pastas","difficulty":"Media","course":"Plato principal","cuisine":"Italiana, adaptación casera","prep_time_minutes":20,"cook_time_minutes":60,"total_time_minutes":90,"servings":6,"keywords":["lasaña de pollo","lasaña con champiñones","bechamel casera","lasaña blanca"],"ingredients":[{"name":"láminas de lasaña secas que requieren cocción previa","amount":"240","unit":"g","group":"Pasta"},{"name":"pechuga de pollo cruda sin piel ni hueso","amount":"600","unit":"g","group":"Relleno"},{"name":"champiñones blancos frescos","amount":"500","unit":"g","group":"Relleno"},{"name":"cebolla","amount":"150","unit":"g","group":"Relleno"},{"name":"ajo","amount":"10","unit":"g","group":"Relleno"},{"name":"aceite de oliva","amount":"20","unit":"g","group":"Relleno"},{"name":"leche entera pasteurizada","amount":"700","unit":"g","group":"Bechamel"},{"name":"mantequilla sin sal","amount":"40","unit":"g","group":"Bechamel"},{"name":"harina de trigo de uso común","amount":"40","unit":"g","group":"Bechamel"},{"name":"mozzarella de baja humedad de leche entera, rallada","amount":"180","unit":"g","group":"Acabado"},{"name":"sal fina","amount":"6","unit":"g","group":"Sazonado"},{"name":"pimienta negra molida","amount":"0.5","unit":"g","group":"Sazonado"},{"name":"nuez moscada molida","amount":"0.2","unit":"g","group":"Sazonado"}],"steps":[{"title":"Prepara los ingredientes y la fuente","content":"Precalienta el horno a 190 °C con calor arriba y abajo, sin ventilador, y prepara una fuente de unos 20 × 30 cm. Limpia y corta los 500 g de champiñones en láminas, pica los 150 g de cebolla y los 10 g de ajo. En otra tabla corta los 600 g de pollo en dados de unos 1,5 cm, sin lavarlo. Separa utensilios crudos y cocidos. Divide la sal: 3 g para el relleno y 3 g para la bechamel; la pimienta: 0,25 g para cada uno.","image_alt":"Ingredientes de lasaña separados, champiñones laminados y pollo crudo en una tabla aparte","image_url":"/recetas/receta-de-lasana-de-pollo-con-champinones/paso-01.webp"},{"title":"Cuece y escurre las láminas","content":"Cuece los 240 g de láminas en una olla grande con agua potable hirviendo, sin sal añadida, siguiendo el tiempo del envase y retirándolas aproximadamente 1 minuto antes si después se hornean. El agua de cocción se desecha y no forma parte del cálculo. Escurre y extiende sobre un paño limpio, sin amontonarlas. Usa láminas que requieren cocción previa; las listas para horno necesitan otra proporción de líquido y no son la opción de esta ficha.","image_alt":"Láminas de lasaña cocidas extendidas sin superponerse sobre un paño limpio","image_url":"/recetas/receta-de-lasana-de-pollo-con-champinones/paso-02.webp"},{"title":"Cocina el pollo por separado","content":"Calienta 10 g del aceite en una sartén amplia. Añade el pollo en dos tandas si queda amontonado y cocina a fuego medio-alto unos 8–10 minutos en total, removiendo. Reparte parte de los 3 g de sal y 0,25 g de pimienta destinados al relleno. Comprueba los dados más gruesos con termómetro: deben alcanzar al menos 74 °C. Si no llegan, prolonga la cocción. Pasa a un recipiente limpio con utensilio limpio, nunca al plato del pollo crudo.","image_alt":"Dados de pollo cocinándose en una sartén sin champiñones","image_url":"/recetas/receta-de-lasana-de-pollo-con-champinones/paso-03.webp"},{"title":"Saltea los champiñones y mezcla el relleno","content":"En la misma sartén añade los otros 10 g de aceite y la cebolla; cocina 4–5 minutos. Incorpora el ajo 30 segundos y luego los champiñones. Saltea 8–10 minutos, en tandas si hace falta, hasta que se reduzcan y el líquido libre se evapore. Añade el resto de sal y pimienta reservadas al relleno, incorpora el pollo cocido y mezcla. El relleno debe quedar húmedo pero sin un charco; si hay líquido, reduce antes de montar.","image_alt":"Champiñones y cebolla salteados mezclados con dados de pollo cocidos","image_url":"/recetas/receta-de-lasana-de-pollo-con-champinones/paso-04.webp"},{"title":"Haz la bechamel","content":"Derrite los 40 g de mantequilla en un cazo a fuego medio-bajo. Añade los 40 g de harina y remueve 2 minutos sin dorarla. Vierte los 700 g de leche poco a poco, batiendo para disolver grumos. Cocina a hervor suave 6–8 minutos, removiendo hasta que cubra la cuchara pero se pueda extender. Incorpora los otros 3 g de sal, 0,25 g de pimienta y 0,2 g de nuez moscada. No reduzcas hasta obtener una pasta espesa.","image_alt":"Bechamel blanca y fluida removida con varillas en un cazo","image_url":"/recetas/receta-de-lasana-de-pollo-con-champinones/paso-05.webp"},{"title":"Monta las tres capas de pasta","content":"Extiende una capa fina de bechamel en el fondo. Reserva aproximadamente un cuarto de la salsa restante para la cubierta y divide el resto entre dos capas. Divide el relleno en dos partes iguales y los 240 g originales de pasta en tres capas adaptadas a la fuente, cortando láminas si hace falta. Alterna pasta, mitad del relleno, bechamel y 30 g de mozzarella; repite con otros 30 g de mozzarella. Termina con la tercera capa de pasta, la salsa reservada y los 120 g de mozzarella restantes. Cubre todos los bordes de pasta con salsa.","image_alt":"Montaje de lasaña en fuente con láminas, pollo, champiñones y bechamel","image_url":"/recetas/receta-de-lasana-de-pollo-con-champinones/paso-06.webp"},{"title":"Hornea y comprueba el centro","content":"Cubre holgadamente con aluminio y hornea 20 minutos a 190 °C. Retira el aluminio y hornea otros 10–15 minutos hasta que burbujee y la superficie dore sin quemarse. Introduce una sonda limpia en varios puntos del centro, sin tocar la fuente: debe alcanzar al menos 74 °C. Si está por debajo, cubre si hace falta y prolonga 5 minutos antes de medir otra vez. La corteza dorada no sustituye esta comprobación.","image_alt":"Lasaña gratinada en una fuente de horno con la superficie dorada","image_url":"/recetas/receta-de-lasana-de-pollo-con-champinones/paso-07.webp"},{"title":"Reposa, porciona y conserva","content":"Reposa 10 minutos sobre una superficie resistente al calor y corta en 6 porciones. Sirve con utensilios limpios. Para guardar, separa las sobras en recipientes bajos y refrigera a 4 °C o menos dentro de 2 horas, o 1 hora si el ambiente supera 32 °C. Se propone consumirlas en 3 días y recalentar la porción una sola vez hasta 74 °C en el centro. No dejes toda la fuente enfriándose durante horas en la encimera.","image_alt":"Porción de lasaña blanca con pollo y champiñones mostrando sus capas","image_url":"/recetas/receta-de-lasana-de-pollo-con-champinones/paso-08.webp"}],"notes":"Contiene trigo y lácteos; revisa si las láminas llevan huevo u otros alérgenos. Esta ficha utiliza pasta seca para precocer, no láminas listas para horno, y no valida sustituciones sin gluten o sin leche. Puedes cambiar champiñones blancos por cremini al mismo peso, con variación de sabor y nutrientes. Usa pollo sin salmuera añadida y mozzarella de baja humedad, no bolas húmedas, para aproximarte al cálculo y evitar exceso de agua. No sustituyas el pollo por sobras sin ajustar la formulación y su conservación previa. Los champiñones se reducen antes de montar; no añadas nata o caldo extra. No se ha validado aquí el montaje crudo de un día para otro ni la congelación; prepara y hornea de forma continua. La nutrición usa los pesos comestibles originales y divide entre 6, sin calcular absorción o pérdida exacta durante la cocción; no incluye guarniciones.","nutrition":{"sodium_mg":705,"sugar_g":10,"saturated_fat_g":11.4,"carbs_g":47,"calories":567.7,"fat_g":23.5,"fiber_g":2.8,"protein_g":41.6,"estimated":true,"serving_size":"1 de 6 porciones propuestas","source":"USDA FoodData Central — SR Legacy, abril de 2018","source_url":"https://fdc.nal.usda.gov/download-datasets/","method":"Trece fichas USDA verificadas por FDC ID en el archivo oficial. Pesos comestibles originales sumados y divididos entre 6; pasta seca aproximada con Pasta, dry, enriched y mozzarella con Cheese, mozzarella, whole milk, low moisture. Se cuentan toda la grasa y el sazonado. Agua de cocer desechada, sin sal añadida; no se incluyen guarniciones.","note":"Estimación, no análisis del plato cocinado. Marcas de pasta y mozzarella, salmuera del pollo y reparto real cambian las cifras; cantidades, tiempos y rendimiento pendientes de prueba de cocina.","inputs":[{"fdc_id":169736,"fdc_description":"Pasta, dry, enriched","per_100g":{"sodium_mg":6,"sugar_g":2.67,"saturated_fat_g":0.277,"carbs_g":74.7,"calories":371,"fat_g":1.51,"fiber_g":3.2,"protein_g":13},"source_url":"https://fdc.nal.usda.gov/food-details/169736/nutrients","ingredient":"láminas de lasaña secas","edible_grams":240},{"fdc_id":171077,"fdc_description":"Chicken, broiler or fryers, breast, skinless, boneless, meat only, raw","per_100g":{"fat_g":2.62,"calories":120,"saturated_fat_g":0.563,"sodium_mg":45,"protein_g":22.5,"sugar_g":0,"carbs_g":0,"fiber_g":0},"source_url":"https://fdc.nal.usda.gov/food-details/171077/nutrients","ingredient":"pechuga de pollo cruda","edible_grams":600},{"fdc_id":169251,"fdc_description":"Mushrooms, white, raw","per_100g":{"sugar_g":1.98,"saturated_fat_g":0.05,"fiber_g":1,"fat_g":0.34,"sodium_mg":5,"protein_g":3.09,"carbs_g":3.26,"calories":22},"source_url":"https://fdc.nal.usda.gov/food-details/169251/nutrients","ingredient":"champiñones blancos","edible_grams":500},{"fdc_id":170000,"fdc_description":"Onions, raw","per_100g":{"sugar_g":4.24,"fat_g":0.1,"carbs_g":9.34,"calories":40,"saturated_fat_g":0.042,"protein_g":1.1,"fiber_g":1.7,"sodium_mg":4},"source_url":"https://fdc.nal.usda.gov/food-details/170000/nutrients","ingredient":"cebolla","edible_grams":150},{"fdc_id":169230,"fdc_description":"Garlic, raw","per_100g":{"carbs_g":33.1,"calories":149,"sugar_g":1,"saturated_fat_g":0.089,"fiber_g":2.1,"sodium_mg":17,"protein_g":6.36,"fat_g":0.5},"source_url":"https://fdc.nal.usda.gov/food-details/169230/nutrients","ingredient":"ajo","edible_grams":10},{"fdc_id":171413,"fdc_description":"Oil, olive, salad or cooking","per_100g":{"fat_g":100,"carbs_g":0,"calories":884,"sodium_mg":2,"protein_g":0,"saturated_fat_g":13.8,"fiber_g":0,"sugar_g":0},"source_url":"https://fdc.nal.usda.gov/food-details/171413/nutrients","ingredient":"aceite de oliva","edible_grams":20},{"fdc_id":171265,"fdc_description":"Milk, whole, 3.25% milkfat, with added vitamin D","per_100g":{"fat_g":3.25,"sugar_g":5.05,"carbs_g":4.8,"calories":61,"saturated_fat_g":1.86,"fiber_g":0,"sodium_mg":43,"protein_g":3.15},"source_url":"https://fdc.nal.usda.gov/food-details/171265/nutrients","ingredient":"leche entera","edible_grams":700},{"fdc_id":173430,"fdc_description":"Butter, without salt","per_100g":{"sugar_g":0.06,"calories":717,"saturated_fat_g":50.5,"fat_g":81.1,"carbs_g":0.06,"protein_g":0.85,"fiber_g":0,"sodium_mg":11},"source_url":"https://fdc.nal.usda.gov/food-details/173430/nutrients","ingredient":"mantequilla sin sal","edible_grams":40},{"fdc_id":168936,"fdc_description":"Wheat flour, white, all-purpose, enriched, unbleached","per_100g":{"fiber_g":2.7,"fat_g":0.98,"carbs_g":76.3,"calories":364,"protein_g":10.3,"sodium_mg":2,"saturated_fat_g":0.155,"sugar_g":0.27},"source_url":"https://fdc.nal.usda.gov/food-details/168936/nutrients","ingredient":"harina de trigo","edible_grams":40},{"fdc_id":170846,"fdc_description":"Cheese, mozzarella, whole milk, low moisture","per_100g":{"sugar_g":1.01,"sodium_mg":710,"saturated_fat_g":15.6,"fiber_g":0,"protein_g":21.6,"fat_g":24.6,"carbs_g":2.47,"calories":318},"source_url":"https://fdc.nal.usda.gov/food-details/170846/nutrients","ingredient":"mozzarella baja humedad entera","edible_grams":180},{"fdc_id":173468,"fdc_description":"Salt, table","per_100g":{"fiber_g":0,"sodium_mg":38800,"saturated_fat_g":0,"protein_g":0,"fat_g":0,"carbs_g":0,"calories":0,"sugar_g":0},"source_url":"https://fdc.nal.usda.gov/food-details/173468/nutrients","ingredient":"sal","edible_grams":6},{"fdc_id":170931,"fdc_description":"Spices, pepper, black","per_100g":{"fat_g":3.26,"sugar_g":0.64,"carbs_g":64,"calories":251,"protein_g":10.4,"fiber_g":25.3,"sodium_mg":20,"saturated_fat_g":1.39},"source_url":"https://fdc.nal.usda.gov/food-details/170931/nutrients","ingredient":"pimienta","edible_grams":0.5},{"fdc_id":171326,"fdc_description":"Spices, nutmeg, ground","per_100g":{"protein_g":5.84,"sodium_mg":16,"saturated_fat_g":25.9,"fat_g":36.3,"carbs_g":49.3,"calories":525,"sugar_g":2.99,"fiber_g":20.8},"source_url":"https://fdc.nal.usda.gov/food-details/171326/nutrients","ingredient":"nuez moscada","edible_grams":0.2}]},"image_url":"/recetas/receta-de-lasana-de-pollo-con-champinones/portada.webp","gallery":[{"url":"/recetas/receta-de-lasana-de-pollo-con-champinones/portada.webp","alt":"Lasaña de pollo y champiñones con bechamel y queso dorado, servida en una porción"}],"seo":{"title":"Lasaña de pollo con champiñones y bechamel | Manual de Cocina","description":"Lasaña blanca para 6 con pollo, champiñones, bechamel y mozzarella. Cuece la pasta, reduce el relleno y comprueba 74 °C en el centro.","image_alt":"Lasaña de pollo y champiñones con bechamel y queso dorado, servida en una porción","image_variants":["/recetas/receta-de-lasana-de-pollo-con-champinones/portada-1x1.webp","/recetas/receta-de-lasana-de-pollo-con-champinones/portada-4x3.webp","/recetas/receta-de-lasana-de-pollo-con-champinones/portada-16x9.webp"],"faq":[{"q":"¿Puedo usar láminas listas para horno?","a":"No como cambio directo en esta formulación. Se proponen 240 g de pasta seca para cocer previamente. Las láminas listas para horno absorben salsa y requieren ajustar líquidos y tiempo según el envase."},{"q":"¿Cómo evito que quede aguada?","a":"Evapora el líquido libre de los champiñones antes de unir el pollo, usa mozzarella de baja humedad y bechamel que cubra la cuchara sin ser una pasta. Reposa 10 minutos antes de cortar."},{"q":"¿Puedo montar la lasaña el día anterior?","a":"Esta ficha propone preparación y horneado continuos; no valida un montaje crudo prolongado ni congelación. Guarda la lasaña ya cocinada en porciones frías, consume en 3 días y recalienta una vez hasta 74 °C."}]},"published":false,"editorial_status":"draft","content_html":"<p>Esta propuesta de lasaña combina pollo cocinado en dados, champiñones salteados y una bechamel de leche entera. Se monta con tres capas de pasta previamente cocida y dos capas de relleno, y termina con mozzarella de baja humedad. Conserva la URL histórica de la lasaña de pollo con champiñones y su clasificación aprobada como receta.</p><p>Se proponen 6 porciones en una fuente de unos 20 × 30 cm, 20 minutos de preparación, 60 de cocción con algunas tareas en paralelo y 10 de reposo: 90 minutos en total. La marca y el tamaño de las láminas pueden cambiar el montaje y la cocción. Cantidades, tiempos y rendimiento son estimados y pendientes de prueba de cocina; la temperatura del pollo y del centro se comprueba con termómetro.</p>"},{"id":"2c209239-d104-5286-b66f-7ab68c0de8f4","recipe_group_id":"14f34319-2bdc-478f-b55b-909be0df6964","language":"de","slug":"huhnchen-lasana-mit-pilzen-rezept","public_path":"/de/huhnchen-lasana-mit-pilzen-rezept","source_url":null,"title":"Hähnchen-Lasagne mit Champignons und Béchamel","excerpt":"Lasagne für 6 mit Hähnchen, Champignons, vorgekochter Pasta, hausgemachter Béchamel und goldener Mozzarella.","summary":"Gegarte Hähnchenwürfel, gebratene Champignons und Vollmilch-Béchamel werden zwischen drei vorgekochte Pastaschichten und zwei Füllungsschichten verteilt und mit Mozzarella mit geringem Wassergehalt überbacken. Historische URL und genehmigte Recipe-Klassifizierung bleiben erhalten.\n\nVorgeschlagen sind 6 Portionen aus einer Form von etwa 20 × 30 cm: 20 Minuten Vorbereitung, 60 Garen mit teils parallelen Arbeiten, 10 Ruhen, insgesamt 90 Minuten. Marke und Größe der Platten beeinflussen Aufbau und Garung. Mengen, Zeiten und Ausbeute sind Schätzungen ohne Küchentest. Hähnchen und Auflaufkern mit Thermometer prüfen.","category":"Pasta","category_slug":"pastas","difficulty":"Mittel","course":"Hauptgericht","cuisine":"Italienisch, hausgemachte Anpassung","prep_time_minutes":20,"cook_time_minutes":60,"total_time_minutes":90,"servings":6,"keywords":["Hähnchen Lasagne","Champignon Lasagne","Béchamel selbst machen","weiße Lasagne"],"ingredients":[{"name":"trockene Lasagneplatten zum Vorkochen","amount":"240","unit":"g","group":"Pasta"},{"name":"rohe Hähnchenbrust ohne Haut und Knochen","amount":"600","unit":"g","group":"Füllung"},{"name":"frische weiße Champignons","amount":"500","unit":"g","group":"Füllung"},{"name":"Zwiebel","amount":"150","unit":"g","group":"Füllung"},{"name":"Knoblauch","amount":"10","unit":"g","group":"Füllung"},{"name":"Olivenöl","amount":"20","unit":"g","group":"Füllung"},{"name":"pasteurisierte Vollmilch","amount":"700","unit":"g","group":"Béchamel"},{"name":"ungesalzene Butter","amount":"40","unit":"g","group":"Béchamel"},{"name":"Weizenmehl","amount":"40","unit":"g","group":"Béchamel"},{"name":"geriebener Vollmilch-Mozzarella mit geringem Wassergehalt","amount":"180","unit":"g","group":"Zum Überbacken"},{"name":"feines Salz","amount":"6","unit":"g","group":"Würzung"},{"name":"gemahlener schwarzer Pfeffer","amount":"0.5","unit":"g","group":"Würzung"},{"name":"gemahlene Muskatnuss","amount":"0.2","unit":"g","group":"Würzung"}],"steps":[{"title":"Zutaten und Form vorbereiten","content":"Ofen auf 190 °C Ober-/Unterhitze ohne Umluft vorheizen, eine Form von etwa 20 × 30 cm bereitstellen. 500 g Champignons putzen und schneiden, 150 g Zwiebel und 10 g Knoblauch hacken. 600 g Hähnchen auf einem anderen Brett in etwa 1,5 cm große Würfel schneiden, nicht waschen. Rohe und gegarte Werkzeuge trennen. Salz aufteilen: 3 g für Füllung und 3 g für Béchamel; Pfeffer je 0,25 g.","image_alt":"Lasagnezutaten mit Champignons und rohem Hähnchen auf separatem Brett","image_url":"/recetas/receta-de-lasana-de-pollo-con-champinones/paso-01.webp"},{"title":"Platten kochen und abtropfen","content":"240 g Platten in einem großen Topf mit kochendem Trinkwasser ohne Salzzugabe nach Packungszeit kochen, etwa 1 Minute früher herausnehmen, wenn sie anschließend gebacken werden. Kochwasser entsorgen; nicht im Nährwert enthalten. Abtropfen und einzeln auf einem sauberen Tuch auslegen. Vorkochplatten verwenden; ofenfertige Platten benötigen ein anderes Flüssigkeitsverhältnis und gehören nicht zu dieser Rezeptur.","image_alt":"Gekochte Lasagneplatten einzeln auf sauberem Tuch","image_url":"/recetas/receta-de-lasana-de-pollo-con-champinones/paso-02.webp"},{"title":"Hähnchen separat garen","content":"10 g Öl in großer Pfanne erhitzen. Bei Platzmangel Hähnchen in zwei Durchgängen bei mittelhoher Hitze insgesamt etwa 8–10 Minuten unter Rühren garen. Einen Teil der für die Füllung vorgesehenen 3 g Salz und 0,25 g Pfeffer verwenden. Dickste Würfel mit Thermometer prüfen: mindestens 74 °C. Bei Bedarf weitergaren. Mit sauberem Werkzeug in einen sauberen Behälter geben, nie auf den Rohfleischteller.","image_alt":"Hähnchenwürfel garen allein in einer Pfanne","image_url":"/recetas/receta-de-lasana-de-pollo-con-champinones/paso-03.webp"},{"title":"Champignons braten und Füllung mischen","content":"Die übrigen 10 g Öl und Zwiebel in dieselbe Pfanne geben, 4–5 Minuten garen. Knoblauch 30 Sekunden zugeben, dann Champignons. Etwa 8–10 Minuten, nötigenfalls portionsweise, braten, bis sie reduziert sind und freie Flüssigkeit verdampft ist. Restliche Füllungswürzung und gegartes Hähnchen einrühren. Feucht, aber ohne Pfütze; Flüssigkeit vor dem Schichten reduzieren.","image_alt":"Gebratene Champignons und Zwiebeln mit gegarten Hähnchenwürfeln","image_url":"/recetas/receta-de-lasana-de-pollo-con-champinones/paso-04.webp"},{"title":"Béchamel zubereiten","content":"40 g Butter bei mittelniedriger Hitze im Topf schmelzen. 40 g Mehl 2 Minuten einrühren, ohne Bräunung. 700 g Milch nach und nach unter Rühren zugießen, Klumpen lösen. Sanft 6–8 Minuten unter Rühren köcheln, bis die Sauce den Löffel überzieht, aber streichfähig bleibt. Die übrigen 3 g Salz, 0,25 g Pfeffer und 0,2 g Muskat zugeben. Nicht zu einer dicken Paste reduzieren.","image_alt":"Weiße fließende Béchamel wird im Topf gerührt","image_url":"/recetas/receta-de-lasana-de-pollo-con-champinones/paso-05.webp"},{"title":"Drei Pastaschichten aufbauen","content":"Dünn Béchamel auf dem Boden verteilen. Etwa ein Viertel der übrigen Sauce für oben reservieren, Rest auf zwei Schichten verteilen. Füllung halbieren und die ursprünglich 240 g Pasta in drei zur Form passende Schichten teilen, bei Bedarf zuschneiden. Pasta, halbe Füllung, Béchamel und 30 g Mozzarella schichten; mit weiteren 30 g Mozzarella wiederholen. Dritte Pastaschicht, reservierte Sauce und übrige 120 g Mozzarella auflegen. Alle Pastaränder mit Sauce bedecken.","image_alt":"Pasta, Hähnchen, Champignons und Béchamel werden geschichtet","image_url":"/recetas/receta-de-lasana-de-pollo-con-champinones/paso-06.webp"},{"title":"Backen und Kerntemperatur prüfen","content":"Locker mit Alufolie abdecken, 20 Minuten bei 190 °C backen. Folie entfernen, weitere 10–15 Minuten bis zum Blubbern und Goldbraunwerden backen, ohne Verbrennen. Saubere Sonde an mehreren Stellen im Kern einsetzen, nicht an die Form: mindestens 74 °C. Ist es kälter, nötigenfalls abdecken, weitere 5 Minuten backen und erneut messen. Bräunung ersetzt die Messung nicht.","image_alt":"Goldbraune Lasagne in einer Ofenform","image_url":"/recetas/receta-de-lasana-de-pollo-con-champinones/paso-07.webp"},{"title":"Ruhen lassen, portionieren und lagern","content":"Auf hitzefester Fläche 10 Minuten ruhen lassen, in 6 Portionen schneiden, mit sauberen Werkzeugen servieren. Reste in flache Behälter teilen und innerhalb von 2 Stunden bei höchstens 4 °C kühlen, bei Umgebung über 32 °C innerhalb von 1 Stunde. Vorgeschlagene Lagerung: 3 Tage; Portion nur einmal auf 74 °C im Kern erhitzen. Ganze Form nicht stundenlang auf der Arbeitsplatte abkühlen lassen.","image_alt":"Weiße Hähnchen-Champignon-Lasagne zeigt ihre Schichten","image_url":"/recetas/receta-de-lasana-de-pollo-con-champinones/paso-08.webp"}],"notes":"Enthält Weizen und Milchprodukte; Platten auf Ei und weitere Allergene prüfen. Trockene Vorkochplatten, keine ofenfertigen; gluten- und milchfreie Varianten nicht geprüft. Braune Champignons können bei gleichem Gewicht verwendet werden, Geschmack und Nährwerte ändern sich. Hähnchen ohne zugesetzte Lake und Mozzarella mit wenig Wasser statt feuchter Kugeln verwenden. Hähnchenreste nicht ohne angepasste Rezeptur und Berücksichtigung der bisherigen Lagerung einsetzen. Champignons vor dem Aufbau reduzieren; keine zusätzliche Sahne oder Brühe. Rohes Schichten über Nacht und Einfrieren sind nicht geprüft; kontinuierlich zubereiten und backen. Nährwerte basieren auf ursprünglichen essbaren Gewichten geteilt durch 6, ohne exakte Aufnahme oder Garverluste und ohne Beilage.","nutrition":{"sodium_mg":705,"sugar_g":10,"saturated_fat_g":11.4,"carbs_g":47,"calories":567.7,"fat_g":23.5,"fiber_g":2.8,"protein_g":41.6,"estimated":true,"serving_size":"1 von 6 vorgeschlagenen Portionen","source":"USDA FoodData Central — SR Legacy, April 2018 JSON","source_url":"https://fdc.nal.usda.gov/download-datasets/","method":"Dreizehn USDA-Datensätze nach FDC-ID im offiziellen Archiv geprüft. Ursprüngliche essbare Gewichte addiert und durch 6 geteilt. Pasta mit Pasta, dry, enriched und Käse mit Cheese, mozzarella, whole milk, low moisture angenähert. Fett und Würzung vollständig gezählt. Ungesalzenes Kochwasser entsorgt, ohne Beilage.","note":"Schätzung, keine Analyse des gegarten Gerichts. Pasta- und Käsemarke, Hähnchenlake und tatsächliche Portionen ändern Werte. Mengen, Zeiten und Ausbeute ohne Küchentest.","inputs":[{"fdc_id":169736,"fdc_description":"Pasta, dry, enriched","per_100g":{"sodium_mg":6,"sugar_g":2.67,"saturated_fat_g":0.277,"carbs_g":74.7,"calories":371,"fat_g":1.51,"fiber_g":3.2,"protein_g":13},"source_url":"https://fdc.nal.usda.gov/food-details/169736/nutrients","ingredient":"trockene Lasagneplatten zum Vorkochen","edible_grams":240},{"fdc_id":171077,"fdc_description":"Chicken, broiler or fryers, breast, skinless, boneless, meat only, raw","per_100g":{"fat_g":2.62,"calories":120,"saturated_fat_g":0.563,"sodium_mg":45,"protein_g":22.5,"sugar_g":0,"carbs_g":0,"fiber_g":0},"source_url":"https://fdc.nal.usda.gov/food-details/171077/nutrients","ingredient":"rohe Hähnchenbrust ohne Haut und Knochen","edible_grams":600},{"fdc_id":169251,"fdc_description":"Mushrooms, white, raw","per_100g":{"sugar_g":1.98,"saturated_fat_g":0.05,"fiber_g":1,"fat_g":0.34,"sodium_mg":5,"protein_g":3.09,"carbs_g":3.26,"calories":22},"source_url":"https://fdc.nal.usda.gov/food-details/169251/nutrients","ingredient":"frische weiße Champignons","edible_grams":500},{"fdc_id":170000,"fdc_description":"Onions, raw","per_100g":{"sugar_g":4.24,"fat_g":0.1,"carbs_g":9.34,"calories":40,"saturated_fat_g":0.042,"protein_g":1.1,"fiber_g":1.7,"sodium_mg":4},"source_url":"https://fdc.nal.usda.gov/food-details/170000/nutrients","ingredient":"Zwiebel","edible_grams":150},{"fdc_id":169230,"fdc_description":"Garlic, raw","per_100g":{"carbs_g":33.1,"calories":149,"sugar_g":1,"saturated_fat_g":0.089,"fiber_g":2.1,"sodium_mg":17,"protein_g":6.36,"fat_g":0.5},"source_url":"https://fdc.nal.usda.gov/food-details/169230/nutrients","ingredient":"Knoblauch","edible_grams":10},{"fdc_id":171413,"fdc_description":"Oil, olive, salad or cooking","per_100g":{"fat_g":100,"carbs_g":0,"calories":884,"sodium_mg":2,"protein_g":0,"saturated_fat_g":13.8,"fiber_g":0,"sugar_g":0},"source_url":"https://fdc.nal.usda.gov/food-details/171413/nutrients","ingredient":"Olivenöl","edible_grams":20},{"fdc_id":171265,"fdc_description":"Milk, whole, 3.25% milkfat, with added vitamin D","per_100g":{"fat_g":3.25,"sugar_g":5.05,"carbs_g":4.8,"calories":61,"saturated_fat_g":1.86,"fiber_g":0,"sodium_mg":43,"protein_g":3.15},"source_url":"https://fdc.nal.usda.gov/food-details/171265/nutrients","ingredient":"pasteurisierte Vollmilch","edible_grams":700},{"fdc_id":173430,"fdc_description":"Butter, without salt","per_100g":{"sugar_g":0.06,"calories":717,"saturated_fat_g":50.5,"fat_g":81.1,"carbs_g":0.06,"protein_g":0.85,"fiber_g":0,"sodium_mg":11},"source_url":"https://fdc.nal.usda.gov/food-details/173430/nutrients","ingredient":"ungesalzene Butter","edible_grams":40},{"fdc_id":168936,"fdc_description":"Wheat flour, white, all-purpose, enriched, unbleached","per_100g":{"fiber_g":2.7,"fat_g":0.98,"carbs_g":76.3,"calories":364,"protein_g":10.3,"sodium_mg":2,"saturated_fat_g":0.155,"sugar_g":0.27},"source_url":"https://fdc.nal.usda.gov/food-details/168936/nutrients","ingredient":"Weizenmehl","edible_grams":40},{"fdc_id":170846,"fdc_description":"Cheese, mozzarella, whole milk, low moisture","per_100g":{"sugar_g":1.01,"sodium_mg":710,"saturated_fat_g":15.6,"fiber_g":0,"protein_g":21.6,"fat_g":24.6,"carbs_g":2.47,"calories":318},"source_url":"https://fdc.nal.usda.gov/food-details/170846/nutrients","ingredient":"geriebener Vollmilch-Mozzarella mit geringem Wassergehalt","edible_grams":180},{"fdc_id":173468,"fdc_description":"Salt, table","per_100g":{"fiber_g":0,"sodium_mg":38800,"saturated_fat_g":0,"protein_g":0,"fat_g":0,"carbs_g":0,"calories":0,"sugar_g":0},"source_url":"https://fdc.nal.usda.gov/food-details/173468/nutrients","ingredient":"feines Salz","edible_grams":6},{"fdc_id":170931,"fdc_description":"Spices, pepper, black","per_100g":{"fat_g":3.26,"sugar_g":0.64,"carbs_g":64,"calories":251,"protein_g":10.4,"fiber_g":25.3,"sodium_mg":20,"saturated_fat_g":1.39},"source_url":"https://fdc.nal.usda.gov/food-details/170931/nutrients","ingredient":"gemahlener schwarzer Pfeffer","edible_grams":0.5},{"fdc_id":171326,"fdc_description":"Spices, nutmeg, ground","per_100g":{"protein_g":5.84,"sodium_mg":16,"saturated_fat_g":25.9,"fat_g":36.3,"carbs_g":49.3,"calories":525,"sugar_g":2.99,"fiber_g":20.8},"source_url":"https://fdc.nal.usda.gov/food-details/171326/nutrients","ingredient":"gemahlene Muskatnuss","edible_grams":0.2}]},"image_url":"/recetas/receta-de-lasana-de-pollo-con-champinones/portada.webp","gallery":[{"url":"/recetas/receta-de-lasana-de-pollo-con-champinones/portada.webp","alt":"Hähnchen-Champignon-Lasagne mit Béchamel und goldener Käsekruste als Portion"}],"seo":{"title":"Hähnchen-Lasagne mit Champignons und Béchamel | Manual de Cocina","description":"Weiße Lasagne für 6 mit Hähnchen, Champignons, Béchamel und Mozzarella. Pasta vorkochen, Füllung reduzieren und 74 °C im Kern prüfen.","image_alt":"Hähnchen-Champignon-Lasagne mit Béchamel und goldener Käsekruste als Portion","image_variants":["/recetas/receta-de-lasana-de-pollo-con-champinones/portada-1x1.webp","/recetas/receta-de-lasana-de-pollo-con-champinones/portada-4x3.webp","/recetas/receta-de-lasana-de-pollo-con-champinones/portada-16x9.webp"],"faq":[{"q":"Kann ich ofenfertige Platten verwenden?","a":"Nicht direkt austauschen. Vorgesehen sind 240 g trockene Pasta zum Vorkochen. Ofenfertige Platten nehmen Sauce auf und erfordern Flüssigkeits- und Zeitanpassung nach Packung."},{"q":"Wie vermeide ich eine wässrige Lasagne?","a":"Freie Champignonflüssigkeit vor Zugabe des Hähnchens verdampfen lassen, wasserarmen Mozzarella und Béchamel verwenden, die den Löffel überzieht, ohne Paste zu werden. Vor dem Schneiden 10 Minuten ruhen."},{"q":"Kann ich am Vortag schichten?","a":"Kontinuierliche Zubereitung und Backen sind vorgesehen; längerer roher Aufbau oder Einfrieren sind nicht geprüft. Gegarte Portionen kühlen, innerhalb von 3 Tagen verbrauchen und einmal auf 74 °C erhitzen."}]},"published":false,"editorial_status":"draft","content_html":"<p>Gegarte Hähnchenwürfel, gebratene Champignons und Vollmilch-Béchamel werden zwischen drei vorgekochte Pastaschichten und zwei Füllungsschichten verteilt und mit Mozzarella mit geringem Wassergehalt überbacken. Historische URL und genehmigte Recipe-Klassifizierung bleiben erhalten.</p><p>Vorgeschlagen sind 6 Portionen aus einer Form von etwa 20 × 30 cm: 20 Minuten Vorbereitung, 60 Garen mit teils parallelen Arbeiten, 10 Ruhen, insgesamt 90 Minuten. Marke und Größe der Platten beeinflussen Aufbau und Garung. Mengen, Zeiten und Ausbeute sind Schätzungen ohne Küchentest. Hähnchen und Auflaufkern mit Thermometer prüfen.</p>"},{"id":"d02cf810-aa36-5d1f-83ba-b39ff6b19a42","recipe_group_id":"14f34319-2bdc-478f-b55b-909be0df6964","language":"en","slug":"chicken-lasana-with-mushrooms-recipe","public_path":"/en/chicken-lasana-with-mushrooms-recipe","source_url":null,"title":"Chicken and mushroom lasagna with béchamel","excerpt":"Chicken and mushroom lasagna for 6 with preboiled pasta, a filling without excess liquid, homemade béchamel and browned mozzarella.","summary":"Cooked diced chicken, sautéed mushrooms and whole-milk béchamel are arranged with three layers of preboiled pasta and two filling layers, then topped with low-moisture mozzarella. The historical chicken-and-mushroom-lasagna URL and approved Recipe classification are retained.\n\nThe proposed yield is 6 portions in a dish about 20 × 30 cm: 20 minutes preparation, 60 cooking with some tasks in parallel, and 10 resting, 90 overall. Sheet brand and size can change assembly and cooking. Quantities, timings and yield are estimates awaiting a kitchen trial; check the chicken and casserole centre with a thermometer.","category":"Pasta","category_slug":"pastas","difficulty":"Medium","course":"Main course","cuisine":"Italian, home-style adaptation","prep_time_minutes":20,"cook_time_minutes":60,"total_time_minutes":90,"servings":6,"keywords":["chicken lasagna","mushroom lasagna","homemade béchamel","white lasagna"],"ingredients":[{"name":"dry lasagna sheets requiring preboiling","amount":"240","unit":"g","group":"Pasta"},{"name":"raw boneless skinless chicken breast","amount":"600","unit":"g","group":"Filling"},{"name":"fresh white mushrooms","amount":"500","unit":"g","group":"Filling"},{"name":"onion","amount":"150","unit":"g","group":"Filling"},{"name":"garlic","amount":"10","unit":"g","group":"Filling"},{"name":"olive oil","amount":"20","unit":"g","group":"Filling"},{"name":"pasteurised whole milk","amount":"700","unit":"g","group":"Béchamel"},{"name":"unsalted butter","amount":"40","unit":"g","group":"Béchamel"},{"name":"plain all-purpose wheat flour","amount":"40","unit":"g","group":"Béchamel"},{"name":"shredded low-moisture whole-milk mozzarella","amount":"180","unit":"g","group":"Topping"},{"name":"fine salt","amount":"6","unit":"g","group":"Seasoning"},{"name":"ground black pepper","amount":"0.5","unit":"g","group":"Seasoning"},{"name":"ground nutmeg","amount":"0.2","unit":"g","group":"Seasoning"}],"steps":[{"title":"Prepare ingredients and baking dish","content":"Preheat a conventional oven, top and bottom heat without fan, to 190 °C. Prepare a dish about 20 × 30 cm. Clean and slice 500 g mushrooms, chop 150 g onion and 10 g garlic. On another board cut 600 g chicken into about 1.5 cm cubes without washing it. Separate raw and cooked utensils. Divide salt: 3 g for filling and 3 g for béchamel; pepper: 0.25 g for each.","image_alt":"Lasagna ingredients with sliced mushrooms and raw chicken on a separate board","image_url":"/recetas/receta-de-lasana-de-pollo-con-champinones/paso-01.webp"},{"title":"Boil and drain the sheets","content":"Boil 240 g sheets in a large pot of potable water without added salt. Follow the packet time, taking them out about 1 minute early if they will be baked. Discard cooking water; it is excluded from the calculation. Drain and spread separately on a clean cloth. Use sheets requiring preboiling: oven-ready sheets need another liquid ratio and are not specified here.","image_alt":"Cooked lasagna sheets laid separately on a clean cloth","image_url":"/recetas/receta-de-lasana-de-pollo-con-champinones/paso-02.webp"},{"title":"Cook the chicken separately","content":"Heat 10 g oil in a wide skillet. Add chicken in two batches if crowded and cook over medium-high heat for about 8–10 minutes overall, stirring. Add part of the filling’s 3 g salt and 0.25 g pepper. Check the thickest cubes with a thermometer: at least 74 °C. Continue cooking if needed. Transfer with a clean utensil to a clean container, never to the raw-chicken plate.","image_alt":"Chicken cubes cooking alone in a skillet","image_url":"/recetas/receta-de-lasana-de-pollo-con-champinones/paso-03.webp"},{"title":"Sauté mushrooms and combine the filling","content":"Add the other 10 g oil and onion to the same skillet and cook 4–5 minutes. Add garlic for 30 seconds, then mushrooms. Sauté 8–10 minutes, in batches if needed, until reduced and free liquid evaporates. Add the rest of the filling’s salt and pepper, then the cooked chicken. The filling should be moist without a puddle; reduce liquid before assembly.","image_alt":"Sautéed mushrooms and onion mixed with cooked chicken cubes","image_url":"/recetas/receta-de-lasana-de-pollo-con-champinones/paso-04.webp"},{"title":"Make the béchamel","content":"Melt 40 g butter in a saucepan over medium-low heat. Stir in 40 g flour for 2 minutes without browning. Gradually whisk in 700 g milk to remove lumps. Simmer gently for 6–8 minutes, stirring, until it coats a spoon but remains spreadable. Add the other 3 g salt, 0.25 g pepper and 0.2 g nutmeg. Do not reduce to a thick paste.","image_alt":"Smooth pourable white béchamel whisked in a saucepan","image_url":"/recetas/receta-de-lasana-de-pollo-con-champinones/paso-05.webp"},{"title":"Build three pasta layers","content":"Spread a thin béchamel layer on the base. Reserve about a quarter of the remaining sauce for the top, dividing the rest between two layers. Split filling in two equal parts and the original 240 g pasta into three layers fitted to the dish, trimming sheets if needed. Layer pasta, half filling, béchamel and 30 g mozzarella; repeat with another 30 g mozzarella. Finish with the third pasta layer, reserved sauce and remaining 120 g mozzarella. Cover every pasta edge with sauce.","image_alt":"Layering pasta, chicken, mushrooms and béchamel in a baking dish","image_url":"/recetas/receta-de-lasana-de-pollo-con-champinones/paso-06.webp"},{"title":"Bake and check the centre","content":"Cover loosely with foil and bake 20 minutes at 190 °C. Remove foil and bake another 10–15 minutes until bubbling and golden, without burning. Insert a clean probe at several central points without touching the dish: at least 74 °C. If cooler, cover if needed and bake another 5 minutes before measuring again. Browning does not replace the temperature check.","image_alt":"Golden baked lasagna in its oven dish","image_url":"/recetas/receta-de-lasana-de-pollo-con-champinones/paso-07.webp"},{"title":"Rest, portion and store","content":"Rest for 10 minutes on a heatproof surface, then cut into 6 portions and serve with clean utensils. Divide leftovers into shallow containers and refrigerate at 4 °C or below within 2 hours, or 1 hour if the room exceeds 32 °C. Use within a proposed 3 days and reheat a portion only once to 74 °C at the centre. Do not leave the whole dish cooling on the counter for hours.","image_alt":"White chicken and mushroom lasagna portion showing its layers","image_url":"/recetas/receta-de-lasana-de-pollo-con-champinones/paso-08.webp"}],"notes":"Contains wheat and dairy; check sheets for egg or other allergens. This formula uses dry sheets for preboiling, not oven-ready sheets, and gluten-free or dairy-free substitutions have not been validated. Cremini can replace white mushrooms at the same weight, altering flavour and nutrients. Use chicken without added brine and low-moisture mozzarella, rather than wet balls, to approximate the calculation and avoid excess water. Do not substitute leftover chicken without adjusting the formula and considering its previous storage. Reduce mushrooms before assembly; add no extra cream or stock. Overnight raw assembly and freezing have not been validated; prepare and bake continuously. Nutrition uses original edible weights divided by 6, without exact absorption or cooking-loss calculation, and excludes sides.","nutrition":{"sodium_mg":705,"sugar_g":10,"saturated_fat_g":11.4,"carbs_g":47,"calories":567.7,"fat_g":23.5,"fiber_g":2.8,"protein_g":41.6,"estimated":true,"serving_size":"1 of 6 proposed portions","source":"USDA FoodData Central — SR Legacy, April 2018 JSON","source_url":"https://fdc.nal.usda.gov/download-datasets/","method":"Thirteen USDA records verified by FDC ID in the official archive. Original edible weights summed and divided by 6. Dry sheets use Pasta, dry, enriched as a proxy; cheese uses Cheese, mozzarella, whole milk, low moisture. All fat and seasoning counted. Unsalted cooking water discarded; no sides included.","note":"Estimate, not analysis of cooked lasagna. Pasta and cheese brands, chicken brine and actual portions change values. Quantities, timings and yield await a kitchen trial.","inputs":[{"fdc_id":169736,"fdc_description":"Pasta, dry, enriched","per_100g":{"sodium_mg":6,"sugar_g":2.67,"saturated_fat_g":0.277,"carbs_g":74.7,"calories":371,"fat_g":1.51,"fiber_g":3.2,"protein_g":13},"source_url":"https://fdc.nal.usda.gov/food-details/169736/nutrients","ingredient":"dry lasagna sheets requiring preboiling","edible_grams":240},{"fdc_id":171077,"fdc_description":"Chicken, broiler or fryers, breast, skinless, boneless, meat only, raw","per_100g":{"fat_g":2.62,"calories":120,"saturated_fat_g":0.563,"sodium_mg":45,"protein_g":22.5,"sugar_g":0,"carbs_g":0,"fiber_g":0},"source_url":"https://fdc.nal.usda.gov/food-details/171077/nutrients","ingredient":"raw boneless skinless chicken breast","edible_grams":600},{"fdc_id":169251,"fdc_description":"Mushrooms, white, raw","per_100g":{"sugar_g":1.98,"saturated_fat_g":0.05,"fiber_g":1,"fat_g":0.34,"sodium_mg":5,"protein_g":3.09,"carbs_g":3.26,"calories":22},"source_url":"https://fdc.nal.usda.gov/food-details/169251/nutrients","ingredient":"fresh white mushrooms","edible_grams":500},{"fdc_id":170000,"fdc_description":"Onions, raw","per_100g":{"sugar_g":4.24,"fat_g":0.1,"carbs_g":9.34,"calories":40,"saturated_fat_g":0.042,"protein_g":1.1,"fiber_g":1.7,"sodium_mg":4},"source_url":"https://fdc.nal.usda.gov/food-details/170000/nutrients","ingredient":"onion","edible_grams":150},{"fdc_id":169230,"fdc_description":"Garlic, raw","per_100g":{"carbs_g":33.1,"calories":149,"sugar_g":1,"saturated_fat_g":0.089,"fiber_g":2.1,"sodium_mg":17,"protein_g":6.36,"fat_g":0.5},"source_url":"https://fdc.nal.usda.gov/food-details/169230/nutrients","ingredient":"garlic","edible_grams":10},{"fdc_id":171413,"fdc_description":"Oil, olive, salad or cooking","per_100g":{"fat_g":100,"carbs_g":0,"calories":884,"sodium_mg":2,"protein_g":0,"saturated_fat_g":13.8,"fiber_g":0,"sugar_g":0},"source_url":"https://fdc.nal.usda.gov/food-details/171413/nutrients","ingredient":"olive oil","edible_grams":20},{"fdc_id":171265,"fdc_description":"Milk, whole, 3.25% milkfat, with added vitamin D","per_100g":{"fat_g":3.25,"sugar_g":5.05,"carbs_g":4.8,"calories":61,"saturated_fat_g":1.86,"fiber_g":0,"sodium_mg":43,"protein_g":3.15},"source_url":"https://fdc.nal.usda.gov/food-details/171265/nutrients","ingredient":"pasteurised whole milk","edible_grams":700},{"fdc_id":173430,"fdc_description":"Butter, without salt","per_100g":{"sugar_g":0.06,"calories":717,"saturated_fat_g":50.5,"fat_g":81.1,"carbs_g":0.06,"protein_g":0.85,"fiber_g":0,"sodium_mg":11},"source_url":"https://fdc.nal.usda.gov/food-details/173430/nutrients","ingredient":"unsalted butter","edible_grams":40},{"fdc_id":168936,"fdc_description":"Wheat flour, white, all-purpose, enriched, unbleached","per_100g":{"fiber_g":2.7,"fat_g":0.98,"carbs_g":76.3,"calories":364,"protein_g":10.3,"sodium_mg":2,"saturated_fat_g":0.155,"sugar_g":0.27},"source_url":"https://fdc.nal.usda.gov/food-details/168936/nutrients","ingredient":"plain all-purpose wheat flour","edible_grams":40},{"fdc_id":170846,"fdc_description":"Cheese, mozzarella, whole milk, low moisture","per_100g":{"sugar_g":1.01,"sodium_mg":710,"saturated_fat_g":15.6,"fiber_g":0,"protein_g":21.6,"fat_g":24.6,"carbs_g":2.47,"calories":318},"source_url":"https://fdc.nal.usda.gov/food-details/170846/nutrients","ingredient":"shredded low-moisture whole-milk mozzarella","edible_grams":180},{"fdc_id":173468,"fdc_description":"Salt, table","per_100g":{"fiber_g":0,"sodium_mg":38800,"saturated_fat_g":0,"protein_g":0,"fat_g":0,"carbs_g":0,"calories":0,"sugar_g":0},"source_url":"https://fdc.nal.usda.gov/food-details/173468/nutrients","ingredient":"fine salt","edible_grams":6},{"fdc_id":170931,"fdc_description":"Spices, pepper, black","per_100g":{"fat_g":3.26,"sugar_g":0.64,"carbs_g":64,"calories":251,"protein_g":10.4,"fiber_g":25.3,"sodium_mg":20,"saturated_fat_g":1.39},"source_url":"https://fdc.nal.usda.gov/food-details/170931/nutrients","ingredient":"ground black pepper","edible_grams":0.5},{"fdc_id":171326,"fdc_description":"Spices, nutmeg, ground","per_100g":{"protein_g":5.84,"sodium_mg":16,"saturated_fat_g":25.9,"fat_g":36.3,"carbs_g":49.3,"calories":525,"sugar_g":2.99,"fiber_g":20.8},"source_url":"https://fdc.nal.usda.gov/food-details/171326/nutrients","ingredient":"ground nutmeg","edible_grams":0.2}]},"image_url":"/recetas/receta-de-lasana-de-pollo-con-champinones/portada.webp","gallery":[{"url":"/recetas/receta-de-lasana-de-pollo-con-champinones/portada.webp","alt":"Chicken and mushroom lasagna portion with béchamel and golden cheese"}],"seo":{"title":"Chicken and mushroom lasagna with béchamel | Manual de Cocina","description":"White lasagna for 6 with chicken, mushrooms, béchamel and mozzarella. Preboil pasta, reduce the filling and check 74 °C at the centre.","image_alt":"Chicken and mushroom lasagna portion with béchamel and golden cheese","image_variants":["/recetas/receta-de-lasana-de-pollo-con-champinones/portada-1x1.webp","/recetas/receta-de-lasana-de-pollo-con-champinones/portada-4x3.webp","/recetas/receta-de-lasana-de-pollo-con-champinones/portada-16x9.webp"],"faq":[{"q":"Can I use oven-ready sheets?","a":"Not as a direct swap. This formula uses 240 g dry pasta for preboiling. Oven-ready sheets absorb sauce and require liquid and time adjustments following their packet."},{"q":"How can I prevent watery lasagna?","a":"Evaporate free mushroom liquid before adding chicken, use low-moisture mozzarella and béchamel that coats a spoon without becoming a paste. Rest 10 minutes before cutting."},{"q":"Can I assemble it the day before?","a":"This proposal uses continuous preparation and baking; extended raw assembly and freezing are unvalidated. Refrigerate cooked portions, use within 3 days and reheat once to 74 °C."}]},"published":false,"editorial_status":"draft","content_html":"<p>Cooked diced chicken, sautéed mushrooms and whole-milk béchamel are arranged with three layers of preboiled pasta and two filling layers, then topped with low-moisture mozzarella. The historical chicken-and-mushroom-lasagna URL and approved Recipe classification are retained.</p><p>The proposed yield is 6 portions in a dish about 20 × 30 cm: 20 minutes preparation, 60 cooking with some tasks in parallel, and 10 resting, 90 overall. Sheet brand and size can change assembly and cooking. Quantities, timings and yield are estimates awaiting a kitchen trial; check the chicken and casserole centre with a thermometer.</p>"},{"id":"8a73dec2-1ab9-5dfb-b97d-11c03fa09dda","recipe_group_id":"14f34319-2bdc-478f-b55b-909be0df6964","language":"fr","slug":"recette-de-poulet-lasana-aux-champignons","public_path":"/fr/recette-de-poulet-lasana-aux-champignons","source_url":null,"title":"Lasagnes au poulet et aux champignons, béchamel maison","excerpt":"Lasagnes pour 6 au poulet et aux champignons, pâtes précuites, garniture sans excès de liquide, béchamel et mozzarella gratinée.","summary":"Poulet cuit en dés, champignons sautés et béchamel au lait entier sont montés avec trois couches de pâtes précuites et deux de garniture, puis recouverts de mozzarella à faible humidité. L’URL historique et la classification Recipe approuvée sont conservées.\n\nLa proposition donne 6 portions dans un plat d’environ 20 × 30 cm : préparation 20 minutes, cuisson 60 avec certaines tâches en parallèle, repos 10, soit 90 au total. Marque et taille des feuilles modifient montage et cuisson. Quantités, durées et rendement sont estimés, en attente d’un essai en cuisine ; mesurez poulet et centre au thermomètre.","category":"Pâtes","category_slug":"pastas","difficulty":"Moyenne","course":"Plat principal","cuisine":"Italienne, adaptation maison","prep_time_minutes":20,"cook_time_minutes":60,"total_time_minutes":90,"servings":6,"keywords":["lasagnes poulet","lasagnes champignons","béchamel maison","lasagnes blanches"],"ingredients":[{"name":"feuilles de lasagnes sèches à précuire","amount":"240","unit":"g","group":"Pâtes"},{"name":"blanc de poulet cru sans peau ni os","amount":"600","unit":"g","group":"Garniture"},{"name":"champignons blancs frais","amount":"500","unit":"g","group":"Garniture"},{"name":"oignon","amount":"150","unit":"g","group":"Garniture"},{"name":"ail","amount":"10","unit":"g","group":"Garniture"},{"name":"huile d’olive","amount":"20","unit":"g","group":"Garniture"},{"name":"lait entier pasteurisé","amount":"700","unit":"g","group":"Béchamel"},{"name":"beurre doux","amount":"40","unit":"g","group":"Béchamel"},{"name":"farine de blé courante","amount":"40","unit":"g","group":"Béchamel"},{"name":"mozzarella de lait entier à faible humidité râpée","amount":"180","unit":"g","group":"Finition"},{"name":"sel fin","amount":"6","unit":"g","group":"Assaisonnement"},{"name":"poivre noir moulu","amount":"0.5","unit":"g","group":"Assaisonnement"},{"name":"muscade moulue","amount":"0.2","unit":"g","group":"Assaisonnement"}],"steps":[{"title":"Préparer les ingrédients et le plat","content":"Préchauffez à 190 °C, chaleur traditionnelle haut et bas sans ventilation, et préparez un plat d’environ 20 × 30 cm. Nettoyez et émincez 500 g de champignons, hachez 150 g d’oignon et 10 g d’ail. Sur une autre planche, coupez 600 g de poulet en dés d’environ 1,5 cm sans le laver. Séparez ustensiles crus et cuits. Divisez le sel : 3 g pour garniture, 3 g pour béchamel ; poivre : 0,25 g chacun.","image_alt":"Ingrédients avec champignons émincés et poulet cru sur planche séparée","image_url":"/recetas/receta-de-lasana-de-pollo-con-champinones/paso-01.webp"},{"title":"Cuire et égoutter les feuilles","content":"Faites cuire 240 g de feuilles dans une grande casserole d’eau potable bouillante sans sel ajouté, selon le paquet, environ 1 minute de moins si elles passent ensuite au four. Jetez l’eau, exclue du calcul. Égouttez et étalez séparément sur un linge propre. Utilisez des feuilles à précuire ; les feuilles prêtes au four demandent une autre quantité de liquide et ne sont pas prévues ici.","image_alt":"Feuilles cuites étalées séparément sur un linge propre","image_url":"/recetas/receta-de-lasana-de-pollo-con-champinones/paso-02.webp"},{"title":"Cuire le poulet séparément","content":"Chauffez 10 g d’huile dans une grande poêle. Ajoutez le poulet en deux fois s’il est serré et cuisez à feu moyen-vif environ 8–10 minutes au total en remuant. Ajoutez une partie des 3 g de sel et 0,25 g de poivre de la garniture. Vérifiez les plus gros dés : au moins 74 °C au thermomètre. Prolongez si nécessaire. Transférez avec un ustensile propre dans un récipient propre, jamais sur l’assiette du poulet cru.","image_alt":"Dés de poulet cuisant seuls dans une poêle","image_url":"/recetas/receta-de-lasana-de-pollo-con-champinones/paso-03.webp"},{"title":"Sauter les champignons et réunir la garniture","content":"Ajoutez les autres 10 g d’huile et l’oignon dans la même poêle ; cuisez 4–5 minutes. Ajoutez l’ail 30 secondes, puis les champignons. Faites sauter 8–10 minutes, en plusieurs fois si besoin, jusqu’à réduction et évaporation du liquide libre. Ajoutez le reste du sel et du poivre prévus pour la garniture et le poulet cuit. Le mélange doit être humide sans flaque ; réduisez avant le montage.","image_alt":"Champignons et oignon sautés avec dés de poulet cuit","image_url":"/recetas/receta-de-lasana-de-pollo-con-champinones/paso-04.webp"},{"title":"Préparer la béchamel","content":"Faites fondre 40 g de beurre à feu moyen-doux dans une casserole. Ajoutez 40 g de farine et remuez 2 minutes sans coloration. Versez progressivement 700 g de lait en fouettant pour supprimer les grumeaux. Laissez frémir 6–8 minutes en remuant jusqu’à nappage de la cuillère, avec une sauce encore étalable. Ajoutez les autres 3 g de sel, 0,25 g de poivre et 0,2 g de muscade. Ne réduisez pas en pâte épaisse.","image_alt":"Béchamel blanche fluide fouettée dans une casserole","image_url":"/recetas/receta-de-lasana-de-pollo-con-champinones/paso-05.webp"},{"title":"Monter trois couches de pâtes","content":"Étalez un peu de béchamel au fond. Réservez environ un quart du reste pour le dessus et partagez le reste entre deux couches. Divisez la garniture en deux et les 240 g initiaux de pâtes en trois couches adaptées au plat, en coupant si besoin. Alternez pâtes, moitié de garniture, béchamel et 30 g de mozzarella ; répétez avec encore 30 g de mozzarella. Terminez par la troisième couche de pâtes, sauce réservée et les 120 g de mozzarella restants. Couvrez tous les bords de pâtes de sauce.","image_alt":"Montage des pâtes, poulet, champignons et béchamel","image_url":"/recetas/receta-de-lasana-de-pollo-con-champinones/paso-06.webp"},{"title":"Enfourner et mesurer le centre","content":"Couvrez lâchement d’aluminium et cuisez 20 minutes à 190 °C. Retirez l’aluminium et poursuivez 10–15 minutes, jusqu’à bouillonnement et dorure sans brûler. Insérez une sonde propre en plusieurs points du centre sans toucher le plat : au moins 74 °C. Sinon couvrez si besoin, prolongez 5 minutes et mesurez encore. La croûte dorée ne remplace pas le contrôle.","image_alt":"Lasagnes gratinées dans un plat de cuisson","image_url":"/recetas/receta-de-lasana-de-pollo-con-champinones/paso-07.webp"},{"title":"Laisser reposer, portionner et conserver","content":"Reposez 10 minutes sur une surface résistante à la chaleur et coupez en 6 portions. Servez avec des ustensiles propres. Répartissez les restes en contenants peu profonds et réfrigérez à 4 °C ou moins sous 2 heures, ou 1 heure si l’ambiance dépasse 32 °C. Consommez sous 3 jours proposés et réchauffez une portion une seule fois à 74 °C à cœur. Ne laissez pas tout le plat refroidir des heures sur le plan de travail.","image_alt":"Part de lasagnes blanches montrant poulet, champignons et couches","image_url":"/recetas/receta-de-lasana-de-pollo-con-champinones/paso-08.webp"}],"notes":"Contient blé et lait ; vérifiez œuf et autres allergènes dans les feuilles. Pâtes sèches à précuire, pas prêtes au four ; substitutions sans gluten ou lait non validées. Les champignons bruns peuvent remplacer les blancs au même poids, avec variation de goût et nutriments. Poulet sans saumure ajoutée et mozzarella à faible humidité, pas boules humides, pour approcher le calcul et éviter l’eau. Ne remplacez pas le poulet par des restes sans adapter formule et conservation antérieure. Réduisez les champignons avant montage, sans crème ou bouillon supplémentaire. Montage cru la veille et congélation non validés ; préparez et enfournez sans interruption. Calcul selon les poids comestibles initiaux divisés par 6, sans absorption ou pertes exactes de cuisson ni accompagnement.","nutrition":{"sodium_mg":705,"sugar_g":10,"saturated_fat_g":11.4,"carbs_g":47,"calories":567.7,"fat_g":23.5,"fiber_g":2.8,"protein_g":41.6,"estimated":true,"serving_size":"1 des 6 portions proposées","source":"USDA FoodData Central — SR Legacy, April 2018 JSON","source_url":"https://fdc.nal.usda.gov/download-datasets/","method":"Treize fiches USDA vérifiées par FDC ID dans l’archive officielle. Poids comestibles initiaux additionnés et divisés par 6. Pâtes approchées par Pasta, dry, enriched et fromage par Cheese, mozzarella, whole milk, low moisture. Graisses et assaisonnements intégralement comptés. Eau de cuisson sans sel jetée ; sans accompagnement.","note":"Estimation, pas analyse du plat cuit. Marques de pâtes et mozzarella, saumure du poulet et partage réel modifient les chiffres. Quantités, durées et rendement en attente d’un essai en cuisine.","inputs":[{"fdc_id":169736,"fdc_description":"Pasta, dry, enriched","per_100g":{"sodium_mg":6,"sugar_g":2.67,"saturated_fat_g":0.277,"carbs_g":74.7,"calories":371,"fat_g":1.51,"fiber_g":3.2,"protein_g":13},"source_url":"https://fdc.nal.usda.gov/food-details/169736/nutrients","ingredient":"feuilles de lasagnes sèches à précuire","edible_grams":240},{"fdc_id":171077,"fdc_description":"Chicken, broiler or fryers, breast, skinless, boneless, meat only, raw","per_100g":{"fat_g":2.62,"calories":120,"saturated_fat_g":0.563,"sodium_mg":45,"protein_g":22.5,"sugar_g":0,"carbs_g":0,"fiber_g":0},"source_url":"https://fdc.nal.usda.gov/food-details/171077/nutrients","ingredient":"blanc de poulet cru sans peau ni os","edible_grams":600},{"fdc_id":169251,"fdc_description":"Mushrooms, white, raw","per_100g":{"sugar_g":1.98,"saturated_fat_g":0.05,"fiber_g":1,"fat_g":0.34,"sodium_mg":5,"protein_g":3.09,"carbs_g":3.26,"calories":22},"source_url":"https://fdc.nal.usda.gov/food-details/169251/nutrients","ingredient":"champignons blancs frais","edible_grams":500},{"fdc_id":170000,"fdc_description":"Onions, raw","per_100g":{"sugar_g":4.24,"fat_g":0.1,"carbs_g":9.34,"calories":40,"saturated_fat_g":0.042,"protein_g":1.1,"fiber_g":1.7,"sodium_mg":4},"source_url":"https://fdc.nal.usda.gov/food-details/170000/nutrients","ingredient":"oignon","edible_grams":150},{"fdc_id":169230,"fdc_description":"Garlic, raw","per_100g":{"carbs_g":33.1,"calories":149,"sugar_g":1,"saturated_fat_g":0.089,"fiber_g":2.1,"sodium_mg":17,"protein_g":6.36,"fat_g":0.5},"source_url":"https://fdc.nal.usda.gov/food-details/169230/nutrients","ingredient":"ail","edible_grams":10},{"fdc_id":171413,"fdc_description":"Oil, olive, salad or cooking","per_100g":{"fat_g":100,"carbs_g":0,"calories":884,"sodium_mg":2,"protein_g":0,"saturated_fat_g":13.8,"fiber_g":0,"sugar_g":0},"source_url":"https://fdc.nal.usda.gov/food-details/171413/nutrients","ingredient":"huile d’olive","edible_grams":20},{"fdc_id":171265,"fdc_description":"Milk, whole, 3.25% milkfat, with added vitamin D","per_100g":{"fat_g":3.25,"sugar_g":5.05,"carbs_g":4.8,"calories":61,"saturated_fat_g":1.86,"fiber_g":0,"sodium_mg":43,"protein_g":3.15},"source_url":"https://fdc.nal.usda.gov/food-details/171265/nutrients","ingredient":"lait entier pasteurisé","edible_grams":700},{"fdc_id":173430,"fdc_description":"Butter, without salt","per_100g":{"sugar_g":0.06,"calories":717,"saturated_fat_g":50.5,"fat_g":81.1,"carbs_g":0.06,"protein_g":0.85,"fiber_g":0,"sodium_mg":11},"source_url":"https://fdc.nal.usda.gov/food-details/173430/nutrients","ingredient":"beurre doux","edible_grams":40},{"fdc_id":168936,"fdc_description":"Wheat flour, white, all-purpose, enriched, unbleached","per_100g":{"fiber_g":2.7,"fat_g":0.98,"carbs_g":76.3,"calories":364,"protein_g":10.3,"sodium_mg":2,"saturated_fat_g":0.155,"sugar_g":0.27},"source_url":"https://fdc.nal.usda.gov/food-details/168936/nutrients","ingredient":"farine de blé courante","edible_grams":40},{"fdc_id":170846,"fdc_description":"Cheese, mozzarella, whole milk, low moisture","per_100g":{"sugar_g":1.01,"sodium_mg":710,"saturated_fat_g":15.6,"fiber_g":0,"protein_g":21.6,"fat_g":24.6,"carbs_g":2.47,"calories":318},"source_url":"https://fdc.nal.usda.gov/food-details/170846/nutrients","ingredient":"mozzarella de lait entier à faible humidité râpée","edible_grams":180},{"fdc_id":173468,"fdc_description":"Salt, table","per_100g":{"fiber_g":0,"sodium_mg":38800,"saturated_fat_g":0,"protein_g":0,"fat_g":0,"carbs_g":0,"calories":0,"sugar_g":0},"source_url":"https://fdc.nal.usda.gov/food-details/173468/nutrients","ingredient":"sel fin","edible_grams":6},{"fdc_id":170931,"fdc_description":"Spices, pepper, black","per_100g":{"fat_g":3.26,"sugar_g":0.64,"carbs_g":64,"calories":251,"protein_g":10.4,"fiber_g":25.3,"sodium_mg":20,"saturated_fat_g":1.39},"source_url":"https://fdc.nal.usda.gov/food-details/170931/nutrients","ingredient":"poivre noir moulu","edible_grams":0.5},{"fdc_id":171326,"fdc_description":"Spices, nutmeg, ground","per_100g":{"protein_g":5.84,"sodium_mg":16,"saturated_fat_g":25.9,"fat_g":36.3,"carbs_g":49.3,"calories":525,"sugar_g":2.99,"fiber_g":20.8},"source_url":"https://fdc.nal.usda.gov/food-details/171326/nutrients","ingredient":"muscade moulue","edible_grams":0.2}]},"image_url":"/recetas/receta-de-lasana-de-pollo-con-champinones/portada.webp","gallery":[{"url":"/recetas/receta-de-lasana-de-pollo-con-champinones/portada.webp","alt":"Part de lasagnes poulet-champignons avec béchamel et fromage doré"}],"seo":{"title":"Lasagnes poulet-champignons et béchamel | Manual de Cocina","description":"Lasagnes blanches pour 6 avec poulet, champignons, béchamel et mozzarella. Précuisez les pâtes, réduisez la garniture et vérifiez 74 °C à cœur.","image_alt":"Part de lasagnes poulet-champignons avec béchamel et fromage doré","image_variants":["/recetas/receta-de-lasana-de-pollo-con-champinones/portada-1x1.webp","/recetas/receta-de-lasana-de-pollo-con-champinones/portada-4x3.webp","/recetas/receta-de-lasana-de-pollo-con-champinones/portada-16x9.webp"],"faq":[{"q":"Peut-on utiliser des feuilles prêtes au four ?","a":"Pas en remplacement direct. Cette formule utilise 240 g de pâtes sèches à précuire. Les feuilles prêtes au four absorbent la sauce : adaptez liquides et durée selon leur paquet."},{"q":"Comment éviter des lasagnes aqueuses ?","a":"Évaporez le liquide libre des champignons avant le poulet, utilisez mozzarella à faible humidité et béchamel nappant la cuillère sans devenir une pâte. Reposez 10 minutes avant de couper."},{"q":"Peut-on monter le plat la veille ?","a":"Préparation et cuisson continues sont proposées ; montage cru prolongé et congélation non validés. Réfrigérez les portions cuites, consommez sous 3 jours et réchauffez une fois à 74 °C."}]},"published":false,"editorial_status":"draft","content_html":"<p>Poulet cuit en dés, champignons sautés et béchamel au lait entier sont montés avec trois couches de pâtes précuites et deux de garniture, puis recouverts de mozzarella à faible humidité. L’URL historique et la classification Recipe approuvée sont conservées.</p><p>La proposition donne 6 portions dans un plat d’environ 20 × 30 cm : préparation 20 minutes, cuisson 60 avec certaines tâches en parallèle, repos 10, soit 90 au total. Marque et taille des feuilles modifient montage et cuisson. Quantités, durées et rendement sont estimés, en attente d’un essai en cuisine ; mesurez poulet et centre au thermomètre.</p>"},{"id":"ee96c0da-eac6-5ad9-ad07-9a5585997d0e","recipe_group_id":"14f34319-2bdc-478f-b55b-909be0df6964","language":"it","slug":"ricetta-lasana-di-pollo-con-funghi","public_path":"/it/ricetta-lasana-di-pollo-con-funghi","source_url":null,"title":"Lasagne di pollo e funghi con besciamella","excerpt":"Lasagne per 6 con pollo, funghi, pasta precotta, ripieno senza liquido in eccesso, besciamella e mozzarella gratinata.","summary":"Pollo cotto a dadini, funghi saltati e besciamella al latte intero vengono montati con tre strati di pasta precotta e due di ripieno, finendo con mozzarella a bassa umidità. Restano URL storica e classificazione Recipe approvata.\n\nSi propongono 6 porzioni in pirofila di circa 20 × 30 cm: preparazione 20 minuti, cottura 60 con alcune attività in parallelo, riposo 10, totale 90. Marca e dimensione delle sfoglie possono cambiare montaggio e cottura. Dosi, tempi e resa sono stime in attesa di prova in cucina; pollo e centro si controllano con termometro.","category":"Pasta","category_slug":"pastas","difficulty":"Media","course":"Piatto principale","cuisine":"Italiana, adattamento casalingo","prep_time_minutes":20,"cook_time_minutes":60,"total_time_minutes":90,"servings":6,"keywords":["lasagne pollo","lasagne funghi","besciamella casalinga","lasagne bianche"],"ingredients":[{"name":"sfoglie secche per lasagne da precuocere","amount":"240","unit":"g","group":"Pasta"},{"name":"petto di pollo crudo senza pelle né ossa","amount":"600","unit":"g","group":"Ripieno"},{"name":"champignon bianchi freschi","amount":"500","unit":"g","group":"Ripieno"},{"name":"cipolla","amount":"150","unit":"g","group":"Ripieno"},{"name":"aglio","amount":"10","unit":"g","group":"Ripieno"},{"name":"olio d’oliva","amount":"20","unit":"g","group":"Ripieno"},{"name":"latte intero pastorizzato","amount":"700","unit":"g","group":"Besciamella"},{"name":"burro non salato","amount":"40","unit":"g","group":"Besciamella"},{"name":"farina di frumento comune","amount":"40","unit":"g","group":"Besciamella"},{"name":"mozzarella di latte intero a bassa umidità grattugiata","amount":"180","unit":"g","group":"Finitura"},{"name":"sale fino","amount":"6","unit":"g","group":"Condimento"},{"name":"pepe nero macinato","amount":"0.5","unit":"g","group":"Condimento"},{"name":"noce moscata macinata","amount":"0.2","unit":"g","group":"Condimento"}],"steps":[{"title":"Preparare ingredienti e pirofila","content":"Preriscaldare a 190 °C, forno statico sopra e sotto senza ventola, e preparare una pirofila di circa 20 × 30 cm. Pulire e affettare 500 g di funghi, tritare 150 g di cipolla e 10 g di aglio. Su altro tagliere tagliare 600 g di pollo in dadini di circa 1,5 cm senza lavarlo. Separare utensili crudi e cotti. Dividere sale: 3 g al ripieno, 3 g alla besciamella; pepe: 0,25 g ciascuno.","image_alt":"Ingredienti con funghi affettati e pollo crudo su tagliere separato","image_url":"/recetas/receta-de-lasana-de-pollo-con-champinones/paso-01.webp"},{"title":"Cuocere e scolare la pasta","content":"Cuocere 240 g di sfoglie in una pentola grande di acqua potabile bollente senza sale aggiunto, seguendo la confezione e togliendo circa 1 minuto prima se poi vanno in forno. Eliminare l’acqua, esclusa dal calcolo. Scolare e stendere separate su panno pulito. Usare sfoglie da precuocere; quelle pronte al forno richiedono un altro rapporto di liquidi e non sono previste qui.","image_alt":"Sfoglie cotte separate su panno pulito","image_url":"/recetas/receta-de-lasana-de-pollo-con-champinones/paso-02.webp"},{"title":"Cuocere il pollo separatamente","content":"Scaldare 10 g di olio in padella ampia. Cuocere il pollo in due riprese se troppo ammassato, a fuoco medio-alto per circa 8–10 minuti totali mescolando. Usare parte dei 3 g di sale e 0,25 g di pepe del ripieno. Controllare i dadini più grandi: almeno 74 °C al termometro. Prolungare se necessario. Trasferire con utensile pulito in contenitore pulito, mai nel piatto del pollo crudo.","image_alt":"Dadini di pollo che cuociono da soli in padella","image_url":"/recetas/receta-de-lasana-de-pollo-con-champinones/paso-03.webp"},{"title":"Saltare i funghi e unire il ripieno","content":"Nella stessa padella mettere gli altri 10 g di olio e la cipolla, cuocere 4–5 minuti. Aggiungere aglio per 30 secondi, poi funghi. Saltare 8–10 minuti, in riprese se serve, finché ridotti e senza liquido libero. Aggiungere sale e pepe del ripieno rimasti e pollo cotto. Il ripieno deve essere umido senza pozza; ridurre il liquido prima del montaggio.","image_alt":"Funghi e cipolla saltati uniti al pollo cotto","image_url":"/recetas/receta-de-lasana-de-pollo-con-champinones/paso-04.webp"},{"title":"Fare la besciamella","content":"Sciogliere 40 g di burro a fuoco medio-basso in casseruola. Mescolare 40 g di farina per 2 minuti senza dorare. Versare 700 g di latte poco alla volta con la frusta, sciogliendo i grumi. Sobbollire 6–8 minuti mescolando, finché vela il cucchiaio ma resta spalmabile. Unire gli altri 3 g di sale, 0,25 g di pepe e 0,2 g di noce moscata. Non ridurre a pasta densa.","image_alt":"Besciamella bianca fluida mescolata con frusta","image_url":"/recetas/receta-de-lasana-de-pollo-con-champinones/paso-05.webp"},{"title":"Montare tre strati di pasta","content":"Stendere poca besciamella sul fondo. Tenere circa un quarto della salsa restante per sopra e dividere il resto in due strati. Dividere il ripieno a metà e i 240 g iniziali di pasta in tre strati adatti alla pirofila, tagliando se necessario. Alternare pasta, metà ripieno, besciamella e 30 g di mozzarella; ripetere con altri 30 g di mozzarella. Finire con terzo strato di pasta, salsa tenuta e i 120 g di mozzarella rimasti. Coprire tutti i bordi di pasta con salsa.","image_alt":"Montaggio di pasta, pollo, funghi e besciamella","image_url":"/recetas/receta-de-lasana-de-pollo-con-champinones/paso-06.webp"},{"title":"Infornare e controllare il centro","content":"Coprire morbidamente con alluminio e cuocere 20 minuti a 190 °C. Togliere l’alluminio e cuocere altri 10–15 minuti, fino a bolle e doratura senza bruciare. Inserire sonda pulita in più punti centrali senza toccare la pirofila: almeno 74 °C. Se inferiore, coprire se serve e cuocere altri 5 minuti prima di rimisurare. La doratura non sostituisce il controllo.","image_alt":"Lasagne gratinate nella pirofila","image_url":"/recetas/receta-de-lasana-de-pollo-con-champinones/paso-07.webp"},{"title":"Riposare, porzionare e conservare","content":"Riposare 10 minuti su superficie resistente al calore, tagliare in 6 porzioni e servire con utensili puliti. Dividere gli avanzi in contenitori bassi e refrigerare a 4 °C o meno entro 2 ore, o 1 ora se l’ambiente supera 32 °C. Si propone consumo entro 3 giorni e riscaldamento di ogni porzione una sola volta a 74 °C al centro. Non lasciare l’intera pirofila per ore sul piano a raffreddare.","image_alt":"Porzione di lasagne bianche con strati di pollo e funghi","image_url":"/recetas/receta-de-lasana-de-pollo-con-champinones/paso-08.webp"}],"notes":"Contiene frumento e latticini; controllare uovo e altri allergeni nelle sfoglie. Questa formula usa pasta secca da precuocere, non pronta al forno; sostituzioni senza glutine o latte non validate. Cremini al posto degli champignon bianchi allo stesso peso cambiano sapore e nutrienti. Usare pollo senza salamoia aggiunta e mozzarella a bassa umidità, non palline umide, per avvicinare il calcolo ed evitare acqua in eccesso. Non sostituire con avanzi di pollo senza riformulare e considerare la conservazione precedente. Ridurre i funghi prima di montare; niente panna o brodo aggiuntivo. Montaggio crudo il giorno prima e congelamento non validati: preparare e infornare senza interruzioni. Nutrizione dai pesi edibili iniziali divisi per 6, senza assorbimento o perdite esatte di cottura e senza contorni.","nutrition":{"sodium_mg":705,"sugar_g":10,"saturated_fat_g":11.4,"carbs_g":47,"calories":567.7,"fat_g":23.5,"fiber_g":2.8,"protein_g":41.6,"estimated":true,"serving_size":"1 delle 6 porzioni proposte","source":"USDA FoodData Central — SR Legacy, April 2018 JSON","source_url":"https://fdc.nal.usda.gov/download-datasets/","method":"Tredici schede USDA verificate per FDC ID nell’archivio ufficiale. Pesi edibili iniziali sommati e divisi per 6. Pasta approssimata con Pasta, dry, enriched e formaggio con Cheese, mozzarella, whole milk, low moisture. Grassi e condimenti contati integralmente. Acqua di cottura senza sale eliminata; nessun contorno.","note":"Stima, non analisi del piatto cotto. Marche di pasta e mozzarella, salamoia del pollo e porzioni reali cambiano i valori. Dosi, tempi e resa attendono prova in cucina.","inputs":[{"fdc_id":169736,"fdc_description":"Pasta, dry, enriched","per_100g":{"sodium_mg":6,"sugar_g":2.67,"saturated_fat_g":0.277,"carbs_g":74.7,"calories":371,"fat_g":1.51,"fiber_g":3.2,"protein_g":13},"source_url":"https://fdc.nal.usda.gov/food-details/169736/nutrients","ingredient":"sfoglie secche per lasagne da precuocere","edible_grams":240},{"fdc_id":171077,"fdc_description":"Chicken, broiler or fryers, breast, skinless, boneless, meat only, raw","per_100g":{"fat_g":2.62,"calories":120,"saturated_fat_g":0.563,"sodium_mg":45,"protein_g":22.5,"sugar_g":0,"carbs_g":0,"fiber_g":0},"source_url":"https://fdc.nal.usda.gov/food-details/171077/nutrients","ingredient":"petto di pollo crudo senza pelle né ossa","edible_grams":600},{"fdc_id":169251,"fdc_description":"Mushrooms, white, raw","per_100g":{"sugar_g":1.98,"saturated_fat_g":0.05,"fiber_g":1,"fat_g":0.34,"sodium_mg":5,"protein_g":3.09,"carbs_g":3.26,"calories":22},"source_url":"https://fdc.nal.usda.gov/food-details/169251/nutrients","ingredient":"champignon bianchi freschi","edible_grams":500},{"fdc_id":170000,"fdc_description":"Onions, raw","per_100g":{"sugar_g":4.24,"fat_g":0.1,"carbs_g":9.34,"calories":40,"saturated_fat_g":0.042,"protein_g":1.1,"fiber_g":1.7,"sodium_mg":4},"source_url":"https://fdc.nal.usda.gov/food-details/170000/nutrients","ingredient":"cipolla","edible_grams":150},{"fdc_id":169230,"fdc_description":"Garlic, raw","per_100g":{"carbs_g":33.1,"calories":149,"sugar_g":1,"saturated_fat_g":0.089,"fiber_g":2.1,"sodium_mg":17,"protein_g":6.36,"fat_g":0.5},"source_url":"https://fdc.nal.usda.gov/food-details/169230/nutrients","ingredient":"aglio","edible_grams":10},{"fdc_id":171413,"fdc_description":"Oil, olive, salad or cooking","per_100g":{"fat_g":100,"carbs_g":0,"calories":884,"sodium_mg":2,"protein_g":0,"saturated_fat_g":13.8,"fiber_g":0,"sugar_g":0},"source_url":"https://fdc.nal.usda.gov/food-details/171413/nutrients","ingredient":"olio d’oliva","edible_grams":20},{"fdc_id":171265,"fdc_description":"Milk, whole, 3.25% milkfat, with added vitamin D","per_100g":{"fat_g":3.25,"sugar_g":5.05,"carbs_g":4.8,"calories":61,"saturated_fat_g":1.86,"fiber_g":0,"sodium_mg":43,"protein_g":3.15},"source_url":"https://fdc.nal.usda.gov/food-details/171265/nutrients","ingredient":"latte intero pastorizzato","edible_grams":700},{"fdc_id":173430,"fdc_description":"Butter, without salt","per_100g":{"sugar_g":0.06,"calories":717,"saturated_fat_g":50.5,"fat_g":81.1,"carbs_g":0.06,"protein_g":0.85,"fiber_g":0,"sodium_mg":11},"source_url":"https://fdc.nal.usda.gov/food-details/173430/nutrients","ingredient":"burro non salato","edible_grams":40},{"fdc_id":168936,"fdc_description":"Wheat flour, white, all-purpose, enriched, unbleached","per_100g":{"fiber_g":2.7,"fat_g":0.98,"carbs_g":76.3,"calories":364,"protein_g":10.3,"sodium_mg":2,"saturated_fat_g":0.155,"sugar_g":0.27},"source_url":"https://fdc.nal.usda.gov/food-details/168936/nutrients","ingredient":"farina di frumento comune","edible_grams":40},{"fdc_id":170846,"fdc_description":"Cheese, mozzarella, whole milk, low moisture","per_100g":{"sugar_g":1.01,"sodium_mg":710,"saturated_fat_g":15.6,"fiber_g":0,"protein_g":21.6,"fat_g":24.6,"carbs_g":2.47,"calories":318},"source_url":"https://fdc.nal.usda.gov/food-details/170846/nutrients","ingredient":"mozzarella di latte intero a bassa umidità grattugiata","edible_grams":180},{"fdc_id":173468,"fdc_description":"Salt, table","per_100g":{"fiber_g":0,"sodium_mg":38800,"saturated_fat_g":0,"protein_g":0,"fat_g":0,"carbs_g":0,"calories":0,"sugar_g":0},"source_url":"https://fdc.nal.usda.gov/food-details/173468/nutrients","ingredient":"sale fino","edible_grams":6},{"fdc_id":170931,"fdc_description":"Spices, pepper, black","per_100g":{"fat_g":3.26,"sugar_g":0.64,"carbs_g":64,"calories":251,"protein_g":10.4,"fiber_g":25.3,"sodium_mg":20,"saturated_fat_g":1.39},"source_url":"https://fdc.nal.usda.gov/food-details/170931/nutrients","ingredient":"pepe nero macinato","edible_grams":0.5},{"fdc_id":171326,"fdc_description":"Spices, nutmeg, ground","per_100g":{"protein_g":5.84,"sodium_mg":16,"saturated_fat_g":25.9,"fat_g":36.3,"carbs_g":49.3,"calories":525,"sugar_g":2.99,"fiber_g":20.8},"source_url":"https://fdc.nal.usda.gov/food-details/171326/nutrients","ingredient":"noce moscata macinata","edible_grams":0.2}]},"image_url":"/recetas/receta-de-lasana-de-pollo-con-champinones/portada.webp","gallery":[{"url":"/recetas/receta-de-lasana-de-pollo-con-champinones/portada.webp","alt":"Porzione di lasagne pollo e funghi con besciamella e formaggio dorato"}],"seo":{"title":"Lasagne di pollo e funghi con besciamella | Manual de Cocina","description":"Lasagne bianche per 6 con pollo, funghi, besciamella e mozzarella. Precuoci la pasta, riduci il ripieno e verifica 74 °C al centro.","image_alt":"Porzione di lasagne pollo e funghi con besciamella e formaggio dorato","image_variants":["/recetas/receta-de-lasana-de-pollo-con-champinones/portada-1x1.webp","/recetas/receta-de-lasana-de-pollo-con-champinones/portada-4x3.webp","/recetas/receta-de-lasana-de-pollo-con-champinones/portada-16x9.webp"],"faq":[{"q":"Posso usare sfoglie pronte al forno?","a":"Non come sostituzione diretta. Sono previsti 240 g di pasta secca da precuocere. Sfoglie pronte assorbono salsa e richiedono adeguare liquidi e tempi secondo confezione."},{"q":"Come evitare lasagne acquose?","a":"Evaporare liquido libero dei funghi prima del pollo, usare mozzarella a bassa umidità e besciamella che vela il cucchiaio senza diventare pasta. Riposare 10 minuti prima del taglio."},{"q":"Posso montarle il giorno prima?","a":"Si propone preparazione e cottura continue; montaggio crudo prolungato e congelamento non validati. Refrigerare porzioni cotte, consumare entro 3 giorni e riscaldare una volta a 74 °C."}]},"published":false,"editorial_status":"draft","content_html":"<p>Pollo cotto a dadini, funghi saltati e besciamella al latte intero vengono montati con tre strati di pasta precotta e due di ripieno, finendo con mozzarella a bassa umidità. Restano URL storica e classificazione Recipe approvata.</p><p>Si propongono 6 porzioni in pirofila di circa 20 × 30 cm: preparazione 20 minuti, cottura 60 con alcune attività in parallelo, riposo 10, totale 90. Marca e dimensione delle sfoglie possono cambiare montaggio e cottura. Dosi, tempi e resa sono stime in attesa di prova in cucina; pollo e centro si controllano con termometro.</p>"},{"id":"68ad0f73-267d-539a-9756-380f492a5f0a","recipe_group_id":"14f34319-2bdc-478f-b55b-909be0df6964","language":"ja","slug":"キノコ入りチキンラサナのレシピ","public_path":"/ja/キノコ入りチキンラサナのレシピ","source_url":null,"title":"鶏肉とマッシュルームのベシャメルラザニア","excerpt":"6人分の鶏肉とマッシュルームのラザニア。下ゆでしたパスタ、水分を飛ばした詰め物、ベシャメル、モッツァレラを重ねます。","summary":"加熱した鶏肉の角切り、炒めたマッシュルーム、全乳のベシャメルを、下ゆでしたパスタ3層と詰め物2層に組み、低水分モッツァレラで仕上げます。歴史的URLと承認済みRecipe分類を維持します。\n\n約20 × 30 cmの耐熱容器で6人分を提案します。準備20分、一部を並行する加熱60分、休ませる10分、合計90分の推定です。パスタの製品や大きさで組み方と加熱が変わります。分量、時間、出来上がり量は調理試験待ちで、鶏肉と中心を温度計で確認します。","category":"パスタ","category_slug":"pastas","difficulty":"中級","course":"主菜","cuisine":"イタリア風の家庭料理案","prep_time_minutes":20,"cook_time_minutes":60,"total_time_minutes":90,"servings":6,"keywords":["鶏肉 ラザニア","マッシュルーム ラザニア","ベシャメル","白いラザニア"],"ingredients":[{"name":"下ゆでが必要な乾燥ラザニアシート","amount":"240","unit":"g","group":"パスタ"},{"name":"皮と骨のない生の鶏むね肉","amount":"600","unit":"g","group":"詰め物"},{"name":"生の白マッシュルーム","amount":"500","unit":"g","group":"詰め物"},{"name":"玉ねぎ","amount":"150","unit":"g","group":"詰め物"},{"name":"にんにく","amount":"10","unit":"g","group":"詰め物"},{"name":"オリーブ油","amount":"20","unit":"g","group":"詰め物"},{"name":"殺菌済み全乳","amount":"700","unit":"g","group":"ベシャメル"},{"name":"無塩バター","amount":"40","unit":"g","group":"ベシャメル"},{"name":"一般的な小麦粉","amount":"40","unit":"g","group":"ベシャメル"},{"name":"低水分の全乳モッツァレラ、細切り","amount":"180","unit":"g","group":"仕上げ"},{"name":"細粒の塩","amount":"6","unit":"g","group":"味付け"},{"name":"黒こしょう","amount":"0.5","unit":"g","group":"味付け"},{"name":"粉末ナツメグ","amount":"0.2","unit":"g","group":"味付け"}],"steps":[{"title":"材料と耐熱容器を用意する","content":"ファンなし上下加熱のオーブンを190 °Cに予熱し、約20 × 30 cmの耐熱容器を用意します。マッシュルーム500 gをきれいにして薄切りにし、玉ねぎ150 gとにんにく10 gを刻みます。別のまな板で鶏肉600 gを約1.5 cm角に切り、洗いません。生用と加熱済み用の道具を分けます。塩は詰め物3 g、ベシャメル3 g、こしょうは各0.25 gに分けます。","image_alt":"薄切りマッシュルームと別まな板の生の鶏肉などの材料","image_url":"/recetas/receta-de-lasana-de-pollo-con-champinones/paso-01.webp"},{"title":"パスタをゆでて水を切る","content":"シート240 gを大きな鍋の沸騰した飲用水で、塩を加えず製品表示に従ってゆでます。後で焼く場合は約1分早めに取り出します。ゆで汁は捨て、栄養計算に含めません。水を切り、清潔な布に重ねず広げます。下ゆで用シートを使用し、直接オーブン用は水分の比率が異なるためこの案には使いません。","image_alt":"清潔な布に重ねず広げたゆで済みラザニアシート","image_url":"/recetas/receta-de-lasana-de-pollo-con-champinones/paso-02.webp"},{"title":"鶏肉を別に加熱する","content":"広いフライパンで油10 gを温めます。混み合う場合は鶏肉を2回に分け、中強火で合計約8–10分混ぜて加熱します。詰め物用の塩3 gとこしょう0.25 gの一部を加えます。大きい肉の中心を温度計で測り、少なくとも74 °Cを確認し、足りなければ加熱を続けます。清潔な道具で清潔な容器へ移し、生肉の皿には戻しません。","image_alt":"フライパンで鶏肉の角切りだけを加熱する","image_url":"/recetas/receta-de-lasana-de-pollo-con-champinones/paso-03.webp"},{"title":"マッシュルームを炒めて詰め物を合わせる","content":"同じフライパンに残りの油10 gと玉ねぎを入れ、4–5分加熱します。にんにくを30秒炒めてマッシュルームを加えます。必要なら分けて8–10分炒め、縮んで遊離した水分が蒸発するまで加熱します。詰め物用の残りの塩とこしょう、加熱した鶏肉を合わせます。湿り気は残し、水たまりがあれば組む前に煮詰めます。","image_alt":"炒めたマッシュルームと玉ねぎに加熱済み鶏肉を混ぜる","image_url":"/recetas/receta-de-lasana-de-pollo-con-champinones/paso-04.webp"},{"title":"ベシャメルを作る","content":"鍋でバター40 gを中弱火で溶かし、小麦粉40 gを2分混ぜ、色を付けません。牛乳700 gを少しずつ加えて泡立て器でだまをなくします。静かに6–8分煮て混ぜ、スプーンを覆い、なお広げられる濃度にします。残りの塩3 g、こしょう0.25 g、ナツメグ0.2 gを加えます。固いペーストまで煮詰めません。","image_alt":"鍋で泡立て器で混ぜる白く流動性のあるベシャメル","image_url":"/recetas/receta-de-lasana-de-pollo-con-champinones/paso-05.webp"},{"title":"パスタを3層に組む","content":"底にベシャメルを薄く塗ります。残りのソースの約4分の1を上用に取り、あとは2層に分けます。詰め物を半分に、元のパスタ240 gを容器に合う3層に分け、必要なら切ります。パスタ、詰め物半量、ベシャメル、モッツァレラ30 gを重ね、さらにモッツァレラ30 gを使って同様に繰り返します。3層目のパスタ、取っておいたソース、残りのモッツァレラ120 gで仕上げます。パスタの縁をすべてソースで覆います。","image_alt":"耐熱容器にパスタ、鶏肉、マッシュルーム、ソースを重ねる","image_url":"/recetas/receta-de-lasana-de-pollo-con-champinones/paso-06.webp"},{"title":"焼いて中心温度を確認する","content":"アルミホイルをふんわりかぶせ、190 °Cで20分焼きます。外してさらに10–15分、沸々として表面が焦げずに色付くまで焼きます。清潔なプローブを容器に触れないよう中心の複数箇所に入れ、少なくとも74 °Cを確認します。低ければ必要に応じて覆い、5分延長して再測定します。焼き色では温度確認を代替できません。","image_alt":"耐熱容器に入った焼き色のついたラザニア","image_url":"/recetas/receta-de-lasana-de-pollo-con-champinones/paso-07.webp"},{"title":"休ませて切り、保存する","content":"耐熱面で10分休ませ、6等分し、清潔な道具で提供します。残りは浅い容器に分け、2時間以内、室温が32 °Cを超える場合は1時間以内に4 °C以下で冷蔵します。保存は3日以内を提案し、1人分を1回だけ中心74 °Cまで再加熱します。容器全体を調理台で何時間も冷まさないでください。","image_alt":"層が見える鶏肉とマッシュルームの白いラザニア","image_url":"/recetas/receta-de-lasana-de-pollo-con-champinones/paso-08.webp"}],"notes":"小麦と乳製品を含み、シートの卵やほかのアレルゲンを確認します。この配合は下ゆで用の乾燥パスタで、直接オーブン用やグルテン・乳不使用代替は未検証です。白マッシュルームを同重量のブラウン種に替えると味と栄養が変わります。計算に近づけ水分過多を避けるため、塩水無添加の鶏肉と、水分の多い球形ではない低水分モッツァレラを使います。前回の保存を考慮し配合を調整せずに残りの鶏肉へ替えません。組む前にマッシュルームの水分を飛ばし、生クリームやだしは追加しません。生の組み立てを翌日まで保存したり冷凍する案は未検証で、準備から焼くまで続けて行います。栄養は元の可食重量を6で割り、吸収や加熱損失の正確な計算、付け合わせは含めません。","nutrition":{"sodium_mg":705,"sugar_g":10,"saturated_fat_g":11.4,"carbs_g":47,"calories":567.7,"fat_g":23.5,"fiber_g":2.8,"protein_g":41.6,"estimated":true,"serving_size":"提案する6人分のうち1人分","source":"USDA FoodData Central — SR Legacy, April 2018 JSON","source_url":"https://fdc.nal.usda.gov/download-datasets/","method":"公式アーカイブでFDC IDからUSDA13項目を確認。元の可食重量を合計して6で割る。乾燥シートはPasta, dry, enriched、チーズはCheese, mozzarella, whole milk, low moistureで近似。油脂と味付け全量を計上。無塩のゆで汁を捨て、付け合わせは除外。","note":"調理済み料理の分析ではなく推定。パスタとチーズの製品、鶏肉の塩水、実際の分け方で変わる。分量、時間、出来上がり量は調理試験待ち。","inputs":[{"fdc_id":169736,"fdc_description":"Pasta, dry, enriched","per_100g":{"sodium_mg":6,"sugar_g":2.67,"saturated_fat_g":0.277,"carbs_g":74.7,"calories":371,"fat_g":1.51,"fiber_g":3.2,"protein_g":13},"source_url":"https://fdc.nal.usda.gov/food-details/169736/nutrients","ingredient":"下ゆでが必要な乾燥ラザニアシート","edible_grams":240},{"fdc_id":171077,"fdc_description":"Chicken, broiler or fryers, breast, skinless, boneless, meat only, raw","per_100g":{"fat_g":2.62,"calories":120,"saturated_fat_g":0.563,"sodium_mg":45,"protein_g":22.5,"sugar_g":0,"carbs_g":0,"fiber_g":0},"source_url":"https://fdc.nal.usda.gov/food-details/171077/nutrients","ingredient":"皮と骨のない生の鶏むね肉","edible_grams":600},{"fdc_id":169251,"fdc_description":"Mushrooms, white, raw","per_100g":{"sugar_g":1.98,"saturated_fat_g":0.05,"fiber_g":1,"fat_g":0.34,"sodium_mg":5,"protein_g":3.09,"carbs_g":3.26,"calories":22},"source_url":"https://fdc.nal.usda.gov/food-details/169251/nutrients","ingredient":"生の白マッシュルーム","edible_grams":500},{"fdc_id":170000,"fdc_description":"Onions, raw","per_100g":{"sugar_g":4.24,"fat_g":0.1,"carbs_g":9.34,"calories":40,"saturated_fat_g":0.042,"protein_g":1.1,"fiber_g":1.7,"sodium_mg":4},"source_url":"https://fdc.nal.usda.gov/food-details/170000/nutrients","ingredient":"玉ねぎ","edible_grams":150},{"fdc_id":169230,"fdc_description":"Garlic, raw","per_100g":{"carbs_g":33.1,"calories":149,"sugar_g":1,"saturated_fat_g":0.089,"fiber_g":2.1,"sodium_mg":17,"protein_g":6.36,"fat_g":0.5},"source_url":"https://fdc.nal.usda.gov/food-details/169230/nutrients","ingredient":"にんにく","edible_grams":10},{"fdc_id":171413,"fdc_description":"Oil, olive, salad or cooking","per_100g":{"fat_g":100,"carbs_g":0,"calories":884,"sodium_mg":2,"protein_g":0,"saturated_fat_g":13.8,"fiber_g":0,"sugar_g":0},"source_url":"https://fdc.nal.usda.gov/food-details/171413/nutrients","ingredient":"オリーブ油","edible_grams":20},{"fdc_id":171265,"fdc_description":"Milk, whole, 3.25% milkfat, with added vitamin D","per_100g":{"fat_g":3.25,"sugar_g":5.05,"carbs_g":4.8,"calories":61,"saturated_fat_g":1.86,"fiber_g":0,"sodium_mg":43,"protein_g":3.15},"source_url":"https://fdc.nal.usda.gov/food-details/171265/nutrients","ingredient":"殺菌済み全乳","edible_grams":700},{"fdc_id":173430,"fdc_description":"Butter, without salt","per_100g":{"sugar_g":0.06,"calories":717,"saturated_fat_g":50.5,"fat_g":81.1,"carbs_g":0.06,"protein_g":0.85,"fiber_g":0,"sodium_mg":11},"source_url":"https://fdc.nal.usda.gov/food-details/173430/nutrients","ingredient":"無塩バター","edible_grams":40},{"fdc_id":168936,"fdc_description":"Wheat flour, white, all-purpose, enriched, unbleached","per_100g":{"fiber_g":2.7,"fat_g":0.98,"carbs_g":76.3,"calories":364,"protein_g":10.3,"sodium_mg":2,"saturated_fat_g":0.155,"sugar_g":0.27},"source_url":"https://fdc.nal.usda.gov/food-details/168936/nutrients","ingredient":"一般的な小麦粉","edible_grams":40},{"fdc_id":170846,"fdc_description":"Cheese, mozzarella, whole milk, low moisture","per_100g":{"sugar_g":1.01,"sodium_mg":710,"saturated_fat_g":15.6,"fiber_g":0,"protein_g":21.6,"fat_g":24.6,"carbs_g":2.47,"calories":318},"source_url":"https://fdc.nal.usda.gov/food-details/170846/nutrients","ingredient":"低水分の全乳モッツァレラ、細切り","edible_grams":180},{"fdc_id":173468,"fdc_description":"Salt, table","per_100g":{"fiber_g":0,"sodium_mg":38800,"saturated_fat_g":0,"protein_g":0,"fat_g":0,"carbs_g":0,"calories":0,"sugar_g":0},"source_url":"https://fdc.nal.usda.gov/food-details/173468/nutrients","ingredient":"細粒の塩","edible_grams":6},{"fdc_id":170931,"fdc_description":"Spices, pepper, black","per_100g":{"fat_g":3.26,"sugar_g":0.64,"carbs_g":64,"calories":251,"protein_g":10.4,"fiber_g":25.3,"sodium_mg":20,"saturated_fat_g":1.39},"source_url":"https://fdc.nal.usda.gov/food-details/170931/nutrients","ingredient":"黒こしょう","edible_grams":0.5},{"fdc_id":171326,"fdc_description":"Spices, nutmeg, ground","per_100g":{"protein_g":5.84,"sodium_mg":16,"saturated_fat_g":25.9,"fat_g":36.3,"carbs_g":49.3,"calories":525,"sugar_g":2.99,"fiber_g":20.8},"source_url":"https://fdc.nal.usda.gov/food-details/171326/nutrients","ingredient":"粉末ナツメグ","edible_grams":0.2}]},"image_url":"/recetas/receta-de-lasana-de-pollo-con-champinones/portada.webp","gallery":[{"url":"/recetas/receta-de-lasana-de-pollo-con-champinones/portada.webp","alt":"ベシャメルと焼けたチーズを重ねた鶏肉とマッシュルームのラザニア1人分"}],"seo":{"title":"鶏肉とマッシュルームのベシャメルラザニア | Manual de Cocina","description":"6人分の白いラザニア。鶏肉、マッシュルーム、ベシャメル、モッツァレラを重ね、下ゆでと水分調整、中心74 °Cを確認。","image_alt":"ベシャメルと焼けたチーズを重ねた鶏肉とマッシュルームのラザニア1人分","image_variants":["/recetas/receta-de-lasana-de-pollo-con-champinones/portada-1x1.webp","/recetas/receta-de-lasana-de-pollo-con-champinones/portada-4x3.webp","/recetas/receta-de-lasana-de-pollo-con-champinones/portada-16x9.webp"],"faq":[{"q":"直接オーブン用のシートに替えられますか？","a":"そのままの置換はできません。下ゆでする乾燥パスタ240 gの案です。直接オーブン用はソースを吸うため、製品に合わせ水分と時間を調整する必要があります。"},{"q":"水っぽくしない方法は？","a":"鶏肉を合わせる前にマッシュルームの遊離水を飛ばし、低水分モッツァレラと、ペーストでなくスプーンを覆うベシャメルを使います。切る前に10分休ませます。"},{"q":"前日に組み立てられますか？","a":"準備と加熱を連続する案で、生の長時間保存や冷凍は未検証です。加熱後の分量を冷蔵し、3日以内に食べ、1回だけ74 °Cまで再加熱します。"}]},"published":false,"editorial_status":"draft","content_html":"<p>加熱した鶏肉の角切り、炒めたマッシュルーム、全乳のベシャメルを、下ゆでしたパスタ3層と詰め物2層に組み、低水分モッツァレラで仕上げます。歴史的URLと承認済みRecipe分類を維持します。</p><p>約20 × 30 cmの耐熱容器で6人分を提案します。準備20分、一部を並行する加熱60分、休ませる10分、合計90分の推定です。パスタの製品や大きさで組み方と加熱が変わります。分量、時間、出来上がり量は調理試験待ちで、鶏肉と中心を温度計で確認します。</p>"},{"id":"90942a2a-dd69-5244-bb86-525c8c89996e","recipe_group_id":"14f34319-2bdc-478f-b55b-909be0df6964","language":"pt","slug":"lasanha-de-frango-com-champignon","public_path":"/pt/lasanha-de-frango-com-champignon","source_url":null,"title":"Lasanha de frango com champignon e molho branco","excerpt":"Lasanha para 6 com frango, champignon, massa pré-cozida, recheio sem líquido excessivo, bechamel caseiro e muçarela gratinada.","summary":"Frango cozido em cubos, champignon refogado e bechamel de leite integral são montados com três camadas de massa pré-cozida e duas de recheio, terminando com muçarela de baixa umidade. Mantém a URL histórica e a classificação Recipe aprovada.\n\nPropõem-se 6 porções em refratário de cerca de 20 × 30 cm: preparo 20 minutos, cozimento 60 com algumas tarefas em paralelo, descanso 10, total 90. Marca e tamanho das placas podem alterar montagem e cozimento. Quantidades, tempos e rendimento são estimativas aguardando teste de cozinha; confira frango e centro com termômetro.","category":"Massas","category_slug":"pastas","difficulty":"Média","course":"Prato principal","cuisine":"Italiana, adaptação caseira","prep_time_minutes":20,"cook_time_minutes":60,"total_time_minutes":90,"servings":6,"keywords":["lasanha de frango","lasanha de champignon","bechamel caseiro","lasanha branca"],"ingredients":[{"name":"placas de lasanha secas que exigem pré-cozimento","amount":"240","unit":"g","group":"Massa"},{"name":"peito de frango cru sem pele e osso","amount":"600","unit":"g","group":"Recheio"},{"name":"champignon branco fresco","amount":"500","unit":"g","group":"Recheio"},{"name":"cebola","amount":"150","unit":"g","group":"Recheio"},{"name":"alho","amount":"10","unit":"g","group":"Recheio"},{"name":"azeite de oliva","amount":"20","unit":"g","group":"Recheio"},{"name":"leite integral pasteurizado","amount":"700","unit":"g","group":"Bechamel"},{"name":"manteiga sem sal","amount":"40","unit":"g","group":"Bechamel"},{"name":"farinha de trigo comum","amount":"40","unit":"g","group":"Bechamel"},{"name":"muçarela de leite integral de baixa umidade ralada","amount":"180","unit":"g","group":"Finalização"},{"name":"sal fino","amount":"6","unit":"g","group":"Tempero"},{"name":"pimenta-do-reino moída","amount":"0.5","unit":"g","group":"Tempero"},{"name":"noz-moscada moída","amount":"0.2","unit":"g","group":"Tempero"}],"steps":[{"title":"Prepare ingredientes e refratário","content":"Preaqueça a 190 °C com calor superior e inferior, sem ventilação, e prepare refratário de cerca de 20 × 30 cm. Limpe e fatie 500 g de champignon, pique 150 g de cebola e 10 g de alho. Em outra tábua corte 600 g de frango em cubos de cerca de 1,5 cm sem lavar. Separe utensílios crus e cozidos. Divida sal: 3 g para recheio e 3 g para bechamel; pimenta: 0,25 g para cada.","image_alt":"Ingredientes com champignon fatiado e frango cru em tábua separada","image_url":"/recetas/receta-de-lasana-de-pollo-con-champinones/paso-01.webp"},{"title":"Cozinhe e escorra as placas","content":"Cozinhe 240 g de placas em panela grande com água potável fervente sem sal adicionado, conforme embalagem, retirando cerca de 1 minuto antes se forem ao forno depois. Descarte a água, fora do cálculo. Escorra e espalhe sem sobrepor sobre pano limpo. Use placas que exigem pré-cozimento; as prontas para forno precisam de outra proporção de líquido e não são usadas aqui.","image_alt":"Placas de lasanha cozidas separadas sobre pano limpo","image_url":"/recetas/receta-de-lasana-de-pollo-con-champinones/paso-02.webp"},{"title":"Cozinhe o frango separado","content":"Aqueça 10 g de azeite em frigideira ampla. Se amontoar, faça o frango em duas levas, em fogo médio-alto por cerca de 8–10 minutos no total, mexendo. Use parte dos 3 g de sal e 0,25 g de pimenta do recheio. Confira os cubos mais grossos: pelo menos 74 °C com termômetro. Prolongue se necessário. Transfira com utensílio limpo para recipiente limpo, nunca para o prato do frango cru.","image_alt":"Cubos de frango cozinhando sozinhos na frigideira","image_url":"/recetas/receta-de-lasana-de-pollo-con-champinones/paso-03.webp"},{"title":"Refogue o champignon e misture o recheio","content":"Na mesma frigideira, adicione os outros 10 g de azeite e cebola; cozinhe 4–5 minutos. Junte alho por 30 segundos, depois champignon. Refogue 8–10 minutos, em levas se preciso, até reduzir e evaporar o líquido livre. Acrescente o restante do sal e pimenta do recheio e o frango cozido. Deve ficar úmido sem poça; reduza líquido antes de montar.","image_alt":"Champignon e cebola refogados com frango cozido","image_url":"/recetas/receta-de-lasana-de-pollo-con-champinones/paso-04.webp"},{"title":"Faça o bechamel","content":"Derreta 40 g de manteiga em panela no fogo médio-baixo. Junte 40 g de farinha e mexa 2 minutos sem dourar. Adicione 700 g de leite aos poucos, batendo para desfazer grumos. Cozinhe em fervura suave por 6–8 minutos mexendo, até cobrir a colher mas continuar espalhável. Junte os outros 3 g de sal, 0,25 g de pimenta e 0,2 g de noz-moscada. Não reduza a pasta espessa.","image_alt":"Bechamel branco fluido mexido com batedor na panela","image_url":"/recetas/receta-de-lasana-de-pollo-con-champinones/paso-05.webp"},{"title":"Monte três camadas de massa","content":"Espalhe camada fina de bechamel no fundo. Reserve cerca de um quarto do molho restante para cobertura e divida o resto em duas camadas. Divida recheio em duas partes e os 240 g originais de massa em três camadas adaptadas ao refratário, cortando se preciso. Alterne massa, metade do recheio, bechamel e 30 g de muçarela; repita com outros 30 g de muçarela. Termine com terceira camada de massa, molho reservado e os 120 g de muçarela restantes. Cubra todas as bordas da massa com molho.","image_alt":"Montagem de massa, frango, champignon e molho branco","image_url":"/recetas/receta-de-lasana-de-pollo-con-champinones/paso-06.webp"},{"title":"Asse e confira o centro","content":"Cubra frouxamente com alumínio e asse 20 minutos a 190 °C. Retire alumínio e asse mais 10–15 minutos até borbulhar e dourar sem queimar. Insira sonda limpa em vários pontos centrais, sem tocar o refratário: pelo menos 74 °C. Se abaixo, cubra se preciso e prolongue 5 minutos antes de medir novamente. Crosta dourada não substitui a conferência.","image_alt":"Lasanha gratinada em refratário","image_url":"/recetas/receta-de-lasana-de-pollo-con-champinones/paso-07.webp"},{"title":"Descanse, porcione e conserve","content":"Descanse 10 minutos em superfície resistente ao calor e corte em 6 porções; sirva com utensílios limpos. Separe sobras em recipientes rasos e refrigere a 4 °C ou menos dentro de 2 horas, ou 1 hora se o ambiente superar 32 °C. Propõe-se consumir em 3 dias e reaquecer a porção uma única vez até 74 °C no centro. Não deixe o refratário inteiro esfriar por horas na bancada.","image_alt":"Porção de lasanha branca mostrando camadas de frango e champignon","image_url":"/recetas/receta-de-lasana-de-pollo-con-champinones/paso-08.webp"}],"notes":"Contém trigo e laticínios; confira ovo e outros alérgenos nas placas. Usa massa seca para pré-cozinhar, não pronta para forno; substituições sem glúten ou leite não validadas. Cremini pode substituir champignon branco no mesmo peso, mudando sabor e nutrientes. Use frango sem salmoura e muçarela de baixa umidade, não bolas úmidas, para aproximar cálculo e evitar água. Não substitua por sobras de frango sem reformular e considerar conservação anterior. Reduza champignon antes de montar; sem creme de leite ou caldo extra. Montagem crua de véspera e congelamento não validados: prepare e asse continuamente. Nutrição usa pesos comestíveis originais divididos por 6, sem absorção ou perda exata de cozimento e sem acompanhamentos.","nutrition":{"sodium_mg":705,"sugar_g":10,"saturated_fat_g":11.4,"carbs_g":47,"calories":567.7,"fat_g":23.5,"fiber_g":2.8,"protein_g":41.6,"estimated":true,"serving_size":"1 das 6 porções propostas","source":"USDA FoodData Central — SR Legacy, April 2018 JSON","source_url":"https://fdc.nal.usda.gov/download-datasets/","method":"Treze fichas USDA verificadas por FDC ID no arquivo oficial. Pesos comestíveis originais somados e divididos por 6. Massa aproximada com Pasta, dry, enriched e queijo com Cheese, mozzarella, whole milk, low moisture. Gorduras e temperos contados integralmente. Água de cozimento sem sal descartada; sem acompanhamento.","note":"Estimativa, não análise do prato cozido. Marcas de massa e muçarela, salmoura do frango e porções reais mudam valores. Quantidades, tempos e rendimento aguardam teste de cozinha.","inputs":[{"fdc_id":169736,"fdc_description":"Pasta, dry, enriched","per_100g":{"sodium_mg":6,"sugar_g":2.67,"saturated_fat_g":0.277,"carbs_g":74.7,"calories":371,"fat_g":1.51,"fiber_g":3.2,"protein_g":13},"source_url":"https://fdc.nal.usda.gov/food-details/169736/nutrients","ingredient":"placas de lasanha secas que exigem pré-cozimento","edible_grams":240},{"fdc_id":171077,"fdc_description":"Chicken, broiler or fryers, breast, skinless, boneless, meat only, raw","per_100g":{"fat_g":2.62,"calories":120,"saturated_fat_g":0.563,"sodium_mg":45,"protein_g":22.5,"sugar_g":0,"carbs_g":0,"fiber_g":0},"source_url":"https://fdc.nal.usda.gov/food-details/171077/nutrients","ingredient":"peito de frango cru sem pele e osso","edible_grams":600},{"fdc_id":169251,"fdc_description":"Mushrooms, white, raw","per_100g":{"sugar_g":1.98,"saturated_fat_g":0.05,"fiber_g":1,"fat_g":0.34,"sodium_mg":5,"protein_g":3.09,"carbs_g":3.26,"calories":22},"source_url":"https://fdc.nal.usda.gov/food-details/169251/nutrients","ingredient":"champignon branco fresco","edible_grams":500},{"fdc_id":170000,"fdc_description":"Onions, raw","per_100g":{"sugar_g":4.24,"fat_g":0.1,"carbs_g":9.34,"calories":40,"saturated_fat_g":0.042,"protein_g":1.1,"fiber_g":1.7,"sodium_mg":4},"source_url":"https://fdc.nal.usda.gov/food-details/170000/nutrients","ingredient":"cebola","edible_grams":150},{"fdc_id":169230,"fdc_description":"Garlic, raw","per_100g":{"carbs_g":33.1,"calories":149,"sugar_g":1,"saturated_fat_g":0.089,"fiber_g":2.1,"sodium_mg":17,"protein_g":6.36,"fat_g":0.5},"source_url":"https://fdc.nal.usda.gov/food-details/169230/nutrients","ingredient":"alho","edible_grams":10},{"fdc_id":171413,"fdc_description":"Oil, olive, salad or cooking","per_100g":{"fat_g":100,"carbs_g":0,"calories":884,"sodium_mg":2,"protein_g":0,"saturated_fat_g":13.8,"fiber_g":0,"sugar_g":0},"source_url":"https://fdc.nal.usda.gov/food-details/171413/nutrients","ingredient":"azeite de oliva","edible_grams":20},{"fdc_id":171265,"fdc_description":"Milk, whole, 3.25% milkfat, with added vitamin D","per_100g":{"fat_g":3.25,"sugar_g":5.05,"carbs_g":4.8,"calories":61,"saturated_fat_g":1.86,"fiber_g":0,"sodium_mg":43,"protein_g":3.15},"source_url":"https://fdc.nal.usda.gov/food-details/171265/nutrients","ingredient":"leite integral pasteurizado","edible_grams":700},{"fdc_id":173430,"fdc_description":"Butter, without salt","per_100g":{"sugar_g":0.06,"calories":717,"saturated_fat_g":50.5,"fat_g":81.1,"carbs_g":0.06,"protein_g":0.85,"fiber_g":0,"sodium_mg":11},"source_url":"https://fdc.nal.usda.gov/food-details/173430/nutrients","ingredient":"manteiga sem sal","edible_grams":40},{"fdc_id":168936,"fdc_description":"Wheat flour, white, all-purpose, enriched, unbleached","per_100g":{"fiber_g":2.7,"fat_g":0.98,"carbs_g":76.3,"calories":364,"protein_g":10.3,"sodium_mg":2,"saturated_fat_g":0.155,"sugar_g":0.27},"source_url":"https://fdc.nal.usda.gov/food-details/168936/nutrients","ingredient":"farinha de trigo comum","edible_grams":40},{"fdc_id":170846,"fdc_description":"Cheese, mozzarella, whole milk, low moisture","per_100g":{"sugar_g":1.01,"sodium_mg":710,"saturated_fat_g":15.6,"fiber_g":0,"protein_g":21.6,"fat_g":24.6,"carbs_g":2.47,"calories":318},"source_url":"https://fdc.nal.usda.gov/food-details/170846/nutrients","ingredient":"muçarela de leite integral de baixa umidade ralada","edible_grams":180},{"fdc_id":173468,"fdc_description":"Salt, table","per_100g":{"fiber_g":0,"sodium_mg":38800,"saturated_fat_g":0,"protein_g":0,"fat_g":0,"carbs_g":0,"calories":0,"sugar_g":0},"source_url":"https://fdc.nal.usda.gov/food-details/173468/nutrients","ingredient":"sal fino","edible_grams":6},{"fdc_id":170931,"fdc_description":"Spices, pepper, black","per_100g":{"fat_g":3.26,"sugar_g":0.64,"carbs_g":64,"calories":251,"protein_g":10.4,"fiber_g":25.3,"sodium_mg":20,"saturated_fat_g":1.39},"source_url":"https://fdc.nal.usda.gov/food-details/170931/nutrients","ingredient":"pimenta-do-reino moída","edible_grams":0.5},{"fdc_id":171326,"fdc_description":"Spices, nutmeg, ground","per_100g":{"protein_g":5.84,"sodium_mg":16,"saturated_fat_g":25.9,"fat_g":36.3,"carbs_g":49.3,"calories":525,"sugar_g":2.99,"fiber_g":20.8},"source_url":"https://fdc.nal.usda.gov/food-details/171326/nutrients","ingredient":"noz-moscada moída","edible_grams":0.2}]},"image_url":"/recetas/receta-de-lasana-de-pollo-con-champinones/portada.webp","gallery":[{"url":"/recetas/receta-de-lasana-de-pollo-con-champinones/portada.webp","alt":"Porção de lasanha de frango com champignon, bechamel e queijo dourado"}],"seo":{"title":"Lasanha de frango com champignon e bechamel | Manual de Cocina","description":"Lasanha branca para 6 com frango, champignon, bechamel e muçarela. Pré-cozinhe massa, reduza recheio e confira 74 °C no centro.","image_alt":"Porção de lasanha de frango com champignon, bechamel e queijo dourado","image_variants":["/recetas/receta-de-lasana-de-pollo-con-champinones/portada-1x1.webp","/recetas/receta-de-lasana-de-pollo-con-champinones/portada-4x3.webp","/recetas/receta-de-lasana-de-pollo-con-champinones/portada-16x9.webp"],"faq":[{"q":"Posso usar placas prontas para forno?","a":"Não como troca direta. São 240 g de massa seca para pré-cozinhar. Placas prontas absorvem molho e precisam de ajuste de líquido e tempo conforme embalagem."},{"q":"Como evitar lasanha aguada?","a":"Evapore líquido livre do champignon antes de juntar frango, use muçarela de baixa umidade e bechamel que cubra a colher sem virar pasta. Descanse 10 minutos antes de cortar."},{"q":"Posso montar no dia anterior?","a":"A proposta é preparo e forno contínuos; montagem crua prolongada e congelamento não validados. Refrigere porções cozidas, consuma em 3 dias e reaqueça uma vez a 74 °C."}]},"published":false,"editorial_status":"draft","content_html":"<p>Frango cozido em cubos, champignon refogado e bechamel de leite integral são montados com três camadas de massa pré-cozida e duas de recheio, terminando com muçarela de baixa umidade. Mantém a URL histórica e a classificação Recipe aprovada.</p><p>Propõem-se 6 porções em refratário de cerca de 20 × 30 cm: preparo 20 minutos, cozimento 60 com algumas tarefas em paralelo, descanso 10, total 90. Marca e tamanho das placas podem alterar montagem e cozimento. Quantidades, tempos e rendimento são estimativas aguardando teste de cozinha; confira frango e centro com termômetro.</p>"},{"id":"2ac6ac2b-ce9e-458c-b43d-93ea541ea20c","recipe_group_id":"ceed8c90-4245-4396-9095-d1d858d397ac","language":"es","slug":"pollo-al-limon-y-miel-con-esparragos-asados","public_path":"/pollo-al-limon-y-miel-con-esparragos-asados","source_url":"https://manualdecocina.com/pollo-al-limon-y-miel-con-esparragos-asados/","title":"Pollo al limón y miel con espárragos asados","excerpt":"Pechugas con salsa de limón, miel y ajo, y espárragos asados por separado. Una propuesta para 4 con control de temperatura a 74 °C.","summary":"Pechugas doradas en sartén y terminadas en una salsa de limón, miel y ajo, con espárragos verdes asados por separado. La miel entra después de dorar el pollo, a fuego suave, para reducir el riesgo de que se queme. Se conserva la identidad y la URL histórica de esta receta.\n\nLa propuesta rinde 4 porciones, cada una con una pieza de pollo y un cuarto de los espárragos y de la salsa. Se estiman 15 minutos de preparación, 25 de cocción con tareas en paralelo y 5 de reposo: 45 en total. Cantidades, tiempos y rendimiento quedan pendientes de prueba de cocina. Comprueba 74 °C en cada pieza; el color y el tiempo no certifican la cocción.","category":"Platos principales","category_slug":"platos-principales","difficulty":"Fácil","course":"Plato principal","cuisine":"Cocina casera","prep_time_minutes":15,"cook_time_minutes":25,"total_time_minutes":45,"servings":4,"keywords":["pollo al limón","pollo con miel","espárragos asados","pechugas en salsa"],"ingredients":[{"name":"pechuga de pollo cruda sin piel ni hueso","amount":"800","unit":"g","group":"Pollo"},{"name":"espárragos verdes, peso después de recortar","amount":"600","unit":"g","group":"Guarnición"},{"name":"zumo de limón recién exprimido","amount":"40","unit":"g","group":"Salsa"},{"name":"miel","amount":"40","unit":"g","group":"Salsa"},{"name":"aceite de oliva","amount":"30","unit":"g","group":"Cocción y sazonado"},{"name":"ajo","amount":"10","unit":"g","group":"Salsa"},{"name":"sal fina","amount":"4","unit":"g","group":"Cocción y sazonado"},{"name":"pimienta negra molida","amount":"0.5","unit":"g","group":"Cocción y sazonado"},{"name":"agua potable","amount":"60","unit":"ml","group":"Salsa"}],"steps":[{"title":"Prepara el pollo y los espárragos","content":"Precalienta el horno a 210 °C con calor arriba y abajo, sin ventilador. Lava los espárragos, recorta las bases duras y pesa 600 g ya limpios; seca bien. En una tabla aparte prepara 4 piezas de pechuga que sumen 800 g, de unos 200 g cada una, con grosor uniforme de 1,5–2 cm; abre las más gruesas si hace falta. No laves el pollo crudo. Separa utensilios crudos y cocidos. Reserva 3 g de sal y 0,25 g de pimienta para el pollo, y 1 g de sal y 0,25 g de pimienta para los espárragos.","image_alt":"Espárragos limpios en una tabla y cuatro pechugas crudas en otra tabla separada","image_url":"/recetas/pollo-al-limon-y-miel-con-esparragos-asados/paso-01.webp"},{"title":"Mezcla la salsa en un recipiente limpio","content":"Mezcla los 40 g de zumo de limón, 40 g de miel, 10 g de ajo picado y 60 ml de agua potable. Remueve hasta disolver la miel. Mantén esta salsa en un recipiente limpio y evita que toque el pollo crudo; no es una marinada ni se reutilizan jugos del plato crudo.","image_alt":"Salsa de limón, miel y ajo mezclándose en un cuenco, sin contacto con pollo crudo","image_url":"/recetas/pollo-al-limon-y-miel-con-esparragos-asados/paso-02.webp"},{"title":"Asa los espárragos por separado","content":"Reparte los espárragos en una bandeja, en una sola capa, con 10 g del aceite, 1 g de sal y 0,25 g de pimienta. Hornea a 210 °C unos 12–18 minutos, girándolos al cumplir 8 minutos, hasta que estén tiernos con algo de firmeza y las puntas ligeramente doradas. El grosor modifica el tiempo. Haz esta tarea mientras cocinas el pollo; si terminan antes, mantenlos brevemente cubiertos mientras acabas la salsa. No pongas pollo crudo en esta bandeja.","image_alt":"Espárragos verdes asados en una sola capa en una bandeja sin pollo","image_url":"/recetas/pollo-al-limon-y-miel-con-esparragos-asados/paso-03.webp"},{"title":"Dora las cuatro piezas de pollo","content":"Calienta los otros 20 g de aceite en una sartén amplia a fuego medio. Sazona el pollo con los 3 g de sal y 0,25 g de pimienta reservados. Coloca las 4 piezas sin amontonarlas y dora unos 4 minutos por cada lado, aproximadamente 8 minutos en total. Ajusta el fuego para dorar sin quemar. En esta fase no añadas miel ni salsa y no des por cocinado el centro.","image_alt":"Cuatro pechugas dorándose en una sartén amplia sin salsa ni espárragos","image_url":"/recetas/pollo-al-limon-y-miel-con-esparragos-asados/paso-04.webp"},{"title":"Termina con la salsa y comprueba la temperatura","content":"Baja el fuego, añade toda la salsa limpia del paso 2 y cocina a hervor suave unos 6–8 minutos, girando el pollo para cubrirlo. Si espesa demasiado pronto, baja más el fuego y tapa brevemente; no dejes que el azúcar oscurezca o se queme. Mide cada pieza con una sonda limpia en el centro más grueso, sin tocar la sartén: debe alcanzar al menos 74 °C. Si no llega, prolonga la cocción a fuego suave y vuelve a medir. La salsa debe quedar fluida y ligeramente brillante, no como un caramelo espeso.","image_alt":"Pechugas cocinadas cubiertas de salsa ligera de limón y miel en la sartén","image_url":"/recetas/pollo-al-limon-y-miel-con-esparragos-asados/paso-05.webp"},{"title":"Reposa, sirve y conserva con seguridad","content":"Retira el pollo a una fuente limpia y reposa 5 minutos. Divide en 4 porciones y reparte los espárragos y toda la salsa; usa utensilios limpios. Para guardar, distribuye las sobras en recipientes bajos y refrigera a 4 °C o menos dentro de 2 horas, o 1 hora si el ambiente supera 32 °C. Se propone consumirlas en 3 días y recalentar la porción una sola vez hasta 74 °C en el centro. No dejes pollo cocinado en el plato que contuvo el crudo.","image_alt":"Una pechuga con salsa de limón y miel junto a espárragos asados en un plato","image_url":"/recetas/pollo-al-limon-y-miel-con-esparragos-asados/paso-06.webp"}],"notes":"La miel no es adecuada para menores de 12 meses. Revisa alérgenos en productos envasados y usa pollo sin salmuera añadida para aproximarte al cálculo. No se incluye mostaza, salsa de soja, mantequilla, caldo ni guarniciones extra. Puedes usar espárragos blancos al mismo peso, ajustando pelado y cocción; el resultado y la nutrición cambian. No sustituyas la miel por edulcorantes como cambio equivalente: su textura, sabor y reducción son distintos. El zumo es la parte comestible contada, no se añaden rodajas de limón ni hierbas al plato. Los espárragos se pesan después de quitar las bases duras. La nutrición cuenta toda la salsa y el aceite repartidos entre 4; si queda parte en la sartén, la ingesta real puede ser menor. No se ha validado aquí la congelación ni el uso de sobras previas.","nutrition":{"fat_g":13,"calories":372.9,"saturated_fat_g":2.2,"sodium_mg":482,"protein_g":48.5,"sugar_g":11.3,"carbs_g":15.7,"fiber_g":3.3,"estimated":true,"serving_size":"1 de 4 porciones propuestas","source":"USDA FoodData Central — SR Legacy, abril de 2018","source_url":"https://fdc.nal.usda.gov/download-datasets/","method":"Ocho fichas USDA verificadas por FDC ID en el archivo oficial. Pesos comestibles crudos sumados y divididos entre 4; se cuentan toda la salsa, el aceite y el sazonado. Los 60 ml de agua potable no aportan energía y se excluyen de los ocho inputs. No se calculan pérdidas de nutrientes ni reparto exacto después de cocinar.","note":"Estimación, no análisis del plato cocinado. La salmuera del pollo, el tipo de miel, las pérdidas y el reparto real alteran las cifras; cantidades, tiempos y rendimiento pendientes de prueba de cocina.","inputs":[{"fdc_id":171077,"fdc_description":"Chicken, broiler or fryers, breast, skinless, boneless, meat only, raw","per_100g":{"fat_g":2.62,"calories":120,"saturated_fat_g":0.563,"sodium_mg":45,"protein_g":22.5,"sugar_g":0,"carbs_g":0,"fiber_g":0},"source_url":"https://fdc.nal.usda.gov/food-details/171077/nutrients","ingredient":"pechuga de pollo cruda","edible_grams":800},{"fdc_id":168389,"fdc_description":"Asparagus, raw","per_100g":{"saturated_fat_g":0.04,"protein_g":2.2,"sugar_g":1.88,"sodium_mg":2,"carbs_g":3.88,"calories":20,"fiber_g":2.1,"fat_g":0.12},"source_url":"https://fdc.nal.usda.gov/food-details/168389/nutrients","ingredient":"espárragos crudos recortados","edible_grams":600},{"fdc_id":167747,"fdc_description":"Lemon juice, raw","per_100g":{"protein_g":0.35,"saturated_fat_g":0.04,"fiber_g":0.3,"sodium_mg":1,"sugar_g":2.52,"fat_g":0.24,"carbs_g":6.9,"calories":22},"source_url":"https://fdc.nal.usda.gov/food-details/167747/nutrients","ingredient":"zumo de limón","edible_grams":40},{"fdc_id":169640,"fdc_description":"Honey","per_100g":{"saturated_fat_g":0,"protein_g":0.3,"fiber_g":0.2,"sodium_mg":4,"fat_g":0,"carbs_g":82.4,"calories":304,"sugar_g":82.1},"source_url":"https://fdc.nal.usda.gov/food-details/169640/nutrients","ingredient":"miel","edible_grams":40},{"fdc_id":171413,"fdc_description":"Oil, olive, salad or cooking","per_100g":{"fat_g":100,"carbs_g":0,"calories":884,"sodium_mg":2,"protein_g":0,"saturated_fat_g":13.8,"fiber_g":0,"sugar_g":0},"source_url":"https://fdc.nal.usda.gov/food-details/171413/nutrients","ingredient":"aceite de oliva","edible_grams":30},{"fdc_id":169230,"fdc_description":"Garlic, raw","per_100g":{"carbs_g":33.1,"calories":149,"sugar_g":1,"saturated_fat_g":0.089,"fiber_g":2.1,"sodium_mg":17,"protein_g":6.36,"fat_g":0.5},"source_url":"https://fdc.nal.usda.gov/food-details/169230/nutrients","ingredient":"ajo","edible_grams":10},{"fdc_id":173468,"fdc_description":"Salt, table","per_100g":{"fiber_g":0,"sodium_mg":38800,"saturated_fat_g":0,"protein_g":0,"fat_g":0,"carbs_g":0,"calories":0,"sugar_g":0},"source_url":"https://fdc.nal.usda.gov/food-details/173468/nutrients","ingredient":"sal","edible_grams":4},{"fdc_id":170931,"fdc_description":"Spices, pepper, black","per_100g":{"fat_g":3.26,"sugar_g":0.64,"carbs_g":64,"calories":251,"protein_g":10.4,"fiber_g":25.3,"sodium_mg":20,"saturated_fat_g":1.39},"source_url":"https://fdc.nal.usda.gov/food-details/170931/nutrients","ingredient":"pimienta negra","edible_grams":0.5}]},"image_url":"/recetas/pollo-al-limon-y-miel-con-esparragos-asados/portada.webp","gallery":[{"url":"/recetas/pollo-al-limon-y-miel-con-esparragos-asados/portada.webp","alt":"Una pechuga con salsa de limón y miel junto a espárragos asados en un plato"}],"seo":{"title":"Pollo al limón y miel con espárragos | Manual de Cocina","description":"Pollo con salsa de limón, miel y ajo para 4, junto a espárragos asados. Dora primero, añade la salsa después y comprueba 74 °C en cada pieza.","image_alt":"Una pechuga con salsa de limón y miel junto a espárragos asados en un plato","image_variants":["/recetas/pollo-al-limon-y-miel-con-esparragos-asados/portada-1x1.webp","/recetas/pollo-al-limon-y-miel-con-esparragos-asados/portada-4x3.webp","/recetas/pollo-al-limon-y-miel-con-esparragos-asados/portada-16x9.webp"],"faq":[{"q":"¿Cómo evito que la miel se queme?","a":"Dora el pollo sin miel y añade la salsa al bajar el fuego. Mantén un hervor suave y tapa brevemente si reduce antes de que el pollo alcance 74 °C. No busques una salsa oscura y espesa."},{"q":"¿Puedo asar los espárragos junto al pollo crudo?","a":"Esta ficha los cocina por separado. Los espárragos tienen otro tiempo y no deben recibir jugos crudos de pollo si van a retirarse antes. Usa una bandeja limpia para la guarnición."},{"q":"¿Cómo guardo y recaliento las sobras?","a":"Refrigera en recipientes bajos dentro de 2 horas, o 1 hora por encima de 32 °C, a 4 °C o menos. Se propone consumir en 3 días y recalentar una vez hasta 74 °C en el centro."}]},"published":false,"editorial_status":"draft","content_html":"<p>Pechugas doradas en sartén y terminadas en una salsa de limón, miel y ajo, con espárragos verdes asados por separado. La miel entra después de dorar el pollo, a fuego suave, para reducir el riesgo de que se queme. Se conserva la identidad y la URL histórica de esta receta.</p><p>La propuesta rinde 4 porciones, cada una con una pieza de pollo y un cuarto de los espárragos y de la salsa. Se estiman 15 minutos de preparación, 25 de cocción con tareas en paralelo y 5 de reposo: 45 en total. Cantidades, tiempos y rendimiento quedan pendientes de prueba de cocina. Comprueba 74 °C en cada pieza; el color y el tiempo no certifican la cocción.</p>"},{"id":"b631ebf6-8c4c-533e-9d72-3b505e5f6cb5","recipe_group_id":"ceed8c90-4245-4396-9095-d1d858d397ac","language":"de","slug":"kostliches-zitronen-honig-hahnchen-rezept-mit-gerostetem-spargel-2","public_path":"/de/kostliches-zitronen-honig-hahnchen-rezept-mit-gerostetem-spargel-2","source_url":null,"title":"Zitronen-Honig-Hähnchen mit geröstetem Spargel","excerpt":"Hähnchenbrust mit Zitronen-Honig-Knoblauch-Sauce und separat geröstetem Spargel. Rezeptvorschlag für 4 mit Temperaturkontrolle bei 74°C.","summary":"Hähnchenbrüste werden in der Pfanne angebraten und anschließend in Zitronen-Honig-Knoblauch-Sauce fertig gegart. Grüner Spargel wird separat geröstet. Honig kommt erst nach dem Anbraten bei milder Hitze hinzu, damit er weniger leicht verbrennt. Die historische Identität und URL bleiben erhalten.\n\nVorgeschlagen sind 4 Portionen mit je einem Stück Hähnchen und einem Viertel von Spargel und Sauce. Geschätzt werden 15 Minuten Vorbereitung,25 Minuten teilweise paralleles Garen und 5 Minuten Ruhezeit: insgesamt 45 Minuten. Mengen, Zeiten und Ausbeute sind noch nicht in der Küche erprobt. Jedes Stück muss 74°C erreichen; Farbe und Zeit beweisen keine sichere Garung.","category":"Hauptgerichte","category_slug":"platos-principales","difficulty":"Einfach","course":"Hauptgericht","cuisine":"Hausmannskost","prep_time_minutes":15,"cook_time_minutes":25,"total_time_minutes":45,"servings":4,"keywords":["Zitronenhähnchen","Honighähnchen","gerösteter Spargel","Hähnchenbrust in Sauce"],"ingredients":[{"name":"rohe Hähnchenbrust ohne Haut und Knochen","amount":"800","unit":"g","group":"Hähnchen"},{"name":"grüner Spargel, nach dem Putzen gewogen","amount":"600","unit":"g","group":"Beilage"},{"name":"frisch gepresster Zitronensaft","amount":"40","unit":"g","group":"Sauce"},{"name":"Honig","amount":"40","unit":"g","group":"Sauce"},{"name":"Olivenöl","amount":"30","unit":"g","group":"Garen und Würzen"},{"name":"Knoblauch","amount":"10","unit":"g","group":"Sauce"},{"name":"feines Salz","amount":"4","unit":"g","group":"Garen und Würzen"},{"name":"gemahlener schwarzer Pfeffer","amount":"0.5","unit":"g","group":"Garen und Würzen"},{"name":"Trinkwasser","amount":"60","unit":"ml","group":"Sauce"}],"steps":[{"title":"Hähnchen und Spargel vorbereiten","content":"Backofen auf 210°C Ober-/Unterhitze ohne Umluft vorheizen. Spargel waschen, harte Enden abschneiden und 600 g geputzten Spargel abwiegen; gut trocknen. Auf einem separaten Brett 4 Hähnchenbruststücke mit zusammen 800 g, je etwa 200 g und gleichmäßiger Dicke von 1,5–2 cm vorbereiten; dickere Stücke bei Bedarf aufklappen. Rohes Hähnchen nicht waschen. Geräte für rohe und gegarte Lebensmittel trennen.3 g Salz und 0,25 g Pfeffer fürs Hähnchen sowie 1 g Salz und 0,25 g Pfeffer für den Spargel bereitstellen.","image_alt":"Geputzter Spargel auf einem Brett und vier rohe Hähnchenbrüste auf einem separaten Brett","image_url":"/recetas/pollo-al-limon-y-miel-con-esparragos-asados/paso-01.webp"},{"title":"Sauce in einem sauberen Gefäß mischen","content":"40 g Zitronensaft,40 g Honig,10 g gehackten Knoblauch und 60 ml Trinkwasser verrühren, bis der Honig gelöst ist. Sauce in einem sauberen Gefäß halten und Kontakt mit rohem Hähnchen vermeiden. Sie ist keine Marinade; Saft vom Teller mit rohem Fleisch wird nicht verwendet.","image_alt":"Zitronen-Honig-Knoblauch-Sauce wird ohne Kontakt mit rohem Hähnchen in einer Schüssel verrührt","image_url":"/recetas/pollo-al-limon-y-miel-con-esparragos-asados/paso-02.webp"},{"title":"Spargel separat rösten","content":"Spargel in einer Lage auf einem Blech mit 10 g vom Öl,1 g Salz und 0,25 g Pfeffer verteilen. Bei 210°C etwa 12–18 Minuten rösten und nach 8 Minuten wenden, bis er bissfest mit leicht gebräunten Spitzen ist. Die Dicke beeinflusst die Zeit. Parallel zum Hähnchen garen; ist der Spargel früher fertig, kurz abgedeckt halten, während die Sauce fertig wird. Kein rohes Hähnchen auf dieses Blech legen.","image_alt":"Grüner gerösteter Spargel in einer Lage auf einem Blech ohne Hähnchen","image_url":"/recetas/pollo-al-limon-y-miel-con-esparragos-asados/paso-03.webp"},{"title":"Vier Hähnchenstücke anbraten","content":"Die übrigen 20 g Öl in einer großen Pfanne bei mittlerer Hitze erwärmen. Hähnchen mit den bereitgestellten 3 g Salz und 0,25 g Pfeffer würzen. Die 4 Stücke ohne Gedränge einlegen und ungefähr 4 Minuten je Seite, insgesamt etwa 8 Minuten, anbraten. Hitze so regeln, dass sie bräunen, ohne zu verbrennen. Noch keinen Honig und keine Sauce zugeben; die Mitte ist nicht automatisch gar.","image_alt":"Vier Hähnchenbrüste bräunen in einer großen Pfanne ohne Sauce und Spargel","image_url":"/recetas/pollo-al-limon-y-miel-con-esparragos-asados/paso-04.webp"},{"title":"In der Sauce fertig garen und Temperatur prüfen","content":"Hitze reduzieren, die gesamte saubere Sauce aus Schritt 2 zugeben und etwa 6–8 Minuten sanft köcheln, dabei das Hähnchen wenden. Dickt sie zu früh ein, Hitze weiter reduzieren und kurz abdecken; Zucker nicht dunkel werden oder verbrennen lassen. Jedes Stück mit sauberer Sonde in der dicksten Mitte messen, ohne die Pfanne zu berühren: mindestens 74°C sind nötig. Bei niedrigerer Temperatur sanft weitergaren und erneut messen. Sauce soll flüssig und leicht glänzend bleiben, nicht wie dicker Karamell.","image_alt":"Gegarte Hähnchenbrüste mit leichter Zitronen-Honig-Sauce in der Pfanne","image_url":"/recetas/pollo-al-limon-y-miel-con-esparragos-asados/paso-05.webp"},{"title":"Ruhen lassen, servieren und sicher aufbewahren","content":"Hähnchen auf eine saubere Platte geben und 5 Minuten ruhen lassen. In 4 Portionen aufteilen, Spargel und gesamte Sauce verteilen und saubere Geräte verwenden. Reste in flache Behälter geben und bei 4°C oder kälter innerhalb von 2 Stunden kühlen, beziehungsweise 1 Stunde bei Umgebungstemperatur über 32°C. Vorgeschlagen wird Verbrauch innerhalb von 3 Tagen; die Portion nur einmal auf 74°C im Kern erhitzen. Gegartes Hähnchen nicht auf den Teller legen, auf dem es roh lag.","image_alt":"Eine Hähnchenbrust mit Zitronen-Honig-Sauce neben geröstetem Spargel auf einem Teller","image_url":"/recetas/pollo-al-limon-y-miel-con-esparragos-asados/paso-06.webp"}],"notes":"Honig eignet sich nicht für Kinder unter 12 Monaten. Allergene verpackter Produkte prüfen und Hähnchen ohne zugesetzte Salzlake verwenden, um die Berechnung anzunähern. Senf, Sojasauce, Butter, Brühe und weitere Beilagen sind nicht enthalten. Weißer Spargel kann bei gleichem Gewicht verwendet werden; Schälen und Garzeit anpassen, Ergebnis und Nährwerte ändern sich. Süßungsmittel sind kein gleichwertiger Ersatz für Honig: Konsistenz, Geschmack und Reduktion unterscheiden sich. Berechnet wird der Saft als essbarer Anteil; Zitronenscheiben und Kräuter kommen nicht ins Gericht. Spargel nach Entfernen harter Enden wiegen. Nährwerte zählen die gesamte Sauce und das Öl, geteilt durch 4; bleibt etwas in der Pfanne, kann die tatsächliche Aufnahme geringer sein. Einfrieren und Verwendung älterer Reste sind hier nicht geprüft.","nutrition":{"fat_g":13,"calories":372.9,"saturated_fat_g":2.2,"sodium_mg":482,"protein_g":48.5,"sugar_g":11.3,"carbs_g":15.7,"fiber_g":3.3,"estimated":true,"serving_size":"1 von 4 vorgeschlagenen Portionen","source":"USDA FoodData Central — SR Legacy, abril de 2018","source_url":"https://fdc.nal.usda.gov/download-datasets/","method":"Acht USDA-Datensätze anhand der FDC-ID im offiziellen Archiv geprüft. Rohe essbare Gewichte addiert und durch 4 geteilt; gesamte Sauce, Öl und Würzung gezählt.60 ml Trinkwasser liefern keine Energie und sind nicht Teil der acht Inputs. Nährstoffverluste und exakte Verteilung nach dem Garen werden nicht berechnet.","note":"Schätzung, keine Analyse des gegarten Gerichts. Salzlake im Fleisch, Honigsorte, Verluste und tatsächliche Portionen verändern die Werte; Mengen, Zeiten und Ausbeute sind noch nicht in der Küche geprüft.","inputs":[{"fdc_id":171077,"fdc_description":"Chicken, broiler or fryers, breast, skinless, boneless, meat only, raw","per_100g":{"fat_g":2.62,"calories":120,"saturated_fat_g":0.563,"sodium_mg":45,"protein_g":22.5,"sugar_g":0,"carbs_g":0,"fiber_g":0},"source_url":"https://fdc.nal.usda.gov/food-details/171077/nutrients","ingredient":"rohe Hähnchenbrust ohne Haut und Knochen","edible_grams":800},{"fdc_id":168389,"fdc_description":"Asparagus, raw","per_100g":{"saturated_fat_g":0.04,"protein_g":2.2,"sugar_g":1.88,"sodium_mg":2,"carbs_g":3.88,"calories":20,"fiber_g":2.1,"fat_g":0.12},"source_url":"https://fdc.nal.usda.gov/food-details/168389/nutrients","ingredient":"grüner Spargel, nach dem Putzen gewogen","edible_grams":600},{"fdc_id":167747,"fdc_description":"Lemon juice, raw","per_100g":{"protein_g":0.35,"saturated_fat_g":0.04,"fiber_g":0.3,"sodium_mg":1,"sugar_g":2.52,"fat_g":0.24,"carbs_g":6.9,"calories":22},"source_url":"https://fdc.nal.usda.gov/food-details/167747/nutrients","ingredient":"frisch gepresster Zitronensaft","edible_grams":40},{"fdc_id":169640,"fdc_description":"Honey","per_100g":{"saturated_fat_g":0,"protein_g":0.3,"fiber_g":0.2,"sodium_mg":4,"fat_g":0,"carbs_g":82.4,"calories":304,"sugar_g":82.1},"source_url":"https://fdc.nal.usda.gov/food-details/169640/nutrients","ingredient":"Honig","edible_grams":40},{"fdc_id":171413,"fdc_description":"Oil, olive, salad or cooking","per_100g":{"fat_g":100,"carbs_g":0,"calories":884,"sodium_mg":2,"protein_g":0,"saturated_fat_g":13.8,"fiber_g":0,"sugar_g":0},"source_url":"https://fdc.nal.usda.gov/food-details/171413/nutrients","ingredient":"Olivenöl","edible_grams":30},{"fdc_id":169230,"fdc_description":"Garlic, raw","per_100g":{"carbs_g":33.1,"calories":149,"sugar_g":1,"saturated_fat_g":0.089,"fiber_g":2.1,"sodium_mg":17,"protein_g":6.36,"fat_g":0.5},"source_url":"https://fdc.nal.usda.gov/food-details/169230/nutrients","ingredient":"Knoblauch","edible_grams":10},{"fdc_id":173468,"fdc_description":"Salt, table","per_100g":{"fiber_g":0,"sodium_mg":38800,"saturated_fat_g":0,"protein_g":0,"fat_g":0,"carbs_g":0,"calories":0,"sugar_g":0},"source_url":"https://fdc.nal.usda.gov/food-details/173468/nutrients","ingredient":"feines Salz","edible_grams":4},{"fdc_id":170931,"fdc_description":"Spices, pepper, black","per_100g":{"fat_g":3.26,"sugar_g":0.64,"carbs_g":64,"calories":251,"protein_g":10.4,"fiber_g":25.3,"sodium_mg":20,"saturated_fat_g":1.39},"source_url":"https://fdc.nal.usda.gov/food-details/170931/nutrients","ingredient":"gemahlener schwarzer Pfeffer","edible_grams":0.5}]},"image_url":"/recetas/pollo-al-limon-y-miel-con-esparragos-asados/portada.webp","gallery":[{"url":"/recetas/pollo-al-limon-y-miel-con-esparragos-asados/portada.webp","alt":"Hähnchenbrust mit Zitronen-Honig-Sauce und geröstetem Spargel"}],"seo":{"title":"Zitronen-Honig-Hähnchen mit Spargel | Manual de Cocina","description":"Hähnchen in Zitronen-Honig-Knoblauch-Sauce für 4 mit geröstetem Spargel. Erst anbraten, dann Sauce zugeben und jedes Stück auf 74°C prüfen.","image_alt":"Hähnchenbrust mit Zitronen-Honig-Sauce und geröstetem Spargel","image_variants":["/recetas/pollo-al-limon-y-miel-con-esparragos-asados/portada-1x1.webp","/recetas/pollo-al-limon-y-miel-con-esparragos-asados/portada-4x3.webp","/recetas/pollo-al-limon-y-miel-con-esparragos-asados/portada-16x9.webp"],"faq":[{"q":"Wie verhindere ich, dass Honig verbrennt?","a":"Hähnchen ohne Honig anbraten und Sauce nach Reduzieren der Hitze zugeben. Sanft köcheln und kurz abdecken, wenn die Sauce einkocht, bevor das Fleisch 74°C erreicht. Keine dunkle, dicke Sauce anstreben."},{"q":"Darf Spargel mit rohem Hähnchen rösten?","a":"Hier wird beides getrennt gegart. Spargel braucht eine andere Zeit und darf keine rohen Hähnchensäfte erhalten, wenn er früher herausgenommen wird. Ein sauberes Blech für die Beilage verwenden."},{"q":"Wie bewahre ich Reste auf und wärme sie auf?","a":"In flachen Behältern innerhalb von 2 Stunden kühlen, bei mehr als 32°C innerhalb von 1 Stunde, auf 4°C oder kälter. Vorgeschlagen sind 3 Tage Verbrauchsfrist und einmaliges Erhitzen auf 74°C im Kern."}]},"published":false,"editorial_status":"draft","content_html":"<p>Hähnchenbrüste werden in der Pfanne angebraten und anschließend in Zitronen-Honig-Knoblauch-Sauce fertig gegart. Grüner Spargel wird separat geröstet. Honig kommt erst nach dem Anbraten bei milder Hitze hinzu, damit er weniger leicht verbrennt. Die historische Identität und URL bleiben erhalten.</p><p>Vorgeschlagen sind 4 Portionen mit je einem Stück Hähnchen und einem Viertel von Spargel und Sauce. Geschätzt werden 15 Minuten Vorbereitung,25 Minuten teilweise paralleles Garen und 5 Minuten Ruhezeit: insgesamt 45 Minuten. Mengen, Zeiten und Ausbeute sind noch nicht in der Küche erprobt. Jedes Stück muss 74°C erreichen; Farbe und Zeit beweisen keine sichere Garung.</p>"},{"id":"32dbe096-a5e6-5993-9319-95287ada4d49","recipe_group_id":"ceed8c90-4245-4396-9095-d1d858d397ac","language":"en","slug":"delicious-lemon-and-honey-chicken-recipe-with-roasted-asparagus-2","public_path":"/en/delicious-lemon-and-honey-chicken-recipe-with-roasted-asparagus-2","source_url":null,"title":"Lemon and honey chicken with roasted asparagus","excerpt":"Chicken breasts with lemon, honey and garlic sauce and separately roasted asparagus. A proposed recipe for 4, with a 74°C temperature check.","summary":"Chicken breasts are browned in a skillet, then finished in a lemon, honey and garlic sauce, with green asparagus roasted separately. Honey is added after browning, over gentle heat, to reduce the risk of burning. The recipe preserves its historical identity and URL.\n\nThe proposal makes 4 servings, each with one chicken piece and a quarter of the asparagus and sauce. Allow an estimated 15 minutes preparation,25 cooking with parallel tasks and 5 resting:45 in total. Quantities, times and yield await kitchen testing. Check 74°C in every piece; colour and time do not certify doneness.","category":"Main dishes","category_slug":"platos-principales","difficulty":"Easy","course":"Main course","cuisine":"Home cooking","prep_time_minutes":15,"cook_time_minutes":25,"total_time_minutes":45,"servings":4,"keywords":["lemon chicken","honey chicken","roasted asparagus","chicken breasts in sauce"],"ingredients":[{"name":"raw boneless skinless chicken breast","amount":"800","unit":"g","group":"Chicken"},{"name":"green asparagus, weighed after trimming","amount":"600","unit":"g","group":"Side dish"},{"name":"freshly squeezed lemon juice","amount":"40","unit":"g","group":"Sauce"},{"name":"honey","amount":"40","unit":"g","group":"Sauce"},{"name":"olive oil","amount":"30","unit":"g","group":"Cooking and seasoning"},{"name":"garlic","amount":"10","unit":"g","group":"Sauce"},{"name":"fine salt","amount":"4","unit":"g","group":"Cooking and seasoning"},{"name":"ground black pepper","amount":"0.5","unit":"g","group":"Cooking and seasoning"},{"name":"drinking water","amount":"60","unit":"ml","group":"Sauce"}],"steps":[{"title":"Prepare the chicken and asparagus","content":"Preheat a conventional oven to 210°C, without fan. Wash the asparagus, trim woody bases and weigh 600 g after trimming; dry well. On a separate board prepare 4 chicken breast pieces totalling 800 g, about 200 g each, with an even thickness of 1.5–2 cm; butterfly thicker pieces if needed. Do not wash raw chicken. Keep raw and cooked utensils separate. Reserve 3 g salt and 0.25 g pepper for chicken, and 1 g salt and 0.25 g pepper for asparagus.","image_alt":"Clean asparagus on one board and four raw chicken breasts on another separate board","image_url":"/recetas/pollo-al-limon-y-miel-con-esparragos-asados/paso-01.webp"},{"title":"Mix the sauce in a clean bowl","content":"Combine 40 g lemon juice,40 g honey,10 g chopped garlic and 60 ml drinking water. Stir until the honey dissolves. Keep this sauce in a clean bowl and prevent contact with raw chicken; it is not a marinade and juices from the raw-chicken plate are not reused.","image_alt":"Lemon, honey and garlic sauce being mixed in a bowl without contact with raw chicken","image_url":"/recetas/pollo-al-limon-y-miel-con-esparragos-asados/paso-02.webp"},{"title":"Roast the asparagus separately","content":"Spread asparagus in a single layer on a tray with 10 g of the oil,1 g salt and 0.25 g pepper. Roast at 210°C for about 12–18 minutes, turning after 8 minutes, until tender with some bite and lightly browned tips. Thickness changes the timing. Do this while cooking chicken; if finished first, keep briefly covered while finishing the sauce. Do not put raw chicken on this tray.","image_alt":"Roasted green asparagus in a single layer on a tray without chicken","image_url":"/recetas/pollo-al-limon-y-miel-con-esparragos-asados/paso-03.webp"},{"title":"Brown the four chicken pieces","content":"Heat the remaining 20 g oil in a wide skillet over medium heat. Season chicken with the reserved 3 g salt and 0.25 g pepper. Place the 4 pieces without crowding and brown for about 4 minutes per side, approximately 8 minutes total. Adjust heat to brown without burning. Do not add honey or sauce yet, and do not assume the centre is cooked.","image_alt":"Four chicken breasts browning in a wide skillet without sauce or asparagus","image_url":"/recetas/pollo-al-limon-y-miel-con-esparragos-asados/paso-04.webp"},{"title":"Finish with sauce and check temperature","content":"Lower the heat, add all the clean sauce from step 2 and simmer gently for about 6–8 minutes, turning chicken to coat. If it thickens too early, lower heat further and cover briefly; do not let sugar darken or burn. Check each piece with a clean probe in the thickest centre, without touching the skillet: it must reach at least 74°C. If lower, continue cooking gently and measure again. Sauce should be fluid and lightly glossy, not thick caramel.","image_alt":"Cooked chicken breasts coated with light lemon and honey sauce in a skillet","image_url":"/recetas/pollo-al-limon-y-miel-con-esparragos-asados/paso-05.webp"},{"title":"Rest, serve and store safely","content":"Transfer chicken to a clean dish and rest 5 minutes. Divide into 4 servings and distribute asparagus and all the sauce; use clean utensils. For storage, put leftovers in shallow containers and refrigerate at 4°C or below within 2 hours, or 1 hour if ambient temperature exceeds 32°C. The proposal is to consume within 3 days and reheat each portion only once to 74°C at its centre. Do not put cooked chicken on the plate that held it raw.","image_alt":"One chicken breast with lemon and honey sauce beside roasted asparagus on a plate","image_url":"/recetas/pollo-al-limon-y-miel-con-esparragos-asados/paso-06.webp"}],"notes":"Honey is unsuitable for children under 12 months. Check packaged-product allergens and use chicken without added brine to approximate the calculation. No mustard, soy sauce, butter, stock or extra sides are included. White asparagus can replace green at the same weight, with peeling and cooking adjusted; results and nutrients change. Sweeteners are not equivalent substitutes for honey: texture, taste and reduction differ. Juice is the edible part counted; lemon slices and herbs are not added to the dish. Weigh asparagus after removing woody bases. Nutrition counts all sauce and oil shared between 4; if some remains in the skillet, actual intake may be lower. Freezing and use of previous leftovers have not been validated here.","nutrition":{"fat_g":13,"calories":372.9,"saturated_fat_g":2.2,"sodium_mg":482,"protein_g":48.5,"sugar_g":11.3,"carbs_g":15.7,"fiber_g":3.3,"estimated":true,"serving_size":"1 of 4 proposed servings","source":"USDA FoodData Central — SR Legacy, abril de 2018","source_url":"https://fdc.nal.usda.gov/download-datasets/","method":"Eight USDA records verified by FDC ID in the official archive. Raw edible weights summed and divided by 4; all sauce, oil and seasoning are counted. The 60 ml drinking water contributes no energy and is excluded from the eight inputs. Nutrient losses and exact distribution after cooking are not calculated.","note":"Estimate, not an analysis of the cooked dish. Chicken brine, honey type, losses and actual portions alter the figures; quantities, times and yield await kitchen testing.","inputs":[{"fdc_id":171077,"fdc_description":"Chicken, broiler or fryers, breast, skinless, boneless, meat only, raw","per_100g":{"fat_g":2.62,"calories":120,"saturated_fat_g":0.563,"sodium_mg":45,"protein_g":22.5,"sugar_g":0,"carbs_g":0,"fiber_g":0},"source_url":"https://fdc.nal.usda.gov/food-details/171077/nutrients","ingredient":"raw boneless skinless chicken breast","edible_grams":800},{"fdc_id":168389,"fdc_description":"Asparagus, raw","per_100g":{"saturated_fat_g":0.04,"protein_g":2.2,"sugar_g":1.88,"sodium_mg":2,"carbs_g":3.88,"calories":20,"fiber_g":2.1,"fat_g":0.12},"source_url":"https://fdc.nal.usda.gov/food-details/168389/nutrients","ingredient":"green asparagus, weighed after trimming","edible_grams":600},{"fdc_id":167747,"fdc_description":"Lemon juice, raw","per_100g":{"protein_g":0.35,"saturated_fat_g":0.04,"fiber_g":0.3,"sodium_mg":1,"sugar_g":2.52,"fat_g":0.24,"carbs_g":6.9,"calories":22},"source_url":"https://fdc.nal.usda.gov/food-details/167747/nutrients","ingredient":"freshly squeezed lemon juice","edible_grams":40},{"fdc_id":169640,"fdc_description":"Honey","per_100g":{"saturated_fat_g":0,"protein_g":0.3,"fiber_g":0.2,"sodium_mg":4,"fat_g":0,"carbs_g":82.4,"calories":304,"sugar_g":82.1},"source_url":"https://fdc.nal.usda.gov/food-details/169640/nutrients","ingredient":"honey","edible_grams":40},{"fdc_id":171413,"fdc_description":"Oil, olive, salad or cooking","per_100g":{"fat_g":100,"carbs_g":0,"calories":884,"sodium_mg":2,"protein_g":0,"saturated_fat_g":13.8,"fiber_g":0,"sugar_g":0},"source_url":"https://fdc.nal.usda.gov/food-details/171413/nutrients","ingredient":"olive oil","edible_grams":30},{"fdc_id":169230,"fdc_description":"Garlic, raw","per_100g":{"carbs_g":33.1,"calories":149,"sugar_g":1,"saturated_fat_g":0.089,"fiber_g":2.1,"sodium_mg":17,"protein_g":6.36,"fat_g":0.5},"source_url":"https://fdc.nal.usda.gov/food-details/169230/nutrients","ingredient":"garlic","edible_grams":10},{"fdc_id":173468,"fdc_description":"Salt, table","per_100g":{"fiber_g":0,"sodium_mg":38800,"saturated_fat_g":0,"protein_g":0,"fat_g":0,"carbs_g":0,"calories":0,"sugar_g":0},"source_url":"https://fdc.nal.usda.gov/food-details/173468/nutrients","ingredient":"fine salt","edible_grams":4},{"fdc_id":170931,"fdc_description":"Spices, pepper, black","per_100g":{"fat_g":3.26,"sugar_g":0.64,"carbs_g":64,"calories":251,"protein_g":10.4,"fiber_g":25.3,"sodium_mg":20,"saturated_fat_g":1.39},"source_url":"https://fdc.nal.usda.gov/food-details/170931/nutrients","ingredient":"ground black pepper","edible_grams":0.5}]},"image_url":"/recetas/pollo-al-limon-y-miel-con-esparragos-asados/portada.webp","gallery":[{"url":"/recetas/pollo-al-limon-y-miel-con-esparragos-asados/portada.webp","alt":"Chicken breast with lemon and honey sauce beside roasted asparagus"}],"seo":{"title":"Lemon honey chicken with asparagus | Manual de Cocina","description":"Chicken with lemon, honey and garlic sauce for 4, with roasted asparagus. Brown first, add sauce later and check 74°C in every piece.","image_alt":"Chicken breast with lemon and honey sauce beside roasted asparagus","image_variants":["/recetas/pollo-al-limon-y-miel-con-esparragos-asados/portada-1x1.webp","/recetas/pollo-al-limon-y-miel-con-esparragos-asados/portada-4x3.webp","/recetas/pollo-al-limon-y-miel-con-esparragos-asados/portada-16x9.webp"],"faq":[{"q":"How can I stop honey burning?","a":"Brown chicken without honey and add sauce after lowering the heat. Keep a gentle simmer and cover briefly if sauce reduces before chicken reaches 74°C. Do not aim for a dark, thick sauce."},{"q":"Can I roast asparagus with raw chicken?","a":"This recipe cooks them separately. Asparagus has a different timing and must not receive raw chicken juices if it will be removed sooner. Use a clean tray for the side dish."},{"q":"How should I store and reheat leftovers?","a":"Refrigerate in shallow containers within 2 hours, or 1 hour above 32°C, at 4°C or below. Consume within the proposed 3 days and reheat once to 74°C in the centre."}]},"published":false,"editorial_status":"draft","content_html":"<p>Chicken breasts are browned in a skillet, then finished in a lemon, honey and garlic sauce, with green asparagus roasted separately. Honey is added after browning, over gentle heat, to reduce the risk of burning. The recipe preserves its historical identity and URL.</p><p>The proposal makes 4 servings, each with one chicken piece and a quarter of the asparagus and sauce. Allow an estimated 15 minutes preparation,25 cooking with parallel tasks and 5 resting:45 in total. Quantities, times and yield await kitchen testing. Check 74°C in every piece; colour and time do not certify doneness.</p>"},{"id":"5368bb57-0665-577a-b036-23e0de5be2c4","recipe_group_id":"ceed8c90-4245-4396-9095-d1d858d397ac","language":"fr","slug":"delicieuse-recette-de-poulet-au-citron-et-miel-avec-asperges-roties","public_path":"/fr/delicieuse-recette-de-poulet-au-citron-et-miel-avec-asperges-roties","source_url":null,"title":"Poulet au citron et au miel, asperges rôties","excerpt":"Blancs de poulet en sauce citron, miel et ail, accompagnés d’asperges rôties séparément. Proposition pour 4 avec contrôle à 74°C.","summary":"Les blancs de poulet sont dorés à la poêle puis terminés dans une sauce au citron, au miel et à l’ail. Les asperges vertes rôtissent séparément. Le miel est ajouté après coloration, à feu doux, pour limiter le risque de brûler. L’identité et l’URL historiques sont conservées.\n\nLa proposition donne 4 portions, chacune avec un morceau de poulet et un quart des asperges et de la sauce. Compter environ 15 minutes de préparation,25 de cuisson avec des tâches parallèles et 5 de repos, soit 45 minutes. Quantités, temps et rendement restent à tester en cuisine. Vérifier 74°C dans chaque morceau; couleur et durée ne certifient pas la cuisson.","category":"Plats principaux","category_slug":"platos-principales","difficulty":"Facile","course":"Plat principal","cuisine":"Cuisine maison","prep_time_minutes":15,"cook_time_minutes":25,"total_time_minutes":45,"servings":4,"keywords":["poulet au citron","poulet au miel","asperges rôties","blancs de poulet en sauce"],"ingredients":[{"name":"blanc de poulet cru sans peau ni os","amount":"800","unit":"g","group":"Poulet"},{"name":"asperges vertes, pesées après parage","amount":"600","unit":"g","group":"Accompagnement"},{"name":"jus de citron fraîchement pressé","amount":"40","unit":"g","group":"Sauce"},{"name":"miel","amount":"40","unit":"g","group":"Sauce"},{"name":"huile d’olive","amount":"30","unit":"g","group":"Cuisson et assaisonnement"},{"name":"ail","amount":"10","unit":"g","group":"Sauce"},{"name":"sel fin","amount":"4","unit":"g","group":"Cuisson et assaisonnement"},{"name":"poivre noir moulu","amount":"0.5","unit":"g","group":"Cuisson et assaisonnement"},{"name":"eau potable","amount":"60","unit":"ml","group":"Sauce"}],"steps":[{"title":"Préparer le poulet et les asperges","content":"Préchauffer le four à 210°C, chaleur haut et bas sans ventilation. Laver les asperges, retirer les bases dures et peser 600 g nettoyés; bien sécher. Sur une autre planche préparer 4 morceaux de blanc totalisant 800 g, environ 200 g chacun, d’épaisseur régulière de 1,5–2 cm; ouvrir les plus épais si nécessaire. Ne pas laver le poulet cru. Séparer les ustensiles du cru et du cuit. Réserver 3 g de sel et 0,25 g de poivre pour le poulet, puis 1 g de sel et 0,25 g de poivre pour les asperges.","image_alt":"Asperges propres sur une planche et quatre blancs de poulet crus sur une autre planche séparée","image_url":"/recetas/pollo-al-limon-y-miel-con-esparragos-asados/paso-01.webp"},{"title":"Mélanger la sauce dans un récipient propre","content":"Mélanger 40 g de jus de citron,40 g de miel,10 g d’ail haché et 60 ml d’eau potable. Remuer pour dissoudre le miel. Garder cette sauce dans un récipient propre, sans contact avec le poulet cru. Ce n’est pas une marinade et les jus du plat de poulet cru ne sont pas réutilisés.","image_alt":"Sauce citron, miel et ail mélangée dans un bol sans contact avec du poulet cru","image_url":"/recetas/pollo-al-limon-y-miel-con-esparragos-asados/paso-02.webp"},{"title":"Rôtir les asperges séparément","content":"Répartir les asperges en une seule couche sur une plaque avec 10 g de l’huile,1 g de sel et 0,25 g de poivre. Rôtir à 210°C environ 12–18 minutes, en les retournant après 8 minutes, jusqu’à ce qu’elles soient tendres mais encore fermes, avec des pointes légèrement dorées. L’épaisseur modifie le temps. Faire cette tâche pendant la cuisson du poulet; si elles finissent avant, les couvrir brièvement le temps de terminer la sauce. Ne pas déposer de poulet cru sur cette plaque.","image_alt":"Asperges vertes rôties en une couche sur une plaque sans poulet","image_url":"/recetas/pollo-al-limon-y-miel-con-esparragos-asados/paso-03.webp"},{"title":"Dorer les quatre morceaux de poulet","content":"Chauffer les 20 g d’huile restants dans une grande poêle à feu moyen. Assaisonner le poulet avec les 3 g de sel et 0,25 g de poivre réservés. Placer les 4 morceaux sans les entasser et dorer environ 4 minutes par face, soit 8 minutes au total. Régler le feu pour colorer sans brûler. Ne pas ajouter miel ou sauce à ce stade et ne pas considérer le centre comme déjà cuit.","image_alt":"Quatre blancs de poulet dorent dans une grande poêle sans sauce ni asperges","image_url":"/recetas/pollo-al-limon-y-miel-con-esparragos-asados/paso-04.webp"},{"title":"Terminer dans la sauce et vérifier la température","content":"Baisser le feu, ajouter toute la sauce propre de l’étape 2 et laisser frémir environ 6–8 minutes en retournant le poulet. Si elle épaissit trop tôt, réduire encore le feu et couvrir brièvement; ne pas laisser le sucre foncer ou brûler. Mesurer chaque morceau avec une sonde propre au centre le plus épais, sans toucher la poêle: il doit atteindre au moins 74°C. Sinon, prolonger doucement et mesurer de nouveau. La sauce doit rester fluide et légèrement brillante, pas devenir un caramel épais.","image_alt":"Blancs cuits nappés de sauce légère au citron et au miel dans une poêle","image_url":"/recetas/pollo-al-limon-y-miel-con-esparragos-asados/paso-05.webp"},{"title":"Laisser reposer, servir et conserver","content":"Transférer le poulet sur un plat propre et laisser reposer 5 minutes. Diviser en 4 portions et répartir asperges et totalité de la sauce avec des ustensiles propres. Pour conserver, placer les restes dans des récipients peu profonds et réfrigérer à 4°C ou moins dans les 2 heures, ou 1 heure si l’ambiance dépasse 32°C. Il est proposé de consommer dans les 3 jours et de réchauffer chaque portion une seule fois à 74°C au centre. Ne pas remettre le poulet cuit dans le plat ayant contenu le cru.","image_alt":"Un blanc en sauce citron et miel avec des asperges rôties dans une assiette","image_url":"/recetas/pollo-al-limon-y-miel-con-esparragos-asados/paso-06.webp"}],"notes":"Le miel ne convient pas aux enfants de moins de 12 mois. Vérifier les allergènes des produits emballés et choisir du poulet sans saumure ajoutée pour approcher le calcul. Moutarde, sauce soja, beurre, bouillon et accompagnements supplémentaires sont exclus. On peut utiliser le même poids d’asperges blanches en ajustant épluchage et cuisson; résultat et nutriments changent. Les édulcorants ne remplacent pas le miel à l’identique: texture, goût et réduction diffèrent. Le jus est la partie comestible comptée; aucune rondelle de citron ni herbe n’est ajoutée. Peser les asperges après retrait des bases dures. La nutrition compte toute la sauce et l’huile réparties entre 4; si une partie reste dans la poêle, l’apport réel peut être inférieur. Congélation et utilisation de restes antérieurs ne sont pas validées ici.","nutrition":{"fat_g":13,"calories":372.9,"saturated_fat_g":2.2,"sodium_mg":482,"protein_g":48.5,"sugar_g":11.3,"carbs_g":15.7,"fiber_g":3.3,"estimated":true,"serving_size":"1 des 4 portions proposées","source":"USDA FoodData Central — SR Legacy, abril de 2018","source_url":"https://fdc.nal.usda.gov/download-datasets/","method":"Huit fiches USDA vérifiées par identifiant FDC dans l’archive officielle. Poids comestibles crus additionnés puis divisés par 4; toute la sauce, l’huile et l’assaisonnement sont comptés. Les 60 ml d’eau potable n’apportent pas d’énergie et sont exclus des huit inputs. Pertes de nutriments et répartition exacte après cuisson non calculées.","note":"Estimation, pas une analyse du plat cuisiné. Saumure du poulet, type de miel, pertes et portions réelles modifient les chiffres; quantités, temps et rendement restent à tester en cuisine.","inputs":[{"fdc_id":171077,"fdc_description":"Chicken, broiler or fryers, breast, skinless, boneless, meat only, raw","per_100g":{"fat_g":2.62,"calories":120,"saturated_fat_g":0.563,"sodium_mg":45,"protein_g":22.5,"sugar_g":0,"carbs_g":0,"fiber_g":0},"source_url":"https://fdc.nal.usda.gov/food-details/171077/nutrients","ingredient":"blanc de poulet cru sans peau ni os","edible_grams":800},{"fdc_id":168389,"fdc_description":"Asparagus, raw","per_100g":{"saturated_fat_g":0.04,"protein_g":2.2,"sugar_g":1.88,"sodium_mg":2,"carbs_g":3.88,"calories":20,"fiber_g":2.1,"fat_g":0.12},"source_url":"https://fdc.nal.usda.gov/food-details/168389/nutrients","ingredient":"asperges vertes, pesées après parage","edible_grams":600},{"fdc_id":167747,"fdc_description":"Lemon juice, raw","per_100g":{"protein_g":0.35,"saturated_fat_g":0.04,"fiber_g":0.3,"sodium_mg":1,"sugar_g":2.52,"fat_g":0.24,"carbs_g":6.9,"calories":22},"source_url":"https://fdc.nal.usda.gov/food-details/167747/nutrients","ingredient":"jus de citron fraîchement pressé","edible_grams":40},{"fdc_id":169640,"fdc_description":"Honey","per_100g":{"saturated_fat_g":0,"protein_g":0.3,"fiber_g":0.2,"sodium_mg":4,"fat_g":0,"carbs_g":82.4,"calories":304,"sugar_g":82.1},"source_url":"https://fdc.nal.usda.gov/food-details/169640/nutrients","ingredient":"miel","edible_grams":40},{"fdc_id":171413,"fdc_description":"Oil, olive, salad or cooking","per_100g":{"fat_g":100,"carbs_g":0,"calories":884,"sodium_mg":2,"protein_g":0,"saturated_fat_g":13.8,"fiber_g":0,"sugar_g":0},"source_url":"https://fdc.nal.usda.gov/food-details/171413/nutrients","ingredient":"huile d’olive","edible_grams":30},{"fdc_id":169230,"fdc_description":"Garlic, raw","per_100g":{"carbs_g":33.1,"calories":149,"sugar_g":1,"saturated_fat_g":0.089,"fiber_g":2.1,"sodium_mg":17,"protein_g":6.36,"fat_g":0.5},"source_url":"https://fdc.nal.usda.gov/food-details/169230/nutrients","ingredient":"ail","edible_grams":10},{"fdc_id":173468,"fdc_description":"Salt, table","per_100g":{"fiber_g":0,"sodium_mg":38800,"saturated_fat_g":0,"protein_g":0,"fat_g":0,"carbs_g":0,"calories":0,"sugar_g":0},"source_url":"https://fdc.nal.usda.gov/food-details/173468/nutrients","ingredient":"sel fin","edible_grams":4},{"fdc_id":170931,"fdc_description":"Spices, pepper, black","per_100g":{"fat_g":3.26,"sugar_g":0.64,"carbs_g":64,"calories":251,"protein_g":10.4,"fiber_g":25.3,"sodium_mg":20,"saturated_fat_g":1.39},"source_url":"https://fdc.nal.usda.gov/food-details/170931/nutrients","ingredient":"poivre noir moulu","edible_grams":0.5}]},"image_url":"/recetas/pollo-al-limon-y-miel-con-esparragos-asados/portada.webp","gallery":[{"url":"/recetas/pollo-al-limon-y-miel-con-esparragos-asados/portada.webp","alt":"Blanc de poulet au citron et au miel accompagné d’asperges rôties"}],"seo":{"title":"Poulet citron miel et asperges | Manual de Cocina","description":"Poulet en sauce citron, miel et ail pour 4, avec asperges rôties. Dorer d’abord, ajouter la sauce ensuite et vérifier 74°C dans chaque morceau.","image_alt":"Blanc de poulet au citron et au miel accompagné d’asperges rôties","image_variants":["/recetas/pollo-al-limon-y-miel-con-esparragos-asados/portada-1x1.webp","/recetas/pollo-al-limon-y-miel-con-esparragos-asados/portada-4x3.webp","/recetas/pollo-al-limon-y-miel-con-esparragos-asados/portada-16x9.webp"],"faq":[{"q":"Comment éviter de brûler le miel?","a":"Dorer le poulet sans miel et ajouter la sauce après avoir baissé le feu. Garder un frémissement doux et couvrir brièvement si la sauce réduit avant que le poulet atteigne 74°C. Ne pas rechercher une sauce foncée et épaisse."},{"q":"Peut-on rôtir les asperges avec le poulet cru?","a":"Cette fiche les cuit séparément. Les asperges ont un autre temps et ne doivent pas recevoir de jus crus de poulet si elles sont retirées plus tôt. Utiliser une plaque propre pour l’accompagnement."},{"q":"Comment conserver et réchauffer les restes?","a":"Réfrigérer en récipients peu profonds dans les 2 heures, ou 1 heure au-dessus de 32°C, à 4°C ou moins. Consommer dans les 3 jours proposés et réchauffer une fois à 74°C au centre."}]},"published":false,"editorial_status":"draft","content_html":"<p>Les blancs de poulet sont dorés à la poêle puis terminés dans une sauce au citron, au miel et à l’ail. Les asperges vertes rôtissent séparément. Le miel est ajouté après coloration, à feu doux, pour limiter le risque de brûler. L’identité et l’URL historiques sont conservées.</p><p>La proposition donne 4 portions, chacune avec un morceau de poulet et un quart des asperges et de la sauce. Compter environ 15 minutes de préparation,25 de cuisson avec des tâches parallèles et 5 de repos, soit 45 minutes. Quantités, temps et rendement restent à tester en cuisine. Vérifier 74°C dans chaque morceau; couleur et durée ne certifient pas la cuisson.</p>"},{"id":"b44de411-6e7e-5f03-8fa2-c3a24d8aa91a","recipe_group_id":"ceed8c90-4245-4396-9095-d1d858d397ac","language":"it","slug":"deliziosa-ricetta-di-pollo-al-limone-e-miele-con-asparagi-arrostiti-2","public_path":"/it/deliziosa-ricetta-di-pollo-al-limone-e-miele-con-asparagi-arrostiti-2","source_url":null,"title":"Pollo al limone e miele con asparagi arrostiti","excerpt":"Petti di pollo con salsa di limone, miele e aglio e asparagi arrostiti separatamente. Proposta per 4 con controllo a 74°C.","summary":"I petti di pollo vengono rosolati in padella e poi terminati in una salsa di limone, miele e aglio, con asparagi verdi arrostiti separatamente. Il miele entra dopo la rosolatura, a fuoco dolce, per ridurre il rischio di bruciarlo. Identità e URL storici vengono conservati.\n\nLa proposta dà 4 porzioni, ciascuna con un pezzo di pollo e un quarto degli asparagi e della salsa. Si stimano 15 minuti di preparazione,25 di cottura con attività in parallelo e 5 di riposo:45 in totale. Quantità, tempi e resa attendono una prova in cucina. Verifica 74°C in ogni pezzo; colore e tempo non certificano la cottura.","category":"Secondi piatti","category_slug":"platos-principales","difficulty":"Facile","course":"Secondo piatto","cuisine":"Cucina casalinga","prep_time_minutes":15,"cook_time_minutes":25,"total_time_minutes":45,"servings":4,"keywords":["pollo al limone","pollo al miele","asparagi arrostiti","petto di pollo in salsa"],"ingredients":[{"name":"petto di pollo crudo senza pelle né ossa","amount":"800","unit":"g","group":"Pollo"},{"name":"asparagi verdi, pesati dopo la pulizia","amount":"600","unit":"g","group":"Contorno"},{"name":"succo di limone appena spremuto","amount":"40","unit":"g","group":"Salsa"},{"name":"miele","amount":"40","unit":"g","group":"Salsa"},{"name":"olio d’oliva","amount":"30","unit":"g","group":"Cottura e condimento"},{"name":"aglio","amount":"10","unit":"g","group":"Salsa"},{"name":"sale fino","amount":"4","unit":"g","group":"Cottura e condimento"},{"name":"pepe nero macinato","amount":"0.5","unit":"g","group":"Cottura e condimento"},{"name":"acqua potabile","amount":"60","unit":"ml","group":"Salsa"}],"steps":[{"title":"Prepara pollo e asparagi","content":"Preriscalda il forno a 210°C statico, senza ventola. Lava gli asparagi, elimina le basi dure e pesa 600 g già puliti; asciuga bene. Su un tagliere separato prepara 4 pezzi di petto per un totale di 800 g, circa 200 g ciascuno, con spessore uniforme di 1,5–2 cm; apri quelli più spessi se serve. Non lavare il pollo crudo. Separa utensili per crudo e cotto. Riserva 3 g di sale e 0,25 g di pepe per il pollo, e 1 g di sale e 0,25 g di pepe per gli asparagi.","image_alt":"Asparagi puliti su un tagliere e quattro petti crudi su un altro tagliere separato","image_url":"/recetas/pollo-al-limon-y-miel-con-esparragos-asados/paso-01.webp"},{"title":"Mescola la salsa in un recipiente pulito","content":"Mescola 40 g di succo di limone,40 g di miele,10 g di aglio tritato e 60 ml di acqua potabile. Sciogli il miele mescolando. Conserva la salsa in un recipiente pulito e impedisci il contatto con pollo crudo; non è una marinata e i liquidi del piatto del pollo crudo non vengono riutilizzati.","image_alt":"Salsa di limone, miele e aglio mescolata in una ciotola senza contatto con pollo crudo","image_url":"/recetas/pollo-al-limon-y-miel-con-esparragos-asados/paso-02.webp"},{"title":"Arrostisci gli asparagi separatamente","content":"Distribuisci gli asparagi in un solo strato su una teglia con 10 g dell’olio,1 g di sale e 0,25 g di pepe. Cuoci a 210°C per circa 12–18 minuti, girando dopo 8 minuti, finché sono teneri ma ancora consistenti, con punte leggermente dorate. Lo spessore modifica il tempo. Procedi mentre cuoci il pollo; se finiscono prima, tienili brevemente coperti mentre termini la salsa. Non mettere pollo crudo su questa teglia.","image_alt":"Asparagi verdi arrostiti in un solo strato su una teglia senza pollo","image_url":"/recetas/pollo-al-limon-y-miel-con-esparragos-asados/paso-03.webp"},{"title":"Rosola i quattro pezzi di pollo","content":"Scalda i 20 g di olio restanti in una padella ampia a fuoco medio. Condisci il pollo con i 3 g di sale e 0,25 g di pepe riservati. Disponi i 4 pezzi senza affollarli e rosola circa 4 minuti per lato, approssimativamente 8 minuti totali. Regola il fuoco per dorare senza bruciare. Non aggiungere ancora miele o salsa e non considerare già cotto il centro.","image_alt":"Quattro petti di pollo rosolano in una padella ampia senza salsa né asparagi","image_url":"/recetas/pollo-al-limon-y-miel-con-esparragos-asados/paso-04.webp"},{"title":"Termina con la salsa e controlla la temperatura","content":"Abbassa il fuoco, aggiungi tutta la salsa pulita del passaggio 2 e fai sobbollire dolcemente circa 6–8 minuti, girando il pollo. Se si addensa troppo presto, riduci ancora il fuoco e copri brevemente; non lasciare scurire o bruciare lo zucchero. Misura ogni pezzo con una sonda pulita al centro più spesso, senza toccare la padella: deve raggiungere almeno 74°C. Se non ci arriva, prolunga a fuoco dolce e misura ancora. La salsa deve essere fluida e leggermente lucida, non un caramello denso.","image_alt":"Petti cotti ricoperti di salsa leggera al limone e miele in padella","image_url":"/recetas/pollo-al-limon-y-miel-con-esparragos-asados/paso-05.webp"},{"title":"Riposa, servi e conserva in sicurezza","content":"Trasferisci il pollo in un piatto pulito e lascia riposare 5 minuti. Dividi in 4 porzioni e distribuisci asparagi e tutta la salsa con utensili puliti. Per conservare, metti gli avanzi in contenitori bassi e refrigera a 4°C o meno entro 2 ore, oppure 1 ora se l’ambiente supera 32°C. Si propone di consumare entro 3 giorni e riscaldare ogni porzione una sola volta fino a 74°C al centro. Non mettere pollo cotto nel piatto che conteneva quello crudo.","image_alt":"Un petto con salsa al limone e miele accanto ad asparagi arrostiti nel piatto","image_url":"/recetas/pollo-al-limon-y-miel-con-esparragos-asados/paso-06.webp"}],"notes":"Il miele non è adatto a bambini sotto 12 mesi. Controlla gli allergeni dei prodotti confezionati e usa pollo senza salamoia aggiunta per avvicinarti al calcolo. Non sono inclusi senape, salsa di soia, burro, brodo o contorni extra. Puoi usare lo stesso peso di asparagi bianchi adattando pelatura e cottura; risultato e nutrienti cambiano. I dolcificanti non equivalgono al miele: consistenza, gusto e riduzione sono diversi. La parte commestibile conteggiata è il succo; non si aggiungono fettine di limone o erbe. Pesa gli asparagi dopo aver tolto le basi dure. La nutrizione conta tutta la salsa e l’olio divisi tra 4; se ne resta in padella, l’apporto reale può diminuire. Non sono stati validati qui congelamento e uso di avanzi precedenti.","nutrition":{"fat_g":13,"calories":372.9,"saturated_fat_g":2.2,"sodium_mg":482,"protein_g":48.5,"sugar_g":11.3,"carbs_g":15.7,"fiber_g":3.3,"estimated":true,"serving_size":"1 delle 4 porzioni proposte","source":"USDA FoodData Central — SR Legacy, abril de 2018","source_url":"https://fdc.nal.usda.gov/download-datasets/","method":"Otto schede USDA verificate per FDC ID nell’archivio ufficiale. Pesi commestibili crudi sommati e divisi per 4; conteggiati tutta la salsa, olio e condimento. I 60 ml di acqua potabile non danno energia e sono esclusi dagli otto inputs. Non si calcolano perdite di nutrienti o ripartizione esatta dopo la cottura.","note":"Stima, non analisi del piatto cotto. Salamoia nel pollo, tipo di miele, perdite e porzioni reali cambiano i valori; quantità, tempi e resa attendono prova in cucina.","inputs":[{"fdc_id":171077,"fdc_description":"Chicken, broiler or fryers, breast, skinless, boneless, meat only, raw","per_100g":{"fat_g":2.62,"calories":120,"saturated_fat_g":0.563,"sodium_mg":45,"protein_g":22.5,"sugar_g":0,"carbs_g":0,"fiber_g":0},"source_url":"https://fdc.nal.usda.gov/food-details/171077/nutrients","ingredient":"petto di pollo crudo senza pelle né ossa","edible_grams":800},{"fdc_id":168389,"fdc_description":"Asparagus, raw","per_100g":{"saturated_fat_g":0.04,"protein_g":2.2,"sugar_g":1.88,"sodium_mg":2,"carbs_g":3.88,"calories":20,"fiber_g":2.1,"fat_g":0.12},"source_url":"https://fdc.nal.usda.gov/food-details/168389/nutrients","ingredient":"asparagi verdi, pesati dopo la pulizia","edible_grams":600},{"fdc_id":167747,"fdc_description":"Lemon juice, raw","per_100g":{"protein_g":0.35,"saturated_fat_g":0.04,"fiber_g":0.3,"sodium_mg":1,"sugar_g":2.52,"fat_g":0.24,"carbs_g":6.9,"calories":22},"source_url":"https://fdc.nal.usda.gov/food-details/167747/nutrients","ingredient":"succo di limone appena spremuto","edible_grams":40},{"fdc_id":169640,"fdc_description":"Honey","per_100g":{"saturated_fat_g":0,"protein_g":0.3,"fiber_g":0.2,"sodium_mg":4,"fat_g":0,"carbs_g":82.4,"calories":304,"sugar_g":82.1},"source_url":"https://fdc.nal.usda.gov/food-details/169640/nutrients","ingredient":"miele","edible_grams":40},{"fdc_id":171413,"fdc_description":"Oil, olive, salad or cooking","per_100g":{"fat_g":100,"carbs_g":0,"calories":884,"sodium_mg":2,"protein_g":0,"saturated_fat_g":13.8,"fiber_g":0,"sugar_g":0},"source_url":"https://fdc.nal.usda.gov/food-details/171413/nutrients","ingredient":"olio d’oliva","edible_grams":30},{"fdc_id":169230,"fdc_description":"Garlic, raw","per_100g":{"carbs_g":33.1,"calories":149,"sugar_g":1,"saturated_fat_g":0.089,"fiber_g":2.1,"sodium_mg":17,"protein_g":6.36,"fat_g":0.5},"source_url":"https://fdc.nal.usda.gov/food-details/169230/nutrients","ingredient":"aglio","edible_grams":10},{"fdc_id":173468,"fdc_description":"Salt, table","per_100g":{"fiber_g":0,"sodium_mg":38800,"saturated_fat_g":0,"protein_g":0,"fat_g":0,"carbs_g":0,"calories":0,"sugar_g":0},"source_url":"https://fdc.nal.usda.gov/food-details/173468/nutrients","ingredient":"sale fino","edible_grams":4},{"fdc_id":170931,"fdc_description":"Spices, pepper, black","per_100g":{"fat_g":3.26,"sugar_g":0.64,"carbs_g":64,"calories":251,"protein_g":10.4,"fiber_g":25.3,"sodium_mg":20,"saturated_fat_g":1.39},"source_url":"https://fdc.nal.usda.gov/food-details/170931/nutrients","ingredient":"pepe nero macinato","edible_grams":0.5}]},"image_url":"/recetas/pollo-al-limon-y-miel-con-esparragos-asados/portada.webp","gallery":[{"url":"/recetas/pollo-al-limon-y-miel-con-esparragos-asados/portada.webp","alt":"Petto di pollo al limone e miele con asparagi arrostiti"}],"seo":{"title":"Pollo limone e miele con asparagi | Manual de Cocina","description":"Pollo con salsa di limone, miele e aglio per 4 e asparagi arrostiti. Rosola prima, aggiungi poi la salsa e controlla 74°C in ogni pezzo.","image_alt":"Petto di pollo al limone e miele con asparagi arrostiti","image_variants":["/recetas/pollo-al-limon-y-miel-con-esparragos-asados/portada-1x1.webp","/recetas/pollo-al-limon-y-miel-con-esparragos-asados/portada-4x3.webp","/recetas/pollo-al-limon-y-miel-con-esparragos-asados/portada-16x9.webp"],"faq":[{"q":"Come evito che il miele bruci?","a":"Rosola il pollo senza miele e aggiungi la salsa dopo aver abbassato il fuoco. Mantieni un sobbollore dolce e copri brevemente se la salsa si riduce prima che il pollo arrivi a 74°C. Non cercare una salsa scura e densa."},{"q":"Posso arrostire asparagi e pollo crudo insieme?","a":"Questa scheda li cuoce separatamente. Gli asparagi hanno un altro tempo e non devono ricevere liquidi crudi del pollo se vengono tolti prima. Usa una teglia pulita per il contorno."},{"q":"Come conservo e riscaldo gli avanzi?","a":"Refrigera in contenitori bassi entro 2 ore, o 1 ora sopra 32°C, a 4°C o meno. Consuma nei 3 giorni proposti e riscalda una volta a 74°C al centro."}]},"published":false,"editorial_status":"draft","content_html":"<p>I petti di pollo vengono rosolati in padella e poi terminati in una salsa di limone, miele e aglio, con asparagi verdi arrostiti separatamente. Il miele entra dopo la rosolatura, a fuoco dolce, per ridurre il rischio di bruciarlo. Identità e URL storici vengono conservati.</p><p>La proposta dà 4 porzioni, ciascuna con un pezzo di pollo e un quarto degli asparagi e della salsa. Si stimano 15 minuti di preparazione,25 di cottura con attività in parallelo e 5 di riposo:45 in totale. Quantità, tempi e resa attendono una prova in cucina. Verifica 74°C in ogni pezzo; colore e tempo non certificano la cottura.</p>"},{"id":"c5f3b8da-c6c3-5db1-9697-a0b956bc7a9e","recipe_group_id":"ceed8c90-4245-4396-9095-d1d858d397ac","language":"ja","slug":"おいしいレモンとはちみつチキンのレシピ、ロー","public_path":"/ja/おいしいレモンとはちみつチキンのレシピ、ロー","source_url":null,"title":"レモンとはちみつのチキンとローストアスパラガス","excerpt":"レモン、はちみつ、にんにくのソースで仕上げる鶏むね肉と、別に焼くアスパラガス。4人分の提案で、鶏肉は74°Cを確認します。","summary":"鶏むね肉をフライパンで焼き付け、レモン、はちみつ、にんにくのソースで火を通します。グリーンアスパラガスは別にオーブンで焼きます。はちみつは焼き付けた後に弱火で加え、焦げる危険を減らします。このレシピの歴史的な識別情報とURLを保持しています。\n\n提案量は4人分です。1人分は鶏肉1切れとアスパラガス、ソースそれぞれ全量の4分の1。下準備15分、並行作業を含む加熱25分、休ませる時間5分、合計45分を推定しています。分量、時間、出来上がり量は調理検証前の目安です。各切れの中心が74°Cに達したことを確認してください。色や時間だけで安全な加熱を判断しません。","category":"主菜","category_slug":"platos-principales","difficulty":"簡単","course":"主菜","cuisine":"家庭料理","prep_time_minutes":15,"cook_time_minutes":25,"total_time_minutes":45,"servings":4,"keywords":["レモンチキン","はちみつチキン","ローストアスパラガス","鶏むね肉のソース煮"],"ingredients":[{"name":"生の皮なし骨なし鶏むね肉","amount":"800","unit":"g","group":"鶏肉"},{"name":"グリーンアスパラガス、硬い根元を除いた重量","amount":"600","unit":"g","group":"付け合わせ"},{"name":"搾りたてのレモン汁","amount":"40","unit":"g","group":"ソース"},{"name":"はちみつ","amount":"40","unit":"g","group":"ソース"},{"name":"オリーブオイル","amount":"30","unit":"g","group":"加熱と味付け"},{"name":"にんにく","amount":"10","unit":"g","group":"ソース"},{"name":"細かい塩","amount":"4","unit":"g","group":"加熱と味付け"},{"name":"黒こしょう粉","amount":"0.5","unit":"g","group":"加熱と味付け"},{"name":"飲用水","amount":"60","unit":"ml","group":"ソース"}],"steps":[{"title":"鶏肉とアスパラガスを準備する","content":"オーブンをファンなしの上下加熱210°Cに予熱します。アスパラガスを洗い、硬い根元を切り落として600 gを量り、水気をよく拭きます。別のまな板で鶏むね肉を合計800 g、約200 gずつ4切れにし、厚さを1.5–2 cmにそろえます。厚いものは必要に応じて開きます。生の鶏肉は洗いません。生用と加熱後用の器具を分けます。鶏肉用に塩3 gとこしょう0.25 g、アスパラガス用に塩1 gとこしょう0.25 gを分けておきます。","image_alt":"清潔なアスパラガスと、別のまな板に置かれた生の鶏むね肉4切れ","image_url":"/recetas/pollo-al-limon-y-miel-con-esparragos-asados/paso-01.webp"},{"title":"清潔な器でソースを混ぜる","content":"レモン汁40 g、はちみつ40 g、刻んだにんにく10 g、飲用水60 mlを混ぜ、はちみつを溶かします。ソースは清潔な器に入れ、生の鶏肉に触れさせません。漬け汁にはせず、生肉を置いた皿の肉汁も再使用しません。","image_alt":"生の鶏肉に触れず、器で混ぜるレモン、はちみつ、にんにくのソース","image_url":"/recetas/pollo-al-limon-y-miel-con-esparragos-asados/paso-02.webp"},{"title":"アスパラガスを別に焼く","content":"天板にアスパラガスを重ならないように並べ、オイルのうち10 g、塩1 g、こしょう0.25 gを絡めます。210°Cで約12–18分焼き、8分経ったら裏返します。適度な歯ごたえを残して柔らかくなり、穂先が軽く色づくのが目安です。太さで時間は変わります。鶏肉と並行して焼き、先に焼けた場合はソースができるまで短時間覆っておきます。この天板に生の鶏肉を置きません。","image_alt":"鶏肉を載せず、天板に1層に並べて焼いたグリーンアスパラガス","image_url":"/recetas/pollo-al-limon-y-miel-con-esparragos-asados/paso-03.webp"},{"title":"鶏肉4切れを焼き付ける","content":"大きなフライパンに残りのオイル20 gを入れ、中火にします。鶏肉に分けておいた塩3 gとこしょう0.25 gを振ります。4切れを詰め込まずに並べ、片面約4分、合計約8分焼き付けます。焦げないよう火力を調整します。まだはちみつやソースを加えず、中心まで火が通ったとは判断しません。","image_alt":"ソースやアスパラガスを加えず、フライパンで焼き付ける鶏むね肉4切れ","image_url":"/recetas/pollo-al-limon-y-miel-con-esparragos-asados/paso-04.webp"},{"title":"ソースで仕上げ、温度を確認する","content":"火を弱め、手順2の清潔なソースを全量加えます。鶏肉を返して絡めながら約6–8分、穏やかに煮ます。早くとろみが付いたらさらに火を弱め、短時間ふたをします。糖分を濃く色づかせたり焦がしたりしません。清潔な温度計を各切れの最も厚い中心に差し、フライパンに触れないよう測ります。最低74°Cが必要です。足りなければ弱火で加熱を続け、再測定します。ソースは流れる程度で軽い艶があり、濃いカラメル状にはしません。","image_alt":"軽いレモンとはちみつのソースを絡めた加熱済みの鶏むね肉","image_url":"/recetas/pollo-al-limon-y-miel-con-esparragos-asados/paso-05.webp"},{"title":"休ませて盛り付け、安全に保存する","content":"鶏肉を清潔な皿に取り出し、5分休ませます。4人分に分け、アスパラガスとソース全量を配り、清潔な器具で盛ります。残りは浅い容器に分け、2時間以内、室温が32°Cを超える場合は1時間以内に、4°C以下で冷蔵します。保存期間は3日以内を提案し、1人分ずつ中心が74°Cになるまで1回だけ再加熱します。生肉が入っていた皿に加熱済みの鶏肉を戻しません。","image_alt":"皿に盛ったレモンとはちみつのチキンとローストアスパラガス","image_url":"/recetas/pollo-al-limon-y-miel-con-esparragos-asados/paso-06.webp"}],"notes":"はちみつは12か月未満の乳児には与えません。包装食品のアレルゲンを確認し、計算に近づけるには塩水を添加していない鶏肉を使います。マスタード、しょうゆ、バター、スープ、追加の付け合わせは含みません。同じ重量のホワイトアスパラガスに替える場合は皮むきと加熱を調整し、仕上がりと栄養値が変わります。甘味料ははちみつと同等の代用品ではなく、食感、味、煮詰まり方が異なります。計算する可食部はレモン汁で、レモンの輪切りやハーブは加えません。アスパラガスは硬い根元を除いてから量ります。栄養計算はソースとオイルを全量含み、4人分に分けています。フライパンに残れば実際の摂取量は少なくなる場合があります。冷凍や以前の残り物の利用は検証していません。","nutrition":{"fat_g":13,"calories":372.9,"saturated_fat_g":2.2,"sodium_mg":482,"protein_g":48.5,"sugar_g":11.3,"carbs_g":15.7,"fiber_g":3.3,"estimated":true,"serving_size":"提案量4人分のうち1人分","source":"USDA FoodData Central — SR Legacy, abril de 2018","source_url":"https://fdc.nal.usda.gov/download-datasets/","method":"公式アーカイブの8件のUSDA食品データをFDC IDで確認。生の可食重量を合計して4で割り、ソース、オイル、調味料を全量計上します。飲用水60 mlはエネルギーを含まず、8件のinputsから除外します。加熱による栄養損失や正確な分配は計算しません。","note":"調理後の分析値ではなく推定値です。鶏肉への塩水添加、はちみつの種類、損失、実際の分配で数値は変わり、分量、時間、出来上がり量は調理検証前です。","inputs":[{"fdc_id":171077,"fdc_description":"Chicken, broiler or fryers, breast, skinless, boneless, meat only, raw","per_100g":{"fat_g":2.62,"calories":120,"saturated_fat_g":0.563,"sodium_mg":45,"protein_g":22.5,"sugar_g":0,"carbs_g":0,"fiber_g":0},"source_url":"https://fdc.nal.usda.gov/food-details/171077/nutrients","ingredient":"生の皮なし骨なし鶏むね肉","edible_grams":800},{"fdc_id":168389,"fdc_description":"Asparagus, raw","per_100g":{"saturated_fat_g":0.04,"protein_g":2.2,"sugar_g":1.88,"sodium_mg":2,"carbs_g":3.88,"calories":20,"fiber_g":2.1,"fat_g":0.12},"source_url":"https://fdc.nal.usda.gov/food-details/168389/nutrients","ingredient":"グリーンアスパラガス、硬い根元を除いた重量","edible_grams":600},{"fdc_id":167747,"fdc_description":"Lemon juice, raw","per_100g":{"protein_g":0.35,"saturated_fat_g":0.04,"fiber_g":0.3,"sodium_mg":1,"sugar_g":2.52,"fat_g":0.24,"carbs_g":6.9,"calories":22},"source_url":"https://fdc.nal.usda.gov/food-details/167747/nutrients","ingredient":"搾りたてのレモン汁","edible_grams":40},{"fdc_id":169640,"fdc_description":"Honey","per_100g":{"saturated_fat_g":0,"protein_g":0.3,"fiber_g":0.2,"sodium_mg":4,"fat_g":0,"carbs_g":82.4,"calories":304,"sugar_g":82.1},"source_url":"https://fdc.nal.usda.gov/food-details/169640/nutrients","ingredient":"はちみつ","edible_grams":40},{"fdc_id":171413,"fdc_description":"Oil, olive, salad or cooking","per_100g":{"fat_g":100,"carbs_g":0,"calories":884,"sodium_mg":2,"protein_g":0,"saturated_fat_g":13.8,"fiber_g":0,"sugar_g":0},"source_url":"https://fdc.nal.usda.gov/food-details/171413/nutrients","ingredient":"オリーブオイル","edible_grams":30},{"fdc_id":169230,"fdc_description":"Garlic, raw","per_100g":{"carbs_g":33.1,"calories":149,"sugar_g":1,"saturated_fat_g":0.089,"fiber_g":2.1,"sodium_mg":17,"protein_g":6.36,"fat_g":0.5},"source_url":"https://fdc.nal.usda.gov/food-details/169230/nutrients","ingredient":"にんにく","edible_grams":10},{"fdc_id":173468,"fdc_description":"Salt, table","per_100g":{"fiber_g":0,"sodium_mg":38800,"saturated_fat_g":0,"protein_g":0,"fat_g":0,"carbs_g":0,"calories":0,"sugar_g":0},"source_url":"https://fdc.nal.usda.gov/food-details/173468/nutrients","ingredient":"細かい塩","edible_grams":4},{"fdc_id":170931,"fdc_description":"Spices, pepper, black","per_100g":{"fat_g":3.26,"sugar_g":0.64,"carbs_g":64,"calories":251,"protein_g":10.4,"fiber_g":25.3,"sodium_mg":20,"saturated_fat_g":1.39},"source_url":"https://fdc.nal.usda.gov/food-details/170931/nutrients","ingredient":"黒こしょう粉","edible_grams":0.5}]},"image_url":"/recetas/pollo-al-limon-y-miel-con-esparragos-asados/portada.webp","gallery":[{"url":"/recetas/pollo-al-limon-y-miel-con-esparragos-asados/portada.webp","alt":"レモンとはちみつのソースを絡めた鶏むね肉とローストアスパラガス"}],"seo":{"title":"レモンはちみつチキンとアスパラガス | Manual de Cocina","description":"4人分のレモン、はちみつ、にんにくのチキンとローストアスパラガス。先に焼き付け、後からソースを加え、各切れの74°Cを確認。","image_alt":"レモンとはちみつのソースを絡めた鶏むね肉とローストアスパラガス","image_variants":["/recetas/pollo-al-limon-y-miel-con-esparragos-asados/portada-1x1.webp","/recetas/pollo-al-limon-y-miel-con-esparragos-asados/portada-4x3.webp","/recetas/pollo-al-limon-y-miel-con-esparragos-asados/portada-16x9.webp"],"faq":[{"q":"はちみつを焦がさない方法は？","a":"はちみつなしで鶏肉を焼き付け、火を弱めてからソースを加えます。穏やかに煮て、鶏肉が74°Cに達する前にソースが煮詰まったら短時間ふたをします。濃く暗いソースを目指しません。"},{"q":"生の鶏肉とアスパラガスを一緒に焼けますか？","a":"この配合では別々に調理します。アスパラガスは加熱時間が異なり、先に取り出す場合は生の鶏肉の汁に触れさせません。付け合わせには清潔な天板を使います。"},{"q":"残りの保存と再加熱は？","a":"浅い容器に入れ、2時間以内、32°Cを超える場合は1時間以内に4°C以下で冷蔵します。提案期間は3日以内で、中心74°Cまで1回だけ再加熱します。"}]},"published":false,"editorial_status":"draft","content_html":"<p>鶏むね肉をフライパンで焼き付け、レモン、はちみつ、にんにくのソースで火を通します。グリーンアスパラガスは別にオーブンで焼きます。はちみつは焼き付けた後に弱火で加え、焦げる危険を減らします。このレシピの歴史的な識別情報とURLを保持しています。</p><p>提案量は4人分です。1人分は鶏肉1切れとアスパラガス、ソースそれぞれ全量の4分の1。下準備15分、並行作業を含む加熱25分、休ませる時間5分、合計45分を推定しています。分量、時間、出来上がり量は調理検証前の目安です。各切れの中心が74°Cに達したことを確認してください。色や時間だけで安全な加熱を判断しません。</p>"},{"id":"108de2d0-0504-5da8-8ca1-218801755135","recipe_group_id":"ceed8c90-4245-4396-9095-d1d858d397ac","language":"pt","slug":"frango-com-limao-e-mel-e-aspargos-assados","public_path":"/pt/frango-com-limao-e-mel-e-aspargos-assados","source_url":null,"title":"Frango com limão e mel e aspargos assados","excerpt":"Peitos de frango com molho de limão, mel e alho e aspargos assados separadamente. Proposta para 4, com controle de temperatura a 74°C.","summary":"Os peitos de frango são dourados na frigideira e terminam o cozimento em molho de limão, mel e alho, com aspargos verdes assados separadamente. O mel entra depois de dourar, em fogo baixo, para reduzir o risco de queimar. A identidade e a URL históricas são mantidas.\n\nA proposta rende 4 porções, cada uma com um pedaço de frango e um quarto dos aspargos e do molho. Estimam-se 15 minutos de preparo,25 de cozimento com tarefas em paralelo e 5 de descanso:45 no total. Quantidades, tempos e rendimento aguardam teste de cozinha. Confira 74°C em cada pedaço; cor e tempo não certificam o cozimento.","category":"Pratos principais","category_slug":"platos-principales","difficulty":"Fácil","course":"Prato principal","cuisine":"Cozinha caseira","prep_time_minutes":15,"cook_time_minutes":25,"total_time_minutes":45,"servings":4,"keywords":["frango com limão","frango com mel","aspargos assados","peito de frango ao molho"],"ingredients":[{"name":"peito de frango cru sem pele e sem osso","amount":"800","unit":"g","group":"Frango"},{"name":"aspargos verdes, peso após retirar as bases duras","amount":"600","unit":"g","group":"Acompanhamento"},{"name":"suco de limão espremido na hora","amount":"40","unit":"g","group":"Molho"},{"name":"mel","amount":"40","unit":"g","group":"Molho"},{"name":"azeite de oliva","amount":"30","unit":"g","group":"Cozimento e tempero"},{"name":"alho","amount":"10","unit":"g","group":"Molho"},{"name":"sal fino","amount":"4","unit":"g","group":"Cozimento e tempero"},{"name":"pimenta-do-reino moída","amount":"0.5","unit":"g","group":"Cozimento e tempero"},{"name":"água potável","amount":"60","unit":"ml","group":"Molho"}],"steps":[{"title":"Prepare o frango e os aspargos","content":"Preaqueça o forno a 210°C, com calor em cima e embaixo, sem ventilador. Lave os aspargos, retire as bases duras e pese 600 g já limpos; seque bem. Em outra tábua prepare 4 pedaços de peito que somem 800 g, cerca de 200 g cada, com espessura uniforme de 1,5–2 cm; abra os mais grossos se necessário. Não lave o frango cru. Separe utensílios para alimentos crus e cozidos. Reserve 3 g de sal e 0,25 g de pimenta para o frango, e 1 g de sal e 0,25 g de pimenta para os aspargos.","image_alt":"Aspargos limpos em uma tábua e quatro peitos crus em outra tábua separada","image_url":"/recetas/pollo-al-limon-y-miel-con-esparragos-asados/paso-01.webp"},{"title":"Misture o molho em um recipiente limpo","content":"Misture 40 g de suco de limão,40 g de mel,10 g de alho picado e 60 ml de água potável. Mexa para dissolver o mel. Mantenha esse molho em recipiente limpo, sem contato com frango cru; não é uma marinada e não se reaproveitam líquidos do prato do frango cru.","image_alt":"Molho de limão, mel e alho sendo misturado em tigela sem contato com frango cru","image_url":"/recetas/pollo-al-limon-y-miel-con-esparragos-asados/paso-02.webp"},{"title":"Asse os aspargos separadamente","content":"Espalhe os aspargos em uma só camada numa assadeira com 10 g do azeite,1 g de sal e 0,25 g de pimenta. Asse a 210°C por cerca de 12–18 minutos, virando após 8 minutos, até ficarem macios com alguma firmeza e pontas levemente douradas. A espessura altera o tempo. Faça essa tarefa enquanto cozinha o frango; se terminarem antes, mantenha cobertos por pouco tempo enquanto finaliza o molho. Não coloque frango cru nessa assadeira.","image_alt":"Aspargos verdes assados em uma só camada na assadeira, sem frango","image_url":"/recetas/pollo-al-limon-y-miel-con-esparragos-asados/paso-03.webp"},{"title":"Doure os quatro pedaços de frango","content":"Aqueça os 20 g de azeite restantes em frigideira ampla em fogo médio. Tempere o frango com os 3 g de sal e 0,25 g de pimenta reservados. Coloque os 4 pedaços sem amontoar e doure cerca de 4 minutos de cada lado, aproximadamente 8 minutos no total. Ajuste o fogo para dourar sem queimar. Não adicione mel nem molho nessa fase e não considere o centro já cozido.","image_alt":"Quatro peitos de frango dourando em frigideira ampla, sem molho nem aspargos","image_url":"/recetas/pollo-al-limon-y-miel-con-esparragos-asados/paso-04.webp"},{"title":"Finalize no molho e confira a temperatura","content":"Abaixe o fogo, junte todo o molho limpo do passo 2 e cozinhe em fervura suave por cerca de 6–8 minutos, virando o frango para envolver. Se engrossar cedo demais, abaixe mais o fogo e tampe brevemente; não deixe o açúcar escurecer ou queimar. Meça cada pedaço com sonda limpa no centro mais grosso, sem tocar a frigideira: deve atingir pelo menos 74°C. Caso contrário, prolongue em fogo baixo e meça novamente. O molho deve ficar fluido e levemente brilhante, não como caramelo grosso.","image_alt":"Peitos cozidos envolvidos em molho leve de limão e mel na frigideira","image_url":"/recetas/pollo-al-limon-y-miel-con-esparragos-asados/paso-05.webp"},{"title":"Descanse, sirva e conserve com segurança","content":"Passe o frango para uma travessa limpa e descanse 5 minutos. Divida em 4 porções e distribua aspargos e todo o molho com utensílios limpos. Para guardar, coloque as sobras em recipientes rasos e refrigere a 4°C ou menos dentro de 2 horas, ou 1 hora se o ambiente passar de 32°C. Propõe-se consumir em 3 dias e reaquecer cada porção uma única vez até 74°C no centro. Não coloque frango cozido no prato que recebeu o cru.","image_alt":"Um peito com molho de limão e mel ao lado de aspargos assados no prato","image_url":"/recetas/pollo-al-limon-y-miel-con-esparragos-asados/paso-06.webp"}],"notes":"Mel não é adequado para menores de 12 meses. Confira alergênicos em produtos embalados e use frango sem salmoura adicionada para se aproximar do cálculo. Não entram mostarda, molho de soja, manteiga, caldo ou acompanhamentos extras. Pode usar aspargos brancos no mesmo peso, ajustando descascamento e cozimento; resultado e nutrientes mudam. Adoçantes não substituem mel de forma equivalente: textura, sabor e redução são diferentes. O suco é a parte comestível contada; não se adicionam rodelas de limão nem ervas ao prato. Pese os aspargos depois de remover as bases duras. A nutrição conta todo o molho e azeite divididos entre 4; se algo ficar na frigideira, a ingestão real pode ser menor. Congelamento e uso de sobras anteriores não foram validados aqui.","nutrition":{"fat_g":13,"calories":372.9,"saturated_fat_g":2.2,"sodium_mg":482,"protein_g":48.5,"sugar_g":11.3,"carbs_g":15.7,"fiber_g":3.3,"estimated":true,"serving_size":"1 das 4 porções propostas","source":"USDA FoodData Central — SR Legacy, abril de 2018","source_url":"https://fdc.nal.usda.gov/download-datasets/","method":"Oito fichas USDA verificadas por FDC ID no arquivo oficial. Pesos comestíveis crus somados e divididos por 4; conta todo o molho, azeite e tempero. Os 60 ml de água potável não fornecem energia e ficam fora dos oito inputs. Não são calculadas perdas de nutrientes nem divisão exata após cozinhar.","note":"Estimativa, não análise do prato pronto. Salmoura no frango, tipo de mel, perdas e porções reais alteram as cifras; quantidades, tempos e rendimento aguardam teste de cozinha.","inputs":[{"fdc_id":171077,"fdc_description":"Chicken, broiler or fryers, breast, skinless, boneless, meat only, raw","per_100g":{"fat_g":2.62,"calories":120,"saturated_fat_g":0.563,"sodium_mg":45,"protein_g":22.5,"sugar_g":0,"carbs_g":0,"fiber_g":0},"source_url":"https://fdc.nal.usda.gov/food-details/171077/nutrients","ingredient":"peito de frango cru sem pele e sem osso","edible_grams":800},{"fdc_id":168389,"fdc_description":"Asparagus, raw","per_100g":{"saturated_fat_g":0.04,"protein_g":2.2,"sugar_g":1.88,"sodium_mg":2,"carbs_g":3.88,"calories":20,"fiber_g":2.1,"fat_g":0.12},"source_url":"https://fdc.nal.usda.gov/food-details/168389/nutrients","ingredient":"aspargos verdes, peso após retirar as bases duras","edible_grams":600},{"fdc_id":167747,"fdc_description":"Lemon juice, raw","per_100g":{"protein_g":0.35,"saturated_fat_g":0.04,"fiber_g":0.3,"sodium_mg":1,"sugar_g":2.52,"fat_g":0.24,"carbs_g":6.9,"calories":22},"source_url":"https://fdc.nal.usda.gov/food-details/167747/nutrients","ingredient":"suco de limão espremido na hora","edible_grams":40},{"fdc_id":169640,"fdc_description":"Honey","per_100g":{"saturated_fat_g":0,"protein_g":0.3,"fiber_g":0.2,"sodium_mg":4,"fat_g":0,"carbs_g":82.4,"calories":304,"sugar_g":82.1},"source_url":"https://fdc.nal.usda.gov/food-details/169640/nutrients","ingredient":"mel","edible_grams":40},{"fdc_id":171413,"fdc_description":"Oil, olive, salad or cooking","per_100g":{"fat_g":100,"carbs_g":0,"calories":884,"sodium_mg":2,"protein_g":0,"saturated_fat_g":13.8,"fiber_g":0,"sugar_g":0},"source_url":"https://fdc.nal.usda.gov/food-details/171413/nutrients","ingredient":"azeite de oliva","edible_grams":30},{"fdc_id":169230,"fdc_description":"Garlic, raw","per_100g":{"carbs_g":33.1,"calories":149,"sugar_g":1,"saturated_fat_g":0.089,"fiber_g":2.1,"sodium_mg":17,"protein_g":6.36,"fat_g":0.5},"source_url":"https://fdc.nal.usda.gov/food-details/169230/nutrients","ingredient":"alho","edible_grams":10},{"fdc_id":173468,"fdc_description":"Salt, table","per_100g":{"fiber_g":0,"sodium_mg":38800,"saturated_fat_g":0,"protein_g":0,"fat_g":0,"carbs_g":0,"calories":0,"sugar_g":0},"source_url":"https://fdc.nal.usda.gov/food-details/173468/nutrients","ingredient":"sal fino","edible_grams":4},{"fdc_id":170931,"fdc_description":"Spices, pepper, black","per_100g":{"fat_g":3.26,"sugar_g":0.64,"carbs_g":64,"calories":251,"protein_g":10.4,"fiber_g":25.3,"sodium_mg":20,"saturated_fat_g":1.39},"source_url":"https://fdc.nal.usda.gov/food-details/170931/nutrients","ingredient":"pimenta-do-reino moída","edible_grams":0.5}]},"image_url":"/recetas/pollo-al-limon-y-miel-con-esparragos-asados/portada.webp","gallery":[{"url":"/recetas/pollo-al-limon-y-miel-con-esparragos-asados/portada.webp","alt":"Peito de frango com molho de limão e mel e aspargos assados"}],"seo":{"title":"Frango com limão, mel e aspargos | Manual de Cocina","description":"Frango com molho de limão, mel e alho para 4 e aspargos assados. Doure primeiro, adicione o molho depois e confira 74°C em cada pedaço.","image_alt":"Peito de frango com molho de limão e mel e aspargos assados","image_variants":["/recetas/pollo-al-limon-y-miel-con-esparragos-asados/portada-1x1.webp","/recetas/pollo-al-limon-y-miel-con-esparragos-asados/portada-4x3.webp","/recetas/pollo-al-limon-y-miel-con-esparragos-asados/portada-16x9.webp"],"faq":[{"q":"Como evitar que o mel queime?","a":"Doure o frango sem mel e coloque o molho depois de abaixar o fogo. Mantenha fervura suave e tampe brevemente se o molho reduzir antes de o frango alcançar 74°C. Não busque molho escuro e espesso."},{"q":"Posso assar aspargos junto do frango cru?","a":"Esta ficha cozinha separadamente. Os aspargos têm outro tempo e não devem receber líquidos crus de frango se forem retirados antes. Use assadeira limpa para o acompanhamento."},{"q":"Como guardar e reaquecer as sobras?","a":"Refrigere em recipientes rasos dentro de 2 horas, ou 1 hora acima de 32°C, a 4°C ou menos. Consuma nos 3 dias propostos e reaqueça uma vez até 74°C no centro."}]},"published":false,"editorial_status":"draft","content_html":"<p>Os peitos de frango são dourados na frigideira e terminam o cozimento em molho de limão, mel e alho, com aspargos verdes assados separadamente. O mel entra depois de dourar, em fogo baixo, para reduzir o risco de queimar. A identidade e a URL históricas são mantidas.</p><p>A proposta rende 4 porções, cada uma com um pedaço de frango e um quarto dos aspargos e do molho. Estimam-se 15 minutos de preparo,25 de cozimento com tarefas em paralelo e 5 de descanso:45 no total. Quantidades, tempos e rendimento aguardam teste de cozinha. Confira 74°C em cada pedaço; cor e tempo não certificam o cozimento.</p>"}]$records$::jsonb;
